values
  ('688233628629618437', 'Bergman Island', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mia Hansen-Løve, Denis Lenoir, Marie Doller', 'Mia Hansen-Løve', 'Vicky Krieps, Tim Roth, Mia Wasikowska, Anders Danielsen Lie, Hampus Nordenson, Anki Larsson, Kerstin Brunnberg, Melinda Kinnaman', 'R', 'An English-German filmmaking couple retreat to Fårö for the summer to each write screenplays for their upcoming films in an act of pilgrimage to the place that inspired Ingmar Bergman. As the summer and their screenplays advance, the lines between reality and fiction start to blur against the backdrop of the Island''s wild landscape.', 'An English-German filmmaking couple retreat to Fårö for the summer to each write screenplays for their upcoming films in an act of pilgrimage to the place that inspired Ingmar Bergman. As the summer and their screenplays advance, the lines between reality and fiction start to blur against the backdrop of the Island''s wild landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8bQfC7SbaTDVKywhCiNL3ZVSyy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477044'),
  ('957563908917827971', 'Berkeley in the Sixties', 1990, 'Documentary', 'Mark Kitchell, Stephen Lighthill', 'Mark Kitchell, Susan Griffin, Stephen Most', 'Jentri Anders, John De Bonis, Hardy Frye, John Gage, Allen Ginsberg, Todd Gitlin, Susan Griffin, Joan Baez', null, 'A documentary about militant student political activity at the University of California, Berkeley in the 1960s.', 'A documentary about militant student political activity at the University of California, Berkeley in the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBeBmyftJgAe0Y0FNXGnIcyZbLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37447'),
  ('489006342603682944', 'Berkeley Square', 1933, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Frank Lloyd, Louis De Francesco, Ernest Palmer', 'Sonya Levien, John L. Balderston', 'Leslie Howard, Heather Angel, Valerie Taylor, Irene Browne, Beryl Mercer, Colin Keith-Johnston, Alan Mowbray, Juliette Compton', 'NR', 'A young American man is transported back to London in the time shortly after the American Revolution and meets his ancestors.', 'A young American man is transported back to London in the time shortly after the American Revolution and meets his ancestors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1crCm5tK3Nro4kiEkF03dme21Sj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104211'),
  ('52306228663254401', 'Berkshire County', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Jari Davidson, Audrey Cummings', 'Chris Gamble', 'Alysa King, Madison Ferguson, Samora Smallwood, Bart Rochon, Aaron Chartrand, Christophe Gallander, Robert Nolan, Daniel Stolfi', null, 'Kylie Winters, a bullied and self-loathing teen, reluctantly agrees to babysit at an isolated country mansion on Halloween night. When a small boy in a pig mask appears at the door trick-or-treating, Kylie''s night transforms into a horrifying and violent cat-and-mouse game. She must go beyond what she ever thought possible if she and the children are to survive the night.', 'Kylie Winters, a bullied and self-loathing teen, reluctantly agrees to babysit at an isolated country mansion on Halloween night. When a small boy in a pig mask appears at the door trick-or-treating, Kylie''s night transforms into a horrifying and violent cat-and-mouse game. She must go beyond what she ever thought possible if she and the children are to survive the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mz3YkitirfSSh0A0U0VW2O7BlhD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298653'),
  ('886420407336705314', 'Berlin - Ecke Schönhauser...', 1957, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gerhard Klein, Wolf Göthe', 'Wolfgang Kohlhaase', 'Ekkehard Schall, Ilse Pagé, Ernst-Georg Schwill, Harry Engel, Raimund Schelcher, Ingeborg Beeske, Helga Göring, Siegfried Weiß', null, 'The corner Schönhauser Allee in East Berlin is the main meeting-point for a group of adolescents. Dieter is a construction worker who falls in love with Angela. She, in turn, spends time with the clique whenever her mother is occupied with her new lover. "Kohle" stays away from home to avoid his dad''s alcohol problem, and Karl-Heinz is on his way to becoming a small-time criminal. Due to their interest in western music and culture they are regarded as no-goods and rowdies. Things get interesting when an incident forces Dieter and "Kohle" to escape to West Germany. Written by c.winter', 'The corner Schönhauser Allee in East Berlin is the main meeting-point for a group of adolescents. Dieter is a construction worker who falls in love with Angela. She, in turn, spends time with the clique whenever her mother is occupied with her new lover. "Kohle" stays away from home to avoid his dad''s alcohol problem, and Karl-Heinz is on his way to becoming a small-time criminal. Due to their interest in western music and culture they are regarded as no-goods and rowdies. Things get interesting when an incident forces Dieter and "Kohle" to escape to West Germany. Written by c.winter', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1E8kq8OYW11qBQDFjvJ76Jzxjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68594'),
  ('523381234337701018', 'Berlin ''36', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Kaspar Heidelbach, Achim Poulheim', 'Eric Friedler', 'Karoline Herfurth, Sebastian Urzendowsky, Axel Prahl, Robert Gallinowski, Thomas Thieme, Johann von Bülow, August Zirner, Maria Happel', null, 'Berlin 36 is a 2009 German film telling the fate of Jewish athlete Gretel Bergmann in the 1936 Summer Olympics. She was replaced by the Nazi regime by an athlete later discovered to be a man. The film is based on a true story and was released in Germany on September 10, 2009. Reporters at Der Spiegel challenged the historical basis for many of the events in the film, pointing to arrest records and medical examinations indicating German authorities did not learn Dora Ratjen was male until 1938.', 'Berlin 36 is a 2009 German film telling the fate of Jewish athlete Gretel Bergmann in the 1936 Summer Olympics. She was replaced by the Nazi regime by an athlete later discovered to be a man. The film is based on a true story and was released in Germany on September 10, 2009. Reporters at Der Spiegel challenged the historical basis for many of the events in the film, pointing to arrest records and medical examinations indicating German authorities did not learn Dora Ratjen was male until 1938.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNFJqSFoZSFURKM9xCRUizDRD0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50077'),
  ('376168152436832640', 'Berlin Alexanderplatz', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Burhan Qurbani, Yoshi Heimrath, David Houfek', 'Martin Behnke, Burhan Qurbani', 'Welket Bungué, Jella Haase, Albrecht Schuch, Joachim Król, Annabelle Mandeng, Nils Verkooijen, Richard Fouofié Djimeli, Mira Elisa Goeres', null, 'In 2015, thirty year old refugee Francis, the sole survivor of a boat that illegally crossed the Mediterranean, is drawn into Berlin''s seedy underbelly.', 'In 2015, thirty year old refugee Francis, the sole survivor of a boat that illegally crossed the Mediterranean, is drawn into Berlin''s seedy underbelly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5i3ZUjsjDWrcqPGRoKrHsAltBvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575659'),
  ('941516043160073044', 'Berlin Blues', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Leander Haußmann, Frank Griebe', 'Sven Regener', 'Christian Ulmen, Katja Danowski, Detlev Buck, Janek Rieke, Uwe Dag Berlin, Martin Olbertz, Hartmut Lange, Margit Bendokat', null, 'In October 1989, the part of the West Berlin borough of Kreuzberg called SO 36, had been largely shut off by the Wall from the rest of the city for 28 years. A lethargic sub-culture of students, artists, bohemians and barflys had flourished among crumbling buildings. Part of that microcosm is barkeeper Frank, semi-formally called ''Herr Lehmann'' by friends and patrons. He hangs out drinking, sports utter disregard for anything beyond SO 36 and lazily pursues an affair with cook Katrin. His lifestyle is gradually disturbed, when his parents show up for a visit, things go awry with Katrin and his best friend Karl starts to act strange. Meanwhile, political turmoil mounts on the other side of the Wall.', 'In October 1989, the part of the West Berlin borough of Kreuzberg called SO 36, had been largely shut off by the Wall from the rest of the city for 28 years. A lethargic sub-culture of students, artists, bohemians and barflys had flourished among crumbling buildings. Part of that microcosm is barkeeper Frank, semi-formally called ''Herr Lehmann'' by friends and patrons. He hangs out drinking, sports utter disregard for anything beyond SO 36 and lazily pursues an affair with cook Katrin. His lifestyle is gradually disturbed, when his parents show up for a visit, things go awry with Katrin and his best friend Karl starts to act strange. Meanwhile, political turmoil mounts on the other side of the Wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jxhEu4H4dOMA5cLxRbGd7K5KUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4326'),
  ('347157052489943150', 'Berlin Bouncer', 2019, 'Documentary', 'David Dietl, Eric Ferranti, Raphael Beinder', null, 'Sven Marquardt, Frank Künster, Smiley Baldwin', null, 'A portrait of Berlin’s most famous bouncers – Sven Marquardt, Frank Künster and Smiley Baldwin. The three men have been part and parcel of the capital’s club scene for more than 25 years – from the days after the fall of the Berlin Wall to the present day – but aren’t yet considering calling it a day even though life makes more demands on them as they turn 50.', 'A portrait of Berlin’s most famous bouncers – Sven Marquardt, Frank Künster and Smiley Baldwin. The three men have been part and parcel of the capital’s club scene for more than 25 years – from the days after the fall of the Berlin Wall to the present day – but aren’t yet considering calling it a day even though life makes more demands on them as they turn 50.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woBlfYZdP4BnQspcU5HzktFlipD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575848'),
  ('213556399071927895', 'Berlin Calling', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Hannes Stöhr, Andreas Doub, Mirko Borscht', 'Hannes Stöhr', 'Paul Kalkbrenner, Rita Lengyel, Corinna Harfouch, Araba Walton, Peter Schneider, Rolf Peter Kahl, Henriette Müller, Udo Kroschwald', null, 'A man tours clubs around the globe with his manager and girlfriend. On the eve of their largest album release he is admitted to a psychiatric clinic after overdosing at a gig.', 'A man tours clubs around the globe with his manager and girlfriend. On the eve of their largest album release he is admitted to a psychiatric clinic after overdosing at a gig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxEZwuBATJbAdS2JVrALQDnP0Cu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30508'),
  ('966723196941502709', 'Berlin Drifters', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kōichi Imaizumi, Taguchi Hiroki', 'Gengoroh Tagame', 'Lyota Majima, Kōichi Imaizumi, Mioo Satô, Michael Selvaggio, Claude Kolz, Toby Ashraf, Christian Slaughter, Lupus', 'NR', 'Kôichi is a Japanese man living alone in Berlin. He has no job and hardly any friends. One night Kôichi meets Ryota at a bar which is also a sex club. Ryota came to Berlin to visit a German guy whom he had "met" on a dating app. His high hopes for romance (and marriage?) were quickly crushed since the German was only interested in sex, not even letting Ryota stay for the night. That is why Ryota ended up spending the night in the dark room of the sex club. Kôichi for some reason lets Ryota stay at his apartment. They have sex. Ryota goes out almost everyday to get laid by various local men and comes home to Kôichi''s. Increasingly caught up with a strange feeling that is akin to but not quite frustration or curiosity (needless to say, it is not even close to love), Kôichi gradually gives himself up to sex with Ryota.', 'Kôichi is a Japanese man living alone in Berlin. He has no job and hardly any friends. One night Kôichi meets Ryota at a bar which is also a sex club. Ryota came to Berlin to visit a German guy whom he had "met" on a dating app. His high hopes for romance (and marriage?) were quickly crushed since the German was only interested in sex, not even letting Ryota stay for the night. That is why Ryota ended up spending the night in the dark room of the sex club. Kôichi for some reason lets Ryota stay at his apartment. They have sex. Ryota goes out almost everyday to get laid by various local men and comes home to Kôichi''s. Increasingly caught up with a strange feeling that is akin to but not quite frustration or curiosity (needless to say, it is not even close to love), Kôichi gradually gives himself up to sex with Ryota.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22Kfq1qMXAi2LDv19fYZg9knAG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511617'),
  ('659624717357457758', 'Berlin Express', 1948, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Lucien Ballard, Jacques Tourneur, Nate Levinson', 'Harold Medford', 'Merle Oberon, Robert Ryan, Charles Korvin, Paul Lukas, Robert Coote, Reinhold Schünzel, Roman Toporow, Peter von Zerneck', null, 'In post-war Europe, a diverse group of passengers aboard a U.S. Army train to bombed-out Frankfurt becomes involved in a Nazi assassination plot.', 'In post-war Europe, a diverse group of passengers aboard a U.S. Army train to bombed-out Frankfurt becomes involved in a Nazi assassination plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoJHaq8FLu7vJiJZTEs1OsdAjcy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42286'),
  ('560374960761408649', 'Berlin Falling', 2017, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'The Chau Ngo, Ken Duken', 'Christoph Mille, Norbert Kneissl', 'Tom Wlaschiha, Ken Duken, Marisa Leonie Bach, Tim Wilde, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Ricardo Ewert, Amelie Plaas-Link', null, 'Frank left his life as a soldier behind and wants to rebuild his life in Brandenburg. He is on his way to meet his daughter, Lily, after a long time of not seeing her. As he stops at a gas station he meets Andreas, who needs a ride to Berlin. Reluctantly, Frank agrees to take Andreas with him - unaware of the consequences.', 'Frank left his life as a soldier behind and wants to rebuild his life in Brandenburg. He is on his way to meet his daughter, Lily, after a long time of not seeing her. As he stops at a gas station he meets Andreas, who needs a ride to Berlin. Reluctantly, Frank agrees to take Andreas with him - unaware of the consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CIiGNzWn5WLBpXv83jHa0exceU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429886'),
  ('397736235651997457', 'Berlin Horse', 1970, null, 'Malcolm Le Grice, Malcolm Le Grice', null, null, null, 'Two fragments of 8mm home-movie footage shot by the artist near Berlin weave together in repeating cycles of action, temporal manipulation, and colour distortion, heightening the viewer’s awareness of film-time and the film-image, and perception of colour in motion.', 'Two fragments of 8mm home-movie footage shot by the artist near Berlin weave together in repeating cycles of action, temporal manipulation, and colour distortion, heightening the viewer’s awareness of film-time and the film-image, and perception of colour in motion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yfzVcimnexvSYsNAdqhClk152z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251612'),
  ('565842904337821420', 'Berlin in Berlin', 1993, 'Drama', 'Sinan Çetin', 'Ümit Ünal, Sinan Çetin', 'Hülya Avşar, Cem Özer, Armin Block, Aliye Rona, Eşref Kolçak, Nilüfer Aydan, Zafer Ergin, Emrah Aydemir', null, 'A young German engineer photographs a beautiful Turkish woman without her permission. Her husband finds out and starts a fight. In the midst of the argument the German engineer accidentally kills the husband.', 'A young German engineer photographs a beautiful Turkish woman without her permission. Her husband finds out and starts a fight. In the midst of the argument the German engineer accidentally kills the husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dokL3fOZTZlSlukt5J4tPYeaEK1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329166'),
  ('906026266022634498', 'Berlin is in Germany', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Florian Hoffmeister, Hannes Stöhr', 'Hannes Stöhr', 'Jörg Schüttauf, Julia Jäger, Tom Jahn, Valentin Plătăreanu, Edita Malovčić, Robert Lohr, Robin Becker, Carmen-Maja Antoni', null, 'When Martin, a former GDR citizen, is released from jail, he lately becomes confronted with the consequences of the German re-unification.', 'When Martin, a former GDR citizen, is released from jail, he lately becomes confronted with the consequences of the German re-unification.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsejIOb5nxF0vJf5RtU6O5u1Dg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211'),
  ('1006479054139049179', 'Berlin Kaplanı', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Hakan Algül, Gökhan Atılmış', 'Ata Demirer', 'Ata Demirer, Necati Bilgiç, Tarık Ünlüoğlu, Özlem Türkad, Nihal Yalçın, Cemil Özbayer, Cengiz Bozkurt, Orhan Güner', null, 'A boxer from berlin gets involved in several schemes. When trouble mounts, he relocates to Turkey.', 'A boxer from berlin gets involved in several schemes. When trouble mounts, he relocates to Turkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cysoQkHiCoNWiZEAuGGPwQ1oykj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85782'),
  ('936621098157293073', 'Berlin Syndrome', 2017, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Deborah Antoniou, Michael McLean, Annika Birgel', 'Shaun Grant', 'Teresa Palmer, Max Riemelt, Matthias Habich, Emma Bading, Elmira Bahrami, Christoph Franken, Lucie Aron, Nassim Avat', 'R', 'A passionate holiday romance leads to an obsessive relationship when an Australian photojournalist wakes one morning in an abandoned Berlin apartment and is unable to leave.', 'A passionate holiday romance leads to an obsessive relationship when an Australian photojournalist wakes one morning in an abandoned Berlin apartment and is unable to leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PvCWXOeGJ1tavQcs5z4hqOZui2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363126'),
  ('1131509625237377617', 'Berlin-Alexanderplatz: The Story of Franz Biberkopf', 1931, 'Crime, Drama', 'Phil Jutzi, Artur Guttmann, Nicolas Farkas', 'Alfred Döblin, Karlheinz Martin, Hans Wilhelm', 'Heinrich George, Margarete Schlegel, Bernhard Minetti, Albert Florath, Paul Westermeier, Jakob Tiedtke, Hans Deppe, Käthe Haack', null, 'Franz Biberkopf has served four years in prison. His return to normal life is not successful.', 'Franz Biberkopf has served four years in prison. His return to normal life is not successful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WEmyr89buEFeBauMKVASaoKisq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156318'),
  ('1026878327714562849', 'Berlin, Berlin', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Franziska Meyer Price', 'David Safier, Ben Safier', 'Felicitas Woll, Jan Sosniok, Matthias Klimsa, Janina Uhse, Kai Lentrodt, Sandra Borgmann, Farouk El-Khalili, Gitta Schweighöfer', null, 'Lolle''s love life in Berlin is as complicated as ever. After the story with Sven, her second cousin, was over, she got together with her best friend Hart and the two are about to get married. That is, if Sven doesn''t ruin things.', 'Lolle''s love life in Berlin is as complicated as ever. After the story with Sven, her second cousin, was over, she got together with her best friend Hart and the two are about to get married. That is, if Sven doesn''t ruin things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hy7dbF4YXX5fMbxisAbQpwwknwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632587'),
