  ('733376635512808839', 'Bernadette', 1988, 'Drama', 'Jean Delannoy, Michel Leroy, Jean Penzer', 'Robert Arnaut, Jean Delannoy', 'Sydney Penny, Jean-Marc Bory, Jean-Marie Bernicat, Philippe Brigaud, Claude Buchwald, Arlette Didier, Bérangère Jean, Elisabeth Kaza', null, 'Evocation of the life of Bernadette Soubirous, the eldest of four children, who, at the age of fifteen, experiences a religious vision at the Massabielle grotto near Lourdes.', 'Evocation of the life of Bernadette Soubirous, the eldest of four children, who, at the age of fifteen, experiences a religious vision at the Massabielle grotto near Lourdes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8ncSIajEr2iCZFWAqxfklqNugG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66970'),
