  ('56558358618921784', 'Best F(r)iends: Volume 1', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Farhan Umedaly, Justin MacGregor, Justin MacGregor', 'Greg Sestero', 'Greg Sestero, Tommy Wiseau, Kristen StephensonPino, Rick Edwards, Paul Scheer, Vince Jolivette, R.J. Cantu, Patrick Greene', 'R', 'When a drifter befriends a quirky mortician, an unlikely business partnership is formed. Paranoia soon develops, however, and both men are forced to come to terms with the fragility of friendship and loyalty.', 'When a drifter befriends a quirky mortician, an unlikely business partnership is formed. Paranoia soon develops, however, and both men are forced to come to terms with the fragility of friendship and loyalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwd4qZ6hr13m3txjqyQtPJZKbyd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421044'),
  ('597220243938554615', 'Best Friend', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hong Jae-sik, Kim Jae-keun, Lee Hwan-kyung', 'Lee Hwan-kyung, Yoon Pil-joon, Kim Yeong-seok', 'Jung Woo, Oh Dal-su, Kim Hie-won, Kim Byong-chul, Lee Yu-bi, Cho Hyun-chul, Kim Sun-kyung, Yeom Hye-ran', null, 'A leader of the opposition party in 1980s South Korea struggles to outwit the government who, unbeknownst to him, has placed a surveillance team in the house next door. Based on the life of Kim Dae-jung, the 8th President of South Korea.', 'A leader of the opposition party in 1980s South Korea struggles to outwit the government who, unbeknownst to him, has placed a surveillance team in the house next door. Based on the life of Kim Dae-jung, the 8th President of South Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfszy5E2Q7MMeZNoGQCZs7AKnAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636282'),
  ('47228363569383150', 'Best Friends', 1975, 'Drama', 'Noel Nosseck, Stephen M. Katz, Jack G. Roberts', 'Arnold Somkin', 'Richard Hatch, Susanne Benton, Doug Chapin, Ann Noland, Renee Paul, Ralph Montgomery, Roger Bear, John McKee', 'R', 'Two young couples taste the ''free and easy'' life on a cross country motor-home tour until love backfires and tragedy follows.', 'Two young couples taste the ''free and easy'' life on a cross country motor-home tour until love backfires and tragedy follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVdHPyF548pjl7EdMYE00K7ts3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82402'),
  ('242374660056249489', 'Best Friends', 1982, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Norman Jewison, Jordan Cronenweth', 'Barry Levinson, Valerie Curtin', 'Burt Reynolds, Goldie Hawn, Jessica Tandy, Barnard Hughes, Audra Lindley, Keenan Wynn, Ron Silver, Richard Libertini', 'PG', 'When a professional couple, who have lived and worked together for many years, finally decide to marry, their sudden betrothal causes many unexpected difficulties. They soon find that being married is often quite different from being "best friends."', 'When a professional couple, who have lived and worked together for many years, finally decide to marry, their sudden betrothal causes many unexpected difficulties. They soon find that being married is often quite different from being "best friends."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kM78uHJJvUdqW3Aczb1ALNOAGW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45840'),
  ('748926735956607097', 'Best Friends Forever', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Julien Rambaldi', null, 'Marc Lavoine, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Léa Drucker, Pascale Arbillot, Yvon Back, Guillaume de Tonquédec', null, 'A weekend in the green with your best friends. Those who really love you. Those in whom you have absolute confidence. Those who understand you and always tell you the truth. And above all, those who rot you without knowing that they pressed the callback key of their phone.', 'A weekend in the green with your best friends. Those who really love you. Those in whom you have absolute confidence. Those who understand you and always tell you the truth. And above all, those who rot you without knowing that they pressed the callback key of their phone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAWHEtViStu1y0OCfMSGxsy0I6W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46675'),
  ('1127242570136380806', 'Best in Bed', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Delphine de Vigan, Antoine Monod', 'Chris Esquerre, Delphine de Vigan', 'Laurence Arné, Éric Elmosnino, Valérie Bonneton, Julia Faure, Didier Bezace, François Morel, Éric Boucher, Jérémy Lopez', null, 'Raised to believe in performance and in the idea that all abilities must be optimized, Emma is a young, methodical woman who appears determined and relatively sure of herself. But two consecutive failures (real or imagined) lead her to believe that she has a real problem: she is useless in bed. Because she is more fragile than she appears, Emma hence decides to become... the best lay in Paris! She then sets out on a formidable plan of action (theory, practical, validation of acquired knowledge), which soon provokes a series of misunderstandings and disasters within her immediate vicinity. For one thing, her method doesn''t turn out to be really adapted to her field of investigation. And Emma has probably also forgotten a little detail: love doesn''t obey any plan. In this absurd and nutty quest, Emma will learn to let go, to lose control, and, to finally win her freedom.', 'Raised to believe in performance and in the idea that all abilities must be optimized, Emma is a young, methodical woman who appears determined and relatively sure of herself. But two consecutive failures (real or imagined) lead her to believe that she has a real problem: she is useless in bed. Because she is more fragile than she appears, Emma hence decides to become... the best lay in Paris! She then sets out on a formidable plan of action (theory, practical, validation of acquired knowledge), which soon provokes a series of misunderstandings and disasters within her immediate vicinity. For one thing, her method doesn''t turn out to be really adapted to her field of investigation. And Emma has probably also forgotten a little detail: love doesn''t obey any plan. In this absurd and nutty quest, Emma will learn to let go, to lose control, and, to finally win her freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGAnY7sLF3NPziikDSzr61hMyGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240581'),
  ('449915192464407067', 'Best in Show', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Guest, Roberto Schaefer, John MacCarthy', 'Christopher Guest, Eugene Levy', 'Bob Balaban, Jennifer Coolidge, Christopher Guest, John Michael Higgins, Michael Hitchcock, Eugene Levy, Jane Lynch, Michael McKean', 'PG-13', 'The tension is palpable, the excitement is mounting and the heady scent of competition is in the air as hundreds of eager contestants from across America prepare to take part in what is undoubtedly one of the greatest events of their lives -- the Mayflower Dog Show. The canine contestants and their owners are as wondrously diverse as the great country that has bred them.', 'The tension is palpable, the excitement is mounting and the heady scent of competition is in the air as hundreds of eager contestants from across America prepare to take part in what is undoubtedly one of the greatest events of their lives -- the Mayflower Dog Show. The canine contestants and their owners are as wondrously diverse as the great country that has bred them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkYBCMN26SxkQww4gLxUXQm5vr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13785'),
  ('912722676847065829', 'Best Intentions', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gilles Legrand', 'Gilles Legrand, Léonore Confino', 'Agnès Jaoui, Tim Seyfi, Alban Ivanov, Claire Sermonne, Hervé Masquelier, Michèle Moretti, Léonore Confino, Nuno Roque', null, 'A 50-year-old who is over-invested in humanitarian work is competing in the social center where she works. She will then embark her students in literacy class, with the help of a pretty foolish monitor, on the dangerous road of the code of the road.', 'A 50-year-old who is over-invested in humanitarian work is competing in the social center where she works. She will then embark her students in literacy class, with the help of a pretty foolish monitor, on the dangerous road of the code of the road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92kSLh9VUsddYRSdxMJkMg3W8j1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535754'),
  ('901905789455177584', 'Best Laid Plans', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Mike Barker, Basil Grillo, Paul N. Martin', 'Ted Griffin', 'Alessandro Nivola, Reese Witherspoon, Josh Brolin, Gene Wolande, Jonathan McMurtry, Terrance Sweeney, Rebecca Klingler, Rocky Carroll', 'R', 'Rich, successful Bryce meets beautiful Lissa at a bar one night and invites her back to his house, not suspecting for a moment that Lissa isn''t really who she seems. What unfolds next is a dangerous, tangled web of double-crosses and seduction.', 'Rich, successful Bryce meets beautiful Lissa at a bar one night and invites her back to his house, not suspecting for a moment that Lissa isn''t really who she seems. What unfolds next is a dangerous, tangled web of double-crosses and seduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvsfeDsJrTV4stJhYY00zL5e8WW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18621'),
  ('345112302307163305', 'Best Man Down', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ted Koland, Seamus Tierney', 'Ted Koland', 'Justin Long, Jess Weixler, Addison Timlin, Tyler Labine, Shelley Long, Frances O''Connor, Evan Jones, Michael Landes', 'PG-13', 'A newlywed couple cancels their honeymoon and returns to the snowy Midwest to make the funeral arrangements for their best man, who died unexpectedly after their ceremony.', 'A newlywed couple cancels their honeymoon and returns to the snowy Midwest to make the funeral arrangements for their best man, who died unexpectedly after their ceremony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJOjvFV0a5znaeMVD8v7Xp51g4c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138222'),
  ('792037809704218218', 'Best Men', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'James Glennon, Tamra Davis', 'Tracy Fraim, Art Brown', 'Dean Cain, Drew Barrymore, Luke Wilson, Andy Dick, Sean Patrick Flanery, Mitchell Whitfield, Fred Ward, Raymond J. Barry', 'R', 'Four tuxedo clad men show up at a penitentiary to meet a friend who has just been released after three years in prison and is going straight from the jail to marry his girlfriend. En route to the wedding, one of the men asks to stop by a bank to pick up some cash. As it turns out, he is a wanted bank robber who uses Shakespeare passages during his robberies and thus has become known as "Hamlet". Soon all five men are caught up in the bank and involved in the robbery as they end up in a hostage situation. The hostage negotiator shows up who turns out to be Hamlet''s father.', 'Four tuxedo clad men show up at a penitentiary to meet a friend who has just been released after three years in prison and is going straight from the jail to marry his girlfriend. En route to the wedding, one of the men asks to stop by a bank to pick up some cash. As it turns out, he is a wanted bank robber who uses Shakespeare passages during his robberies and thus has become known as "Hamlet". Soon all five men are caught up in the bank and involved in the robbery as they end up in a hostage situation. The hostage negotiator shows up who turns out to be Hamlet''s father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDutboDhQeIGZ0VOMI8RkM7MWm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19952'),
  ('884538914964381189', 'Best Night Ever', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Jason Friedberg, Aaron Seltzer, Shawn Maurer', 'Jason Friedberg, Aaron Seltzer', 'Desiree Hall, Samantha Colburn, Eddie Ritchard, Crista Flanagan, Amin Joseph, Jenny Lin, Jena Sims, Guile Branco', 'R', 'Claire is about to get married and she goes to Las Vegas with her sister and two friends for her bachelorette party. Things quickly spiral out of control.', 'Claire is about to get married and she goes to Las Vegas with her sister and two friends for her bachelorette party. Things quickly spiral out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1fSDRzhkQGIhuqn9TM4CTAdH3E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238475'),
  ('649444710734505901', 'Best of Enemies', 2015, 'Documentary, History', 'David Leonard, Robert Gordon, Morgan Neville', 'Robert Gordon, Morgan Neville', 'Gore Vidal, William F. Buckley Jr., Kelsey Grammer, John Lithgow, Dick Cavett, Christopher Hitchens, Noam Chomsky, Reid Buckley', null, 'A documentary about the legendary series of nationally televised debates in 1968 between two great public intellectuals, the liberal Gore Vidal and the conservative William F. Buckley Jr. Intended as commentary on the issues of their day, these vitriolic and explosive encounters came to define the modern era of public discourse in the media, marking the big bang moment of our contemporary media landscape when spectacle trumped content and argument replaced substance. Best of Enemies delves into the entangled biographies of these two great thinkers, and luxuriates in the language and the theater of their debates, begging the question, "What has television done to the way we discuss politics in our democracy today?"', 'A documentary about the legendary series of nationally televised debates in 1968 between two great public intellectuals, the liberal Gore Vidal and the conservative William F. Buckley Jr. Intended as commentary on the issues of their day, these vitriolic and explosive encounters came to define the modern era of public discourse in the media, marking the big bang moment of our contemporary media landscape when spectacle trumped content and argument replaced substance. Best of Enemies delves into the entangled biographies of these two great thinkers, and luxuriates in the language and the theater of their debates, begging the question, "What has television done to the way we discuss politics in our democracy today?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZoEfqzhuGEikvnVLLn5aJPhrm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319067'),
  ('781089130162052488', 'Best of Stand-up 2020', 2020, 'Comedy, Documentary, TV Movie', null, null, 'Jerry Seinfeld, Leslie Jones, Taylor Tomlinson, Tom Segura, Jack Whitehall, Michelle Buteau, Bert Kreischer, Jo Koy', null, 'Unnecessary milk substitutes. Bad passwords. Burlap underpants. 2020 may have sucked, but thankfully the jokes didn''t.', 'Unnecessary milk substitutes. Bad passwords. Burlap underpants. 2020 may have sucked, but thankfully the jokes didn''t.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y778t7hIPMjyY5NNHcJRTs6FJ1w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:781425'),
  ('370904719027136619', 'Best of the Badmen', 1951, 'Western', 'Edward Cronjager, C. Bakaleinikoff, William D. Russell', 'John Twist, Robert Hardy Andrews', 'Robert Ryan, Claire Trevor, Jack Buetel, Robert Preston, Walter Brennan, Bruce Cabot, John Archer, Lawrence Tierney', 'NR', 'After the North defeats the South, Union Maj. Jeff Clanton heads to Missouri to provide the Confederacy''s Quantrill''s Raiders a chance to claim allegiance to the Union, thereby clearing their wanted status. But standing in Clanton''s way are the corrupt lawmen Joad and Fowler, who would rather keep the men outlaws to collect the reward on their heads. After Joad and Fowler frame Clanton for murder, he manages to escape, becoming an outlaw himself.', 'After the North defeats the South, Union Maj. Jeff Clanton heads to Missouri to provide the Confederacy''s Quantrill''s Raiders a chance to claim allegiance to the Union, thereby clearing their wanted status. But standing in Clanton''s way are the corrupt lawmen Joad and Fowler, who would rather keep the men outlaws to collect the reward on their heads. After Joad and Fowler frame Clanton for murder, he manages to escape, becoming an outlaw himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cF7CU6gVBZBs8ezc8Ky9b5L8Fe1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144121'),
  ('679642783752429484', 'Best of the Best', 1989, 'Action, Drama', 'Robert Radler, James F. Tarzia, Douglas Ryan', 'Paul Levine', 'Eric Roberts, Phillip Rhee, James Earl Jones, Sally Kirkland, Chris Penn, John Dye, David Agresta, Tom Everett', 'PG-13', 'A team from the United States is going to compete against Korea in a Tae Kwon Do tournament. The team consists of fighters from all over the country--can they overcome their rivalry and work together to win?', 'A team from the United States is going to compete against Korea in a Tae Kwon Do tournament. The team consists of fighters from all over the country--can they overcome their rivalry and work together to win?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jB1I9LihBFKzJlRhpOPzbEXdgKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238751'),
  ('1137570966376197959', 'Best of the Best 2', 1993, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Robert Radler, Fred Tammes, Hal Olofsson', 'Max Strom, John Allen Nelson', 'Eric Roberts, Phillip Rhee, Chris Penn, Edan Gross, Ralf Moeller, Meg Foster, Sonny Landham, Wayne Newton', 'R', 'In an underground fight club, blackbelt Travis Brickley is killed after losing to the evil martial arts master Brakus. Travis'' death is witnessed by Walter Grady, the son of his best friend Alex Grady. Alex and his partner, Tommy Lee, vow to avenge their friend''s death by defeating Brakus and shutting down the fight club.', 'In an underground fight club, blackbelt Travis Brickley is killed after losing to the evil martial arts master Brakus. Travis'' death is witnessed by Walter Grady, the son of his best friend Alex Grady. Alex and his partner, Tommy Lee, vow to avenge their friend''s death by defeating Brakus and shutting down the fight club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCVKYnyZKmd2nSwfQhPHSeNbwFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32049'),
  ('126713136102833933', 'Best of the Best 3: No Turning Back', 1995, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Phillip Rhee, William Hoy', 'Deborah Scott', 'Phillip Rhee, Christopher McDonald, Gina Gershon, Mark Rolston, Peter Simmons, Anzu Lawson, Justin Brentley, Andra R. Ward', null, 'A martial arts instructor comes to the defense of a schoolteacher who has taken a stand against a local white supremacist organization.', 'A martial arts instructor comes to the defense of a schoolteacher who has taken a stand against a local white supremacist organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUZ2Hbj2Gjpou5uQVzgqh2ELZiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36555'),
  ('1101056912829043949', 'Best of the Best 4: Without Warning', 1998, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Phillip Rhee, Michael D. Margulies', 'Phillip Rhee, Fred Vicarel', 'Phillip Rhee, Ernie Hudson, Tobin Bell, Thure Riefenstein, Jessica Collins, Chris Lemmon, Paul Gleason, Art LaFleur', 'R', 'A group of Russian mobsters have stolen a huge supply of paper for printing U.S. currency, and are now flooding the market with conterfeit bills. When one of the mobsters decides to give herself in and hand over a data CD to the DA, she is shot and killed, but not before handing the disc to an unsuspecting Tommy Lee. Despite working with the police as a martial arts instructor, Lee doesn''t go to the cops with the disc, but instead goes on the run, giving the mafia time to kidnap his daughter and hold as a hostage in exchange for return of the disc. Will Tommy ever see his daughter again?', 'A group of Russian mobsters have stolen a huge supply of paper for printing U.S. currency, and are now flooding the market with conterfeit bills. When one of the mobsters decides to give herself in and hand over a data CD to the DA, she is shot and killed, but not before handing the disc to an unsuspecting Tommy Lee. Despite working with the police as a martial arts instructor, Lee doesn''t go to the cops with the disc, but instead goes on the run, giving the mafia time to kidnap his daughter and hold as a hostage in exchange for return of the disc. Will Tommy ever see his daughter again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DZsEUG1dKIihJLoTroMp647xVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36567'),
  ('707255611629413599', 'Best of Times', 2009, 'Romance, Drama', 'Yongyoot Thongkongtoon, Jarupus Pattamasiri, Somboon Phopitakkul', 'Aummaraporn Phandintong, Nontra Kumwong', 'Arak Amornsupasiri, Yarinda Bunnag, Krissana Sreadthatamrong, Sansanee Wattananukul, James Mackie, Attharut Kongrasri, Nattawas Charoenpoonsiri, Chonladee Jampathom', null, 'When friendship deepens into what veterinarian Keng hopes could become love, he learns that beautiful Fai still harbors feelings for her ex-husband who also happens to be Keng''s best friend.', 'When friendship deepens into what veterinarian Keng hopes could become love, he learns that beautiful Fai still harbors feelings for her ex-husband who also happens to be Keng''s best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UeQNfBVXzXOZa6IV2ZmZ60yMp9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80783'),
  ('415513826792708534', 'Best Player', 2011, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Damon Santostefano, Jon Joffin', 'Richard Amberg', 'Jerry Trainor, Jennette McCurdy, Janet Varney, Jean-Luc Bilodeau, Amir Talai, Elfina Luk, Julia Maxwell, Gabrielle Rose', 'PG', 'After his parents decide to move to a retirement home in Florida, professional gamer Quincy “Q” Johnson (Jerry Trainor) must find a way to raise 175,000 dollars to buy his family home. After hearing about a tournament for the game “Black Hole” with a grand prize of 175,500 dollars, Quincy enters the tournament, only to be faced with a new challenge. An equally skilled gamer, named Chris Saunders “Prodigy” (Jeanette McCurdy), has become the one block in Quincy’s plan, defeating him at every turn. Quincy then teams-up with his friend Wendell (Amir Talai), to try and find ways to stop Chris from entering the tournament.', 'After his parents decide to move to a retirement home in Florida, professional gamer Quincy “Q” Johnson (Jerry Trainor) must find a way to raise 175,000 dollars to buy his family home. After hearing about a tournament for the game “Black Hole” with a grand prize of 175,500 dollars, Quincy enters the tournament, only to be faced with a new challenge. An equally skilled gamer, named Chris Saunders “Prodigy” (Jeanette McCurdy), has become the one block in Quincy’s plan, defeating him at every turn. Quincy then teams-up with his friend Wendell (Amir Talai), to try and find ways to stop Chris from entering the tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIVXQM0X4rawgKa6VFPb84NBqKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60089'),
  ('736115924210730454', 'Best Seller', 1987, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Flynn, Fred Murphy', 'Larry Cohen', 'James Woods, Brian Dennehy, Victoria Tennant, Allison Balson, Paul Shenar, George Coe, Anne Pitoniak, Mary Carver', 'R', 'Hit man Cleve approaches writer/cop Dennis about a story for his next book: How Cleve made a living, working for one of the most powerful politicians in the country. To get the story right, they travel around the country to gather statements and evidence, while strong forces use any means they can to keep the story untold.', 'Hit man Cleve approaches writer/cop Dennis about a story for his next book: How Cleve made a living, working for one of the most powerful politicians in the country. To get the story right, they travel around the country to gather statements and evidence, while strong forces use any means they can to keep the story untold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gURIzutUWsQSed0jKodbRoeVVaR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4639'),
  ('1128305590769491096', 'Best Sellers', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claudine Sauvé, Lina Roessler', 'Anthony Grieco', 'Michael Caine, Aubrey Plaza, Scott Speedman, Ellen Wong, Cary Elwes, Luc Morissette, Veronica Ferres, Frank Schorpion', null, 'A cranky, retired author reluctantly embarks on a final book tour to help out a young publisher.', 'A cranky, retired author reluctantly embarks on a final book tour to help out a young publisher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UQ01PyC4OCo9uFKn6EidomQybd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669659'),
  ('852570912459887190', 'Best Served Cold', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Richard Somes', null, 'Elisse Joson, Alexa Miro, Chloe Webber, Derrick Dover', null, 'Best friends Gwen and Moira join a food and wine tour in Chile, ending up at a remote resort run by a mysterious couple. As guests vanish, they uncover a cannibal cult. The two must fight to survive, rescue each other, and escape becoming the next meal.', 'Best friends Gwen and Moira join a food and wine tour in Chile, ending up at a remote resort run by a mysterious couple. As guests vanish, they uncover a cannibal cult. The two must fight to survive, rescue each other, and escape becoming the next meal.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F3%2Fgracenote%2F3d3970e9b453718af37e11daa1d62180.jpg', 'plex:movie:best-served-cold-2026'),
  ('635537637829959399', 'Best Wishes to All', 2022, 'Horror, Drama', 'Yûta Shimotsu', 'Yûta Shimotsu', 'Aine Hara', null, 'A college student visits her grandparents’ house in the countryside. It has been a while and she relaxes into a warm welcome. When some noise is heard from the second floor, her grandmother freezes her movement. Is somebody up there?', 'A college student visits her grandparents’ house in the countryside. It has been a while and she relaxes into a warm welcome. When some noise is heard from the second floor, her grandmother freezes her movement. Is somebody up there?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fZGV18Anrj7XB5gen6DXsAQbXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1287049'),
  ('31134458414916177', 'Best Wishes to All', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Yûta Shimotsu, Ryuto Iwabuchi, Taka Tachibana', 'Rumi Kakuta', 'Kotone Furukawa, Koya Matsudai, Masashi Arifuku, Yoshiko Inuyama, Kazuo Hashimoto, Shiho Yoshimura, Hirofumi Nishida', null, 'A young woman''s visit to her grandparents'' home leads to the discovery of what''s brought them happiness, a revelation that will lead her to question her choices, sanity and reality itself.', 'A young woman''s visit to her grandparents'' home leads to the discovery of what''s brought them happiness, a revelation that will lead her to question her choices, sanity and reality itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwWYIcVkDb8twv0unOCcriYCSrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1136558'),
  ('354518851017338407', 'Best Worst Movie', 2009, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Michael Stephenson', 'Michael Stephenson', 'Michael Stephenson, George Hardy, Jason Steadman, Jason Wright, Zack Carlson, Randall Colburn, Adam Deyoe, John Gemberling', 'NR', 'A look at the making of the film Troll 2 (1990) and its journey from being crowned the "worst film of all time" to a cherished cult classic.', 'A look at the making of the film Troll 2 (1990) and its journey from being crowned the "worst film of all time" to a cherished cult classic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LQ6kdvVJW9y0B9O4qDTsazNzER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40819'),
