  ('1012489159394637579', 'Beste Zeit', 2007, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Helmut Pirnat, Marcus H. Rosenmüller', 'Karin Michalke', 'Anna Maria Sturm, Rosalie Thomass, Ferdinand Schmidt-Modrow, Florian Brückner, Peter Mitterrutzner, Andreas Giebel, Johanna Bittenbinder, Stefan Murr', null, 'Kati drives the VW bus of her parents even without a license quite fast. But what else should one do in the Bavarian province? Kati and her best friend Jo keep asking themselves this question when they philosophize about God and the world with the tip in one hand and the beer in the other hand. After all, Kati''s swarm Mike has just come back from the Bundeswehr, but while she dreams of the great love, he seems to take the matter far less seriously. And there''s only stress with her dad.', 'Kati drives the VW bus of her parents even without a license quite fast. But what else should one do in the Bavarian province? Kati and her best friend Jo keep asking themselves this question when they philosophize about God and the world with the tip in one hand and the beer in the other hand. After all, Kati''s swarm Mike has just come back from the Bundeswehr, but while she dreams of the great love, he seems to take the matter far less seriously. And there''s only stress with her dad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayQ5ppS9cTV5YVrl8SLEZK8LRJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2195'),
  ('150718728052173311', 'Besties', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marion Desseigne-Ravel, Lucile Mercier', 'Marion Desseigne-Ravel', 'Lina El Arabi, Esther Bernet-Rollande, Mahia Zrouki, Kiyane Benamara, Tasnim Jamlaoui, Laetitia Kerfa, Mariama Gueye, Zoé Marchal', null, 'Paris. Nedjma, a teenager living with her mom and sister, spends the summer with her squad. She sees her life turned upside down when she meets Zina, coming from the opposite gang. They are rivals in broad daylight, but lovers in secret.', 'Paris. Nedjma, a teenager living with her mom and sister, spends the summer with her squad. She sees her life turned upside down when she meets Zina, coming from the opposite gang. They are rivals in broad daylight, but lovers in secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYQvfaO8C2vDxb3gT8lvBLMAuUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879400'),
  ('586288975658852465', 'Bestseller', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Lee Jung-ho, Choi Young-hwan, Nam Dong-hyub', 'Lee Jung-ho', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Ryu Seung-ryong, Lee Do-gyeong, Cho Jin-woong, Lee Sung-min, Park Sa-rang, Song Ji-eun, Kim Hwa-yeong', null, 'Following a humiliating plagiarism scandal, an author moves to an isolated small-town house with her daughter to write her comeback novel. Desperate for inspiration, she communicates with a mysterious ghostly presence that has befriended her daughter.', 'Following a humiliating plagiarism scandal, an author moves to an isolated small-town house with her daughter to write her comeback novel. Desperate for inspiration, she communicates with a mysterious ghostly presence that has befriended her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZaW8EBJV2ZVw56ysSaXCermAP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42507'),
  ('1037467504722437749', 'Bet on Revenge', 2017, 'Drama, Adventure, Romance, History', 'Buda Gulyás, Gábor Herendi', 'Gábor Herendi, Bálint Hegedűs', 'Ervin Nagy, Andrea Petrik, Tibor Gáspár, József Gyabronka, Tamás Keresztes, Péter Scherer, Zoltán Rátóti, Lehel Kovács', null, 'The new owner of a brilliant race horse finds love while carrying out his revenge on the man who murdered his father.', 'The new owner of a brilliant race horse finds love while carrying out his revenge on the man who murdered his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqNp7KbfoKENdLOEJQggvGGUepJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447236'),
  ('820524365725693918', 'Beta', 1992, 'Drama, Family', 'Indra Kumar, Baba Azmi', 'Rajeev Kaul, Praful Parekh', 'Anil Kapoor, Madhuri Dixit, Aruna Irani, Laxmikant Berde, Priya Arun Berde, Kunickaa Sadanand, Akash Khurana, Rajeev Mehta', null, 'Beta is the story of Raju, the only child of a widowed multi millionaire. Raju''s father can provide him anything he wants but Raju''s only desire is to get mother''s love, in order to please Raju, his father gets married to Nagmani, thinking that she will take care of Raju more than his real mother would. Raju becomes completely devoted to his stepmother, doing whatever she wishes. Time passes by, Raju grows up and gets married to Saraswati. Saraswati discovers that Nagmani''s motherly love for Raju is fake and all what Nagmani is interested in, is capturing Raju''s wealth.', 'Beta is the story of Raju, the only child of a widowed multi millionaire. Raju''s father can provide him anything he wants but Raju''s only desire is to get mother''s love, in order to please Raju, his father gets married to Nagmani, thinking that she will take care of Raju more than his real mother would. Raju becomes completely devoted to his stepmother, doing whatever she wishes. Time passes by, Raju grows up and gets married to Saraswati. Saraswati discovers that Nagmani''s motherly love for Raju is fake and all what Nagmani is interested in, is capturing Raju''s wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RUOf9MCf8PsKxrefcwFqb0JCKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107747'),
  ('346618405610991256', 'Beta Test', 2016, 'Thriller, Action, Science Fiction', 'Michael Boydstun, Nicholas Gyeney', 'Nicholas Gyeney', 'Manu Bennett, Larenz Tate, Linden Ashby, Kevon Stover, Sara Coates, Edward Michael Scott, Edi Zanidache, Yuji Okumoto', 'NR', 'While testing the latest first person shooter from global game developer, Sentinel, video game champion Max Troy discovers the events happening within the game are being reflected in the real world. He soon determines that the game''s protagonist is real-life Orson Creed, an ex-Sentinel employee who is being remotely controlled by the corporation for reasons unknown. As virtual and real worlds collide, Max and Creed must join forces to unravel the conspiracy before the game''s sinister events escalate and overwhelm the city.', 'While testing the latest first person shooter from global game developer, Sentinel, video game champion Max Troy discovers the events happening within the game are being reflected in the real world. He soon determines that the game''s protagonist is real-life Orson Creed, an ex-Sentinel employee who is being remotely controlled by the corporation for reasons unknown. As virtual and real worlds collide, Max and Creed must join forces to unravel the conspiracy before the game''s sinister events escalate and overwhelm the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKisJfMxpp0KfX4P3VyDrH0edg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401123'),
