  ('590004581931430252', 'Betty Boop''s Big Boss', 1933, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Mae Questel', null, 'Betty takes a secretarial job where the boss sexually harasses her… but not without some encouragement from Betty.', 'Betty takes a secretarial job where the boss sexually harasses her… but not without some encouragement from Betty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xrU13rqxDqbZSmwWMc4oJ3MIV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161969'),
  ('780493451293691837', 'Betty Boop''s Crazy Inventions', 1933, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer', 'Dave Fleischer', 'Billy Murray, Mae Questel', null, 'In a circus tent, Betty, Bimbo and Koko demonstrate some gadgets reminiscent of TV ads; an animated sewing machine gets out of hand.', 'In a circus tent, Betty, Bimbo and Koko demonstrate some gadgets reminiscent of TV ads; an animated sewing machine gets out of hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlfDvwhdNOcrQ8h0H7cHi14mKHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161847'),
  ('1030775946482339840', 'Betty Boop''s Hallowe''en Party', 1933, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Horror', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Bonnie Poe', null, 'Betty Boop hosts a Hallowe''en party with a few uninvited guests.', 'Betty Boop hosts a Hallowe''en party with a few uninvited guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTuzcsn5XBjMwlOVJNIE8klA51g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161885'),
  ('835256649559589768', 'Betty Boop''s Museum', 1932, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Mae Questel', null, 'Koko is recruiting customers for a 50 cent sightseeing tour of the museum. Betty is Koko''s only passenger. Betty gets locked inside by accident. The skeletons from the displays come to life and chase Betty, until she is finally rescued by Bimbo.', 'Koko is recruiting customers for a 50 cent sightseeing tour of the museum. Betty is Koko''s only passenger. Betty gets locked inside by accident. The skeletons from the displays come to life and chase Betty, until she is finally rescued by Bimbo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bl1IiRykONPHk8lETIFBgIusW7I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148558'),
  ('388072062770544160', 'Betty Boop''s Penthouse', 1933, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Jack Mercer, Mae Questel', null, 'While Bimbo and Koko admire Betty, their experiment becomes a monster.', 'While Bimbo and Koko admire Betty, their experiment becomes a monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RPkZWnwYAvVg2LFQyWHlpOWRKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161863'),
  ('130521528944296099', 'Betty Boop''s Rise to Fame', 1934, 'Animation, Comedy, Music, Family', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Cab Calloway, Mae Questel, Max Fleischer', null, 'A reporter interviews Max Fleischer about his creation, and Betty illustrates with excerpts from three prior cartoons.', 'A reporter interviews Max Fleischer about his creation, and Betty illustrates with excerpts from three prior cartoons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gW5H3dCFZe0N9KPSiLwlxzWvP2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174509'),
  ('105243897134337070', 'Betty Boop''s Ups and Downs', 1932, 'Comedy, Animation, Fantasy', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Mae Questel', null, 'Due to the great depression, property prices start falling. The planet Earth goes up for sale. Mars and Venus make bids, but Saturn, characterised as an old Jew, makes a lower but winning bid. Then just to see what happens, he removes the earth''s magnet, and gravity disappears.', 'Due to the great depression, property prices start falling. The planet Earth goes up for sale. Mars and Venus make bids, but Saturn, characterised as an old Jew, makes a lower but winning bid. Then just to see what happens, he removes the earth''s magnet, and gravity disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyVORGp9VIpLxjNc8nP3AxVjppT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156485'),
  ('1083389407740431573', 'Betty Fisher and Other Stories', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Claude Miller, Christophe Pollock', 'Claude Miller', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Nicole Garcia, Mathilde Seigner, Luck Mervil, Stéphane Freiss, Yves Jacques, Roschdy Zem, Yves Verhoeven', null, 'When bestselling novelist Betty Fisher loses her young son in a tragic accident, her unstable mother resorts to unusual actions to alleviate Betty''s grief, actions which set off a chain reaction among a promiscuous waitress and her criminal associates.', 'When bestselling novelist Betty Fisher loses her young son in a tragic accident, her unstable mother resorts to unusual actions to alleviate Betty''s grief, actions which set off a chain reaction among a promiscuous waitress and her criminal associates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebo9Tgo8IYMmV7evHKEPXeKa7PQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55903'),
  ('1025566552643471249', 'Betty in Blunderland', 1934, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer, Roland Crandall', null, 'Bonnie Poe', null, 'Betty falls asleep doing a jigsaw puzzle and finds herself through the looking glass into a modern, urban wonderland. The shrinking potion comes from a "Shrinkola" dispenser. When most of the characters assemble, Betty sings "How Do You Do" to them. But the jabberwock steals Betty away.', 'Betty falls asleep doing a jigsaw puzzle and finds herself through the looking glass into a modern, urban wonderland. The shrinking potion comes from a "Shrinkola" dispenser. When most of the characters assemble, Betty sings "How Do You Do" to them. But the jabberwock steals Betty away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMfAHicV2U0xjk5mwOeGzcBewZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174280'),
  ('959908961799987046', 'Betty''s Bad Luck In Love', 2024, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Linda-Lisa Hayter, Adam Sliwinski, Mike Crain', 'Cameron Johann', 'Laci J. Mailey, Marco Grazzini, Daylin Willis, Meghan Heffern, David Epstein, Christopher Rosamond, Kyle Warren, Jessica Gracie', null, 'Cursed from childhood to fail at romance, Betty’s relationships have always ended in disaster. But when she meets Alex, she’s tempted to try once more. Can true love prevail over a curse?', 'Cursed from childhood to fail at romance, Betty’s relationships have always ended in disaster. But when she meets Alex, she’s tempted to try once more. Can true love prevail over a curse?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inAybmYPu9WJwjSTgNWmqr3qzqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180390'),
  ('127957598819926667', 'Betty''s Revenge', 2026, 'Horror', 'Brett Bentman, Anthony Gutierrez', null, 'Hannah Fierman, Michelle Sherrill, Faith McKinstry, Emma Claire Dykes, Samuel J. Bennett', null, 'College seniors stumble upon Betty, a mysterious former cabaret owner, while exploring an abandoned club. When they uncover her hidden journal, they''re forced to flee as she pursues them, intent on making them part of her dark story.', 'College seniors stumble upon Betty, a mysterious former cabaret owner, while exploring an abandoned club. When they uncover her hidden journal, they''re forced to flee as she pursues them, intent on making them part of her dark story.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FbEKBq4wYItRS24TIwmFDCLift4Z.jpg', 'plex:movie:bettys-revenge'),
  ('102923679229251474', 'Between Calais and Dover', 1897, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A rocky sea voyage as reenacted by Georges Méliès.', 'A rocky sea voyage as reenacted by Georges Méliès.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efaVxgWt5eOKH6WAyXpAkCp9diX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104474'),
  ('515632483001846999', 'Between Eleven and Midnight', 1949, 'Crime', 'Henri Decoin, Wladimir Roitfeld, Nicolas Hayer', null, 'Louis Jouvet, Madeleine Robinson, Robert Arnoux, Léo Lapara, Monique Mélinand, Gisèle Casadesus, Yvette Etiévant, Simone Sylvestre', null, 'Between eleven o’clock and midnight one evening, a notorious trafficker Jérôme Vidauban is shot whilst walking in a tunnel in Paris. The case is assigned to Inspector Carrel, who is Vidauban’s perfect double. Using his resemblance to the arch criminal, Carrel manages to infiltrate in Vidauban’s circle of acquaintances and contacts. He becomes embroiled in a bizarre web of intrigue and discovers no shortage of possible murder suspects, all of whom appear to be surprised to see him still alive.', 'Between eleven o’clock and midnight one evening, a notorious trafficker Jérôme Vidauban is shot whilst walking in a tunnel in Paris. The case is assigned to Inspector Carrel, who is Vidauban’s perfect double. Using his resemblance to the arch criminal, Carrel manages to infiltrate in Vidauban’s circle of acquaintances and contacts. He becomes embroiled in a bizarre web of intrigue and discovers no shortage of possible murder suspects, all of whom appear to be surprised to see him still alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLOjRkhqY8uML6SNediMERHMlRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64407'),
  ('606642733286878315', 'Between Heaven and Hell', 1956, 'War, Drama', 'Richard Fleischer, Leo Tover, Stanley Hough', 'Harry Brown', 'Robert Wagner, Terry Moore, Broderick Crawford, Buddy Ebsen, Robert Keith, Brad Dexter, Mark Damon, Ken Clark', null, 'Sam Gifford remembers : In prewar years he was an arrogant southern cotton plantation owner, married to the daughter of a colonel. At the beginning of the war he was mobilized with his National Guard unit as a sergeant. Came the day when, revolted by the cowardice of his lieutenant, who had fired at his own men, he hit him. Downgraded, he was sent to a disciplinary battalion. Sam now discovers his new detachment, his new commanding officer, just another cowardly brute, Captain Waco Grimes. While in combat, Sam will gradually become closer to the privates, working-class people he used to despise. He will become another man, a better man.', 'Sam Gifford remembers : In prewar years he was an arrogant southern cotton plantation owner, married to the daughter of a colonel. At the beginning of the war he was mobilized with his National Guard unit as a sergeant. Came the day when, revolted by the cowardice of his lieutenant, who had fired at his own men, he hit him. Downgraded, he was sent to a disciplinary battalion. Sam now discovers his new detachment, his new commanding officer, just another cowardly brute, Captain Waco Grimes. While in combat, Sam will gradually become closer to the privates, working-class people he used to despise. He will become another man, a better man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IzZWFETIaSNJER7OP038tLfrq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84567'),
  ('674312784949476342', 'Between Love & Goodbye', 2009, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Casper Andreas', 'Casper Andreas', 'Simon Miller, Justin Tensen, Rob Harmon, Aaron Michael Davies, Caroline Delran, Ryan Turner, Jane Elliott, Matthew Ludwinski', 'R', 'A modern gay drama about falling in and out of love, and the rocky road in between.', 'A modern gay drama about falling in and out of love, and the rocky road in between.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ACoxfEKvrLmTdnogtwaLRefbMk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43547'),
  ('718132953666303075', 'Between Marx and a Naked Woman', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Camilo Luzuriaga, Olivier Auverlau, Mauricio Samaniego', 'Aristides Vargas', 'Felipe Terán, Aristides Vargas, Lissette Cabrera, Isabel Molina, Maia Koulieva, Carlos Valencia, Francisco Aguirre, Gerson Guerra', null, 'Between Marx and a Naked Woman is the adaptation of a novel written by Ecuadorian Poet, Jorge Enrique Adoum. The scenes of this film insert us into Ecuador in the sixties, when the electoral struggle, convoked by the military government for a new return to democracy, is in full force. Galvez’s left-wing party must elect its candidate, but he is shoved to one side because of the criticism of the party’s political leadership. While his struggle becomes bitter, he must withstand the frustration of not being able to offer full love to Margaramaría, another party member.', 'Between Marx and a Naked Woman is the adaptation of a novel written by Ecuadorian Poet, Jorge Enrique Adoum. The scenes of this film insert us into Ecuador in the sixties, when the electoral struggle, convoked by the military government for a new return to democracy, is in full force. Galvez’s left-wing party must elect its candidate, but he is shoved to one side because of the criticism of the party’s political leadership. While his struggle becomes bitter, he must withstand the frustration of not being able to offer full love to Margaramaría, another party member.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0zGRUA07k5wYsxBDpYSHkcvcnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257595'),
  ('616609230900310025', 'Between Midnight and Dawn', 1950, 'Crime', 'George E. Diskant, Gordon Douglas', 'Eugene Ling', 'Mark Stevens, Edmond O''Brien, Gale Storm, Donald Buka, Gale Robbins, Anthony Ross, Roland Winters, Tito Vuolo', 'NR', 'Rocky and Dan, war buddies, are prowl car cops on night duty. Dan is a cynic who views all lawbreakers as scum; Rocky feels more lenient. Both are attracted to the radio voice of communicator Kate Mallory; but in person, Kate proves reluctant to get involved with men who just might stop a bullet. By lucky chance, Rocky and Dan cause big trouble for murderous racketeer Ritchie Garris; but when he swears vengeance, Kate''s fears may prove justified.', 'Rocky and Dan, war buddies, are prowl car cops on night duty. Dan is a cynic who views all lawbreakers as scum; Rocky feels more lenient. Both are attracted to the radio voice of communicator Kate Mallory; but in person, Kate proves reluctant to get involved with men who just might stop a bullet. By lucky chance, Rocky and Dan cause big trouble for murderous racketeer Ritchie Garris; but when he swears vengeance, Kate''s fears may prove justified.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjFByhrqLY8jGfiVe0pq84ebRnT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61501'),
  ('883168717060504717', 'Between Miracles', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Nino Manfredi, Sofia Scandurra, Giorgio Scotton', 'Nino Manfredi, Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi', 'Nino Manfredi, Lionel Stander, Delia Boccardo, Paola Borboni, Mariangela Melato, Mario Scaccia, Fausto Tozzi, Tano Cimarosa', null, 'Benedetto is a child who came out of an accident uninjured on his first communion''s day. The people of his village attribute that to a miracle and made him undergo a strict religious upbringing. That fact will determine his life, which will be affected by inner torment caused by the confrontation between sexual desires and sacrifices of faith, sin and grace.', 'Benedetto is a child who came out of an accident uninjured on his first communion''s day. The people of his village attribute that to a miracle and made him undergo a strict religious upbringing. That fact will determine his life, which will be affected by inner torment caused by the confrontation between sexual desires and sacrifices of faith, sin and grace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Acy8IxNLGbVB4biFt4V7ErSHIpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58702'),
  ('886648082408300869', 'Between Pancho Villa and a Naked Woman', 1996, 'History, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Sabina Berman, Isabelle Tardán, Claudio Rocha', 'Sabina Berman', 'Diana Bracho, Jesús Ochoa, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez, Arturo Ríos, Delia Casanova, Marta Aura, Angelina Peláez, Gabriel Porras', null, 'Gina, a modern business woman in her late forties, has a lover named Adrian, a journalist, who she sees once in a while just to have sex. They are both attracted to the historic figure of Pancho Villa: he admires his power while she admires his virility. As Gina helps Adrian to write a book about Villa, she discovers the similarity between Villa''s relation to women to that of Adrian and hers, and that Villa''s revolution never included her, nor the rest of the female half of the human species. Can the love of a woman and a man survive machismo?', 'Gina, a modern business woman in her late forties, has a lover named Adrian, a journalist, who she sees once in a while just to have sex. They are both attracted to the historic figure of Pancho Villa: he admires his power while she admires his virility. As Gina helps Adrian to write a book about Villa, she discovers the similarity between Villa''s relation to women to that of Adrian and hers, and that Villa''s revolution never included her, nor the rest of the female half of the human species. Can the love of a woman and a man survive machismo?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbUZ0P1kGpfDyXx0kL2UQoEmdOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282413'),
  ('243186828282486470', 'Between Sheets', 2008, 'Romance', 'Gustavo Nieto Roa', 'Rene Belmonte', 'Reynaldo Gianecchini, Paolla Oliveira', null, 'Two strangers meet in a nightclub and end up spending the night together in a love hotel. Roberto has just came out of a failed relationship and Paula wants to enjoy her last moments of freedom before getting married the next day. After making a pact of sincerity, they spend a night filled with interesting conversations and passion.', 'Two strangers meet in a nightclub and end up spending the night together in a love hotel. Roberto has just came out of a failed relationship and Paula wants to enjoy her last moments of freedom before getting married the next day. After making a pact of sincerity, they spend a night filled with interesting conversations and passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyQv5eNpEfh4qTFHaH2iceUtstS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45109'),
  ('82804047926795589', 'Between Summer and Fall', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Manns', 'Daniel Manns', 'Linn Reusse, Isabel Thierauch, Hannes Sell, Thomas Wolff, Eric Frantzen, Daniel Steiner', null, '17-year-old Lena falls in love with Eva, her older brother''s new girlfriend. With a lot of witty dialogue "Between Summer and Fall" tells the story of how two people slowly grow close to each other even though they were not looking for love. The film paints a picture of two young women caught between their own insecurity and their desire for a connection and a place in the world.', '17-year-old Lena falls in love with Eva, her older brother''s new girlfriend. With a lot of witty dialogue "Between Summer and Fall" tells the story of how two people slowly grow close to each other even though they were not looking for love. The film paints a picture of two young women caught between their own insecurity and their desire for a connection and a place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9P3BftnI0ZV1NbOEtzrLp6W432I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528776'),
  ('615393678777647203', 'Between the Lines', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joan Micklin Silver, Kenneth Van Sickle, Michael Haley', 'Fred Barron', 'John Heard, Lindsay Crouse, Jeff Goldblum, Jill Eikenberry, Bruno Kirby, Gwen Welles, Stephen Collins, Lewis J. Stadlen', null, 'The staff of the Back Bay Mainline, a Boston underground newspaper that rose to prominence in the 1960s, struggles with the shifting social climate of the ''70s amid rumors that the paper is about to be sold to a media giant.', 'The staff of the Back Bay Mainline, a Boston underground newspaper that rose to prominence in the 1960s, struggles with the shifting social climate of the ''70s amid rumors that the paper is about to be sold to a media giant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjSyo92neG1UG6PYAf2HYxNdB6g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175924'),
  ('1136695707966240455', 'Between the Temples', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Laura Klein, Kat Hess, Kate Antognini', 'C. Mason Wells, Nathan Silver', 'Jason Schwartzman, Carol Kane, Dolly de Leon, Caroline Aaron, Robert Smigel, Madeline Weinstein, Matthew Shear, Lindsay Burdge', 'R', 'A grief-stricken cantor in a crisis of faith finds his world turned upside down when his grade school music teacher re-enters his life as his new adult Bat Mitzvah student. The two forlorn souls develop a special connection.', 'A grief-stricken cantor in a crisis of faith finds his world turned upside down when his grade school music teacher re-enters his life as his new adult Bat Mitzvah student. The two forlorn souls develop a special connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOVe3xoJDIdMMYvCy18a4TlDIOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1125073'),
  ('838814112943999120', 'Between Two Dawns', 2021, 'Drama', 'Tudor Vladimir Panduru, Selman Nacar', 'Selman Nacar', 'Mücahit Koçak, Nezaket Erden, Burcu Gölgedar, Ünal Silver, Bedir Bedir, Erdem Şenocak, Ali Seçkiner Alıcı, Cihat Süvarioğlu', null, 'After a worker is severely injured in their family business, Kadir is forced into making a moral decision, which will have an impact on his dreams, his family, and the life of injured worker’s wife', 'After a worker is severely injured in their family business, Kadir is forced into making a moral decision, which will have an impact on his dreams, his family, and the life of injured worker’s wife', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIkMhQq09aXzwGUKSVIYLLcgNim.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677053'),
  ('166066252205072516', 'Between Two Ferns: The Movie', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Scott Aukerman, Benjamin Kasulke', 'Scott Aukerman, Zach Galifianakis', 'Zach Galifianakis, Lauren Lapkus, Ryan Gaul, Jiavani, Will Ferrell, Matthew McConaughey, David Letterman, Peter Dinklage', 'R', 'Galifianakis dreamed of becoming a star. But when Will Ferrell discovered his public access TV show, ''Between Two Ferns'' and uploaded it to Funny or Die, Zach became a viral laughing stock. Now Zach and his crew are taking a road trip to complete a series of high-profile celebrity interviews and restore his reputation.', 'Galifianakis dreamed of becoming a star. But when Will Ferrell discovered his public access TV show, ''Between Two Ferns'' and uploaded it to Funny or Die, Zach became a viral laughing stock. Now Zach and his crew are taking a road trip to complete a series of high-profile celebrity interviews and restore his reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHxc8v1GkzdjjhF2qnpG6wdXrOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584962'),
  ('412372356915610114', 'Between Two Waters', 2018, 'Drama', 'Isaki Lacuesta, Diego Dussuel', 'Isa Campo, Fran Araújo, Isaki Lacuesta', 'Israel Gómez Romero, Francisco José Gómez Romero, Rocío Rendón, Yolanda Carmona, Lorrein Galea, Manuel González del Tanago', null, 'Isra and Cheito are two brothers who have taken very different paths in life. When Isra gets released from prison and Cheito comes home after a long tour with the Marines, they both return to the island of San Fernando. The reunion of the two brothers will bring with it the memory of the violent death their father suffered when they were just boys; the need to get back on track with their lives and finally come to terms with what happened will bring them together again.', 'Isra and Cheito are two brothers who have taken very different paths in life. When Isra gets released from prison and Cheito comes home after a long tour with the Marines, they both return to the island of San Fernando. The reunion of the two brothers will bring with it the memory of the violent death their father suffered when they were just boys; the need to get back on track with their lives and finally come to terms with what happened will bring them together again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93A3FYbKv7NSbw5Nxw7DzURLjjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536808'),
  ('622398404233138706', 'Between Two Worlds', 1944, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Edward A. Blatt, Carl E. Guthrie, Elmer Decker', 'Sutton Vane', 'John Garfield, Paul Henreid, Sydney Greenstreet, Eleanor Parker, Edmund Gwenn, George Tobias, George Coulouris, Faye Emerson', 'NR', 'Passengers on an ocean liner can''t recall how they got onboard or where they are going. Soon it becomes apparent that they all have something in common.', 'Passengers on an ocean liner can''t recall how they got onboard or where they are going. Soon it becomes apparent that they all have something in common.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1NeBrt65qUJCcOBOqf8MlTcnOy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26600'),
  ('874295866274647736', 'Between Two Worlds', 2022, 'Drama', 'Emmanuel Carrère, Patrick Blossier', 'Hélène Devynck', 'Juliette Binoche, Hélène Lambert, Louise Pociecka, Steve Papagiannis, Jérémy Lechevallier, Kévin Maspimby, Faïçal Zoua, Arnaud Duval', null, 'Marianne Winckler relocates to the port city of Caen in order to pass herself off as a member of a large community of itinerant workers desperate to make ends meet. She gains employment as a cleaner on a ferry travelling between Ouistreham and Portsmouth, recording the drudgery of the work she and her colleagues are required to do.', 'Marianne Winckler relocates to the port city of Caen in order to pass herself off as a member of a large community of itinerant workers desperate to make ends meet. She gains employment as a cleaner on a ferry travelling between Ouistreham and Portsmouth, recording the drudgery of the work she and her colleagues are required to do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5aeDtufiLsnRk8dNXWubvC6sP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601188'),
  ('749123085670934470', 'Between Us', 2009, 'Drama', 'Paola Mendoza, Gloria La Morte, Bradford Young', 'Gloria La Morte, Paola Mendoza', 'Paola Mendoza, Sebastian Villada, Laura Montana, Anthony Chisholm, Andres Munar, Sarita Choudhury, Isabel Sung, Farah Bala', null, 'Abruptly abandoned by her husband in a country completely foreign to her, Colombian native Mariana (Paola Mendoza) struggles to take care of herself and her two young children on the unforgiving streets of New York City. Sebastian Villada, Laura Montana and Anthony Chisholm also star in this gritty independent drama jointly written and directed by Mendoza and her collaborator Gloria La Morte.', 'Abruptly abandoned by her husband in a country completely foreign to her, Colombian native Mariana (Paola Mendoza) struggles to take care of herself and her two young children on the unforgiving streets of New York City. Sebastian Villada, Laura Montana and Anthony Chisholm also star in this gritty independent drama jointly written and directed by Mendoza and her collaborator Gloria La Morte.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcBswFQ4gocTG0CKvAuRboKkrJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71575'),
  ('658410094946111843', 'Between Us', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Patricia Martínez de Velasco, Paula Huidobro', 'Patricia Martínez de Velasco', 'Jesús Ochoa, Carmen Beato, Diana García, Giovana Fuentes, Giovanna Zacarías, Camila Risser, Martín Altomaro, Julio Bracho', null, 'Rodolfo Guerra, father of three daughters, wakes up one morning and decides he will not go to work; he is tired of being mistreated by his wife. In that one day in which the family routine is broken, Rodolfo opens his eyes and realizes that he is a perfect stranger in his own home. Rodolfo knows that he is risking his job, yet he still takes the time to put the puzzle pieces together to discover many unknown truths that are present among his daily life.', 'Rodolfo Guerra, father of three daughters, wakes up one morning and decides he will not go to work; he is tired of being mistreated by his wife. In that one day in which the family routine is broken, Rodolfo opens his eyes and realizes that he is a perfect stranger in his own home. Rodolfo knows that he is risking his job, yet he still takes the time to put the puzzle pieces together to discover many unknown truths that are present among his daily life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oflxxk94TjmjMdotXnajh64iMad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114903'),
  ('974972577877785718', 'Between Us', 2013, 'Drama', 'Paulo Morelli, Gustavo Hadba, Amanda Letícia Pio', 'Paulo Morelli', 'Júlio Andrade, Caio Blat, Carolina Dieckmmann, Martha Nowill, Maria Ribeiro, Paulo Vilhena, Lee Taylor', null, 'A group of literature-loving friends bury letters to be opened 10 years later when they will confront the dreams of their youth with what the future has held in store for them.', 'A group of literature-loving friends bury letters to be opened 10 years later when they will confront the dreams of their youth with what the future has held in store for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDqulfk6mJQvQ1IlrnLyZsysat6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230129'),
  ('951631953515734532', 'Between Us', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jude Bauman, Dimitri Borget', 'Jude Bauman', 'Iris Jodorowsky, Amandine Noworyta, William Mesguich, Jean-François Stévenin, Virginie Natkin, Jason Guez, Pierre Nogues, Madelaine Taittinger', null, 'Elodie and Laetitia live in close love and dream of having a child. As Elodie discovers that she cannot get pregnant because of a health problem and encounters financial troubles, they decide to take a roommate.', 'Elodie and Laetitia live in close love and dream of having a child. As Elodie discovers that she cannot get pregnant because of a health problem and encounters financial troubles, they decide to take a roommate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agdVHkEJlJ8C7OlyCOpNLTjnNaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828373'),
  ('166124673873671036', 'Between Worlds', 2018, 'Mystery, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Maria Pulera, Thomas Hencz, David Marion', 'Maria Pulera', 'Nicolas Cage, Franka Potente, Penelope Mitchell, Garrett Clayton, Hopper Penn, Lydia Hearst, Nailim Sanchez, Richard Pait', 'R', 'Joe, a down-on-his-luck truck driver haunted by the memory of his deceased wife and child, meets Julie, a spiritually gifted woman who enlists his help in a desperate effort to find the lost soul of her comatose daughter. But the spirit of Joe''s dead wife proves stronger, possessing the young woman''s body and determined to settle her unfinished business with the living.', 'Joe, a down-on-his-luck truck driver haunted by the memory of his deceased wife and child, meets Julie, a spiritually gifted woman who enlists his help in a desperate effort to find the lost soul of her comatose daughter. But the spirit of Joe''s dead wife proves stronger, possessing the young woman''s body and determined to settle her unfinished business with the living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7V25KUnWkf0NP7wtGkbmPjEfYf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500921'),
  ('1062733294804658382', 'Between Your Legs', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Manuel Gómez Pereira, Juan Amorós, Javier Balaguer', 'Manuel Gómez Pereira, Yolanda García Serrano, Juan Luis Iborra', 'Victoria Abril, Javier Bardem, Carmelo Gómez, Juan Diego, Sergi López, Javier Albalá, María Adánez, Carmen Balagué', null, 'A radio-show assistant meets a budding screenwriter during a group-therapy session for sex addicts.', 'A radio-show assistant meets a budding screenwriter during a group-therapy session for sex addicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RwzIMMaZEmvGWzvOrZZfWctdvx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53116'),
  ('916016506182436938', 'Beur Blanc Rouge', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Mahmoud Zemmouri, François Lartigue', 'Mahmoud Zemmouri, Marie-Laurence Attias', 'Yasmine Belmadi, Karim Belkhadra, Julien Courbey, Mallaury Nataf, Mohamed Ourdache, Didier Becchetti, Nozha Khouadra, Fatima Hellilou', null, 'Le match France - Algérie vient chambouler le train-train de Brahim et Mouloud. Cet évènement va diviser les deux amis : Brahim revendique son identité algérienne, Mouloud fustige son refus de la France, pays qui les a vu grandir.', 'Le match France - Algérie vient chambouler le train-train de Brahim et Mouloud. Cet évènement va diviser les deux amis : Brahim revendique son identité algérienne, Mouloud fustige son refus de la France, pays qui les a vu grandir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b67lCN8bDcxx5jnssvEzPwK12GB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42913'),
  ('724938408907181492', 'Beur sur la ville', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Djamel Bensalah', 'Djamel Bensalah', 'Booder, Issa Doumbia, Sandrine Kiberlain, Josiane Balasko, Gérard Jugnot, Roland Giraud, François-Xavier Demaison, Jean-Claude Van Damme', null, '25-year-old Khalid Belkacem has failed at everything: college education, summer camp instructor''s permit, driver''s license, and even his BCG. He never expected to become the first "positive discrimination" member of the police force. But as his mother says: "That''s France for you! A country where everyone has a chance."', '25-year-old Khalid Belkacem has failed at everything: college education, summer camp instructor''s permit, driver''s license, and even his BCG. He never expected to become the first "positive discrimination" member of the police force. But as his mother says: "That''s France for you! A country where everyone has a chance."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6tfj24kfVRp1ahHBPApK7nAcXZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77460'),
