  ('192443716284470794', 'Beverly Hills Bodysnatchers', 1989, 'Mystery, Comedy, Horror', 'Jonathan Mostow, Zoran Hochstätter, Sharon Nederlander', null, 'Vic Tayback, Frank Gorshin, Art Metrano, Rodney Eastman, Warren Selko, Keone Young, Brooke Bundy, Linda Carol', 'R', 'A doctor and a mortician have teamed up to do re-animation experiments on corpses using gangster money loaned for "remodeling." When they can''t pay it back, the Mafia guy sends his nephews to work at the funeral home to keep a watch on the debtors, but the nephews end up helping in the search for new bodies, and mayhem ensues when some undesirable types are re-animated.', 'A doctor and a mortician have teamed up to do re-animation experiments on corpses using gangster money loaned for "remodeling." When they can''t pay it back, the Mafia guy sends his nephews to work at the funeral home to keep a watch on the debtors, but the nephews end up helping in the search for new bodies, and mayhem ensues when some undesirable types are re-animated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wItbPhH30x83vWPvmIeydSzH6CJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275328'),
  ('562347512282515933', 'Beverly Hills Brats', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Jim Sotos, Harry Mathias, Scott Cameron', 'Linda Silverthorn', 'Burt Young, Martin Sheen, Terry Moore, Peter Billingsley, Fernando Allende, George Kirby, Cathy Podewell, Joe Santos', 'PG-13', 'A rich young boy arranges to be kidnapped so he''ll get more attention from his parents.', 'A rich young boy arranges to be kidnapped so he''ll get more attention from his parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHsFYAF2jAmcYzK1WtEhBszFOlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219002'),
  ('907863718699978482', 'Beverly Hills Chihuahua', 2008, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure, Romance', 'Raja Gosnell, Phil Meheux, Alejandro Laviada', 'Jeffrey Bushell, Analisa LaBianco', 'Drew Barrymore, Piper Perabo, Andy Garcia, George López, Paul Rodríguez, Plácido Domingo, Edward James Olmos, Loretta Devine', 'PG', 'A pampered Beverly Hills chihuahua named Chloe who, while on vacation in Mexico with her owner Viv''s niece, Rachel, gets lost and must rely on her friends to help her get back home before she is caught by a dognapper who wants to ransom her.', 'A pampered Beverly Hills chihuahua named Chloe who, while on vacation in Mexico with her owner Viv''s niece, Rachel, gets lost and must rely on her friends to help her get back home before she is caught by a dognapper who wants to ransom her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aRvqtLoE06hTjG93lASvO7r1as.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14405'),
  ('704453092992898727', 'Beverly Hills Chihuahua 2', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Alex Zamm, Robert Brinkmann', 'Dannah Feinglass Phirman, Danielle Schneider', 'Odette Annable, George López, Zachary Gordon, Christine Lakin, Miguel Ferrer, Madison Pettis, Bridgit Mendler, Jon Donahue', 'G', 'Puppy mayhem turns the lives of newlywed Chihuahua parents Papi and Chloe upside down when their rambunctious, mischievous puppies present one challenge after another. But when their human owners end up in trouble, the tiny pups will stop at nothing to save them - because in good times and hard times, the family always sticks together. So Papi, Chloe and the puppies embark on a heroic adventure, proving once again that big heroes come in small packages.', 'Puppy mayhem turns the lives of newlywed Chihuahua parents Papi and Chloe upside down when their rambunctious, mischievous puppies present one challenge after another. But when their human owners end up in trouble, the tiny pups will stop at nothing to save them - because in good times and hard times, the family always sticks together. So Papi, Chloe and the puppies embark on a heroic adventure, proving once again that big heroes come in small packages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3IHj3utp8m0X1KpNHyfOIsypE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54540'),
  ('198665950202007019', 'Beverly Hills Chihuahua 3: Viva la Fiesta!', 2012, 'Comedy, Family', 'Lev L. Spiro, Greg Gardiner, Kate Caldwell', 'Dana Starfield', 'George López, Frances Fisher, Jake Busey, Emily Osment, Odette Annable, Madison Pettis, Lacey Chabert, Ernie Hudson', 'G', 'When Papi, Chloe, the pups, Uncle Pedro, and their owners move to a hotel, the smallest pup Rosa feels like she doesn''t fit in, and Papi wants to make her feel better by showing her how special she is.', 'When Papi, Chloe, the pups, Uncle Pedro, and their owners move to a hotel, the smallest pup Rosa feels like she doesn''t fit in, and Papi wants to make her feel better by showing her how special she is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fK3U8xulldz6lhMDuz3LFB7ngWH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105965'),
  ('1090373768920241692', 'Beverly Hills Cop', 1984, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Martin Brest, Bruce Surtees, Peter Bogart', 'Daniel Petrie Jr.', 'Eddie Murphy, Judge Reinhold, John Ashton, Lisa Eilbacher, Ronny Cox, Steven Berkoff, James Russo, Jonathan Banks', 'R', 'Fast-talking, quick-thinking Detroit street cop Axel Foley has bent more than a few rules and regs in his time, but when his best friend is murdered, he heads to sunny Beverly Hills to work the case like only he can.', 'Fast-talking, quick-thinking Detroit street cop Axel Foley has bent more than a few rules and regs in his time, but when his best friend is murdered, he heads to sunny Beverly Hills to work the case like only he can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBJEvKkhQ0tUt1dBAcTEYW6kCle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90'),
  ('653273890078824835', 'Beverly Hills Cop II', 1987, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Tony Scott, Jeffrey L. Kimball, Peter Bogart', 'Larry Ferguson, Warren Skaaren', 'Eddie Murphy, Judge Reinhold, John Ashton, Jürgen Prochnow, Ronny Cox, Brigitte Nielsen, Allen Garfield, Dean Stockwell', 'R', 'Axel Foley returns to the land of sunshine and palm trees to investigate the near-fatal shooting of police Captain Andrew Bogomil. With the help of Sgt. Taggart and Det. Rosewood, they soon uncover that the shooting is associated with a series of "alphabet" robberies masterminded by a heartless weapons kingpin—and the chase is on.', 'Axel Foley returns to the land of sunshine and palm trees to investigate the near-fatal shooting of police Captain Andrew Bogomil. With the help of Sgt. Taggart and Det. Rosewood, they soon uncover that the shooting is associated with a series of "alphabet" robberies masterminded by a heartless weapons kingpin—and the chase is on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egDakU8O5yUwpUJP9IMAUVtIDll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96'),
  ('287607885360127073', 'Beverly Hills Cop III', 1994, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'John Landis, Mac Ahlberg, Arthur Anderson', 'Steven E. de Souza', 'Eddie Murphy, Judge Reinhold, Héctor Elizondo, Timothy Carhart, John Saxon, Jon Tenney, Joey Travolta, Eugene Collier', 'R', 'When his boss is killed, Detroit cop Axel Foley finds evidence that the murderer had ties to a California amusement park called Wonder World. Returning to sunny Beverly Hills once more, Foley reunites with Detective Billy Rosewood to solve the case. Along with Billy''s new partner, Detective Jon Flint, they discover that Wonder World is being used as a front for a massive counterfeiting ring.', 'When his boss is killed, Detroit cop Axel Foley finds evidence that the murderer had ties to a California amusement park called Wonder World. Returning to sunny Beverly Hills once more, Foley reunites with Detective Billy Rosewood to solve the case. Along with Billy''s new partner, Detective Jon Flint, they discover that Wonder World is being used as a front for a massive counterfeiting ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vIpCkgGEfk5LZwm78nMxswLJRH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306'),
  ('434773119419641769', 'Beverly Hills Cop: Axel F', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Mark Molloy, Eduard Grau', 'Will Beall, Tom Gormican, Kevin Etten', 'Eddie Murphy, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Taylour Paige, Judge Reinhold, John Ashton, Paul Reiser, Bronson Pinchot, Kevin Bacon', 'R', 'Forty years after his unforgettable first case in Beverly Hills, Detroit cop Axel Foley returns to do what he does best: solve crimes and cause chaos.', 'Forty years after his unforgettable first case in Beverly Hills, Detroit cop Axel Foley returns to do what he does best: solve crimes and cause chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zszRKfzjM5jltiq8rk6rasKVpUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280180'),
  ('1039424496765686834', 'Beverly Hills Family Robinson', 1997, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Troy Miller, Roger Lanser', null, 'Dyan Cannon, Martin Mull, Sarah Michelle Gellar, Ryan O''Donohue, Josh Picker, Kevin Weisman, Michael Edward-Stevens, Nique Needles', null, 'Marsha Robinson, host of a TV cooking show, takes her family on a working vacation to a South Seas Island, but their yacht is hijacked by pirates, and then shipwrecked, and the Robinsons must survive Marsha''s complaints while they build a treehouse, meet a handsome carpenter, bond together as a family and fight off the pirates', 'Marsha Robinson, host of a TV cooking show, takes her family on a working vacation to a South Seas Island, but their yacht is hijacked by pirates, and then shipwrecked, and the Robinsons must survive Marsha''s complaints while they build a treehouse, meet a handsome carpenter, bond together as a family and fight off the pirates', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erZZMrIc8uMSXieoauWk7xL7K8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79738'),
  ('372102325553708331', 'Beverly Hills Ninja', 1997, 'Comedy, Action', 'Dennis Dugan, Arthur Albert, J.B. Rogers', 'Mark Feldberg, Mitchell Klebanoff', 'Chris Farley, Nicollette Sheridan, Robin Shou, Nathaniel Parker, Chris Rock, Soon-Tek Oh, Keith Cooke, François Chau', 'PG-13', 'Haru, an orphaned American who washes ashore in Japan and is mistaken for the great White Ninja of legend. Raised among the finest Ninjas, Haru grows strong and big - very big. With the grace of all Three Stooges rolled into one body, Haru is an embarrassment to his clan. But when a beautiful blonde pleads for his help, Haru is given one dangerous, disastrously funny chance to prove himself.', 'Haru, an orphaned American who washes ashore in Japan and is mistaken for the great White Ninja of legend. Raised among the finest Ninjas, Haru grows strong and big - very big. With the grace of all Three Stooges rolled into one body, Haru is an embarrassment to his clan. But when a beautiful blonde pleads for his help, Haru is given one dangerous, disastrously funny chance to prove himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAUtHecWe0KS54jNggapnbHBGTI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9622'),
  ('384964995413935748', 'Beverly Hills Vamp', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Fred Olen Ray, Stephen Ashley Blake, Gary Graver', 'Ernest D. Farino', 'Britt Ekland, Eddie Deezen, Tim Conway Jr., Tom Shell, Michelle Bauer, Jillian Kesner, Debra Lamb, John Henry Richardson', null, 'Kyle, Brock and Russell are three aspiring filmmakers new in Hollywood. They phone up an escort ad and take a trip to a Beverly Hills mansion, but unfortunately for them the call girls turn out to be fiendish vixens of the undead …', 'Kyle, Brock and Russell are three aspiring filmmakers new in Hollywood. They phone up an escort ad and take a trip to a Beverly Hills mansion, but unfortunately for them the call girls turn out to be fiendish vixens of the undead …', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czVNztaTUlPNZLSXZOIy85JhuY1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70856'),
  ('540592792603892933', 'Beverly of Graustark', 1926, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Percy Hilburn, Sidney Franklin, Hugh Boswell', 'Agnes Christine Johnston, Joseph Farnham', 'Marion Davies, Antonio Moreno, Creighton Hale, Roy D''Arcy, Albert Gran, Paulette Duval, Max Barwyn, Charles Clary', 'NR', 'Beverly Calhoun impersonates the Prince of Graustark to claim his birthright while he recovers from a skiing injury. In the meantime, she falls for her bodyguard Dantan.', 'Beverly Calhoun impersonates the Prince of Graustark to claim his birthright while he recovers from a skiing injury. In the meantime, she falls for her bodyguard Dantan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMHKZpiukzs3fWDVZmJcyGX6rob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322885'),
  ('272415438430870406', 'Bewafaa', 2005, 'Drama', 'Dharmesh Darshan, W. B. Rao', 'Dharmesh Darshan', 'Anil Kapoor, Akshay Kumar, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Sushmita Sen, Shamita Shetty, Manoj Bajpayee, Kabir Bedi, Nafisa Ali', null, 'Anjali, living in Canada with her parents, hides her relationship to the musician Raja from her parents. When her sister dies during the birth of twins, she abandons her love, marries the widower Aditja and moves to New Delhi to become the new mother of her sister''s children. Three years later, when Raja visits Delhi on his concert tour their love inflames again.', 'Anjali, living in Canada with her parents, hides her relationship to the musician Raja from her parents. When her sister dies during the birth of twins, she abandons her love, marries the widower Aditja and moves to New Delhi to become the new mother of her sister''s children. Three years later, when Raja visits Delhi on his concert tour their love inflames again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FVH3HfBkkwmPNMHb6c6lqvH82v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205212'),
  ('1123596301676499378', 'Bewakoofiyaan', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Nupur Asthana, Paarth Harish Joshi, Jay Malhotra', 'Habib Faisal', 'Rishi Kapoor, Ayushmann Khurrana, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Gurpal Singh, Simranjit Singh Hundal, Deepika Amin, Sanjay Nath', 'PG', 'A middle-class corporate couple doesn''t worry about money and living expenses until the recession drains their finances.', 'A middle-class corporate couple doesn''t worry about money and living expenses until the recession drains their finances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eniZIxK1INYbOQBeJWmv0IhKKOz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254171'),
  ('251799780686742636', 'Beware of a Holy Whore', 1971, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Ballhaus, Harry Baer', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Lou Castel, Eddie Constantine, Marquard Bohm, Hanna Schygulla, Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Margarethe von Trotta, Hannes Fuchs, Marcella Michelangeli', null, 'Film director Jeff and his lead actor are taking their time getting to set. In their absence, the crew lack a purposeful way to spend their time waiting, so they drink heavily. However, as booze is downed and frustration sets in, morale hits rock bottom.', 'Film director Jeff and his lead actor are taking their time getting to set. In their absence, the crew lack a purposeful way to spend their time waiting, so they drink heavily. However, as booze is downed and frustration sets in, morale hits rock bottom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwJXQMurcvmS81dqqXVIxb8gJNY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32319'),
  ('125633356319581752', 'Beware of Mr. Baker', 2012, 'Documentary, Music', 'Eric Robbins, Jay Bulger', 'Jay Bulger', 'Ginger Baker, Jay Bulger, Eric Clapton, Jack Bruce, Tony Allen, Bob Adcock, Carmine Appice, Brian Auger', 'NR', 'Ginger Baker is known for playing in Cream and Blind Faith, but the world''s greatest drummer didn’t hit his stride until 1972, when he arrived in Nigeria and discovered Fela Kuti''s Afrobeat. After leaving Nigeria, Ginger returned to his pattern of drug-induced self-destruction, and countless groundbreaking musical works, eventually settling in South Africa, where the 73-year-old lives with his young bride and 39 polo ponies. This documentary includes interviews with Eric Clapton, Steve Winwood, Carlos Santana and more. Beware of Mr. Baker! With every smash of the drum is a man smashing his way through life.', 'Ginger Baker is known for playing in Cream and Blind Faith, but the world''s greatest drummer didn’t hit his stride until 1972, when he arrived in Nigeria and discovered Fela Kuti''s Afrobeat. After leaving Nigeria, Ginger returned to his pattern of drug-induced self-destruction, and countless groundbreaking musical works, eventually settling in South Africa, where the 73-year-old lives with his young bride and 39 polo ponies. This documentary includes interviews with Eric Clapton, Steve Winwood, Carlos Santana and more. Beware of Mr. Baker! With every smash of the drum is a man smashing his way through life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8U2FGiRoyCej0Mh8VU6iAZVRY9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97610'),
  ('729341212500498326', 'Beware of People', 2015, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Arne Feldhusen, Jan Fehse', 'Peter Güde, Ralf Husmann', 'Charly Hübner, Lina Beckmann, Michael Maertens, Natalia Belitski, Christian Hockenbrink, Jörn Hentschel, Alexander Hörbe, David Miesmer', null, 'A story about a notorious liar and case worker.', 'A story about a notorious liar and case worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJTGbT2auFfaRt5xxJyugDF9heL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327311'),
  ('969848406937933641', 'Beware of the Car!', 1966, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Anatoliy Mukasey, Vladimir Nakhabtsev', 'Emil Braginskiy, Eldar Ryazanov', 'Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy, Oleg Efremov, Andrey Mironov, Georgi Zhzhyonov, Anatoliy Papanov, Olga Aroseva, Lyubov Dobrzhanskaya, Evgeniy Evstigneev', null, 'An insurance agent who moonlights as a car thief steals cars various crooks and never from the common people. He sells the stolen cars and gives the money to charity. His best friend, a cop, is assigned to bring in this modern robin hood.', 'An insurance agent who moonlights as a car thief steals cars various crooks and never from the common people. He sells the stolen cars and gives the money to charity. His best friend, a cop, is assigned to bring in this modern robin hood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxf7dGhwpwxe8b1itqxkkjFQac8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39768'),
  ('495758451428680682', 'Beware of the Jönsson Gang', 1981, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Roland Sterner, Jonas Cornell, Annika Levin', 'Gösta Ekman', 'Gösta Ekman, Ulf Brunnberg, Nils Brandt, Siw Malmkvist, Jan-Olof Strandberg, Tomas Norström, Per Grundén, Weiron Holmberg', null, 'A botched burglary leads to the arrest of the Jönsson gang’s leader, Sickan. After serving ten months in prison, he is released and unexpectedly recruited by the enigmatic banker Wall-Enberg Jr. to steal the legendary Bedford Diamonds in Switzerland. Though Sickan successfully carries out the heist, he is betrayed and nearly captured. Returning to Sweden and reuniting with his old accomplices, he sets out to take calculated revenge on the man who double-crossed him.', 'A botched burglary leads to the arrest of the Jönsson gang’s leader, Sickan. After serving ten months in prison, he is released and unexpectedly recruited by the enigmatic banker Wall-Enberg Jr. to steal the legendary Bedford Diamonds in Switzerland. Though Sickan successfully carries out the heist, he is betrayed and nearly captured. Returning to Sweden and reuniting with his old accomplices, he sets out to take calculated revenge on the man who double-crossed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkW9DJAeGzMnOWCDcCX2hEWe9y2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35343'),
  ('387067943453213410', 'Beware the Gorilla', 2019, 'Comedy, Family', 'Luca Miniero, Federico Angelucci', 'Luca Miniero, Gina Neri, Giulia Gianni', 'Frank Matano, Cristiana Capotondi, Lillo Petrolo, Francesco Scianna, Diana Del Bufalo, Massimo De Lorenzo, Ernesto Mahieux, Claudio Bisio', null, 'Lorenzo is a lawyer who files a lawsuit against the zoo of his town but after winning it he has to take home a gorilla.', 'Lorenzo is a lawyer who files a lawsuit against the zoo of his town but after winning it he has to take home a gorilla.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSiRxICCUg2JJyxJ1ZGLexFw1iW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567651'),
  ('25535955104027246', 'Beware the Slenderman', 2016, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Irene Taylor, Nick Midwig', null, 'Morgan Geyser, Anissa Weier, Payton Leutner, Angie Geyser, William Weier, Michael O. Bohren, Michelle Trussoni, Kristi Weier', null, 'In this horrifyingly modern fairytale lurks an online Boogeyman and two 12-year-old girls who would kill for him. The entrance to the internet quickly leads to its darkest basement. How responsible are our children for what they find there?', 'In this horrifyingly modern fairytale lurks an online Boogeyman and two 12-year-old girls who would kill for him. The entrance to the internet quickly leads to its darkest basement. How responsible are our children for what they find there?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5W2nhbnzOR2aNa7vSpwWCzzAw2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376424'),
  ('927013172791348020', 'Beware, My Lovely', 1952, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Harry Horner, George E. Diskant, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Mel Dinelli', 'Ida Lupino, Robert Ryan, Taylor Holmes, Barbara Whiting, James Willmas, O.Z. Whitehead, William Talman, Dee Pollock', 'NR', 'A psychopath on the run takes a job as a handyman at the house of a lonely widow.', 'A psychopath on the run takes a job as a handyman at the house of a lonely widow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAbmuXqrmNxF8OG3yQaiBnt6Y0s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43191'),
  ('1136084938984299401', 'Beware: Children at Play', 1989, 'Horror', 'Mik Cribben, Mik Cribben', 'Fred P. Sharkey', 'Lori Romero, Michael Robertson, Robin Lilly, Mik Cribben, Lori Tirgrath, Herb Klinger, Lorna Courtney, Danny McClaughlin', 'R', 'Parents are in a panic as their children mysteriously disappear. Little do they know that the only thing worse than their children disappearing would be them coming back. After the youngsters of Ellenburg fall under the ruthless control of a cult leader, they turn on their parents with gruesome results.', 'Parents are in a panic as their children mysteriously disappear. Little do they know that the only thing worse than their children disappearing would be them coming back. After the youngsters of Ellenburg fall under the ruthless control of a cult leader, they turn on their parents with gruesome results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUTs5eIhzqpi2Esepxui9HVu6dx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67309'),
  ('580289443054582327', 'Beware! The Blob', 1972, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Larry Hagman, Al Hamm, Jesse Corallo', 'Anthony Harris, Jack Woods', 'Robert Walker Jr., Gwynne Gilford, Richard Stahl, Richard Webb, Shelley Berman, Larry Hagman, Carol Lynley, Godfrey Cambridge', 'PG', 'A technician brings a frozen specimen of the original Blob back from the North Pole. When his wife accidentally defrosts the thing, it terrorizes the populace-- the local hippies, cops, drunks and bowlers must all face the Blob!', 'A technician brings a frozen specimen of the original Blob back from the North Pole. When his wife accidentally defrosts the thing, it terrorizes the populace-- the local hippies, cops, drunks and bowlers must all face the Blob!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqFXrV2zFiIedby3wWz1F7I0WFT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40983'),
  ('547390696164949156', 'Bewildered Bolbol', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Khaled Marei, Ahmed Yousef', 'Khaled Diab', 'Ahmed Helmy, Zeina, Sherry Adel, Amy Samir Ghanem, Youssef Fawzy, Wael Sami, Yasser El Tobgy, Anwar AlKhawam', null, 'Bulbul meets a successful aristocratic girl named Yasmine, but she''s not the romantic type he dreams of, at the same time he admires his cousin Hala for her calmness and kindness. In the middle of all this, the psychiatrist Amal shows up and he thinks of getting engaged to her.', 'Bulbul meets a successful aristocratic girl named Yasmine, but she''s not the romantic type he dreams of, at the same time he admires his cousin Hala for her calmness and kindness. In the middle of all this, the psychiatrist Amal shows up and he thinks of getting engaged to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BvqE3uBGJ0BBzAoUJkFzeq3d7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57773'),
  ('288765149990375203', 'Bewitched', 1945, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Arch Oboler, Charles Salerno Jr.', 'Arch Oboler', 'Phyllis Thaxter, Edmund Gwenn, Henry H. Daniels Jr., Addison Richards, Kathleen Lockhart, Francis Pierlot, Sharon McManus, Gladys Blake', 'NR', 'A girl enlists a psychic to get rid of her murderous alternate personality.', 'A girl enlists a psychic to get rid of her murderous alternate personality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXCmtxfAezpbMw9S3I5ZuG04UFG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42325'),
  ('882413449903695857', 'Bewitched', 1976, 'Drama, Horror', 'Américo Hoss, Gilberto Sierra, Armando Bó', 'Armando Bó', 'Isabel Sarli, Víctor Bó, Miguel A. Olmos, Adolpho Chadler, Sônia Brasil, Josefina Daniele, Gilberto Sierra, Daniel de Alvarado', null, 'Ansise is a former Indian whose only dream is to become a mother. The idea of motherhood gradually turns into an obsession for her. Unfortunately, she has married an impotent man. But she tries to get pregnant anyway. She even tries to work as a prostitute and goes to a local witch. But the real problem is that an evil entity called Pombero has fallen with love with her, killing all the men crossing her way.', 'Ansise is a former Indian whose only dream is to become a mother. The idea of motherhood gradually turns into an obsession for her. Unfortunately, she has married an impotent man. But she tries to get pregnant anyway. She even tries to work as a prostitute and goes to a local witch. But the real problem is that an evil entity called Pombero has fallen with love with her, killing all the men crossing her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFCecHSH1okTGW8hscO6deHyhk3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146728'),
  ('954882752446985027', 'Bewitched', 1981, 'Horror, Crime, Fantasy', 'Kuei Chih-Hung, Lee San-Yip', 'Szeto On', 'Ai Fei, Melvin Wong, Fan Lei, Lily Chan, Wu Pei-Chin, Choi Kwok-Hing, Wong Siu-Ming, Lee Sau-Kei', null, 'While possessed by an evil spirit, a man murders his daughter. A police detective investigating the case also becomes possessed. A good monk helps fight the evil spirit.', 'While possessed by an evil spirit, a man murders his daughter. A police detective investigating the case also becomes possessed. A good monk helps fight the evil spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUy2q8VDNnG0CZ58CHoZmb0vBYY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104599'),
  ('874678566991146797', 'Bewitched', 2005, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Nora Ephron, John Lindley, Amy Vincent', 'Nora Ephron, Delia Ephron, Sol Saks', 'Nicole Kidman, Will Ferrell, Shirley MacLaine, Michael Caine, Jason Schwartzman, Kristin Chenoweth, Heather Burns, Jim Turner', 'PG-13', 'Thinking he can overshadow an unknown actress in the part, an egocentric actor unknowingly gets a witch cast in an upcoming television remake of the classic show "Bewitched".', 'Thinking he can overshadow an unknown actress in the part, an egocentric actor unknowingly gets a witch cast in an upcoming television remake of the classic show "Bewitched".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lx4EXmAZo8ogh4128UBZRQfCjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9722'),
  ('1065924933526393924', 'Bewitched Bunny', 1954, 'Animation', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'Bugs must rescue Hansel and Gretel from Witch Hazel''s clutches.', 'Bugs must rescue Hansel and Gretel from Witch Hazel''s clutches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omS0uuQxsZRURDbMDwnIQbotjjy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83743'),
  ('909536068944917019', 'Bewitching Attraction', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lee Ha, Choi Joo-young', 'Lee Ha', 'Moon So-ri, Ji Jin-hee, Park Won-sang, Yoo Seung-mok, Jeong Woo-hyuk, Shin Joo-ah, Cho Seong-ha, Seo Jun-young', null, 'The lovely and promiscuous textile professor Eun-sook has all the male professors wrapped around her finger. It also helps that she has slept with most of them. Eun-sook is also a member of an environmental awareness group. When the popular comic book artist Suk-gyu joins the group, he arouses the jealousy of Mr. YOO, one of the other member who fears that Suk-gyu will steal Eun-sook from him. It turns out that Eun-sook and Suk-gyu attended the same junior high school where they share a secret and tragic history. Back then, Eun-sook was Suk-gyu''s older brother’s girlfriend. But after Eun-sook decides to sleep with Suk-gyu as well, the older brother''s best friend dies in an accident in which both of them are involved. As the jealous MR.YOO starts to investigate Eun-sook and Suk-gyu''s past, will their secret be kept? Will they get together again?', 'The lovely and promiscuous textile professor Eun-sook has all the male professors wrapped around her finger. It also helps that she has slept with most of them. Eun-sook is also a member of an environmental awareness group. When the popular comic book artist Suk-gyu joins the group, he arouses the jealousy of Mr. YOO, one of the other member who fears that Suk-gyu will steal Eun-sook from him. It turns out that Eun-sook and Suk-gyu attended the same junior high school where they share a secret and tragic history. Back then, Eun-sook was Suk-gyu''s older brother’s girlfriend. But after Eun-sook decides to sleep with Suk-gyu as well, the older brother''s best friend dies in an accident in which both of them are involved. As the jealous MR.YOO starts to investigate Eun-sook and Suk-gyu''s past, will their secret be kept? Will they get together again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcmCNsrKBfBal0pPtpwdeLkO5TB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107540'),
  ('1067160482963242610', 'Beyaz Melek', 2007, 'Drama', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül', null, 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül, Sarp Apak, Arif Erkin Güzelbeyoğlu, Yıldız Kenter, Erol Günaydın, Gazanfer Özcan, Cezmi Baskın, Lale Belkıs', null, 'The film is a love story. However, it is not a story about the love between two people, but rather a story about the love and affection that a group of people feel for life and for each other. The film depicts all kinds of love, from east to west, from schoolchildren to villagers, from young to old, in both an emotional and humorous way.', 'The film is a love story. However, it is not a story about the love between two people, but rather a story about the love and affection that a group of people feel for life and for each other. The film depicts all kinds of love, from east to west, from schoolchildren to villagers, from young to old, in both an emotional and humorous way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/650kW1gSGLnLWKZ7wpEM3gdK6ru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27947'),
  ('1088311961544706172', 'Beyblade the Movie: Fierce Battle', 2002, 'Adventure, Animation', 'Toshifumi Kawase, Yasutaka Hanabusa, Toshiyuki Komaru', null, 'Motoko Kumai, Ai Orikasa, Aya Hisakawa, Houko Kuwashima, Ai Orikasa, Urara Takano, Nao Nagasawa, Shiho Kikuchi', 'NR', 'Immediately after winning the National Championships, Tyson is challenged by a mysterious boy named Daichi, who is determined to become the next Beyblading champion. But when they battle, their Beyblades awaken ancient dark forces that take human form and become the evil Shadow-Bladers who vow to destroy mankind! Now it''s up to Tyson and the Bladebreakers to defeat the Shadow-Bladers before they carry out their destructive plan. Will they succeed... or is this the end of the Bladebreakers?', 'Immediately after winning the National Championships, Tyson is challenged by a mysterious boy named Daichi, who is determined to become the next Beyblading champion. But when they battle, their Beyblades awaken ancient dark forces that take human form and become the evil Shadow-Bladers who vow to destroy mankind! Now it''s up to Tyson and the Bladebreakers to defeat the Shadow-Bladers before they carry out their destructive plan. Will they succeed... or is this the end of the Bladebreakers?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48na9Jhxix2zFCZEyD3hkNxxpaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166823'),
  ('930748812146993882', 'Beyoncé: Life Is But a Dream', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Ed Burke, Beyoncé', 'Beyoncé, Ed Burke, Ilan Benatar', 'Beyoncé, Jay-Z, Tina Knowles, Solange, Kelly Rowland, Michelle Williams, Lady Gaga, Matthew Morrison', 'NR', 'Life Is But a Dream is a HBO documentary about the life of US singer Beyoncé Knowles during the years 2011 and 2012 and on the recording of her fifth album. The film was directed by Beyoncé herself. The film shows Beyoncé from intimate moments of her pregnancy to behind the scenes and rehearsals of the main concerts of that time.', 'Life Is But a Dream is a HBO documentary about the life of US singer Beyoncé Knowles during the years 2011 and 2012 and on the recording of her fifth album. The film was directed by Beyoncé herself. The film shows Beyoncé from intimate moments of her pregnancy to behind the scenes and rehearsals of the main concerts of that time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycCe2U86MvPikPi1grnOrTxefFL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178850'),
  ('547726199271054898', 'Beyond', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Koji Morimoto, Takeshi Honda, Yusuke Hirota', 'Koji Morimoto, Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski', 'Hedy Burress, Tress MacNeille, Kath Soucie, Pamela Adlon, Tara Strong, Jill Talley, Jack Fletcher, Julia Fletcher', null, 'While looking for her cat, a young woman and some kids find an abandoned building where strange things happen and the rules of physics don''t always apply. Part of the Animatrix collection of animated shorts set in the Matrix universe.', 'While looking for her cat, a young woman and some kids find an abandoned building where strange things happen and the rules of physics don''t always apply. Part of the Animatrix collection of animated shorts set in the Matrix universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22A3kGBJHOr5It6HHRXZYKTbKz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24675'),
  ('1130212496005822288', 'Beyond a Reasonable Doubt', 1956, 'Crime, Drama', 'William E. Snyder, Fritz Lang', 'Douglas Morrow', 'Dana Andrews, Joan Fontaine, Sidney Blackmer, Arthur Franz, Philip Bourneuf, Edward Binns, Shepperd Strudwick, Robin Raymond', 'NR', 'A newspaper publisher, wanting to prove a point about the insufficiency of circumstantial evidence, talks his possible son-in-law Tom into a hoax in an attempt to expose ineptitude of the city''s hard-line district attorney. The plan is to have Tom plant clues leading to his arrest for killing a female nightclub dancer. Once Tom is found guilty, he is to reveal the setup and humiliate the DA.', 'A newspaper publisher, wanting to prove a point about the insufficiency of circumstantial evidence, talks his possible son-in-law Tom into a hoax in an attempt to expose ineptitude of the city''s hard-line district attorney. The plan is to have Tom plant clues leading to his arrest for killing a female nightclub dancer. Once Tom is found guilty, he is to reveal the setup and humiliate the DA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/en5rlVq8w4JSrxXForJhMP2S0xY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20330'),
  ('149770567157585471', 'Beyond a Reasonable Doubt', 2009, 'Thriller', 'Peter Hyams, Peter Hyams', 'Douglas Morrow', 'Jesse Metcalfe, Amber Tamblyn, Michael Douglas, Joel David Moore, Orlando Jones, Lawrence P. Beron, Sewell Whitney, David Jensen', 'PG-13', 'Remake of a 1956 Fritz Lang film in which a novelist''s investigation of a dirty district attorney leads to a setup within the courtroom.', 'Remake of a 1956 Fritz Lang film in which a novelist''s investigation of a dirty district attorney leads to a setup within the courtroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZvWmX3fhjnlIbiou5ziR6aVN7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25137'),
  ('794192008530735087', 'Beyond Atlantis', 1973, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Eddie Romero, María Abelardo, Justo Paulino', 'Charles Eric Johnson', 'Patrick Wayne, John Ashley, Leigh Christian, Sid Haig, Lenore Stevens, George Nader, Vic Diaz, Eddie Garcia', 'PG', 'A band of adventurers invade a native island determined to grab a reported fortune in buried treasure.', 'A band of adventurers invade a native island determined to grab a reported fortune in buried treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UmiFVWnbZWQjGldZnamA0YyLbq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86742'),
  ('2287160712337690', 'Beyond Beauty: Taiwan from Above', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Chi Po-Lin', 'Chi-chuan Tsui', 'Wu Nien-jen, Xiang Hong, Cing-Soong Lai, Nolay Piho', null, 'Documenting Taiwan from an aerial perspective offering a glimpse of Taiwan''s natural beauty as well as the effect of human activities and urbanization on our environment.', 'Documenting Taiwan from an aerial perspective offering a glimpse of Taiwan''s natural beauty as well as the effect of human activities and urbanization on our environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnFolVSO2u3G2shKt0VtB02QM5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241693'),
  ('339632635623531634', 'Beyond Borders', 2003, 'Drama, Romance, Adventure, War', 'Martin Campbell, Phil Meheux', null, 'Angelina Jolie, Clive Owen, Teri Polo, Linus Roache, Noah Emmerich, Yorick van Wageningen, Timothy West, Jonathan Higgins', 'R', 'Sarah Jordan, an American living in London in 1984, is married to the son of a wealthy British industrialist. She encounters Nick Callahan, a renegade doctor, whose impassioned plea for help to support his relief efforts in war-torn Africa moves her deeply. As a result, Sarah embarks upon a journey of discovery that leads to danger, heartbreak and romance in the far corners of the world.', 'Sarah Jordan, an American living in London in 1984, is married to the son of a wealthy British industrialist. She encounters Nick Callahan, a renegade doctor, whose impassioned plea for help to support his relief efforts in war-torn Africa moves her deeply. As a result, Sarah embarks upon a journey of discovery that leads to danger, heartbreak and romance in the far corners of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7Upm2AtGuTzCs2Asq0GyBIMAxX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9839'),
  ('211640932015788368', 'Beyond Brotherhood', 2017, 'Drama', 'Arianne Benedetti, Eduardo Enrique Mayén, Nathan Wilson', 'Arianne Benedetti', 'Drew Fuller, Valerie Domínguez, Robin Durán, María Conchita Alonso, Eric Roberts, Juana Viale, Arianne Benedetti, Claudio Gallardou', null, 'Two young siblings ended up living on the streets, having nothing left but their love. It''s a story about survival, second chances and second falls, with an unexpected turn at the end.', 'Two young siblings ended up living on the streets, having nothing left but their love. It''s a story about survival, second chances and second falls, with an unexpected turn at the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tExuJbpB9vDdpFK31QEBq4aksPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477359'),
  ('619019636695403385', 'Beyond Citizen Kane', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Simon Hartog', 'Simon Hartog', 'Leonel Brizola, Chico Buarque, Walter Clark, Dias Gomes, Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva, Armando Nogueira, Antônio Carlos Magalhães, Roberto Marinho', null, 'Beyond Citizen Kane (1993) is a British documentary film directed by Simon Hartog, produced by John Ellis, and broadcast on Channel 4. It details the dominant position of the Rede Globo media group in the Brazilian society, discussing the group''s influence, power, and political connections. Globo''s president and founder Roberto Marinho came in for particular criticism, being compared with fictional newspaper tycoon Charles Foster Kane, created by Orson Welles for the 1941 film Citizen Kane. According to the documentary, Marinho''s media group engages in the same Kane wholesale manipulation of news to influence the public opinion.', 'Beyond Citizen Kane (1993) is a British documentary film directed by Simon Hartog, produced by John Ellis, and broadcast on Channel 4. It details the dominant position of the Rede Globo media group in the Brazilian society, discussing the group''s influence, power, and political connections. Globo''s president and founder Roberto Marinho came in for particular criticism, being compared with fictional newspaper tycoon Charles Foster Kane, created by Orson Welles for the 1941 film Citizen Kane. According to the documentary, Marinho''s media group engages in the same Kane wholesale manipulation of news to influence the public opinion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpgEvSwkxXkef5mcFDRTBZagoEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173077'),
  ('955951389732503527', 'Beyond Darkness', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Claudio Fragasso', 'Claudio Fragasso, Rossella Drudi', 'Gene LeBrock, David Brandon, Barbara Bingham, Michael Stephenson, Stephen Brown, Mary Coulson', null, 'A priest and his family move into a new house, without knowing that it was built over the place where twenty witches were burnt at the stake.', 'A priest and his family move into a new house, without knowing that it was built over the place where twenty witches were burnt at the stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a44jIGdKlMflCz4IYlYu5nlPcXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60190'),
  ('184384998566069544', 'Beyond Desire', 1995, 'Action, Thriller', 'Sven Kirsten, Dominique Othenin-Girard', 'Dale Trevillion', 'William Forsythe, Kari Wührer, Leo Rossi, Sharon Farrell, Billy Bastiani, Dennis Hayden, Fred Doumani Jr., Natalya Lapina', 'R', 'Rita is a sexy call girl in a red Corvette convertible who just met Ray. Ray is an ex-con just released after serving 14 years for a killing he claims he was framed for. When these two get together, sparks fly and temperatures rise. But Ray has a reason not to trust Rita - $1 million has been stashed somewhere in Las Vegas and Ray knows everyone wants it almost as much as they want him dead. When everyone has a hidden agenda, who do you trust?', 'Rita is a sexy call girl in a red Corvette convertible who just met Ray. Ray is an ex-con just released after serving 14 years for a killing he claims he was framed for. When these two get together, sparks fly and temperatures rise. But Ray has a reason not to trust Rita - $1 million has been stashed somewhere in Las Vegas and Ray knows everyone wants it almost as much as they want him dead. When everyone has a hidden agenda, who do you trust?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNaSk0z4sMA0mqZwviQBdYTvONF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87836'),
  ('282104781942842556', 'Beyond Dream''s Door', 1989, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Jay Woelfel, Scott Spears', 'Jay Woelfel', 'Nick Baldasare, Rick Kesler, Susan Pinsky, Norm Singer, Daniel White, John Dunleavy, Darby Vasbinder, Marge Whitney', 'NR', 'Ben Dobbs is a lonely college student who has never had dreams of any kind. This all changes for Ben and he start having a series of sequential and terrifying nightmares that become true in his waking life. As he reaches out for help, he is also expanding the net his nightmare demon is spreading for new victims. Ben’s challenge is to survive this new surrealistic world Beyond Dream’s Door.', 'Ben Dobbs is a lonely college student who has never had dreams of any kind. This all changes for Ben and he start having a series of sequential and terrifying nightmares that become true in his waking life. As he reaches out for help, he is also expanding the net his nightmare demon is spreading for new victims. Ben’s challenge is to survive this new surrealistic world Beyond Dream’s Door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IZVyG3q20fVUlPAoyA451wNmOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83285'),
  ('1014466106427253142', 'Beyond Evil', 1980, 'Horror', 'Herb Freed, Ken Plotin', 'Paul Ross, Herb Freed', 'John Saxon, Lynda Day George, Michael Dante, Mario Milano, Janice Lynde, David Opatoshu, Anne Marisse, Zitto Kazann', 'R', 'Middle-aged newlyweds Larry & Barbara spend their honeymoon at a palatial Filipino mansion, unaware that it is inhabited by the vengeful spirit of a notorious voodoo witch queen who was murdered a century ago. The woman''s evil spirit promptly begins precipitating a variety of violent deaths in accordance with a diabolical ritual intended to bring her back to life -a process which is ultimately consummated by taking possession of Barbara''s body.', 'Middle-aged newlyweds Larry & Barbara spend their honeymoon at a palatial Filipino mansion, unaware that it is inhabited by the vengeful spirit of a notorious voodoo witch queen who was murdered a century ago. The woman''s evil spirit promptly begins precipitating a variety of violent deaths in accordance with a diabolical ritual intended to bring her back to life -a process which is ultimately consummated by taking possession of Barbara''s body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFE1K45Lo0YRDw8hC9VSiHW1k3D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88410'),
  ('373890787120286702', 'Beyond Good and Evil', 1977, 'Drama', 'Liliana Cavani, Armando Nannuzzi, Albino Cocco', 'Franco Arcalli, Liliana Cavani, Italo Moscati', 'Dominique Sanda, Erland Josephson, Robert Powell, Virna Lisi, Michael Degen, Elisa Cegani, Umberto Orsini, Philippe Leroy', null, 'The German philosopher Friedrich Nietzsche and his Jewish companion Paul Ree meet a beautiful young Russian intellectual and draw her into a ménage-à-trois.', 'The German philosopher Friedrich Nietzsche and his Jewish companion Paul Ree meet a beautiful young Russian intellectual and draw her into a ménage-à-trois.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxFXut8oJUTmzYiDdtIrMEMDim5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82299'),
  ('35395199335585117', 'Beyond Hypothermia', 1996, 'Action, Thriller, Romance', 'Patrick Leung Pak-Kin, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Jeong Il-Man', 'Roy Szeto Wai-Cheuk', 'Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Han Jae-suk, Shirley Huang, Deon Cheung Chung-Chi, Yeon Joo Kim, Jung Hee-tae, Cheung Kam-Bon', null, 'A mysterious and highly successful hitwoman in Hong Kong is paid to assassinate top-level crime bosses. After beginning a relationship with a noodle vendor, she decides to travel to South Korea to complete one last job. Unfortunately, the dead man''s bodyguard is out for revenge.', 'A mysterious and highly successful hitwoman in Hong Kong is paid to assassinate top-level crime bosses. After beginning a relationship with a noodle vendor, she decides to travel to South Korea to complete one last job. Unfortunately, the dead man''s bodyguard is out for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEQaqbGG7ucQqMuYkIGq7J7jE95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45509'),
  ('549683033863470466', 'Beyond Infinity: Buzz and the Journey to Lightyear', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Tony Kaplan, Tim Metzger', null, 'Angus MacLane, Pete Docter, Jeff Pidgeon, Jason Headley, Galyn Susman, Anthony J. Greenberg, Gregory Peltz, Paulie Alam', 'PG', 'Explore the evolution of Buzz Lightyear from toy to human in the making of Pixar’s Lightyear. Dive into the origin and cultural impact of everyone’s favorite Space Ranger, the art of designing a new “human Buzz,” and the challenges faced by the Lightyear crew along the way.', 'Explore the evolution of Buzz Lightyear from toy to human in the making of Pixar’s Lightyear. Dive into the origin and cultural impact of everyone’s favorite Space Ranger, the art of designing a new “human Buzz,” and the challenges faced by the Lightyear crew along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnp0INIjyWt4AziWmTHgPk9IFoE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979163'),
  ('933227255776251085', 'Beyond Justice', 1992, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Duccio Tessari, Giorgio Di Battista', 'George Eastman, Luciano Vincenzoni, Sergio Donati', 'Rutger Hauer, Carol Alt, Omar Sharif, David Flosi, Kabir Bedi, Peter Sands, Christopher Ahrens, D.R. Nanayakkara', null, 'A woman''s ex-husband, who is the son of an Arab chieftain, kidnaps their teenage son and brings him back to Morocco, where the boy is to be made the leader of the tribe. The child''s mother hires a mercenary to get her son and bring him back to her.', 'A woman''s ex-husband, who is the son of an Arab chieftain, kidnaps their teenage son and brings him back to Morocco, where the boy is to be made the leader of the tribe. The child''s mother hires a mercenary to get her son and bring him back to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsg0kIf8eKVymaSKJhDV3Bfc5so.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112054'),
  ('1036806080993215616', 'Beyond Loch Ness', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Paul Ziller, Anthony C. Metchie', 'Jason Bourque, Paul Ziller', 'Brian Krause, Niall Matter, Don S. Davis, Donnelly Rhodes, Carrie Genzel, Amber Borycki, Paul McGillion, Serinda Swan', 'R', 'James Murphey is a rugged cryptozoologist, who thirty years earlier, during a trip to Loch Ness, Scotland, had a fatal encounter with the fabled "Nessie" creature that killed his father, and left James with deep facial scar. Twenty years later, James is hunting for Nessie, when his search leads him to the sleepy town of Pike Island, Ashburn, on Lake Superior. Hiring Josh Riley as his guide, James and Josh bond over their mutual scientific interests and deceased fathers, while James tries to convince Josh''s mother, Sheriff Karen Riley, that the 60-foot plesiosaur is killing and breeding.', 'James Murphey is a rugged cryptozoologist, who thirty years earlier, during a trip to Loch Ness, Scotland, had a fatal encounter with the fabled "Nessie" creature that killed his father, and left James with deep facial scar. Twenty years later, James is hunting for Nessie, when his search leads him to the sleepy town of Pike Island, Ashburn, on Lake Superior. Hiring Josh Riley as his guide, James and Josh bond over their mutual scientific interests and deceased fathers, while James tries to convince Josh''s mother, Sheriff Karen Riley, that the 60-foot plesiosaur is killing and breeding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFv5G3Io0hF0ruAO1z0KBTXCHEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48397'),
  ('918986469782643511', 'beyond money', 2017, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Kike Maíllo, Álex Catalán', 'Kike Maíllo', 'Adriana Ugarte, Bárbara Goenaga, Miquel Fernández, Will Shephard', null, 'In a near future, Lucía (Adriana Ugarte) decides to sell some of her most treasured experiences to get rich. Surrounded by luxury we all want to have, she will discover where is her balance. Would you sell your most treasured experiences? How much.', 'In a near future, Lucía (Adriana Ugarte) decides to sell some of her most treasured experiences to get rich. Surrounded by luxury we all want to have, she will discover where is her balance. Would you sell your most treasured experiences? How much.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VjhTgEEASUoaHMHEoNVVFFXykj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453571'),
  ('846776962603014943', 'Beyond My Grandfather Allende', 2015, 'History, Documentary', 'Marcia Tambutti Allende, David Bravo, Eduardo Cruz-Coke', 'Marcia Tambutti Allende, Paola Castillo, Bruni Burres', 'Salvador Allende, Ana María Bussi, Hernán Coloma, Osvaldo Puccio Huidobro, Romilio Tambutti, Isabel Allende Bussi, Hortensia Bussi Soto, Marcia Tambutti Allende', null, 'Marcia, granddaughter of Salvador Allende, the first democratic socialist president who was overthrown by the Army in September 1973, seeks to reconstruct the personal and familiar image of her grandfather, buried by his historical person, her exile and the family pain.', 'Marcia, granddaughter of Salvador Allende, the first democratic socialist president who was overthrown by the Army in September 1973, seeks to reconstruct the personal and familiar image of her grandfather, buried by his historical person, her exile and the family pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OEBzobxfjqLA4rSYllUS93lSSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326299'),
  ('567003119212789250', 'Beyond Oblivion', 1956, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Alberto Etchebehere, Felipe López, Orlando Zumpano', 'Eduardo Borrás', 'Laura Hidalgo, Hugo del Carril, Gloria Ferrandiz, Ricardo Galache, Pedro Laxalt, Francisco López Silva, Eduardo Rudy, Ricardo de Rosas', null, 'After a period of sorrow, Fernando de Arellano, a rich businessman who has recently lost his young wife Blanca from a serious ilness, meets Mónica, who looks identical to her.', 'After a period of sorrow, Fernando de Arellano, a rich businessman who has recently lost his young wife Blanca from a serious ilness, meets Mónica, who looks identical to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqwHSWYhiPaaD1RBOj9XNmLuV3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335486'),
  ('253997977693728011', 'Beyond Outrage', 2012, 'Action, Crime', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Takeshi Kitano, Ryo Kase, Toshiyuki Nishida, Shun Sugata, Ken Mitsuishi, Tomokazu Miura, Yutaka Matsushige, Shigeru Kōyama', 'R', 'As the police launch a full-scale crackdown on organized crime, it ignites a national yakuza struggle between the Sanno of the East and Hanabishi of the West. What started as an internal strife in Outrage has now become a nationwide war in Outrage Beyond.', 'As the police launch a full-scale crackdown on organized crime, it ignites a national yakuza struggle between the Sanno of the East and Hanabishi of the West. What started as an internal strife in Outrage has now become a nationwide war in Outrage Beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9nPRD7PIx7dE5BqbYZKVlQawHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121828'),
  ('611699623369156880', 'Beyond Rangoon', 1995, 'Drama, Thriller', 'John Boorman, John Seale, David Burr', 'Alex Lasker, Bill Rubenstein', 'Patricia Arquette, U Aung Ko, Frances McDormand, Spalding Gray, Tiara Jacquelina, Ann Howard, Victor Slezak, Ye Myint', 'R', 'Dr. Laura Bowman is a young widow who''s unwittingly drawn into political turmoil while vacationing in Burma in the late 1980s. Bowman initially left San Francisco with her sister in an attempt to escape painful memories of her husband and son''s violent deaths. But her fight to escape to Thailand could prove just as harrowing.', 'Dr. Laura Bowman is a young widow who''s unwittingly drawn into political turmoil while vacationing in Burma in the late 1980s. Bowman initially left San Francisco with her sister in an attempt to escape painful memories of her husband and son''s violent deaths. But her fight to escape to Thailand could prove just as harrowing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTiy5kSP3Hetig7xB4E8INq5ron.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1873'),
  ('981889825560479759', 'Beyond Re-Animator', 2003, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Brian Yuzna, Andreu Rebés', 'José Manuel Gómez', 'Jeffrey Combs, Jason Barry, Elsa Pataky, Enrique Arce, Nico Baixas, Lolo Herrero, Raquel Gribler, Simón Andreu', 'R', 'Once again tampering with mother nature to disastrous results, Dr. Herbert West continues his research while serving time in a maximum security prison for his previous exploits. West''s limited prison-cell experiments are suddenly interrupted by the arrival of a new prison doctor and the brother of the girl who suffered from West''s experiments 13 years earlier.', 'Once again tampering with mother nature to disastrous results, Dr. Herbert West continues his research while serving time in a maximum security prison for his previous exploits. West''s limited prison-cell experiments are suddenly interrupted by the arrival of a new prison doctor and the brother of the girl who suffered from West''s experiments 13 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iS4oB4nQEdO86Fvszqf6P2ejK44.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11429'),
  ('896965255333637859', 'Beyond Sherwood Forest', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Peter DeLuise, Adam Sliwinski, Darek Wyszynski', 'Chase Parker', 'Mark Gibbon, Bill Dow, Julian Sands, Richard de Klerk, Robin Dunne, Katharine Isabelle, Erica Durance, Cainan Wiebe', null, 'King Richard is away fighting the Crusade, his brother Prince John has been left in charge. In order to further international diplomatic relations with Norway, the beautiful young Maid Marian is to be married off to a prince. A cursed girl who can change into a ferocious dragon is used to find and pacify Robin Hood.', 'King Richard is away fighting the Crusade, his brother Prince John has been left in charge. In order to further international diplomatic relations with Norway, the beautiful young Maid Marian is to be married off to a prince. A cursed girl who can change into a ferocious dragon is used to find and pacify Robin Hood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/789U5EUoGTAEkxr2ST5tUm7PXz4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37746'),
  ('335552286581255293', 'Beyond Silence', 1996, 'Drama, Music', 'Gernot Roll, Caroline Link', 'Caroline Link, Beth Serlin', 'Sylvie Testud, Tatjana Trieb, Howie Seago, Emmanuelle Laborit, Sibylle Canonica, Matthias Habich, Alexandra Bolz, Hansa Czypionka', null, 'Beyond Silence is about a family and a young girl’s coming of age story. This German film looks into the lives of the deaf and at a story about the love for music. A girl who has always had to translate speech into sign language for her deaf parents yet when her love for playing music grows strong she must decide to continue doing something she cannot share with her parents.', 'Beyond Silence is about a family and a young girl’s coming of age story. This German film looks into the lives of the deaf and at a story about the love for music. A girl who has always had to translate speech into sign language for her deaf parents yet when her love for playing music grows strong she must decide to continue doing something she cannot share with her parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfNOcXDcwzKOlJoTtQM4lsEVxS1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312'),
  ('229110481064136350', 'Beyond Skyline', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Liam O''Donnell, Christopher Probst, Ray Farandy Pakpahan', 'Liam O''Donnell', 'Frank Grillo, Bojana Novaković, Iko Uwais, Yayan Ruhian, Callan Mulvey, Pamelyn Chee, Lindsey Morgan, Zarah Mahler', 'R', 'Detective Mark Corley storms his way onto an alien spaceship to rescue his estranged son. When the ship crashes in Southeast Asia, he forges an alliance with a band of survivors to take back the planet once and for all.', 'Detective Mark Corley storms his way onto an alien spaceship to rescue his estranged son. When the ship crashes in Southeast Asia, he forges an alliance with a band of survivors to take back the planet once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctViyxTFf7r89sUg7jWNqk7cbbT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271404'),
  ('737143772729474546', 'Beyond Suspicion', 2010, 'Thriller', 'Gabriel Le Bomin, Pierre Cottereau', 'Olivier Gorce, Gabriel Le Bomin', 'Marc-André Grondin, Laura Smet, Charles Berling, Grégori Derangère, Dominique Reymond, Francis Perrin, Gabriele Bazzichi, Dominique Favre-Bulle', null, 'Henri est convaincu que Lise, sa nouvelle et jeune femme, l’aime sincèrement. Henri est aussi convaincu que Sam, le témoin de leur mariage, est le frère de Lise. La machination est parfaite. Enfin presque...', 'Henri est convaincu que Lise, sa nouvelle et jeune femme, l’aime sincèrement. Henri est aussi convaincu que Sam, le témoin de leur mariage, est le frère de Lise. La machination est parfaite. Enfin presque...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vY15lBN8g8Gnsq4Zk9QyaacWAtn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53918'),
  ('366837749749561491', 'Beyond Terror', 1980, 'Crime, Horror', 'Tomás Aznar, Hermenegildo Romero, Ana Fernández', 'Miguel Lizondo, Juan Piquer Simón, Tomás Aznar', 'Francisco Sánchez Grajera, Raquel Ramírez, Emilio Siegrist, Antonio Jabalera, Alexia Loreto, David Forrest, Andreé Van de Woestyne, Martin Kordas', null, 'After a drug-fueled night of violence, a group of young degenerates and their hostages find themselves stranded in a remote, abandoned church in rural Spain. Their evening of debauchery and blasphemy quickly turns to greed when they discover a local legend that tells of a vast fortune guarded by mummies in the catacombs beneath the ruins. Their lust for the treasure is short-lived as they find that the supernatural horror in the catacombs is something further than fear… it is Beyond Terror!', 'After a drug-fueled night of violence, a group of young degenerates and their hostages find themselves stranded in a remote, abandoned church in rural Spain. Their evening of debauchery and blasphemy quickly turns to greed when they discover a local legend that tells of a vast fortune guarded by mummies in the catacombs beneath the ruins. Their lust for the treasure is short-lived as they find that the supernatural horror in the catacombs is something further than fear… it is Beyond Terror!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihrZ0CWFI5BkhSaWgLKlCqy4zBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28444'),
  ('527131913993235778', 'Beyond the Barricade', 1920, 'Drama', 'Holger-Madsen, Marius Clausen', 'Valdemar Andersen, Holger-Madsen', 'Lili Beck, Moritz Bielawski, Alf Blütecher, Axel Boesen, Gudrun Bruun Stephensen, Aage Hertel, Holger-Madsen, Elisabeth Jacobsen', null, 'Family man Poul Berg is tempted by a questionable investement offer and indebts himself to a point where suicide seems like the only way out. His widow struggles to maintain even a simple standard of living for herself and their three children, who are fatally marked by their fathers deed. (stumfilm.dk)', 'Family man Poul Berg is tempted by a questionable investement offer and indebts himself to a point where suicide seems like the only way out. His widow struggles to maintain even a simple standard of living for herself and their three children, who are fatally marked by their fathers deed. (stumfilm.dk)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tFclByzyxW00Gk1ko6FES0qFQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238903'),
  ('473003326840697324', 'Beyond the Black Rainbow', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Mystery', 'Panos Cosmatos, Norm Li', 'Panos Cosmatos', 'Michael J Rogers, Eva Bourne, Scott Hylands, Marilyn Norry, Rondel Reynoldson, Ryley Zinger, Gerry South, Chris Gauthier', 'R', 'Deep within the mysterious Arboria Institute, a disturbed and beautiful girl is held captive by a doctor in search of inner peace. Her mind controlled by a sinister technology. Silently, she waits for her next session with deranged therapist Dr. Barry Nyle. If she hopes to escape, she must journey through the darkest reaches of The Institute, but Nyle wonʼt easily part with his most gifted and dangerous creation.', 'Deep within the mysterious Arboria Institute, a disturbed and beautiful girl is held captive by a doctor in search of inner peace. Her mind controlled by a sinister technology. Silently, she waits for her next session with deranged therapist Dr. Barry Nyle. If she hopes to escape, she must journey through the darkest reaches of The Institute, but Nyle wonʼt easily part with his most gifted and dangerous creation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhomcCTQ3lO8L6mLhkCMypsnroO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50037'),
  ('709418962097758926', 'Beyond the Blackboard', 2011, 'Family, Drama', 'Eric Van Haren Noman, Jeff Bleckner', 'Camille Thomasson', 'Emily VanCamp, Steve Talley, Willow Shields, Timothy Busfield, Julio Oscar Mechoso, Nicki Aycox, Kiersten Warren, Treat Williams', 'PG', 'Inspired by a true story, “Beyond the Blackboard” is about a 24-year-old first-time teacher who makes a difference in the lives of the homeless children she teaches in a shelter’s makeshift classroom. Set in 1987 in Albuquerque, New Mexico, this movie tells the story a brand-new teacher and Mom who is given a tougher than expected teaching job and winds up teaching homeless children in a school that is housed in a room and called, literally, The School with No Name. She has some personal prejudicial hurdles to cross before she is able to be a true teacher for these children and of course there are hurdles like the lack of books and supplies.', 'Inspired by a true story, “Beyond the Blackboard” is about a 24-year-old first-time teacher who makes a difference in the lives of the homeless children she teaches in a shelter’s makeshift classroom. Set in 1987 in Albuquerque, New Mexico, this movie tells the story a brand-new teacher and Mom who is given a tougher than expected teaching job and winds up teaching homeless children in a school that is housed in a room and called, literally, The School with No Name. She has some personal prejudicial hurdles to cross before she is able to be a true teacher for these children and of course there are hurdles like the lack of books and supplies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alz6CH9i5EmQJhlT5qLKGOq8YdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60895'),
  ('286514786790783423', 'Beyond the Boundary: I''ll Be Here – Future', 2015, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Noriyuki Kitanohara, Haruka Fujita, Ryuta Nakagami', 'Jukki Hanada', 'Risa Taneda, KENN, Minori Chihara, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Akeno Watanabe, Naomi Shindo, Yuri Yamaoka, Masaya Matsukaze', null, 'The battle is over, and they can go about their normal lives now... or so they thought. With no time to rejoice after miraculously saving Mirai from Beyond the Boundary, Mirai lost all her memories. Akihito, now a high school senior, starts to avoid Mirai thinking it’s for the better. Not aware of Akihito’s feelings, Mirai tries to get closer to Akihito. Then, someone who knows of Mirai appears in front of the two. With Akihito’s troubles in vain, Mirai once again sets forth on a battle that forces her to look within.', 'The battle is over, and they can go about their normal lives now... or so they thought. With no time to rejoice after miraculously saving Mirai from Beyond the Boundary, Mirai lost all her memories. Akihito, now a high school senior, starts to avoid Mirai thinking it’s for the better. Not aware of Akihito’s feelings, Mirai tries to get closer to Akihito. Then, someone who knows of Mirai appears in front of the two. With Akihito’s troubles in vain, Mirai once again sets forth on a battle that forces her to look within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkXH0FuFEMVbEcX9ypFA9tQhlzl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333622'),
  ('1122889347870897103', 'Beyond the Boundary: I''ll Be Here – Past', 2015, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Ai Yukimura, Nobuaki Maruki, Yota Tsuruoka', 'Jukki Hanada', 'Risa Taneda, KENN, Minori Chihara, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Ayako Kawasumi, Masaya Matsukaze, Akeno Watanabe, Naomi Shindo', null, 'It all began quite suddenly. Akihito, who appears human but is actually half yomu with the power to quickly heal himself, sees a freshman girl who appears ready to jump from the school rooftop. The girl, Mirai, who has the ability to manipulate blood, which is unique even among members of the spirit world, continues to fight her isolation. Akihito decides at that moment to save Mirai, but disturbing events soon begin to unfold.', 'It all began quite suddenly. Akihito, who appears human but is actually half yomu with the power to quickly heal himself, sees a freshman girl who appears ready to jump from the school rooftop. The girl, Mirai, who has the ability to manipulate blood, which is unique even among members of the spirit world, continues to fight her isolation. Akihito decides at that moment to save Mirai, but disturbing events soon begin to unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zO300yKOvqXnJD7973mJxaS6R65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311056'),
  ('828241086118665143', 'Beyond the Clouds', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Guillaume Dunand, Bruno Resnais', 'Tonino Guerra, Michelangelo Antonioni, Wim Wenders', 'Fanny Ardant, Chiara Caselli, Irène Jacob, John Malkovich, Sophie Marceau, Vincent Perez, Jean Reno, Kim Rossi Stuart', 'NR', 'Four tales, each centered on a woman, journey inward to explore the enigmatic reality of their lives, connecting through a single narrative thread.', 'Four tales, each centered on a woman, journey inward to explore the enigmatic reality of their lives, connecting through a single narrative thread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFvjnu8NxaGlJUuNHTsaw4Ng5ee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33517'),
  ('894105533742268791', 'Beyond the Clouds', 2018, 'Family, Drama', 'Majid Majidi, Anil Mehta', 'Majid Majidi, Mehran Kashani', 'Ishaan Khatter, Malavika Mohanan, Goutam Ghose, G. V. Sharada, Tannishtha Chatterjee, Mia Maelzer, Heeba Shah', null, 'A hedonistic teenager in Mumbai is busted for dealing drugs and goes to his estranged sister for help, but complications land her in jail.', 'A hedonistic teenager in Mumbai is busted for dealing drugs and goes to his estranged sister for help, but complications land her in jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HvQ7UEngiSQ7Nxj1lH0HW8kOpj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440792'),
  ('205147904558854779', 'Beyond the Darkness', 1979, 'Horror', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato, Franco Gaudenzi', 'Ottavio Fabbri', 'Kieran Canter, Cinzia Monreale, Franca Stoppi, Sam Modesto, Lucia D''Elia, Anna Cardini, Mario Pezzin, Walter Tribus', 'NR', 'A disturbed young embalmer digs the grave of his recently deceased girlfriend and brings her body to his family villa with help from his strange housekeeper. But his bouts of insanity are just beginning.', 'A disturbed young embalmer digs the grave of his recently deceased girlfriend and brings her body to his family villa with help from his strange housekeeper. But his bouts of insanity are just beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tel3ZG4zvbsR3PPEQlQxCjvWrd1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5425'),
  ('903066118559818018', 'Beyond the Door', 1974, 'Horror', 'Ovidio G. Assonitis, Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli, Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli', 'Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli, Aldo Crudo, Giorgio Marini', 'Juliet Mills, Gabriele Lavia, Richard Johnson, Nino Segurini, Elizabeth Turner, Barbara Fiorini, David Colin Jr., Vittorio Fanfoni', 'R', 'Jessica Barrett, wife and mother of two young children, begins to show signs of demonic possession while pregnant with her third child. As she seeks help from her husband and doctor, a mysterious man approaches her and seems to have some answers.', 'Jessica Barrett, wife and mother of two young children, begins to show signs of demonic possession while pregnant with her third child. As she seeks help from her husband and doctor, a mysterious man approaches her and seems to have some answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rm4SyIBQA67mw6DiBampwv6PsU1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33801'),
  ('599777327751893366', 'Beyond the Door', 1982, 'Drama', 'Liliana Cavani, Luciano Tovoli', 'Liliana Cavani, Enrico Medioli', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Eleonora Giorgi, Tom Berenger, Michel Piccoli, Maria Sofia Amendolea, Marcia Briscoe, Enrico Bergier, Paolo Bonetti', 'R', 'A young woman trapped in a web of dark family secrets finds herself in a dangerous triangle of love, jealousy, and deception, where the truth hides in her past.', 'A young woman trapped in a web of dark family secrets finds herself in a dangerous triangle of love, jealousy, and deception, where the truth hides in her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOQJU5U0GuNaNovrtiGZKbNDXJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111007'),
  ('950471237703301888', 'Beyond the Door III', 1989, 'Horror', 'Jeff Kwitny, Adolfo Bartoli, Petar Cvejić', 'Sheila Goldberg', 'Mary Kohnert, Bo Svenson, Victoria Zinny, Savina Geršak, Sarah Conway Ciminera, William Geiger, Alex Vitale, Ron Williams', null, 'A shy co-ed and her classmates travel to Europe to see a ritual. With a satanist/professor with them, he lures them into deadly traps to become sacrifices to Satan. One co-ed is a virgin, the main key to bring Satan back to life. But can the co-ed lose her virginity before Satan controls the world?', 'A shy co-ed and her classmates travel to Europe to see a ritual. With a satanist/professor with them, he lures them into deadly traps to become sacrifices to Satan. One co-ed is a virgin, the main key to bring Satan back to life. But can the co-ed lose her virginity before Satan controls the world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXiqqfjsoH2nVYubD5UrP9XyWBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33767'),
  ('1089896377693022665', 'Beyond the Edge', 2018, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Aleksandr Boguslavskiy, Vyacheslav Lisnevsky, Olga Chibisova', 'Mikhail Zubko', 'Miloš Biković, Lyubov Aksyonova, Antonio Banderas, Evgeniy Stychkin, Aristarkh Venes, Yuriy Chursin, Sergei Astakhov, Nikita Dyuvbanov', 'PG-13', 'Contemporary Moscow. A talented gambler gathers a team of people with supernatural powers to win big at a casino. But they find a much stronger mystical rival.', 'Contemporary Moscow. A talented gambler gathers a team of people with supernatural powers to win big at a casino. But they find a much stronger mystical rival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wCc7YaeolNRo4Bh3xNG4zmu1XQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497727'),
  ('190695528479408110', 'Beyond the Forest', 1949, 'Drama, Thriller', 'King Vidor, Robert Burks, Al Alleborn', 'Lenore J. Coffee', 'Bette Davis, Joseph Cotten, David Brian, Ruth Roman, Minor Watson, Dona Drake, Regis Toomey, Sarah Selby', null, 'Rosa, the self-serving wife of a small-town doctor, gets a better offer when a wealthy big-city man insists she get a divorce and marry him instead. Soon she demonstrates she is capable of rather deplorable acts -- including murder.', 'Rosa, the self-serving wife of a small-town doctor, gets a better offer when a wealthy big-city man insists she get a divorce and marry him instead. Soon she demonstrates she is capable of rather deplorable acts -- including murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKVNZQpyGldpYhEudwJmeAWdSW3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35896'),
  ('926579438365948974', 'Beyond the Gates', 2016, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Jackson Stewart, Brian Sowell, Cosmos Kiindarius', 'Jackson Stewart, Stephen Scarlata', 'Graham Skipper, Chase Williamson, Barbara Crampton, Brea Grant, Justin Welborn, Sara Malakul Lane, Matt Mercer, Caryn Richman', 'NR', 'Two estranged brothers reunite at their missing father''s video store to liquidate the property and sell off his assets. As they dig through the store, they find a VCR board game titled ''Beyond the Gates'' that holds a connection to their father''s disappearance and deadly consequences for anyone who plays it.', 'Two estranged brothers reunite at their missing father''s video store to liquidate the property and sell off his assets. As they dig through the store, they find a VCR board game titled ''Beyond the Gates'' that holds a connection to their father''s disappearance and deadly consequences for anyone who plays it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44PPliIILbsM6IedGw3o6ipC17q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397981'),
  ('1114935618184212485', 'Beyond the Hill', 2012, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Emin Alper', 'Emin Alper', 'Tamer Levent, Reha Özcan, Mehmet Özgür, Berk Hakman, Banu Fotocan, Furkan Berk Kıran, Sercan Gümüş, Şevval Kuş', null, 'In the quiet foothills of Turkey, Faik lives an isolated existence. When his second son brings his boys for a visit, Faik takes the opportunity to pontificate about the law of the land, as he sees it. He shares one unsolicited thought after the next, most particularly focusing on the elusive nomads whom he suspects have been trespassing on his property. The day and night wear on, and each member of the clan takes his turn entrusting the film''s audience with his own dark secret.', 'In the quiet foothills of Turkey, Faik lives an isolated existence. When his second son brings his boys for a visit, Faik takes the opportunity to pontificate about the law of the land, as he sees it. He shares one unsolicited thought after the next, most particularly focusing on the elusive nomads whom he suspects have been trespassing on his property. The day and night wear on, and each member of the clan takes his turn entrusting the film''s audience with his own dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SN9t45t6hImAjr1AzB85gUICxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138574'),
  ('1079009296369389831', 'Beyond the Hills', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cristian Mungiu, Oleg Mutu, Mihaela Ionita', 'Cristian Mungiu', 'Cosmina Stratan, Cristina Flutur, Valeriu Andriuță, Dana Tapalagă, Cătălina Harabagiu, Gina Tandura, Vica Agache, Nora Covali', null, 'Alina returns to Romania from Germany, hoping to bring Voichita—the only person in the world she loves and was loved by—back with her. But Voichita has found God, and God is the hardest lover of all to best.', 'Alina returns to Romania from Germany, hoping to bring Voichita—the only person in the world she loves and was loved by—back with her. But Voichita has found God, and God is the hardest lover of all to best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zV2v5jFXlN2We3GS2IkGQ6e2Bmm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103740'),
  ('196537799959444843', 'Beyond the Horizon', 2020, 'Drama', 'Delphine Lehericey, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Delphine Lehericey, Joanne Giger', 'Luc Bruchez, Laetitia Casta, Thibaut Évrard, Clémence Poésy, Fred Hotier, Patrick Descamps, Lisa Harder, Sasha Gravat Harsch', null, 'Summer ''76, there''s a heatwave and the Swiss countryside is drying out at top speed. In this stifling environment, Gus who is thirteen years old and son of a farmer, sees both his family environment and his innocence relentlessly breaking. He''s living the end of a world.', 'Summer ''76, there''s a heatwave and the Swiss countryside is drying out at top speed. In this stifling environment, Gus who is thirteen years old and son of a farmer, sees both his family environment and his innocence relentlessly breaking. He''s living the end of a world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQOh2FruQijwiR3e35qzLjFdWGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592789'),
  ('225760332625068234', 'Beyond the Infinite Two Minutes', 2020, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Junta Yamaguchi, Masao Nabeshima, Junta Yamaguchi', 'Makoto Ueda', 'Kazunari Tosa, Aki Asakura, Riko Fujitani, Gota Ishida, Masashi Suwa, Yoshifumi Sakai, Haruki Nakagawa, Takashi Sumita', null, 'A cafe owner discovers that the TV in his cafe suddenly shows images from the future, but only two minutes into the future.', 'A cafe owner discovers that the TV in his cafe suddenly shows images from the future, but only two minutes into the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIKcksbl6dbmxTMS1wq15iFkBnB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805627'),
  ('695216461231973078', 'Beyond the Law', 1968, 'Western', 'Giorgio Stegani, Enzo Serafin, Vito Minore', 'Warren Kiefer, Mino Roli, Fernando Di Leo', 'Lee Van Cleef, Antonio Sabàto, Gordon Mitchell, Lionel Stander, Al Hoosmann, Graziella Granata, Bud Spencer, Günther Stoll', 'PG', 'A thief takes the job as a town sheriff in order to rob a silver shipment before his ex-partner can grab it.', 'A thief takes the job as a town sheriff in order to rob a silver shipment before his ex-partner can grab it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pC1R4yNV37dju6cJmyVivroNJnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12758'),
  ('912214770770677191', 'Beyond the Law', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Larry Ferguson', 'Larry Ferguson', 'Charlie Sheen, Linda Fiorentino, Michael Madsen, Courtney B. Vance, Leon Rippy, Dennis Burkley, Lyndsay Riddell, Rino Thunder', 'R', 'Dan Saxon is an undercover cop who infiltrates a biker gang to nail the scum behind a drug-smuggling operation. In order to maintain the trust of the gang''s leader, he must commit ever more dangerous and heinous crimes. Just how far ''beyond the law'' will Saxon go?', 'Dan Saxon is an undercover cop who infiltrates a biker gang to nail the scum behind a drug-smuggling operation. In order to maintain the trust of the gang''s leader, he must commit ever more dangerous and heinous crimes. Just how far ''beyond the law'' will Saxon go?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzlSfPrQDExlb8y8TAfjiYuk3hN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18631'),
  ('282424559479775820', 'Beyond the Law', 2019, 'Action', 'David Newbert, Alex Brendea, James Cullen Bressack', 'Chad Law, Johnny Martin Walters', 'Steven Seagal, Johnny Messner, DMX, Bill Cobbs, Zack Ward, Randy Charach, Patrick Kilpatrick, Chester Rushing', null, 'When a former detective learns of the murder of his estranged son, he ventures back to the darkened streets he once knew so well. Armed, dangerous and with nothing to lose, he must take on the ruthless local mob in his mission for revenge.', 'When a former detective learns of the murder of his estranged son, he ventures back to the darkened streets he once knew so well. Armed, dangerous and with nothing to lose, he must take on the ruthless local mob in his mission for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yIhZPJuoo0LATK9TxVhxmQWGy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650272'),
  ('830182820862381633', 'Beyond the Lights', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gina Prince-Bythewood, Tami Reiker, Richard L. Fox', 'Gina Prince-Bythewood', 'Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Nate Parker, Minnie Driver, mgk, Danny Glover, Aml Ameen, Benito Martinez, Aisha Hinds', 'PG-13', 'Noni Jean is a hot new rising star. But not all is what it seems, and the pressure causes Noni to nearly fall apart - until she meets Kaz Nicol, a promising young cop and aspiring politician who''s been assigned to her detail. Can Kaz''s love give Noni the courage to find her own voice and break free to become the artist she was meant to be?', 'Noni Jean is a hot new rising star. But not all is what it seems, and the pressure causes Noni to nearly fall apart - until she meets Kaz Nicol, a promising young cop and aspiring politician who''s been assigned to her detail. Can Kaz''s love give Noni the courage to find her own voice and break free to become the artist she was meant to be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Di9UXTa2bDec68WOFcZzgB1ot3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241771'),
  ('450270223343380435', 'Beyond the Limits', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Olaf Ittenbach', 'Olaf Ittenbach, Thomas Reitmair', 'Darren Shahlavi, Russell Friedenberg, David Creedon, Natacza Boon, James Matthews, Simon Newby, Hank Stone, Christopher Kriesa', null, 'The rookie journalist Vivian seeks Frederick, the caretaker of the oldest cemetery in an undefined country, asking for an interview and the old man tells the story of two "costumers" and both connected by a mysterious secret. The powerful gangster Jimmie Levinson accuses his former partner Paul Pattuchi of stealing a load of cocaine and orders to kill his beloved girlfriend Clarice. Paul is found dead later in a cottage, and Jimmie and his friends and girlfriends are visited during a dinner party by Robert Downing first and then by the sadistic Mortimer and his partner Rick seeking the truth about Paul and a suitcase with a mysterious relic. The second story takes place in the Middle Ages, where the cruel David Deming and his minion Tom Brewster chase the renegade priest James Flynn in the name of the Inquisition but actually trying to force him to reveal the secret of the Eternal Heart to grant immortality.', 'The rookie journalist Vivian seeks Frederick, the caretaker of the oldest cemetery in an undefined country, asking for an interview and the old man tells the story of two "costumers" and both connected by a mysterious secret. The powerful gangster Jimmie Levinson accuses his former partner Paul Pattuchi of stealing a load of cocaine and orders to kill his beloved girlfriend Clarice. Paul is found dead later in a cottage, and Jimmie and his friends and girlfriends are visited during a dinner party by Robert Downing first and then by the sadistic Mortimer and his partner Rick seeking the truth about Paul and a suitcase with a mysterious relic. The second story takes place in the Middle Ages, where the cruel David Deming and his minion Tom Brewster chase the renegade priest James Flynn in the name of the Inquisition but actually trying to force him to reveal the secret of the Eternal Heart to grant immortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fQBid5s6vn1jwxKyBgs07rZQHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39908'),
  ('457131882975599855', 'Beyond the Line of Duty', 1942, 'War, Documentary', 'Lewis Seiler, Arthur L. Todd', 'Edwin Gilbert', 'Hewitt T. Wheless, Ronald Reagan, William Hopper, Bill Kennedy, Harry Lewis, Knox Manning, Glenn Strange', null, 'This short film in support of the war effort focuses on the training and missions of Army Air Corps Captain Hewitt T. Wheless just after the U.S. entry into World War II.', 'This short film in support of the war effort focuses on the training and missions of Army Air Corps Captain Hewitt T. Wheless just after the U.S. entry into World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8M9tyJCJK5veh323gd6UEjqSPhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236836'),
  ('164700923401430669', 'Beyond the Mask', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Chad Burns', 'Paul McCusker, Stephen Kendrick, Brennan Smith', 'Andrew Cheney, Kara Killmer, John Rhys-Davies, Adetokumboh M''Cormack, Alan Madlane, Steve Blackwood, Thomas D. Mahard, Samrat Chakrabarti', 'PG', 'A former assassin tries to redeem himself by becoming a masked highwayman in Colonial America.', 'A former assassin tries to redeem himself by becoming a masked highwayman in Colonial America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jp98MdkytPiYC21N25QeDU3Hinx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318954'),
  ('446464379775666050', 'Beyond the Mat', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Barry W. Blaustein, Michael Grady', 'Barry W. Blaustein', 'Mick Foley, Terry Funk, Vince McMahon, Aurelian Smith Jr., Jesse Ventura, Noelle Foley, Barry W. Blaustein, Michael Manna', 'R', 'A heartfelt documentary focusing on the day-to-day lives of professional wrestlers, some on the rise, some on the wane, and others fighting for their lives.', 'A heartfelt documentary focusing on the day-to-day lives of professional wrestlers, some on the rise, some on the wane, and others fighting for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48AfKc79mpRcavpA5Hc7UW9Qqq6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14271'),
  ('1126893911166873079', 'Beyond the Memories', 2013, 'Romance', 'Takehiko Shinjo, Tomoko Jo, Masashige Nakanishi', 'Sachiko Tanaka, Satomi Oshima', 'Masami Nagasawa, Masaki Okada, Haru, Kengo Kora, Chizuru Ikewaki, Aoi Nakamura, Yuki Furukawa, Kaoru Hirata', null, 'Kanna Seto lost her childhood friend Haruta in a car accident when she was a freshman in high school. Carrying the emotional pain from that incident throughout her life, Kanna is still wounded as an adult. Kanna then meets Roku Akazawa, who also carries a painful experience from his past. When Roku was an elementary school student, a girl who was with him got into an accident and died. Because of that incident, Roku carries a heavy sense of guilt. When they meet, time, frozen since that day, begins to tick again.', 'Kanna Seto lost her childhood friend Haruta in a car accident when she was a freshman in high school. Carrying the emotional pain from that incident throughout her life, Kanna is still wounded as an adult. Kanna then meets Roku Akazawa, who also carries a painful experience from his past. When Roku was an elementary school student, a girl who was with him got into an accident and died. Because of that incident, Roku carries a heavy sense of guilt. When they meet, time, frozen since that day, begins to tick again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DiOopThBQNFqOeqYhJhSXqVtFY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228436'),
  ('245189935573238544', 'Beyond the Mind''s Eye', 1992, 'Animation, Music', 'Michael Boydstun', null, 'Flo McPherson, Michael Boydstun, Linda Sears', 'NR', 'BEYOND integrates the latest in computer animation technology and artistry with original music from renowned composer Jan Hammer. The Mind''s Eye, Miramar''s first computer animation odyssey, has been described as a "modern Fantasia" - this video steps BEYOND.', 'BEYOND integrates the latest in computer animation technology and artistry with original music from renowned composer Jan Hammer. The Mind''s Eye, Miramar''s first computer animation odyssey, has been described as a "modern Fantasia" - this video steps BEYOND.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ar3ZbI1NqihWNRKyJCuxJIhft3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59169'),
  ('402534867401767355', 'Beyond The Mountain', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David R. Romay, Gustavo Baeza Vila, Rodrigo Urbano', 'David R. Romay', 'Benny Emmanuel, Gustavo Sánchez Parra, Renée Sabina, Enrique Arreola, Marcela Ruiz Esparza, Daniela Schmidt, Erika de la Rosa, Paulina Treviño', null, 'Miguel is a lonely boy letting his life pass by in a monotonous routine. He works in a public kiosk, takes care of his mother Consuelo and dreams with Carmela''s love, one of his usual clients. One day, this perfect bubble of dissatisfaction pops when his mother dies. The tragic event, forces him to face his past and to make a radical decision: find the father that abandoned them, with the intention to kill him.', 'Miguel is a lonely boy letting his life pass by in a monotonous routine. He works in a public kiosk, takes care of his mother Consuelo and dreams with Carmela''s love, one of his usual clients. One day, this perfect bubble of dissatisfaction pops when his mother dies. The tragic event, forces him to face his past and to make a radical decision: find the father that abandoned them, with the intention to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vySJwBFyMiPgIerhEjFUA27c8Xq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554574'),
  ('474600049566205191', 'Beyond the Poseidon Adventure', 1979, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Irwin Allen, Mike Salamunovich, Lindsley Parsons III', 'Paul Gallico', 'Michael Caine, Sally Field, Telly Savalas, Peter Boyle, Jack Warden, Shirley Knight, Shirley Jones, Karl Malden', null, 'After "The Poseidon Adventure", in which the ship got flipped over by a tidal wave, the ship drifts bottom-up in the sea. While the passengers are still on board waiting to be rescued, two rivaling salvage parties enter the ship on search for money, gold and a small amount of plutonium.', 'After "The Poseidon Adventure", in which the ship got flipped over by a tidal wave, the ship drifts bottom-up in the sea. While the passengers are still on board waiting to be rescued, two rivaling salvage parties enter the ship on search for money, gold and a small amount of plutonium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTsUNXz38lIvDlJt7z8wzctuEFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31638'),
