  ('20154471062323795', 'Beyond the Rocks', 1922, 'Drama, Romance, Adventure', 'Sam Wood, A.R. Hamm, Alfred Gilks', 'Jack Cunningham', 'Rudolph Valentino, Gloria Swanson, Edythe Chapman, Alec B. Francis, Robert Bolder, Gertrude Astor, June Elvidge, Mabel Van Buren', 'NR', 'A young woman dutifully marries an older millionaire and then falls in love with a handsome nobleman-- who''d previously saved her life-- on her unhappy honeymoon.', 'A young woman dutifully marries an older millionaire and then falls in love with a handsome nobleman-- who''d previously saved her life-- on her unhappy honeymoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWCoi2Iv9eUUesR88ctjNDLVwFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53231'),
  ('884457718814672457', 'Beyond the Sea', 2004, 'Drama, Music', 'Eduardo Serra, Kevin Spacey, Sean Guest', 'Lewis Colick, Kevin Spacey', 'Kevin Spacey, Kate Bosworth, John Goodman, Bob Hoskins, Brenda Blethyn, Greta Scacchi, Caroline Aaron, Mehmet Yilmaz', 'PG-13', 'Based on the life and career of legendary entertainer, Bobby Darin, the biopic moves back and forth between his childhood and adulthood, to tell the tale of his life.', 'Based on the life and career of legendary entertainer, Bobby Darin, the biopic moves back and forth between his childhood and adulthood, to tell the tale of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIewPJNyyTIMI5rQzcElc23jenW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6478'),
  ('71624249080482871', 'Beyond the Sky', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Javier ''Fox'' Patrón, Patrick Murguia', 'Vicente Leñero, Guillermo Ríos', 'Demián Bichir, Armando Hernández, Damián Alcázar, Dolores Heredia, Rafael Inclán, Martha Higareda, Isela Vega, Ricardo Blume', 'R', 'Malboro and Cucu, the starring characters, are two brothers who split after the older one, Malboro, went to prison five years. One day he is set free, willing to return to his life. Cucu is the younger brother, who has become a boxer with possible success, if only the beater he keeps somewhere inside, didn''t arise in the worst moments. The relationship between the two brothers is somehow ambiguous, there''s something unclear that caused Malboro''s arrest. To complete the triangle is Uncle Jesus who has been like a father to them; a retired boxer who''s always thinking about his past. Sara is Malboro''s great love, a woman full of shame and resented after almost leaving her whole life behind to follow Malboro, but he failed in their attempt to run away because that same night, he got arrested by Rojas. Rojas is Sara''s husband, a police officer who hates Malboro and will do anything to get him out of his way...', 'Malboro and Cucu, the starring characters, are two brothers who split after the older one, Malboro, went to prison five years. One day he is set free, willing to return to his life. Cucu is the younger brother, who has become a boxer with possible success, if only the beater he keeps somewhere inside, didn''t arise in the worst moments. The relationship between the two brothers is somehow ambiguous, there''s something unclear that caused Malboro''s arrest. To complete the triangle is Uncle Jesus who has been like a father to them; a retired boxer who''s always thinking about his past. Sara is Malboro''s great love, a woman full of shame and resented after almost leaving her whole life behind to follow Malboro, but he failed in their attempt to run away because that same night, he got arrested by Rojas. Rojas is Sara''s husband, a police officer who hates Malboro and will do anything to get him out of his way...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66nkDOBmsFq57jUNIIDYrIxttLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48185'),
  ('726729263869518273', 'Beyond The Sky', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Chris Saul, Fulvio Sestito, Jeff Fuller', 'Rob Warren Thomas, Marc Porterfield', 'Ryan Carnes, Jordan Danger, Don Stark, Dee Wallace, Michael Benyaer, Peter Stormare, Danielle Burgio, Martin Sensmeier', null, 'A documentary filmmaker travels to a UFO convention in New Mexico where he meets a local artist with a dark secret. As they follow a trail of clues they discover disturbing sightings and question all they believe when they become immersed in the enigmatic culture of the Pueblo Indians.', 'A documentary filmmaker travels to a UFO convention in New Mexico where he meets a local artist with a dark secret. As they follow a trail of clues they discover disturbing sightings and question all they believe when they become immersed in the enigmatic culture of the Pueblo Indians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jACLTZ5Kt54CBEYOx7FSBJd8QFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478528'),
  ('546818965327067377', 'Beyond the Stars', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'David Saperstein, John S. Bartley', 'David Saperstein', 'Martin Sheen, Christian Slater, Sharon Stone, Robert Foxworth, Olivia D''Abo, F. Murray Abraham, Campbell Lane, Don S. Davis', 'PG', 'Teenager Eric, the son of a computer scientist who worked for the Apollo mission which sent the first human to the moon, is determined to become an astronaut himself one day, and befriends Paul Andrews, the first man on the moon. Paul is avoided by other astronauts nowadays, because he was very rude and rebuffing when he returned from space. Only slowly Eric learns, that he discovered something during his excursion on the moon, that he keeps as a secret.', 'Teenager Eric, the son of a computer scientist who worked for the Apollo mission which sent the first human to the moon, is determined to become an astronaut himself one day, and befriends Paul Andrews, the first man on the moon. Paul is avoided by other astronauts nowadays, because he was very rude and rebuffing when he returned from space. Only slowly Eric learns, that he discovered something during his excursion on the moon, that he keeps as a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfOnqwPoXJHeFAap69LfmW5KZCa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92331'),
  ('579362182635911297', 'Beyond the Summit', 2022, 'Drama, Adventure, Thriller', 'Ibon Cormenzana', 'Ibon Cormenzana, Nerea Castro', 'Javier Rey, Patricia López Arnaiz, Blanca Apilánez, Kandido Uranga', null, 'Mateo undertakes the ascent of Annapurna, the most dangerous mountain on the planet, in order to fulfill an old promise.', 'Mateo undertakes the ascent of Annapurna, the most dangerous mountain on the planet, in order to fulfill an old promise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q72KLwwghNn79OS9Gi3J0f5Rki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895953'),
  ('545991385203865012', 'Beyond the Time Barrier', 1960, 'Science Fiction', 'Edgar G. Ulmer, Meredith M. Nicholson, Sidney Lumet', 'Arthur C. Pierce', 'Robert Clarke, Darlene Tompkins, Vladimir Sokoloff, Boyd ''Red'' Morgan, Stephen Bekassy, John van Dreelen, Arianne Ulmer, Ken Knox', 'NR', 'In 1960, a pilot testing an experimental rocket powered aircraft accidentally flies into the future and finds himself in a sealed city whose people suspect he is a spy from outside their walls, but who want to keep him to procreate with the ruler''s daughter because the majority of the inhabitants are sterile.', 'In 1960, a pilot testing an experimental rocket powered aircraft accidentally flies into the future and finds himself in a sealed city whose people suspect he is a spy from outside their walls, but who want to keep him to procreate with the ruler''s daughter because the majority of the inhabitants are sterile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTSUX9Ju0JIIL3tOYsCeTZdLynm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61194'),
  ('862703411257140477', 'Beyond The Visible - Hilma af Klint', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Halina Dyrschka, Alicja Pahl', 'Halina Dyrschka', 'Iris Müller-Westermann, Julia Voss, Josiah McElheny, Johan af Klint, Ulla af Klint, Ernst Peter Fischer, Anna Maria Bernitz, Monica von Rosen', null, 'How can an artist discover abstraction by the beginning of the 20th century and nobody is noticing? A woman, misjudged and concealed, rocks the art world with her mind-blowing oeuvre. Hilma af Klint was a pioneer creating her first abstract painting in 1906, four years before Vassily Kandinsky. But why was she ignored? Why are her paintings not available on the market? This first film on her is about her life and work, the role of women in art history and the discovery of an art scandal. Her quest for meaning in life and a boundless thinking led into a timeless, outstanding oeuvre.', 'How can an artist discover abstraction by the beginning of the 20th century and nobody is noticing? A woman, misjudged and concealed, rocks the art world with her mind-blowing oeuvre. Hilma af Klint was a pioneer creating her first abstract painting in 1906, four years before Vassily Kandinsky. But why was she ignored? Why are her paintings not available on the market? This first film on her is about her life and work, the role of women in art history and the discovery of an art scandal. Her quest for meaning in life and a boundless thinking led into a timeless, outstanding oeuvre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOAQ5DkJHt2nwM0bVleF0uQKcyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579191'),
  ('16615670652818427', 'Beyond the Walls', 2012, 'Romance, Drama', 'David Lambert, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech', 'David Lambert', 'Guillaume Gouix, Matila Malliarakis, Mélissa Désormeaux-Poulin, David Salles, Flonja Kodheli, Carmela Locantore, Adonis Danieletto, Matilda Perks', null, 'Paulo, a young pianist, meets Ilir, a double-bass player originally from Albania. It''s love at first sight. Confronted by Anka, Paulo finds himself out on the street. Despite Ilir''s misgivings, Paulo moves in with him. One day, when Paulo promises that he will love Ilir for the rest of his life, Ilir leaves the city and doesn''t return. A few days later, Paulo finds out that Ilir is in jail, and the two lovers embark on an heart-breaking relationship.', 'Paulo, a young pianist, meets Ilir, a double-bass player originally from Albania. It''s love at first sight. Confronted by Anka, Paulo finds himself out on the street. Despite Ilir''s misgivings, Paulo moves in with him. One day, when Paulo promises that he will love Ilir for the rest of his life, Ilir leaves the city and doesn''t return. A few days later, Paulo finds out that Ilir is in jail, and the two lovers embark on an heart-breaking relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngNKNQjNDC1OeWLajeVULBLiKvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136437'),
  ('19855552328420695', 'Beyond the Years', 2007, 'Drama', 'Im Kwon-taek, Kim Dong-ho, Jung Il-sung', 'Im Kwon-taek, Yi Cheong-jun', 'Cho Jae-hyun, Oh Jung-hae, Ryu Seung-ryong, Oh Seung-eun, Ryu Tae-ho, Hwang Choon-ha, Ahn Byeong-kyeong, Kwon Tae-won', null, 'A drama centered on brother-and-sister musicians trained to perform the epic Korean poems known as pansori.', 'A drama centered on brother-and-sister musicians trained to perform the epic Korean poems known as pansori.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAuUkv2IKN9jm4Lr4D5raHrXMQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155049'),
  ('318111494246937970', 'Beyond Therapy', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Robert Altman, Pierre Mignot', 'Robert Altman, Christopher Durang', 'Julie Hagerty, Jeff Goldblum, Glenda Jackson, Tom Conti, Christopher Guest, Geneviève Page, Laure Killing, Sandrine Dumas', 'R', 'Manhattanites Bruce and Prudence are each looking for a meaningful romantic relationship and have been encouraged by their psychiatrists to find someone through the personal ads. Their first meeting is disastrous, but they begin to hit it off during their second date. However, Bruce''s bisexual, live-in lover does not want to share Bruce and is willing to do whatever it takes to keep him to himself.', 'Manhattanites Bruce and Prudence are each looking for a meaningful romantic relationship and have been encouraged by their psychiatrists to find someone through the personal ads. Their first meeting is disastrous, but they begin to hit it off during their second date. However, Bruce''s bisexual, live-in lover does not want to share Bruce and is willing to do whatever it takes to keep him to himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYAykpqOMogGlvKxZ33RWitcf8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83726'),
  ('520531524711370515', 'Beyond Tomorrow', 1940, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Lester White, Robert Stillman, A. Edward Sutherland', 'Adele Comandini', 'Harry Carey, C. Aubrey Smith, Charles Winninger, Alex Melesh, Maria Ouspenskaya, Helen Vinson, Rod La Rocque, Richard Carlson', 'NR', 'The ghosts of three elderly industrialists killed in an airplane crash return to Earth to help reunite a young couple whom they initially brought together.', 'The ghosts of three elderly industrialists killed in an airplane crash return to Earth to help reunite a young couple whom they initially brought together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92PSYOOQ8AZJnTnudw9umYooVoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31445'),
  ('378731687528544282', 'Beyond Utopia', 2023, 'Documentary, History', 'Madeleine Gavin, Madeleine Gavin, Kim Hyun-seok', 'Madeleine Gavin', 'Barbara Demick, Kim Sung-eun, Lee Hyeon-seo, Lee So-yeon, Kim Jong-un, Kim Jong-il, Kim Il-sung, Kim Jong-nam', 'PG-13', 'A courageous pastor uses his underground network to rescue and aid North Korean families as they risk their lives to embrace freedom.', 'A courageous pastor uses his underground network to rescue and aid North Korean families as they risk their lives to embrace freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcyCtyXabv0X8TInqoL9yq5DCdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1070032'),
  ('527146434731230727', 'Beyond White Space', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ken Locsmandi, Alberto Moreno, Tom Clancey', 'Ryan Colucci, Clay McLeod Chapman', 'Holt McCallany, Zulay Henao, Dave Sheridan, James Devoti, Kodi Kitchen, Spencer Hill, Tiffany Brouwer, Ron Yuan', null, 'When a deep space fishing vessel is robbed by a gang of pirates, the Captain makes a daring decision to go after a rare and nearly extinct species. His obsession propels them further into space as the crew spins toward mutiny and betrayal.', 'When a deep space fishing vessel is robbed by a gang of pirates, the Captain makes a daring decision to go after a rare and nearly extinct species. His obsession propels them further into space as the crew spins toward mutiny and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IU1Z334s1ssVVU1L2QnMQv77w5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560704'),
  ('144452029997651008', 'Beyond Witch Mountain', 1982, 'Adventure, TV Movie, Family', 'Robert Day, Jack Whitman', null, 'Eddie Albert, Tracey Gold, Andy Freeman, Efrem Zimbalist Jr., J.D. Cannon, Noah Beery Jr.', 'NR', 'After news of the boy''s amazing abilities surfaces, Tony and Tia are sent to go find him knowing that the boy must be from their world. They are joined by an old friend Jason O''Day and a black cat named Winky. Together, they race to find the prodigy before their old nemesis Aristotle Bolt does.', 'After news of the boy''s amazing abilities surfaces, Tony and Tia are sent to go find him knowing that the boy must be from their world. They are joined by an old friend Jason O''Day and a black cat named Winky. Together, they race to find the prodigy before their old nemesis Aristotle Bolt does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArOMADPkSMgwfeYTDG3zblSDaty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34075'),
  ('956931351634290206', 'Beyto', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gitta Gsell, Salvatore Pizzitta', 'Gitta Gsell, Yusuf Yesilöz', 'Burak Ates, Dimitri Stapfer, Ecem Aydin, Beren Tuna, Serkan Tastemur, Ahmet Talay', null, 'Talented swimmer, motivated apprentice, cool buddy: Beyto is in the midst of life. But when the only son of a Turkish migrant family falls in love with his coach Mike, an ideal world falls to pieces. His parents only see one way out: They lure him to their home village and plan his wedding with Seher, his childhood friend. Suddenly, Beyto finds himself in a disruptive love triangle.', 'Talented swimmer, motivated apprentice, cool buddy: Beyto is in the midst of life. But when the only son of a Turkish migrant family falls in love with his coach Mike, an ideal world falls to pieces. His parents only see one way out: They lure him to their home village and plan his wedding with Seher, his childhood friend. Suddenly, Beyto finds himself in a disruptive love triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmgizVNfdfFBmeW01rdHeZYvjOL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745931'),
  ('992114465361800003', 'Bezhin Meadow: Sequences from an Unfinished Film', 1968, 'Drama', 'Sergei Eisenstein, Pera Atasheva', 'Isaak Babel, Alexandr Rzheshevsky, Sergei Eisenstein', 'Viktor Kartashov, Boris Zakhava, Pyotr Arzhanov, Yekaterina Teleshova, Nikolai Maslov, Nikolai Khmelyov, Stanislav Rostotsky, Yakov Zajtsev', null, 'Bezhin Lug (Bezhin Meadow) was to be a Soviet film about a young farm boy whose father attempts to betray the government for political reasons by sabotaging the year''s harvest, and the son''s efforts to stop his own father to protect the Soviet state, culminating in the boy''s murder and a social uprising. Assigned to Soviet film-maker Sergei Eisenstein, the filming followed the same path as with his previous effort, "Que Viva Mexico", into cost overrun and over-shooting of footage. Furthermore, Eisenstein''s usage of forbidden experimental film techniques outraged his government superiors, who ordered the film destroyed before it was even completed. All that survives are the first and last frames of each shot, preserved by Sergei Eisenstein’s wife, Pera Atasheva. The 1967 reconstruction, by Naum Kleiman of the Eisenstein Museum and Sergei Yutkevich of Gosfilmofond, places these frames in order, approximating the original film.', 'Bezhin Lug (Bezhin Meadow) was to be a Soviet film about a young farm boy whose father attempts to betray the government for political reasons by sabotaging the year''s harvest, and the son''s efforts to stop his own father to protect the Soviet state, culminating in the boy''s murder and a social uprising. Assigned to Soviet film-maker Sergei Eisenstein, the filming followed the same path as with his previous effort, "Que Viva Mexico", into cost overrun and over-shooting of footage. Furthermore, Eisenstein''s usage of forbidden experimental film techniques outraged his government superiors, who ordered the film destroyed before it was even completed. All that survives are the first and last frames of each shot, preserved by Sergei Eisenstein’s wife, Pera Atasheva. The 1967 reconstruction, by Naum Kleiman of the Eisenstein Museum and Sergei Yutkevich of Gosfilmofond, places these frames in order, approximating the original film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkzxPNzPlfgV38FJqNrudRg6xa1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105743'),
  ('769262219599709728', 'BFF Detectives', 2019, 'Family, Adventure', 'Viviane Andereggen, Melanie Weber, Henrike Wöbking', 'Sina Flammang, Simon Hauschild', 'Lilli Lacher, Alexandra Petzschmann, Paula Renzler, Jürgen Vogel, Thomas Heinze, Hinnerk Schönemann, Sylvester Groth, Bibiana Beglau', null, 'Friends Franzi, Marieave and Kim planned to spend the summer rehearsing for a Peter Pan play, but when strange things start to happen at the theatre they take on the role of investigators.', 'Friends Franzi, Marieave and Kim planned to spend the summer rehearsing for a Peter Pan play, but when strange things start to happen at the theatre they take on the role of investigators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FCx625AVo8iZJwUUzZrvYvNx3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570169'),
  ('185263185343233668', 'Bhaag Milkha Bhaag', 2013, 'History, Drama', 'Rakeysh Omprakash Mehra, Binod Pradhan', 'Prasoon Joshi', 'Farhan Akhtar, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Divya Dutta, Pavan Malhotra, Rebecca Breeds, Prakash Raj, Yograj Singh, Art Malik', null, 'The true story of the "Flying Sikh" world champion runner and Olympian Milkha Singh who overcame the massacre of his family, civil war during the India-Pakistan partition, and homelessness to become one of India''s most iconic athletes.', 'The true story of the "Flying Sikh" world champion runner and Olympian Milkha Singh who overcame the massacre of his family, civil war during the India-Pakistan partition, and homelessness to become one of India''s most iconic athletes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXywc0CEzS1fIshPWWi4V8A58U3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206324'),
