  ('286535433975786396', 'Bhuj: The Pride of India', 2021, 'War, History, Action, Drama', 'Aseem Bajaj, R.P. Yadav, Peter Hein', 'Pooja Bhavoria, Abhishek Dudhaiya, Raman Kumar', 'Ajay Devgn, Sonakshi Sinha, Sanjay Dutt, Ammy Virk, Nora Fatehi, Sharad Kelkar, Zahid Ali, Ihana Dhillon', null, 'Set in the backdrop of the 1971 Indo-Pakistan War, the film tells the story of the IAF Squadron Leader Vijay Karnik, and his bravery, patriotism and determination.', 'Set in the backdrop of the 1971 Indo-Pakistan War, the film tells the story of the IAF Squadron Leader Vijay Karnik, and his bravery, patriotism and determination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zc0OzUOF8B4x4AH4bubxw0mHCnF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590397'),
  ('1070935814181327992', 'BIA: An Upside Down World', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Music', 'Jorge Bechara', null, 'Isabela Souza, Julio Peña, Gabriella Di Grecco, Andrea de Alba, Guido Messina, Fernando Dente, Rhener Freitas, Agustina Palma', null, 'In this alternate world, Bia and Manuel will have a tempestuous relationship. Pixie, the hateful and stunning owner of Laix, decides to buy the Fundom. The great conflict erupts when Pixie announces a concert. This will have Bia and Helena, who in this upside down universe are divas and rivals, fighting to be the headliner in the final show.', 'In this alternate world, Bia and Manuel will have a tempestuous relationship. Pixie, the hateful and stunning owner of Laix, decides to buy the Fundom. The great conflict erupts when Pixie announces a concert. This will have Bia and Helena, who in this upside down universe are divas and rivals, fighting to be the headliner in the final show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIxLHFMAsdbZGZws0duowTa4N6k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765169'),
  ('763621653839584953', 'Bianca', 1984, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Nanni Moretti, Inigo Lezzi, Daniele Luchetti', 'Nanni Moretti, Sandro Petraglia', 'Nanni Moretti, Laura Morante, Roberto Vezzosi, Remo Remotti, Claudio Bigagli, Enrica Maria Modugno, Vincenzo Salemme, Margherita Sestito', 'R', 'Eccentric and full of manias, Michele is a young high school professor who defines himself as “not used to happiness”. He realizes his life is meaningless if he doesn’t have a woman by his side but, after a series of rather disastrous experiences, he feels more alone than ever. Then, out of the blue, a new French teacher called Bianca arrives at school. Amongst uncertainties and contradictions, the two start dating. In the meantime, a series of homicides take place and a police officer begins to suspect that Michele is involved. Bianca will save him providing an alibi at the right moment, but then, everything goes wrong again.', 'Eccentric and full of manias, Michele is a young high school professor who defines himself as “not used to happiness”. He realizes his life is meaningless if he doesn’t have a woman by his side but, after a series of rather disastrous experiences, he feels more alone than ever. Then, out of the blue, a new French teacher called Bianca arrives at school. Amongst uncertainties and contradictions, the two start dating. In the meantime, a series of homicides take place and a police officer begins to suspect that Michele is involved. Bianca will save him providing an alibi at the right moment, but then, everything goes wrong again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufRG8d4fNbeueW3UFcWfe4ekhJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15014'),
  ('944476744128904613', 'Bianco, rosso e Verdone', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Albino Cocco, Luciano Tovoli, Luca Morsella', 'Carlo Verdone, Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi', 'Carlo Verdone, Irina Sanpiter, Elena Fabrizi, Angelo Infanti, Milena Vukotić, Mario Brega, Andrea Aureli, Elisabeth Wiener', null, 'Three Italians travel to their hometown to vote for elections: Pasquale is a Southern immigrant living in Munich who''s genuinely happy to come back to Italy, even if just for a few days, but the country he dreams of is far from reality; Furio travels to Rome with his family, but his niggling attitude threatens to push his wife Magda over the edge; young Mimmo is also going to Rome, but the trip is repeatedly interrupted by worries about his grandma''s health.', 'Three Italians travel to their hometown to vote for elections: Pasquale is a Southern immigrant living in Munich who''s genuinely happy to come back to Italy, even if just for a few days, but the country he dreams of is far from reality; Furio travels to Rome with his family, but his niggling attitude threatens to push his wife Magda over the edge; young Mimmo is also going to Rome, but the trip is repeatedly interrupted by worries about his grandma''s health.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tS5ca077KEMbJHBVNLa1nCnycXJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37775'),
  ('289389207085611994', 'Bibi', 1974, 'Romance, Drama', 'Joseph W. Sarno, Peter Rohe, Peggy Steffans', 'Joseph W. Sarno', 'Marie Forså, Nadia Henkowa, Anke Syring, Ines André, Birgit Zamulo, Françoise Suehrer, Peter Hamm, Britt Corvin', null, 'Sixteen year old Bibi comes to her aunt Toni''s boarding house where she is seduced by lesbian women.', 'Sixteen year old Bibi comes to her aunt Toni''s boarding house where she is seduced by lesbian women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZCnt2YCWLqjgyBC39BHGqcc3jW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71097'),
  ('815990754705468572', 'Bibi & Tina', 2014, 'Adventure, Family', 'Detlev Buck, Marc Achenbach, Felix Gerd Schneider', 'Bettina Börgerding, Wenka von Mikulicz', 'Lina Larissa Strahl, Lisa-Marie Koroll, Winnie Böwe, Charly Hübner, Michael Maertens, Max von der Groeben, Detlev Buck, Ruby O. Fee', null, 'Bibi Blocksberg visits her friend Tina Martin at the riding stables during the summer vacation. This year there is to be a special horse race organized by Count Falko. However, the two friends run into trouble when Sophia von Gelenberg from an elite boarding school at Falkenstein Castle, a participant and close acquaintance of the house, arrives and tries to steal Tina''s boyfriend Alexander. The shady businessman Hans Kakmann is also up to no good, and it''s not just the foal Socrates, known as "Socke", he''s after. Bibi tries to save Alex and Tina''s relationship on the one hand and expose Kakmann''s business practices on the other. But even witchcraft can''t prevent her from turning everyone against her, Count Falko enrolling his son in boarding school and Kakman offering to buy the foal "Socke".', 'Bibi Blocksberg visits her friend Tina Martin at the riding stables during the summer vacation. This year there is to be a special horse race organized by Count Falko. However, the two friends run into trouble when Sophia von Gelenberg from an elite boarding school at Falkenstein Castle, a participant and close acquaintance of the house, arrives and tries to steal Tina''s boyfriend Alexander. The shady businessman Hans Kakmann is also up to no good, and it''s not just the foal Socrates, known as "Socke", he''s after. Bibi tries to save Alex and Tina''s relationship on the one hand and expose Kakmann''s business practices on the other. But even witchcraft can''t prevent her from turning everyone against her, Count Falko enrolling his son in boarding school and Kakman offering to buy the foal "Socke".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPslMuE7uKH4yRDhhuw1rz6n9Bl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248601'),
  ('126302521010448873', 'Bibi & Tina: Bewildered and Bewitched', 2014, 'Adventure, Family', 'Detlev Buck', 'Detlev Buck, Bettina Börgerding', 'Lina Larissa Strahl, Lisa-Marie Koroll, Louis Held, Emilio Sakraya, Michael Maertens, Mavie Hörbiger, Martin Seifert, Winnie Böwe', null, 'When robbers hit Falkenstein castle, teen witch Bibi and pal Tina hunt for the crooks, then devise a plan to save the neighbors'' failing ranch.', 'When robbers hit Falkenstein castle, teen witch Bibi and pal Tina hunt for the crooks, then devise a plan to save the neighbors'' failing ranch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqjDGwx2khUFfvY1aDXaUGIgq1t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301825'),
  ('363770673548735281', 'Bibi & Tina: Girls vs. Boys', 2016, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Detlev Buck', 'Detlev Buck, Bettina Börgerding', 'Lina Larissa Strahl, Lisa-Marie Koroll, Louis Held, Phil Laude, Kostja Ullmann, Tilman Pörzgen, Max von der Groeben, Winnie Böwe', null, 'At summer camp, young Bibi and her friends are pitted against the boys in a treasure hunt. But what''s a witch to do when she loses her powers?', 'At summer camp, young Bibi and her friends are pitted against the boys in a treasure hunt. But what''s a witch to do when she loses her powers?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mg1pJikPVEOSuKv7IStYMh1L7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369860'),
  ('1117728082900926550', 'Bibi & Tina: Perfect Pandemonium', 2017, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Detlev Buck', null, 'Lina Larissa Strahl, Lisa-Marie Koroll, Louis Held, Michael Maertens, Martin Seifert, Winnie Böwe, Fabian Buch, Max von der Groeben', null, 'It''s perfect pandemonium when Bibi and Tina meet a runaway boy with an attitude problem, who turns out to actually be a girl, named Adea. Adea‘s uncle is so narrow-minded and stubborn that even with all her magic spells, Bibi can''t manage to get the two to reconcile. Meanwhile, Falkenstein Castle is being renovated, which is driving the Count to his wits'' end. Especially since Alex is planning to hold a music festival at Falkenstein and is determined to go through with it over his father''s objections. And if all that was not enough, Tina gets kidnapped. Despite the complete chaos, one thing is clear - in the end, real change comes from everybody working and pulling together, not by magic.', 'It''s perfect pandemonium when Bibi and Tina meet a runaway boy with an attitude problem, who turns out to actually be a girl, named Adea. Adea‘s uncle is so narrow-minded and stubborn that even with all her magic spells, Bibi can''t manage to get the two to reconcile. Meanwhile, Falkenstein Castle is being renovated, which is driving the Count to his wits'' end. Especially since Alex is planning to hold a music festival at Falkenstein and is determined to go through with it over his father''s objections. And if all that was not enough, Tina gets kidnapped. Despite the complete chaos, one thing is clear - in the end, real change comes from everybody working and pulling together, not by magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWAnBgjhONva8lSOcD8EPFzDxdR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410791'),
  ('325492329296447874', 'Bibi Blocksberg', 2002, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Hermine Huntgeburth, Martin Langer, An Dorthe Braker', 'Elfie Donnelly', 'Sidonie von Krosigk, Katja Riemann, Ulrich Noethen, Max Befort, Corinna Harfouch, Rufus Beck, Mareike Lindenmeyer, Inga Busch', 'PG', 'Elation in Neustadt: by the means of a little witching, Bibi Blocksberg saved two kids from burning to death. While her mother Barbara, a witch of flesh and blood herself, is very proud of her daughter, father Bernhard, overworked and stressed, disapproves greatly of her supernatural antics. Then Bibi gets a message from Walpurgia, the senior witch: she is going to receive her crystel ball, that will make a "real" witch of her, early. Proudly, Bibi jumps up her broom to fly to the Blocksberg, the witches'' headquarters. But Rabia, one of the few evil witches, aging in misery and with a secret, begrudges her all the glory...and her youth. And so Rabia sets off events that will soon make Bibi''s life fall into pieces.', 'Elation in Neustadt: by the means of a little witching, Bibi Blocksberg saved two kids from burning to death. While her mother Barbara, a witch of flesh and blood herself, is very proud of her daughter, father Bernhard, overworked and stressed, disapproves greatly of her supernatural antics. Then Bibi gets a message from Walpurgia, the senior witch: she is going to receive her crystel ball, that will make a "real" witch of her, early. Proudly, Bibi jumps up her broom to fly to the Blocksberg, the witches'' headquarters. But Rabia, one of the few evil witches, aging in misery and with a secret, begrudges her all the glory...and her youth. And so Rabia sets off events that will soon make Bibi''s life fall into pieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9r7epbLqqtjtlkvRpCwVHIiGkB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9259'),
  ('239084342757371558', 'Bibi Blocksberg and the Secret of Blue Owls', 2004, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Franziska Buch, Axel Block', null, 'Sidonie von Krosigk, Monica Bleibtreu, Katja Riemann, Ulrich Noethen, Marie Luise Stahl, Corinna Harfouch, Edgar Selge, Frederick Lau', 'PG', 'Poor Bibi - due to her bad marks in maths she has to spend the whole summer in the boarding school of Altenberg to scrape through a series of exams - otherwise she''d stay down in school, being forced to repeat the year. No camping, no white-water rafting, no vacation at all. So it doesn''t surprise anyone that the young witch is quite disgruntled when arriving at Altenberg Castle. Her roommate is a touchy unpleassant fashion victim and headmaster Quirin Bartels is so muddle-headed that he can''t even remember the names of his students properly. But then Bibi makes friends with Elea, a girl wheelchair-bound since a terrible accident where she also lost her beloved parents. Now Bibi is determined to help the sensitive Elea, searching a way to heal her from her palsy legs.', 'Poor Bibi - due to her bad marks in maths she has to spend the whole summer in the boarding school of Altenberg to scrape through a series of exams - otherwise she''d stay down in school, being forced to repeat the year. No camping, no white-water rafting, no vacation at all. So it doesn''t surprise anyone that the young witch is quite disgruntled when arriving at Altenberg Castle. Her roommate is a touchy unpleassant fashion victim and headmaster Quirin Bartels is so muddle-headed that he can''t even remember the names of his students properly. But then Bibi makes friends with Elea, a girl wheelchair-bound since a terrible accident where she also lost her beloved parents. Now Bibi is determined to help the sensitive Elea, searching a way to heal her from her palsy legs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lg7veUKM3VqSnu0bl8otEnDs7M4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40975'),
  ('864763338958450067', 'Bible!', 1974, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Wakefield Poole', null, 'Bo White, Caprice Couselle, Georgina Spelvin, Robert Benes, Nancy Wachter, Nicholas Flammel, Brahm van Zetten, Gloria Grant', null, 'Wakefield Poole''s softcore anthology featuring stories of Adam & Eve, Bath Sheba and Samson & Delilah given sexual twists.', 'Wakefield Poole''s softcore anthology featuring stories of Adam & Eve, Bath Sheba and Samson & Delilah given sexual twists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNahsVHAt9QQyTWEiJ5K0pSEO5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247700'),
  ('608945692295006191', 'Bicentennial Man', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Phil Meheux, Chris Columbus', 'Nicholas Kazan', 'Robin Williams, Embeth Davidtz, Sam Neill, Oliver Platt, Kiersten Warren, Wendy Crewson, Hallie Eisenberg, Lindze Letherman', 'PG', 'Richard Martin buys a gift, a new NDR-114 robot. The product is named Andrew by the youngest of the family''s children. "Bicentennial Man" follows the life and times of Andrew, a robot purchased as a household appliance programmed to perform menial tasks. As Andrew begins to experience emotions and creative thought, the Martin family soon discovers they don''t have an ordinary robot.', 'Richard Martin buys a gift, a new NDR-114 robot. The product is named Andrew by the youngest of the family''s children. "Bicentennial Man" follows the life and times of Andrew, a robot purchased as a household appliance programmed to perform menial tasks. As Andrew begins to experience emotions and creative thought, the Martin family soon discovers they don''t have an ordinary robot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrs23eO0VEWwOQpXoOasMnlW9Y4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2277'),
  ('938933744259726149', 'Bicharo Bachelor', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vipul B Sharma', 'Vipul Sharma', 'Tushar Sadhu, Twinkal Patel, Jaimini Trivedi', null, 'Anuj is a 28-year-old bachelor who feels like he has missed the train when it comes to marrying a perfect girl. Now even his family members have become impatient, and Anuj''s funny ride is in full swing. The story is filled with hilarious moments along with plenty of family emotions. It''s an innovative family comedy film perfect for the entire family to enjoy.', 'Anuj is a 28-year-old bachelor who feels like he has missed the train when it comes to marrying a perfect girl. Now even his family members have become impatient, and Anuj''s funny ride is in full swing. The story is filled with hilarious moments along with plenty of family emotions. It''s an innovative family comedy film perfect for the entire family to enjoy.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F5lF0XAa8EO2NoqrzhbX3yS02R71.jpg', 'plex:movie:bicharo-bachelor'),
  ('857224743014870977', 'Bichhoo', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Guddu Dhanoa, Sripad Natu', 'Dilip Shukla', 'Bobby Deol, Rani Mukerji, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Malaika Arora, Farida Jalal, Mohan Joshi, Veerendra Saxena, Sachin Khedekar', null, 'A contract killer with a tragic past trains a young woman to avenge the murder of her family and falls for her in the process.', 'A contract killer with a tragic past trains a young woman to avenge the murder of her family and falls for her in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMAyftiTGHsIIh3Vlx2rK67pKbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232496'),
  ('513502725798689037', 'Bickford Shmeckler''s Cool Ideas', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Scott Lew, Lowell Peterson, Brendan Garst', 'Scott Lew', 'Patrick Fugit, Fran Kranz, Olivia Wilde, John Cho, Reid Scott, Matthew Lillard, Cheryl Hines, Thomas Lennon', null, 'When his journal of bright ideas is stolen, college freshman Bickford Schmeckler has to blanket the campus in order to locate it.', 'When his journal of bright ideas is stolen, college freshman Bickford Schmeckler has to blanket the campus in order to locate it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDMVu4QS9peGUgvingjfnlBCApQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33563'),
  ('887533385203117608', 'Bicycles Are for the Summer', 1984, 'Drama', 'Jaime Chávarri, Benito Rabal, Miguel Ángel Trujillo', 'Lola Salvador', 'Amparo Soler Leal, Agustín González, Victoria Abril, Alicia Hermida, Patricia Adriani, Marisa Paredes, Carlos Tristancho, Gabino Diego', null, 'In Madrid, the family of Don Luis, his wife Dolores and their children, Manolita and Luisito, share the daily life of the Civil War with their maid and neighbours. Despite having failed his exams, Luisito wants his father to buy him a bicycle. However, the situation forces them to delay the purchase and the delay, like the war itself, is to last much longer than expected.', 'In Madrid, the family of Don Luis, his wife Dolores and their children, Manolita and Luisito, share the daily life of the Civil War with their maid and neighbours. Despite having failed his exams, Luisito wants his father to buy him a bicycle. However, the situation forces them to delay the purchase and the delay, like the war itself, is to last much longer than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifXEufNgsY00h96i6fk5jMYfxOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82265'),
