  ('375182390929887528', 'Bienvenido a casa', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'David Trueba, Catalina Parra, Anne Deluz', 'David Trueba', 'Alejo Sauras, Pilar López de Ayala, Ariadna Gil, Juan Echanove, Jorge Sanz, Javivi, Julián Villagrán, Concha Velasco', null, 'Young couple Samuel and Eva move to Madrid and start living together when he finds work as a photographer. Although Samuel doesn''t knows, Eva''s expecting a baby.', 'Young couple Samuel and Eva move to Madrid and start living together when he finds work as a photographer. Although Samuel doesn''t knows, Eva''s expecting a baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBno2PxzDTz4UuqTtL4lVs3Fzno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63612'),
  ('292148913856058961', 'Bienvenido-Welcome', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gabriel Retes', 'Gabriel Retes', 'Gabriel Retes, Luis Felipe Tovar, Jesse Borrego, Fernando Arau, Juan Claudio Retes, Lucila Balzaretti, Claudia Fernández, Francisco de la O', null, 'During a business trip, a married man (José) has an affair with a blonde who leaves him the message "Welcome to the world of AIDS". Later, his wife Maria, unaware of the situation, makes love to her husband when he is drunk. The consequences of the contagion are devastating. José and María find the support of a group of filmmakers who decide to make a film of their story.', 'During a business trip, a married man (José) has an affair with a blonde who leaves him the message "Welcome to the world of AIDS". Later, his wife Maria, unaware of the situation, makes love to her husband when he is drunk. The consequences of the contagion are devastating. José and María find the support of a group of filmmakers who decide to make a film of their story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fogU9l4Q3c0jJ5xeYPHEd7wBguz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191639'),
  ('64987867044711952', 'Bienvenue au Gondwana', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Mamane, Antoine Marteau', 'Mamane, Stéphane Kazandjian', 'Antoine Gouy, Antoine Duléry, Michel Gohou, Cravatte Digbeu, Prudence Maïdou, Andrea Schieffer, Nicky Marbot, Ricky Tribord', null, 'An idealistic young Frenchman immersed in controversial presidential elections, a dictator decided to stay in power by cheating, two geopolitical followers, a French deputy determined to sell asparagus to Africans, a young and pretty revolutionary: Gondwana!', 'An idealistic young Frenchman immersed in controversial presidential elections, a dictator decided to stay in power by cheating, two geopolitical followers, a French deputy determined to sell asparagus to Africans, a young and pretty revolutionary: Gondwana!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ui2eQlBSKiaJtusftW5cozfX8hh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439151'),
  ('288975401452606558', 'Big', 1987, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Franco Amurri, Luciano Tovoli, Beatrice Banfi', 'Franco Amurri, Stefano Sudriè', 'Renato Pozzetto, Joska Versari, Giulia Boschi, Ottavia Piccolo, Alessandro Haber, Alessandro Partexano, Giampiero Bianchi, Costantino Meloni', null, 'Marco, a nine year old boy, is in love with his elementary teacher, and feels neglected by his workaholic parents. When they forget about his birthday he wishes he could grow up at once. This really happens and Marco begins a new life as an adult. He rents a room in his teacher''s flat and she falls in love with him. He even fakes a kidnapping when he runs out of money but he is mistaken for the kidnapper.', 'Marco, a nine year old boy, is in love with his elementary teacher, and feels neglected by his workaholic parents. When they forget about his birthday he wishes he could grow up at once. This really happens and Marco begins a new life as an adult. He rents a room in his teacher''s flat and she falls in love with him. He even fakes a kidnapping when he runs out of money but he is mistaken for the kidnapper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uJk2ykIVkiUM40XolqEkaNO5dH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57918'),
  ('917795613702406612', 'Big', 1988, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Penny Marshall, Barry Sonnenfeld, Thomas A. Reilly', 'Anne Spielberg, Gary Ross', 'Tom Hanks, Elizabeth Perkins, Robert Loggia, John Heard, Jared Rushton, David Moscow, Jon Lovitz, Mercedes Ruehl', 'PG', 'When a young boy makes a wish at a carnival machine to be big—he wakes up the following morning to find that it has been granted and his body has grown older overnight. But he is still the same 13-year-old boy inside. Now he must learn how to cope with the unfamiliar world of grown-ups including getting a job and having his first romantic encounter with a woman.', 'When a young boy makes a wish at a carnival machine to be big—he wakes up the following morning to find that it has been granted and his body has grown older overnight. But he is still the same 13-year-old boy inside. Now he must learn how to cope with the unfamiliar world of grown-ups including getting a job and having his first romantic encounter with a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWhCDJiwxvx3YXkAFRiHjimnF0j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2280'),
  ('772813459169595425', 'Big Ass Spider!', 2013, 'Science Fiction', 'Mike Mendez, Benji Bakshi, Lauren Elizabeth Hood', 'Gregory Gieras', 'Greg Grunberg, Lombardo Boyar, Clare Kramer, Ray Wise, Lin Shaye, Patrick Bauchau, Lloyd Kaufman, Ruben Pla', 'PG-13', 'When a giant alien spider escapes from a military lab and rampages across the city of Los Angeles, it is up to one clever exterminator and his security guard sidekick to kill the creature before the entire city is destroyed.', 'When a giant alien spider escapes from a military lab and rampages across the city of Los Angeles, it is up to one clever exterminator and his security guard sidekick to kill the creature before the entire city is destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uW4ayPN4B1mjrwb3OURRy0m9Hh7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166822'),
