  ('1103155125494474082', 'Big Bad Mama', 1974, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Steve Carver, Teri Schwartz, Richard Franchot', 'Frances Doel, William W. Norton', 'Angie Dickinson, Tom Skerritt, William Shatner, Susan Sennett, Robbie Lee, Noble Willingham, Dick Miller, Tom Signorelli', 'R', 'Circumstances force a mother and her two daughters to get into bootlegging and bank robbing, and travel across the country pursued by the law.', 'Circumstances force a mother and her two daughters to get into bootlegging and bank robbing, and travel across the country pursued by the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZ6TOtV6WdWHphZfJldvsCdjmb1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45186'),
  ('118535566066750107', 'Big Bad Mama II', 1987, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Jim Wynorski, Robert C. New, Linda Shayne', 'R.J. Robertson, Jim Wynorski', 'Angie Dickinson, Robert Culp, Danielle Brisebois, Julie McCullough, Jeff Yagher, Bruce Glover, Ebbe Roe Smith, Jacque Lynn Colton', 'R', 'Wilma McClatchie and her daughters return to a life of crime and vow vengeance against the evil land baron who foreclosed on their home.', 'Wilma McClatchie and her daughters return to a life of crime and vow vengeance against the evil land baron who foreclosed on their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOBK6lNet3sH30L1AAahHKuaNP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86483'),
  ('88787473903807160', 'Big Bad Wolf', 2006, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Lance W. Dreesen, Jennifer Fiedler, Ken Blakey', 'Lance W. Dreesen', 'Trevor Duke-Moretz, Richard Tyson, Kimberly J. Brown, Sarah Aldrich, Christopher Shyer, Jason Alan Smith, Andrew Bowen, Sarah Christine Smith', 'R', 'In Cameron, a group of hunters is attacked by a wild animal, and Charlie Cowley survives, but sees his brother Scott dying. Seven years later, his teenage nephew Derek Cowley steals the key of his stepfather''s cabin in the isolated Fire Road 13, and travels with four classmates and his friend Sam to spend the weekend having a party with booze and sex. However, they are attacked by a Beast that kills his friends in a sadistic way. Sam and Derek survive, and they suspect that his stepfather, Mitchell Toblat, is a werewolf. When Charlie meets Derek and Sam, they decide to collect evidence to prove that Mitchell is the Beast and kill him, but Mitchell discovers their plot and chases the trio.', 'In Cameron, a group of hunters is attacked by a wild animal, and Charlie Cowley survives, but sees his brother Scott dying. Seven years later, his teenage nephew Derek Cowley steals the key of his stepfather''s cabin in the isolated Fire Road 13, and travels with four classmates and his friend Sam to spend the weekend having a party with booze and sex. However, they are attacked by a Beast that kills his friends in a sadistic way. Sam and Derek survive, and they suspect that his stepfather, Mitchell Toblat, is a werewolf. When Charlie meets Derek and Sam, they decide to collect evidence to prove that Mitchell is the Beast and kill him, but Mitchell discovers their plot and chases the trio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31nFN67QsO3oJ4DDaytejEKKB1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39341'),
  ('1037345434291927907', 'Big Bad Wolves', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Navot Papushado, Aharon Keshales, Giora Bejach', 'Aharon Keshales, Navot Papushado', 'Lior Ashkenazi, Tzahi Grad, Rotem Keinan, Doval''e Glickman, Menashe Noy, Dvir Benedek, Nati Kluger, Qais Nashif', 'NR', 'The twisted paths of three very different men brutally collide due to a chain of unspeakable murders: a grieving father who has been doomed to seek vengeance and a police detective who boldly crosses the narrow boundary between law and crime meet a religion teacher suspected of being the murderer.', 'The twisted paths of three very different men brutally collide due to a chain of unspeakable murders: a grieving father who has been doomed to seek vengeance and a police detective who boldly crosses the narrow boundary between law and crime meet a religion teacher suspected of being the murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SEdoH6qBIYNhIV7H9cFSRe3wO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171540'),
  ('381161836194659005', 'Big Bang', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Park Jung-woo', 'Park Jung-woo', 'Kam Woo-sung, Kim Soo-ro, Moon Jeong-hee, Kang Seong-jin, Jang Hang-seon, Kim Yeong-ok, Jo Deok-hyeon, Jeon Kuk-hwan', null, 'An otherwise model citizen''s petty crime quickly escalates into felony when he runs away from the police station, dragging a career criminal with him.', 'An otherwise model citizen''s petty crime quickly escalates into felony when he runs away from the police station, dragging a career criminal with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zlMw0xbYWlQSuf4XobXiNkY2qZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58498'),
  ('877171752169446677', 'Big Bang Love, Juvenile A', 2006, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Takashi Miike, Masato Kaneko', 'Masaru Nakamura', 'Ryuhei Matsuda, Masanobu Ando, Shunsuke Kubozuka, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Jo Kanamori, Kenichi Endo, Renji Ishibashi, Ryo Ishibashi', null, 'An unknown future. A boy confesses to the murder of another in an all-boy juvenile detention facility. More an exercise in style than storytelling, the story follows two detectives trying to uncover the case. Homosexual tension and explosive violence drives the story which delivers some weird and fascinating visuals.', 'An unknown future. A boy confesses to the murder of another in an all-boy juvenile detention facility. More an exercise in style than storytelling, the story follows two detectives trying to uncover the case. Homosexual tension and explosive violence drives the story which delivers some weird and fascinating visuals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuhe7JYB6AVFIfnyyE3cVUwfNeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13315'),
  ('908024118605042715', 'Big Bear', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Joey Kern', 'Joey Kern', 'Joey Kern, Adam Brody, Zachary Knighton, Tyler Labine, Pablo Schreiber, Ahna O''Reilly, Heidi Heaslet, Toby Huss', null, 'Joe reluctantly has his bachelor party even though his fiancé just dumped him for some Dude.', 'Joe reluctantly has his bachelor party even though his fiancé just dumped him for some Dude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMstoMJZUONH2Pf6c9QHh65mAw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473229'),
  ('175691334681232345', 'Big Big World', 2016, 'Drama', 'Reha Erdem, Florent Herry', 'Reha Erdem', 'Ecem Uzun, Berke Karaer, Melisa Akman, Murat Deniz, Ayta Sözeri, Hakan Çimenser, Sagnak Saribudak, Saygın Soysal', null, 'Ali and Zuhal take their first step out of the orphanage into this big world committing a crime. It becomes impossible for them to live amongst people now, and the forest they take shelter in becomes a desert island for them. A boy and a girl that were thrown out of the civilized world would live the entire human story from scratch.', 'Ali and Zuhal take their first step out of the orphanage into this big world committing a crime. It becomes impossible for them to live amongst people now, and the forest they take shelter in becomes a desert island for them. A boy and a girl that were thrown out of the civilized world would live the entire human story from scratch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eBglv6FmvKQM2bDIZVmRxNaEmE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412369'),
  ('422558065332911908', 'Big Boys Don’t Cry', 2022, 'Drama', 'Steve Crowhurst, Kal Bonner, Louie Blystad-Collins', 'Steve Crowhurst', 'Michael Socha, Zoë Tapper, Mitchell Norman, Joshua Coombes, Poppy Roe, Daniel Adegboyega, Victoria Alcock, Amelia Eve', null, 'Based on true events, Paul is forced to recall his harrowing childhood growing up in a children’s home, when a police investigation into his boyhood friend’s suicide opens old wounds. As Paul struggles to shake off his past and build a relationship with Anthea, his fragile mental state and bitter memories lead to a confrontation with those responsible for his shattered childhood and the death of his friend.', 'Based on true events, Paul is forced to recall his harrowing childhood growing up in a children’s home, when a police investigation into his boyhood friend’s suicide opens old wounds. As Paul struggles to shake off his past and build a relationship with Anthea, his fragile mental state and bitter memories lead to a confrontation with those responsible for his shattered childhood and the death of his friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGBQAan7xdvRqR4LQEqk6DDVUD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:824386'),
  ('778148412314986004', 'Big Brother', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Guddu Dhanoa', 'Guddu Dhanoa', 'Sunny Deol, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Danny Denzongpa, Imran Khan, Farida Jalal, Shahbaz Khan, Suhasini Mulay, Govind Namdeo', null, 'Big Brother is a story set in modern India which revolves around a small middle-class family composed of Dev Sharma Sunny Deol, his wife Aarti Priyanka Chopra, his mother Farida Jalal, brother Imran Khan and sister Prachi. Although they lead a simple and peaceful lifestyle, an incident occurs that changes their lives forever. The family is left with no choice but to leave Delhi and move to Mumbai in disguise. They start life afresh and all seems well until the ghosts of the past surface again. Things reach a point when Dev Sharma is prodded by his mother to take a course of action which not only avenges their plight but also take on the cause of the aggrieved in the country as a whole. The movement so created gets the support of the woman at large and the infirm who proudly proclaim him to be their Big Brother.', 'Big Brother is a story set in modern India which revolves around a small middle-class family composed of Dev Sharma Sunny Deol, his wife Aarti Priyanka Chopra, his mother Farida Jalal, brother Imran Khan and sister Prachi. Although they lead a simple and peaceful lifestyle, an incident occurs that changes their lives forever. The family is left with no choice but to leave Delhi and move to Mumbai in disguise. They start life afresh and all seems well until the ghosts of the past surface again. Things reach a point when Dev Sharma is prodded by his mother to take a course of action which not only avenges their plight but also take on the cause of the aggrieved in the country as a whole. The movement so created gets the support of the woman at large and the infirm who proudly proclaim him to be their Big Brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzd7SpvJNDxZG8kPafMOjVoVJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192339'),
  ('701911232096831442', 'Big Brother', 2018, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Kam Ka-Wai, Donnie Yen, Kenji Tanigaki', 'Chan Tai-Lee', 'Donnie Yen, Joe Chen, Lok Ming-Kit, Yu Kang, Bruce Tong Kwan-Chi, Chris Kwan-Yiu Tong, Gladys Li, Gordon Chiu-Kin Lau', null, 'A soldier-turned-high school teacher uses unusual methods to reach to a class of poor students, while dealing with a greedy entrepreneur and his gang of fighters as well as the government.', 'A soldier-turned-high school teacher uses unusual methods to reach to a class of poor students, while dealing with a greedy entrepreneur and his gang of fighters as well as the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6Y6uQn2fORr7o43EggQrTsp08o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504056'),
  ('796687265557897765', 'Big Brother: A World Under Surveillance', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Christophe Astruc, Ludovic Gaillard, Émilie Champel', 'Sylvain Louvet', 'Sylvain Louvet, Sandra Bertin, Eylon Etshtein, Isaac ben Israël, Hagar Shezaf, Laurent Mucchielli, Christian Estrosi, Martin Drago', null, 'Under the pretext of fighting terrorism or crime, the major powers have embarked on a dangerous race for surveillance technologies. Facial recognition cameras, emotion detectors, citizen rating systems, autonomous drones… A security obsession that in some countries is giving rise to a new form of political regime: numerical totalitarianism. Orwell''s nightmare.', 'Under the pretext of fighting terrorism or crime, the major powers have embarked on a dangerous race for surveillance technologies. Facial recognition cameras, emotion detectors, citizen rating systems, autonomous drones… A security obsession that in some countries is giving rise to a new form of political regime: numerical totalitarianism. Orwell''s nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGlKdcPeMIDucrpzD7z08A4aZ0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682592'),
  ('112036029785055161', 'Big Brown Eyes', 1936, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Boris Morros, Raoul Walsh, George T. Clemens', 'Bert Hanlon, Raoul Walsh', 'Cary Grant, Joan Bennett, Walter Pidgeon, Lloyd Nolan, Alan Baxter, Marjorie Gateson, Joe Sawyer, Isabel Jewell', null, 'Sassy manicurist Eve Fallon is recruited as an even more brassy reporter and she helps police detective boyfriend Danny Barr break a jewel theft ring and solve the murder of a baby.', 'Sassy manicurist Eve Fallon is recruited as an even more brassy reporter and she helps police detective boyfriend Danny Barr break a jewel theft ring and solve the murder of a baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VuHwXVc6vZziEH8bfYaCI7RsWj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81116'),
  ('255784273260137036', 'Big Buck Bunny', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Sacha Goedegebure', null, null, 'G', 'Follow a day of the life of Big Buck Bunny when he meets three bullying rodents: Frank, Rinky, and Gamera. The rodents amuse themselves by harassing helpless creatures by throwing fruits, nuts and rocks at them. After the deaths of two of Bunny''s favorite butterflies, and an offensive attack on Bunny himself, Bunny sets aside his gentle nature and orchestrates a complex plan for revenge.', 'Follow a day of the life of Big Buck Bunny when he meets three bullying rodents: Frank, Rinky, and Gamera. The rodents amuse themselves by harassing helpless creatures by throwing fruits, nuts and rocks at them. After the deaths of two of Bunny''s favorite butterflies, and an offensive attack on Bunny himself, Bunny sets aside his gentle nature and orchestrates a complex plan for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9jJzvoXET4D9pOkoEwncSdNNER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10378'),
  ('1025453298085005934', 'Big Bullet', 1996, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Ma Yuk-Sing', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Susan Chan Suk-Yin, Joe Ma Wai-Ho', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Theresa Lee Yee-Hung, Cheung Tat-Ming, Yu Rongguang, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Spencer Lam Seung-Yi, Francis Ng Chun-Yu', null, 'Hotheaded cop Bill Chu gets relegated to the Emergency Unit after a dustup with his inept boss. When the mob kills Chu''s pal and ex-colleague during a turf-war hit, he rounds up his motley department cohorts and embarks on a mission of revenge against the gangsters.', 'Hotheaded cop Bill Chu gets relegated to the Emergency Unit after a dustup with his inept boss. When the mob kills Chu''s pal and ex-colleague during a turf-war hit, he rounds up his motley department cohorts and embarks on a mission of revenge against the gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRRyKwaL9rjvmTIuT89k9us35tB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89433'),
  ('996985397670107720', 'Big Bully', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Steve Miner, Daryn Okada', 'Mark Steven Johnson', 'Rick Moranis, Tom Arnold, Julianne Phillips, Carol Kane, Jeffrey Tambor, Curtis Armstrong, Don Knotts, Doug Abrahams', 'PG', 'A writer returns to his hometown where he faces the childhood nemesis whose life he ultimately ruined, only the bully wants to relive their painful past by torturing him once again.', 'A writer returns to his hometown where he faces the childhood nemesis whose life he ultimately ruined, only the bully wants to relive their painful past by torturing him once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dws3JR4Yi325Tz33XnuXEB6XjGr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36929'),
  ('303941263023617937', 'Big Business', 1929, 'Comedy', 'James W. Horne, Leo McCarey, Lloyd French', 'H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, James Finlayson, Tiny Sandford, Charlie Hall, Retta Palmer, Lyle Tayo', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie play door-to-door Christmas tree salesmen in California. They end up getting into an escalating feud with grumpy would-be customer James Finlayson, with his home and their car being destroyed in the melee.', 'Stan and Ollie play door-to-door Christmas tree salesmen in California. They end up getting into an escalating feud with grumpy would-be customer James Finlayson, with his home and their car being destroyed in the melee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8if5uYKwnnSmGek683oWti4tVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48649'),
  ('721642372663515715', 'Big Business', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Dean Cundey, Jim Abrahams', 'Marc Reid Rubel, Dori Pierson', 'Bette Midler, Lily Tomlin, Fred Ward, Edward Herrmann, Michele Placido, Daniel Gerroll, Barry Primus, Michael Gross', 'PG', 'In the 1940s in the small town of Jupiter Hollow, two sets of identical twins are born in the same hospital on the same night. One set to a poor local family and the other to a rich family just passing through. The dizzy nurse on duty accidentally mixes the twins unbeknown to the parents. Our story flashes forward to the 1980s where the mismatched sets of twins are about to cross paths.', 'In the 1940s in the small town of Jupiter Hollow, two sets of identical twins are born in the same hospital on the same night. One set to a poor local family and the other to a rich family just passing through. The dizzy nurse on duty accidentally mixes the twins unbeknown to the parents. Our story flashes forward to the 1980s where the mismatched sets of twins are about to cross paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxbXbR1P44caMUKtBdq7sX6aSgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12710'),
  ('751250213901622822', 'Big City', 2007, 'Adventure, Family, Western', 'Djamel Bensalah, Pascal Gennesseaux', 'Djamel Bensalah', 'Eddy Mitchell, Atmen Kelif, Vincent Valladon, Charlie Quatrefages, Jérémy Denisty, Paolina Biguine, Samy Seghir, Claire Bouanich', null, 'Set in the American Wild West, this French-language film quickly overcomes its dire beginning--the Native American ambush of a group of immigrants--and becomes an enjoyable comedy. When the adults of Big City leave for the ambush site, the children realize they are all alone and in charge. With a cast composed almost entirely of young people...', 'Set in the American Wild West, this French-language film quickly overcomes its dire beginning--the Native American ambush of a group of immigrants--and becomes an enjoyable comedy. When the adults of Big City leave for the ambush site, the children realize they are all alone and in charge. With a cast composed almost entirely of young people...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zD3Ti9AHoim4Q4NoiJIH049AnVw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13404'),
  ('658194128204637352', 'Big City Blues', 1932, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mervyn LeRoy, James Van Trees', 'Lillie Hayward, Ward Morehouse', 'Joan Blondell, Eric Linden, Jobyna Howland, Ned Sparks, Guy Kibbee, Grant Mitchell, Walter Catlett, Inez Courtney', null, 'An Indiana boy comes into an inheritance and moves to New York City, living it up with his girlfriend until he gets in over his head and someone gets killed.', 'An Indiana boy comes into an inheritance and moves to New York City, living it up with his girlfriend until he gets in over his head and someone gets killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yT23HKMhpwd294lDMMhyQhRQpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138341'),
  ('742649844566522426', 'Big City Greens the Movie: Spacecation', 2024, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Anna O''Brian', 'Shane Houghton, Julia Layton, Lacey Dyer', 'Chris Houghton, Marieve Herington, Artemis Pebdani, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Bob Joles, Cheri Oteri, Renée Elise Goldsberry, Lorraine Toussaint', 'PG', 'When thrill-seeker Cricket tricks his family into taking a "road trip" in space, chaos in the cosmos quickly ensues. Despite growing frustrations between Cricket and his dad, Bill, the two must learn to appreciate each other''s unique perspectives in order to prevent Big City from being destroyed by an interstellar disaster.', 'When thrill-seeker Cricket tricks his family into taking a "road trip" in space, chaos in the cosmos quickly ensues. Despite growing frustrations between Cricket and his dad, Bill, the two must learn to appreciate each other''s unique perspectives in order to prevent Big City from being destroyed by an interstellar disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kU84ws397tokaTEWgHxw2bPDAMY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:929563'),
  ('509487859101167797', 'Big Daddy', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dennis Dugan, Theo van de Sande', 'Steve Franks, Tim Herlihy, Adam Sandler', 'Adam Sandler, Cole Sprouse, Dylan Sprouse, Joey Lauren Adams, Josh Mostel, Leslie Mann, Jon Stewart, Allen Covert', 'PG-13', 'A lazy law school grad adopts a kid to impress his girlfriend, but everything doesn''t go as planned. Now he''s forced to grow up while navigating the challenges of fatherhood.', 'A lazy law school grad adopts a kid to impress his girlfriend, but everything doesn''t go as planned. Now he''s forced to grow up while navigating the challenges of fatherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqFnFg6YS8urJT6YC95IDkn0VHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9032'),
  ('235164528800629262', 'Big Deal', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Sylwester Chęciński, Zygmunt Samosiuk', 'Andrzej Mularczyk', 'Władysław Hańcza, Wacław Kowalski, Anna Dymna, Duchyll Martin Smith, Robert Lewandowski, Stanley Roginski, Joseph Slowik, Irena Karel', null, 'Pawlak and Kargul - neighbors, frenemies, and grandfathers to Ania- both receive invitation to America from Pawlak''s brother- John. All three of them travel to Chicago, where they discover John has passed away, and they arrived just in time for his funeral. But first- they need to find his illegitimate daughter. Set in late 70''s story of two, charming, Polish villagers'' adventures in Chicago is a third installment of Pawlak and Kargul adventures.', 'Pawlak and Kargul - neighbors, frenemies, and grandfathers to Ania- both receive invitation to America from Pawlak''s brother- John. All three of them travel to Chicago, where they discover John has passed away, and they arrived just in time for his funeral. But first- they need to find his illegitimate daughter. Set in late 70''s story of two, charming, Polish villagers'' adventures in Chicago is a third installment of Pawlak and Kargul adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLuG745C7JajPBj501A1fXScTDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38375'),
  ('344628018406535684', 'Big Deal on Madonna Street 20 Years Later', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Amanzio Todini, Pasqualino De Santis, Valerio Giannetti', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Amanzio Todini, Agenore Incrocci', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Vittorio Gassman, Tiberio Murgia, Clelia Rondinella, Giorgio Gobbi, Gina Rovere, Francesco De Rosa, Alessandra Panelli', null, 'Fresh out prison, Tiberio reconnects with his old partners in crime, Michele Ferribote and Peppe the Panther, only to realise that a lot has changed--including crime--after twenty years. Can he cope with this new reality?', 'Fresh out prison, Tiberio reconnects with his old partners in crime, Michele Ferribote and Peppe the Panther, only to realise that a lot has changed--including crime--after twenty years. Can he cope with this new reality?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dU2MZ3Nt1ou8oIz1muMQ3i65lI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62038'),
  ('601856371686671483', 'Big Driver', 2014, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Bruce Zwicker, John Hencher, David McLeod', null, 'Maria Bello, Ann Dowd, Will Harris, Joan Jett, Olympia Dukakis, Jennifer Kydd, Andre Myette, Juanita Peters', 'NR', 'Tess Thorne, a famous writer, is determined to seek revenge on the man who brutally assaulted and raped her on a desolate New England road.', 'Tess Thorne, a famous writer, is determined to seek revenge on the man who brutally assaulted and raped her on a desolate New England road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOGZagunINGbIMMDXSJnzKJ1Ai4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297961'),
  ('471004613404170127', 'Big Ear', 1989, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Yuriy Butyrin, Ernst Gaman', 'Mikhail Shelekhov', 'Aleksandr Pozharov, Aleksandr Ilin, Zoya Pylnova, Lyudmila Gnilova', null, 'An alien falls down from the sky in front of a wolf cub. His big ear allows him to listen to everything that happens in the universe. Yet somehow he fails to hear forest creatures calling for help.', 'An alien falls down from the sky in front of a wolf cub. His big ear allows him to listen to everything that happens in the universe. Yet somehow he fails to hear forest creatures calling for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Y3QKEDSicfPzZHHcly9G775Is8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218556'),
  ('563415376022233906', 'Big Eden', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Thomas Bezucha, Rob Sweeney', 'Thomas Bezucha', 'Arye Gross, Eric Schweig, Tim DeKay, Louise Fletcher, George Coe, Nan Martin, O''Neal Compton, Corinne Bohrer', 'PG-13', 'Henry Hart is a young gay artist living in New York City. When his grandfather has a stroke, Henry puts his career on hold and returns home to the small town of Big Eden, Montana, to care for him. While there, Henry hopes to strike up a romance with Dean Stewart, his high-school best friend for whom he still has feelings. But he''s surprised when he finds that Pike, a quiet Native American who owns the local general store, may have a crush on him.', 'Henry Hart is a young gay artist living in New York City. When his grandfather has a stroke, Henry puts his career on hold and returns home to the small town of Big Eden, Montana, to care for him. While there, Henry hopes to strike up a romance with Dean Stewart, his high-school best friend for whom he still has feelings. But he''s surprised when he finds that Pike, a quiet Native American who owns the local general store, may have a crush on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAIqu69z1tZjfdq2jThAifAp0tQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21056'),
  ('106091539096009732', 'Big Eyes', 2014, 'Drama', 'Bruno Delbonnel, Tim Burton, Chris August', 'Larry Karaszewski, Scott Alexander', 'Amy Adams, Christoph Waltz, Danny Huston, Jon Polito, Krysten Ritter, Jason Schwartzman, Terence Stamp, Madeleine Arthur', 'PG-13', 'In the late 1950s and early ''60s, artist Walter Keane achieves unbelievable fame and success with portraits of saucer-eyed waifs. However, no one realizes that his wife, Margaret, is the real painter behind the brush. Although Margaret is horrified to learn that Walter is passing off her work as his own, she is too meek to protest too loudly. It isn''t until the Keanes'' marriage comes to an end and a lawsuit follows that the truth finally comes to light.', 'In the late 1950s and early ''60s, artist Walter Keane achieves unbelievable fame and success with portraits of saucer-eyed waifs. However, no one realizes that his wife, Margaret, is the real painter behind the brush. Although Margaret is horrified to learn that Walter is passing off her work as his own, she is too meek to protest too loudly. It isn''t until the Keanes'' marriage comes to an end and a lawsuit follows that the truth finally comes to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/203HAjJcLMl7xThcTqZx4zmEGcV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87093'),
  ('1084788683493387316', 'Big Fan', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert D. Siegel, Michael Simmonds, Josh Trank', 'Robert D. Siegel', 'Patton Oswalt, Kevin Corrigan, Michael Rapaport, Marcia Jean Kurtz, Serafina Fiore, Gino Cafarelli, Jonathan Hamm, Matt Servitto', 'R', 'Paul Aufiero, a 35-year-old parking-garage attendant from Staten Island, is the self-described "world''s biggest New York Giants fan". One night, Paul and his best friend Sal spot Giants star linebacker Quantrell Bishop at a gas station and decide to follow him. At a strip club Paul cautiously decides to approach him but the chance encounter brings Paul''s world crashing down around him.', 'Paul Aufiero, a 35-year-old parking-garage attendant from Staten Island, is the self-described "world''s biggest New York Giants fan". One night, Paul and his best friend Sal spot Giants star linebacker Quantrell Bishop at a gas station and decide to follow him. At a strip club Paul cautiously decides to approach him but the chance encounter brings Paul''s world crashing down around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWQRXpxtSnwp8YS6N5DM3Q9KSsb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29150'),
  ('957565185230656588', 'Big Fat Liar', 2002, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Jonathan Brown, Shawn Levy', 'Dan Schneider', 'Frankie Muniz, Paul Giamatti, Amanda Bynes, Amanda Detmer, Sandra Oh, Russell Hornsby, Michael Bryan French, Christine Tucci', 'PG', 'After one of his class papers is stolen and turned into a movie, a young student and his best friend exact a hilarious, slapstick revenge on the Hollywood hot shot who has taken credit!', 'After one of his class papers is stolen and turned into a movie, a young student and his best friend exact a hilarious, slapstick revenge on the Hollywood hot shot who has taken credit!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EjpQeyOpH8VIaWqIq6SpCQrCks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11870'),
  ('652456645295740005', 'Big Fish', 2003, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama', 'Tim Burton, Philippe Rousselot, Christina Ann Wilson', 'John August', 'Ewan McGregor, Albert Finney, Billy Crudup, Jessica Lange, Helena Bonham Carter, Alison Lohman, Robert Guillaume, Marion Cotillard', 'PG-13', 'Throughout his life Edward Bloom has always been a man of big appetites, enormous passions and tall tales. In his later years, he remains a huge mystery to his son, William. Now, to get to know the real man, Will begins piecing together a true picture of his father from flashbacks of his amazing adventures.', 'Throughout his life Edward Bloom has always been a man of big appetites, enormous passions and tall tales. In his later years, he remains a huge mystery to his son, William. Now, to get to know the real man, Will begins piecing together a true picture of his father from flashbacks of his amazing adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjK063yCgaBAluVU72rZ6PKPH2l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587'),
  ('145224798722205445', 'Big Fish & Begonia', 2016, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Liang Xuan, Zhang Chun', 'Liang Xuan', 'Ji Guanlin, Pan Shulan, Su Shangqing, Timmy Xu, King Shih-chieh, Jiu''er, Xang Yuanyuan, Xue Lifang', 'PG-13', 'Beyond the human realm, there is a magical race of beings who control the tides and the changing of the seasons. One of these beings, a young girl named Chun, seeks something more—she wants to experience the human world! At sixteen, she finally gets her chance and transforms into a dolphin in order to explore the world that has her fascinated. But she soon discovers that it''s a dangerous place and nearly gets killed in a vortex. Luckily, her life is spared when a young boy sacrifices himself to save her. Moved by his kindness and courage, she uses magic to bring him back to life only to learn that this power comes at a serious price. On a new adventure, she’ll have to make her own sacrifices in order to protect his soul until it is ready to return to the human world.', 'Beyond the human realm, there is a magical race of beings who control the tides and the changing of the seasons. One of these beings, a young girl named Chun, seeks something more—she wants to experience the human world! At sixteen, she finally gets her chance and transforms into a dolphin in order to explore the world that has her fascinated. But she soon discovers that it''s a dangerous place and nearly gets killed in a vortex. Luckily, her life is spared when a young boy sacrifices himself to save her. Moved by his kindness and courage, she uses magic to bring him back to life only to learn that this power comes at a serious price. On a new adventure, she’ll have to make her own sacrifices in order to protect his soul until it is ready to return to the human world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRCdXh9MZutj1JJPZlUXMex6AuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271706'),
  ('481397272163066402', 'Big Game', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Jalmari Helander, Mika Orasmaa, Jochen Gosch', 'Jalmari Helander', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Onni Tommila, Ray Stevenson, Victor Garber, Mehmet Kurtuluş, Ted Levine, Jorma Tommila, Risto Salmi', 'PG-13', 'Air Force One is shot down by terrorists, leaving the President of the United States stranded in the wilderness of Finland. 13-year-old Oskari is on a hunting mission to prove his maturity to his kinsfolk by tracking down a deer, but instead discovers the President in an escape pod. With the terrorists closing in to capture their prize, the unlikely duo team up to escape their hunters.', 'Air Force One is shot down by terrorists, leaving the President of the United States stranded in the wilderness of Finland. 13-year-old Oskari is on a hunting mission to prove his maturity to his kinsfolk by tracking down a deer, but instead discovers the President in an escape pod. With the terrorists closing in to capture their prize, the unlikely duo team up to escape their hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZZ5IikYOp3VlyrzyJs4hxSHHXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230179'),
  ('55966644615204444', 'Big George Foreman', 2023, 'History, Drama', 'George Tillman Jr., Soren Miltich, Maurice Sessoms', 'Frank Baldwin, George Tillman Jr.', 'Khris Davis, Forest Whitaker, Sullivan Jones, Deion Smith, Matthew Glave, John Magaro, Sonja Sohn, Sam Trammell', 'PG-13', 'Fueled by an impoverished childhood, George Foreman channeled his anger into becoming an Olympic Gold medalist and World Heavyweight Champion, followed by a near-death experience that took him from the boxing ring to the pulpit. But when he sees his community struggling spiritually and financially, Foreman returns to the ring and makes history by reclaiming his title, becoming the oldest and most improbable World Heavyweight Boxing Champion ever.', 'Fueled by an impoverished childhood, George Foreman channeled his anger into becoming an Olympic Gold medalist and World Heavyweight Champion, followed by a near-death experience that took him from the boxing ring to the pulpit. But when he sees his community struggling spiritually and financially, Foreman returns to the ring and makes history by reclaiming his title, becoming the oldest and most improbable World Heavyweight Boxing Champion ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdVd6thTstt0MQ4dUC1IXiOXpxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878361'),
  ('900519454068871732', 'Big Girls Don''t Cry', 2002, 'Drama', 'Roman Osin, Maria von Heland', 'Maria von Heland', 'Anna Maria Mühe, Karoline Herfurth, David Winter, Josefine Domes, Nina Petri, Stefan Kurt, Teresa Harder, Matthias Brandt', null, 'Kati and Steffi have been best friends since they were six. Now they''re both 17 and enjoying the ups and downs of becoming adults together. While Kati''s parents are religious and conservative, but argue constantly, Steffi comes from what appears to be a harmonious and liberal family. But the girls discover how quickly their attractive world can fall apart when, at a hip nightclub, they happen to see Steffi''s father in the arms of another woman. Steffi is shocked, her trust in her small perfect world shaken to the core. She can only think of one thing: revenge.', 'Kati and Steffi have been best friends since they were six. Now they''re both 17 and enjoying the ups and downs of becoming adults together. While Kati''s parents are religious and conservative, but argue constantly, Steffi comes from what appears to be a harmonious and liberal family. But the girls discover how quickly their attractive world can fall apart when, at a hip nightclub, they happen to see Steffi''s father in the arms of another woman. Steffi is shocked, her trust in her small perfect world shaken to the core. She can only think of one thing: revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqht6AcPcCbljOu4NKghz9bBnYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10636'),
  ('92913027174572751', 'Big Girls Don''t Cry', 2026, 'Drama', 'Paloma Schneideman, Maria Ines Manchego', 'Paloma Schneideman', 'Ani Palmer, Rain Spencer, Noah Taylor, Tara Canton, Beatrix Wolfe', null, 'Rural New Zealand, 2006. Over one transformative summer, 14 year-old Sid Bookman discovers desire, identity and the internet, as she imitates the people she longs to be loved by.', 'Rural New Zealand, 2006. Over one transformative summer, 14 year-old Sid Bookman discovers desire, identity and the internet, as she imitates the people she longs to be loved by.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FpgafAXWrwOGhr4TJrlImmzlKtJX.jpg', 'plex:movie:big-girls-dont-cry-2026'),
  ('700239620011936852', 'Big Girls Don''t Cry... They Get Even', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Joan Micklin Silver, Theo van de Sande, David Sardi', 'Frank Mugavero', 'Hillary Wolf, Griffin Dunne, Dan Futterman, Patricia Kalember, Jenny Lewis, Ben Savage, Jessica Seely, Adrienne Shelly', 'PG', 'A girl fed up with her quirky, dysfunctional family runs away from home, causing all of them to spend time with each other.', 'A girl fed up with her quirky, dysfunctional family runs away from home, causing all of them to spend time with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWG6PMlu1jTst0HPokQ1FjskxLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46972'),
