  ('482178289537616545', 'Big Kids', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Florian Kuhn, Eric Métayer, Andréa Bescond', 'Andréa Bescond, Eric Métayer', 'Vincent Macaigne, Aïssa Maïga, Marie Gillain, Carole Franck, Eric Métayer, Laurence Facelina, Christian Sinniger, Evelyne Istria', null, 'Yannick is a caregiver in a retirement home. Between permanent pressure and budget restrictions, he faces the lack of means with a contagious good mood. But when he is forced to share the dining room with a class of children, the situation becomes complicated. Their arrival, as well as that of his hostess, Aude, will shake up the daily life of everyone, especially the residents.', 'Yannick is a caregiver in a retirement home. Between permanent pressure and budget restrictions, he faces the lack of means with a contagious good mood. But when he is forced to share the dining room with a class of children, the situation becomes complicated. Their arrival, as well as that of his hostess, Aude, will shake up the daily life of everyone, especially the residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UapULHfWK4tmx9JN5v9ZjxQOLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960464'),
