  ('164792857498110599', 'Big Man from the North', 1931, 'Crime, Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Rudolf Ising, Hugh Harman', null, 'Rochelle Hudson, Bernard B. Brown, Ken Darby, Purv Pullen, Rudolf Ising', null, 'Bosko is a Mountie in the cold, snowy north. His sergeant demands that he get his man: a peg-legged villain wanted dead or alive.', 'Bosko is a Mountie in the cold, snowy north. His sergeant demands that he get his man: a peg-legged villain wanted dead or alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Wje3nNe3jlG3GwUwZ5KUZayQrN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151756'),
  ('612696637577886728', 'Big Man Japan', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Hitoshi Matsumoto, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Mitsuyoshi Takasu', 'Hitoshi Matsumoto, UA, Itsuji Itao, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Miyagawa Daisuke, Hiroyuki Miyasako, Riki Takeuchi, Unabara Haruka', null, 'Daisato, a second-rate, third-generation superhero, annoys his neighbors with the noise and destruction he causes on the job. But a heroic public image is the least of his concerns. Besides defending Japan from bizarre monsters, he must deal with an agent seeking to brand him with ads, a superhero grandfather with Alzheimer''s and a family embarrassed by his incompetence.', 'Daisato, a second-rate, third-generation superhero, annoys his neighbors with the noise and destruction he causes on the job. But a heroic public image is the least of his concerns. Besides defending Japan from bizarre monsters, he must deal with an agent seeking to brand him with ads, a superhero grandfather with Alzheimer''s and a family embarrassed by his incompetence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pT5ze3fjW8rYPVtqDyHSRNExHTq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11693'),
  ('136294808599142686', 'Big Man on Campus', 1989, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jeremy Kagan, Bojan Bazelli', 'Allan Katz', 'Allan Katz, Corey Parker, Cindy Williams, Melora Hardin, Gerrit Graham, Jessica Harper, Tom Skerritt, John Finnegan', 'PG-13', 'In this version of "The Hunchback of Notre Dame", a hunchback is found living in the bell tower of UCLA. He discovers life as two students bring him out of the tower and into society.', 'In this version of "The Hunchback of Notre Dame", a hunchback is found living in the bell tower of UCLA. He discovers life as two students bring him out of the tower and into society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHJIvSEm6D1nXi01XCYSrTkMWut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44403'),
  ('630733902206305696', 'Big Man, Little Love', 2001, 'Drama', 'Handan İpekçi', 'Handan İpekçi, Özgü Namal', 'Şükran Güngör, Dilan Erçetin, Füsun Demirel, Yıldız Kenter, İsmail Hakkı Şen, Sevinç Erol, Erdal Ceviz, Saniye Tunç', null, 'An orphaned Kurdish child (Hêjar) and a Turkish pensioner (Rıfat) are thrown together by circumstance. Rıfat, a widowed retired judge, refuses to get involved in politics. He is forced out of his solitude, when Hêjar the only survivor of a police raid on his Kurdish neighbors, takes refuge at his home. Gradually, he warms up to the kid and decides to reunite her with her family.', 'An orphaned Kurdish child (Hêjar) and a Turkish pensioner (Rıfat) are thrown together by circumstance. Rıfat, a widowed retired judge, refuses to get involved in politics. He is forced out of his solitude, when Hêjar the only survivor of a police raid on his Kurdish neighbors, takes refuge at his home. Gradually, he warms up to the kid and decides to reunite her with her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMCTxJZhAXdGZ4e1KXCDyeXTPvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61850'),
  ('292295627982137008', 'Big Match', 2014, 'Comedy, Action, Thriller', 'Choi Ho, Lim Jae-young', 'Shim Bo-kyoung, Choi Ho', 'Lee Jung-jae, Shin Ha-kyun, Kwon BoA, Lee Sung-min, Ra Mi-ran, Kim Eui-sung, Park Doo-sik, Choi Woo-shik', null, 'Choi Ik-Ho is a martial arts star with talent for action and humor. But one day, he is framed for murder. Ace is a game planner, who makes a game for the Korean upper class. He is a villain who makes a city into a big gameboard through technology. Ace and Choi Ik-Ho become adversaries as Choi Ik-Ho jumps into the game to save his brother.', 'Choi Ik-Ho is a martial arts star with talent for action and humor. But one day, he is framed for murder. Ace is a game planner, who makes a game for the Korean upper class. He is a villain who makes a city into a big gameboard through technology. Ace and Choi Ik-Ho become adversaries as Choi Ik-Ho jumps into the game to save his brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6W9tnOLWYNueU9cZ9FNmMj06hk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320150'),
  ('156786394153666032', 'Big Miracle', 2012, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Ken Kwapis, John Bailey', 'Michael Begler, Jack Amiel', 'Drew Barrymore, John Krasinski, Kristen Bell, Vinessa Shaw, Dermot Mulroney, Ted Danson, Kathy Baker, Tim Blake Nelson', 'PG', 'A small-town news reporter and a Greenpeace volunteer enlist the help of rival superpowers to save three majestic gray whales trapped under the ice of the Arctic Circle.', 'A small-town news reporter and a Greenpeace volunteer enlist the help of rival superpowers to save three majestic gray whales trapped under the ice of the Arctic Circle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqdrgC5oHK06DDaAlulReUC7Nog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78698'),
