  ('385318133475376080', 'Big Red', 1962, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Norman Tokar', 'Louis Pelletier', 'Walter Pidgeon, Gilles Payant, Émile Genest, Janette Bertrand, Georges Bouvier, Doris Lussier, Rolland Bédard, Teddy Burns Goulet', 'PG', 'Wealthy sportsman James Haggin (Walter Pidgeon) lives on a Quebec estate called Wintapi. Émile Fornet (Émile Genest), handler of Haggin''s hunting dogs, and Émile''s wife Therese (Janette Bertrand), Haggin''s cook and housekeeper, live in a separate house on the estate. To start a line of top show dogs, Haggin purchases the winner of the Montreal Kennel Club show, an Irish setter named Red.', 'Wealthy sportsman James Haggin (Walter Pidgeon) lives on a Quebec estate called Wintapi. Émile Fornet (Émile Genest), handler of Haggin''s hunting dogs, and Émile''s wife Therese (Janette Bertrand), Haggin''s cook and housekeeper, live in a separate house on the estate. To start a line of top show dogs, Haggin purchases the winner of the Montreal Kennel Club show, an Irish setter named Red.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFE9DlcfKkOUxQMa3LLLPVomxRk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61871'),
