  ('411425661170470796', 'Big Time Adolescence', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jason Orley, Andrew Huebscher, Devin Jurkiewicz', 'Jason Orley', 'Griffin Gluck, Pete Davidson, Jon Cryer, Sydney Sweeney, Emily Arlook, mgk, Thomas Barbusca, Oona Laurence', 'R', 'A seemingly bright and mostly innocent 16-year-old named Mo attempts to navigate high school under the guidance of his best friend Zeke, an unmotivated-yet-charismatic college dropout. Although Zeke genuinely cares about Mo, things start to go awry as he teaches Mo nontraditional life lessons in drug dealing, partying, and dating. Meanwhile, Mo’s well-meaning dad tries to step in and take back the reins of his son’s upbringing.', 'A seemingly bright and mostly innocent 16-year-old named Mo attempts to navigate high school under the guidance of his best friend Zeke, an unmotivated-yet-charismatic college dropout. Although Zeke genuinely cares about Mo, things start to go awry as he teaches Mo nontraditional life lessons in drug dealing, partying, and dating. Meanwhile, Mo’s well-meaning dad tries to step in and take back the reins of his son’s upbringing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaoIzpakgSm0IQEz3edfAttr4YC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539617'),
  ('663769413286559126', 'Big Time Gambling Boss', 1968, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Kōsaku Yamashita, Nagaki Yamagishi, Tatsuo Honda', 'Kazuo Kasahara', 'Koji Tsuruta, Sumiko Fuji, Hiroko Sakuramachi, Hiroshi Nawa, Harumi Sone, Takamaru Sasaki, Shinichirō Mikami, Tomisaburō Wakayama', null, 'Tokyo, 1934. The boss of the clan that controls gambling agonizes and some of his followers propose to Nakai to take his place, but he refuses the offer.', 'Tokyo, 1934. The boss of the clan that controls gambling agonizes and some of his followers propose to Nakai to take his place, but he refuses the offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoczwbVY6PDHMC2jWSrJ2iIuoEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125269'),
  ('520796821386217534', 'Big Time Movie', 2012, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Music, Mystery', 'Savage Steve Holland, Rick Maguire', 'Scott Fellows', 'Kendall Schmidt, James Maslow, Carlos PenaVega, Logan Henderson, Ciara Bravo, Challen Cates, Tanya Chisholm, Stephen Kramer Glickman', null, 'In Big Time Movie, the guys must tap their inner spy as their adventure finds them driving exotic cars and jumping out of helicopters, while trying to make it to their first world tour concert on time. Hot on their trail are evil henchmen named Maxwell, British secret agents and Swedish spies as well as billionaire businessman, Sir Atticus Moon who wants back his precious device code named: “The Beetle,” an anti-gravitational device with enormous power. Once they learn they’re carrying this precious cargo, the guys get pulled into a madcap mission throughout London, which threatens the onset of their world tour. With the help of teen spy Penny Lane, the guys set out to save Penny’s father MI6 Agent Simon Lane and stop Sir Atticus Moon’s plot to use “The Beetle” to gain world domination.', 'In Big Time Movie, the guys must tap their inner spy as their adventure finds them driving exotic cars and jumping out of helicopters, while trying to make it to their first world tour concert on time. Hot on their trail are evil henchmen named Maxwell, British secret agents and Swedish spies as well as billionaire businessman, Sir Atticus Moon who wants back his precious device code named: “The Beetle,” an anti-gravitational device with enormous power. Once they learn they’re carrying this precious cargo, the guys get pulled into a madcap mission throughout London, which threatens the onset of their world tour. With the help of teen spy Penny Lane, the guys set out to save Penny’s father MI6 Agent Simon Lane and stop Sir Atticus Moon’s plot to use “The Beetle” to gain world domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIFqLhlK8fhYnBCrrYedKHTzlhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95754'),
