  ('496091842099180201', 'Big Trouble', 1986, 'Comedy, Crime', 'John Cassavetes, Bill Butler', 'Andrew Bergman', 'Alan Arkin, Beverly D''Angelo, Peter Falk, Charles Durning, Robert Stack, Paul Dooley, Valerie Curtin, Richard Libertini', 'R', 'Leonard Hoffman is an insurance salesman struggling to make ends meet. The fact that he has triplet sons who all want to go to Yale isn''t making things any easier. Blanche Rickey is also worried about money; her husband is a millionaire with a weak heart, and she worries that he''ll blow through all his cash before he finally dies. When Blanche meets Leonard, she devises a murderous plan that she claims will fix both their problems.', 'Leonard Hoffman is an insurance salesman struggling to make ends meet. The fact that he has triplet sons who all want to go to Yale isn''t making things any easier. Blanche Rickey is also worried about money; her husband is a millionaire with a weak heart, and she worries that he''ll blow through all his cash before he finally dies. When Blanche meets Leonard, she devises a murderous plan that she claims will fix both their problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fQ9ryGMLt1fZxX45CI9xfVWPG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78041'),
