  ('589162470335890345', 'Bigfoot', 1987, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Frank P. Flynn, John M. Poer, John N. Whittle', 'John Groves', 'James Sloyan, Gracie Harrison, Joseph Maher, Adam Carl, Candace Cameron Bure, Bernard White, Colleen Dewhurst, Dawan Scott', null, 'A family goes to the mountains for a few days, and there they meet... Bigfoot!', 'A family goes to the mountains for a few days, and there they meet... Bigfoot!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOCAOBCJs9yGXQoOOyXavy8cONk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398614'),
  ('246398092198060697', 'Bigfoot', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Bruce Davison, Alexander Yellen', 'Micho Rutare, Brian Brinkman', 'Barry Williams, Howard Hesseman, Sherilyn Fenn, Danny Bonaduce, Alice Cooper, Bruce Davison, Andre Royo, Stephanie Sarreal Park', null, 'A rock concert awakens the legendary monster, who goes on a rampage. The event''s organizer plans to kill the beast and create a tourist attraction around its stuffed body, but an environmentalist realizes the creature is the last of its species, and is determined to make sure it does not become extinct.', 'A rock concert awakens the legendary monster, who goes on a rampage. The event''s organizer plans to kill the beast and create a tourist attraction around its stuffed body, but an environmentalist realizes the creature is the last of its species, and is determined to make sure it does not become extinct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5ZuJTEzPxyifFTYs1BvGRQfLb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117856'),
  ('1104889871587012717', 'Bigfoot Family', 2020, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Jérémie Degruson, Ben Stassen', 'Cal Brunker, Bob Barlen', 'Jules Medcraft, David Lodge, Grant George, Shyloh Oostwald, Joey Camen, Kyle Hebert, Jeff Rector, Roger Craig Smith', 'G', 'Bigfoot, Adam''s father, wants to use his fame for a good cause. Protecting a large wildlife reserve in Alaska sounds like the perfect opportunity! When Bigfoot mysteriously disappears without a trace, Adam and his animal friends will brave anything to find him again and save the nature reserve.', 'Bigfoot, Adam''s father, wants to use his fame for a good cause. Protecting a large wildlife reserve in Alaska sounds like the perfect opportunity! When Bigfoot mysteriously disappears without a trace, Adam and his animal friends will brave anything to find him again and save the nature reserve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vn7sNO6CD8FBHBEVcOiNv08mjy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:702525'),
  ('221064378302163951', 'Bigfoot: The Lost Coast Tapes', 2012, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Corey Grant, Richard J. Vialet', 'Bryan O''Cain, Brian Kelsey', 'Drew Rausch, Rich McDonald, Noah Weisberg, Frank Ashmore, Rowdy Kelley, Japheth Gordon, Sweetie Sherrié, Ashley Wood', 'R', 'Sean Reynolds, a highly acclaimed investigative journalist (who strongly believed in paranormal phenomena), destroyed his career when the most watched episode of his reality show, based on paranormal phenomena, turned out to be a hoax. Sean saw a news report on a "Bigfoot Hunter" (Carl Drybeck) who claimed to possess the body of a dead Sasquatch. He believes Drybeck is a phony and decides to create a new show that reveals people''s paranormal claims as hoaxes. Sean assembles his old film crew and heads to Northern California''s "Lost Coast" to meet with and interview Drybeck. Obsessed, Sean is staking his comeback, his life and the lives of his documentary film crew on proving Drybeck''s claim to be a hoax.', 'Sean Reynolds, a highly acclaimed investigative journalist (who strongly believed in paranormal phenomena), destroyed his career when the most watched episode of his reality show, based on paranormal phenomena, turned out to be a hoax. Sean saw a news report on a "Bigfoot Hunter" (Carl Drybeck) who claimed to possess the body of a dead Sasquatch. He believes Drybeck is a phony and decides to create a new show that reveals people''s paranormal claims as hoaxes. Sean assembles his old film crew and heads to Northern California''s "Lost Coast" to meet with and interview Drybeck. Obsessed, Sean is staking his comeback, his life and the lives of his documentary film crew on proving Drybeck''s claim to be a hoax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esIg4M7lhgxtstGVPMvBXhctM1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129418'),
  ('511875068987930880', 'Bigfoot: The Unforgettable Encounter', 1994, 'Family', 'Corey Michael Eubanks, Ken Blakey', 'Corey Michael Eubanks', 'Matt McCoy, David Rasche, Zachery Ty Bryan, Crystal Chappell, Clint Howard, Brian Avery, Rance Howard, Debbie James', 'PG', 'When Cody gets lost while exploring in the woods, he finds a friend in the legendary creature, Bigfoot.', 'When Cody gets lost while exploring in the woods, he finds a friend in the legendary creature, Bigfoot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlA4Eew3jca5iR31e2Dunr2y4Uw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79869'),
  ('797637431198500877', 'Bigga Than Ben', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Suzie Halewood, Ben Moulden', 'Suzie Halewood', 'Ben Barnes, Andrey Chadov, Ovidiu Matesan, Andrew Byron, Jeff Mirza, Sean O''Callaghan, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Wendy Nottingham', null, 'Spiker & Cobakka are two self-confessed ''pieces of Moscow scum'' who come to London to rip it off. This is their guide.', 'Spiker & Cobakka are two self-confessed ''pieces of Moscow scum'' who come to London to rip it off. This is their guide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4TLaZo05yphmD198C5MyL5pYrm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17155'),
  ('843369726079984851', 'Bigger', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'George Gallo, Michael Negrin', 'Andy Weiss, George Gallo, Ellen Brown Furman', 'Tyler Hoechlin, Aneurin Barnard, Colton Haynes, Julianne Hough, DJ Qualls, Victoria Justice, Kevin Durand, Steve Guttenberg', null, 'The inspirational tale of the grandfathers of the fitness movement as we now know it, Joe & Ben Weider. Battling anti-Semitism, racism and extreme poverty, the brothers beat all odds to build an empire & inspire future generations.', 'The inspirational tale of the grandfathers of the fitness movement as we now know it, Joe & Ben Weider. Battling anti-Semitism, racism and extreme poverty, the brothers beat all odds to build an empire & inspire future generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6rmiFTfT3Rf9XDrXfLO6XcAgWn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481370'),
  ('204627146089270606', 'Bigger Fatter Liar', 2017, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Ron Oliver', 'David H. Steinberg', 'Ricky Garcia, Barry Bostwick, Jodelle Ferland, Andrew Herr, April Telek, Nelson Wong, Morgan Brayton, Irene Reynolds', 'PG', 'Kevin Shepard is a tech-savvy young genius who uses his intelligence to slack off. When greedy video game executive Alan Wolf gets a hold of his ideas for a video game, Kevin and his best friend Becca set off for San Francisco to make Wolf''s life miserable through a series of pranks.', 'Kevin Shepard is a tech-savvy young genius who uses his intelligence to slack off. When greedy video game executive Alan Wolf gets a hold of his ideas for a video game, Kevin and his best friend Becca set off for San Francisco to make Wolf''s life miserable through a series of pranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6jMDEIebIHpZKePOZzhlEDeROW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437042'),
  ('454966768910220957', 'Bigger Is Beautiful', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Charlotte de Turckheim', 'Charlotte de Turckheim, Gladys Marciano', 'Catherine Hosmalin, Lola Dewaere, Charlotte de Turckheim, Patrick de Valette, Charlotte Gaccio, Johanna Piaton de Turckheim, Marc Riso, Barbara Bolotner', null, 'Isabelle and her niece Nina open a "fasting and detox" cure in the heart of Provence, with the help of Baptiste, a yogi and handyman, Jessica, a tantric masseuse, and Maxime, a seductive equine therapist. Among the first curists, four overweight teenagers sent by the town hall; Marion and Lio, her skinny sister who imposes the cure on her "for her own good"; and their friend Émilie who, having shed her extra kilos, discovers as soon as she arrives that her beloved husband is swooning in the arms of a man... who is clearly overweight!', 'Isabelle and her niece Nina open a "fasting and detox" cure in the heart of Provence, with the help of Baptiste, a yogi and handyman, Jessica, a tantric masseuse, and Maxime, a seductive equine therapist. Among the first curists, four overweight teenagers sent by the town hall; Marion and Lio, her skinny sister who imposes the cure on her "for her own good"; and their friend Émilie who, having shed her extra kilos, discovers as soon as she arrives that her beloved husband is swooning in the arms of a man... who is clearly overweight!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTt4AJDGH1J1b7FQ336jJvZhpLH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756594'),
  ('445027683028429053', 'Bigger Stronger Faster*', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Chris Bell', 'Chris Bell, Tamsin Rawady, Alexander Buono', 'Chris Bell, Mike Bell, Mark Bell, Joe Biden, Ronald Reagan, Al Gore, Dick Cheney, Laura Bush', 'PG-13', 'In America, we define ourselves in the superlative: we are the biggest, strongest, fastest country in the world. Is it any wonder that so many of our heroes are on performance enhancing drugs? Director Christopher Bell explores America''s win-at-all-cost culture by examining how his two brothers became members of the steroid-subculture in an effort to realize their American dream.', 'In America, we define ourselves in the superlative: we are the biggest, strongest, fastest country in the world. Is it any wonder that so many of our heroes are on performance enhancing drugs? Director Christopher Bell explores America''s win-at-all-cost culture by examining how his two brothers became members of the steroid-subculture in an effort to realize their American dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sZNQ7OQgkJj7kLFx4su21yEHTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13636'),
  ('118002010670039975', 'Bigger Than Life', 1956, 'Drama', 'Nicholas Ray, Joseph MacDonald, Eli Dunn', 'Richard Maibaum, Cyril Hume', 'James Mason, Barbara Rush, Walter Matthau, Robert F. Simon, Christopher Olsen, Roland Winters, Rusty Lane, Rachel Stephens', 'NR', 'A friendly, successful suburban teacher and father grows dangerously addicted to cortisone, resulting in his transformation into a household despot.', 'A friendly, successful suburban teacher and father grows dangerously addicted to cortisone, resulting in his transformation into a household despot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nC3J5B2lkWDLm7Q7C26AVFzqJLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26036'),
  ('970770068249927181', 'Bigger Than the Sky', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, Family', 'Al Corley, Carl Nilsson', 'Rodney Patrick Vaccaro', 'Marcus Thomas, John Corbett, Amy Smart, Sean Astin, Clare Higgins, Patty Duke, Allan Corduner, J.W. Crawford', 'PG-13', 'After being dumped by his girlfriend, a man stuck in a deadend life decides to audition for a small role in a local community theatre''s production of Cyrano de Bergerac. Despite having no experience as an actor, he lands the lead role, which wreaks havoc upon his life.', 'After being dumped by his girlfriend, a man stuck in a deadend life decides to audition for a small role in a local community theatre''s production of Cyrano de Bergerac. Despite having no experience as an actor, he lands the lead role, which wreaks havoc upon his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djKEJkN9D3pQAI8aGbz1Uq44g7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51177'),
  ('43511105739486677', 'Biggest Heist Ever', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Chris Smith', null, null, 'R', 'Their crimes earned them the nickname Bitcoin Bonnie and Clyde — and the story only gets weirder in this documentary about the most lucrative heist ever.', 'Their crimes earned them the nickname Bitcoin Bonnie and Clyde — and the story only gets weirder in this documentary about the most lucrative heist ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIS7g0i09afNbHQ9VHRnP8PErTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1391409'),
  ('888660315015466364', 'Biggie & Tupac', 2002, 'Music, Documentary', 'Nick Broomfield, Joan Churchill', null, 'Tupac Shakur, Nick Broomfield, The Notorious B.I.G., Russell Poole, Voletta Wallace, Billy Garland, Chico Del Vec, Don Seabold', 'R', 'In 1997, rap superstars Tupac Shakur and Christopher Wallace (aka Biggie Smalls, The Notorious B.I.G.) were gunned down in separate incidents, the apparent victims of hip hop''s infamous east-west rivalry. Nick Broomfield''s film introduces Russell Poole, an ex-cop with damning evidence that suggests the LAPD deliberately fumbled the case to conceal connections between the police, LA gangs and Death Row Records, the label run by feared rap mogul Marion "Suge" Knight.', 'In 1997, rap superstars Tupac Shakur and Christopher Wallace (aka Biggie Smalls, The Notorious B.I.G.) were gunned down in separate incidents, the apparent victims of hip hop''s infamous east-west rivalry. Nick Broomfield''s film introduces Russell Poole, an ex-cop with damning evidence that suggests the LAPD deliberately fumbled the case to conceal connections between the police, LA gangs and Death Row Records, the label run by feared rap mogul Marion "Suge" Knight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hh64yVsYNWjPGcIEKITp0f6Uqsu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30586'),
  ('441932850887065032', 'Biggie: I Got a Story to Tell', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Ben Kutchins, Emmett Malloy', null, 'The Notorious B.I.G., Sean Combs, Faith Evans, Damion Butler, Voletta Wallace, Lil'' Cease, Gwendolyn Wallace, Dave Wallace', 'R', 'Christopher Wallace, AKA The Notorious B.I.G., remains one of Hip-Hop’s icons, renowned for his distinctive flow and autobiographical lyrics. This documentary celebrates his life via rare behind-the-scenes footage and the testimonies of his closest friends and family.', 'Christopher Wallace, AKA The Notorious B.I.G., remains one of Hip-Hop’s icons, renowned for his distinctive flow and autobiographical lyrics. This documentary celebrates his life via rare behind-the-scenes footage and the testimonies of his closest friends and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwMZiuoucmdVxZmj4HjYSLwAFJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797309'),
  ('1041986014467417327', 'Biggles', 1986, 'Action, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction, War', 'John Hough, Ernest Vincze', 'Kent Walwin, John Groves', 'Neil Dickson, Alex Hyde-White, Fiona Hutchison, Peter Cushing, Marcus Gilbert, William Hootkins, Alan Polonsky, Francesca Gonshaw', 'PG', 'Unassuming catering salesmen Jim Ferguson falls through a time hole to 1917 where he saves the life of dashing Royal Flying Corps pilot James "Biggles" Bigglesworth after his photo recon mission is shot down. Before he can work out what has happened, Jim is zapped back to the 1980s......', 'Unassuming catering salesmen Jim Ferguson falls through a time hole to 1917 where he saves the life of dashing Royal Flying Corps pilot James "Biggles" Bigglesworth after his photo recon mission is shot down. Before he can work out what has happened, Jim is zapped back to the 1980s......', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dsO33VTBp265IQDcLG2HNFtUdO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22976'),
