  ('825059086668257462', 'Bigil', 2019, 'Drama, Action, Family', 'Atlee, G. K. Vishnu, Tapas Nayak', 'Ramana Girivasan, Atlee', 'Vijay, Nayanthara, Jackie Shroff, Kathir, Vivek, Daniel Balaji, Anandaraj, Yogi Babu', null, 'A do-gooder don wants his footballer son to uplift the life of his people by becoming a champion, but fate draws the youngster into a life of violence. Will he be able to fulfill his father’s dream when an opportunity comes his way seven years later?', 'A do-gooder don wants his footballer son to uplift the life of his people by becoming a champion, but fate draws the youngster into a life of violence. Will he be able to fulfill his father’s dream when an opportunity comes his way seven years later?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4Yi1RbMyyN3hH2hElwvluP2rOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563309'),
  ('202740837742846841', 'Bihter: A Forbidden Passion', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Olcay Oğuz, Mehmet Binay, Caner Alper', 'Merve Göntem', 'Farah Zeynep Abdullah, Boran Kuzum, Osman Sonant, Hande Ataizi, Helin Kandemir, Nezaket Erden, Lorin Merhart, Mertcan Tekin', null, 'Bihter, who is desperate for love, sees Adnan, a wealthy and respected older guy, as a way out of the stereotype that society and her materialistic mother have given her. But she soon discovers that she is not satisfied with his attention and has other needs.', 'Bihter, who is desperate for love, sees Adnan, a wealthy and respected older guy, as a way out of the stereotype that society and her materialistic mother have given her. But she soon discovers that she is not satisfied with his attention and has other needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80LYrmrs3EcW0hj9aXAwglmXtJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1078642'),
  ('555423338128679520', 'Bikeman', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Prueksa Amaruji, Nattawut Kittikhun, Taveechart Kittipanta', 'Prueksa Amaruji, Weeravat Chayochaikorn', 'Pachara Chirathivat, Jennifer Kim, Sananthachat Thanapatpisal, Pramote Pathan, Akom Preedakul, Paitoon Pumrat, Thoedchat Jumneankul, Apiporn Leetrakoon', null, 'Pretending to be a banker to his family, a nimble, motorcycle taxi driver struggles to maintain his charade when he runs into his childhood crush.', 'Pretending to be a banker to his family, a nimble, motorcycle taxi driver struggles to maintain his charade when he runs into his childhood crush.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5j2RXZECwjmTUuARfKiZW3m93A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550189'),
  ('987914063198805128', 'Biker Boyz', 2003, 'Action, Drama', 'Reggie Rock Bythewood, Greg Gardiner, Amy Vincent', 'Craig Fernandez, Reggie Rock Bythewood', 'Laurence Fishburne, Derek Luke, Orlando Jones, Djimon Hounsou, Meagan Good, Lisa Bonet, Kid Rock, Salli Richardson-Whitfield', 'PG-13', 'A mythic motorcycle tale of father and son, this is the story of Manuel Galloway, also known as "the King of Cali", the president of a motorcycle club whose members are all African-American men, mostly white-collar workers who exchange their suits and ties at night and on weekends for leather outfits and motorcycle helmets.', 'A mythic motorcycle tale of father and son, this is the story of Manuel Galloway, also known as "the King of Cali", the president of a motorcycle club whose members are all African-American men, mostly white-collar workers who exchange their suits and ties at night and on weekends for leather outfits and motorcycle helmets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frb2Tk7DTBshZ61Or0D3M1kslWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12253'),
  ('888499889515029613', 'Bikes', 2018, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Manuel J. García', 'John Michael Boughn, Michael Maurer', 'Silvia Cabrera Martínez, Marta Aparicio, María Querol, Perico Delgado, Carlos Latre, Anabel Alonso, Roberto Merhi, Pedro Suero', null, 'Life for the bike citizens is idyllic, until one day, a new and surprising gizmo, the gas engine, comes to town. What follows is a thrilling, hilarious adventure, that will see Speedy the mountain bike become the unwitting leader of a group of environmental activists, who are determined to stop the gas engine from polluting their unspoilt haven.', 'Life for the bike citizens is idyllic, until one day, a new and surprising gizmo, the gas engine, comes to town. What follows is a thrilling, hilarious adventure, that will see Speedy the mountain bike become the unwitting leader of a group of environmental activists, who are determined to stop the gas engine from polluting their unspoilt haven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7hFWcR1MtWqx5IuJWJmI4kjVFZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568066'),
