  ('425409753223906032', 'Bikini Bar: Delicious Service', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jo Tae-ho', null, 'Seo Won, Seung Ha, Han Seok-bong, Hae Il', null, 'Minzhu ran a bar, but the business was so bad that she lost all her store deposit, and the landlord kept pressing for rent. Seeing this, Meizhen decided to develop an innovative spirit and began to provide special services in a bikini. Soon, the bar''s Business is booming….', 'Minzhu ran a bar, but the business was so bad that she lost all her store deposit, and the landlord kept pressing for rent. Seeing this, Meizhen decided to develop an innovative spirit and began to provide special services in a bikini. Soon, the bar''s Business is booming….', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfbPZlw9AX75rPXkOQmpxJ8OV2u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1229343'),
  ('528856554204629608', 'Bikini Beach', 1964, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'William Asher, Anthony Carras, Clark L. Paylow', 'William Asher, Leo Townsend, Robert Dillon', 'Frankie Avalon, Annette Funicello, Martha Hyer, Don Rickles, Harvey Lembeck, Delores Wells, John Ashley, Jody McCrea', 'NR', 'A millionaire sets out to prove his theory that his pet chimpanzee is as intelligent as the teenagers who hang out on the local beach, where he is intending to build a retirement home.', 'A millionaire sets out to prove his theory that his pet chimpanzee is as intelligent as the teenagers who hang out on the local beach, where he is intending to build a retirement home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGlBaAR2FZbmOaAuZ7cznVkKDGh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39113'),
  ('1075552541896948751', 'Bikini Drive-In', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Gary Graver, Fred Olen Ray, Dan Katzman', 'Steve Armogida, John N. Willey', 'Ashlie Rhey, Richard Gabai, Ross Hagen, Roxanne Blaze, Conrad Brooks, Rob Vogl, Steve Barkett, Nikki Fritz', null, 'Kim Taylor inherits her grandfather''s drive-in theatre. She must raise $25,000 over one weekend or the bank will take the property from her. She also has to deal with pesky capitalist J.B. Winston.', 'Kim Taylor inherits her grandfather''s drive-in theatre. She must raise $25,000 over one weekend or the bank will take the property from her. She also has to deal with pesky capitalist J.B. Winston.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87pbXP0uzA2NpSUjyGWJOj3Ik75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28267'),
  ('669890355058163490', 'Bikini Girls on Ice', 2009, 'Horror', 'Geoff Klein, Natalino Lattanzio', 'Geoff Klein, Jeff Ross', 'Suzi Lorraine, Kerri Taylor, Cindel Chartrand, Danielle Doetsch, William Jarand, Christina Sciortino, Caroline Faille, Tarek Gader', null, 'When a bus-load of women''s college soccer players get stranded on their way to a bikini car-wash fundraiser, they decide to set-up shop in front of an abandoned gas station on the edge of town. Little do they know the place is the stalking-grounds for a homicidal maniac mechanic named Moe.', 'When a bus-load of women''s college soccer players get stranded on their way to a bikini car-wash fundraiser, they decide to set-up shop in front of an abandoned gas station on the edge of town. Little do they know the place is the stalking-grounds for a homicidal maniac mechanic named Moe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fb4TqBGizDK3kT8y2GzVSzZN0t9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28585'),
  ('849553523080815488', 'Bikini Island', 1991, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Tony Markes, Howard Wexler', 'Emerson Bixby', 'Holly Floria, Alicia Anne, Jackson Robinson, Kelly Poole, Cheryl Janecky, Cyndi Pass, Shannon Stiles, Kathleen McOsker', null, '"Swimwear Illustrated" is approaching its fifteenth anniversary issue. From a group of eager and beautiful young women, five are chosen for a photo shoot on an island off the California coast. One of the five will be the cover girl, and she''ll get an extra $100,000. On the island, the group stays at an isolated inn, staffed by the odd Frab. There''s him, the five models, and four magazine staff: photographer, make-up man, ambitious assistant Anesa, and Jack Denton, the playboy in charge of production. One by one, models and staff disappear.', '"Swimwear Illustrated" is approaching its fifteenth anniversary issue. From a group of eager and beautiful young women, five are chosen for a photo shoot on an island off the California coast. One of the five will be the cover girl, and she''ll get an extra $100,000. On the island, the group stays at an isolated inn, staffed by the odd Frab. There''s him, the five models, and four magazine staff: photographer, make-up man, ambitious assistant Anesa, and Jack Denton, the playboy in charge of production. One by one, models and staff disappear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6gPW0B1T23pnrQqw7D1cA771eO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137663'),
  ('636901951195995427', 'Bikini Med School', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Michael Paul Girard, Denis Maloney, Pavlino Soto', 'Michael Paul Girard', 'Kim Dawson, Konstantine Greco, Tamara Landry, Thomas Draper, Sean Abbananto, Anastasia Alexander, Kyle Anderson, Lisa Comshaw', null, 'Medical school is tough work--except when the students throw a party! Join these wild and crazy med students as they work in a little extracurricular activity. Of course, what''s a check-up without a complete physical?', 'Medical school is tough work--except when the students throw a party! Join these wild and crazy med students as they work in a little extracurricular activity. Of course, what''s a check-up without a complete physical?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBqgSa8FZlSnCYs2OcvU3xNei9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419766'),
  ('540642024476260631', 'Bikini Spring Break', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jared Cohn, Ben Demaree, Glenn Miller', 'Naomi L. Selfman, Jared Cohn', 'Rachel Alig, Robert Carradine, Samantha Stewart, Erica Duke, Virginia Petrucci, Andrew Clements, Erin O''Brien, Tristan Ott', 'R', 'A group of coeds from a small conservative college break out of their shells when their marching band bus breaks down in Fort Lauderdale during Spring Break.', 'A group of coeds from a small conservative college break out of their shells when their marching band bus breaks down in Fort Lauderdale during Spring Break.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clDfJg7o5PVG3n7ChMBIbsEiD9X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114574'),
  ('268261143726871114', 'Bikini Summer', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Robert Veze, Ken Blakey, Felicia Miller', 'Robert Veze, Nick Stone', 'Melinda Armstrong, David Millbern, Kelli Konop, Shelley Michelle, Alex Smith, Rebekah Alfred, Carmen Santa Maria, David Garrison', 'R', 'A group of friends are hired to redecorate a beach house while the elderly owners are out of town for the summer. Redecorating is the last thing on their minds, and a wild bikini filled summer is had by all. An imposter-photographer, a bikini designer, an all girl metal-band, and the token environmentalist all join forces in staging a riotous Bikini Contest... much to the consternation of the local D.A., and her loyal cadre of policemen.', 'A group of friends are hired to redecorate a beach house while the elderly owners are out of town for the summer. Redecorating is the last thing on their minds, and a wild bikini filled summer is had by all. An imposter-photographer, a bikini designer, an all girl metal-band, and the token environmentalist all join forces in staging a riotous Bikini Contest... much to the consternation of the local D.A., and her loyal cadre of policemen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCvX95baRInY1ZJN2vVkrD3Ebsx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96105'),
  ('1149576970371881902', 'Bikini Summer II', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Kristina Baker, Scott McAboy, Laurie Petkus', 'Charles T. Kanganis', 'Jessica Hahn, Maureen Flaherty, Melinda Armstrong, Robert Miano, Richard Arbolino, Michele Conaway, Brian Cassidy, Avalon Anders', 'R', 'Two rich girls take a homelss man in and he teaches them about the real world. Meanwhile, their family has problems: the husband''s kind of kinky and the wife has "issues." But don''t fret for this wacky crew - it''s a comedy with a happy ending. The girls put on a rock ''n'' roll concert at the beach and all is well in bikini land!', 'Two rich girls take a homelss man in and he teaches them about the real world. Meanwhile, their family has problems: the husband''s kind of kinky and the wife has "issues." But don''t fret for this wacky crew - it''s a comedy with a happy ending. The girls put on a rock ''n'' roll concert at the beach and all is well in bikini land!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OQ39KASUifxg2Wdj7dn0LYAFWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141055'),
  ('100467019974702113', 'Bikini Traffic School', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Gary Graver, Gary Graver', 'Kimberly A. Ray', 'Shayna Ryan, Maureen Flaherty, Shari Eckert, Gregory S. O''Rourke, Steve Scionti, Peter Spellos, Oleg Zatsepin, Kimberly A. Ray', null, 'Las Vegas strippers inherit a traffic school while a local slumlord dreams of building a corrupt community.', 'Las Vegas strippers inherit a traffic school while a local slumlord dreams of building a corrupt community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zd78zsF0jtHCzADcn7Fsi6rNBMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131369'),
  ('106770603607595032', 'Bikram: Yogi, Guru, Predator', 2019, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Eva Orner, Jenna Rosher', null, 'Larissa Anderson, Francesca Asumah, Sarah Baughn, Bikram Choudhury, John Dowd, Mukul Dutta, Jafa-Bodden Micki, Carla Minnard', null, 'The spectacular rise and scandalous fall of hot-yoga evangelist Bikram Choudhury is chronicled through archival footage and extensive insider interviews.', 'The spectacular rise and scandalous fall of hot-yoga evangelist Bikram Choudhury is chronicled through archival footage and extensive insider interviews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qzgxaWtAtl19YwHvtQ1E8Kju6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621753'),
  ('697738097359236996', 'Bilal: A New Breed of Hero', 2016, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, History', 'Ayman Jamal, Khurram H. Alavi', 'Michael Wolfe, Alexander Kronemer, Ayman Jamal', 'Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, China Anne McClain, Ian McShane, Jacob Latimore, Cynthia Kaye McWilliams, Fred Tatasciore, Mick Wingert, Thomas Ian Nicholas', 'PG-13', 'A thousand years ago, one boy with a dream of becoming a great warrior is abducted with his sister and taken to a land far away from home. Thrown into a world where greed and injustice rule all, Bilal finds the courage to raise his voice and make a change. Inspired by true events, this is a story of a real hero who earned his remembrance in time and history.', 'A thousand years ago, one boy with a dream of becoming a great warrior is abducted with his sister and taken to a land far away from home. Thrown into a world where greed and injustice rule all, Bilal finds the courage to raise his voice and make a change. Inspired by true events, this is a story of a real hero who earned his remembrance in time and history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncWuEzxnXqssxRfHghZuUAIezCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332718'),
  ('140259107286724529', 'Bilbao', 1978, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bigas Luna', 'Bigas Luna', 'Àngel Jové, Isabel Pisano, María Martín, Jordi Torras, Maika Thienen, Francisco Falcon', null, 'A disturbed middle-aged man is obsessed by a dancer and prostitute and abducts her, with tragic consequences.', 'A disturbed middle-aged man is obsessed by a dancer and prostitute and abducts her, with tragic consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzbuoiRzpa29TCD9uQvtWfrfdVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115867'),
  ('827995210830965658', 'Bilby', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'JP Sans, Liron Topaz, Pierre Perifel', 'Pierre Perifel, Liron Topaz, JP Sans', 'Dee Bradley Baker, David P. Smith', 'G', 'Threatened daily by the deadly residents and harsh environment of Australia’s Outback, a lonesome bilby finds himself an unwitting protector, and unexpected friend, to a helpless (and quite adorable) baby bird.', 'Threatened daily by the deadly residents and harsh environment of Australia’s Outback, a lonesome bilby finds himself an unwitting protector, and unexpected friend, to a helpless (and quite adorable) baby bird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjOrumBkIq6hDjijozRuja8Obo0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528644'),
  ('124722516841671703', 'Bilitis', 1977, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Hamilton, Bernard Daillencourt, Alain Nahum', 'Catherine Breillat, Jean-Louis Roncoroni', 'Patti D''Arbanville, Mona Kristensen, Bernard Giraudeau, Gilles Kohler, Mathieu Carrière, Catherine Leprince, Germaine Delbat, Madeleine Damien', 'R', 'A coming of age story centering on the exploits of a young girl during summer vacation.', 'A coming of age story centering on the exploits of a young girl during summer vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhebKo7EuNJpSTfOorWxDCQQJAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50435'),
  ('786222499686222758', 'Bill', 2015, 'Comedy, Family', 'Laurie Rose, Richard Bracewell', 'Laurence Rickard, Ben Willbond, Susie Donkin', 'Mathew Baynton, Simon Farnaby, Martha Howe-Douglas, Jim Howick, Laurence Rickard, Ben Willbond, Helen McCrory, Damian Lewis', null, 'What really happened during Shakespeare''s ''Lost Years''? Hopeless lute player Bill Shakespeare leaves his home to follow his dream.', 'What really happened during Shakespeare''s ''Lost Years''? Hopeless lute player Bill Shakespeare leaves his home to follow his dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xasl8mg8odWgceBfHimz39smNjb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338913'),
  ('140640078011535820', 'Bill & Ted Face the Music', 2020, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure, Music', 'Shannon de Vergnette, Alexander Salazar, Jonathan M. Warren', 'Ed Solomon, Chris Matheson', 'Keanu Reeves, Alex Winter, Kristen Schaal, Samara Weaving, Jack Haven, William Sadler, Anthony Carrigan, Erinn Hayes', 'PG-13', 'Yet to fulfill their rock and roll destiny, the stakes are higher than ever for the now middle-aged Bill and Ted who set out on a new adventure when a visitor from the future warns them that only their song can save life as we know it.', 'Yet to fulfill their rock and roll destiny, the stakes are higher than ever for the now middle-aged Bill and Ted who set out on a new adventure when a visitor from the future warns them that only their song can save life as we know it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4V2nTPfeB59TcqJcUfQ9ziTi7VN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501979'),
  ('749744268951675084', 'Bill & Ted''s Bogus Journey', 1991, 'Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Oliver Wood, Peter Hewitt, Richard Yuricich', 'Chris Matheson, Ed Solomon', 'Keanu Reeves, Alex Winter, William Sadler, Joss Ackland, Pam Grier, George Carlin, Amy Stoch, Jim Martin', 'PG', 'Amiable slackers Bill and Ted are once again roped into a fantastical adventure when De Nomolos, a villain from the future, sends evil robot duplicates of the two lads to terminate and replace them. The robot doubles actually succeed in killing Bill and Ted, but the two are determined to escape the afterlife, challenging the Grim Reaper to a series of games in order to return to the land of the living.', 'Amiable slackers Bill and Ted are once again roped into a fantastical adventure when De Nomolos, a villain from the future, sends evil robot duplicates of the two lads to terminate and replace them. The robot doubles actually succeed in killing Bill and Ted, but the two are determined to escape the afterlife, challenging the Grim Reaper to a series of games in order to return to the land of the living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tldtDfLnPFOtTWp758EmIP2Hbz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1649'),
  ('1144226057425698376', 'Bill & Ted''s Excellent Adventure', 1989, 'Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Stephen Herek, Tim Suhrstedt, Glen Sanford', 'Ed Solomon, Chris Matheson', 'Keanu Reeves, Alex Winter, George Carlin, Terry Camilleri, Dan Shor, Tony Steedman, Rod Loomis, Al Leong', 'PG', 'Bill and Ted are high school buddies starting a band. They are also about to fail their history class—which means Ted would be sent to military school—but receive help from Rufus, a traveller from a future where their band is the foundation for a perfect society. With the use of Rufus'' time machine, Bill and Ted travel to various points in history, returning with important figures to help them complete their final history presentation.', 'Bill and Ted are high school buddies starting a band. They are also about to fail their history class—which means Ted would be sent to military school—but receive help from Rufus, a traveller from a future where their band is the foundation for a perfect society. With the use of Rufus'' time machine, Bill and Ted travel to various points in history, returning with important figures to help them complete their final history presentation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tV25lGWGWGEqUe3U0xjQTBgilSx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1648'),
  ('186734266885654655', 'Bill and Coo', 1948, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Dean Riesner, Donald Verk, Jack A. Marta', 'Dean Riesner, Royal Foster', 'George Burton, Elizabeth Walters, Ken Murray, Pinto Colvig', null, 'The feathered residents of Chirpendale are terrorized by an evil black crow by the name of "The Black Menace". But to the citizen''s rescue comes a brave young taxi puller named Bill! In other words, every single role in this film is played by birds. Actual birds.', 'The feathered residents of Chirpendale are terrorized by an evil black crow by the name of "The Black Menace". But to the citizen''s rescue comes a brave young taxi puller named Bill! In other words, every single role in this film is played by birds. Actual birds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgwc4jYyS4TWwfYMweSA2pAb2hM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126805'),
  ('830135551626635229', 'Bill Bailey: Cosmic Jam', 1997, 'Comedy', 'John Kaye Cooper', 'Bill Bailey', 'Bill Bailey', 'PG-13', 'One night from his 1996 Cosmic Jam tour at the Bloomsbury in London in which Bill explains the seminal influence of cockney knees-up music upon classical composers through the ages and takes a shot at Bryan Adams.', 'One night from his 1996 Cosmic Jam tour at the Bloomsbury in London in which Bill explains the seminal influence of cockney knees-up music upon classical composers through the ages and takes a shot at Bryan Adams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IuVvOETSYT37PEKK9Uy0ZKcDoe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29581'),
  ('48683735723293581', 'Bill Burr Presents: Friends Who Kill', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Ryan Polito', null, 'Bill Burr, Michelle Wolf, Jimmy Carr, Steph Tolev, Jeff Ross, Dave Attell, Ian Edwards, Jessica Kirson', null, 'In a night of killer comedy, Bill Burr hosts a showcase of his most raucous stand-up comic pals as they riff on everything from COVID to Michael Jackson.', 'In a night of killer comedy, Bill Burr hosts a showcase of his most raucous stand-up comic pals as they riff on everything from COVID to Michael Jackson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gSpgNwjP3Qg8LAsrBgo1Fu6QdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983683'),
  ('1016590201962000128', 'Bill Burr: Drop Dead Years', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Ben Tishler, Dylan Sanford', 'Bill Burr', 'Bill Burr, Club Soda Kenny', 'R', 'In what might be his most personal and introspective hour yet, Bill offers hilarious takes on everything from male sadness to dating advice.', 'In what might be his most personal and introspective hour yet, Bill offers hilarious takes on everything from male sadness to dating advice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBdVi94tI9AH3oNgNtVuHc6vYu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1417677'),
  ('699223042766693393', 'Bill Burr: I''m Sorry You Feel That Way', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Jay Karas, Brian Burgoyne', 'Bill Burr', 'Bill Burr', null, 'Fresh, unflinching and devastatingly honest, Bill Burr lets loose in this feature length comedy special. Burr shares his essential tips for surviving the zombie apocalypse, exposes how rom-coms ruin great sex and explains how too many childhood hugs may be the ultimate downfall of man.', 'Fresh, unflinching and devastatingly honest, Bill Burr lets loose in this feature length comedy special. Burr shares his essential tips for surviving the zombie apocalypse, exposes how rom-coms ruin great sex and explains how too many childhood hugs may be the ultimate downfall of man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abpDJ3XyqSp0sQdG7SIAItjBHb1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308571'),
  ('14445033911275211', 'Bill Burr: Let It Go', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Shannon Hartman', 'Bill Burr', 'Bill Burr', null, 'It’s always been a dream of mine to do a show at the Fillmore. The name itself is synonymous with legendary performances. Countless iconic musicians and comedians have been on that stage. To be a part of that history was something I’ll never forget. As much as I was trying to keep my head together before the show, I couldn’t help but feel like a tourist or just some random dude who won a contest. LET IT GO represents the culmination of material I developed on the road from 2008-2009. As always thanks to everyone who came out to my shows, laughed at the funny stuff and stared during the bombing. I hope you enjoy it. – Bill Burr', 'It’s always been a dream of mine to do a show at the Fillmore. The name itself is synonymous with legendary performances. Countless iconic musicians and comedians have been on that stage. To be a part of that history was something I’ll never forget. As much as I was trying to keep my head together before the show, I couldn’t help but feel like a tourist or just some random dude who won a contest. LET IT GO represents the culmination of material I developed on the road from 2008-2009. As always thanks to everyone who came out to my shows, laughed at the funny stuff and stared during the bombing. I hope you enjoy it. – Bill Burr', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DKunkJiOxInOXZsk22bULt1428.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46967'),
  ('989729918743395270', 'Bill Burr: Live at Red Rocks', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Mike Binder', 'Bill Burr', 'Bill Burr', null, 'Comedian Bill Burr sounds off on cancel culture, feminism, getting bad reviews from his wife and a life-changing epiphany during a fiery stand-up set.', 'Comedian Bill Burr sounds off on cancel culture, feminism, getting bad reviews from his wife and a life-changing epiphany during a fiery stand-up set.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3VmDVhgVq8c9lWNkMzsSeJIdgA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:991115'),
  ('262324856355900527', 'Bill Burr: Paper Tiger', 2019, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Nat Hill, Mike Binder', 'Bill Burr', 'Bill Burr', null, 'Comedian Bill Burr talks male feminists, outrage culture, robot sex, and cultural appropriation in this standup comedy special shot in London.', 'Comedian Bill Burr talks male feminists, outrage culture, robot sex, and cultural appropriation in this standup comedy special shot in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zho1ypBSxia3bHCSeB4Znpzh7nM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625128'),
  ('733621295262693098', 'Bill Burr: Walk Your Way Out', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Jay Karas, Brian Burgoyne', 'Bill Burr', 'Bill Burr', null, 'No-nonsense comic Bill Burr takes the stage in Nashville and riffs on fast food, overpopulation, dictators and gorilla sign language.', 'No-nonsense comic Bill Burr takes the stage in Nashville and riffs on fast food, overpopulation, dictators and gorilla sign language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQpJbMzfmzwb14MiUVC991LEyTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437752'),
  ('670260200784924695', 'Bill Burr: Why Do I Do This?', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Shannon Hartman', 'Bill Burr', 'Bill Burr', null, 'One of America''s fastest-rising comedians, Bill Burr wields his razor-sharp wit with rare skill. In this brand-new stand-up performance, Bill takes aim at the stuff that drives us crazy, political correctness gone haywire, and girlfriends, or as he calls them: relentless psycho robots. A keenly observant social commentator, Bill Burr is also one of the funniest voices in comedy today.', 'One of America''s fastest-rising comedians, Bill Burr wields his razor-sharp wit with rare skill. In this brand-new stand-up performance, Bill takes aim at the stuff that drives us crazy, political correctness gone haywire, and girlfriends, or as he calls them: relentless psycho robots. A keenly observant social commentator, Bill Burr is also one of the funniest voices in comedy today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKycji2aWSOS8at0W4VIEm2cmec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32836'),
  ('891323845405749162', 'Bill Burr: You People Are All The Same', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jay Karas', 'Bill Burr', 'Bill Burr', 'R', 'Taking the stage in Washington, D.C., funnyman Bill Burr brings his stinging brand of humor to the spotlight, uncorking a profanity-laced, incisive routine that pokes fun at plastic surgery, reality TV, gold diggers and more.', 'Taking the stage in Washington, D.C., funnyman Bill Burr brings his stinging brand of humor to the spotlight, uncorking a profanity-laced, incisive routine that pokes fun at plastic surgery, reality TV, gold diggers and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bjakdfXXzQ1M82vpqyQXH85lz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191489'),
  ('967307249655684939', 'Bill Cosby: 49', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Camille O. Cosby, David Lewis', 'Bill Cosby', 'Bill Cosby', null, 'In this concert film, Bill Cosby muses on his nearing the big 5-0 and how that age affects men, their wives, and their children.', 'In this concert film, Bill Cosby muses on his nearing the big 5-0 and how that age affects men, their wives, and their children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idISPEWCe5bDWh81EqlNh4HboyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74593'),
  ('39030059121198905', 'Bill Cosby: Himself', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Bill Cosby, David Shepherd, Matt Tundo', 'Bill Cosby', 'Bill Cosby', 'PG', 'A 1983 stand-up comedy film featuring the comedy of Bill Cosby. Filmed before a live audience at the Hamilton Place Theatre, in Hamilton, Ontario. Cosby gives his comedic views on people who drink too much and take drugs, going to the dentist, marriage and parenthood.', 'A 1983 stand-up comedy film featuring the comedy of Bill Cosby. Filmed before a live audience at the Hamilton Place Theatre, in Hamilton, Ontario. Cosby gives his comedic views on people who drink too much and take drugs, going to the dentist, marriage and parenthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t685Vbw4q2PxgnrlBFpgZO607D0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20120'),
  ('1000913462727238053', 'Bill Cunningham New York', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Richard Press', null, 'Bill Cunningham, Tom Wolfe, Anna Wintour, Carmen Dell''Orefice, Iris Apfel', 'NR', 'Doubling as a cartography of the ever-changing city, Bill Cunningham New York portrays the secluded pioneer of street fashion with grace and heart.', 'Doubling as a cartography of the ever-changing city, Bill Cunningham New York portrays the secluded pioneer of street fashion with grace and heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ex1m4lIAcdxJLBojN90fD3HoxlU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55244'),
  ('578562010078083717', 'Bill Evans Trio: The Oslo Concerts', 2007, 'Music', null, null, null, null, 'Two concerts from the late Bill Evans and his trio are captured on THE OSLO CONCERTS. Evans released more than 50 albums, and his piano playing lit up the jazz world and garnered an impressive following.', 'Two concerts from the late Bill Evans and his trio are captured on THE OSLO CONCERTS. Evans released more than 50 albums, and his piano playing lit up the jazz world and garnered an impressive following.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbb47IqKRWHIucyCOwlfmiTLnwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271236'),
  ('308363348822249239', 'Bill Hicks: It''s Just a Ride', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Rupert Edwards', null, 'Bill Hicks, Jay Leno, David Letterman, Sean Hughes, Eric Bogosian, Eddie Izzard', null, 'Short documentary / tribute to the late, truly great American stand-up comedian Bill Hicks, included as an extra in several box sets. Bill Hicks passed away in 1994, taken tragically young aged only 32. His legend and reputation, however, continue to grow. "It''s Just a Ride" is a celebration of his life and work, featuring numerous clips of Bill''s many recorded stand-up performances, along with trbutes from Sean Hughes, Eric Bogosian, David Letterman and Eddie Izzard, amongst others.', 'Short documentary / tribute to the late, truly great American stand-up comedian Bill Hicks, included as an extra in several box sets. Bill Hicks passed away in 1994, taken tragically young aged only 32. His legend and reputation, however, continue to grow. "It''s Just a Ride" is a celebration of his life and work, featuring numerous clips of Bill''s many recorded stand-up performances, along with trbutes from Sean Hughes, Eric Bogosian, David Letterman and Eddie Izzard, amongst others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rGNrqYp13zK4No5resmtlmQasn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174020'),
  ('109386547959926406', 'Bill Hicks: Relentless', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Chris St. John Smith, Chris Bould, Debra d''Entremont', 'Bill Hicks', 'Bill Hicks', null, 'Bill Hicks tells us how he feels about non-smokers, blow-jobs, religion, war and peace, and drugs and music.', 'Bill Hicks tells us how he feels about non-smokers, blow-jobs, religion, war and peace, and drugs and music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32lUxq4tk5M8FJPRgxPHTwFmbgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34505'),
  ('77297320721754031', 'Bill Hicks: Revelations', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Chris Bould', 'Bill Hicks', 'Bill Hicks', 'NR', 'Bill Hicks in the height of his genius. Recorded at the Dominion Theatre in London, Hicks opens our eyes and minds to the hypocrisy and ludicrousness of the world around us.', 'Bill Hicks in the height of his genius. Recorded at the Dominion Theatre in London, Hicks opens our eyes and minds to the hypocrisy and ludicrousness of the world around us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xcuMgFbvWZBoTKS46Xbo5kOMj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25117'),
  ('817376383871397071', 'Bill Hicks: Sane Man', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Kevin Booth, David Johndrow', 'Bill Hicks', 'Bill Hicks', 'R', 'Sane Man was filmed before Bill recorded ‘Dangerous’, his first comedy album, and is a turning point in Hicks’ career. It was the first complete Hicks show ever filmed and Bill pulled out all the stops for the cameras. Completely focused, a newly-sober Hicks paces the stage like a wild animal riffing effortless.', 'Sane Man was filmed before Bill recorded ‘Dangerous’, his first comedy album, and is a turning point in Hicks’ career. It was the first complete Hicks show ever filmed and Bill pulled out all the stops for the cameras. Completely focused, a newly-sober Hicks paces the stage like a wild animal riffing effortless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gN9RtL9u9mHjNH4IA2NH6ocdeyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14733'),
  ('519311068787985955', 'Bill of Hare', 1962, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'The Tasmanian Devil finds Bugs cooking dinner underneath a beach boardwalk.', 'The Tasmanian Devil finds Bugs cooking dinner underneath a beach boardwalk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKfw3pjDLSYiKGPFZaAMUP3pWfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83744'),
  ('275782142424026704', 'Billa', 1980, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'G. R. Nathan, R Krishnamurthy', null, 'Rajinikanth, Sripriya, K. Balaji, Major Sundarrajan, R. S. Manohar, Thengai Srinivasan, S. A. Asokan, A. V. M. Rajan', null, 'Billa, a powerful outlaw with a long list of enemies, kills Rajesh, a member of his gang, after he quits the criminal life. But Rajesh''s fiancee and his sister pledge to take revenge on Billa.', 'Billa, a powerful outlaw with a long list of enemies, kills Rajesh, a member of his gang, after he quits the criminal life. But Rajesh''s fiancee and his sister pledge to take revenge on Billa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjEGhN4w6pnsi2z4mgmMvdMYyub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271825'),
  ('862799283117262190', 'Billa', 2007, 'Action, Thriller', 'Vishnu Varadhan, Nirav Shah, S. Gopala Reddy', 'Vishnu Varadhan', 'Ajith Kumar, Prabhu, Nayanthara, Rahman, Santhanam, Adithya Menon, Vimalraj Ganesan, Yog Jappie', null, 'The intertwined stories of an international Don in Malaysia, David Billa, chased by the cops, an Indian police officer, a woman who wants to avenge the death of her brother, and a lowly thief, Velu who shares with Billa, an unusual connection.', 'The intertwined stories of an international Don in Malaysia, David Billa, chased by the cops, an Indian police officer, a woman who wants to avenge the death of her brother, and a lowly thief, Velu who shares with Billa, an unusual connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpvEmE3xsb1N3AmLotORbZwrdOR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23767'),
  ('241035104368052667', 'Billboard Dad', 1998, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Alan Metter, Mauro Fiore', 'Maria Jacquemetton', 'Mary-Kate Olsen, Ashley Olsen, Tom Amandes, Jessica Tuck, Carl Banks, Ellen Ratner, Sam Saletta, Rafael Rojas III', null, 'High above Hollywood Mary-Kate and Ashley Olsen are playing Matchmakers! One''s a surfer. The other''s a high diver. When these two sisters team up to find a new love for their newly single Dad, it''s a fun-loving, eye-catching California adventure gone wild. Mary-Kate and Ashley star in this fabulously funny love-struck comedy filled with crazy schemes and cool surprises. Determined to find their Dad, Max, a new love, the girls paint a personal ad on a giant billboard in the heart of Hollywood. After a few disastrous dates, Max finally meets Brooke and it''s love at first sight. There''s just one hitch, her unruly skateboarding son is the girls'' arch rival. Now, with the girls plotting every action-packed step of the way, they''ve got to find out if love really does conquer all. Full of outrageous events, mixed-up matches and lots of laughs, Billboard Dad tops the charts as Mary-Kate and Ashley''s coolest mischief-making adventure ever!', 'High above Hollywood Mary-Kate and Ashley Olsen are playing Matchmakers! One''s a surfer. The other''s a high diver. When these two sisters team up to find a new love for their newly single Dad, it''s a fun-loving, eye-catching California adventure gone wild. Mary-Kate and Ashley star in this fabulously funny love-struck comedy filled with crazy schemes and cool surprises. Determined to find their Dad, Max, a new love, the girls paint a personal ad on a giant billboard in the heart of Hollywood. After a few disastrous dates, Max finally meets Brooke and it''s love at first sight. There''s just one hitch, her unruly skateboarding son is the girls'' arch rival. Now, with the girls plotting every action-packed step of the way, they''ve got to find out if love really does conquer all. Full of outrageous events, mixed-up matches and lots of laughs, Billboard Dad tops the charts as Mary-Kate and Ashley''s coolest mischief-making adventure ever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7q7FmI2LDSESQ71ORdKTwulauN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56195'),
  ('558253408683995856', 'Billboard Frolics', 1935, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Cliff Nazarro', null, 'Billboards come to life. Eddie Camphor and his "wioleen" player Rub-Him-Off do a song and dance to "Merrily We Roll Along" with new lyrics...', 'Billboards come to life. Eddie Camphor and his "wioleen" player Rub-Him-Off do a song and dance to "Merrily We Roll Along" with new lyrics...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEzyur4fIUMWf6LWLb4qv2g0B7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184604'),
  ('351241706773967966', 'Billi Pig', 2012, 'Comedy', 'José Eduardo Belmonte, André Lavenère, Kity Féo', 'Ronaldo Guedes, Luis Carlos Pacca', 'Selton Mello, Grazi Massafera, Milton Gonçalves, Otávio Müller, Murilo Grossi, Tadeu Mello, Simônia Queiroz, Aimee Espinosa', null, 'The aspiring actress Marivalda, her husband Wanderley, a bankrupt insurance broker and a false priest do their best to get along in life. But they end up in the hands of a drug boss, whose daughter they promised to save the life of, hit in a shooting at a party in São Cristóvão. A huge cash reward is at stake and now all three have to chase the promised miracle.', 'The aspiring actress Marivalda, her husband Wanderley, a bankrupt insurance broker and a false priest do their best to get along in life. But they end up in the hands of a drug boss, whose daughter they promised to save the life of, hit in a shooting at a party in São Cristóvão. A huge cash reward is at stake and now all three have to chase the promised miracle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5jvzRBl3c8jDgzmd3vsq9HeMgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113465'),
  ('356597228742096905', 'Billie', 1965, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Don Weis', 'Ronald Alexander', 'Patty Duke, Jim Backus, Jane Greer, Warren Berlinger, Billy De Wolfe, Charles Lane, Dick Sargent, Ted Bessell', null, 'A 16-year-old tomboy and high school athlete becomes embroiled with the lives around her boyfriend whose conservative father is running for mayor.', 'A 16-year-old tomboy and high school athlete becomes embroiled with the lives around her boyfriend whose conservative father is running for mayor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8GGBVUBfgsIeyAy2csH3ckgQcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57621'),
  ('546418126528097413', 'Billie', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Tim Cragg, James Erskine', 'James Erskine', 'Billie Holiday, Tony Bennett, Count Basie, Charles Mingus', null, '‘Lady Day’ was one of the greatest jazz vocalists the world ever heard. In 1971, journalist Linda Lipnack Kuehl set out to write the definitive biography of Billie Holiday. Before her mysterious death in 1978, Lipnack Kuehl had taped over 200 hours of interviews. The tapes have never been heard. Now they form the basis of an atmospheric, multi-layered documentary that captures the many complex facets of a proud black woman, violent drug addict, loyal friend, vindictive lover and unforgettable singer of ‘God Bless The Child’, ‘Saddest Tale’ and the haunting ‘Strange Fruit’.', '‘Lady Day’ was one of the greatest jazz vocalists the world ever heard. In 1971, journalist Linda Lipnack Kuehl set out to write the definitive biography of Billie Holiday. Before her mysterious death in 1978, Lipnack Kuehl had taped over 200 hours of interviews. The tapes have never been heard. Now they form the basis of an atmospheric, multi-layered documentary that captures the many complex facets of a proud black woman, violent drug addict, loyal friend, vindictive lover and unforgettable singer of ‘God Bless The Child’, ‘Saddest Tale’ and the haunting ‘Strange Fruit’.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypIq3W5OQjZjBGJQk9l4cHjR6Lu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649137'),
  ('200648888033529136', 'Billie Eilish: Hit Me Hard and Soft - The Tour Live in 3D', 2026, 'Music, Documentary, Musical', 'Billie Eilish, James Cameron', null, 'FINNEAS, Maggie Baird, Billie Eilish, James Cameron', null, 'An accompanying 3D concert film, documenting the Manchester shows and co-directed by Eilish and James Cameron.', 'An accompanying 3D concert film, documenting the Manchester shows and co-directed by Eilish and James Cameron.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fm9JQjDufp397fjWD0fh9LdbYhMg.jpg', 'plex:movie:billie-eilish-hit-me-hard-and-soft-the-tour-live-in-3d'),
  ('628875573227804574', 'Billie Eilish: The World''s a Little Blurry', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jenna Rosher, R. J. Cutler', 'R. J. Cutler', 'Billie Eilish, FINNEAS, Maggie Baird, Patrick O''Connell, Claudia Sulewski, Zoe Donahoe, Brandon ''Q'' Adams, Carlos López Estrada', 'R', 'This documentary offers a deeply intimate look at extraordinary teenager Billie Eilish. Award-winning filmmaker R.J. Cutler follows her journey on the road, onstage, and at home with her family as the writing and recording of her debut album changes her life.', 'This documentary offers a deeply intimate look at extraordinary teenager Billie Eilish. Award-winning filmmaker R.J. Cutler follows her journey on the road, onstage, and at home with her family as the writing and recording of her debut album changes her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDQ95W5LPHW9FHlPj3QX3jvM9Z7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654754'),
  ('810864391887604665', 'Billion', 2019, 'Comedy, Action', 'Roman Prygunov, Ilya Averbakh, Dmitriy Kasyan', 'Andrey Zolotarev', 'Vladimir Mashkov, Aleksandra Bortich, Gela Meskhi, Pavel Chinaryov, Marina Petrenko, Mariya Mironova, Daniil Spivakovskiy, Grigory Kalinin', null, 'An influential banker is doing everything possible not to share the property with his illegitimate sons. But when he is deprived of all the money, it turns out that only they can help Matthew ... To regain his fortune, the billionaire will be forced to rob his own bank in Monte Carlo. And for this, he will have to perform an even more difficult task: regain the trust of children who grew up without a father ...', 'An influential banker is doing everything possible not to share the property with his illegitimate sons. But when he is deprived of all the money, it turns out that only they can help Matthew ... To regain his fortune, the billionaire will be forced to rob his own bank in Monte Carlo. And for this, he will have to perform an even more difficult task: regain the trust of children who grew up without a father ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ve4TipFEBcBuFxX9IXwlnsklMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567801'),
  ('139483562729868603', 'Billion Dollar Brain', 1967, 'Thriller', 'Ken Russell, Billy Williams, Teddy Mason', 'John McGrath', 'Michael Caine, Karl Malden, Ed Begley, Oskar Homolka, Françoise Dorléac, Guy Doleman, Vladek Sheybal, Milo Sperber', null, 'A former British spy stumbles into in a plot to overthrow Communism with the help of a supercomputer. But who is working for whom?', 'A former British spy stumbles into in a plot to overthrow Communism with the help of a supercomputer. But who is working for whom?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3wANX6hEsSDTSsiczmkoweh9bZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4889'),
  ('322949620330835290', 'Billion Dollar Heist', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Michael Timney, Daniel Gordon', 'Matthew Metcalfe, Tom Blackwell, Whetham Allpress', 'Eric Chien, Mikko Hyppönen, Keith Mularski, Misha Glenny', 'NR', 'Global, dynamic, and eye-opening, this is story of the most daring cyber heist of all time, the Bangladeshi Central Bank theft, tracing the origins of cyber-crime from basic credit card fraud to the wildly complex criminal organisations in existence today, supported by commentary and fascinating insight from highly regarded cyber security experts.', 'Global, dynamic, and eye-opening, this is story of the most daring cyber heist of all time, the Bangladeshi Central Bank theft, tracing the origins of cyber-crime from basic credit card fraud to the wildly complex criminal organisations in existence today, supported by commentary and fascinating insight from highly regarded cyber security experts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QGQWVvIRwP1tLaSzQoRUZVp7HA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1147203'),
  ('60909319438749221', 'Billion Dollar Limited', 1942, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Dave Fleischer', 'Seymour Kneitel, Izzy Sparber', 'Bud Collyer, Joan Alexander, Julian Noa, Jackson Beck', null, 'Robbers target a special train carrying a billion dollars worth of gold, and the only one who can stop them is Superman!', 'Robbers target a special train carrying a billion dollars worth of gold, and the only one who can stop them is Superman!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fVcAw27D1ALr3zBIkQTnJH949H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145931'),
  ('628938825850019168', 'Billionaire', 1986, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Ertunç Şenkay, Kartal Tibet', 'Ümit Ünal', 'Şener Şen, Adile Naşit, Münir Özkul, Tuluğ Çizgen, Müge Akyamaç, Uğur Yücel, Ergun Köknar, Tayfun Çorağan', null, 'A civil servant in a small town, shunned by his family and his friends due to his lack of ambition, hits the jackpot in the national lottery. Not trusting anybody around him, he gradually starts to lose his mind.', 'A civil servant in a small town, shunned by his family and his friends due to his lack of ambition, hits the jackpot in the national lottery. Not trusting anybody around him, he gradually starts to lose his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTn1uAiXWTlqkkc4oU8jc36v9rL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219998'),
  ('1152173539563266349', 'Billionaire Boys Club', 1987, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Isidore Mankofsky, Marvin J. Chomsky', 'Gy Waldron', 'Judd Nelson, Fredric Lehne, Brian McNamara, Raphael Sbarge, John Stockwell, Barry Tubb, Stan Shaw, Ron Silver', null, 'The Billionaire Boys Club is based on the true story of Joe Hunt (Nelson), a shady investor who built an empire on B.S. back in the early ''80s. Known as the BBC, the story involves a couple of guys recruited into Hunt''s company on the promise of making millions. However, every time Hunt''s lapdogs think his boss has used his cleverness to make them filthy rich, they instead find themselves with financial losses. Trying to recoup a mounting pile of debt made from giant b.s. deals, the ruthless Hunt involves select members of the BBC to aid in the worst of crimes to get what they want. But a few, scared of how far Hunt will go, try to stop Hunt''s brutal reign of terror possibly before real damage begins.', 'The Billionaire Boys Club is based on the true story of Joe Hunt (Nelson), a shady investor who built an empire on B.S. back in the early ''80s. Known as the BBC, the story involves a couple of guys recruited into Hunt''s company on the promise of making millions. However, every time Hunt''s lapdogs think his boss has used his cleverness to make them filthy rich, they instead find themselves with financial losses. Trying to recoup a mounting pile of debt made from giant b.s. deals, the ruthless Hunt involves select members of the BBC to aid in the worst of crimes to get what they want. But a few, scared of how far Hunt will go, try to stop Hunt''s brutal reign of terror possibly before real damage begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTN3sQmDo4JzSo7H8d16ySKDp6t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57566'),
  ('614610588768649635', 'Billionaire Boys Club', 2018, 'Drama', 'James Cox, J. Michael Muro, Urs Hirschbiegel', 'Captain Mauzner, James Cox', 'Ansel Elgort, Kevin Spacey, Taron Egerton, Emma Roberts, Jeremy Irvine, Thomas Cocquerel, Rosanna Arquette, Cary Elwes', 'R', 'A group of wealthy boys in Los Angeles during the early 1980s establishes a get rich quick scam that turns deadly.', 'A group of wealthy boys in Los Angeles during the early 1980s establishes a get rich quick scam that turns deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EpC1etIcUQxqPnBz0CpHLp3evv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385360'),
  ('340289685768818480', 'Billposters', 1940, 'Animation', 'Clyde Geronimi', null, 'Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Donald and Goofy are putting up advertising posters in a farm. Goofy prepares to post on a windmill, but his tools keep disappearing and reappearing on the windmill blades. Donald puts up his posters, a picture of a soup can, and a goat eats them immediately. Goofy gets stuck to his poster after it comes around on the windmill. Donald, being his calm, even-tempered self, gets into a battle with the goat.', 'Donald and Goofy are putting up advertising posters in a farm. Goofy prepares to post on a windmill, but his tools keep disappearing and reappearing on the windmill blades. Donald puts up his posters, a picture of a soup can, and a goat eats them immediately. Goofy gets stuck to his poster after it comes around on the windmill. Donald, being his calm, even-tempered self, gets into a battle with the goat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dstF7aWftUFYGwjAoLH9rksNHNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53462'),
  ('660856882245183238', 'Billu', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Priyadarshan, Twisha Pal, Abilash Nair', 'Manisha Korde, Mushtaq Sheikh, Priyadarshan', 'Irrfan Khan, Shah Rukh Khan, Lara Dutta, Om Puri, Rajpal Yadav, Mitali Mayekar, Pratik Dalvi, Manoj Joshi', 'PG', 'When a famous Bollywood actor visits a small village for a film''s shoot, a poor hairdresser''s claim that they were once childhood friends soon makes him the centre of attention.', 'When a famous Bollywood actor visits a small village for a film''s shoot, a poor hairdresser''s claim that they were once childhood friends soon makes him the centre of attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmWKskigmvBow3uOP4RPQOIaUux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16345'),
  ('20591204553383154', 'Billy & Mandy: Wrath of the Spider Queen', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror, Fantasy, TV Movie, Adventure', 'Matt Engstrom, Gordon Kent, Kris Sherwood', 'Maxwell Atoms', 'Greg Eagles, Richard Steven Horvitz, Grey DeLisle, Vanessa Marshall, Kari Wahlgren, Maxwell Atoms, Dee Bradley Baker, Jennifer Hale', null, 'The Spider Queen wants to take revenge on Grim for denying her the rightful place as the Ripper.', 'The Spider Queen wants to take revenge on Grim for denying her the rightful place as the Ripper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mVLQJMdqBkAeJXNIbaVIdBtOdf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463708'),
  ('716857177527641575', 'Billy & Mandy''s Big Boogey Adventure', 2007, 'Adventure, Comedy, Animation, TV Movie, Fantasy, Family', 'Robert Alvarez, Russell Calabrese, Shaun Cashman', 'Maxwell Atoms, Nina G. Bargiel, Jeremy J. Bargiel', 'Richard Steven Horvitz, Grey DeLisle, Greg Eagles, Vanessa Marshall, Maxwell Atoms, George Ball, Jane Carr, Greg Ellis', null, 'When the Boogey Man causes Grim to lose his powers, rank, and title in the Underworld Court for misusing his powers, he plots to seek out Horror''s Hand and take over the world. It''s up to Billy, Mandy, Irwin, and Grim to get to Horror''s Hand before the Boogey Man does.', 'When the Boogey Man causes Grim to lose his powers, rank, and title in the Underworld Court for misusing his powers, he plots to seek out Horror''s Hand and take over the world. It''s up to Billy, Mandy, Irwin, and Grim to get to Horror''s Hand before the Boogey Man does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMWGHdVUrGQwo1SQ4JdDUv556L8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17305'),
  ('1056446611920208715', 'Billy & Molly: An Otter Love Story', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Charlie Hamilton James, Jane Hamlin, Claire Sharrock', 'Charlie Hamilton James', 'Billy Mail, Susan Mail', 'G', 'A man forms an unlikely friendship with a wild otter while living in the remote Shetland Islands.', 'A man forms an unlikely friendship with a wild otter while living in the remote Shetland Islands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksvg5VoDKcGBFt3Q2aLT2wOMKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242387'),
  ('656223726990804455', 'Billy and Buddy', 2013, 'Comedy, Family', 'Alexandre Charlot, Franck Magnier', 'Franck Magnier, Alexandre Charlot', 'Franck Dubosc, Marina Foïs, Charles Crombez, Nicolas Vaude, Jean-Jacques Domingues, Géraud Thomas, Alain Cerrer, Lionel Abelanski', null, 'Buddy is an abandoned young cocker spaniel waiting dejectedly in his cage for a kind, new owner to adopt him. Suddenly, Billy, a little boy whose hair is as red as Buddy''s, appears. It''s love at first sight and the beginning of a great friendship. But for Billy''s parents, this is where the trouble begins.', 'Buddy is an abandoned young cocker spaniel waiting dejectedly in his cage for a kind, new owner to adopt him. Suddenly, Billy, a little boy whose hair is as red as Buddy''s, appears. It''s love at first sight and the beginning of a great friendship. But for Billy''s parents, this is where the trouble begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBDw96kEEPgbfAjGpALsefLsjiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168615'),
  ('1152311437329910359', 'Billy Bathgate', 1991, 'Crime', 'Robert Benton, Néstor Almendros, Tim Donahue', 'Tom Stoppard', 'Loren Dean, Dustin Hoffman, Nicole Kidman, Bruce Willis, Steve Buscemi, Stanley Tucci, Steven Hill, Billy Jaye', 'R', 'In the year 1935, a teen named Billy Bathgate finds first love while becoming the protégé of fledgling gangster Dutch Schultz.', 'In the year 1935, a teen named Billy Bathgate finds first love while becoming the protégé of fledgling gangster Dutch Schultz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDC0bY6IvGIf1SrDipLZJxR0Z2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12647'),
  ('878461627288170340', 'Billy Boy', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Daws Butler', null, 'A deep south farmer is initially delighted to get a baby goat, but this soon turns to apprehension when he discovers that it eats literally anything (including, at one point, the animation artwork).', 'A deep south farmer is initially delighted to get a baby goat, but this soon turns to apprehension when he discovers that it eats literally anything (including, at one point, the animation artwork).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceMqRygeJIVSWlvVOTdHLWbVc3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84668'),
  ('616228272633861085', 'Billy Budd', 1962, 'Drama, Action', 'Peter Ustinov, Robert Krasker', 'Peter Ustinov, DeWitt Bodeen', 'Terence Stamp, Robert Ryan, Peter Ustinov, Melvyn Douglas, Paul Rogers, John Neville, David McCallum, Ronald Lewis', null, 'Billy is an innocent, naive seaman in the British Navy in 1797. When the ship''s sadistic master-at-arms is murdered, Billy is accused and tried.', 'Billy is an innocent, naive seaman in the British Navy in 1797. When the ship''s sadistic master-at-arms is murdered, Billy is accused and tried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdhGhduqT85qIbSgxD9VP6JvJlH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5334'),
  ('585799074204980235', 'Billy Elliot', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Brian Tufano, Stephen Daldry, Finn McGrath', 'Lee Hall', 'Jamie Bell, Gary Lewis, Julie Walters, Jean Heywood, Jamie Draven, Stuart Wells, Mike Elliot, Billy Fane', 'R', 'County Durham, England, 1984. The miners'' strike has started and the police have started coming up from Bethnal Green, starting a class war with the lower classes suffering. Caught in the middle of the conflict is 11-year old Billy Elliot, who, after leaving his boxing club for the day, stumbles upon a ballet class and finds out that he''s naturally talented. He practices with his teacher Mrs. Wilkinson for an upcoming audition in Newcastle-upon Tyne for the royal Ballet school in London.', 'County Durham, England, 1984. The miners'' strike has started and the police have started coming up from Bethnal Green, starting a class war with the lower classes suffering. Caught in the middle of the conflict is 11-year old Billy Elliot, who, after leaving his boxing club for the day, stumbles upon a ballet class and finds out that he''s naturally talented. He practices with his teacher Mrs. Wilkinson for an upcoming audition in Newcastle-upon Tyne for the royal Ballet school in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYtqgWCJiXpDeZwjVcC3OQGD8IR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71'),
  ('462934278410189599', 'Billy Jack', 1971, 'Action', 'Tom Laughlin, Fred J. Koenekamp, John M. Stephens', 'Delores Taylor, Tom Laughlin', 'Tom Laughlin, Delores Taylor, Clark Howat, Victor Izay, Julie Webb, Debbie Schock, Teresa Kelly, Lynn Baker', 'PG', 'Ex-Green Beret hapkido expert saves wild horses from being slaughtered for dog food and helps protect a desert "freedom school" for runaways.', 'Ex-Green Beret hapkido expert saves wild horses from being slaughtered for dog food and helps protect a desert "freedom school" for runaways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVE2YKxiHMHTxA5yPZPzsChc37H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21142'),
  ('38390781098675491', 'Billy Jack Goes to Washington', 1977, 'Drama', 'Tom Laughlin, Jack A. Marta', 'Tom Laughlin, Delores Taylor', 'Tom Laughlin, Delores Taylor, E.G. Marshall, Teresa Kelly, Sam Wanamaker, Richard Gautier, Kathy Cronkite, Peter Donat', 'NR', 'After a senator suddenly dies after completing (and sealing) an investigation into the nuclear power industry, the remaining senator and the state governor must decide on a person who will play along with their shady deals and not cause any problems. They decide on Billy Jack, currently sitting in prison after being sent to jail at the end of his previous film, as they don''t expect him to be capable of much, and they think he will attract young voters to the party.', 'After a senator suddenly dies after completing (and sealing) an investigation into the nuclear power industry, the remaining senator and the state governor must decide on a person who will play along with their shady deals and not cause any problems. They decide on Billy Jack, currently sitting in prison after being sent to jail at the end of his previous film, as they don''t expect him to be capable of much, and they think he will attract young voters to the party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6wvKVuxfm2P4Tw7QUXso3tLvwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78140'),
  ('342163396513236976', 'Billy Liar', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'John Schlesinger, Denys N. Coop, Frank Ernst', 'Keith Waterhouse, Willis Hall', 'Tom Courtenay, Julie Christie, Wilfred Pickles, Mona Washbourne, Ethel Griffies, Finlay Currie, Gwendolyn Watts, Helen Fraser', null, 'A young Englishman dreams of escaping from his working class family and dead-end job as an undertaker''s assistant. A number of indiscretions cause him to lie in order to avoid the penalties. His life turns into a mess and he has an opportunity to run away and leave it all behind.', 'A young Englishman dreams of escaping from his working class family and dead-end job as an undertaker''s assistant. A number of indiscretions cause him to lie in order to avoid the penalties. His life turns into a mess and he has an opportunity to run away and leave it all behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YUzVyN3HdedaK7oGVf2nVrsf4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26535'),
  ('295729226500203951', 'Billy Lynn''s Long Halftime Walk', 2016, 'Drama, War', 'Ang Lee, John Toll, Richard Styles', 'Jean-Christophe Castelli', 'Joe Alwyn, Kristen Stewart, Chris Tucker, Garrett Hedlund, Makenzie Leigh, Vin Diesel, Steve Martin, Stro', 'R', '19-year-old Billy Lynn is brought home for a victory tour after a harrowing Iraq battle. Through flashbacks the film shows what really happened to his squad – contrasting the realities of war with America''s perceptions.', '19-year-old Billy Lynn is brought home for a victory tour after a harrowing Iraq battle. Through flashbacks the film shows what really happened to his squad – contrasting the realities of war with America''s perceptions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjuDRavgTazvs5ishEgnfZ8YhbV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293767'),
  ('657279132978735357', 'Billy Madison', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Tamra Davis, Victor Hammer, Martin Walters', 'Adam Sandler, Tim Herlihy', 'Adam Sandler, Bradley Whitford, Josh Mostel, Bridgette Wilson-Sampras, Darren McGavin, Norm Macdonald, Mark Beltzman, Larry Hankin', 'PG-13', 'Billy Madison is the 27 year-old son of Bryan Madison, a very rich man who has made his living in the hotel industry. Billy stands to inherit his father''s empire, but only if he can make it through all 12 grades, 2 weeks per grade, to prove that he has what it takes to run the family business.', 'Billy Madison is the 27 year-old son of Bryan Madison, a very rich man who has made his living in the hotel industry. Billy stands to inherit his father''s empire, but only if he can make it through all 12 grades, 2 weeks per grade, to prove that he has what it takes to run the family business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOdgtJdFalL9kRKaeJItARLTAEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11017'),
  ('907743219679948121', 'Billy Rose''s Jumbo', 1962, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Charles Walters, William H. Daniels', 'Sidney Sheldon', 'Doris Day, Stephen Boyd, Jimmy Durante, Martha Raye, Dean Jagger, Joseph Waring, Lynn Wood, Charles Watts', 'NR', 'The daughter of a circus owner fights to save her father from a takeover spearheaded by the man she loves.', 'The daughter of a circus owner fights to save her father from a takeover spearheaded by the man she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmvuW4U5zjawlCNDqbJW5fMSOtl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42991'),
  ('620357454542692224', 'Billy the Kid', 1930, 'Western', 'King Vidor, Gordon Avil', 'Harry Behn, Willard Mack, John T. Neville', 'Johnny Mack Brown, Wallace Beery, Kay Johnson, Karl Dane, Wyndham Standing, Russell Simpson, Blanche Friderici, Roscoe Ates', 'NR', 'Billy, after shooting down land baron William Donovan''s henchmen for killing Billy''s boss, is hunted down and captured by his friend, Sheriff Pat Garrett. He escapes and is on his way to Mexico when Garrett, recapturing him, must decide whether to bring him in or to let him go.', 'Billy, after shooting down land baron William Donovan''s henchmen for killing Billy''s boss, is hunted down and captured by his friend, Sheriff Pat Garrett. He escapes and is on his way to Mexico when Garrett, recapturing him, must decide whether to bring him in or to let him go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xW5EIKvrcW6OWKEO2PemgQ94U6t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183832'),
  ('314238491493325992', 'Billy the Kid', 1941, 'Drama, Western', 'David Miller, Frank Borzage, Leonard Smith', 'Gene Fowler', 'Robert Taylor, Brian Donlevy, Ian Hunter, Mary Howard, Gene Lockhart, Lon Chaney Jr., Henry O''Neill, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams', 'NR', 'Billy "The Kid" Bonney is a hot-headed gunslinger who postpones his life of crime when he is befriended and hired by peaceful cattle rancher Eric Keating. When Keating is killed by a rival, Billy seeks revenge, even if it means opposing his old friend, Marshal Jim Sherwood.', 'Billy "The Kid" Bonney is a hot-headed gunslinger who postpones his life of crime when he is befriended and hired by peaceful cattle rancher Eric Keating. When Keating is killed by a rival, Billy seeks revenge, even if it means opposing his old friend, Marshal Jim Sherwood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cySamNwhXYdqmzdQRYOOrk15iH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111470'),
  ('937383476467966260', 'Billy the Kid', 1989, 'History, Western, TV Movie', 'William A. Graham', 'Gore Vidal', 'Val Kilmer, Andrew Bicknell, Wilford Brimley, John O''Hurley, Ned Vaughn, Duncan Regehr, Patrick Massett, Julie Carmen', 'NR', 'Gore Vidal''s historical novel is brought to life in this television production of Turner Network Television''s Billy the Kid.', 'Gore Vidal''s historical novel is brought to life in this television production of Turner Network Television''s Billy the Kid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4X69ZORXruvF7QgxWawiANXLlQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291385'),
  ('666272055018726133', 'Billy the Kid and the Green Baize Vampire', 1985, 'Western, Comedy, Horror, Music, Fantasy, Drama', 'Alan Clarke, Clive Tickner', 'Trevor Preston', 'Phil Daniels, Alun Armstrong, Bruce Payne, Don Henderson, Eve Ferret, Louise Gold, Richard Ridings, Zoot Money', null, 'Cocky cockney snooker player Billy Kid accepts the challenge of a grudge match from Maxwell Randall (the Green Baize Vampire), six times world champion; the loser will never play professional snooker again.', 'Cocky cockney snooker player Billy Kid accepts the challenge of a grudge match from Maxwell Randall (the Green Baize Vampire), six times world champion; the loser will never play professional snooker again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjRi3sbEdKUp7W9Rzihn4XqoFJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172620'),
  ('1033120918045025694', 'Billy The Kid Returns', 1938, 'Action, Western, Music, Comedy', 'Joseph Kane, Ernest Miller', 'Jack Natteford', 'Roy Rogers, Lynne Roberts, Smiley Burnette, Wade Boteler, Fred Kohler, Morgan Wallace, Joseph Crehan, Edwin Stanley', 'G', 'After Pat Garrett kills Billy the Kid, Billy''s look-alike Roy Rogers arrives and is mistaken for him. Although a murderer, Billy was on the side of the homesteaders against the large ranchers. As Billy''s death is unknown, Roy gets Garrett to let him pose as Billy to continue the fight, but without the killing.', 'After Pat Garrett kills Billy the Kid, Billy''s look-alike Roy Rogers arrives and is mistaken for him. Although a murderer, Billy was on the side of the homesteaders against the large ranchers. As Billy''s death is unknown, Roy gets Garrett to let him pose as Billy to continue the fight, but without the killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wItHoVhFbwTuQg676RGS7Cx28iN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53111'),
  ('992612923639652894', 'Billy the Kid Versus Dracula', 1966, 'Horror, Western', 'William Beaudine, Max Stein, Lothrop B. Worth', 'Carl K. Hittleman', 'John Carradine, Chuck Courtney, Melinda Casey, Virginia Christine, Walter Janovitz, Olive Carey, Roy Barcroft, Hannie Landman', 'NR', 'Dracula travels to the American West, intent on making a beautiful ranch owner his next victim. Her fiance, outlaw Billy the Kid, finds out about it and rushes to save her.', 'Dracula travels to the American West, intent on making a beautiful ranch owner his next victim. Her fiance, outlaw Billy the Kid, finds out about it and rushes to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A822lbDC7VkH6ZBR5wbVYl8C6K1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56165'),
  ('149865511624273803', 'Billy Two Hats', 1974, 'Western', 'Ted Kotcheff, Brian West, Paul Ibbetson', 'Alan Sharp', 'Gregory Peck, Desi Arnaz Jr., Jack Warden, David Huddleston, Sian Barbara Allen, John Pearce, Dawn Little Sky, Vincent St. Cyr', 'PG', 'After a bank robbery, runaway Scottish outlaw Arch Deans and his young half-breed Kiowa partner Billy Two Hats develop a father-son relationship, but Sheriff Henry Gifford is determined to capture or kill them.', 'After a bank robbery, runaway Scottish outlaw Arch Deans and his young half-breed Kiowa partner Billy Two Hats develop a father-son relationship, but Sheriff Henry Gifford is determined to capture or kill them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDgbZ1JYQxrqNmv3HNLULDBysKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32143'),
  ('630458451014389127', 'Billy''s Balloon', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy, Thriller', 'Don Hertzfeldt', 'Don Hertzfeldt', null, null, 'A balloon wraps itself around a young child''s hand, bringing him higher and higher, much to the child''s delight, but a sinister truth begins to unravel.', 'A balloon wraps itself around a young child''s hand, bringing him higher and higher, much to the child''s delight, but a sinister truth begins to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxI9iOL838ywA8QFduJ5hwfg8yQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32531'),
  ('129955553480557111', 'Billy''s Hollywood Screen Kiss', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tommy O''Haver, Mark Mervis', 'Tommy O''Haver', 'Sean Hayes, Brad Rowe, Richard Ganoung, Meredith Scott Lynn, Matthew Ashford, Christopher Bradley, Armando Valdes-Kennedy, Carmine Giovinazzo', null, 'Billy Collier is a photographer working on a series of pictures featuring recreations of movie kisses, with drag queens playing the female roles. For his male model, he hires Gabriel, a young waiter on whom he has developed a serious crush. While Billy is openly gay, Gabriel says that he is straight and even claims to have a girlfriend. However, as they spend more time together and grow closer, Billy becomes increasingly unsure that this is true.', 'Billy Collier is a photographer working on a series of pictures featuring recreations of movie kisses, with drag queens playing the female roles. For his male model, he hires Gabriel, a young waiter on whom he has developed a serious crush. While Billy is openly gay, Gabriel says that he is straight and even claims to have a girlfriend. However, as they spend more time together and grow closer, Billy becomes increasingly unsure that this is true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUj3KciCFdOPnyavPzhYbbpIHv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17539'),
  ('435835768974234440', 'Bilo the Banker', 1980, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ertem Eğilmez, Ertunç Şenkay', 'Yavuz Turgul, Sadık Şendil', 'İlyas Salman, Şener Şen, Meral Zeren, Ahu Tuğba, Münir Özkul, Ali Şen, Cahit Kaşıkçılar', null, 'Bilo is a goodhearted man who wants to marry the cutest girl in the village but needs money to take the consent from her father. His best friend Mahmut offers him a way to go to Germany and work in a factory to save up the money he needs.', 'Bilo is a goodhearted man who wants to marry the cutest girl in the village but needs money to take the consent from her father. His best friend Mahmut offers him a way to go to Germany and work in a factory to save up the money he needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whShZNqudVvUBfWE58105ootjOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184979'),
  ('716193695258184540', 'Bilocation', 2013, 'Horror', 'Mari Asato, Yuta Tsukinaga, Atsushi Unno', 'Mari Asato', 'Asami Mizukawa, Kento Senga, Sho Takada, Kenichi Takitoh, Yōsuke Asari, Wakana Sakai, Kosuke Toyohara', null, 'Shinobu Takamura is an aspiring painter. One day, she is accused of using counterfeit money. Shinobu is confused by the allegation, because she never did such a thing and was at home when the crime occurred. Police Officer Kanou then appears and takes her to a place. When they get there, a group of people are already gathered. All of the people there are concerned over a doppelganger like existence that looks just like them and acts like them. They call that existence "bilocation".', 'Shinobu Takamura is an aspiring painter. One day, she is accused of using counterfeit money. Shinobu is confused by the allegation, because she never did such a thing and was at home when the crime occurred. Police Officer Kanou then appears and takes her to a place. When they get there, a group of people are already gathered. All of the people there are concerned over a doppelganger like existence that looks just like them and acts like them. They call that existence "bilocation".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1osWAUW35sUxVxpsGWZjk25uIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264216'),
  ('810253444147097462', 'Biloxi Blues', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Mike Nichols, Bill Butler, Michael Haley', 'Neil Simon', 'Matthew Broderick, Christopher Walken, Matt Mulhern, Corey Parker, Markus Flanagan, Casey Siemaszko, Michael Dolan, Penelope Ann Miller', 'PG-13', 'A Jewish teenager sets three goals: lose his virginity, become a writer, and survive World War II.', 'A Jewish teenager sets three goals: lose his virginity, become a writer, and survive World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAhQegSNb0OYwBN2KbSr8GRSUsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19382'),
  ('10185237810163528', 'Bimbo Movie Bash', 1997, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Mike Mendez, Dave Parker', 'Mike Mendez, Dave Parker', 'Ian Abercrombie, Adrienne Barbeau, Michelle Bauer, Roxanne Blaze, Sara Suzanne Brown, Troy Donahue, Joe Estevez, Morgan Fairchild', null, 'Hell hath no fury like a bimbo scorned! For decades, the blond and the beautiful have been billboarded, belittled and bad-mouthed. Now, a massive squadron of the lightheaded lovelies is about to exact the ultimate revenge on the chauvinists of the Earth. See all of your favorite femmes return to the small screen, in this cleverly crafted compilation of scenes from the most bodacious Bimbo movies of all time!', 'Hell hath no fury like a bimbo scorned! For decades, the blond and the beautiful have been billboarded, belittled and bad-mouthed. Now, a massive squadron of the lightheaded lovelies is about to exact the ultimate revenge on the chauvinists of the Earth. See all of your favorite femmes return to the small screen, in this cleverly crafted compilation of scenes from the most bodacious Bimbo movies of all time!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCJFIbaPllXv2ys2YjZDw0zkXvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28350'),
  ('777849357690560182', 'Bimbo''s Initiation', 1931, 'Comedy, Animation, Music, Horror', 'Dave Fleischer, Grim Natwick', null, 'Billy Murray, Mae Questel', null, 'Bimbo finds himself surrounded by a mysterious group of robed figures who invite him to become a member of their secret organisation. When he refuses, they fling him through a nightmarish sequence of terror and torture devices. Will our hapless hero make it out alive?', 'Bimbo finds himself surrounded by a mysterious group of robed figures who invite him to become a member of their secret organisation. When he refuses, they fling him through a nightmarish sequence of terror and torture devices. Will our hapless hero make it out alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jISoOpXnsA46uX9Bfd6qJQhYMpA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139753'),
  ('190129052151065516', 'Bimboland', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ariel Zeitoun, Thierry Jault', 'Roselyne Bosch', 'Judith Godrèche, Aure Atika, Gérard Depardieu, Dany Boon, Armelle, Sophie Forte, Amanda Lear, Laëtitia Lacroix', null, 'A shy French anthropologist who happens to be secretly in love with her college superior, chooses "bimbos" as the subject of her thesis. She becomes one of them in order to do that, and the professor she loves falls for her new identity.', 'A shy French anthropologist who happens to be secretly in love with her college superior, chooses "bimbos" as the subject of her thesis. She becomes one of them in order to do that, and the professor she loves falls for her new identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeWdfO5FlowwqUEdXqF04i8s5Ib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62009'),
  ('1090114983966694710', 'Bimmer', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Pyotr Buslov, Daniil Gurevich, Alexander Fedenev', 'Pyotr Buslov, Denis Rodimin', 'Sergey Gorobchenko, Vladimir Vdovichenkov, Andrey Merzlikin, Maksim Konovalov, Yana Shivkova, Lyudmila Polyakova, Anastasiya Sapozhnikova, Vasiliy Sedykh', null, 'A black BMW, a symbol of luxury, is racing along the night streets of Moscow in the 90s. Bad luck turns four friends into criminals and they have no way back. Only the black “bimmer” is reliable in this life without rules, taking the friends farther and farther from Moscow, into the crazy and ruthless wilderness of Russian roads… None of them wanted to kill. None of them wanted to die. But they will have to face their destiny in the end.', 'A black BMW, a symbol of luxury, is racing along the night streets of Moscow in the 90s. Bad luck turns four friends into criminals and they have no way back. Only the black “bimmer” is reliable in this life without rules, taking the friends farther and farther from Moscow, into the crazy and ruthless wilderness of Russian roads… None of them wanted to kill. None of them wanted to die. But they will have to face their destiny in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3arq1ZirWVWik79quovmb2XhO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62276'),
