  ('488458075608893016', 'Bingo', 1991, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Matthew Robbins, John McPherson', 'Jim Strain', 'Cindy Williams, David Rasche, Suzie Plakson, Jackson Davies, Robert J. Steinmiller Jr., Kurt Fuller, Stephen E. Miller, Frank C. Turner', 'PG', 'Bingo, the runaway circus dog, is off the leash and saving Chuckie''s life! Bingo and the boy become the best of friends in this canine comedy featuring doggy disguises and skateboarding, pinball and prison. Chuckie and his parents are moving house, a thousand miles away, but Bingo won''t be allowed to join them.', 'Bingo, the runaway circus dog, is off the leash and saving Chuckie''s life! Bingo and the boy become the best of friends in this canine comedy featuring doggy disguises and skateboarding, pinball and prison. Chuckie and his parents are moving house, a thousand miles away, but Bingo won''t be allowed to join them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giooyb8azHrgbwqWUWCn7QhIBBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16790'),
