  ('428129287674754383', 'Bingo Bongo', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Alfio Contini, Maria Pia Rocco', 'Enrico Oldoini, Franco Ferrini, Laura Toscano', 'Adriano Celentano, Carole Bouquet, Felice Andreasi, Enzo Robutti, Walter D''Amore, Roberto Marelli, Guido Spadea, Alfio Patané', null, 'The ape-man, found somewhere in the jungles of Congo, transferred to Milan and named Bingo Bongo. The only one who believes in the human qualities of him is Laura, a woman anthropologist , so their affection for each other even grows to love.', 'The ape-man, found somewhere in the jungles of Congo, transferred to Milan and named Bingo Bongo. The only one who believes in the human qualities of him is Laura, a woman anthropologist , so their affection for each other even grows to love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ve4VuCwi7Xas5s50ynEB7uFjM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62029'),
  ('1120359304536320738', 'Bingo Hell', 2021, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Byron Werner, Matthew Sewell, Gigi Saul Guerrero', 'Perry Blackshear, Shane McKenzie', 'Adriana Barraza, L. Scott Caldwell, Joshua Caleb Johnson, Richard Brake, Clayton Landey, Jonathan Medina, Bertila Damas, Grover Coulson', 'NR', 'In the barrio of Oak Springs lives a strong and stubborn group of elderly friends who refuse to be gentrified. Their leader, Lupita, keeps them together as a community, a family. But little did they know, their beloved bingo hall is about to be sold to a much more powerful force than money itself.', 'In the barrio of Oak Springs lives a strong and stubborn group of elderly friends who refuse to be gentrified. Their leader, Lupita, keeps them together as a community, a family. But little did they know, their beloved bingo hall is about to be sold to a much more powerful force than money itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86VKuiaox9eVJTETel0ld7XZtiO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802226'),
  ('1068001757242759244', 'Bingwit', 2022, 'Romance', 'Neal ''Buboy'' Tan', null, 'Krista Miller, Drei Arias, Conan King, Rob Sy, Aldwin Alegre', null, 'Salem is an ambitious woman who uses her body to attract three men - her politician husband Domingo, the hunk servant Medel/Arnel, and her boy toy Aldon - until Medel/Arnel and Aldon fall in love with each other!', 'Salem is an ambitious woman who uses her body to attract three men - her politician husband Domingo, the hunk servant Medel/Arnel, and her boy toy Aldon - until Medel/Arnel and Aldon fall in love with each other!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40mwVoQw2ERm5AAhUZ34aII37b7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:992784'),
  ('71777082017093673', 'Bini Sutor Taan', 2026, 'Drama, Family', 'Satyajit Das, Sourideb Chatterjee, Amit Mitra', 'Samir Mondal, Koushik Bit', 'Ayesha Bhattacharya, Payel Mukherjee, Bodhisattva Mazumdar, Jiya Mukherjee, Mitas Bhattacharjee', null, 'A single father''s quiet life shatters when his daughter suddenly falls ill. Racing against time, they cherish precious moments together while facing an uncertain future with courage and unwavering love.', 'A single father''s quiet life shatters when his daughter suddenly falls ill. Racing against time, they cherish precious moments together while facing an uncertain future with courage and unwavering love.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fw706ji0OCHYIrZk5laSq7wEX4Me.jpg', 'plex:movie:bini-sutor-taan'),
  ('538071637122960962', 'Binky Nelson Unpacified', 2015, 'Family, Animation', 'Fabrice Joubert, Brian Lynch', 'Brian Lynch', 'Michael Keaton, Allison Janney, Tara Strong, Matt Kwaczynski, Michael Beattie, Katy Mixon', 'NR', 'After a daring heist at a museum, the youngest member of the villainous Nelson family, Binky, realizes he''s left behind his beloved pacifier. Determined to retrieve it, Binky embarks on an adorable and hilarious mission to recover his prized possession.', 'After a daring heist at a museum, the youngest member of the villainous Nelson family, Binky, realizes he''s left behind his beloved pacifier. Determined to retrieve it, Binky embarks on an adorable and hilarious mission to recover his prized possession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvlzgn8J5SXkRnhvzTzf2m6U2Ut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366143'),
  ('1066090993313744776', 'Binta and the Great Idea', 2004, 'Family, Drama', 'Javier Fesser', null, 'Zeynabou Diallo, Agnile Sambou, Aminata Sane', null, 'Binta, a little girl from Senegal, tells us about the everyday life in her village, the importance of education for the girls, and about her father''s great idea to make the world a better place.', 'Binta, a little girl from Senegal, tells us about the everyday life in her village, the importance of education for the girls, and about her father''s great idea to make the world a better place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1z7Vww9EKW1mseaS0idFYgZZCEV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245017'),
  ('475017700630867718', 'Bio Hunter', 1995, 'Horror, Animation, Action', 'Yuzo Sato, Hiroshi Hamasaki, Hitoshi Yamaguchi', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri', 'Toshihiko Seki, Yuko Minaguchi, Kazuhiko Inoue, Taro Ishida, Rei Igarashi, Issei Miyazaki, Takehiro Murozono, Daiki Nakamura', null, 'A strange virus known as the Demon Virus, attacks the human genetic code, transforming people into monsters with demonic powers. One particular monster is terrorizing the streets of Tokyo. ripping open young women to devour their livers. A famed psychic holds the secret to the identity and purpose of this monster. Now it is up to two molecular biologists. self-proclaimed Bio Hunters Komada and Koshigaya, to reach the psychic and his beautiful daughter before its too late! The Demon Virus is out to conquer the world.', 'A strange virus known as the Demon Virus, attacks the human genetic code, transforming people into monsters with demonic powers. One particular monster is terrorizing the streets of Tokyo. ripping open young women to devour their livers. A famed psychic holds the secret to the identity and purpose of this monster. Now it is up to two molecular biologists. self-proclaimed Bio Hunters Komada and Koshigaya, to reach the psychic and his beautiful daughter before its too late! The Demon Virus is out to conquer the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfjQGbYsHFq2TUrGGMJ4JU8snO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57224'),
  ('528465166603895212', 'Bio Zombie', 1998, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Wilson Yip, Venus Keung, Gary Mak Wing-Lun', 'So Man-Sing, Wilson Yip, Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong', 'Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Sam Lee, Angela Tong Ying-Ying, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Bonnie Lai Suk-Yin, Emotion Cheung Kam-Ching, Frankie Chan Chi-Leung, Chow Hoi-San', 'R', 'A group of young shoppers and employees must band together when a zombie outbreak overruns their shopping center.', 'A group of young shoppers and employees must band together when a zombie outbreak overruns their shopping center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7SjozBaxLoiD8JEhiwIgCGW2oK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24916'),
  ('29421900266940728', 'Bio-Dome', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Jason Bloom, Phedon Papamichael, Rod Smith', 'Kip Koenig, Scott Marcano', 'Pauly Shore, Stephen Baldwin, William Atherton, Joey Lauren Adams, Teresa Hill, Henry Gibson, Kevin West, Denise Dowse', 'PG-13', 'Moronic best friends get themselves locked inside the Bio-Dome, a science experiment, along with a group of environmental scientists for one year.', 'Moronic best friends get themselves locked inside the Bio-Dome, a science experiment, along with a group of environmental scientists for one year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjSkGZAvksrbO6tGain8PJ3rfC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9536'),
  ('1101538661911496305', 'Biohazard', 1985, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Fred Olen Ray, Paul Elliott, Donald G. Jackson', 'Fred Olen Ray', 'Aldo Ray, Angelique Pettyjohn, William Fair, David O''Hara, Frank McDonald, Art Payton, Charles Roth, Carroll Borland', 'R', 'A group of skeptical government officials headed by General Randolph are brought to a remote laboratory for a demonstration in "Psychic Materialization", a successful side effect of an experimental drug. But the project scientists had warned that not enough testing had been completed to access safety concerns. In a freak accident during the demonstration to the politicians, a vicious creature is created! Unable to contain the monster, it unleashes unbelievable havoc & destruction against mankind! Reproducing itself at an alarming rate, and all known weapons seemingly powerless against the creature, the scientists are gravely concerned for the survival of mankind!', 'A group of skeptical government officials headed by General Randolph are brought to a remote laboratory for a demonstration in "Psychic Materialization", a successful side effect of an experimental drug. But the project scientists had warned that not enough testing had been completed to access safety concerns. In a freak accident during the demonstration to the politicians, a vicious creature is created! Unable to contain the monster, it unleashes unbelievable havoc & destruction against mankind! Reproducing itself at an alarming rate, and all known weapons seemingly powerless against the creature, the scientists are gravely concerned for the survival of mankind!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nPxykXfrfTxRLpRdgshgNvZ0bk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5734'),
  ('1051258341091637896', 'Bionic', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Afonso Poyart, Carlos André Zalasik, Neco Vila Lobos', 'Josefina Trotta, Cris Cera, Victor Navas', 'Jessica Córes, Gabz, Bruno Gagliasso, Christian Malheiros, Nill Marcondes, Guta Ruiz, Márcio Fecher, Miguel Nader', 'R', 'When the progress of robotics makes Paralympic athletes the new sports stars, Maria dreams of competing against her sister. For that, she will have to enter a world of crime and violence.', 'When the progress of robotics makes Paralympic athletes the new sports stars, Maria dreams of competing against her sister. For that, she will have to enter a world of crime and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVCYzdBE6lo3sUFK1OMZnXvpGtT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025463'),
  ('1079785842010050111', 'Bionic Ever After?', 1994, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie, Action', 'Steve Stafford', null, 'Lee Majors, Lindsay Wagner, Richard Anderson, Farrah Forke, Martin E. Brooks, Anne Lockhart, Alan Sader, Geordie Johnson', 'NR', 'Days away from her wedding to Steve Austin, Jaime Sommers experiences a mysterious breakdown of her Bionic limbs. With her physical fate unknown, Jaime calls off the wedding. Her condition quickly deteriorates, and Dr. Rudy Wells races to find the cause behind the breakdown. Meanwhile, in the Bahamas, terrorist Miles Kendrick takes control of the American Embassy and threatens the launch of a nuclear missile. Steve and OSI operative Kimberly Harmon head to the Bahamas to stop Kendrick, but in the midst of the mission Steve is suddenly stricken with the same computer virus that is destroying Jaime.', 'Days away from her wedding to Steve Austin, Jaime Sommers experiences a mysterious breakdown of her Bionic limbs. With her physical fate unknown, Jaime calls off the wedding. Her condition quickly deteriorates, and Dr. Rudy Wells races to find the cause behind the breakdown. Meanwhile, in the Bahamas, terrorist Miles Kendrick takes control of the American Embassy and threatens the launch of a nuclear missile. Steve and OSI operative Kimberly Harmon head to the Bahamas to stop Kendrick, but in the midst of the mission Steve is suddenly stricken with the same computer virus that is destroying Jaime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uBgfPyKKV207l2BJRCaq9ZHYmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69206'),
  ('1107146158999753664', 'Bionic Showdown: The Six Million Dollar Man and the Bionic Woman', 1989, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Alan J. Levi, Maris H. Jansons', 'Brock Choy, Michael Sloan', 'Lindsay Wagner, Lee Majors, Richard Anderson, Sandra Bullock, Jeff Yagher, Martin E. Brooks, Josef Sommer, Carolyn Dunn', 'PG', 'The Bionic Woman and the Six-Million-Dollar Man reunite--with a few younger bionic assistants--and try to catch a bionic spy.', 'The Bionic Woman and the Six-Million-Dollar Man reunite--with a few younger bionic assistants--and try to catch a bionic spy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5ojVzzQTzdx5tiSuF05HxL2LYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97262'),
  ('536878499826330852', 'Bionicle 2: Legends of Metru Nui', 2004, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Terry Shakespeare, David Molina', 'Henry Gilroy, Greg Klein, Tom Pugsley', 'Christopher Gaze, Michael Dobson, Paul Dobson, Tabitha St. Germain, Brian Drummond, Trevor Devall, Alessandro Juliani, Gerard Plunkett', 'PG', 'In the time before time, six unlikely Matoran find themselves transformed into mighty Toa. The new Toa Metru must prove themselves as true heroes, find the missing Toa Lhikan, and uncover a plot that threatens the heart of Metru Nui.', 'In the time before time, six unlikely Matoran find themselves transformed into mighty Toa. The new Toa Metru must prove themselves as true heroes, find the missing Toa Lhikan, and uncover a plot that threatens the heart of Metru Nui.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7PwIVnWYjXIRlOaByXMW6CmteV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21379'),
  ('301067148803875667', 'Bionicle 3: Web of Shadows', 2005, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'David Molina, Terry Shakespeare', 'Brett Matthews', 'Christopher Gaze, Brian Drummond, Trevor Devall, Paul Dobson, Tabitha St. Germain, Alessandro Juliani, Kathleen Barr, French Tickner', 'PG', 'The Toa Metru return to their glorious city of Metru Nui to finally accomplish their mission, only to find the city in ruins, overrun by the dreaded Visorak horde. Captured by their new enemy and transformed into hideous Toa Hordika, our heroes must find a figure out of myth to be cured of their mutations and fulfill their destiny before the beast within overtakes them.', 'The Toa Metru return to their glorious city of Metru Nui to finally accomplish their mission, only to find the city in ruins, overrun by the dreaded Visorak horde. Captured by their new enemy and transformed into hideous Toa Hordika, our heroes must find a figure out of myth to be cured of their mutations and fulfill their destiny before the beast within overtakes them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFxHUekr0n4ZHRD4tnzow3oqLBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18224'),
  ('567909767004793427', 'Bionicle: Mask of Light', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Mystery', 'David Molina, Terry Shakespeare', 'Henry Gilroy', 'Jason Michas, Andrew Francis, Scott McNeil, Lee Tockar, Christopher Gaze, Kathleen Barr, Dale Wilson, Michael Dobson', 'PG', 'With darkness encroaching on the island of Mata Nui, the only hope for the survival of the islanders rests with two Matoran villagers, who must find the seventh Toa and deliver to him the fabled Mask of Light.', 'With darkness encroaching on the island of Mata Nui, the only hope for the survival of the islanders rests with two Matoran villagers, who must find the seventh Toa and deliver to him the fabled Mask of Light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcd1HhhOoiMMftKGn4ILgLQ6KrV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19325'),
  ('595828973313188697', 'Bionicle: The Legend Reborn', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Mark Baldo, Heidi Klein', 'Sean Catherine Derek', 'Dee Bradley Baker, Jeff Bennett, Jim Cummings, Michael Dorn, Mark Famiglietti, David Leisure, Armin Shimerman, Marla Sokoloff', 'PG', 'Once the ruler of an entire universe, the Great Spirit Mata Nui finds himself cast out of his own body, his spirit trapped inside the fabled Mask of Life, hurtling through space. After landing on the far-away planet of Bara Magna, the mask creates a new body for Mata Nui, who unwillingly gets caught up in the furious battles of the nearly barren and dangerous planet.', 'Once the ruler of an entire universe, the Great Spirit Mata Nui finds himself cast out of his own body, his spirit trapped inside the fabled Mask of Life, hurtling through space. After landing on the far-away planet of Bara Magna, the mask creates a new body for Mata Nui, who unwillingly gets caught up in the furious battles of the nearly barren and dangerous planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKCJ0oy1gEY8JGxugI6FvmHBKqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22259'),
  ('42410302470455501', 'Biosphere', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Mel Eslyn, Nathan M. Miller, Josh Spiegel', 'Mel Eslyn, Mark Duplass', 'Sterling K. Brown, Mark Duplass', null, 'In the not-too-distant future, the last two men on earth must adapt and evolve to save humanity.', 'In the not-too-distant future, the last two men on earth must adapt and evolve to save humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yqYQMibudBGrqP70mEcv7pNOQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865797'),
  ('1126455785105820076', 'Biotherapy', 1986, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Akihiro Kashima', 'Hiroshi Takatsu, Kazuhiro Kasai', 'Junichi Haruta, Yumiko Ishikawa, Hirohisa Nakata, Shoji Nakayama, Sakaguchi Tetsurou, Ai Nogawa, Toshimichi Takahashi, Higashi Ken''ichirou', null, 'A group of Japanese scientists are stalked and viciously butchered by a creepy alien in a trenchcoat.', 'A group of Japanese scientists are stalked and viciously butchered by a creepy alien in a trenchcoat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0paxlL3YmzXe94Up43BFR2gjsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39906'),
  ('1044591113608377356', 'Biquefarre', 1984, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Georges Rouquier, Alain Peyrollaz, André Villard', 'Georges Rouquier', 'Henri Rouquier, Maria Rouquier, Roger Malet, Marius Benaben, Hélène Benaben, André Benaben, Francine Benaben, Marie-Hélène Benaben', null, 'Biquefarre is a small farm in Aveyron. The changing economics of farming lead Raoul, in late middle age, to decide to sell and move to Toulouse. At least two neighboring farmers want to buy Biquefarre: Lucien and the young Marcel. Behind the scenes, Henri, whose brother is Marcel''s father and who is also Lucien''s brother-in-law, negotiates with Raoul so that Marcel''s father can secretly sweeten Marcel''s offer. Will dad and uncle succeed? In the background is the hard daily work of farming: milking cows, harvesting at night, and finding help when a farmer falls ill. Progress brings challenges: polluted water, factory farms, and skyrocketing land prices.', 'Biquefarre is a small farm in Aveyron. The changing economics of farming lead Raoul, in late middle age, to decide to sell and move to Toulouse. At least two neighboring farmers want to buy Biquefarre: Lucien and the young Marcel. Behind the scenes, Henri, whose brother is Marcel''s father and who is also Lucien''s brother-in-law, negotiates with Raoul so that Marcel''s father can secretly sweeten Marcel''s offer. Will dad and uncle succeed? In the background is the hard daily work of farming: milking cows, harvesting at night, and finding help when a farmer falls ill. Progress brings challenges: polluted water, factory farms, and skyrocketing land prices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYcofdLhwPdqK8zifIrKSFT7pOi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146398'),
  ('974576109357031409', 'Bir Baba Hindu', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Sermiyan Midyat', 'Sermiyan Midyat', 'Sermiyan Midyat, Burak Satıbol, Nicole Faria, Şafak Sezer, Zeynep Kankonde, Hakan Akın, Füsun Demirel, Ayhan Taş', null, 'Fadil, one of the fiercest mobsters of Turkey, one day falls in love with his Indian yoga instructor, Gundhi. Once Gundhi is kidnapped from Fadil''s mansion Fadil sets out to India with his trustworthy friend Hulusi. He plans to rescue Gundhi and win her heart but this is a tough job as Gundhi''s mother is one of the fiercest mobsters of India. With the help of a Turkish municipality worker in Mumbai, Fadil and Hulusi get entangled in numerous adventures as they try to reach Gundhi. Laughter ensues once Fadil''s parents arrive in town. Will Fadil be able to save Gundhi and have his happy ending?', 'Fadil, one of the fiercest mobsters of Turkey, one day falls in love with his Indian yoga instructor, Gundhi. Once Gundhi is kidnapped from Fadil''s mansion Fadil sets out to India with his trustworthy friend Hulusi. He plans to rescue Gundhi and win her heart but this is a tough job as Gundhi''s mother is one of the fiercest mobsters of India. With the help of a Turkish municipality worker in Mumbai, Fadil and Hulusi get entangled in numerous adventures as they try to reach Gundhi. Laughter ensues once Fadil''s parents arrive in town. Will Fadil be able to save Gundhi and have his happy ending?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDMJTS7m2ncDr1T8kGnOaUX1MdG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419530'),
  ('654153185309583851', 'Bir Nefes Yeter', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Asuman Erdoğan', null, 'Seçkin Özdemir, Tuvana Türkay, Zuhal Gencer, Hakkı Ergök, Galip Erdal, Nilüfer Kurt, Mihriban Er, Coşkun Özmeriç', null, 'A love story that begins when Yaman, a man who has given up on life, crosses paths with Nefes, a girl who is trying to hold on to life, will be a great choice for those who love romantic movies. Yaman, who has lost all hope in life due to the events he has experienced, is searching for something when he meets Nefes, who is just like him, and a great love begins between the two.', 'A love story that begins when Yaman, a man who has given up on life, crosses paths with Nefes, a girl who is trying to hold on to life, will be a great choice for those who love romantic movies. Yaman, who has lost all hope in life due to the events he has experienced, is searching for something when he meets Nefes, who is just like him, and a great love begins between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meHe8MgQiYIWyfZYzzMqPQLCnyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477269'),
  ('416892449243751810', 'Bird', 1988, 'Drama, Music', 'Clint Eastwood, Jack N. Green', 'Joel Oliansky', 'Forest Whitaker, Diane Venora, Michael Zelniker, Samuel E. Wright, Keith David, Michael McGuire, James Handy, Damon Whitaker', 'R', 'Saxophone player Charlie ‘Bird’ Parker comes to New York in 1940 and is quickly noticed for his remarkable way of playing. He becomes a drug addict but his loving wife Chan tries to help him.', 'Saxophone player Charlie ‘Bird’ Parker comes to New York in 1940 and is quickly noticed for his remarkable way of playing. He becomes a drug addict but his loving wife Chan tries to help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTCp6M98RQAxRl0x0guU9GlH7HS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24679'),
  ('933704246943892962', 'Bird', 2024, 'Drama', 'Kate Stamp, Florence Sweeney, Flora Kakas', 'Andrea Arnold', 'Nykiya Adams, Franz Rogowski, Barry Keoghan, Jason Buda, Jasmine Jobson, Frankie Box, James Nelson-Joyce, Jason Williamson', 'R', '12-year-old Bailey lives with her single dad Bug and brother Hunter in a squat in North Kent. Bug doesn’t have much time for his kids, and Bailey, who is approaching puberty, seeks attention and adventure elsewhere.', '12-year-old Bailey lives with her single dad Bug and brother Hunter in a squat in North Kent. Bug doesn’t have much time for his kids, and Bailey, who is approaching puberty, seeks attention and adventure elsewhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKshd6n8EKrwbE2fLOUqC4TSG6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128752'),
  ('1019514594639236463', 'Bird Box', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Susanne Bier, Salvatore Totino, Eric Glasser', 'Eric Heisserer', 'Sandra Bullock, Trevante Rhodes, John Malkovich, Sarah Paulson, Jacki Weaver, Rosa Salazar, Danielle Macdonald, Lil Rel Howery', 'R', 'Five years after an ominous unseen presence drives most of society to suicide, a survivor and her two children make a desperate bid to reach safety.', 'Five years after an ominous unseen presence drives most of society to suicide, a survivor and her two children make a desperate bid to reach safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGfGfgL2pEPCfhIvqHXieXFn7gp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405774'),
  ('340791381359551050', 'Bird Box Barcelona', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Àlex Pastor, David Pastor, Can Aydin', 'Àlex Pastor, David Pastor', 'Mario Casas, Georgina Campbell, Diego Calva, Naila Schuberth, Alejandra Howard, Patrick Criado, Celia Freijeiro, Lola Dueñas', 'R', 'After a mysterious force decimates the world’s population, Sebastian must navigate his own survival journey through the desolate streets of Barcelona. As he forms uneasy alliances with other survivors and they try to escape the city, an unexpected and even more sinister threat grows.', 'After a mysterious force decimates the world’s population, Sebastian must navigate his own survival journey through the desolate streets of Barcelona. As he forms uneasy alliances with other survivors and they try to escape the city, an unexpected and even more sinister threat grows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTGBHdL12QEpLyRVlykDuiYxzAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805320'),
  ('753889128045444218', 'Bird of Paradise', 1932, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, Clyde De Vinna, H. Bruce Humberstone', 'Wells Root, Wanda Tuchock, Leonard Praskins', 'Dolores del Río, Joel McCrea, John Halliday, Richard ''Skeets'' Gallagher, Bert Roach, Lon Chaney Jr., Wade Boteler, Arnold Gray', 'NR', 'When a young South Seas sailor falls overboard, the beautiful daughter of a Polynesian king dives in and saves his life. Thus begins the romance of Johnny and Luana. Though Luana is promised to another man, Johnny whisks her away, and for a brief time the lovers live very happily together. But, when a local volcano threatens their lives, Luana knows that she must sacrifice herself to the volcanic gods in order to save her island.', 'When a young South Seas sailor falls overboard, the beautiful daughter of a Polynesian king dives in and saves his life. Thus begins the romance of Johnny and Luana. Though Luana is promised to another man, Johnny whisks her away, and for a brief time the lovers live very happily together. But, when a local volcano threatens their lives, Luana knows that she must sacrifice herself to the volcanic gods in order to save her island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2vjVQ1Y3m0LBTm59bYm1NfclqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92341'),
  ('514686665639779254', 'Bird on a Wire', 1990, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'John Badham, Robert Primes, Sandy Cochrane', 'David Seltzer, Louis Venosta, Eric Lerner', 'Mel Gibson, Goldie Hawn, David Carradine, Bill Duke, Stephen Tobolowsky, Joan Severance, Harry Caesar, Jeff Corey', 'PG-13', 'An FBI informant has kept his new identity secret for 15 years. Now an old flame has recognised him, and the bad guys are back for revenge.', 'An FBI informant has kept his new identity secret for 15 years. Now an old flame has recognised him, and the bad guys are back for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liMWv3o05MbXV0QoDdFNsincUxa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1727'),
