  ('852715397970079810', 'Bird Thongchai Concert #1/1988 Kaolao ThongChai (Mai-Ngok)', 1988, 'Music', null, null, 'Thongchai McIntyre', null, 'Relive the magic of Thongchai "Bird" McIntyre''s captivating performance at Bangkok Youth Center in 1988', 'Relive the magic of Thongchai "Bird" McIntyre''s captivating performance at Bangkok Youth Center in 1988', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lF70yd1kLsTw3tXINjvcyds7S9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1245774'),
  ('991059688467297958', 'Bird Thongchai Concert Feather and Flowers #3/2015 The Original Returns', 2015, 'Music', null, null, 'Thongchai McIntyre, Saranya Songsermsawad, Siriwimol Charoenpura, Saowaluk Leelabut, Marsha Vadhanapanich, Christina Aguilar', null, 'The fin spread every round for the magnificent concert celebrating the 20th anniversary of The Original Returns Feathers and Flowers, making over 40,000 viewers full of happiness. With an impressive show of feathers, superstars of all time, Bird-Thongchai McIntyre, who are associated with 5 original diva flowers such as Mai Charoenpura, Christina AkiLar, Marsha Wattanapanich, Am Saowaluk and Koi Saranya', 'The fin spread every round for the magnificent concert celebrating the 20th anniversary of The Original Returns Feathers and Flowers, making over 40,000 viewers full of happiness. With an impressive show of feathers, superstars of all time, Bird-Thongchai McIntyre, who are associated with 5 original diva flowers such as Mai Charoenpura, Christina AkiLar, Marsha Wattanapanich, Am Saowaluk and Koi Saranya', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeZjGb0iWaXVZtQqe5orBdKyrnT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1173688'),
  ('669985961363404003', 'Birdboy', 2011, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Animation, Drama', 'Alberto Vázquez, Pedro Rivero, Alberto Vázquez', 'Pedro Rivero, Alberto Vázquez', 'Ana Lemos, Tacho González, Óscar Fernández, Antón Rei, Matías Brea, Xermana Carballido, Antón Rubal', null, 'A terrible industrial accident changes little Dinki''s life forever. Now Dinki''s fate may ride on the wings of her eccentric friend Birdboy, a misfit who hides in the forest lost in his fantasies.', 'A terrible industrial accident changes little Dinki''s life forever. Now Dinki''s fate may ride on the wings of her eccentric friend Birdboy, a misfit who hides in the forest lost in his fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Gn4YFyMc4qgcCCRSUNMgqKPFe3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444980'),
  ('574392575967487227', 'Birdboy: The Forgotten Children', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Alberto Vázquez, Pedro Rivero, Alberto Vázquez', 'Alberto Vázquez, Pedro Rivero', 'Andrea Alzuri, Eba Ojanguren, Josu Cubero, Felix Arkarazo, Jorge Carrero, Nuria Marín, Josu Varela, Jon Goiri', 'NR', 'Teenagers Birdboy and Dinki have decided to escape from an island devastated by ecological catastrophe: Birdboy by shutting himself off from the world, Dinki by setting out on a dangerous voyage in the hope that Birdboy will accompany her.', 'Teenagers Birdboy and Dinki have decided to escape from an island devastated by ecological catastrophe: Birdboy by shutting himself off from the world, Dinki by setting out on a dangerous voyage in the hope that Birdboy will accompany her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xS6M8jigRzQ0oFG0SdAQBfmEYtd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361705'),
  ('97769305367620402', 'Birdcage Inn', 1998, 'Drama', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Ki-duk, Seo Jeong-min', 'Lee Ji-eun, Lee Hae-eun, Ahn Jae-mo, Jeong Hyeong-gi, Son Min-seok, Lee In-ok, Jang Hang-seon, Lee Yoon-geon', null, 'Jin-a, a young prostitute, moves into a seaside motel called the Birdcage Inn, run by a dysfunctional family. Struggling with her circumstances and the family''s treatment, she forms an unlikely bond with the daughter, Hye-mi. As they navigate love, betrayal, and personal growth, their friendship ultimately leads to a deeper understanding and a chance for redemption.', 'Jin-a, a young prostitute, moves into a seaside motel called the Birdcage Inn, run by a dysfunctional family. Struggling with her circumstances and the family''s treatment, she forms an unlikely bond with the daughter, Hye-mi. As they navigate love, betrayal, and personal growth, their friendship ultimately leads to a deeper understanding and a chance for redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AudXaWqKI4Bb9xIsyjTeQCTxJId.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2777'),
  ('670411589851343960', 'Birdemic 2: The Resurrection', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'James Nguyen, Bobby Hacker', 'James Nguyen', 'Alan Bagh, Whitney Moore, Thomas Favaloro, Chelsea Turnbo, Thuan Luu, Aaron Pressburg, Brittany N. Pierce, Colton Osborne', null, 'A platoon of eagles and vultures attack Hollywood, California. Why did the eagles and vultures attack? Who will survive?', 'A platoon of eagles and vultures attack Hollywood, California. Why did the eagles and vultures attack? Who will survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gb5DsfCrVHOpsqYOhnfYike1Yn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188489'),
  ('1027350333464050122', 'Birdemic 3: Sea Eagle', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Romance', 'James Nguyen', 'James Nguyen', 'Ryan Lord, Julia Culbert, Alan Bagh, Victorya Brandart, Marc DeNola, Damien Carter, Chris Dale, Robert Finch', 'NR', 'Love blossoms between Evan and Kim in the coastal town of Santa Cruz, California, but so does a flock of displaced sea eagles, who go on a rampage.', 'Love blossoms between Evan and Kim in the coastal town of Santa Cruz, California, but so does a flock of displaced sea eagles, who go on a rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9smfYfuAwYNzHCKGJcKMIn08k4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724585'),
  ('443873450362901005', 'Birdemic: Shock and Terror', 2010, 'Romance, Horror, Thriller', 'James Nguyen, Daniel Mai', 'James Nguyen', 'Alan Bagh, Whitney Moore, Janae Caster, Colton Osborne, Adam Sessa, Catherine Batcha, Patsy van Ettinger, Damien Carter', 'NR', 'A platoon of eagles and vultures attacks the residents of a small town. Many people die. It''s not known what caused the flying menace to attack. Two people manage to fight back, but will they survive Birdemic?', 'A platoon of eagles and vultures attacks the residents of a small town. Many people die. It''s not known what caused the flying menace to attack. Two people manage to fight back, but will they survive Birdemic?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqmcAVNNUosB55RliecFYnkWT4M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40016'),
  ('573784799330430978', 'Birder', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Nate Dushku, Robert M. Edgecomb', 'Amnon Lourie', 'Michael Emery, David J. Cork, Cody Sloan, Jes Davis, Uki Pavlovic, Ryan Czerwonko, Miles Crawford, Delilah DuBois', null, 'A birdwatcher invades a nude queer campground on a remote lake in the New Hampshire wilds. He wears whatever he needs to ensnare the locals in his dark fetish in this nightmarish erotic thriller. Consent has never been more deadly.', 'A birdwatcher invades a nude queer campground on a remote lake in the New Hampshire wilds. He wears whatever he needs to ensnare the locals in his dark fetish in this nightmarish erotic thriller. Consent has never been more deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3N0NwMV1GyxOrtSwABQDqqA74.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145758'),
  ('255703677523416787', 'Birdman of Alcatraz', 1962, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Burnett Guffey, John Frankenheimer, John Alton', 'Guy Trosper', 'Burt Lancaster, Karl Malden, Thelma Ritter, Neville Brand, Betty Field, Telly Savalas, Edmond O''Brien, Hugh Marlowe', 'NR', 'After killing a prison guard, convict Robert Stroud faces life imprisonment in solitary confinement. Driven nearly mad by loneliness and despair, Stroud''s life gains new meaning when he happens upon a helpless baby sparrow in the exercise yard and nurses it back to health. Despite having only a third grade education, Stroud goes on to become a renowned ornithologist and achieves a greater sense of freedom and purpose behind bars than most people find in the outside world.', 'After killing a prison guard, convict Robert Stroud faces life imprisonment in solitary confinement. Driven nearly mad by loneliness and despair, Stroud''s life gains new meaning when he happens upon a helpless baby sparrow in the exercise yard and nurses it back to health. Despite having only a third grade education, Stroud goes on to become a renowned ornithologist and achieves a greater sense of freedom and purpose behind bars than most people find in the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EODLN11HTX4l2cmakAhWIoJLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:898'),
  ('974148322365869080', 'Birdman or (The Unexpected Virtue of Ignorance)', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alejandro González Iñárritu, Emmanuel Lubezki, David Meyer', 'Alejandro González Iñárritu, Alexander Dinelaris, Nicolás Giacobone', 'Michael Keaton, Emma Stone, Zach Galifianakis, Edward Norton, Andrea Riseborough, Naomi Watts, Amy Ryan, Lindsay Duncan', 'R', 'A fading actor best known for his portrayal of a popular superhero attempts to mount a comeback by appearing in a Broadway play. As opening night approaches, his attempts to become more altruistic, rebuild his career, and reconnect with friends and family prove more difficult than expected.', 'A fading actor best known for his portrayal of a popular superhero attempts to mount a comeback by appearing in a Broadway play. As opening night approaches, his attempts to become more altruistic, rebuild his career, and reconnect with friends and family prove more difficult than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHUg2AuIuLSIYMYFgavVwqt1jtc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194662'),
  ('931976912260403797', 'Birds Anonymous', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'In this spoof of Alcoholics Anonymous, pussycats are cast as bird-eating addicts and go through the 12-step process to deal with their addiction. Sylvester, who could never quite get the best of the object of his desire, Tweety Bird, joins and resolves to quit chasing and eating the canary.', 'In this spoof of Alcoholics Anonymous, pussycats are cast as bird-eating addicts and go through the 12-step process to deal with their addiction. Sylvester, who could never quite get the best of the object of his desire, Tweety Bird, joins and resolves to quit chasing and eating the canary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqE7qxG7N4mLf2WzTQVMKW8lrnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100395'),
  ('1140118107684812183', 'Birds Flying East', 2024, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Pau Durà, David Omedes', 'Ana M. Peiró, Pau Durà', 'Luis Zahera, Javier Gutiérrez, Teresa Saponangelo, Diana Cavallotti, Edgar Moreno, Florin Kevorkian, Sophie Heideker, Babou Cham', null, 'Colombo works at a 24-hour parking lot and tops up his measly wages by selling weed. Mario is a lawyer and a keen birdwatcher, but unfortunately for him, he is unable to drive due to a past accident. Mario offers to pay Colombo to drive him from Valencia to a lake in the Costa Brava (Spain), where he wants to see some cranes. When they reach the lake, the lawyer tells him that the birds have changed their migratory route and are now going to nest in the Danube delta in Constanza (Romania). Mario needs to get there, and Colombo needs the money. Neither of them is aware of the other’s story, but at that moment, a new and definitive journey starts for both of them.', 'Colombo works at a 24-hour parking lot and tops up his measly wages by selling weed. Mario is a lawyer and a keen birdwatcher, but unfortunately for him, he is unable to drive due to a past accident. Mario offers to pay Colombo to drive him from Valencia to a lake in the Costa Brava (Spain), where he wants to see some cranes. When they reach the lake, the lawyer tells him that the birds have changed their migratory route and are now going to nest in the Danube delta in Constanza (Romania). Mario needs to get there, and Colombo needs the money. Neither of them is aware of the other’s story, but at that moment, a new and definitive journey starts for both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2PX0wzcXxxX3ObktFEJpRjdRJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1130428'),
  ('946312911440593453', 'Birds in Peru', 1968, 'Drama', 'Romain Gary, Christian Matras', 'Romain Gary', 'Jean Seberg, Maurice Ronet, Pierre Brasseur, Danielle Darrieux, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Michel Buades, Henri Czarniak, Pierre Koulak', null, 'A nymphomaniac young woman, unsatisfied by her husband, searches for sex in the brothels of a seaside town while he sets to kill her.', 'A nymphomaniac young woman, unsatisfied by her husband, searches for sex in the brothels of a seaside town while he sets to kill her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ADzaX2QPpTAyAGEpqmfjDXMO94.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261221'),
  ('327126067099000453', 'Birds in the Spring', 1933, 'Animation', 'David Hand', null, 'Marion Darlington, Clarence Nash, Purv Pullen, Mae Questel', 'NR', 'Two birds rejoice over the hatching of their three eggs; as they grow, the hatchlings are taught to sing and fly. One falls from the nest and has adventures with a rattlesnake and a beehive before finding his way home.', 'Two birds rejoice over the hatching of their three eggs; as they grow, the hatchlings are taught to sing and fly. One falls from the nest and has adventures with a rattlesnake and a beehive before finding his way home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PH9xmPp8azqgwvcgFTJuNKEHFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66822'),
  ('186593483754792895', 'Birds of a Father', 1961, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Sylvester Cat discovers that his son, Junior, has a new best friend - a bird named Spike. Aghast, Sylvester decides to teach his son the facts of feline life and goes with him on a bird hunt, which, as usual, isn''t Sylvester''s forte. He is hit with a badminton racket after he mistakenly shoots a badminton birdie and then is blown up when he sends a model plane after Spike and is himself shot at by the out-of-control plane and forced to take refuge in an explosives store shed, with the plane slipping in behind him and firing at the TNT.', 'Sylvester Cat discovers that his son, Junior, has a new best friend - a bird named Spike. Aghast, Sylvester decides to teach his son the facts of feline life and goes with him on a bird hunt, which, as usual, isn''t Sylvester''s forte. He is hit with a badminton racket after he mistakenly shoots a badminton birdie and then is blown up when he sends a model plane after Spike and is himself shot at by the out-of-control plane and forced to take refuge in an explosives store shed, with the plane slipping in behind him and firing at the TNT.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4oJC5pJ33AerQ2yewrQ7RVNUYh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226815'),
