  ('235364142888372103', 'Birgit Haas Must Be Killed', 1981, 'Drama', 'Laurent Heynemann, Jean-Francis Gondre', 'Pierre Fabre, Caroline Huppert, Laurent Heynemann', 'Philippe Noiret, Jean Rochefort, Lisa Kreuzer, Bernard Le Coq, Maurice Teynac, Michel Beaune, Victor Garrivier, Monique Chaumette', null, '"Hangar" is a new agency whose purpose is to carry out missions even too sensitive for the police or intelligence services. The agency must eliminate a German female terrorist by the name of Birgitt Haas. The murder is to be disguised as a crime of passion, so an agent must lure Birgitt into falling in love.', '"Hangar" is a new agency whose purpose is to carry out missions even too sensitive for the police or intelligence services. The agency must eliminate a German female terrorist by the name of Birgitt Haas. The murder is to be disguised as a crime of passion, so an agent must lure Birgitt into falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDPWQm6lVhtuSUssBhodILDGIY4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140068'),
  ('366455298942780424', 'Birth', 1984, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Noriyoshi Matsuura, Sadafumi Sano, Yoshinori Kanada', 'Junki Takegami', 'Ichiro Nagai, Kaneto Shiozawa, Kazuki Yao, Mina Tominaga, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Joji Yanami, Noriko Tsukase, Reiko Suzuki', null, 'Aqualoid was a prosperous planet, but an attack from a mysterious life force, the Inorganics, transforms it into a post-apocalyptic shell of its former self. When Nam finds a mysterious sword, he is suddenly the object of a planet-wide chase. With the Inorganics closing in, will Nam and his friends discover the secret of the sword and save their world? Or will they destroy Aqualoid in favor of a new Birth?', 'Aqualoid was a prosperous planet, but an attack from a mysterious life force, the Inorganics, transforms it into a post-apocalyptic shell of its former self. When Nam finds a mysterious sword, he is suddenly the object of a planet-wide chase. With the Inorganics closing in, will Nam and his friends discover the secret of the sword and save their world? Or will they destroy Aqualoid in favor of a new Birth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQEmHnMMexRImjEW2YmcFN1o8e7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56069'),
  ('1100934081694496772', 'Birth', 2004, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jonathan Glazer, Harris Savides, Todd Pfeiffer', 'Milo Addica, Jonathan Glazer, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Nicole Kidman, Cameron Bright, Danny Huston, Lauren Bacall, Alison Elliott, Arliss Howard, Michael Desautels, Anne Heche', 'R', 'It took Anna 10 years to recover from the death of her husband, Sean, but now she''s on the verge of marrying her boyfriend, Joseph, and finally moving on. However, on the night of her engagement party, a young boy named Sean turns up, saying he is her dead husband reincarnated. At first she ignores the child, but his knowledge of her former husband''s life is uncanny, leading her to believe that he might be telling the truth.', 'It took Anna 10 years to recover from the death of her husband, Sean, but now she''s on the verge of marrying her boyfriend, Joseph, and finally moving on. However, on the night of her engagement party, a young boy named Sean turns up, saying he is her dead husband reincarnated. At first she ignores the child, but his knowledge of her former husband''s life is uncanny, leading her to believe that he might be telling the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z70iQ61WqhxETAz8ar2oD8pkIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10740'),
  ('386217900674175361', 'Birth Certificate', 1961, 'Drama, War', 'Stanisław Różewicz, Stanisław Jędryka, Halina Lachowicz', 'Tadeusz Różewicz, Stanisław Różewicz', 'Henryk Hryniewicz, Wojciech Siemion, Edward Mincer, Andrzej Banaszewski, Pawel Rózewicz, Beata Barszczewska, Zofia Małynicz, Barbara Rachwalska', 'NR', 'Three separate stories depicting the tense everyday life during occupation, as seen through the eyes of children. In “On the Road,” the two main protagonists are lost in the September’s strife: a young boy, and a soldier transporting the valueless documents of his broken unit. In “Letter from the Concentration Camp” the story’s protagonists are young boys who help their mother during the hardships of the occupation. Their treasure is an officer uniform belonging their father who is being held in a prisoner of war camp. In “Blood Drop,” the Germans find a set of typical Aryan characteristics in this story’s protagonist – a Jewish girl, hiding in an orphanage.', 'Three separate stories depicting the tense everyday life during occupation, as seen through the eyes of children. In “On the Road,” the two main protagonists are lost in the September’s strife: a young boy, and a soldier transporting the valueless documents of his broken unit. In “Letter from the Concentration Camp” the story’s protagonists are young boys who help their mother during the hardships of the occupation. Their treasure is an officer uniform belonging their father who is being held in a prisoner of war camp. In “Blood Drop,” the Germans find a set of typical Aryan characteristics in this story’s protagonist – a Jewish girl, hiding in an orphanage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBnX1rHg7KTJQdMXxTCK2hK9Lav.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217411'),
  ('20973723548842027', 'Birth of a Leader', 2016, 'Drama', 'Antoine de Bary, Nicolas Loir, Antoine Poulet', 'Antoine de Bary', 'Vincent Lacoste, Félix Moati, Thomas Blumenthal, Jochen Hägele, Lottie Andersen, Antoine Poulet, Adèle Wismes, Barbara Graustark', null, 'Vincent, a 20-year-old successful actor, is being offered the leading role in the film of the year: a biopic on Charles de Gaulle in his youth. At the same time, his parents move to Orléans, thus pushing him to live alone. The film follows his first steps towards independence.', 'Vincent, a 20-year-old successful actor, is being offered the leading role in the film of the year: a biopic on Charles de Gaulle in his youth. At the same time, his parents move to Orléans, thus pushing him to live alone. The film follows his first steps towards independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTqGkK0qRaHlZxER86oEgTNVbnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398371'),
  ('360427931893431849', 'Birth of a Notion', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'Daffy Duck, hoping to avoid flying south by finding a sucker who will let him stay, ends up at the house of a mad scientist and his dog, Leopold.', 'Daffy Duck, hoping to avoid flying south by finding a sucker who will let him stay, ends up at the house of a mad scientist and his dog, Leopold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IlQu1ftrU7T1s5eOhpFmpe1DPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173142'),
  ('888405317228227260', 'Birth of the Beatles', 1979, 'Drama, Music', 'Richard Marquand, Alan Hume', null, 'Stephen MacKenna, Rod Culbertson, Ray Ashcroft, John Altman, Michael Ryan, David Wilkinson, Brian Jameson, Wendy Morgan', 'NR', 'The early days of the Fab Four are traced from their bleakest hours as unknowns on Penny Lane in Liverpool to their triumph on "The Ed Sullivan Show."', 'The early days of the Fab Four are traced from their bleakest hours as unknowns on Penny Lane in Liverpool to their triumph on "The Ed Sullivan Show."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atiteTI0aK5WdQFCrFHobAcxfXs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75184'),
  ('65016748002713326', 'Birth of the Blues', 1941, 'Music, Romance', 'Victor Schertzinger, William C. Mellor', 'Walter DeLeon', 'Bing Crosby, Mary Martin, Brian Donlevy, Carolyn Lee, Eddie ''Rochester'' Anderson, J. Carrol Naish, Warren Hymer, Horace McMahon', 'NR', 'Jeff grows up near Basin Street in New Orleans, playing his clarinet with the dock workers. He puts together a band, the Basin Street Hot-Shots, which includes a cornet player, Memphis. They struggle to get their jazz music accepted by the cafe society of the city. Betty Lou joins their band as a singer and gets Louie to show her how to do scat singing. Memphis and Jeff both fall in love with Betty Lou.', 'Jeff grows up near Basin Street in New Orleans, playing his clarinet with the dock workers. He puts together a band, the Basin Street Hot-Shots, which includes a cornet player, Memphis. They struggle to get their jazz music accepted by the cafe society of the city. Betty Lou joins their band as a singer and gets Louie to show her how to do scat singing. Memphis and Jeff both fall in love with Betty Lou.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHFLaMleKWsfCEh6bEFbgUtw3zw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96700'),
  ('544027432755843346', 'Birth of the Dragon', 2017, 'Action, Drama', 'George Nolfi, Amir Mokri, Corey Yuen', 'Christopher Wilkinson, Stephen J. Rivele', 'Philip Ng Wan-Lung, Billy Magnussen, Xia Yu, Ron Yuan, Darren E. Scott, King Lau, Yee Jee Tso, Teresa Navarro', 'PG-13', 'Set against the backdrop of San Francisco’s Chinatown, this cross-cultural biopic chronicles Bruce Lee’s emergence as a martial-arts superstar after his legendary secret showdown with fellow martial artist Wong Jack Man.', 'Set against the backdrop of San Francisco’s Chinatown, this cross-cultural biopic chronicles Bruce Lee’s emergence as a martial-arts superstar after his legendary secret showdown with fellow martial artist Wong Jack Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odn4Hj2u7IQhJRmr15pTYZbkbc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408266'),
