  ('511511758727267373', 'Birth of the Tramp', 2013, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Serge Bromberg, Eric Lange, Jean-Louis Sonzogni', null, 'Peter Hudson, Kate Guyonvarch, David Robinson, Kevin Brownlow, Antoine Lange, Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, John R. Freuler', null, 'A look back at Charlie Chaplin''s early life and career, from his rough childhood and music hall success in England to his early Hollywood days and the development of his enormously popular character, the Little Tramp, also called Charlot.', 'A look back at Charlie Chaplin''s early life and career, from his rough childhood and music hall success in England to his early Hollywood days and the development of his enormously popular character, the Little Tramp, also called Charlot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQwzEK1Vn3d4cPaJE3XqBokZ3dg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319352'),
  ('392473547150789984', 'Birth/Rebirth', 2023, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Lee Moss, Chananun Chotrungroj, Tasha Petty', 'Lee Moss, Brendan Jamieson O''Brien', 'Marin Ireland, Judy Reyes, A.J. Lister, Breeda Wool, Monique Gabriela Curnen, LaChanze, Bryant Carroll, Rachel Zeiger-Haag', 'R', 'A single mother and a childless morgue technician are bound together by their relationship to a little girl they have reanimated from the dead.', 'A single mother and a childless morgue technician are bound together by their relationship to a little girl they have reanimated from the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlEhsNfOKhbnfs5NTJ6zOZtoLBb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058638'),
  ('660505091198405158', 'Birthday', 2019, 'Drama', 'Park Si-hwan, Lee Jong-un, Cho Yong-kyu', 'Lee Jong-un', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Jeon Do-yeon, Do Yeong-seo, Yoon Chan-young, Kim Soo-jin, Lee Bong-ryeon, Park Jong-hwan, Kwon So-hyun', null, 'Returning from eight years abroad at work and in prison, Jeong-il struggles to reconnect with his wife and their young daughter, Ye-sol, whom he barely knows.', 'Returning from eight years abroad at work and in prison, Jeong-il struggles to reconnect with his wife and their young daughter, Ye-sol, whom he barely knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brlmQTkZwi1HYBzUf2l4cv1LF17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574297'),
  ('942175106426384058', 'Birthday Boy', 2004, 'Animation', 'Sejong Park', null, null, null, 'Korean War, 1951 Little Manuk is playing on the streets of his village and dreaming of life at the front where his father is a soldier. He returns home to find a parcel on the doorstep and, thinking it is a birthday present, he opens it. But its contents will change his life.', 'Korean War, 1951 Little Manuk is playing on the streets of his village and dreaming of life at the front where his father is a soldier. He returns home to find a parcel on the doorstep and, thinking it is a birthday present, he opens it. But its contents will change his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4h7h3fmsTxybdUKU3PECkLDgmfI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48606'),
  ('275773932265015764', 'Birthday Girl', 2001, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Jez Butterworth, Oliver Stapleton, Simon Hinkly', 'Tom Butterworth, Jez Butterworth', 'Nicole Kidman, Ben Chaplin, Vincent Cassel, Mathieu Kassovitz, Kate Lynn Evans, Stephen Mangan, Alexander Armstrong, Sally Phillips', 'R', 'John is a mild-mannered banker who has never been lucky in love. Fed up with waiting for the right girl to come along, John takes a chance on a Russian mail-order bride arranged via the Internet, where he is introduced to Nadia. John''s fondness for Nadia grows... until the sudden arrival of Nadia''s gregarious cousins makes John realize that he''s in over his head.', 'John is a mild-mannered banker who has never been lucky in love. Fed up with waiting for the right girl to come along, John takes a chance on a Russian mail-order bride arranged via the Internet, where he is introduced to Nadia. John''s fondness for Nadia grows... until the sudden arrival of Nadia''s gregarious cousins makes John realize that he''s in over his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrwCiqQjEm3WqxHXxvAoW4gOsUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2084'),
  ('656332100243271372', 'Birthday Girl', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Noer, Heli Jürisson, Matilde Matvere', 'Michael Noer, Jesper Fink', 'Trine Dyrholm, Flora Ofelia Hofmann Lindahl, Maja Ida Thiele, Herman Tømmeraas, Jenilyn Olivar-Grinkin, Sebastian DeMots, Keith Eric Chappelle, Nathan Popa', null, 'On a cruise ship bound for the Caribbean, 42 year old Nanna has invited her daughter Cille and her best friend on a cruise to celebrate Cille''s 18th birthday. The expectations are high, and they have big plans set for the three days aboard the cruise. But on the first evening, the dream vacation descends a nightmare, and Nanna realizes that in order to get justice, she must take matters into her own hands.', 'On a cruise ship bound for the Caribbean, 42 year old Nanna has invited her daughter Cille and her best friend on a cruise to celebrate Cille''s 18th birthday. The expectations are high, and they have big plans set for the three days aboard the cruise. But on the first evening, the dream vacation descends a nightmare, and Nanna realizes that in order to get justice, she must take matters into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkUtWGKI7O4efZ2yEqDjIj7tGpq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983524'),
  ('269173732718152531', 'Birthmarked', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Emanuel Hoss-Desmarais', 'Marc Tulin', 'Matthew Goode, Toni Collette, Fionnula Flanagan, Michael Smiley, Suzanne Clément, Andreas Apergis, Jadyn Malone, Nathaly Thibault', null, 'Two scientists raise three children contrarily to their genetic tendencies in order to prove the ultimate power of nurture over nature.', 'Two scientists raise three children contrarily to their genetic tendencies in order to prove the ultimate power of nurture over nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OYW8gHVkZYmQs2pJ2sWj4pNSf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476046'),
  ('847567495946527586', 'Birthright', 1938, 'Drama', 'Oscar Micheaux, Robert J. Marshall', 'Oscar Micheaux', 'Carman Newsome, Ethel Moses, Alec Lovejoy, Hazel Diaz, Trixie Smith, W. Herbert Jelley, Ida Forsyne, John Ward', null, 'After graduating from Harvard University, Peter Siner returns to his small Tennessee hometown, where he hopes to start a school for black children.', 'After graduating from Harvard University, Peter Siner returns to his small Tennessee hometown, where he hopes to start a school for black children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCnehBWCm0YqiFTHRJSVwYfIJi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247357'),
  ('1048602033883627757', 'Birthright', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery', 'João Cândido Zacharias, Guilherme Tostes', 'João Cândido Zacharias, Fernando Toste', 'Diego Montez, Yohan Levy, Analú Prestes, Cristina Pereira, Luiza Kosovski, Ana Carbatti, Jimmy London, Gilda Nomacce', null, 'When he learns of his mother’s death, Thomas returns to Brazil with Beni, his partner, and is told he now owns a country house that used to belong to a grandmother he never met. Curious to connect with his family history, they visit the house and Thomas is welcomed by two aunts that treat him like a long-lost child. As Thomas becomes increasingly enchanted with the place, Beni begins to suspect that something lurks beneath the façade of a quiet country life.', 'When he learns of his mother’s death, Thomas returns to Brazil with Beni, his partner, and is told he now owns a country house that used to belong to a grandmother he never met. Curious to connect with his family history, they visit the house and Thomas is welcomed by two aunts that treat him like a long-lost child. As Thomas becomes increasingly enchanted with the place, Beni begins to suspect that something lurks beneath the façade of a quiet country life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvwA6rkBVQY9SMIe2ImfD1PEOCN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140346'),
  ('55583026369053667', 'Bis', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Dominique Farrugia, Rémy Chevrin', 'Nans Delgado, Frédéric Hazan, Dominique Farrugia', 'Franck Dubosc, Kad Merad, Alexandra Lamy, Gérard Darmon, Julien Boisselier, Anne Girouard, Éléonore Bernheim, Antonin Chalon', null, 'Éric and Patrice have been friends since high school. Over the years, they have both taken very different paths: Éric has become a hedonist, has a string of girlfriends and is always on the look out for a new one; Patrice has become a monogamous father with a very ordered life. After a drunken evening, the two childhood friends find themselves cast back into 1986, when they were 17 years old. This return to the past is a dream opportunity to try to change the path their lives will take. What will they do with this second chance?', 'Éric and Patrice have been friends since high school. Over the years, they have both taken very different paths: Éric has become a hedonist, has a string of girlfriends and is always on the look out for a new one; Patrice has become a monogamous father with a very ordered life. After a drunken evening, the two childhood friends find themselves cast back into 1986, when they were 17 years old. This return to the past is a dream opportunity to try to change the path their lives will take. What will they do with this second chance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuW0Qp1Wrnc3NjPslRwKevUKtJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323020'),
  ('524491205263246183', 'Bis zum Ellenbogen', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Matthias Schellenberg, Justus von Dohnányi', 'Justus von Dohnányi', 'Stefan Kurt, Jan Josef Liefers, Justus von Dohnányi, Susanne Wolff, Sophie Stierle, Antoine Monot Jr., Oscar Ortega Sánchez, Katharina Matz', null, 'Sven, a private banker, is enjoying his holiday in Switzerland. Not far from his secluded mountain cabin, dodgy businessman Achim collides with Willi, a claimant on income support, whilst riding his mountain bike. The crash is minor, but both need some rest – in Sven’s mountain cabin.', 'Sven, a private banker, is enjoying his holiday in Switzerland. Not far from his secluded mountain cabin, dodgy businessman Achim collides with Willi, a claimant on income support, whilst riding his mountain bike. The crash is minor, but both need some rest – in Sven’s mountain cabin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGYAVxSL1cQcFgUWE0F80FBe7kM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3962'),
