  ('175294700922071525', 'Bitch Slap', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Rick Jacobson, Stuart Asbjornsen, Mark Wallace', 'Rick Jacobson, Eric Gruendemann', 'Julia Voth, Erin Cummings, America Olivo, Lucy Lawless, Zoë Bell, William Gregory Lee, Michael Hurst, Kevin Sorbo', 'R', 'Three bad girls - a down-and-out stripper, a drug-running killer, and a corporate powerbroker - arrive at a remote desert hideaway to extort and steal $200 million in diamonds from a ruthless underworld kingpin.', 'Three bad girls - a down-and-out stripper, a drug-running killer, and a corporate powerbroker - arrive at a remote desert hideaway to extort and steal $200 million in diamonds from a ruthless underworld kingpin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwpDERT9drTPhvoV8cWzuV6xhdt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26715'),
  ('938394035717347428', 'Bitconned', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Bryan Storkel, Nate Larson, Britton Foster', 'Jonathan Ignatius Green', 'Ray Trapani, Robert Farkas, Sohrab Sharma, Sam Bankman-Fried, Damian Williams', 'R', 'In this true-crime documentary, three guys exploit the freewheeling cryptocurrency market to scam millions from investors and bankroll lavish lifestyles.', 'In this true-crime documentary, three guys exploit the freewheeling cryptocurrency market to scam millions from investors and bankroll lavish lifestyles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDHpIF5mcAkeiv3r8KlMkksr7b9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1213997'),
  ('567310981886567896', 'Bite', 2015, 'Horror', 'Jeff Maher, Chad Archibald', 'Jayme Laforest', 'Elma Begovic, Jordan Gray, Annette Wozniak, Denise Yuen, Tianna Nori, Caroline Palmer, MarieBeth Young, Lawrene Denkers', null, 'While on her bachelorette party getaway, Casey, the bride to be, gets a seemingly harmless bite from an unknown insect. After returning home with cold feet, Casey tries to call off her wedding but before she''s able to, she starts exhibiting insect like traits. Between her physical transformation and her wedding anxiety, Casey succumbs to her new instincts and begins creating a hive that not only houses her translucent eggs, but feeds on the flesh of others. As her transformation becomes complete, Casey discovers that everything can change with a single bite.', 'While on her bachelorette party getaway, Casey, the bride to be, gets a seemingly harmless bite from an unknown insect. After returning home with cold feet, Casey tries to call off her wedding but before she''s able to, she starts exhibiting insect like traits. Between her physical transformation and her wedding anxiety, Casey succumbs to her new instincts and begins creating a hive that not only houses her translucent eggs, but feeds on the flesh of others. As her transformation becomes complete, Casey discovers that everything can change with a single bite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHoqxVKgXUiz0gGQ23AZPPLgUXd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347642'),
  ('508221399955871801', 'Bite the Bullet', 1975, 'Action, Western, Adventure', 'Richard Brooks, Harry Stradling Jr., Charles Bonniwell', 'Richard Brooks', 'Gene Hackman, Candice Bergen, James Coburn, Ben Johnson, Ian Bannen, Jan-Michael Vincent, Dabney Coleman, Sally Kirkland', 'PG', 'At the beginning of the 20th century, a newspaper organizes an endurance horse race : 700 miles to run in a few days. 9 adventurers are competing, among them a woman, Miss Jones, a Mexican, an Englishman, a young cow-boy, an old one and two friends, Sam Clayton and Luke Matthews. All those individualists will learn to respect each other.', 'At the beginning of the 20th century, a newspaper organizes an endurance horse race : 700 miles to run in a few days. 9 adventurers are competing, among them a woman, Miss Jones, a Mexican, an Englishman, a young cow-boy, an old one and two friends, Sam Clayton and Luke Matthews. All those individualists will learn to respect each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tg8EWatD9mwuKTsTJJ5A96oy5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32617'),
  ('553302651037396212', 'Bits & Pieces', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Daniele Cesarano, Antonello Grimaldi, Alessandro Pesci', 'Paolo Marchesini, Daniele Cesarano', 'Monica Bellucci, Asia Argento, Margaret Mazzantini, Luca Barbareschi, Claudio Bisio, Enrico Lo Verso, Nicola Farron, Andrea Occhipinti', null, 'Dive into the Eternal City – see Rome like you’ve never seen it before. Storefront robberies, bizarre murders, career dreamers, and cameos from Italy''s foremost directors and actors feature in this star-studded omnibus tale about life and love.', 'Dive into the Eternal City – see Rome like you’ve never seen it before. Storefront robberies, bizarre murders, career dreamers, and cameos from Italy''s foremost directors and actors feature in this star-studded omnibus tale about life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSVZi2Xhd0ytmsLcpWC71itnMib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59147'),
  ('647417604941476030', 'Bitten', 2008, 'Comedy, Horror, Romance, Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Harvey Glazer, Simon Shohet', 'Tim McGregor, Tyler Levine', 'Jason Mewes, Erica Cox, Richard Fitzpatrick, Jordan Madley, Nick Nicotera, Stuart Stone, Grace Armas, Amy Lynn Grover', 'R', 'A lovelorn paramedic rescues a woman left for dead after a deadly assault. When she refuses to go to the hospital, he takes her in, nurses her back to health and soon falls in love with her. Before long the mysterious woman suffers withdrawal symptoms, leaving the paramedic to believe his newfound love is a drug addict. Coming home to find a blood-drained corpse on his floor, he learns she does indeed have an addiction problem but it''s not to drugs...', 'A lovelorn paramedic rescues a woman left for dead after a deadly assault. When she refuses to go to the hospital, he takes her in, nurses her back to health and soon falls in love with her. Before long the mysterious woman suffers withdrawal symptoms, leaving the paramedic to believe his newfound love is a drug addict. Coming home to find a blood-drained corpse on his floor, he learns she does indeed have an addiction problem but it''s not to drugs...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Uzdlx9m91MvwJWcRAnjxhtv0Rc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17005'),
  ('992988832072368530', 'Bitten', 2024, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Romain de Saint-Blanquat, Martin Roux, Jérôme Briand Gomez', 'Romain de Saint-Blanquat, Romain de Saint-Blanquat', 'Léonie Dahan-Lamort, Lilith Grasmug, Cyril Metzger, Maxime Rohart, Fred Blin', null, '1967, Mardi Gras. Françoise is a seventeen-year-old boarder in an all-girls Catholic high school. Convinced that she has only one night left before her death, she sneaks out with her friend Delphine to attend a costume party and live the night as if it was her last.', '1967, Mardi Gras. Françoise is a seventeen-year-old boarder in an all-girls Catholic high school. Convinced that she has only one night left before her death, she sneaks out with her friend Delphine to attend a costume party and live the night as if it was her last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cR75dH5etlDFORvblAMPZnp4c7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978027'),
  ('1148149028483499999', 'Bitter Christmas', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pedro Almodóvar, Pau Esteve Birba, Alba Bello', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Bárbara Lennie, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Victoria Luengo, Patrick Criado, Milena Smit, Quim Gutiérrez, Rossy de Palma', null, 'After her mother dies in December, advertising director Elsa immerses herself in work to cope. When a panic attack forces her to take a break, she decides to travel to Lanzarote with her friend Patricia. The story of these women run parallel to that of a screenwriter and film director, exploring how life and fiction are inseparably linked, sometimes painfully so.', 'After her mother dies in December, advertising director Elsa immerses herself in work to cope. When a panic attack forces her to take a break, she decides to travel to Lanzarote with her friend Patricia. The story of these women run parallel to that of a screenwriter and film director, exploring how life and fiction are inseparably linked, sometimes painfully so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiPGcHX0YT49nrab76G0bqw3gHW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088548'),
  ('746849742983698567', 'Bitter End of a Sweet Night', 1961, 'Drama', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Takao Narita, Tōichirō Narushima', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Yoichi Maeda', 'Michiko Saga, Masahiko Tsugawa, Hiroko Sugita, Teruyo Yamagami, Reiko Hitomi, Osamu Takizawa, Takamaru Sasaki, Sumiko Hidaka', null, 'An opportunistic department store clerk gets involved with three women and attempts to manipulate them so he can move up the social ladder.', 'An opportunistic department store clerk gets involved with three women and attempts to manipulate them so he can move up the social ladder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTzElQQMa2EHjvZwodosMCbNzSt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97535'),
  ('963092352602591620', 'Bitter Feast', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Joe Maggio, Kathleen Katz, Michael McDonough', 'Joe Maggio', 'Mario Batali, Joshua Leonard, Megan Hilty, James Le Gros, Amy Seimetz, John Speredakos, Larry Fessenden, Tobias Campbell', null, 'A celebrity chef exacts revenge on a food blogger who torpedoes his career.', 'A celebrity chef exacts revenge on a food blogger who torpedoes his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzeZn0t0AtzTNdOHJNE9UbWm2vQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52817'),
  ('1110913281905517337', 'Bitter Flowers', 2018, 'Drama', 'Olivier Meys', 'Maarten Loix, Olivier Meys, Zhou Amei', 'Qi Xi, Xi Wang, Chloe Maayan, Geng Le, Qu Gaowei, Sâm Mirhosseini', null, 'Thirtysomething Chinese-born Lina borrows money to move to Paris to save up money to pursue her entrepreneurial dreams, leaving behind her husband and son in Liaoning province. But once in Europe, nothing goes as planned, and she is forced into a line of work she never would have imagined. When her flighty sister-in-law shows up on her doorstep, Lina becomes inevitably tangled in her own web of lies.', 'Thirtysomething Chinese-born Lina borrows money to move to Paris to save up money to pursue her entrepreneurial dreams, leaving behind her husband and son in Liaoning province. But once in Europe, nothing goes as planned, and she is forced into a line of work she never would have imagined. When her flighty sister-in-law shows up on her doorstep, Lina becomes inevitably tangled in her own web of lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxpa83SMeiMwhrq3agSBsAIe9HB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482865'),
  ('732397685793028274', 'Bitter Harvest', 1963, 'Drama', 'Peter Graham Scott', 'Ted Willis', 'Janet Munro, John Stride, Thora Hird, Alan Badel, Vanda Godsell, Norman Bird, Barbara Ferris, Allan Cuthbertson', null, 'A pretty young woman will do anything to escape her deadly dull existence in the backlots of Wales. But when she reaches the bright lights of London is the price too high?', 'A pretty young woman will do anything to escape her deadly dull existence in the backlots of Wales. But when she reaches the bright lights of London is the price too high?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p04Q2dOgn2SAUD4iMjLKqFGZbY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180641'),
  ('4882662315203682', 'Bitter Harvest', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Duane Clark, Paul Childs, Adam Kane', 'Randall Fontana', 'Stephen Baldwin, Patsy Kensit, Jennifer Rubin, Adam Baldwin, M. Emmet Walsh, James Crittenden, Art Evans, Ed Morgan', 'R', 'Travis has just buried his father, when Kelly, an attractive hitchhiker walks into his life. At the same time, another attractive blonde, Jolene, starts taking an interest in Travis. Both women are secretly after something.', 'Travis has just buried his father, when Kelly, an attractive hitchhiker walks into his life. At the same time, another attractive blonde, Jolene, starts taking an interest in Travis. Both women are secretly after something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsybDx6vyo30tPjvS0g7B32bVCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233390'),
  ('156325833481693567', 'Bitter Harvest', 2017, 'War, Drama, History, Romance', 'Lauro David Chartrand-DelValle, George Mendeluk, D. Dominic Devine', 'George Mendeluk', 'Max Irons, Samantha Barks, Terence Stamp, Barry Pepper, Tamer Hassan, Aneurin Barnard, Anastasiya Ostreinova, Tom Austen', 'R', 'Set between the two World Wars and based on true historical events, Bitter Harvest conveys the untold story of the Holodomor, the genocidal famine engineered by the tyrant Joseph Stalin. The film displays a powerful tale of love, honour, rebellion and survival at a time when Ukraine was forced to adjust to the horrifying territorial ambitions of the burgeoning Soviet Union.', 'Set between the two World Wars and based on true historical events, Bitter Harvest conveys the untold story of the Holodomor, the genocidal famine engineered by the tyrant Joseph Stalin. The film displays a powerful tale of love, honour, rebellion and survival at a time when Ukraine was forced to adjust to the horrifying territorial ambitions of the burgeoning Soviet Union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6qOtH7LWsv4UaxAfZ5uQjDnzBE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403390'),
  ('1083112834220602295', 'Bitter Lake', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Adam Curtis', 'Adam Curtis', 'Adam Curtis, George H. W. Bush, George W. Bush, Joanne Herring, Ronald Reagan', null, 'An experimental documentary that explores Saudi Arabia''s relationship with the U.S. and the role this has played in the war in Afghanistan.', 'An experimental documentary that explores Saudi Arabia''s relationship with the U.S. and the role this has played in the war in Afghanistan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TIXHoByfOPv7d88cM4OGxhTUx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321109'),
  ('282461451913656897', 'Bitter Money', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Wang Bing', null, null, null, 'In a fast growing city of East China, migrants have been arriving and living for a dream of a better life. But what they find there is little opportunities and poor living conditions that push people, even couples, into violent and oppressive relations. Xiao Min, Ling Ling and Lao Yeh are some of the characters of this bitter chronicle of today China.', 'In a fast growing city of East China, migrants have been arriving and living for a dream of a better life. But what they find there is little opportunities and poor living conditions that push people, even couples, into violent and oppressive relations. Xiao Min, Ling Ling and Lao Yeh are some of the characters of this bitter chronicle of today China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEKkV7NTqOw4Pbfc39yjA1mpYpJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412366'),
  ('607975375695906228', 'Bitter Moon', 1992, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Tonino Delli Colli, Roman Polanski, Jean-Michel Ducourty', 'Roman Polanski, Gérard Brach, John Brownjohn', 'Peter Coyote, Emmanuelle Seigner, Hugh Grant, Kristin Scott Thomas, Victor Banerjee, Sophie Patel, Patrick Albenque, Smilja Mihailovitch', 'R', 'A passenger on a cruise ship develops an irresistible infatuation with an eccentric paraplegic''s wife.', 'A passenger on a cruise ship develops an irresistible infatuation with an eccentric paraplegic''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bW7E4cLWh0elRRbp2VCrtXrY1if.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10497'),
  ('881462688301505591', 'Bitter Rice', 1949, 'Drama, Crime', 'Giuseppe De Santis, Piero Nelli, Basilio Franchina', 'Giuseppe De Santis, Corrado Alvaro, Carlo Musso', 'Doris Dowling, Silvana Mangano, Vittorio Gassman, Raf Vallone, Checco Rissone, Nico Pepe, Adriana Sivieri, Lia Corelli', null, 'Francesca and Walter are two-bit criminals in Northern Italy, and, in an effort to avoid the police, Francesca joins a group of women rice workers. She meets the voluptuous peasant rice worker, Silvana, and the soon-to-be-discharged soldier, Marco. Walter follows her to the rice fields, and the four characters become involved in a complex plot involving robbery, love, and murder.', 'Francesca and Walter are two-bit criminals in Northern Italy, and, in an effort to avoid the police, Francesca joins a group of women rice workers. She meets the voluptuous peasant rice worker, Silvana, and the soon-to-be-discharged soldier, Marco. Walter follows her to the rice fields, and the four characters become involved in a complex plot involving robbery, love, and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vvbZgbkfE7urqQXRNiONmvYTtF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31058'),
  ('575873853082364410', 'Bitter Sweet', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Shogo Kusano, Akiko Haraya, Takashi Komatsu', 'Tomohiro Otoshi', 'Haruna Kawaguchi, Kento Hayashi, Yasushi Fuchikami, Mackenyu, Hiyori Sakurada, Kazuto Otsuki, Hideo Nakano, Mako Ishino', null, 'Maki, a creative executive with a deep-seated loathing for vegetables, meets Nagisa, a closeted gay vegetarian with amazing cooking skills and they end up as roommates. Being complete opposites, the two initially clash. But Maki falls for Nagisa and his food over time. As they begin accepting the other as they are, a unique relationship flourishes.', 'Maki, a creative executive with a deep-seated loathing for vegetables, meets Nagisa, a closeted gay vegetarian with amazing cooking skills and they end up as roommates. Being complete opposites, the two initially clash. But Maki falls for Nagisa and his food over time. As they begin accepting the other as they are, a unique relationship flourishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfnmbK3bNWSOwC4QXpoK7zeTbt2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447040'),
  ('886086558427562435', 'Bitter Victory', 1957, 'Drama, War', 'Nicholas Ray, Édouard Luntz, Christian Ferry', 'René Hardy, Nicholas Ray, Gavin Lambert', 'Richard Burton, Curd Jürgens, Ruth Roman, Christopher Lee, Raymond Pellegrin, Anthony Bushell, Alfred Burke, Ramón de Larrocha', null, 'During the second world war, two British officers, Brand and Leith, who have never seen combat, are assigned a vital mission. Their relationship and the operation are complicated by the arrival of Brand''s wife, who had a tryst with Leith years earlier.', 'During the second world war, two British officers, Brand and Leith, who have never seen combat, are assigned a vital mission. Their relationship and the operation are complicated by the arrival of Brand''s wife, who had a tryst with Leith years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8i6gzqhFqeDyddzv68P0ZzB9Jx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68850'),
  ('585269332786937820', 'Bitter Victory', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama', 'François Favrat, Giovanni Fiore Coltellacci', 'François Favrat', 'Clovis Cornillac, Christian Clavier, Sami Bouajila, Vimala Pons, Valérie Benguigui, Marilyne Canto, Michel Aumont, Éric Berger', null, 'Xavier Alvarez est un petit architecte d''Aix-en-Provence en recherche perpétuelle de reconnaissance sociale. Il s''est fait tout seul et prospère, mais ne parvient pas à décrocher de gros marchés publics pour assouvir ses rêves de grandeur. Il décide donc de se lancer corps, âme et biens dans la campagne de Vincent Cluzel, le candidat outsider à la mairie, persuadé qu''il renverra l''ascenseur en cas de victoire. À force d''énergie et de ruse, il parvient à discréditer le favori et à faire élire son protégé. Mais leur amitié sincère, nouée dans la conquête du pouvoir, se heurte alors aux limites des intérêts et de l''ambition.', 'Xavier Alvarez est un petit architecte d''Aix-en-Provence en recherche perpétuelle de reconnaissance sociale. Il s''est fait tout seul et prospère, mais ne parvient pas à décrocher de gros marchés publics pour assouvir ses rêves de grandeur. Il décide donc de se lancer corps, âme et biens dans la campagne de Vincent Cluzel, le candidat outsider à la mairie, persuadé qu''il renverra l''ascenseur en cas de victoire. À force d''énergie et de ruse, il parvient à discréditer le favori et à faire élire son protégé. Mais leur amitié sincère, nouée dans la conquête du pouvoir, se heurte alors aux limites des intérêts et de l''ambition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8Fq9VWJwDpERpKTdrWuYG9Xuqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52624'),
  ('417718101354499200', 'Bitter Years', 2019, 'Drama', 'Gianmarco Rossetti, Andrea Adriatico', 'Andrea Adriatico, Stefano Casi, Grazia Verasani', 'Nicola Di Benedetto, Sandra Ceccarelli, Antonio Catania, Tobia De Angelis, Lorenzo Balducci, Matteo Andrea Barbaria, Adriana Barbieri, Giuseppe Brunetti', null, 'A drama film based on the life of Mario Mieli, a leading figure in the Italian gay movement of the 1970s.', 'A drama film based on the life of Mario Mieli, a leading figure in the Italian gay movement of the 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUPnuk9C2aEcpqoi7rnAlgLtEuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649735'),
  ('621083029581358763', 'Bitterly!', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Zhora Kryzhovnikov, Evgeny Dostal, Yuliya Marina', 'Nikolai Kulikov, Zhora Kryzhovnikov, Alexey Kazakov', 'Yuliya Aleksandrova, Egor Koreshkov, Sergey Svetlakov, Yan Tsapnik, Elena Valyushkina, Vasily Kortukov, Yuliya Sules, Danila Yakushev', null, 'Progressive and talented Natasha and Roma dream of a European wedding by the sea - but Natasha''s stepfather procured a different scenario. Rough official of the city administration considers the celebration as a springboard for their careers, and seeks to arrange all the «how to». Young awaits an unforgettable evening in the restaurant «Golden» with a complete set of the tedious rites. Not fight, the guys decide to spend their dream wedding in secret from conservative relatives. But by accident both celebration come together.', 'Progressive and talented Natasha and Roma dream of a European wedding by the sea - but Natasha''s stepfather procured a different scenario. Rough official of the city administration considers the celebration as a springboard for their careers, and seeks to arrange all the «how to». Young awaits an unforgettable evening in the restaurant «Golden» with a complete set of the tedious rites. Not fight, the guys decide to spend their dream wedding in secret from conservative relatives. But by accident both celebration come together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WkssY4QM8Vs7ets0YVptnYSW3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229974'),
  ('714156075533704212', 'Bittersweet', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Khaled Marei, Mohamed Al Manadely, Sameh Selim', 'Khaled Diab', 'Ahmed Helmy, Edward, Lotfy Labib, Inam Salusah, Tarek ElAmir, Amy Samir Ghanem, Mohamed Shaheen, Yasser El Tobgy', null, 'An Egyptian-American returns to his homeland after twenty years abroad, filled with nostalgia and high hopes. But as he reconnects with his roots, he finds himself caught between two worlds—and begins to experience the reality of a country he thought he knew.', 'An Egyptian-American returns to his homeland after twenty years abroad, filled with nostalgia and high hopes. But as he reconnects with his roots, he finds himself caught between two worlds—and begins to experience the reality of a country he thought he knew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VftuMgC4O9uDJZGA6XzNety5W1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84250'),
  ('96444153042677777', 'BitterSweet', 1999, 'Thriller, Romance, Action', 'Luca Bercovici, Adam Kane', 'Rick Bloggs', 'James Russo, Eric Roberts, Angie Everhart, Brian Wimmer, Joe Penny, Francia DiMase, Lenny Citrano, Joanne Baron', 'R', 'A young co-ed who''s just been release from prison for a crime she didn''t commit plots her revenge against a former lover, who was the real culprit, with the help of a policeman.', 'A young co-ed who''s just been release from prison for a crime she didn''t commit plots her revenge against a former lover, who was the real culprit, with the help of a policeman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmz4vSBE1UgIp30JI71ExvdEU2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151896'),
  ('605416806368174410', 'Biutiful', 2010, 'Drama', 'Alejandro González Iñárritu, Rodrigo Prieto', 'Alejandro González Iñárritu, Armando Bo, Nicolás Giacobone', 'Javier Bardem, Maricel Álvarez, Hanaa Bouchaib, Guillermo Estrella, Eduard Fernández, Cheikh Ndiaye, Diaryatou Daff, Cheng Taishen', 'R', 'This is a story of a man in free fall. On the road to redemption, darkness lights his way. Connected with the afterlife, Uxbal is a tragic hero and father of two who''s sensing the danger of death. He struggles with a tainted reality and a fate that works against him in order to forgive, for love, and forever.', 'This is a story of a man in free fall. On the road to redemption, darkness lights his way. Connected with the afterlife, Uxbal is a tragic hero and father of two who''s sensing the danger of death. He struggles with a tainted reality and a fate that works against him in order to forgive, for love, and forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BLshBMp8INRDhvfuKwxMlHDIIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45958'),
  ('869951483672943518', 'Biwi No.1', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Dhawan', 'Rumi Jaffery', 'Salman Khan, Anil Kapoor, Karisma Kapoor, Sushmita Sen, Tabu, Himani Shivpuri, Saif Ali Khan, Amitabh Bachchan', null, 'Two adorable kids, a quirky mother-in-law and a happy-go-lucky friend help a heartbroken wife bring a straying husband back from the other woman''s tangled embrace.', 'Two adorable kids, a quirky mother-in-law and a happy-go-lucky friend help a heartbroken wife bring a straying husband back from the other woman''s tangled embrace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4c787y8j6XCuJHDv13Yuwu0FHmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161226'),
  ('667110172164147169', 'Bix', 1991, 'Drama', 'Pupi Avati, Pasquale Rachini, Francesco Russo', 'Pupi Avati, Antonio Avati, Lino Patruno', 'Bryant Weeks, Emile B. Levisetti, Julia Ewing, Mark Collver, Romano Orzari, Debbon Ayer, Gayla Goehl, Michael T. Henderson', null, 'Biopic of troubled jazz musician/composer Bix Beiderbecke (1903-1931), who played with the Paul Whiteman band, among others.', 'Biopic of troubled jazz musician/composer Bix Beiderbecke (1903-1931), who played with the Paul Whiteman band, among others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJlswDTAvuHLObX2GNyLaCyf8iU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64948'),
  ('68273731916699434', 'Bixa Travesty', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Kiko Goifman, Claudia Priscilla, Karla Meneghetti Vaz da Costa', 'Linn da Quebrada, Claudia Priscilla, Kiko Goifman', 'Linn da Quebrada, Jup do Bairro, Liniker, Assucena Assucena, Raquel Virgínia, Ney Matogrosso', null, 'A portrait of transgender musician and artist Linn da Quebrada, who uses her body and performances as weapons to fight sexism, homophobia, and racism.', 'A portrait of transgender musician and artist Linn da Quebrada, who uses her body and performances as weapons to fight sexism, homophobia, and racism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kg1N7e38hmzXOKcj9xCnUFEHQY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493659'),
  ('90554169151507380', 'Bixler High Private Eye', 2019, 'Adventure, Family, TV Movie', 'Leslie Kolins Small', 'Christopher Baldi, Danny Kallis, Michele J. Wolff', 'Jace Norman, Samiyah Womack, Ed Begley Jr., Ariel Martin, Terryn Westbrook, Marissa Morgan, Ashley Michelle Brenner, Mike C. Nelson', null, 'Teenage detective Xander DeWitt is the new kid at Bixler Valley High, and he''s there to unravel the biggest mystery of his life- the truth about his missing father. But in order to crack this case, Xander must learn to work with a partner- fearless investigative reporter Kenzie Messina.', 'Teenage detective Xander DeWitt is the new kid at Bixler Valley High, and he''s there to unravel the biggest mystery of his life- the truth about his missing father. But in order to crack this case, Xander must learn to work with a partner- fearless investigative reporter Kenzie Messina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqLQbg1aFLMxlPxfHDyIVC4ejdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567966'),
  ('545956419911598588', 'Bizans Oyunları: Geym of Bizans', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Gani Müjde', 'Gani Müjde', 'Gürkan Uygun, Tolgahan Sayışman, Gonca Vuslateri, Tuvana Türkay, Ünal Yeter, Murat Dalkılıç, Nazmi Kırık, Altuğ Yücel', null, 'Fed up with South America’s heat, the Maya, lured by rumors of golden soil, migrate to Anatolia, settling near Bağcılar and blending their advanced techniques with Turkish tribal culture. Their rapid rise, however, alarms Byzantium: peace-loving Emperor Klitor III is an avid Maya admirer, but his scheming wife, Empress Klitorya V, and his brother Muhteris conspire to eliminate Klitor, then abduct all Maya women to the imperial dungeons. Their twisted plan? By “improving” Byzantine lineage with Maya genetics while the men take local wives—“only God should know loneliness”—they intend to dilute the Maya’s flawless DNA into common stock.', 'Fed up with South America’s heat, the Maya, lured by rumors of golden soil, migrate to Anatolia, settling near Bağcılar and blending their advanced techniques with Turkish tribal culture. Their rapid rise, however, alarms Byzantium: peace-loving Emperor Klitor III is an avid Maya admirer, but his scheming wife, Empress Klitorya V, and his brother Muhteris conspire to eliminate Klitor, then abduct all Maya women to the imperial dungeons. Their twisted plan? By “improving” Byzantine lineage with Maya genetics while the men take local wives—“only God should know loneliness”—they intend to dilute the Maya’s flawless DNA into common stock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsk4vQaQtMhG9b8kp7pd48pysa4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389702'),
  ('96147104004499149', 'Bizarre', 1970, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Antony Balch, David McDonald, Tay Stormett', 'Maureen Owen, Martin Locke, Elliott Stein', 'Richard Schulman, Janet Spearman, Dorothy Grumbar, Anthony Rowlands, Norma Eden, George Herbert, Kenneth Benda, Yvonne Quenet', 'R', 'An offbeat anthology film, mix of sex, horror and humor filmed in varied styles.', 'An offbeat anthology film, mix of sex, horror and humor filmed in varied styles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olQaUZtPLZbU0UyZeZnhYkBis4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107121'),
