  ('105999515768823617', 'Bizarre, Bizarre', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Marcel Carné, Eugen Schüfftan', 'Jacques Prévert', 'Françoise Rosay, Michel Simon, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Louis Jouvet, Nadine Vogel, Henri Guisol, Jenny Burnay, Agnès Capri', 'NR', 'A French farce set in Victorian London where a botanist and his wife get into trouble when they pretend to go missing in order to hide from their sanctimonious cousin – an Anglican bishop who is leading a campaign against such writing.', 'A French farce set in Victorian London where a botanist and his wife get into trouble when they pretend to go missing in order to hide from their sanctimonious cousin – an Anglican bishop who is leading a campaign against such writing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5Pe2U3R4AZkoMImTdMk0H581UX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59950'),
  ('515775891520458493', 'Bize Müsaade', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Giray Altınok, Mehmet Başbaran', 'Giray Altınok', 'Giray Altınok, Fırat Albayram, Sami Aksu, Fatih Al, Ferit Aktuğ, Ferdi Sancar, Deniz Karaoğlu, Gizem Ünsal', null, 'In the film, we follow the story of three close friends who work in the entertainment industry. The three friends set out to provide a consulting service that is a little out of the ordinary, but they witness an event they should not have seen. As a result, they find themselves trapped in an unexpected situation.', 'In the film, we follow the story of three close friends who work in the entertainment industry. The three friends set out to provide a consulting service that is a little out of the ordinary, but they witness an event they should not have seen. As a result, they find themselves trapped in an unexpected situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peRkKCD2VUKO2YmG8TfRflUjvbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:859555'),
  ('663368540685729596', 'Bizim Köyün Şarkısı', 2018, 'Comedy, Family', 'Tuğçe Soysop', 'Uğur Gövercin, Cihan Deniz, Onur Ümit', 'Berat Efe Parlar, Esat Polat Güler, Dora Dalgıç, Tansel Öngel, Güneş Sayın, Sezai Aydın, Alperen Efe Esmer, İhsan Berk Aydın', null, 'Çınar, who lives in Istanbul, dreams of participating in a music competition. However, his plans are disrupted by his father''s decision to return to the village. Çınar and his ultra-intelligent sister Zeynep find themselves in hilarious situations as they try to adapt to village life. Eventually, the friends they make far from the city will show them the importance of friendship. Will Çınar and Zeynep be able to adjust to village life? And will they be able to defeat the city dwellers in the music competition with their new friends and achieve their dreams?', 'Çınar, who lives in Istanbul, dreams of participating in a music competition. However, his plans are disrupted by his father''s decision to return to the village. Çınar and his ultra-intelligent sister Zeynep find themselves in hilarious situations as they try to adapt to village life. Eventually, the friends they make far from the city will show them the importance of friendship. Will Çınar and Zeynep be able to adjust to village life? And will they be able to defeat the city dwellers in the music competition with their new friends and achieve their dreams?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JOjzYTeJMOUuRDuQCkXdoqTeuQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528364'),
  ('1140526899998563708', 'Bıçkın', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Orhan Aksoy, Evin Esen, İbrahim Gündüz', 'İlhan Engin, Orhan Aksoy', 'Kemal Sunal, Nilgün Belgün, Necati Bilgiç, Leman Çıdamlı, Nevzat Okçugil, Ayten Erman, Necdet Yakın, Hüseyin Kutman', null, 'Ali, who looks exactly like the famous actor Kemal Sunal, is in love with his neighbor Zehra. However, Zehra, who is a fan of Kemal Sunal, does not reciprocate Ali''s love. Despite Ali''s insistence, she rejects him. Ali will temporarily take Kemal Sunal''s place in order to be with Zehra.', 'Ali, who looks exactly like the famous actor Kemal Sunal, is in love with his neighbor Zehra. However, Zehra, who is a fan of Kemal Sunal, does not reciprocate Ali''s love. Despite Ali''s insistence, she rejects him. Ali will temporarily take Kemal Sunal''s place in order to be with Zehra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7Vkf5xtS1sVbqEErt7e80CewrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80839'),
  ('979953291320501810', 'BKO: Bangkok Knockout', 2010, 'Action', 'Panna Rittikrai, Pipat Pyakha, Nonthakorn Thaweesuk', 'Dojit Hongthong, Jonathon Siminoe', 'Sorapong Chatree, Kiattisak Udomnak, Krittiya Lardphanna, Supakson Ruengsomboon, Pimchanok Luevisadpaibul, Chatchapol Kulsiriwuthichai, Sarawoot Kumsorn, Sumret Muengput', 'R', 'A group of martial arts students are enjoying a reunion party when a bomb goes off in the building. When they wake up, some of their friends have been kidnapped and they soon find a group of assassins coming after them. The only way to survive is to fight their way out.', 'A group of martial arts students are enjoying a reunion party when a bomb goes off in the building. When they wake up, some of their friends have been kidnapped and they soon find a group of assassins coming after them. The only way to survive is to fight their way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GcXOHBEHqfaT3bYTb56Vd4zbEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64205'),
