  ('598354998173108815', 'Black', 2024, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Balasubramani KG', 'Balasubramani KG', 'Jiiva, Priya Bhavani Shankar, Vivek Prasanna, Shah Ra, Swayam Siddha, Yog Jappie, Sindhuri, Raja Rudrakodi', null, 'Vasanth and Aaranya, a couple move into a serene row house, eager for peace and privacy, but a violent storm leaves them trapped inside, unsettling supernatural disturbances threaten to unravel their marriage. Vasanth must uncover the truth behind these supernatural occurrences before everything falls apart.', 'Vasanth and Aaranya, a couple move into a serene row house, eager for peace and privacy, but a violent storm leaves them trapped inside, unsettling supernatural disturbances threaten to unravel their marriage. Vasanth must uncover the truth behind these supernatural occurrences before everything falls apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIoIQ4JX8wNQWynnwhghtgkAu0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1340332'),
  ('119807240624359317', 'Black ''47', 2018, 'Drama', 'Lance Daly, Declan Quinn, Ray Kenny', 'Pierce Ryan, P.J. Dillon, Lance Daly', 'Hugo Weaving, James Frecheville, Stephen Rea, Freddie Fox, Barry Keoghan, Moe Dunford, Sarah Greene, Jim Broadbent', 'R', 'In 1847, when Ireland is in the grip of the Great Famine that has ravaged the country for two long years, Feeney, a hardened Irish Ranger who has been fighting for the British Army abroad, returns home to reunite with his estranged family, only to discover the cruelest reality, a black land where death reigns.', 'In 1847, when Ireland is in the grip of the Great Famine that has ravaged the country for two long years, Feeney, a hardened Irish Ranger who has been fighting for the British Army abroad, returns home to reunite with his estranged family, only to discover the cruelest reality, a black land where death reigns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZiu9RIcMeQLUaDVqQffQTl6bhy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438145'),
  ('745936452096589591', 'Black & White', 1999, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Yuri Zeltser, Phil Parmet', 'Yuri Zeltser, Leon Zeltser', 'Rory Cochrane, Gina Gershon, Ron Silver, Alison Eastwood, Ross Partridge, James Handy, Carl Anthony Payne II, Ashley Tucker', 'R', 'Chris O''Brien, devote Catholic and rookie cop with LAPD, is assigned to partner with the hard-edged, street-smart Nora Hugosian. A serial killer is loose, and all the victims are low-life guys whom Nora has dealt with. So, when the tire tracks of a police car are found at a murder scene, she''s the prime suspect of internal affairs investigator Simon Hertzel...', 'Chris O''Brien, devote Catholic and rookie cop with LAPD, is assigned to partner with the hard-edged, street-smart Nora Hugosian. A serial killer is loose, and all the victims are low-life guys whom Nora has dealt with. So, when the tire tracks of a police car are found at a murder scene, she''s the prime suspect of internal affairs investigator Simon Hertzel...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyfIYhT8NUDdZtW8Qq2un4K7Ze0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66166'),
  ('611847724128242646', 'Black & White: The Dawn of Assault', 2012, 'Comedy, Action', 'Tsai Yueh-Hsun, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Kelly Chen, Tsai Yueh-Hsun', 'Mark Chao You-Ting, AngelaBaby, Huang Bo, Terri Kwan, Leon Dai, Alex To, Ken Lin, Dean Fujioka', null, 'A policeman, who is fearless to death, can do anything for just one truth, while a gangster, who fears death the most, has drew life threats from his risky action all for love. One policeman and one gangster can be great partners that you have never imagined. Somehow, rescue of the world now is entirely relying on the partners. Within 36 hours, they must resolve the crisis that could destroy the Harbor City...', 'A policeman, who is fearless to death, can do anything for just one truth, while a gangster, who fears death the most, has drew life threats from his risky action all for love. One policeman and one gangster can be great partners that you have never imagined. Somehow, rescue of the world now is entirely relying on the partners. Within 36 hours, they must resolve the crisis that could destroy the Harbor City...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7rStRxfNNgzQmZwiijR2rd0U39.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137400'),
  ('712211798592968248', 'Black & White: The Dawn of Justice', 2014, 'Action', 'Tsai Yueh-Hsun, Jai Ip', 'Tsai Yueh-Hsun, Yu Hsiao-hui', 'Mark Chao You-Ting, Lin Gengxin, Janine Chang Chun-Ning, Shiou Chieh-kai, Huang Bo, Jason Tsou, Terri Kwan, Gulnezer Bextiyar', null, 'Police officer in the Southern Precinct, WU Ying-xiong, has been revered as a hero in the Harbor City ever since he stopped the terrorists on a Boeing 777 airplane and kept the city safe. Unfortunately, the peace is only temporary… Panic spreads the whole city as a series of bomb explosions happen within hours and this is just the beginning of a tight-knit conspiracy. Facing the unprecedented crisis, the two-men team of totally opposite characteristics is the only hope to reverse the situation. Nonetheless, when moral standards are turned upside down, what faith should they keep to maintain the so-called justice?', 'Police officer in the Southern Precinct, WU Ying-xiong, has been revered as a hero in the Harbor City ever since he stopped the terrorists on a Boeing 777 airplane and kept the city safe. Unfortunately, the peace is only temporary… Panic spreads the whole city as a series of bomb explosions happen within hours and this is just the beginning of a tight-knit conspiracy. Facing the unprecedented crisis, the two-men team of totally opposite characteristics is the only hope to reverse the situation. Nonetheless, when moral standards are turned upside down, what faith should they keep to maintain the so-called justice?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxWwKOwUWmXbhGIPrSLNEPwpR1Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296777'),
  ('1057636120974277081', 'Black Adam', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Virginia Berg, Yuri Bartoli, Robert Aguirre', 'Adam Sztykiel, Sohrab Noshirvani, Rory Haines', 'Dwayne Johnson, Aldis Hodge, Noah Centineo, Sarah Shahi, Quintessa Swindell, Marwan Kenzari, Mo Amer, Bodhi Sabongui', 'PG-13', 'Nearly 5,000 years after he was bestowed with the almighty powers of the Egyptian gods—and imprisoned just as quickly—Black Adam is freed from his earthly tomb, ready to unleash his unique form of justice on the modern world.', 'Nearly 5,000 years after he was bestowed with the almighty powers of the Egyptian gods—and imprisoned just as quickly—Black Adam is freed from his earthly tomb, ready to unleash his unique form of justice on the modern world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCtreCr4xiYEWDQTebybolIh6Xe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436270'),
  ('143816912759871229', 'Black Adam: Saviour or Destroyer?', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Dwayne Johnson, Aldis Hodge, Noah Centineo, Quintessa Swindell, Pierce Brosnan', null, 'Ahead of the release of upcoming fantasy film ‘Black Adam’, sit down with Dwayne Johnson as he discusses his starring role as the eponymous superhero.', 'Ahead of the release of upcoming fantasy film ‘Black Adam’, sit down with Dwayne Johnson as he discusses his starring role as the eponymous superhero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLoBwQ1TrNgsTul3QV0UkF9YLk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1040330'),
  ('1112654143194866306', 'Black and Blue', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Paul Shapiro, Jonnie Katz', null, 'Mary Stuart Masterson, Anthony LaPaglia, Will Rothhaar, Sam Robards, Sabrina Grdevich, Beau Starr', null, 'After a woman''s husband beats and abuses her, she and her son join the witness protection program and move away secretly.', 'After a woman''s husband beats and abuses her, she and her son join the witness protection program and move away secretly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7P27pxGcgzvnMNH04QgxJpsQaft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233786'),
  ('155760969158874028', 'Black and Blue', 2019, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Kevin O''Neil, Deon Taylor, Dante Spinotti', 'Peter A. Dowling', 'Naomie Harris, Tyrese Gibson, Frank Grillo, Mike Colter, Reid Scott, Beau Knapp, Nafessa Williams, James Moses Black', 'R', 'Rookie cop Alicia West, an Army veteran, inadvertently captures the murder of a young drug dealer on her body cam. After realizing that the murder was committed by corrupt cops, she teams up with the one person from her community who is willing to help her as she tries to escape both the criminals out for revenge and the police who are desperate to destroy the incriminating footage.', 'Rookie cop Alicia West, an Army veteran, inadvertently captures the murder of a young drug dealer on her body cam. After realizing that the murder was committed by corrupt cops, she teams up with the one person from her community who is willing to help her as she tries to escape both the criminals out for revenge and the police who are desperate to destroy the incriminating footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cSHEKYYP8Dpi4o1iBVd4U75FYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:578189'),
  ('728178479420570257', 'Black and Tan', 1929, 'Music, Drama', 'Dudley Murphy, Dal Clawson', 'Dudley Murphy', 'Duke Ellington, Barney Bigard, Wellman Braud, Joe ''Tricky Sam'' Nanton, Edgar Connor, Alec Lovejoy, Fredi Washington, Arthur Whetsol', null, 'Duke Ellington plays hot jazz in a fictional story that finds him down on his luck; he tries in vain to dissuade his friend, dancer Fredi Washington, from working with heart trouble even though it means work for his band. Sure enough, she collapses on stage...', 'Duke Ellington plays hot jazz in a fictional story that finds him down on his luck; he tries in vain to dissuade his friend, dancer Fredi Washington, from working with heart trouble even though it means work for his band. Sure enough, she collapses on stage...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9zciO8mWXetOB9YeBLhLQYxUfb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144615'),
  ('208141839362726449', 'Black and White', 1932, 'Animation', 'Leonid Amalrik, Ivan Ivanov-Vano', 'Iosif Sklyut', null, null, 'The film addresses issues of racism in the Jim Crow American South. Themes of racial injustice, racial violence, working-class solidarity dominate the film. It depicts black men working in a field, walking in chains, sitting behind bars, and being executed in an electric chair. In most scenes, a white authority figure is seen whipping or guarding the men.', 'The film addresses issues of racism in the Jim Crow American South. Themes of racial injustice, racial violence, working-class solidarity dominate the film. It depicts black men working in a field, walking in chains, sitting behind bars, and being executed in an electric chair. In most scenes, a white authority figure is seen whipping or guarding the men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdJrYJGZw8boEIMUH0fB31ktEeB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157474'),
  ('928376561964146373', 'Black and White', 1999, 'Drama', 'James Toback, David M. Ferrara, Vince P. Maggio', 'James Toback', 'Robert Downey Jr., Scott Caan, Stacy Edwards, Allan Houston, Gaby Hoffmann, Jared Leto, Claudia Schiffer, Brooke Shields', 'R', 'Rich Bower is an up-and-coming star in the hip-hop world. Everyone wants to be around him, including Raven and her fellow upper-class white high school friends. The growing appeal of black culture among white teens fascinates documentary filmmaker Sam Donager, who sets out to chronicle it with her husband, Terry. But before Bower was a rapper, he was a gangster, and his criminal past comes back to haunt him and all those around him.', 'Rich Bower is an up-and-coming star in the hip-hop world. Everyone wants to be around him, including Raven and her fellow upper-class white high school friends. The growing appeal of black culture among white teens fascinates documentary filmmaker Sam Donager, who sets out to chronicle it with her husband, Terry. But before Bower was a rapper, he was a gangster, and his criminal past comes back to haunt him and all those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzFgLnuvC7IngemxqpplSx1Zq8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38809'),
  ('617898035627591461', 'Black and White', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Cristina Comencini, Fabio Cianchetti, Francesca Polic Greco', 'Giulia Calenda, Maddalena Ravagli, Cristina Comencini', 'Fabio Volo, Ambra Angiolini, Aïssa Maïga, Ériq Ebouaney, Katia Ricciarelli, Anna Bonaiuto, Teresa Saponangelo, Franco Branciaroli', null, 'Racial integration is Elena''s profession and passion, not only filling her working day as a cultural mediator assisting immigrants, but spilling over into her home life as well. All too often her husband Carlo must attend charity events where he feels distinctly out of place. During one of these evenings, Carlo meets Nadine, a beautiful black woman.', 'Racial integration is Elena''s profession and passion, not only filling her working day as a cultural mediator assisting immigrants, but spilling over into her home life as well. All too often her husband Carlo must attend charity events where he feels distinctly out of place. During one of these evenings, Carlo meets Nadine, a beautiful black woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szfT2A2hdLUwGOs2RNja40CI8jq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56974'),
  ('914203246269245971', 'Black and White', 2010, 'Drama', 'Ahmet Boyacıoğlu', null, 'Tuncel Kurtiz, Nejat İşler, Erkan Can, Şevval Sam, Taner Birsel, Derya Alabora, Almıla Uluer', null, 'A painter with a turbulent history, fiercely committed to his ideals and still averse to settling down despite his 70 years; a lawyer who packed in his job after suffering a heart attack and now pursues a quiet life looking after his pet snail; a doctor already disenchanted with his profession and now discarded by his wife; a career woman braving life on her own, who has made loneliness a life style. These characters are all patrons of Black & White, an Ankara bar that has been around for 25 years, and in a sense the bar is their last haven. The owner, meanwhile, is the irritable, easily offended but utterly lovable Faruk... Black & White is a film about the awareness of growing old, friendship, sensitivity and the finer details of life.', 'A painter with a turbulent history, fiercely committed to his ideals and still averse to settling down despite his 70 years; a lawyer who packed in his job after suffering a heart attack and now pursues a quiet life looking after his pet snail; a doctor already disenchanted with his profession and now discarded by his wife; a career woman braving life on her own, who has made loneliness a life style. These characters are all patrons of Black & White, an Ankara bar that has been around for 25 years, and in a sense the bar is their last haven. The owner, meanwhile, is the irritable, easily offended but utterly lovable Faruk... Black & White is a film about the awareness of growing old, friendship, sensitivity and the finer details of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mk6Ak7PkMxi0tjaxL2AgmmV33R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64138'),
  ('1052813382814487230', 'Black and White in Color', 1976, 'Drama, Comedy, War', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Claude Agostini, Dominique Cheminal', 'Georges Conchon, Jean-Jacques Annaud', 'Jean Carmet, Jacques Dufilho, Catherine Rouvel, Jacques Spiesser, Dora Doll, Maurice Barrier, Benjamin Memel Atchory, Peter Berling', null, 'French colonists in Africa, several months behind in the news, find themselves at war with their German neighbors. Deciding that they must do their proper duty and fight the Germans, they promptly conscript the local native population. Issuing them boots and rifles, the French attempt to make "proper" soldiers out of the Africans. A young, idealistic French geographer seems to be the only rational person in the town, and he takes over control of the "war" after several bungles on the part of the others.', 'French colonists in Africa, several months behind in the news, find themselves at war with their German neighbors. Deciding that they must do their proper duty and fight the Germans, they promptly conscript the local native population. Issuing them boots and rifles, the French attempt to make "proper" soldiers out of the Africans. A young, idealistic French geographer seems to be the only rational person in the town, and he takes over control of the "war" after several bungles on the part of the others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8G86Ow4Qcm7FEcHsJoR3pFIBCaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42238'),
  ('1049417989592366820', 'Black and White Stripes: The Juventus Story', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Mauro La Villa, Marco La Villa', 'Marco La Villa, Mauro La Villa', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Gianni Agnelli, Umberto Agnelli, John Elkann, Andrea Agnelli, Lapo Elkann, Alessandro Del Piero, Pavel Nedved', null, 'Set against the backdrop of ''the beautiful game'', Black and White Stripes tells the epic story of Italy''s legendary Agnelli family and their team, Juventus F.C., as they set out to capture an elusive gold star in order to avoid annihilation. As the inspirational journey unfolds, the film weaves in game-changing moments from their heart-wrenching legacy - revealing the profound passion between family and team. On and off the field it''s love, war and breathtaking cinema.', 'Set against the backdrop of ''the beautiful game'', Black and White Stripes tells the epic story of Italy''s legendary Agnelli family and their team, Juventus F.C., as they set out to capture an elusive gold star in order to avoid annihilation. As the inspirational journey unfolds, the film weaves in game-changing moments from their heart-wrenching legacy - revealing the profound passion between family and team. On and off the field it''s love, war and breathtaking cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tp8UlgihxuNpslsQ1OFmDIOcow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421064'),
  ('21248252205806911', 'Black Angel', 1946, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Roy William Neill, Charles S. Gould, Bernard B. Brown', 'Roy Chanslor', 'Dan Duryea, June Vincent, Peter Lorre, Broderick Crawford, Constance Dowling, Wallace Ford, Hobart Cavanaugh, Freddie Steele', 'NR', 'A falsely convicted man''s wife, Catherine, and an alcoholic composer and pianist, Martin, team up in an attempt to clear her husband of the murder of a blonde singer, who is Martin''s wife.', 'A falsely convicted man''s wife, Catherine, and an alcoholic composer and pianist, Martin, team up in an attempt to clear her husband of the murder of a blonde singer, who is Martin''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSpQ7iTM8P3VIW8vlrvtmYBPjap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20298'),
  ('1118840882942159148', 'Black Angel', 1980, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Horror', 'Roger Christian, Roger Pratt', 'Roger Christian', 'Tony Vogel, John Young, Patricia Christian, James Gibb', null, 'A knight returns home from the Crusades to find his village devastated by disease and his family gone. He roams the forest searching for them, until he finds a mysterious maiden who is being held prisoner by a black knight. In order to free her, he must confront her captor.', 'A knight returns home from the Crusades to find his village devastated by disease and his family gone. He roams the forest searching for them, until he finds a mysterious maiden who is being held prisoner by a black knight. In order to free her, he must confront her captor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2znTF1MPhhV5Ny1ggXDBxN3rjmk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273879'),
  ('849650968941969706', 'Black Angel', 1998, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Takashi Ishii, Yasuo Matsumoto, Kazuto Sato', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Riona Hazuki, Reiko Takashima, Miyuki Ono, Jinpachi Nezu, Kippei Shiina, Yoshiyuki Yamaguchi, Hideo Murota, Shingo Tsurumi', null, 'Tokyo is a dark technopolis, a city of faceless chrome and cold marble. It is ruled by Nogi, a yakuza boss specializing in drugs and murder. He gained absolute power by executing the former boss and marrying his daughter, Chiaki. Only the mysterious Ikko, Chiaki''s half-sister threatens him. Inspired by a legendary hit-woman, Ikko calls herself the Black Angel and plans to wash away her father''s murderer with a deluge of blood.', 'Tokyo is a dark technopolis, a city of faceless chrome and cold marble. It is ruled by Nogi, a yakuza boss specializing in drugs and murder. He gained absolute power by executing the former boss and marrying his daughter, Chiaki. Only the mysterious Ikko, Chiaki''s half-sister threatens him. Inspired by a legendary hit-woman, Ikko calls herself the Black Angel and plans to wash away her father''s murderer with a deluge of blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lHGemSanX2O3gP1qZXePsodKd5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51719'),
  ('502966782081875124', 'Black Angel', 2002, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller, War, History', 'Tinto Brass, Claudio Bernabei, Luca Servino', 'Tinto Brass', 'Anna Galiena, Gabriel Garko, Franco Branciaroli, Antonio Salines, Simona Borioni, Loredana Cannata, Erika Savastani, Agostino Nani', null, 'Livia, the attractive wife of a high-ranking Ministry of the People''s Republic official, is accompanied by Ugo, a lawyer, her admirer and her husband''s spy, to Venice. There, she is to meet her lover Helmut Schultz, a lieutenant in the infamous SS with whom she is having a passionate love affair. During the journey, Livia retraces the steps of her sexual aberration. But a surprise awaits her in the lagoon city.', 'Livia, the attractive wife of a high-ranking Ministry of the People''s Republic official, is accompanied by Ugo, a lawyer, her admirer and her husband''s spy, to Venice. There, she is to meet her lover Helmut Schultz, a lieutenant in the infamous SS with whom she is having a passionate love affair. During the journey, Livia retraces the steps of her sexual aberration. But a surprise awaits her in the lagoon city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Cb8n2cAwssBCApYjwYbz67S6P0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30301'),
  ('36033534388109282', 'Black Angel 2', 1999, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Takashi Ishii, Hiroyuki Yasukouchi, Koji Yamaguchi', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Yuki Amami, Takeshi Yamato, Reiko Kataoka, Ito Yozaburo, Shingo Tsurumi, Susumu Terajima, Daisuke Iijima, Eugene Nomura', null, 'Mayo, the Black Angel, is ordered to assassinate a powerful syndicate leader. The hit goes awry, however, as the crime boss'' bodyguard steps in the way. It''s none other than Yamambe, who once rescued Mayo from a rape and has lived in her heart since then.', 'Mayo, the Black Angel, is ordered to assassinate a powerful syndicate leader. The hit goes awry, however, as the crime boss'' bodyguard steps in the way. It''s none other than Yamambe, who once rescued Mayo from a rape and has lived in her heart since then.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTrpVHVj3J99am6xPN1Byv7Utuo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51720'),
  ('873580236428337196', 'Black as Night', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Georgianna Whitley, Cybel Martin, Maritte Lee Go', 'Sherman Payne', 'Asjha Cooper, Fabrizio Guido, Craig Tate, Keith David, Mason Beauchamp, Abbie Gayle, Frankie Smith, Kenneisha Thompson', 'NR', 'A teenage girl with self-esteem issues finds confidence in the most unlikely way, by spending her summer battling vampires that prey on New Orleans'' disenfranchised with the help of her best friend, the boy she''s always pined for, and a peculiar rich girl.', 'A teenage girl with self-esteem issues finds confidence in the most unlikely way, by spending her summer battling vampires that prey on New Orleans'' disenfranchised with the help of her best friend, the boy she''s always pined for, and a peculiar rich girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mx6cgtUiEOVGSI3sb3SNQxAXqRa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767504'),
  ('1089964263514255172', 'Black Bag', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Martin Krauka', 'David Koepp', 'Cate Blanchett, Michael Fassbender, Tom Burke, Marisa Abela, Regé-Jean Page, Naomie Harris, Pierce Brosnan, Kae Alexander', 'R', 'When intelligence agent Kathryn Woodhouse is suspected of betraying the nation, her husband – also a legendary agent – faces the ultimate test of whether to be loyal to his marriage, or his country.', 'When intelligence agent Kathryn Woodhouse is suspected of betraying the nation, her husband – also a legendary agent – faces the ultimate test of whether to be loyal to his marriage, or his country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHPovtU4b96LHcoeEwRkGHI5btw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233575'),
  ('621534020957490736', 'Black Balls', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Anders Matthesen, Joakim Höglund, Mads Thomsen', 'Anders Matthesen', 'Anders Matthesen, Søren Rislund, Iben Dorner, Søren Malling, Thomas Hartmann, Linda P, Jack Arnold, Jakob Fauerby', null, 'Alex Klein is a bankrupt real estate executive whose life is on a collision course. Not only do the market and his career look like a Trabant from before the fall of the Berlin Wall, but he has a wife who is thriving in success; a family whose habits are driving him insane; clients with bad taste and too much money. Not to mention 14-year-old baristas who think they know the difference between highland coffee beans, picked by virgins at midnight and the coffee from the local supermarket. So there''s a lot getting on his nerves, so much so, that one day, when things become real serious, he can only weather the storm in his own repelling way.', 'Alex Klein is a bankrupt real estate executive whose life is on a collision course. Not only do the market and his career look like a Trabant from before the fall of the Berlin Wall, but he has a wife who is thriving in success; a family whose habits are driving him insane; clients with bad taste and too much money. Not to mention 14-year-old baristas who think they know the difference between highland coffee beans, picked by virgins at midnight and the coffee from the local supermarket. So there''s a lot getting on his nerves, so much so, that one day, when things become real serious, he can only weather the storm in his own repelling way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNesTS4C25tVz1spoaLTbTo7uKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17959'),
  ('1036021610287320053', 'Black Barons', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Zdenek Sirový, Jan Křížek, Jana Jiřičková', 'Miloslav Švandrlík, Zdenek Sirový', 'Ondřej Vetchý, Pavel Landovský, Bronislav Poloczek, Alois Švehlík, Jiří Schmitzer, Miroslav Donutil, Josef Dvořák, Rudolf Hrušínský', null, 'Life of Czechoslovak soldiers in a military unit for the so called "politically unreliable" - the Technical auxiliary battalions, aka "the black barons". Although it might seem like a political satire and it''s mostly funny, it shows the reality and the absurdity of military service under the communist regime. Based on a novel by Miloslav Svandrlik.', 'Life of Czechoslovak soldiers in a military unit for the so called "politically unreliable" - the Technical auxiliary battalions, aka "the black barons". Although it might seem like a political satire and it''s mostly funny, it shows the reality and the absurdity of military service under the communist regime. Based on a novel by Miloslav Svandrlik.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRBVyT5vU53G5pK1bl6zc9j6WBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15388'),
  ('994616017013896991', 'Black Bart', 1948, 'Western, Crime', 'George Sherman, Irving Glassberg', 'Luci Ward, Jack Natteford, William Bowers', 'Yvonne De Carlo, Dan Duryea, Jeffrey Lynn, Percy Kilbride, Lloyd Gough, Frank Lovejoy, John McIntire, Don Beddoe', 'NR', 'Cheerful outlaw Charlie Boles leaves former partners Lance and Jersey and heads for California, where the Gold Rush is beginning. Soon, a lone gunman in black is robbing Wells Fargo gold shipments. One fateful day, the stage he robs carries old friends Lance and Jersey...and notorious dancer Lola Montez, coming to perform in Sacramento. Black Bart and Lance become rivals for both Lola''s favors and Wells Fargo''s gold.', 'Cheerful outlaw Charlie Boles leaves former partners Lance and Jersey and heads for California, where the Gold Rush is beginning. Soon, a lone gunman in black is robbing Wells Fargo gold shipments. One fateful day, the stage he robs carries old friends Lance and Jersey...and notorious dancer Lola Montez, coming to perform in Sacramento. Black Bart and Lance become rivals for both Lola''s favors and Wells Fargo''s gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jl2p733QwoaZASiRI29qWFDs9YH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138296'),
  ('230085498303143055', 'Black Bart', 1975, 'Western, Comedy', 'Robert Butler, Michael D. Margulies', 'Michael Elias, Frank Shaw', 'Louis Gossett Jr., Steve Landesberg, Millie Slavin, Noble Willingham, Ruben Moreno, Theodore Lehmann, Gerrit Graham, Brooke Adams', null, 'A television series titled Black Bart was produced for CBS based on Andrew Bergman''s original story for Blazing Saddles (Black Bart was the movie''s original title). It featured Lou Gossett, Jr. as Bart and Steve Landesberg as his drunkard sidekick, a former Confederate officer named "Reb Jordan". The Humour was much more toned down than it''s feature film predecessor Other cast members included Millie Slavin and Noble Willingham. Bergman is listed as the sole creator. CBS aired the pilot once on April 4, 1975 as a CBS Special Presentation. The pilot featured guest appearances by Gerrit Graham and Brooke Adams and was written by Michael Elias and Rich Eustis. Elias and Eutis later created and executive produced the ABC sitcom Head of the Class (1986-1991).', 'A television series titled Black Bart was produced for CBS based on Andrew Bergman''s original story for Blazing Saddles (Black Bart was the movie''s original title). It featured Lou Gossett, Jr. as Bart and Steve Landesberg as his drunkard sidekick, a former Confederate officer named "Reb Jordan". The Humour was much more toned down than it''s feature film predecessor Other cast members included Millie Slavin and Noble Willingham. Bergman is listed as the sole creator. CBS aired the pilot once on April 4, 1975 as a CBS Special Presentation. The pilot featured guest appearances by Gerrit Graham and Brooke Adams and was written by Michael Elias and Rich Eustis. Elias and Eutis later created and executive produced the ABC sitcom Head of the Class (1986-1991).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBS2xbk7YGyu1xUvSqGl7rYv99P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145652'),
  ('787440020716073208', 'Black Beach', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Esteban Crespo, Ángel Amorós, Carlos Gras', 'David Moreno, Esteban Crespo', 'Raúl Arévalo, Candela Peña, Lidia Nené, Claude Musungayi, Emilio Buale, Melina Matthews, Paulina García, Babou Cham', null, 'Carlos, a ruthless Spanish negotiation expert working in Brussels, is tasked with handling the kidnapping of a senior oil company executive in a troubled West African country —with which he has old and deep ties—, torn by ethnic tensions and government abuses.', 'Carlos, a ruthless Spanish negotiation expert working in Brussels, is tasked with handling the kidnapping of a senior oil company executive in a troubled West African country —with which he has old and deep ties—, torn by ethnic tensions and government abuses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eecIVH7l34XAC5K80Od2A2vTmK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:735129'),
  ('198116496466065259', 'Black Bear', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lawrence Michael Levine, Rob Leitzell, Hilton Jamal Day', 'Lawrence Michael Levine', 'Aubrey Plaza, Christopher Abbott, Sarah Gadon, Paola Lázaro, Grantham Coleman, Lindsay Burdge, Lou Gonzalez, Shannon O''Neill', 'R', 'At a remote lake house in the Adirondack Mountains, a couple entertains an out-of-town guest looking for inspiration in her filmmaking. The group quickly falls into a calculated game of desire, manipulation, and jealousy, unaware of how dangerously intertwined their lives will soon become.', 'At a remote lake house in the Adirondack Mountains, a couple entertains an out-of-town guest looking for inspiration in her filmmaking. The group quickly falls into a calculated game of desire, manipulation, and jealousy, unaware of how dangerously intertwined their lives will soon become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqZFjQRWfW6PjFTc17pzJ5LRAAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624788'),
  ('593123348553651073', 'Black Beauty', 1971, 'Drama, Family', 'James Hill, Chris Menges', 'Wolf Mankowitz', 'Mark Lester, Walter Slezak, Peter Lee Lawrence, Uschi Glas, Patrick Mower, Maria Rohm, Eddie Golden, Clive Geraghty', null, 'Told from the POV of Black Beauty himself, his birth and perception of humans are explored, but his first owner, a boy named Joe, is his most memorable.', 'Told from the POV of Black Beauty himself, his birth and perception of humans are explored, but his first owner, a boy named Joe, is his most memorable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsUDY8L6eCakWdWUttdMdGKiOaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28356'),
  ('940839829182873114', 'Black Beauty', 1994, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Caroline Thompson, Alex Thomson, Leslie Tomkins', 'Caroline Thompson', 'Alan Cumming, Docs Keepin Time, Sean Bean, David Thewlis, Jim Carter, Peter Davison, Alun Armstrong, John McEnery', 'G', 'The fates of horses, and the people who own and command them, are revealed as Black Beauty narrates the circle of his life.', 'The fates of horses, and the people who own and command them, are revealed as Black Beauty narrates the circle of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uH60FBDPQoyAnc4uvU0fIB8JXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14522'),
  ('696502557265176657', 'Black Beauty', 1995, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Toshiyuki Hiruma', 'Anna Sewell', 'Jesse Moss, Venus Terzo, Tony Ail, Nathan Aswell, Bailee Reid, Kathleen Barr, Garry Chalk, Lillian Carlson', null, 'Black Beauty lives with Squire Gordon and his stable girl Jenny. Squire Gordon is forced to sell Black Beauty to a cruel society lady. He is a sweet-tempered horse who through the course of his life encounters many trying experiences. He endures through his unyielding courage and faith.', 'Black Beauty lives with Squire Gordon and his stable girl Jenny. Squire Gordon is forced to sell Black Beauty to a cruel society lady. He is a sweet-tempered horse who through the course of his life encounters many trying experiences. He endures through his unyielding courage and faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EsLAwrbORLGogbwTQbHlo9KC8K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83300'),
  ('279628245856188787', 'Black Belt', 2007, 'Action, Drama', 'Shunichi Nagasaki, Masato Kaneko', 'George Iida', 'Akihito Yagi, Tatsuya Naka, Yū Kamio, Arashi Fukasawa, Hakuryu, Takayasu Komiya, Yōsuke Natsuki, Shin''ya Ohwada', null, 'Set in 1932, amid the rise of militarism after the establishment of the Manchukuo colony in Northeast China, the story centers on a trio of karateka. Studying under their aging master in a small dojo in the woods of central Kyushu, Choei, Taikan and Giryu face a company of kempeitai military police come to requisition their dojo for use as a military base.', 'Set in 1932, amid the rise of militarism after the establishment of the Manchukuo colony in Northeast China, the story centers on a trio of karateka. Studying under their aging master in a small dojo in the woods of central Kyushu, Choei, Taikan and Giryu face a company of kempeitai military police come to requisition their dojo for use as a military base.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idWqTc6DSpeNWSmREKh9xGc71N0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20225'),
  ('70726428746967612', 'Black Belt Jones', 1974, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Robert Clouse, Kent L. Wakeford, Al Sheppard', 'Oscar Williams', 'Jim Kelly, Gloria Hendry, Scatman Crothers, Eric Laneuville, Alan Weeks, Andre Philippe, Vincent Barbi, Mel Novak', 'R', 'Jones is a secret agent who has gone into semi-retirement, concentrating instead on teaching the martial arts to inner city youths. The karate school is run by a kindly old coot named Pops. His gambling debts, however, bring the local thug, Pinky, down on him. To make matters worse, Pinky is then hired by some white thugs who want to get a hold of the property Pops'' school occupies so they can build a shopping mall. When things get heavy, Black Belt Jones leaps into action. Only he''s not alone. Pops'' daughter, Sidney, shows up to lend a hand, proving herself every bit as agile and powerful a martial artist as Jones.', 'Jones is a secret agent who has gone into semi-retirement, concentrating instead on teaching the martial arts to inner city youths. The karate school is run by a kindly old coot named Pops. His gambling debts, however, bring the local thug, Pinky, down on him. To make matters worse, Pinky is then hired by some white thugs who want to get a hold of the property Pops'' school occupies so they can build a shopping mall. When things get heavy, Black Belt Jones leaps into action. Only he''s not alone. Pops'' daughter, Sidney, shows up to lend a hand, proving herself every bit as agile and powerful a martial artist as Jones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnzPJzKr2IVPGqkkE6aCGNePDq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18257'),
  ('597883606424339325', 'Black Book', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Paul Verhoeven, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Astrid Poeschke', 'Paul Verhoeven, Gerard Soeteman', 'Carice van Houten, Sebastian Koch, Thom Hoffman, Halina Reijn, Waldemar Kobus, Matthias Schoenaerts, Theo Maassen, Derek de Lint', 'R', 'Israel, 1956: Jewish teacher Rachel Stein rather unexpectedly meets an old friend at the kibbutz. It brings back memories of her experiences in the Netherlands during the war, memories of betrayal. In September 1944, Rachel''s hiding place is bombed by Allied troops; she makes contact with a resistance member and joins a group of Jews to be smuggled across the Biesbosch to the freed South Netherlands. Only Rachel escapes a massacre by patrol Germans, and is rescued by a resistance group under the leadership of Gerben Kuipers, whose son is captured trying to smuggle weapons. Kuipers asks Rachel to seduce SS-hauptsturmführer Ludwig Müntze, a mission that she will soon learn that the boat attack wasn''t a coincidence.', 'Israel, 1956: Jewish teacher Rachel Stein rather unexpectedly meets an old friend at the kibbutz. It brings back memories of her experiences in the Netherlands during the war, memories of betrayal. In September 1944, Rachel''s hiding place is bombed by Allied troops; she makes contact with a resistance member and joins a group of Jews to be smuggled across the Biesbosch to the freed South Netherlands. Only Rachel escapes a massacre by patrol Germans, and is rescued by a resistance group under the leadership of Gerben Kuipers, whose son is captured trying to smuggle weapons. Kuipers asks Rachel to seduce SS-hauptsturmführer Ludwig Müntze, a mission that she will soon learn that the boat attack wasn''t a coincidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8UyT6tUKJl07gYhPheLAzogG8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9075'),
  ('469305025564659954', 'Black Boots, Leather Whip', 1983, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jesús Franco, Juan Soler', 'Jesús Franco', 'Lina Romay, Antonio Mayans, Asunción Calero, Alfredo Kier, Rocío Freixas, Juan Antonio García, Lorna Green, Jesús Franco', null, 'Al Pereira is hired by Lina, the wife of a wealthy man, to recover some compromising photos. She has sex with him by way of a retainer. In the course of his investigation, Al is obliged to commit a couple of murders... and he''s left holding the bag when Lina turns out not to be what she seems to be.', 'Al Pereira is hired by Lina, the wife of a wealthy man, to recover some compromising photos. She has sex with him by way of a retainer. In the course of his investigation, Al is obliged to commit a couple of murders... and he''s left holding the bag when Lina turns out not to be what she seems to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzdDdU0kq0OOMbzSCgfzBYaj1jf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335940'),
  ('372308764713628254', 'Black Box', 2005, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Richard Berry, Thomas Hardmeier', 'Richard Berry, Eric Assous', 'José Garcia, Marion Cotillard, Michel Duchaussoy, Bernard Le Coq, Marilou Berry, Héléna Noguerra, Alexandre Donders, Arnaud Maillard', null, 'An accident survivor wakes from a coma and confronts old, uncomfortable memories.', 'An accident survivor wakes from a coma and confronts old, uncomfortable memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAe4qbHiuhygQkwUnHkfRkCeJXo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13730'),
  ('895820455953483390', 'Black Box', 2020, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Paul B. Uddo, Emmanuel Osei-Kuffour, Jr.', 'Stephen Herman, Emmanuel Osei-Kuffour, Jr.', 'Mamoudou Athie, Phylicia Rashād, Amanda Christine, Tosin Morohunfola, Charmaine Bingwa, Donald Watkins, Troy James, Nyah Marie Johnson', 'NR', 'After losing his wife and his memory in a car accident, a single father undergoes an experimental treatment that causes him to question who he really is.', 'After losing his wife and his memory in a car accident, a single father undergoes an experimental treatment that causes him to question who he really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldlpTitpSTBINwgifzlRRXveXUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716258'),
  ('99124664974969208', 'Black Box', 2021, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Pierre Cottereau, Marine Benoit, Natalie Engelstein', 'Jérémie Guez', 'Pierre Niney, Lou de Laâge, André Dussollier, Sébastien Pouderoux, Olivier Rabourdin, Guillaume Marquet, Mehdi Djaadi, Aurélien Recoing', 'G', 'Mathieu is a young and talented black box analyst on a mission to solve the reason behind the deadly crash of a brand new aircraft. Yet, when the case is closed by authorities, Mathieu cannot help but sense there is something wrong with the evidence. As he listens to the tracks again, he starts detecting some seriously disturbing details. Could the tape have been modified? Going against his boss'' orders, Mathieu begins his own rogue investigation - an obsessional and dangerous quest for truth that will quickly threaten far more than his career...', 'Mathieu is a young and talented black box analyst on a mission to solve the reason behind the deadly crash of a brand new aircraft. Yet, when the case is closed by authorities, Mathieu cannot help but sense there is something wrong with the evidence. As he listens to the tracks again, he starts detecting some seriously disturbing details. Could the tape have been modified? Going against his boss'' orders, Mathieu begins his own rogue investigation - an obsessional and dangerous quest for truth that will quickly threaten far more than his career...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIYxQoxQC78kQBxIKCR41hheqwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663260'),
  ('303550478701911950', 'Black Box', 2023, 'Drama', 'Aslı Özge', null, 'Luise Heyer, Felix Kramer, Christian Berkel, Timur Magomedgadzhiev, Manal Issa, Sascha Alexander Geršak, Anne Ratte-Polle, Jonathan Berlin', null, 'The exits of a Berlin courtyard are blocked by the police due to an ambiguous event outside and a state of emergency occurs. Among the residents of the building, insecurities start to pump fear. Suspicion takes over panic, prejudices bring polarization and another question appears: Is the real danger coming from inside or outside?', 'The exits of a Berlin courtyard are blocked by the police due to an ambiguous event outside and a state of emergency occurs. Among the residents of the building, insecurities start to pump fear. Suspicion takes over panic, prejudices bring polarization and another question appears: Is the real danger coming from inside or outside?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Mwu5mdHJ5AqHhbthwXYpOrYIqH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958173'),
  ('179615952609102135', 'Black Box BRD', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Andres Veiel, Jörg Jeshel', 'Andres Veiel', 'Traudl Herrhausen, Rainer Grams, Werner Grams, Ruth Grams, Thomas R. Fischer, Hilmar Kopper, Rolf-Ernst Breuer, Michael Endres', null, 'Black Box BRD steps back into German history, showing the Federal Republic of Germany of the 70s and 80s. The country is polarized due to the power struggle of the German state and the "Red Army Faction". Society is torn, the fronts are irreconcilable. The life stories of both Wolfgang Grams and Alfred Herrhausen are tragically linked to this era. Grams is the one who takes up arms for moral rigor; Herrhausen however seizes power and dies when powerful.', 'Black Box BRD steps back into German history, showing the Federal Republic of Germany of the 70s and 80s. The country is polarized due to the power struggle of the German state and the "Red Army Faction". Society is torn, the fronts are irreconcilable. The life stories of both Wolfgang Grams and Alfred Herrhausen are tragically linked to this era. Grams is the one who takes up arms for moral rigor; Herrhausen however seizes power and dies when powerful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jLaeg8hbj1NTox8NbsgYjLkTjP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11089'),
  ('778083051177263425', 'Black Box Diaries', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Shiori Ito, Yuta Okamura', 'Shiori Ito', 'Shiori Ito, Shinzo Abe', null, 'Journalist Shiori Ito embarks on a courageous investigation of her own sexual assault in an improbable attempt to prosecute her high-profile offender. Her quest becomes a landmark case in Japan, exposing the country''s outdated judicial and societal systems.', 'Journalist Shiori Ito embarks on a courageous investigation of her own sexual assault in an improbable attempt to prosecute her high-profile offender. Her quest becomes a landmark case in Japan, exposing the country''s outdated judicial and societal systems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wX95ps6Haijvt7evwSwqx1gs88e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214499'),
  ('724178339190224662', 'Black Bread', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Agustí Villaronga, Antonio Riestra', 'Agustí Villaronga', 'Francesc Colomer, Marina Comas, Nora Navas, Roger Casamajor, Lluïsa Castell, Mercé Arànega, Marina Gatell, Elisa Crehuet', 'NR', 'In the harsh post-war years'' Catalan countryside, Andreu, a child that belongs to the losing side, finds the corpses of a man and his son in the forest. The authorities want his father to be made responsible of the deaths, but Andreu tries to help his father by finding out who truly killed them. In this search, Andreu develops a moral consciousness against a world of adults fed by lies. In order to survive, he betrays his own roots and ends up finding out the monster that lives within him.', 'In the harsh post-war years'' Catalan countryside, Andreu, a child that belongs to the losing side, finds the corpses of a man and his son in the forest. The authorities want his father to be made responsible of the deaths, but Andreu tries to help his father by finding out who truly killed them. In this search, Andreu develops a moral consciousness against a world of adults fed by lies. In order to survive, he betrays his own roots and ends up finding out the monster that lives within him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8YTscygBsjiwwkX2jlROpCTeuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57521'),
  ('183370360669387825', 'Black Butler', 2014, 'Horror, Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Kentaro Otani, Keiichi Sato, Takahito Ôuchi', 'Tsutomu Kuroiwa', 'Hiro Mizushima, Ayame Goriki, Mizuki Yamamoto, Yûka, Takuro Ohno, Ken Kaito, Yu Shirota, Tomomi Maruyama', null, 'Set in the year 2020, following her supposed death, a young woman returns as the son of her noble family to precede the family''s prestigious company, with a demon at her side to avenge her parent''s murder.', 'Set in the year 2020, following her supposed death, a young woman returns as the son of her noble family to precede the family''s prestigious company, with a demon at her side to avenge her parent''s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vidfsb8UxcWIl0amKk7adYdKWVh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220447'),
  ('69553637542337701', 'Black Butler: Book of Murder', 2014, 'Mystery, Animation, Adventure, Action', 'Harume Kosaka, Chigai Okado, Takayuki Furukawa', 'Yana Toboso', 'Daisuke Ono, Maaya Sakamoto, Ryohei Kimura, Shintaro Asanuma, Junichi Suwabe, Yuki Kaji, Yukari Tamura, Takuma Terashima', 'NR', 'At the Queen’s request, Ciel and the demon butler Sebastian host an extravagant dinner party for the who’s who of the London underground. But an evening that begins with the promise of unmatched elegance quickly spirals into mayhem when their most distinguished guest is found murdered in his room. Now, trapped in the Phantomhive Manor by a dark and stormy night, Ciel and Sebastian must work together with their high-class guests, including the legendary author Sir Arthur Conan Doyle, to find the murderer in their midst before the blame falls on the host and his somewhat suspicious staff.', 'At the Queen’s request, Ciel and the demon butler Sebastian host an extravagant dinner party for the who’s who of the London underground. But an evening that begins with the promise of unmatched elegance quickly spirals into mayhem when their most distinguished guest is found murdered in his room. Now, trapped in the Phantomhive Manor by a dark and stormy night, Ciel and Sebastian must work together with their high-class guests, including the legendary author Sir Arthur Conan Doyle, to find the murderer in their midst before the blame falls on the host and his somewhat suspicious staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7N8os3UNezyfyY8FowkLbSzHDqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511082'),
  ('416741981495127748', 'Black Butler: Book of the Atlantic', 2017, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Takayuki Tanaka, Tsuyoshi Tobita, Katsuyoshi Kobayashi', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'Daisuke Ono, Maaya Sakamoto, Yukari Tamura, Junichi Suwabe, Jun Fukuyama, KENN, Noriaki Sugiyama, Hiroki Touchi', null, 'Ciel learns of a "Aurora Society", that is rumored to be researching how to bring the dead back to life. Their next meeting is scheduled to be conducted on the ship Campania, voyaging across the Atlantic Ocean. Much to Ciel''s dismay, Elizabeth "Lizzy" Midford, is taking the same ship, thus leaving him with no choice but to get aboard as well.', 'Ciel learns of a "Aurora Society", that is rumored to be researching how to bring the dead back to life. Their next meeting is scheduled to be conducted on the ship Campania, voyaging across the Atlantic Ocean. Much to Ciel''s dismay, Elizabeth "Lizzy" Midford, is taking the same ship, thus leaving him with no choice but to get aboard as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jU2Bdk1MB2OvP4BBvTJIPQc0BF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432131'),
