  ('934608477533360338', 'Black Butterfly', 2017, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Brian Goodman, Marco Della Torre, Valentina de Cassan', 'Justin Stanley, Marc Frydman', 'Antonio Banderas, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Piper Perabo, Abel Ferrara, Nicholas Aaron, Vincent Riotta, Gioia Libardoni, Nathalie Rapti Gomez', 'R', 'Paul is a down-on-his-luck screenwriter who picks up a drifter and offers him a place to stay. However, when the deranged stranger takes Paul hostage and forces him to write, their unhinged relationship brings buried secrets to light.', 'Paul is a down-on-his-luck screenwriter who picks up a drifter and offers him a place to stay. However, when the deranged stranger takes Paul hostage and forces him to write, their unhinged relationship brings buried secrets to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toB9yjJssyJZSworX0KePbjSexP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76812'),
