  ('611707910174685827', 'Black Diamonds', 2013, 'Drama', 'Miguel Alcantud', 'Miguel Alcantud', 'Setigui Diallo, Hamidou Samake, Carlos Bardem, Raúl Tejón, Guillermo Toledo, Daniel Muriel, Carlo D''Ursi, Victor Gonçalves', null, 'Diamantes Negros tells the long journey undertaken by two young boys from Mali who arrive in Spain after being persuaded to pursue their dream of escaping from poverty by becoming professional football players.', 'Diamantes Negros tells the long journey undertaken by two young boys from Mali who arrive in Spain after being persuaded to pursue their dream of escaping from poverty by becoming professional football players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrGpBDABkYWyMQgXDZiZN8VyWux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187098'),
