  ('533604739146520016', 'Black Dog', 2024, 'Drama', 'Guan Hu, Gao Weizhe, Li Jinglan', 'Ge Rui, Guan Hu, Wu Bing', 'Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Tong Liya, Jia Zhangke, Zhou You, Hu Xiaoguang, Wang Yiquan, Niu Ben, Yin Yuanzhang', 'NR', 'On the edge of the Gobi desert in Northwest China, Lang returns to his hometown after being released from jail. While working for the local dog patrol team to clear the town of stray dogs before the Olympic Games, he strikes up an unlikely connection with a black dog. These two lonely souls embark on a journey together.', 'On the edge of the Gobi desert in Northwest China, Lang returns to his hometown after being released from jail. While working for the local dog patrol team to clear the town of stray dogs before the Olympic Games, he strikes up an unlikely connection with a black dog. These two lonely souls embark on a journey together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWssO0oGC6b3PtN5uarGuVp66Uv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1249423'),
  ('521636324531136234', 'Black Dossier', 1955, 'Crime, Drama', 'André Cayatte, Jean Bourgoin', 'André Cayatte, Charles Spaak', 'Jean-Marc Bory, Danièle Delorme, Bernard Blier, Lea Padovani, Antoine Balpêtré, Paul Frankeur, Nelly Borgeaud, Noël Roquevert', null, 'In the 1950s, in a small provincial town, a young inexperienced judge clashes with an influential notable during an investigation into a suspicious death. His perseverance to get to the truth will cause a huge scandal.', 'In the 1950s, in a small provincial town, a young inexperienced judge clashes with an influential notable during an investigation into a suspicious death. His perseverance to get to the truth will cause a huge scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyuA1hNyZH5vwfvVDdpEoNhZUIc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199252'),
  ('1022077202180097680', 'Black Dragons', 1942, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'William Nigh, Arthur Reed, Arthur Hammond', 'Harvey Gates', 'Bela Lugosi, Clayton Moore, Joan Barclay, George Pembroke, Robert Frazer, Robert Fiske, Irving Mitchell, Edward Peil Sr.', 'NR', 'It is prior to the commencement of World War II, and Japan''s fiendish Black Dragon Society is hatching an evil plot with the Nazis. They instruct a brilliant scientist, Dr. Melcher, to travel to Japan on a secret mission. There he operates on six Japanese conspirators, transforming them to resemble six American leaders. The actual leaders are murdered and replaced with their likeness.', 'It is prior to the commencement of World War II, and Japan''s fiendish Black Dragon Society is hatching an evil plot with the Nazis. They instruct a brilliant scientist, Dr. Melcher, to travel to Japan on a secret mission. There he operates on six Japanese conspirators, transforming them to resemble six American leaders. The actual leaders are murdered and replaced with their likeness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyUGxTPkzYmcKJjKPM5aDIKLmC0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22741'),
  ('763181927481279198', 'Black Dynamite', 2009, 'Comedy, Action', 'Scott Sanders, Cristi Rickey, Ron Yuan', 'Michael Jai White, Scott Sanders, Byron Minns', 'Michael Jai White, Arsenio Hall, Tommy Davidson, Kevin Chapman, Richard Edson, Bokeem Woodbine, Buddy Lewis, Irwin Keyes', 'R', 'This is the story of 1970s African-American action legend Black Dynamite. The Man killed his brother, pumped heroin into local orphanages, and flooded the ghetto with adulterated malt liquor. Black Dynamite was the one hero willing to fight The Man all the way from the blood-soaked city streets to the hallowed halls of the Honky House.', 'This is the story of 1970s African-American action legend Black Dynamite. The Man killed his brother, pumped heroin into local orphanages, and flooded the ghetto with adulterated malt liquor. Black Dynamite was the one hero willing to fight The Man all the way from the blood-soaked city streets to the hallowed halls of the Honky House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3oWQDz0JggzzsVlsuHY7XVxp5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24804'),
  ('737718836727049360', 'Black Eagle', 1988, 'Action, Drama', 'Eric Karson, George Koblasa, Sharon Shamir', 'A.E. Peters, Michael Gonzales', 'Sho Kosugi, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Doran Clark, Bruce French, Vladimir Skomarovsky, William Bassett, Kane Kosugi, Shane Kosugi', 'R', 'One of the US Air Force''s most modern tactical aircrafts, an F-100 with a new laser guidance system, crashes into the sea near Malta - a region where the Soviet forces are highly present, too. The CIA immediately sends out their best secret agent, Ken Tani, to salvage the system before it falls into enemy hands. To ensure his loyalty, they bring his two young sons to a nearby hotel on the island.', 'One of the US Air Force''s most modern tactical aircrafts, an F-100 with a new laser guidance system, crashes into the sea near Malta - a region where the Soviet forces are highly present, too. The CIA immediately sends out their best secret agent, Ken Tani, to salvage the system before it falls into enemy hands. To ensure his loyalty, they bring his two young sons to a nearby hotel on the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMm9hIhErPcgONWknYBgfQP2Z00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18214'),
  ('628983226941744811', 'Black Eagles', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Torsten Körner, Johannes Imdahl', 'Torsten Körner', 'Guy Acolatse, Otto Addo, Gerald Asamoah, Anthony Baffoe, Cacau, Rigobert Gruber, Jimmy Hartwig, Steffi Jones', null, 'The documentary Schwarze Adler (Black Eagles) lets black players of the German national football team tell their personal stories for the first time. What road did they take before they got to where we cheer for them? What hurdles did they have to overcome? What prejudices and racist hostility were they exposed to – and what was it like in the past, what is it like today?', 'The documentary Schwarze Adler (Black Eagles) lets black players of the German national football team tell their personal stories for the first time. What road did they take before they got to where we cheer for them? What hurdles did they have to overcome? What prejudices and racist hostility were they exposed to – and what was it like in the past, what is it like today?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ex43MgaNo504DrG5IQWhSoxRI57.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818563'),
  ('727999064829504817', 'Black Emanuelle 2', 1976, 'Drama, Romance, Horror', 'Bitto Albertini, Alfonso Zenga, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Bitto Albertini, Ambrogio Molteni', 'Shulamith Lasri, Angelo Infanti, Don Powell, Percy Hogan, Dagmar Lassander, Danielle Ellison, Franco Cremonini, Pietro Torrisi', 'NR', 'Fashion model Emanuelle is experiencing psychotic freakout every time she has sex. Haunted by memories of sexual abuse from the men in her life, including her father, she turns to Dr. Gardner, who offers help while she resides at his mental health center.', 'Fashion model Emanuelle is experiencing psychotic freakout every time she has sex. Haunted by memories of sexual abuse from the men in her life, including her father, she turns to Dr. Gardner, who offers help while she resides at his mental health center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCjTUYWG62CFXOiPta48hGCVXhl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90119'),
