  ('1124996279894328330', 'Black for Remembrance', 1995, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Edmond Richard', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, André Ruellan', 'Jane Birkin, Sabine Azéma, Jean-François Stévenin, Benoît Régent, Matthias Habich, Jenny Alpha, Vanessa Larré, Samuel Dupuy', null, 'This French thriller begins with a flashback to a small village dance where a six-year-old girl is kidnapped and killed. Seventeen years later the murder remains unsolved. The girl''s parents Caroline and Chris have gone on with separate lives Caroline remarried and had another daughter while Chris became an alcoholic. The two are thrown back together when each begin receiving strange messages that imply their daughter has returned from the dead for vengeance. They contact a police detective (the lover of Caroline''s best friend) who finds the case intriguing and decides to reopen it. Unfortunately, as soon as he begins questioning the old suspects, people begin to die.', 'This French thriller begins with a flashback to a small village dance where a six-year-old girl is kidnapped and killed. Seventeen years later the murder remains unsolved. The girl''s parents Caroline and Chris have gone on with separate lives Caroline remarried and had another daughter while Chris became an alcoholic. The two are thrown back together when each begin receiving strange messages that imply their daughter has returned from the dead for vengeance. They contact a police detective (the lover of Caroline''s best friend) who finds the case intriguing and decides to reopen it. Unfortunately, as soon as he begins questioning the old suspects, people begin to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsFGtLUignBLIVXKJq2teCFP8Sr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76601'),
  ('671698654300610919', 'Black Forest', 2010, 'Thriller', 'Gert Steinheimer', 'Gert Steinheimer', 'Johanna Klante, Nikola Kastner, Adrian Topol, Bernhard Bulling, Andreas Hoppe, Hans Joachim Weiser, Mela Mselmani, Christian Begyn', null, 'Two couples plan to spend a week in an empty farmhouse located in Germany''s Black Forest.', 'Two couples plan to spend a week in an empty farmhouse located in Germany''s Black Forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kW7LvP1nptNNnxxDRHGnmodK17l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244490'),
  ('987485925426193735', 'Black Fox', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Yasuomi Kishi, Yu Wakabayashi, Kazuya Nomura', 'Naoki Hayashi', 'Ayaka Nanase, Haruka Tomatsu, You Taichi, Hiroshi Tsuchida, Eizo Tsuda, Keiji Fujiwara, Aki Toyosaki, Kohsuke Toriumi', 'PG-13', 'Rikka is a ninja descendant. Her grandfather Hyoe is the last chief of their ninja clan and her father is a cyborg researcher. Both are killed when a weapons'' company raids his lab to use his research. Rikka sets out to avenge their deaths.', 'Rikka is a ninja descendant. Her grandfather Hyoe is the last chief of their ninja clan and her father is a cyborg researcher. Both are killed when a weapons'' company raids his lab to use his research. Rikka sets out to avenge their deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ypOmAQ3TowBa4iBILBboOEQqYh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609202'),
  ('786373390970093815', 'Black Friday', 1940, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Horror, Mystery', 'Elwood Bredell, Arthur Lubin, Hans J. Salter', 'Curt Siodmak, Eric Taylor', 'Stanley Ridges, Boris Karloff, Bela Lugosi, Anne Nagel, Anne Gwynne, Virginia Brissac, Edmund MacDonald, Paul Fix', null, 'University professor George Kingsley is struck by gangsters while crossing the street, leaving him with brain damage and one of the gangsters, Cannon, paralyzed. Kingsley''s friend Dr. Sovac attends to both men, and when Cannon offers him a reward for aiding his recovery, Kovac transplants part of Cannon''s brain into the dying Kingsley''s skull, creating a dual personality.', 'University professor George Kingsley is struck by gangsters while crossing the street, leaving him with brain damage and one of the gangsters, Cannon, paralyzed. Kingsley''s friend Dr. Sovac attends to both men, and when Cannon offers him a reward for aiding his recovery, Kovac transplants part of Cannon''s brain into the dying Kingsley''s skull, creating a dual personality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/268GiPoyYmuNhrez1I7GXypKC6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13784'),
