  ('829378770852760237', 'Black Friday', 2021, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'David Kruta, Casey Tebo, Hristo Dimitrov', 'Andy Greskoviak', 'Devon Sawa, Ivana Baquero, Ryan Lee, Stephen Amethyst Peck, Michael Jai White, Bruce Campbell, Louie Kurtzman, Celeste Oliva', null, 'A group of toy store employees must protect each other from a horde of parasite infected shoppers.', 'A group of toy store employees must protect each other from a horde of parasite infected shoppers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vf9Ex4EwSPlwbva4ZJdljsQQOML.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765869'),
