  ('467382067828368887', 'Black Goat', 2026, 'Horror', 'David Hinds, Todd Franklin', 'David Hinds', 'Darren Randall, Becki jones, Anouska o’hara, Pete Chilvers, Michael Myunda', 'Not Rated', 'In the mysterious town of Blackwood Falls, a young environmental engineer investigates a plague affecting local livestock. He uncovers horrifying secrets tied to cult sacrifices and a demonic entity, known as The Black Goat of the Woods.', 'In the mysterious town of Blackwood Falls, a young environmental engineer investigates a plague affecting local livestock. He uncovers horrifying secrets tied to cult sacrifices and a demonic entity, known as The Black Goat of the Woods.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BZTg2MjU0MGEtOGVlMS00YWVmLWE3YTUtYzQ1YzZiNGFjNTczXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:black-goat-2026'),
  ('1081755337618074712', 'Black God, White Devil', 1964, 'Adventure, Western, Drama', 'Glauber Rocha, Agnaldo Siri Azevedo, Waldemar Lima', 'Paulo Gil Soares, Glauber Rocha, Walter Lima Jr.', 'Geraldo del Rey, Yoná Magalhães, Othon Bastos, Sonia dos Humildes, Maurício do Valle, Lídio Silva, João Gama, Antônio Pinto', null, 'Wanted for killing his boss, Manuel flees with his wife Rosa to the sertão, the barren landscape of Northern Brazil. Thrust into a primordial violent region, Manuel and Rosa come under the influence and control of a series of frightening figures.', 'Wanted for killing his boss, Manuel flees with his wife Rosa to the sertão, the barren landscape of Northern Brazil. Thrust into a primordial violent region, Manuel and Rosa come under the influence and control of a series of frightening figures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keNDV8nbgVLiCUyzObisEDxdAI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67612'),
  ('441791237464395421', 'Black Gold', 2011, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Jean-Marie Dreujou, Lilith Bekmezian', 'Menno Meyjes', 'Mark Strong, Antonio Banderas, Freida Pinto, Tahar Rahim, Riz Ahmed, Lotfi Dziri, Liya Kebede, Corey Johnson', 'R', 'On the Arabian Peninsula in the 1930s, two warring leaders come face to face. The victorious Nesib, Emir of Hobeika, lays down his peace terms to rival Amar, Sultan of Salmaah. The two men agree that neither can lay claim to the area of no man’s land between them called The Yellow Belt. In return, Nesib adopts Amar’s two boys Saleeh and Auda as a guarantee against invasion. Twelve years later, Saleeh and Auda have grown into young men. Saleeh, the warrior, itches to escape his gilded cage and return to his father’s land. Auda cares only for books and the pursuit of knowledge. One day, their adopted father Nesib is visited by an American from Texas. He tells the Emir that his land is blessed with oil and promises him riches beyond his wildest imagination. Nesib imagines a realm of infinite possibility, a kingdom with roads, schools and hospitals all paid for by the black gold beneath the barren sand. There is only one problem. The precious oil is located in the Yellow Belt.', 'On the Arabian Peninsula in the 1930s, two warring leaders come face to face. The victorious Nesib, Emir of Hobeika, lays down his peace terms to rival Amar, Sultan of Salmaah. The two men agree that neither can lay claim to the area of no man’s land between them called The Yellow Belt. In return, Nesib adopts Amar’s two boys Saleeh and Auda as a guarantee against invasion. Twelve years later, Saleeh and Auda have grown into young men. Saleeh, the warrior, itches to escape his gilded cage and return to his father’s land. Auda cares only for books and the pursuit of knowledge. One day, their adopted father Nesib is visited by an American from Texas. He tells the Emir that his land is blessed with oil and promises him riches beyond his wildest imagination. Nesib imagines a realm of infinite possibility, a kingdom with roads, schools and hospitals all paid for by the black gold beneath the barren sand. There is only one problem. The precious oil is located in the Yellow Belt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ikn974ObBFOnIre7JE4tDwQnGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77221'),
  ('81103971162077276', 'Black Gravel', 1961, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Helmut Käutner, Klaus Dudenhöfer, Heinz Pehlke', 'Walter Ulbrich, Helmut Käutner', 'Helmut Wildt, Ingmar Zeisberg, Hans Cossy, Wolfgang Büttner, Anita Höfer, Heinrich Trimbur, Peter Nestler, Edeltraut Elsner', null, 'Tensions rise when a U.S. military base is built in a small village in post-war Germany.', 'Tensions rise when a U.S. military base is built in a small village in post-war Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCyqHV4eRP19GVFbDn4vmeoUnwB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267768'),
  ('78445211330109516', 'Black Gunn', 1972, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Robert Hartford-Davis, Richard H. Kline, Max Stein', 'Robert Shearer, Franklin Coen', 'Jim Brown, Martin Landau, Brenda Sykes, Luciana Paluzzi, Vida Blue, Stephen McNally, Keefe Brasselle, Timothy Brown', null, 'A successful and popular nightclub owner who believes financial independence is the path to equality and success, must act as a go-between for militant-minded brother and the white gang syndicate his brother has attacked and robbed. Their involvements lead to a breathless race course chase, the destruction of a dopepusher and a violent waterfront climax.', 'A successful and popular nightclub owner who believes financial independence is the path to equality and success, must act as a go-between for militant-minded brother and the white gang syndicate his brother has attacked and robbed. Their involvements lead to a breathless race course chase, the destruction of a dopepusher and a violent waterfront climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ka1Bcy9w7YOroUXMJe2aZPadkkm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100088'),
  ('23641845906537419', 'Black Hand', 1950, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Paul Vogel, Richard Thorpe', 'Luther Davis', 'Gene Kelly, Teresa Celli, J. Carrol Naish, Mario Siletti, Marc Lawrence, Frank Puglia, Barry Kelley, Carl Milletaire', 'NR', 'In turn-of-the-century New York, an Italian seeks vengeance on the mobsters who killed his father.', 'In turn-of-the-century New York, an Italian seeks vengeance on the mobsters who killed his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WfHXzS2CpXT3DRAwEkDnw7aJIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41552'),
  ('324619277057748459', 'Black Hawk Down', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Chris Mills', null, 'Mike Goodale, Dale Sizemore, Shawn Nelson, George H. W. Bush, Bill Clinton, Hillary Clinton, Colin Powell', null, 'The story behind the infamous downing of an American Black Hawk helicopter by Somali gunmen.', 'The story behind the infamous downing of an American Black Hawk helicopter by Somali gunmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecwQPm0IbcO4lT8r53nRhXsdXF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1387650'),
  ('677679910142186480', 'Black Hawk Down', 2001, 'Action, War, History', 'Ridley Scott, Sławomir Idziak, Basil Grillo', 'Ken Nolan', 'Josh Hartnett, Eric Bana, Ewan McGregor, Tom Sizemore, William Fichtner, Sam Shepard, Jason Isaacs, Ewen Bremner', 'R', 'When U.S. Rangers and an elite Delta Force team attempt to kidnap two underlings of a Somali warlord, their Black Hawk helicopters are shot down, and the Americans suffer heavy casualties, facing intense fighting from the militia on the ground.', 'When U.S. Rangers and an elite Delta Force team attempt to kidnap two underlings of a Somali warlord, their Black Hawk helicopters are shot down, and the Americans suffer heavy casualties, facing intense fighting from the militia on the ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fU5dSqKRL4XHeEUz62rCKBfYok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:855'),
  ('269002111835607448', 'Black Heat', 1976, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Al Adamson, Gary Graver, John D''Amato', 'Budd Donnelly, John D''Amato, Sheldon Lee', 'Timothy Brown, Russ Tamblyn, Jana Bellan, Geoffrey Land, Regina Carrol, Al Richardson, Tanya Boyd, Darlene Anders', 'R', 'Kicks Carter is a streetwise policeman whose beat is Las Vegas. A crime gang is running guns, selling drugs, loan-sharking, and running a prostitution ring out of an upscale hotel in the city and Kicks is trying to put them out of business. But the interference of a woman reporter is making his job more difficult.', 'Kicks Carter is a streetwise policeman whose beat is Las Vegas. A crime gang is running guns, selling drugs, loan-sharking, and running a prostitution ring out of an upscale hotel in the city and Kicks is trying to put them out of business. But the interference of a woman reporter is making his job more difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWQyl8rWZlTelNnyE7MT2HMHfiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60087'),
  ('481723906401660706', 'Black Heaven', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gilles Marchand, Céline Bozon', 'Gilles Marchand, Dominik Moll', 'Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Louise Bourgoin, Melvil Poupaud, Pauline Étienne, Pierre Niney, Ali Marhyar, Patrick Descamps, Swann Arlaud', null, 'An innocent young man becomes enamored with a mysterious girl. He is lured into "Black Hole" - a dark, obscure video game world of avatars with deadly serious intentions in the real world.', 'An innocent young man becomes enamored with a mysterious girl. He is lured into "Black Hole" - a dark, obscure video game world of avatars with deadly serious intentions in the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22Q9WMNtOWI4jqlKgtMK8Q1WyzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49001'),
  ('681757083770953385', 'Black Holes', 1995, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Pappi Corsicato, Italo Petriccione', 'Pappi Corsicato', 'Iaia Forte, Vincenzo Peluso, Manuela Arcuri, Marinella Anaclerio, Paola Iovinella, Anna Avitabile, Lorenzo Crespi, Maurizio Bizzi', null, 'The impossible love between one prostitute, managing a bunch of handicapped prostitutes, and the homosexual Adamo. In the horrible suburb of Napoli we can follow among fantasy, mythology and reality the absurd life of the protagonists.', 'The impossible love between one prostitute, managing a bunch of handicapped prostitutes, and the homosexual Adamo. In the horrible suburb of Napoli we can follow among fantasy, mythology and reality the absurd life of the protagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOWDfSJKrEfO91NVlv3ODKUGRaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196913'),
  ('1086526676054032809', 'Black Holes: The Edge of All We Know', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Peter Galison, Stephen McCarthy, Tim Cragg', null, 'Sheperd Doeleman, Stephen Hawking, Sasha Haco, Andrew Strominger, Malcolm Perry, Gopal Narayanan, Lindy Blackburn', null, 'Black holes stand at the limit of what we can know. To explore that edge of knowledge, the Event Horizon Telescope links observatories across the world to simulate an earth-sized instrument. With this tool the team pursues the first-ever picture of a black hole, resulting in an image seen by billions of people in April 2019. Meanwhile, Hawking and his team attack the black hole paradox at the heart of theoretical physics—Do predictive laws still function, even in these massive distortions of space and time? Weaving them together is a third strand, philosophical and exploratory using expressive animation. “Edge” is about practicing science at the highest level, a film where observation, theory, and philosophy combine to grasp these most mysterious objects.', 'Black holes stand at the limit of what we can know. To explore that edge of knowledge, the Event Horizon Telescope links observatories across the world to simulate an earth-sized instrument. With this tool the team pursues the first-ever picture of a black hole, resulting in an image seen by billions of people in April 2019. Meanwhile, Hawking and his team attack the black hole paradox at the heart of theoretical physics—Do predictive laws still function, even in these massive distortions of space and time? Weaving them together is a third strand, philosophical and exploratory using expressive animation. “Edge” is about practicing science at the highest level, a film where observation, theory, and philosophy combine to grasp these most mysterious objects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9q9K2OqagIIMd1JcmDo38cDFzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:686002'),
  ('929694121159091390', 'Black Hollow Cage', 2017, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Drama, Horror', 'Sadrac González-Perellón', 'Sadrac González-Perellón', 'Lowena McDonell, Haydée Lysander, Julian Nicholson, Marc Puiggener, Lucy Tillett, Daniel M. Jacobs, Will Hudson', null, 'A girl who lives in a secluded house with her father and her dog finds a mysterious black cube in the woods with the ability to change the past.', 'A girl who lives in a secluded house with her father and her dog finds a mysterious black cube in the woods with the ability to change the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuWp3kfSCtXIOY3Cr2cBA9t9Sib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427253'),
  ('929896637236823320', 'Black House', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Shin Terra, Choi Joo-young, Lee Sung-jae', 'Lee Young-jong, Kim Sung-ho', 'Hwang Jung-min, Kang Shin-il, Yu Seon, Yoo Seung-mok, Kim Seo-hyung, Kim Jung-pal, Jeong In-gi, Lee Kyung-hoon', null, 'Jun-oh, an insurance claims agent, faces off with a client who he suspects of committing murders with the intention of collecting insurance premiums.', 'Jun-oh, an insurance claims agent, faces off with a client who he suspects of committing murders with the intention of collecting insurance premiums.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wghwvk7PmEBQEmgqpdzuFzmMJaq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107976'),
  ('381186202234683139', 'Black Ice', 1992, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Neill Fearnley, David Geddes', 'Arne Olsen, John Alan Schwartz', 'Joanna Pacula, Michael Ironside, Mickey Jones, Michael Nouri, Brent Neale, Harry Nelken, Arne Olsen, Gene Pyrz', 'R', 'A young woman on the run from a murderous rogue government agent hooks up with a pony-tailed taxi driver who reluctantly agrees to help her.', 'A young woman on the run from a murderous rogue government agent hooks up with a pony-tailed taxi driver who reluctantly agrees to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhJ84PyhuhxwZyELOiGX1B0qre4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252072'),
  ('964109818105543907', 'Black Ice', 1994, 'Animation', 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Inspired by a bad fall on a patch of black ice (that ultimately resulted in Brakhage''s need for eye surgery), the filmmaker gives us something of a dreamlike descent through the fear and refractions of closed-eye vision regarding such an event.', 'Inspired by a bad fall on a patch of black ice (that ultimately resulted in Brakhage''s need for eye surgery), the filmmaker gives us something of a dreamlike descent through the fear and refractions of closed-eye vision regarding such an event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVdD0f3oNZ2n5dS0GJ9psGQfJSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126204'),
  ('1065673223914304857', 'Black Ice', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Petri Kotwica, Katri Kannisto, Hanna Bergholm', 'Petri Kotwica', 'Outi Mäenpää, Ria Kataja, Martti Suosalo, Ville Virtanen, Sara Paavolainen, Netta Heikkilä, Väinö Heiskanen, Philipp Danne', null, 'Saara is a middle-aged doctor who one day finds out that her architect-husband Leo is having an affair with a younger woman, Tuuli. Instead of revealing her true identity, Saara pretends to be someone else and makes friends with Tuuli. At the same time she is planning the best way to revenge her husband and his lover.', 'Saara is a middle-aged doctor who one day finds out that her architect-husband Leo is having an affair with a younger woman, Tuuli. Instead of revealing her true identity, Saara pretends to be someone else and makes friends with Tuuli. At the same time she is planning the best way to revenge her husband and his lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l84cc4yrpUGii37FWKBabbjp4iK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25004'),
  ('601349228598201820', 'Black Irish', 2007, 'Drama', 'Brad Gann, Michael Fimognari', 'Brad Gann', 'Michael Angarano, Brendan Gleeson, Tom Guiry, Melissa Leo, Emily VanCamp, Michael Rispoli, Francis Capra, Finn Curtin', null, 'In South Boston, where Irish roots run deep and Catholic tradition reigns, two brothers face similar hardships but lead far different lives. While older brother Terry descends into drugs and crime, 16-year-old Cole vies to make the state baseball championships - but must struggle to withstand his brother''s destructive influence.', 'In South Boston, where Irish roots run deep and Catholic tradition reigns, two brothers face similar hardships but lead far different lives. While older brother Terry descends into drugs and crime, 16-year-old Cole vies to make the state baseball championships - but must struggle to withstand his brother''s destructive influence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBzTbAziSGvfJORB8C2zz690Zre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13071'),
  ('283536985108180157', 'Black Is King', 2020, 'Music', 'Anissa Williams, Emmanuel Adjei, Beyoncé', 'Warsan Shire, Andrew Morrow, Clover Hope', 'Beyoncé, Adut Akech, Naomi Campbell, Blue Ivy Carter, Connie Chiume, Lupita Nyong''o, Kelly Rowland, Moonchild Sanelly', 'PG-13', 'This visual album from Beyoncé reimagines the lessons of "The Lion King" (2019) for today''s young kings and queens in search of their own crowns.', 'This visual album from Beyoncé reimagines the lessons of "The Lion King" (2019) for today''s young kings and queens in search of their own crowns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2u1cyQgBpWWypISdbUDCu2hasGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719643'),
  ('743511601988634708', 'Black Is… Black Ain’t', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Marlon Riggs, Robert Shepard, Christiane Badgley', null, 'Marlon Riggs, Angela Davis, bell hooks, Essex Hemphill, Cornel West, Maulana Karenga, Barbara Smith, Michele Wallace', null, 'African-American documentary filmmaker Marlon Riggs was working on this final film as he died from AIDS-related complications in 1994; he addresses the camera from his hospital bed in several scenes. The film directly addresses sexism and homophobia within the black community, with snippets of misogynistic and anti-gay slurs from popular hip-hop songs juxtaposed with interviews with African-American intellectuals and political theorists, including Cornel West, bell hooks and Angela Davis.', 'African-American documentary filmmaker Marlon Riggs was working on this final film as he died from AIDS-related complications in 1994; he addresses the camera from his hospital bed in several scenes. The film directly addresses sexism and homophobia within the black community, with snippets of misogynistic and anti-gay slurs from popular hip-hop songs juxtaposed with interviews with African-American intellectuals and political theorists, including Cornel West, bell hooks and Angela Davis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqEUXvyBBX7iFXbURAo40ELQLp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77341'),
  ('396797147751712079', 'Black Island', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Miguel Alexandre, Miguel Alexandre', 'Miguel Alexandre, Lisa Hofer', 'Philip Froissant, Hanns Zischler, Alice Dwyer, Mercedes Müller, Lieselotte Voß, Ilknur Boyraz, Charlotte Crome, Katja Geist', null, 'The dark secrets of a seemingly peaceful island threaten to swallow up an orphaned student when he grows close to a mysterious new teacher.', 'The dark secrets of a seemingly peaceful island threaten to swallow up an orphaned student when he grows close to a mysterious new teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53jsv5TASLwOqsJNsUNp4RPPq2l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:847981'),
  ('310511549467109054', 'Black Jack', 1968, 'Western', 'Gianfranco Baldanello, Mario Fioretti', 'Giuseppe Andreoli, Gianfranco Baldanello, Luigi Ambrosini', 'Robert Woods, Lucienne Bridou, Rik Battaglia, Larry Dolgin, Federico Chentrens, Nino Fuscagni, Mimmo Palmara, Goffredo Unger', null, 'Black Jack Murphy is the brains in an outfit of outlaws who rob the bank at Tusca City. All goes to plan with the heist but once the loot is safely obtained Jack''s men lose no time in trying to double cross him. Wily Jack manages to outfox them at first and gets away with the cash but they soon catch up with him again and not only make off with the money but leave him crippled and carrying multiple causes for wanting revenge. This need for amends possesses Jack with an all consuming passion and he sets out to get even with each of his unfaithful former compadres but has his particular sights set on Indian Joe and Sanchez who abused and killed his beloved sister.', 'Black Jack Murphy is the brains in an outfit of outlaws who rob the bank at Tusca City. All goes to plan with the heist but once the loot is safely obtained Jack''s men lose no time in trying to double cross him. Wily Jack manages to outfox them at first and gets away with the cash but they soon catch up with him again and not only make off with the money but leave him crippled and carrying multiple causes for wanting revenge. This need for amends possesses Jack with an all consuming passion and he sets out to get even with each of his unfaithful former compadres but has his particular sights set on Indian Joe and Sanchez who abused and killed his beloved sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJq2ICmcKxirGiFwrpgrayZthJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144734'),
  ('326872857360084279', 'Black Jack', 1979, 'Adventure, History', 'Ken Loach, Chris Menges, Raymond Day', 'Ken Loach', 'Jean Franval, Stephen Hirst, Louise Cooper, Pat Wallis, John Young, William Moore, Doreen Mantle, Russell Waters', null, 'When honest young Tolly is forced on the run with ‘Black Jack’, a villainous ruffian, adventure and mishap are never far away. As the two enter a world of body-snatchers, private lunatic asylums, and traveling fairs they find friendship in the most unlikely places.', 'When honest young Tolly is forced on the run with ‘Black Jack’, a villainous ruffian, adventure and mishap are never far away. As the two enter a world of body-snatchers, private lunatic asylums, and traveling fairs they find friendship in the most unlikely places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYXm5MiaWFMrFHOO7PXsVaf8nvj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69567'),
  ('650138464306937132', 'Black Jack: The Movie', 1996, 'Animation, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Osamu Dezaki, Hirokata Takahashi, Fumihiro Yoshimura', 'Eto Mori, Osamu Dezaki', 'Akio Otsuka, Yuko Mizutani, Mayo Suzukaze, Ai Orikasa, Atsushi Ⅱ, Kikuko Inoue, Issei Futamata, Katsuhisa Houki', 'NR', 'Black Jack is a master surgeon who possesses impeccable skills, enabling him to perform operations that are impossible for even the finest surgeons. He now is faced with his most difficult task to date and must challenge the limits of medical science...before it''s too late!', 'Black Jack is a master surgeon who possesses impeccable skills, enabling him to perform operations that are impossible for even the finest surgeons. He now is faced with his most difficult task to date and must challenge the limits of medical science...before it''s too late!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iceZCYdSExrLuUotkU9XJUWiU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27213'),
  ('191374274358644802', 'Black Jack: The Two Doctors in Black', 2005, 'Animation, Drama', 'Keisuke Nakamura, Makoto Tezuka, Satoshi Kuwabara', 'Katsuhiko Chiba, Hirotoshi Kobayashi', 'Akio Otsuka, Yuko Mizutani, Makoto Ishii, Kenji Utsumi, Aya Hirayama, Yuma Ishigaki, Takeshi Kaga, Akiko Kawase', null, 'The mega-corporate Daedalus Group is under attack by a small group of activists known as the Ghost of Icarus. While taking care of some of the victims of the bombing, Black Jack encounters Dr. Kiriko, also known as Death Incarnate, who just like him, asks his patients huge sums of money but instead of saving them, he offers them a painless death. When the activist group requests both doctors’ collaboration, Black Jack finds himself caught in a spiral of life, death and treason while trying to save his patients'' lives and avoid the breaking of a biological war that could destroy humanity.', 'The mega-corporate Daedalus Group is under attack by a small group of activists known as the Ghost of Icarus. While taking care of some of the victims of the bombing, Black Jack encounters Dr. Kiriko, also known as Death Incarnate, who just like him, asks his patients huge sums of money but instead of saving them, he offers them a painless death. When the activist group requests both doctors’ collaboration, Black Jack finds himself caught in a spiral of life, death and treason while trying to save his patients'' lives and avoid the breaking of a biological war that could destroy humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3ut5CbzJCIh15YYdW6kfUDFF03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87270'),
  ('916573754560252417', 'Black Jesus', 1968, 'Drama', 'Valerio Zurlini, Aiace Parolin', 'Valerio Zurlini, Franco Brusati', 'Woody Strode, Franco Citti, Jean Servais, Pier Paolo Capponi, Stephen Forsyth, Salvatore Basile, Giuseppe Transocchi, Renzo Rossi', null, 'A thinly-disguised biography of African leader Patrice Lumumba, here called Lalubi. Lalubi, a Christ-like leader determined to save his people, by passive resistance, from the dictatorial regime propped up by European colonialists, is imprisoned and tortured, along with a thief who comes to a greater understanding through his contact with Lalubi.', 'A thinly-disguised biography of African leader Patrice Lumumba, here called Lalubi. Lalubi, a Christ-like leader determined to save his people, by passive resistance, from the dictatorial regime propped up by European colonialists, is imprisoned and tortured, along with a thief who comes to a greater understanding through his contact with Lalubi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uizGBWftsZZYlAzMZZVdtFNLiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89642'),
  ('221373386339700807', 'Black Journal', 1977, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Mauro Bolognini, Armando Nannuzzi, Antonio Gabrielli', 'Nicola Badalucco', 'Shelley Winters, Max von Sydow, Renato Pozzetto, Alberto Lionello, Laura Antonelli, Mario Scaccia, Franco Branciaroli, Milena Vukotić', null, 'A mother so insanely overprotective of her grown son decides to make a deal with death by offering alternate victims plucked from among her fellow tenants in a 1938 Italian apartment building.', 'A mother so insanely overprotective of her grown son decides to make a deal with death by offering alternate victims plucked from among her fellow tenants in a 1938 Italian apartment building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRMenXwuYjbOtWjw705y9nPutpI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58203'),
  ('341274468466835504', 'Black Killer', 1971, 'Action, Romance, Western', 'Carlo Croccolo, Franco Villa, Renata Parisi', 'Carlo Croccolo, Luigi Angelo', 'Klaus Kinski, Fred Robsahm, Antonio Cantafora, Marina Rabissi, Enzo Pulcrano, Tiziana Dini, Calogero Caruana, Gerardo Rossi', null, 'The town of Tombstone is overrun by Ramon, Pedro, Miguel, Ryan and Slide -- five outlaw brothers who are taken on by gunslinger Burt Collins and a deadly lawyer.', 'The town of Tombstone is overrun by Ramon, Pedro, Miguel, Ryan and Slide -- five outlaw brothers who are taken on by gunslinger Burt Collins and a deadly lawyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2vyKEJX9dtRk5szQTitV87Jh5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90468'),
  ('303858701873624342', 'Black Kiss', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Romance', 'Makoto Tezuka, Tomohiro Kubo, Kazuhiro Shirao', 'Makoto Tezuka, Koji Tanaka, Haruyo Moriyoshi', 'Reika Hashimoto, Kaori Kawamura, Shunsuke Matsuoka, Masanobu Ando, Hijiri Kojima, Seri Iwahori, Anji, Sawaco', null, 'Asuka is an aspiring model who moves to Tokyo to pursue her career. She moves into a small apartment with a friend of a friend, Kasumi. A bizarre murder occurs in the hotel across the street. The body was mutilated and repositioned into a lurid work of art. After this, a string of murders start happening all around the two girls, as if some crazed serial killer was following them. At the scene of each crime, the perpetrator leaves a black lip print, and is subsequently dubbed "The Black Kiss."', 'Asuka is an aspiring model who moves to Tokyo to pursue her career. She moves into a small apartment with a friend of a friend, Kasumi. A bizarre murder occurs in the hotel across the street. The body was mutilated and repositioned into a lurid work of art. After this, a string of murders start happening all around the two girls, as if some crazed serial killer was following them. At the scene of each crime, the perpetrator leaves a black lip print, and is subsequently dubbed "The Black Kiss."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XDNIeQS6T3jxptmzvHzOx0w1W1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47331'),
  ('92171866486033021', 'Black Knight', 2001, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Sandi Sissel, Ueli Steiger, Gil Junger', 'Gerry Swallow, Peter Gaulke, Darryl Quarles', 'Martin Lawrence, Marsha Thomason, Tom Wilkinson, Jeannette Weegar, Vincent Regan, Daryl Mitchell, Michael Countryman, Kevin Conway', 'PG-13', 'Martin Lawrence plays Jamal, an employee in Medieval World amusement park. After nearly drowning in the moat, he awakens to find himself in 14th century England.', 'Martin Lawrence plays Jamal, an employee in Medieval World amusement park. After nearly drowning in the moat, he awakens to find himself in 14th century England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JC7c2Y70R5oBNa8v4pnHfzYvFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11469'),
  ('618397768396428381', 'Black Legion', 1937, 'Crime, Drama', 'Archie Mayo, George Barnes, Jack Sullivan', 'William Wister Haines, Abem Finkel', 'Humphrey Bogart, Dick Foran, Erin O''Brien-Moore, Ann Sheridan, Helen Flint, Joe Sawyer, Clifford Soubier, Alonzo Price', 'NR', 'When a hard-working machinist loses a promotion to a Polish-born worker, he is seduced into joining the secretive Black Legion, which intimidates foreigners through violence.', 'When a hard-working machinist loses a promotion to a Polish-born worker, he is seduced into joining the secretive Black Legion, which intimidates foreigners through violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9g8F2u5sn2DvFovY1Dxqyd1Ryvi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42683'),
  ('724447715050555884', 'Black Light', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Bae Jong-dae, Song Jae-ho, Cho Wang-seob', 'Bae Jong-dae', 'Kim See-eun, Yeom Hye-ran, Park Ji-hu, Lee Ju-won, Kang Jin-ah, Jo Dae-hee, Son Kang-gook, Kim Kwang-shik', null, 'After a car accident leaves one man dead and another in a coma, it''s believed that the dead man was at fault. Guilt-ridden, his wife, Hee-ju, struggles to move forward. She ends up learning that the victim had previously tried to kill himself. Suspecting the accident may have been on purpose, she begins an investigation.', 'After a car accident leaves one man dead and another in a coma, it''s believed that the dead man was at fault. Guilt-ridden, his wife, Hee-ju, struggles to move forward. She ends up learning that the victim had previously tried to kill himself. Suspecting the accident may have been on purpose, she begins an investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFyiL9EqtTRxBUKJit6ib6eFgTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:705993'),
  ('1096962374792145814', 'Black Lightning', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Dmitry Kiselev, Alexander Voitinsky, Sergey Trofimov', 'Dmitriy Aleynikov, Alexandr Talal, Vladimir Neklyudov', 'Grigoriy Dobrygin, Ekaterina Vilkova, Viktor Verzhbitskiy, Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Juozas Budraitis, Ivan Zhidkov, Sergey Garmash, Ekaterina Starshova', 'NR', 'A Moscow University student discovers that his otherwise unremarkable car can fly. After his father is attacked, he decides to use the car to fight crime and becomes the city''s defender against an evil millionaire.', 'A Moscow University student discovers that his otherwise unremarkable car can fly. After his father is attacked, he decides to use the car to fight crime and becomes the city''s defender against an evil millionaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jR8cXfPw0bXx4vc2YUlBxPbg0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31162'),
