  ('466752159763240119', 'Black Magic 2', 1976, 'Horror', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Ni Kuang', 'Ti Lung, Tanny Tien-Ni, Lo Lieh, Wai Wang, Lily Li, Lam Wai-Tiu, Terry Lau Wai-Yue, Yang Chi-Ching', null, 'A doctor suspects black magic on his hospital after experiencing some bizarre incidents and sends for two doctors (who are a couple) from Hong Kong. The wife is very skeptical and places volunteer for a spell. It became obvious that here is an evil wizard who stay young by including drinking human breast milk. A Shaw Brothers production.', 'A doctor suspects black magic on his hospital after experiencing some bizarre incidents and sends for two doctors (who are a couple) from Hong Kong. The wife is very skeptical and places volunteer for a spell. It became obvious that here is an evil wizard who stay young by including drinking human breast milk. A Shaw Brothers production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7XyDfQ66qV0eMdRkfm11fq1LaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104272'),
  ('1052179863847135423', 'Black Magic M-66', 1987, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Shirow Masamune, Hiroyuki Kitakubo, Nobuo Koyama', 'Shirow Masamune, Hiroyuki Kitakubo', 'Ichiro Nagai, Shinji Ogawa, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Kozo Shioya, Norio Wakamoto, Kazuya Sokabe, Kyôko Tonomiya, Masato Tsujimura', null, 'A top-secret weapon escapes from military custody ready to destroy its pre-programmed target. The nosy freelance reporter who shows up to cover the story lands herself at the center of something even more dangerous than the international scandal she signed up for.', 'A top-secret weapon escapes from military custody ready to destroy its pre-programmed target. The nosy freelance reporter who shows up to cover the story lands herself at the center of something even more dangerous than the international scandal she signed up for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osln12VHCtGEhiib7FHnTBZr9FJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66045'),
  ('444949632948588809', 'Black Magic Rites', 1973, 'Horror', 'Renato Polselli', 'Renato Polselli', 'Mickey Hargitay, Rita Calderoni, Raul Lovecchio, Christa Barrymore, William Darni, Max Dorian, Marcello Bonini Olas, Cristina Perrier', null, 'Isabel is a dead vampire and witch whose body is hanging in a basement while the owner tries to kidnap virgins for a sacrifice that could mean Isabel’s resurrection. But doing this won’t be easy as the women aren’t gonna give in very easily.', 'Isabel is a dead vampire and witch whose body is hanging in a basement while the owner tries to kidnap virgins for a sacrifice that could mean Isabel’s resurrection. But doing this won’t be easy as the women aren’t gonna give in very easily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tycjaj0acMncXA1lZYfeRj4qhh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59912'),
  ('990729129040874112', 'Black Maiden: Chapter Q', 2019, 'Horror', 'Sakichi Sato, Tojiro Kurita, Toshiaki Kondo', 'Sakichi Sato', 'Nana Asakawa, Kana Kita, Soko Wada, Yoko Mitsuya, Ririne Sasano, Natsu Andô, Harumi Shuhama, Ryôta Matsushima', null, 'Mei lives in an orphanage, but she is adopted by the wealthy and kind Uda family. The family already has an adopted daughter Rana. While Rana seems weird, Mei and Rana find that they have a lot in common and become like real sisters. The girls then learn that the Uda family''s business has collapsed and they can only keep one of the daughters. One of the girls will be returned to the orphanage in a week. Revenge is soon planned.', 'Mei lives in an orphanage, but she is adopted by the wealthy and kind Uda family. The family already has an adopted daughter Rana. While Rana seems weird, Mei and Rana find that they have a lot in common and become like real sisters. The girls then learn that the Uda family''s business has collapsed and they can only keep one of the daughters. One of the girls will be returned to the orphanage in a week. Revenge is soon planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJIwP3iuXiWOjx9gkTEucRCvBGo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665568'),
  ('107290527601408904', 'Black Mama, White Mama', 1973, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Eddie Romero, Maria Saret, Justo Paulino', 'H.R. Christian', 'Pam Grier, Margaret Markov, Sid Haig, Lynn Borden, Zaldy Zshornack, Laurie Burton, Eddie Garcia, Alona Alegre', null, 'When two troublemaking female prisoners (one a revolutionary, the other a former harem-girl) can''t seem to get along, they are chained together and extradited for safekeeping. The women, still chained together, stumble, stab, and cat-fight their way across the wilderness, igniting a bloody shootout between gangsters and a group of revolutionaries.', 'When two troublemaking female prisoners (one a revolutionary, the other a former harem-girl) can''t seem to get along, they are chained together and extradited for safekeeping. The women, still chained together, stumble, stab, and cat-fight their way across the wilderness, igniting a bloody shootout between gangsters and a group of revolutionaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwTnHe9WBBWvaivTNeuuy1tUzLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28797'),
  ('43403168636296969', 'Black Mask', 1996, 'Action', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Tony Cheung Tung-Leung, Daniel Lee', 'Koan Hui, Tsui Hark, Teddy Chan', 'Jet Li, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Françoise Yip, Patrick Lung Kong, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Xiong Xinxin, Henry Fong Ping', 'R', 'Super-soldier recruit Tsui Chik is forced to escape with his comrades after the project is canceled. Months later, he''s trying to have a quiet life as a librarian with his best friend, Inspector Shek Wai-Ho. However, a string of vicious gangland murders begins that has all the markings of Tsui''s former compatriots who seem to have turned to crime. Realizing that the police are helpless, he decides to take them on himself. With a disguise, Tsui becomes the mysterious superhero known only as Black Mask.', 'Super-soldier recruit Tsui Chik is forced to escape with his comrades after the project is canceled. Months later, he''s trying to have a quiet life as a librarian with his best friend, Inspector Shek Wai-Ho. However, a string of vicious gangland murders begins that has all the markings of Tsui''s former compatriots who seem to have turned to crime. Realizing that the police are helpless, he decides to take them on himself. With a disguise, Tsui becomes the mysterious superhero known only as Black Mask.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEmG43S9o5C6XeFschoFQU4Bcub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9460'),
  ('578294537890957292', 'Black Mask 2: City of Masks', 2002, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Tsui Hark, Horace Wong Wing-Hang, William Yim Wai-Lun', 'Dirk Blackman, Charles Cain', 'Andy On Chi-Kit, Tobin Bell, Jon Polito, Teresa Maria Herrera, Scott Adkins, Rob Szatkowski, Tyler Mane, Oris Erhuero', 'PG', 'The Black Mask must stop a group intent on setting off a DNA bomb that could cause mutations to the human race.', 'The Black Mask must stop a group intent on setting off a DNA bomb that could cause mutations to the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uc9rOZs8ybdZKQVi8zLwSiEP9kz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49516'),
  ('583085449819184407', 'Black Mass', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Scott Cooper, Masanobu Takayanagi, Sarah Contant', 'Jez Butterworth, Mark Mallouk', 'Johnny Depp, Joel Edgerton, Julianne Nicholson, Dakota Johnson, Kevin Bacon, Benedict Cumberbatch, Peter Sarsgaard, Juno Temple', 'R', 'The true story of Whitey Bulger, the brother of a state senator and the most infamous violent criminal in the history of South Boston, who became an FBI informant to take down a Mafia family invading his turf.', 'The true story of Whitey Bulger, the brother of a state senator and the most infamous violent criminal in the history of South Boston, who became an FBI informant to take down a Mafia family invading his turf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfwciv4LIJkNQsfuhYGv0Nkiweg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261023'),
  ('291102716734848633', 'Black Mic Mac', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Thomas Gilou, Claude Agostini', 'Patrick Braoudé, Cheik Doukouré, Monique Annaud', 'Jacques Villeret, Isaach de Bankolé, Félicité Wouassi, Daniel Russo, Houdia Seye, Sidy Lamine Diarra, Cheik Doukouré, Mohamed Camara', null, 'This is a charming and successful farce from director Thomas Gilou, featuring a witty screenplay co-authored by producer Monique Annaud. When a group of African squatters in Paris are threatened with eviction, they find themselves fighting against a bureaucracy that few French citizens understand, let alone immigrants. In desperation, they turn to their best option to resolve this dilemma: they call for a sorcerer from home. The sorcerer hops on a jet to Paris to cast spells on the entrenched bureaucrat, and while en route he strikes up a conversation with a fellow passenger, mentioning his job pays quite well. The interested passenger could stand to make a few extra francs, so he decides to take the sorcerer''s place. Once he arrives, this imposter has to act like he knows what he is doing, and at the same time, he had better solve the eviction problem.', 'This is a charming and successful farce from director Thomas Gilou, featuring a witty screenplay co-authored by producer Monique Annaud. When a group of African squatters in Paris are threatened with eviction, they find themselves fighting against a bureaucracy that few French citizens understand, let alone immigrants. In desperation, they turn to their best option to resolve this dilemma: they call for a sorcerer from home. The sorcerer hops on a jet to Paris to cast spells on the entrenched bureaucrat, and while en route he strikes up a conversation with a fellow passenger, mentioning his job pays quite well. The interested passenger could stand to make a few extra francs, so he decides to take the sorcerer''s place. Once he arrives, this imposter has to act like he knows what he is doing, and at the same time, he had better solve the eviction problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptdw2OnXFnjB1rDKeR6VSyRvYwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63657'),
  ('420005165081768467', 'Black Mirror: Bandersnatch', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Drama, Horror, TV Movie', 'Jay Arthur, Nick Simmonds, Mike Chapman', 'Charlie Brooker', 'Fionn Whitehead, Craig Parkinson, Alice Lowe, Asim Chaudhry, Will Poulter, Tallulah Haddon, Catriona Knox, Paul Bradley', 'R', 'In 1984, a young programmer begins to question reality as he adapts a dark fantasy novel into a video game. A mind-bending tale with multiple endings.', 'In 1984, a young programmer begins to question reality as he adapts a dark fantasy novel into a video game. A mind-bending tale with multiple endings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fR0VZ0VE598zl1lrYf7IfBqEwQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569547'),
  ('954043440019579549', 'Black Mold', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'John Pata, Sarah Cayce, Michele B. McGraw', 'John Pata', 'Agnes Albright, Jeremy Holm, Maisie Merlock, Caito Aase, Andrew Bailes, Jessica Ambuehl, Cate Rio, Leslie Lux', null, 'Photographers Brooke Konrad and Tanner Behlman travel to rural, abandoned buildings to capture the inherent beauty of long-forgotten locations, but far from forgotten are the traumatic memories that surface in Brooke when they meet The Man Upstairs, an unsuspecting squatter. As tensions and uncertainties arise, Brooke must determine if this mysterious stranger will provide her the closure she so desperately seeks or let the fears of the past consume her.', 'Photographers Brooke Konrad and Tanner Behlman travel to rural, abandoned buildings to capture the inherent beauty of long-forgotten locations, but far from forgotten are the traumatic memories that surface in Brooke when they meet The Man Upstairs, an unsuspecting squatter. As tensions and uncertainties arise, Brooke must determine if this mysterious stranger will provide her the closure she so desperately seeks or let the fears of the past consume her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwxQ2PW7hvpxCofF4IzrlHbIHME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949855'),
  ('259204229015437193', 'Black Money', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Chung Ji-young, Kim Hyeong-seok', 'Han Hyeon-geun', 'Cho Jin-woong, Lee Hanee, Lee Kyung-young, Kang Shin-il, Choi Deok-moon, Cho Han-cheul, Heo Sung-tae, Lee Sung-min', null, 'A prosecutor is falsely accused of sexual assault in a suicide note from a woman that he is convinced was actually murdered. As he investigates her death to clear his name, he realizes that the truth lies in a huge financial scandal.', 'A prosecutor is falsely accused of sexual assault in a suicide note from a woman that he is convinced was actually murdered. As he investigates her death to clear his name, he realizes that the truth lies in a huge financial scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHiWj4APPx5GxByvUAVN3H0AN58.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603314'),
  ('479663429924875735', 'Black Moon', 1934, 'Horror, Drama', 'Roy William Neill, Joseph H. August', 'Wells Root', 'Jack Holt, Fay Wray, Dorothy Burgess, Cora Sue Collins, Arnold Korff, Clarence Muse, Eleanor Wesselhoeft, Madame Sul-Te-Wan', 'NR', 'A woman returning to her island birthplace finds herself drawn to a voodoo cult.', 'A woman returning to her island birthplace finds herself drawn to a voodoo cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9tWqX7G3w3PCCaN8JkDkNo9sXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29126'),
  ('1130920339233091524', 'Black Moon', 1975, 'Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Louis Malle, Sven Nykvist, Fernand Moszkowicz', 'Louis Malle', 'Cathryn Harrison, Therese Giehse, Alexandra Stewart, Joe Dallesandro', 'R', 'There is a global civil war between men and women. A teenage girl tries to escape this reality and arrives at a hidden place where a strange unicorn lives with a family: sister, brother, many children and an old, bedridden woman who stays in contact with the world through her radio.', 'There is a global civil war between men and women. A teenage girl tries to escape this reality and arrives at a hidden place where a strange unicorn lives with a family: sister, brother, many children and an old, bedridden woman who stays in contact with the world through her radio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsbauHYC5E7YK7UeMl3FM4U9xhK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27361'),
