  ('632659670534568665', 'Black Souls', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Vladan Radović, Francesco Munzi', 'Fabrizio Ruggirello, Maurizio Braucci, Francesco Munzi', 'Marco Leonardi, Peppino Mazzotta, Fabrizio Ferracane, Barbora Bobuľová, Anna Ferruzzo, Giuseppe Fumo, Pasquale Romeo, Vito Facciolla', 'NR', 'A former narcotics smuggler, now living peaceably in the Calabrian hills, is drawn back into his family’s drug-trade dynasty by his impetuous teenage son.', 'A former narcotics smuggler, now living peaceably in the Calabrian hills, is drawn back into his family’s drug-trade dynasty by his impetuous teenage son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wed0sY0JNWVGZmvTKEIMluT8M2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283707'),
  ('318470291820225823', 'Black Spurs', 1965, 'Western', 'R.G. Springsteen, Ralph Woolsey, James A. Rosenberger', 'Steve Fisher', 'Rory Calhoun, Linda Darnell, Terry Moore, Scott Brady, Lon Chaney Jr., Richard Arlen, James Best, Bruce Cabot', 'NR', 'A dissatisfied ranch hand becomes a bounty hunter. He conspires with a crooked town boss to dirty up a neighboring village where a valuable railroad franchise is headed.', 'A dissatisfied ranch hand becomes a bounty hunter. He conspires with a crooked town boss to dirty up a neighboring village where a valuable railroad franchise is headed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxNcJpxnCbmrhngZtyXe0Esyz2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179921'),
  ('197262289595735472', 'Black Stone', 2016, 'Drama', 'Roh Gyeong-tae, Jo Yeong-sang, Park Ji-sung', 'Roh Gyeong-tae', 'Won Tae-hee, Son Suk-ku, Jung Yong-sik, Baek Hyun-joo', null, 'In a post-trauma search for truth, Shon Sun’s path winds through a mysterious jungle where the line between past and present fades.', 'In a post-trauma search for truth, Shon Sun’s path winds through a mysterious jungle where the line between past and present fades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bc14kSJdbw5hI9RooQCyD79F0OV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317991'),
  ('1145826478603921399', 'Black Storm', 2024, 'Action, Crime', 'Qin Pengfei, Zhao Xiaofeng', 'Wang Po-Song', 'Ashton Chen, Bao Bei''er, Qu Shanshan, Li Daqiang, Liu Fengchao, Wang Zhengquan, Zhao Runnan, Wang Hong', null, 'After villager Gu Dahe reports criminal leader Wei Tianlang, he mysteriously disappears, and his sister dies under suspicious circumstances. Amid a nationwide anti-crime campaign, Lei Yang, captain of the criminal investigation unit, steps in to uncover the truth and bring justice.', 'After villager Gu Dahe reports criminal leader Wei Tianlang, he mysteriously disappears, and his sister dies under suspicious circumstances. Amid a nationwide anti-crime campaign, Lei Yang, captain of the criminal investigation unit, steps in to uncover the truth and bring justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqILl3CWEZv7M8V70aPtH23GOAl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1336762'),
  ('929433526856316669', 'Black Sun', 1964, 'Drama', 'Koreyoshi Kurahara, Mitsuji Kanau, Yukihiko Kondo', 'Nobuo Yamada', 'Tamio Kawachi, Chico Lourant, Tatsuya Fuji, Yuko Chishiro, Hideji Ōtaki, Shogen Nitta, Zenji Yamada, Ryusei Ito', null, 'Akira, a young, jazz-obsessed drifter, returns to his squat, a ruined church, and finds Gill, a wounded African-American GI, on the run after the death of a white GI. Despite terrible misunderstandings and culture clash, Akira agrees to help Gill escape towards the sea, dodging military police along the way.', 'Akira, a young, jazz-obsessed drifter, returns to his squat, a ruined church, and finds Gill, a wounded African-American GI, on the run after the death of a white GI. Despite terrible misunderstandings and culture clash, Akira agrees to help Gill escape towards the sea, dodging military police along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cVSAMCFi3hczugjdfwookGEBx2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111304'),
  ('901557706279622603', 'Black Sun', 2016, null, 'Laura Huertas Millán, Jordane Chouzenoux', 'Laura Huertas Millán', 'Nohemi Millan, Martha Millán, Laura Huertas Millán', null, 'Antonia is a lyrical singer whose beauty is uncommon, lush and somber. Recovering from a suicide attempt in a rehabilitation institution, all her family ties are irreparably broken. But her sister remains deeply affected by what happened.', 'Antonia is a lyrical singer whose beauty is uncommon, lush and somber. Recovering from a suicide attempt in a rehabilitation institution, all her family ties are irreparably broken. But her sister remains deeply affected by what happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vFRDvGY0WYbIJL4coz9GZlBagb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422431'),
  ('990868766558217009', 'Black Sun: The Nanking Massacre', 1995, 'Drama, History, Horror, Thriller, War', 'Mou Tun-Fei, Sung Kin-Man, Zhang Xihe', 'Lee Wing-Shui', 'Zhang Liang, Poon Wing, Hung Siu-Tin, Geung Man-Ting, Siu Wa, Poon Man-Diy, Han Zhenhua, Li Wei', null, 'Black Sun: The Nanking Massacre depicts the brutal events behind the Nanking Massacre committed by the Imperial Japanese army against the Chinese people during the Second Sino-Japanese War.', 'Black Sun: The Nanking Massacre depicts the brutal events behind the Nanking Massacre committed by the Imperial Japanese army against the Chinese people during the Second Sino-Japanese War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxDxcrXzJzZLzEkk0MNozzKiAzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51007'),
  ('991119339079042813', 'Black Sunday', 1960, 'Horror', 'Mario Bava, Mario Bava, Vana Caruso', 'Mario Serandrei, Ennio De Concini', 'Barbara Steele, John Richardson, Andrea Checchi, Ivo Garrani, Arturo Dominici, Enrico Olivieri, Antonio Pierfederici, Tino Bianchi', 'NR', 'A vengeful witch, Asa Vajda, and her fiendish servant, Igor Jauvitch, return from the grave and begin a bloody campaign to possess the body of the witch''s beautiful look-alike descendant: Katia. Only a handsome doctor with the help of family members stand in her way.', 'A vengeful witch, Asa Vajda, and her fiendish servant, Igor Jauvitch, return from the grave and begin a bloody campaign to possess the body of the witch''s beautiful look-alike descendant: Katia. Only a handsome doctor with the help of family members stand in her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x41Zx8GeZhducquhOq9nE7z1GBG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27632'),
  ('744324907195278566', 'Black Sunday', 1977, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'John Frankenheimer, John A. Alonzo, Larry Franco', 'Ernest Lehman, Kenneth Ross, Ivan Moffat', 'Robert Shaw, Bruce Dern, Marthe Keller, Fritz Weaver, Steven Keats, Bekim Fehmiu, Michael V. Gazzo, William Daniels', 'R', 'An Israeli anti-terrorist agent must stop a disgruntled Vietnam vet cooperating in a Black September PLO plot to commit a terrorist attack at the Super Bowl.', 'An Israeli anti-terrorist agent must stop a disgruntled Vietnam vet cooperating in a Black September PLO plot to commit a terrorist attack at the Super Bowl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rMXQICfFEsSGHCjh3bJj7K33sZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50374'),
  ('443214841161850663', 'Black Swan', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Darren Aronofsky, Matthew Libatique, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Andres Heinz, John J. McLaughlin, Mark Heyman', 'Natalie Portman, Mila Kunis, Vincent Cassel, Barbara Hershey, Winona Ryder, Benjamin Millepied, Ksenia Solo, Kristina Anapau', 'R', 'A committed dancer struggles to maintain her sanity after winning the lead role in a production of Tchaikovsky''s "Swan Lake".', 'A committed dancer struggles to maintain her sanity after winning the lead role in a production of Tchaikovsky''s "Swan Lake".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viWheBd44bouiLCHgNMvahLThqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44214'),
  ('723577145586361594', 'Black Swarm', 2007, 'Horror, Action', 'David Winning, Nadine Brassard, Ross Clyde', null, 'Sebastien Roberts, Sarah Allen, Jayne Heitmeyer, Rebecca Windheim, Robert Englund, Michel Perron, Sheena Larkin, Robert Higden', null, 'A widow, Deputy Sheriff Jane Kozik, moves from Manhattan to Black Stone, New York, with her daughter Kelsey. There she expects to find a safe place to live. The day after moving, a homeless man is found dead in the tool shed of Jane''s blind friend Beverly; an entomologist, Katherine is summoned to help with the investigation, along with Devin, Jane''s brother-in-law and former boyfriend. Meanwhile, Kelsey befriends Eli, a scientist who has developed genetically modified wasps to the army as a weapon, and who is now trying to revert the process. When the wasps attack Black Stone, Jane, Devin and Eli team-up to attempt to destroy the swarm.', 'A widow, Deputy Sheriff Jane Kozik, moves from Manhattan to Black Stone, New York, with her daughter Kelsey. There she expects to find a safe place to live. The day after moving, a homeless man is found dead in the tool shed of Jane''s blind friend Beverly; an entomologist, Katherine is summoned to help with the investigation, along with Devin, Jane''s brother-in-law and former boyfriend. Meanwhile, Kelsey befriends Eli, a scientist who has developed genetically modified wasps to the army as a weapon, and who is now trying to revert the process. When the wasps attack Black Stone, Jane, Devin and Eli team-up to attempt to destroy the swarm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8p4LZnanlJBIzEL2ZRX4cyo23dG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15591'),
  ('30929008486896147', 'Black Tar Heroin: The Dark End of the Street', 2000, 'Documentary', 'Steven Okazaki', null, null, 'R', 'The film follows a simple structure, and shows the drug-related degradation of five youths (Jake, Tracey, Jessica, Alice, Oreo) during the course of three years. The film depicts drug-related crimes and diseases: prostitution, male prostitution, AIDS, and lethal overdoses.', 'The film follows a simple structure, and shows the drug-related degradation of five youths (Jake, Tracey, Jessica, Alice, Oreo) during the course of three years. The film depicts drug-related crimes and diseases: prostitution, male prostitution, AIDS, and lethal overdoses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbJuchlaqKwGtkHKe5QL7Sm2CfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79515'),
  ('265720637786526815', 'Black Tea', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Aymerick Pilarski, Steve Berron, Clément Comet', 'Abderrahmane Sissako, Kessen Tall', 'Nina Mélo, Chang Han, Wu Ke-xi, Michael Chang, Yu Pei-Jen, Huang Wei, Isabelle Kabano, Emery Gahuranyi', 'NR', 'Aya, a young Ivorian woman in her early thirties, says no on her wedding day, to everyone’s astonishment. After emigrating to Asia, she works in a tea export shop with Cai, a 45-year-old Chinese man. Aya and Cai fall in love but can their affair survive the turmoil of their past and other people’s prejudices?', 'Aya, a young Ivorian woman in her early thirties, says no on her wedding day, to everyone’s astonishment. After emigrating to Asia, she works in a tea export shop with Cai, a 45-year-old Chinese man. Aya and Cai fall in love but can their affair survive the turmoil of their past and other people’s prejudices?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wfbaGi9wS9wKvpN3eMSRgfgbkM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662402'),
  ('903141782882052647', 'Black Tears', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fernando Bauluz, Ricardo Franco', 'Ángeles González-Sinde, Dionisio Pérez, Ricardo Franco', 'Ariadna Gil, Fele Martínez, Elena Anaya, Ana Risueño, Elvira Mínguez', null, 'A mentally unbalanced woman captures the heart of an already-engaged admirer.', 'A mentally unbalanced woman captures the heart of an already-engaged admirer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Vh7PfSsxirEF9hWc3BroO7dh8W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111689'),
  ('1029535875636482671', 'Black Test Car', 1962, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Yoshihisa Nakagawa', 'Kazuo Funahashi, Yoshihiro Ishimatsu', 'Jirō Tamiya, Junko Kano, Eiji Funakoshi, Hideo Takamatsu, Ichirō Sugai, Kichijirō Ueda, Reiko Shirai, Sachiko Meguro', null, 'Two car manufacturers spy on each other to try to find out details and prices of a new sports car each is about to launch.', 'Two car manufacturers spy on each other to try to find out details and prices of a new sports car each is about to launch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CHEqH1fItetgKY5vVNmNlGrlqA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93891'),
  ('717177814100331792', 'Black Thunder', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Rick Jacobson', 'William C. Martell', 'Catherine Bell, Michael Dudikoff, Michael Cavanaugh, Frederic Forrest, Nancy Valen, Landon Hall, Marcus Aurelius, John Furey', null, 'When the top secret prototype of the Nova Stealth fighter has been stolen, the Pentagon launches big alarm; the plane shouldn''t come into hostile hands...', 'When the top secret prototype of the Nova Stealth fighter has been stolen, the Pentagon launches big alarm; the plane shouldn''t come into hostile hands...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lofCiFwAuNcaxvt4EaFiMvVUhwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57735'),
  ('1062315533852343214', 'Black Thursday', 1974, 'History, Drama', 'Michel Mitrani, Claude Othnin-Girard', null, 'Christine Pascal, Judith Magre, Alice Sapritch, Michel Auclair, Christian Rist, Michel Robin, Henri Garcin, Jacques Rispal', null, 'In Paris, in 1942, on a Thursday, the Parisian police herded together some 13,000 Jews for deportation to German territory. In this story, Paul (Christian Rist) is a teenager who tries to prevent this from happening. At first he attempts to save two elderly Jews, but they are resigned to their fate and comply with the order to assemble. For a short while, he is able to keep Jeanne (Christine Pascal) from joining them, but, after a long and strenuous day, she finally escapes from him he is too tired to chase after her.', 'In Paris, in 1942, on a Thursday, the Parisian police herded together some 13,000 Jews for deportation to German territory. In this story, Paul (Christian Rist) is a teenager who tries to prevent this from happening. At first he attempts to save two elderly Jews, but they are resigned to their fate and comply with the order to assemble. For a short while, he is able to keep Jeanne (Christine Pascal) from joining them, but, after a long and strenuous day, she finally escapes from him he is too tired to chase after her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilgjUUImh4xoP2dvzUhLYidqTt3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264564'),
  ('690687909550662203', 'Black Tide', 2018, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Julien Ducos, Jean-Sébastien Viguié, Violette Horvat', 'Erick Zonca, Lou de Fanget Signolet', 'Vincent Cassel, Romain Duris, Sandrine Kiberlain, Élodie Bouchez, Charles Berling, Hafsia Herzi, Jérôme Pouly, Félix Back', null, 'When a teenager suddenly disappears without a trace, the case is assigned to an alcoholic police officer who maintains a complicated relationship with his own troubled teenage son, suspected of drug trafficking.', 'When a teenager suddenly disappears without a trace, the case is assigned to an alcoholic police officer who maintains a complicated relationship with his own troubled teenage son, suspected of drug trafficking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lPw8H108VLDrU3yNisgWRv045o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446170'),
  ('298851166604723830', 'Black Tight Killers', 1966, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Yasuharu Hasebe, Kazue Nagatsuka', 'Michio Tsuzuki, Ryuzo Nakanishi', 'Akemi Kita, Mieko Nishio, Bokuzen Hidari, Akira Kobayashi, Chieko Matsubara, Hiroshi Nihon''yanagi, Kaku Takashina, Toshizō Kudō', null, 'Daisuke Honda, a war photographer in Vietnam, meets Yuriko Sawanouchi, a stewardess on his plane back to Japan. After drinking with her at a Tokyo bar, he becomes involved in saving Yuriko from assassination by stylish, female ninjas. When trying to rescue Yuriko from kidnappers, Daisuke discovers a group of foreigners are hunting for a WWII-era treasure hidden on an island by Yuriko''s father.', 'Daisuke Honda, a war photographer in Vietnam, meets Yuriko Sawanouchi, a stewardess on his plane back to Japan. After drinking with her at a Tokyo bar, he becomes involved in saving Yuriko from assassination by stylish, female ninjas. When trying to rescue Yuriko from kidnappers, Daisuke discovers a group of foreigners are hunting for a WWII-era treasure hidden on an island by Yuriko''s father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ys1sczdtgpQ4xACGSknpAMuoK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67096'),
  ('184191544796717010', 'Black to the Future', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Antoine Roch, Jean-Pascal Zadi, Patrick Schmitt', 'Jean-Pascal Zadi, Hélène Bararuzunza', 'Jean-Pascal Zadi, Fadily Camara, Reda Kateb, Fary Lopes, Claudia Tagbo, Lous and the Yakuza, Déborah Lukumuena, Éric Judor', null, 'In the utmost secrecy, the first African space mission is preparing to take off! The crew, from Africa and its diaspora, is set to explore the planet "NARDAL", assessing its potential as a refuge for all Africans should Earth ever become uninhabitable. The problem is that the journey will be long. Very long. And in interstellar missions, the greatest unknown is whether the astronauts will be able to get along.', 'In the utmost secrecy, the first African space mission is preparing to take off! The crew, from Africa and its diaspora, is set to explore the planet "NARDAL", assessing its potential as a refuge for all Africans should Earth ever become uninhabitable. The problem is that the journey will be long. Very long. And in interstellar missions, the greatest unknown is whether the astronauts will be able to get along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkc0MM36br8oyh6QoqzhvKYHPFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1255783'),
  ('576762488764005410', 'Black Tuesday', 1954, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Hugo Fregonese, Stanley Cortez, Sam Wurtzel', 'Sydney Boehm', 'Edward G. Robinson, Jean Parker, Peter Graves, Milburn Stone, Warren Stevens, Sylvia Findley, Jack Kelly, Hal Baylor', 'NR', 'Vicious gangster Vincent Canelli pulls off a daring prison escape just moments before going to the electric chair, taking with him Peter Manning – a bank robber and cop killer who was to die right after him. Taking several hostages along, they try to get their hands on the loot from Manning’s robbery to finance their escape from the country.', 'Vicious gangster Vincent Canelli pulls off a daring prison escape just moments before going to the electric chair, taking with him Peter Manning – a bank robber and cop killer who was to die right after him. Taking several hostages along, they try to get their hands on the loot from Manning’s robbery to finance their escape from the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1TopGrmEohQZIH1USRkAYKGsK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33224'),
  ('929563396894383068', 'Black Turin', 1972, 'Drama, Crime', 'Carlo Lizzani, Pasqualino De Santis', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Nicola Badalucco', 'Bud Spencer, Françoise Fabian, Marcel Bozzuffi, Guido Leontini, Vittorio Duse, Mario Pilar, Nicola Di Bari, Andrea Balestri', null, 'Mino and Lello, two sons of a worker wrongly accused of murder, try to find out evidence of his innocence and begin to investigate mafia business in Torino.', 'Mino and Lello, two sons of a worker wrongly accused of murder, try to find out evidence of his innocence and begin to investigate mafia business in Torino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1Sp5kg0PIN59eAUrwtc6lijsag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46565'),
  ('1123167216082278485', 'Black TV', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Aldo Tambellini', null, null, null, 'Black TV is the title of Tambellini’s best-known videographic film, which is part of a large intermedia project about American television. Compiled from filmed television news programs and personal experimental videotapes, Black TV has been seen in many versions during the four-year period in which Tambellini constantly re-edited it (1964-68).', 'Black TV is the title of Tambellini’s best-known videographic film, which is part of a large intermedia project about American television. Compiled from filmed television news programs and personal experimental videotapes, Black TV has been seen in many versions during the four-year period in which Tambellini constantly re-edited it (1964-68).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYu2Lx7WXDjykcvLxgv1zY4uOZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132851'),
  ('447065828652917341', 'Black Velvet', 1976, 'Drama, Romance, Horror', 'Gastone Di Giovanni, Brunello Rondi, Renata Melingò', 'Brunello Rondi', 'Laura Gemser, Annie Belle, Al Cliver, Gabriele Tinti, Feodor Chaliapin Jr., Ziggy Zanger, Nieves Navarro, Tarik Al-Nahry', 'R', 'Crystal, a wealthy, scorned woman living in a massive Egyptian palace with her daughter Magda, finds commiseration in a dried-up Hollywood expat who surrounds himself with singing children.', 'Crystal, a wealthy, scorned woman living in a massive Egyptian palace with her daughter Magda, finds commiseration in a dried-up Hollywood expat who surrounds himself with singing children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRIkmhFx3xJmFKi6ExsiHapDJKP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28844'),
  ('333848388351187870', 'Black Venus', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Mulot', 'Harry Alan Towers', 'Josephine Jacqueline Jones, José Antonio Ceinos, Emiliano Redondo, Helga Liné, Florence Guérin, Mandy Rice-Davies, Karin Schubert, Monique Gabrielle', 'R', 'Spanish actor Jose Antonio Ceinos stars as a down-and-out sculptor, whose inspiration returns with the strange appearance of a beautiful, mysterious black muse.', 'Spanish actor Jose Antonio Ceinos stars as a down-and-out sculptor, whose inspiration returns with the strange appearance of a beautiful, mysterious black muse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rR07Oegct3UsvPvlAS0kKVycspX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46556'),
  ('1073447709730143058', 'Black Venus', 2010, 'History, Drama', 'Abdellatif Kechiche, Lubomir Bakchev, Sofian El Fani', 'Abdellatif Kechiche, Ghalya Lacroix', 'Yahima Torres, André Jacobs, Olivier Gourmet, Elina Löwensohn, François Marthouret, Michel Gionti, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Jonathan Pienaar', null, 'The true story of Saartje Baartman, a black South African worker who moves to London with her master in the early 19th century. Although she dreams of being an artist, once in Europe she is exploited as a sideshow attraction due to her large buttocks and genitalia.', 'The true story of Saartje Baartman, a black South African worker who moves to London with her master in the early 19th century. Although she dreams of being an artist, once in Europe she is exploited as a sideshow attraction due to her large buttocks and genitalia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPyysXgqFwqsju9KrBWCI9skQSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56405'),
  ('730802431488304732', 'Black Warrant', 2022, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller', 'Tibor Takács, Brandon Ruiz', 'D. Glase Lomond', 'Tom Berenger, Cam Gigandet, Jeff Fahey, Jonathan Avigdori, Sara Seyed, Rafael Cabrera, Rodrigo Abed, Tonantzin Esparza', 'R', 'A semi-retired special ops assassin and a DEA agent cross paths on separate missions to stop a cyber terrorist organization that has built a dangerous machine threatening to attack the power grid and bring catastrophe to the world.', 'A semi-retired special ops assassin and a DEA agent cross paths on separate missions to stop a cyber terrorist organization that has built a dangerous machine threatening to attack the power grid and bring catastrophe to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7vFFZHbDyxfjuYKzJwruTnwwjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983768'),
  ('452173980940044478', 'Black Water', 2008, 'Adventure, Drama, Horror', 'Andrew Traucki, David Nerlich, Ian Astridge', 'David Nerlich', 'Maeve Dermody, Diana Glenn, Andy Rodoreda, Ben Oxenbould, Fiona Press', 'R', 'Based on true events, Grace, her boyfriend Adam, and her younger sister, Lee, are on holiday in Northern Australia when they decide to take a tour down a river. As they drift into a swamp, their boat suddenly capsizes. Stranded in the flooded swamp, the three tourists must figure out what to do to survive as they realize they are being watched through the black water.', 'Based on true events, Grace, her boyfriend Adam, and her younger sister, Lee, are on holiday in Northern Australia when they decide to take a tour down a river. As they drift into a swamp, their boat suddenly capsizes. Stranded in the flooded swamp, the three tourists must figure out what to do to survive as they realize they are being watched through the black water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hd6iyViluCMOqIJz5TsiyBFqp9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14138'),
  ('1015989785693603129', 'Black Water', 2018, 'Action, Thriller', 'Pasha Patriki, Pasha Patriki', 'Chad Law', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Dolph Lundgren, Patrick Kilpatrick, Al Sapienza, Jasmine Waltz, Kris Van Damme, Courtney Blythe Turk, Aleksander Vayshelboym', 'R', 'A deep cover operative awakens to find himself imprisoned on a submarine. With the help of a fellow prisoner and an amateur agent, he must race against the clock to escape the vessel and expose who set him up.', 'A deep cover operative awakens to find himself imprisoned on a submarine. With the help of a fellow prisoner and an amateur agent, he must race against the clock to escape the vessel and expose who set him up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIcZAB5AmRN8fIDXfDZ2aUok9qa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454615'),
  ('147453721530985614', 'Black Water: Abyss', 2020, 'Horror, Action, Adventure', 'Andrew Traucki, Damien Beebe, Ian Astridge', 'John Ridley, Sarah Smith', 'Jessica McNamee, Luke Mitchell, Amali Golden, Benjamin Hoetjes, Anthony J. Sharpe, Louis Toshio Okada, Rumi Kikuchi, Anna Kubat', 'NR', 'An adventure-loving couple convince their friends to explore a remote, uncharted cave system in the forests of Northern Australia. With a tropical storm approaching, they abseil into the mouth of the cave, but when the caves start to flood, tensions rise as oxygen levels fall and the friends find themselves trapped. Unknown to them, the storm has also brought in a pack of dangerous and hungry crocodiles.', 'An adventure-loving couple convince their friends to explore a remote, uncharted cave system in the forests of Northern Australia. With a tropical storm approaching, they abseil into the mouth of the cave, but when the caves start to flood, tensions rise as oxygen levels fall and the friends find themselves trapped. Unknown to them, the storm has also brought in a pack of dangerous and hungry crocodiles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmAv14TPE2vKMIRrVeCd1Ll7K94.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522444'),
  ('569891876645616610', 'Black Widow', 1954, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Nunnally Johnson, Charles G. Clarke, A.F. Erickson', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Van Heflin, Reginald Gardiner, Gene Tierney, Peggy Ann Garner, Ginger Rogers, George Raft, Virginia Leith, Otto Kruger', null, 'When a young stage hopeful is found dead, suspicion falls on her mentor, a successful Broadway producer.', 'When a young stage hopeful is found dead, suspicion falls on her mentor, a successful Broadway producer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6u1ynJxGhqhKpFMvDmPk1OWQ5FW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44052'),
  ('240364572367426364', 'Black Widow', 1987, 'Thriller', 'Bob Rafelson, Conrad Hall', 'Ronald Bass', 'Debra Winger, Theresa Russell, Sami Frey, Dennis Hopper, Nicol Williamson, Terry O''Quinn, James Hong, Diane Ladd', 'R', 'Federal agent Alexandra Barnes believes that Catherine Petersen is a serial killer who marries rich men and then murders them for their money. But since Catherine is seemingly a master of disguise and has multiple identities, Alexandra can''t prove anything with conventional detective work. With no other option, she goes undercover, pursuing the same man as Catherine, and hoping that Catherine will slip up and reveal her true identity.', 'Federal agent Alexandra Barnes believes that Catherine Petersen is a serial killer who marries rich men and then murders them for their money. But since Catherine is seemingly a master of disguise and has multiple identities, Alexandra can''t prove anything with conventional detective work. With no other option, she goes undercover, pursuing the same man as Catherine, and hoping that Catherine will slip up and reveal her true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTkwd9XPlwdS2fdUuxuUYQ5wTkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19345'),
  ('352378845746427775', 'Black Widow', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Carlos De Carvalho, Darrin Prescott, Alex Bowens', 'Eric Pearson', 'Scarlett Johansson, Florence Pugh, Rachel Weisz, David Harbour, Ray Winstone, Ever Anderson, Violet McGraw, O-T Fagbenle', 'PG-13', 'Natasha Romanoff, also known as Black Widow, confronts the darker parts of her ledger when a dangerous conspiracy with ties to her past arises. Pursued by a force that will stop at nothing to bring her down, Natasha must deal with her history as a spy and the broken relationships left in her wake long before she became an Avenger.', 'Natasha Romanoff, also known as Black Widow, confronts the darker parts of her ledger when a dangerous conspiracy with ties to her past arises. Pursued by a force that will stop at nothing to bring her down, Natasha must deal with her history as a spy and the broken relationships left in her wake long before she became an Avenger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JPpIjhD2V0sKyFvhB9khUMa30d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497698'),
  ('950366716333617636', 'Black Wind', 1965, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Servando González, Agustín Jiménez, Alex Phillips', 'Servando González, Rafael García Travesí', 'David Reynoso, José Elías Moreno, Eleazar García, Fernando Luján, Jorge Martínez de Hoyos, Enrique Aguilar, Rodolfo Landa, Roberto Cobo', null, 'The building of a railroad under tough conditions from searing heat to freezing cold in the Sonora desert provokes clashes of passion and struggles between the engineers and the workers at the campsite. The workers also contend with sudden dust storms that are called the ''black wind''. Based on true events.', 'The building of a railroad under tough conditions from searing heat to freezing cold in the Sonora desert provokes clashes of passion and struggles between the engineers and the workers at the campsite. The workers also contend with sudden dust storms that are called the ''black wind''. Based on true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGLItK0fTpdEr6XlnMJDBOjVz6R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240628'),
  ('22742503933332478', 'Black''s Game', 2012, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Óskar Thór Axelsson, Bergsteinn Björgúlfsson, Sandra Steinþórsdóttir', 'Stefán Máni, Óskar Thór Axelsson', 'Thorvaldur Kristjansson, Jóhannes Haukur Jóhannesson, Damon Younger, María Birta, Vignir Rafn Valþórsson, Egill Einarsson, Björn Jörundur Friðbjörnsson, Ísak Hinriksson', 'R', 'In the mid to late ''90s, the Reykjavik crime and drug scene saw a drastic change from a relatively small and innocent world into a much more aggressive and violent one.. The film tells the story of this change through the fictional gang of pushers that took control of Iceland''s underworld.', 'In the mid to late ''90s, the Reykjavik crime and drug scene saw a drastic change from a relatively small and innocent world into a much more aggressive and violent one.. The film tells the story of this change through the fictional gang of pushers that took control of Iceland''s underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iG3e6KeIvhbkryLolUGx8BNfCnj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97340'),
  ('351798631433271021', 'Black★Rock Shooter', 2010, 'Drama, Animation, Fantasy', 'Shinobu Yoshioka, Hiromi Kikuta, Yuusuke Matsuo', 'Nagaru Tanigawa, Shinobu Yoshioka', 'Kana Hanazawa, Miyuki Sawashiro, Kana Asumi', null, 'The story of two girls bound in friendship, as well as Black Rock Star''s struggle unfolding in another world. But when the two worlds come together... what will happen?', 'The story of two girls bound in friendship, as well as Black Rock Star''s struggle unfolding in another world. But when the two worlds come together... what will happen?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nriSc6IHJRnSBmBujo5kZpvLBTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58107'),
  ('598928398863175039', 'Blackadder: Back & Forth', 1999, 'Comedy, History, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Paul Weiland', 'Richard Curtis, Ben Elton', 'Rowan Atkinson, Tony Robinson, Stephen Fry, Hugh Laurie, Tim McInnerny, Miranda Richardson, Tyrannosaurus Rex, Patsy Byrne', null, 'What was a cunning plan from Lord Edmund Blackadder V to fake a time machine on his gullibly incompetent friends, turns out to be the real thing and hurls him and his imbecile underling, Baldrick, through the course of human history.', 'What was a cunning plan from Lord Edmund Blackadder V to fake a time machine on his gullibly incompetent friends, turns out to be the real thing and hurls him and his imbecile underling, Baldrick, through the course of human history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iqIMjXdmmovOGcBgHygKWOK1UY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194113'),
  ('71472742329531570', 'Blackadder: The Cavalier Years', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Mandie Fletcher', 'Ben Elton, Richard Curtis', 'Rowan Atkinson, Tony Robinson, Stephen Fry, Warren Clarke, Harry Enfield, Hugh Laurie, Tim McInnerny', null, 'A short movie, made for Comic Relief, in which Blackadder (Rowan Atkinson) and Baldrick (Tony Robinson) must help protect King Charles I (Stephen Fry) from the machinations of Oliver Cromwell and his Roundheads', 'A short movie, made for Comic Relief, in which Blackadder (Rowan Atkinson) and Baldrick (Tony Robinson) must help protect King Charles I (Stephen Fry) from the machinations of Oliver Cromwell and his Roundheads', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yw5S8hsHMsSJrXhBGJ1Byn3PxDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250478'),
  ('331658345769915893', 'Blackadder''s Christmas Carol', 1988, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Richard Boden', 'Richard Curtis, Ben Elton', 'Rowan Atkinson, Tony Robinson, Miranda Richardson, Stephen Fry, Hugh Laurie, Robbie Coltrane, Miriam Margolyes, Jim Broadbent', null, 'After a genial spirit shows the benevolent Ebenezer Blackadder visions of his unscrupulous ancestors, he resolves to mend his generous ways.', 'After a genial spirit shows the benevolent Ebenezer Blackadder visions of his unscrupulous ancestors, he resolves to mend his generous ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJD1sTuPlw3DoDyrC2XU7b5LVX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942609'),
  ('160362954070947317', 'Blackball', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Mel Smith, Vernon Layton', 'Tim Firth', 'Paul Kaye, Johnny Vegas, James Cromwell, Bernard Cribbins, Alice Evans, Vince Vaughn, Imelda Staunton, James Fleet', 'R', 'Blackball follows the fortunes of Cliff Starkey, a working-class fine of lawn bowls with an exceptional talent. Wanting to take on the Aussies he manages to become regional champion, only to get banned. Sports agent Rich Schwartz picks him up and makes him so popular the Bowls Committee deem to lift the ban. Now the question is whether he can regain his form and his friends to beat the Aussies.', 'Blackball follows the fortunes of Cliff Starkey, a working-class fine of lawn bowls with an exceptional talent. Wanting to take on the Aussies he manages to become regional champion, only to get banned. Sports agent Rich Schwartz picks him up and makes him so popular the Bowls Committee deem to lift the ban. Now the question is whether he can regain his form and his friends to beat the Aussies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVlrowz2VtOJIxDTBMU4Jsb1njN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15443'),
  ('723269170952192244', 'Blackbeard, the Pirate', 1952, 'Adventure', 'Raoul Walsh, William E. Snyder, James E. Casey', 'Alan Le May', 'Robert Newton, Linda Darnell, William Bendix, Keith Andes, Torin Thatcher, Irene Ryan, Alan Mowbray, Richard Egan', null, 'Honest Robert Maynard finds himself serving as ship''s surgeon under the infamous pirate Blackbeard.', 'Honest Robert Maynard finds himself serving as ship''s surgeon under the infamous pirate Blackbeard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocuraoHR7bclHL9SUuV5GNYYBPh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120509'),
  ('926261623588605222', 'Blackbeard''s Ghost', 1968, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Robert Stevenson, Arthur J. Vitarelli, Edward Colman', 'Bill Walsh, Don DaGradi', 'Peter Ustinov, Dean Jones, Suzanne Pleshette, Elsa Lanchester, Richard Deacon, Joby Baker, Elliott Reid, Norman Grabowski', 'G', 'The eponymous wraith returns to Earth to aid his descendant, elderly Emily Stowecroft. The villains want to kick Emily and her friends out of their group home so that they can build a crooked casino. Good guy Steve Walker gets caught in the middle of the squabble after evoking Blackbeard''s ghost.', 'The eponymous wraith returns to Earth to aid his descendant, elderly Emily Stowecroft. The villains want to kick Emily and her friends out of their group home so that they can build a crooked casino. Good guy Steve Walker gets caught in the middle of the squabble after evoking Blackbeard''s ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEMEjagTsdkUi7Jzxe0lQsquD7J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16249'),
  ('81339626281932557', 'Blackbelt', 1992, 'Action', 'Charles Philip Moore, Rick Jacobson, John Ulyanov', 'Charles Philip Moore', 'Don Wilson, Deirdre Haj, Matthias Hues, Richard Beymer, Alan Blumenfeld, Jack Forcinito, Barbara A. Graham, Bob McFarland', null, 'Don "The Dragon" Wilson is back and forced to take on the greatest legends of the martial arts world. Wilson fights off all comers while defending rock superstar Shanna (Deirdre Imershein) against the insane attacks of a fanatical veteran John Sweet (Matthias Hues-I Come In Peace).', 'Don "The Dragon" Wilson is back and forced to take on the greatest legends of the martial arts world. Wilson fights off all comers while defending rock superstar Shanna (Deirdre Imershein) against the insane attacks of a fanatical veteran John Sweet (Matthias Hues-I Come In Peace).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3A5NLmS7ofdz5CCJPZpglOLNmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147973'),
  ('1096564678664621484', 'BlackBerry', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Matt Johnson, Jared Raab, Matt Greyson', 'Matt Johnson, Matthew Miller', 'Jay Baruchel, Glenn Howerton, Matt Johnson, Saul Rubinek, Cary Elwes, Rich Sommer, Michael Ironside, Martin Donovan', 'R', 'Two mismatched entrepreneurs – egghead innovator Mike Lazaridis and cut-throat businessman Jim Balsillie – joined forces in an endeavour that was to become a worldwide hit in little more than a decade. The story of the meteoric rise and catastrophic demise of the world''s first smartphone.', 'Two mismatched entrepreneurs – egghead innovator Mike Lazaridis and cut-throat businessman Jim Balsillie – joined forces in an endeavour that was to become a worldwide hit in little more than a decade. The story of the meteoric rise and catastrophic demise of the world''s first smartphone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePWKQzOnwabMcJsWYWIiy5p1Ofr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1016084'),
  ('1042109562021005124', 'Blackbird', 1958, 'Animation, Music', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'To the tune of a classic French-Canadian nonsense song, surreal blackbird made of lines loses body parts and gets them back threefold.', 'To the tune of a classic French-Canadian nonsense song, surreal blackbird made of lines loses body parts and gets them back threefold.', null, 'tmdb:movie:162755'),
  ('1112750267252474957', 'Blackbird', 2019, 'Drama', 'Barrie McCulloch, Ben Harrison, Jamie Graham', 'Christian Torpe', 'Susan Sarandon, Kate Winslet, Mia Wasikowska, Sam Neill, Lindsay Duncan, Rainn Wilson, Bex Taylor-Klaus, Anson Boon', 'R', 'A terminally ill mother invites her family to their country house for one final gathering, but tensions quickly boil over between her two daughters.', 'A terminally ill mother invites her family to their country house for one final gathering, but tensions quickly boil over between her two daughters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4GpcTZjX8zIU9RbG7j6w7OJFua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536396'),
  ('895308134268720760', 'Blackbird Blackbird Blackberry', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Elene Naveriani, Shoka Maghradze, Ágnes Pákózdi', 'Nikoloz Mdivani, Elene Naveriani', 'Eka Chavleishvili, Temiko Chichinadze, Piqria Niqabadze, Tamar Mdinaradze, Lia Abuladze, Ana Khurtsidze, Ani Mogeladze, Joni Janashia', null, 'In a small traditional Georgian village, Etero, the owner of a housekeeping shop, is a forty-eight-year-old spinster. She cherishes her freedom, as much as her cakes, and is preparing for a peaceful and comfortable retirement away from gossip. But a fiery affair with her delivery man could derail all her plans.', 'In a small traditional Georgian village, Etero, the owner of a housekeeping shop, is a forty-eight-year-old spinster. She cherishes her freedom, as much as her cakes, and is preparing for a peaceful and comfortable retirement away from gossip. But a fiery affair with her delivery man could derail all her plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcG2bRze3RYzx6ajHJhD7HpeOxV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114866'),
  ('777835239612200147', 'Blackboard Jumble', 1957, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Michael Lah', null, 'Daws Butler', 'G', 'A wolf with a Southern accent walks by just as a teacher is getting fed up with his class and walks out. Unfortunately, the class consists of three junior clones of Droopy, who manage to try his patience.', 'A wolf with a Southern accent walks by just as a teacher is getting fed up with his class and walks out. Unfortunately, the class consists of three junior clones of Droopy, who manage to try his patience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLsxM7fa9CQ7RED7HXsYfOgvso9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144238'),
  ('694614620812623645', 'Blackboard Jungle', 1955, 'Crime, Drama', 'Richard Brooks, Russell Harlan', 'Richard Brooks', 'Glenn Ford, Anne Francis, Louis Calhern, Margaret Hayes, John Hoyt, Richard Kiley, Emile Meyer, Warner Anderson', 'NR', 'Richard Dadier is a teacher at North Manual High School, an inner-city school where many of the pupils frequently engage in anti-social behavior. Dadier makes various attempts to engage the students'' interest in education, challenging both the school staff and the pupils. He is subjected to violence as well as duplicitous schemes.', 'Richard Dadier is a teacher at North Manual High School, an inner-city school where many of the pupils frequently engage in anti-social behavior. Dadier makes various attempts to engage the students'' interest in education, challenging both the school staff and the pupils. He is subjected to violence as well as duplicitous schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPGvWlsMg4niyuGCSzvAiyjYNWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26516'),
  ('332792711168167059', 'Blackboards', 2000, 'Drama, History, War', 'Samira Makhmalbaf', 'Samira Makhmalbaf, Mohsen Makhmalbaf', 'Said Mohamadi, Behnaz Jafari, Bahman Ghobadi, Mohamad Karim Rahmati, Rafat Moradi, Mayas Rostami, Saman Akbari, Ahmad Bahrami', null, 'Itinerant Kurdish teachers, carrying blackboards on their backs, look for students in the hills and villages of Iran, near the Iraqi border during the Iran-Iraq war. Said falls in with a group of old men looking for their bombed-out village; he offers to guide them, and takes as his wife Halaleh, the clan''s lone woman, a widow with a young son. Reeboir attaches himself to a dozen pre-teen boys weighed down by contraband they carry across the border; they''re mules, always on the move. Said and Reeboir try to teach as their potential students keep walking. Danger is close; armed soldiers patrol the skies, the roads, and the border. Is there a role for a teacher? Is there hope?', 'Itinerant Kurdish teachers, carrying blackboards on their backs, look for students in the hills and villages of Iran, near the Iraqi border during the Iran-Iraq war. Said falls in with a group of old men looking for their bombed-out village; he offers to guide them, and takes as his wife Halaleh, the clan''s lone woman, a widow with a young son. Reeboir attaches himself to a dozen pre-teen boys weighed down by contraband they carry across the border; they''re mules, always on the move. Said and Reeboir try to teach as their potential students keep walking. Danger is close; armed soldiers patrol the skies, the roads, and the border. Is there a role for a teacher? Is there hope?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApLKw8jjGTp7M4FbivX3mHXJ6da.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28988'),
  ('396822847571311226', 'Blackenstein', 1973, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Robert Caramico, William A. Levey', 'Frank R. Saletri', 'John Hart, Ivory Stone, Joe De Sue, Roosevelt Jackson, Andrea King, Nick Bolin, Karin Lind, Yvonne Robinson', 'R', 'Eddie is a Vietnam veteran who loses his arms and legs when he steps on a land mine, but a brilliant surgeon is able to attach new limbs. Unfortunately, an insanely jealous assistant (who has fallen in love with Eddie''s fiancée) switches Eddie''s DNA injections, transforming him into a gigantic killer.', 'Eddie is a Vietnam veteran who loses his arms and legs when he steps on a land mine, but a brilliant surgeon is able to attach new limbs. Unfortunately, an insanely jealous assistant (who has fallen in love with Eddie''s fiancée) switches Eddie''s DNA injections, transforming him into a gigantic killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUDG9xyeogKzGa2QZu8zRNtu6sH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3162'),
  ('665015610772160770', 'Blacker Than the Night', 1975, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada, Daniel López', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada', 'Claudia Islas, Lucía Méndez, Helena Rojo, Susana Dosamantes, Alicia Palacios, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Julián Pastor, Tamara Garina', null, 'When four women move into an old house left by one woman''s aunt, strange things begin to happen. Bizarre voices, visions of ghosts, and mysterious noises lead them to discover the darkest powers of evil and a horror and agony beyond terror.', 'When four women move into an old house left by one woman''s aunt, strange things begin to happen. Bizarre voices, visions of ghosts, and mysterious noises lead them to discover the darkest powers of evil and a horror and agony beyond terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awiRINySbTVIsK78htbPWEOUVEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68636'),
  ('50016117327357451', 'Blackfish', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Gabriela Cowperthwaite, Christopher Towey, Jonathan Ingalls', 'Eli Despres, Gabriela Cowperthwaite, Tim Zimmermann', 'Dean Gomersall, Samantha Berg, John Jett, John Hargrove, Carol Ray, Jeffrey Ventre, Kim Ashdown, Ken Balcomb', 'PG-13', 'Notorious killer whale Tilikum is responsible for the deaths of three individuals, including a top killer whale trainer. Blackfish shows the sometimes devastating consequences of keeping such intelligent and sentient creatures in captivity.', 'Notorious killer whale Tilikum is responsible for the deaths of three individuals, including a top killer whale trainer. Blackfish shows the sometimes devastating consequences of keeping such intelligent and sentient creatures in captivity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCk4mDFE96Mn1AYfEcbxkIiw7ND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158999'),
  ('823542074772889794', 'Blackfly', 1991, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Music', 'Christopher Hinton', null, 'Wade Hemsworth', null, 'A young surveyer, new to Ontario, encounters the blackflies. Over and over again, he encounters those blackflies.', 'A young surveyer, new to Ontario, encounters the blackflies. Over and over again, he encounters those blackflies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBAbYB8phUk4hvdgpiSdA9oxWh3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48608'),
  ('1031117906177841036', 'Blackhat', 2015, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Michael Mann, Stuart Dryburgh, Tom Reta', 'Morgan Davis Foehl', 'Chris Hemsworth, Tang Wei, Leehom Wang, Viola Davis, Holt McCallany, Andy On Chi-Kit, Yorick van Wageningen, John Ortiz', 'R', 'Nicholas Hathaway, a furloughed convict, and his American and Chinese partners hunt a high-level cybercrime network from Chicago to Los Angeles to Hong Kong to Jakarta. As Hathaway closes in, the stakes become personal as he discovers that the attack on a Chinese nuclear power plant was just the beginning.', 'Nicholas Hathaway, a furloughed convict, and his American and Chinese partners hunt a high-level cybercrime network from Chicago to Los Angeles to Hong Kong to Jakarta. As Hathaway closes in, the stakes become personal as he discovers that the attack on a Chinese nuclear power plant was just the beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zu6HPnKPjNA7NuR4DGRdaH0PdX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201088'),
  ('137881711088080314', 'Blackie the Pirate', 1971, 'Adventure, Comedy, Action', 'Lorenzo Gicca Palli, Ferdinando Merighi, Federico Canudas', 'Lorenzo Gicca Palli', 'Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, Silvia Monti, George Martin, Diana Lorys, Mónica Randall, Sal Borgese, Pasquale Basile', null, 'Rivaling Pirates and Spanish gold are the ingredients for this story. Blackie the pirate is the one who first hears from this shipment of gold when he encounters "Don" Pedro. He thinks of a plan to find this ship and its gold. His counter player is the vice roy of the Spanish kolony. When they visit one of the pirate settlements, they find three other pirate captains over there. One of them sells goods and prisoners from his latest capture. Don Pedro recognizes the wife of the vice roy, and Blackie buys her. However, one of the pirate captains, Skull, knows also who she is, and tries to make a deal. Blackie refuses, and Skull makes a deal with the other two pirate captains to plot against Blackie.', 'Rivaling Pirates and Spanish gold are the ingredients for this story. Blackie the pirate is the one who first hears from this shipment of gold when he encounters "Don" Pedro. He thinks of a plan to find this ship and its gold. His counter player is the vice roy of the Spanish kolony. When they visit one of the pirate settlements, they find three other pirate captains over there. One of them sells goods and prisoners from his latest capture. Don Pedro recognizes the wife of the vice roy, and Blackie buys her. However, one of the pirate captains, Skull, knows also who she is, and tries to make a deal. Blackie refuses, and Skull makes a deal with the other two pirate captains to plot against Blackie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMUbLBHbEmc2eDGLgTkbGNUUKiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52721'),
  ('231128954759118527', 'Blackjack', 1998, 'TV Movie, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'John Woo, Jonnie Katz, Bill Wong Chung-Piu', 'Peter Lance', 'Dolph Lundgren, Kate Vernon, Phillip MacKenzie, Kam Heskin, Fred Williamson, Andrew Jackson, Padraigin Murphy, Tony De Santis', 'PG', 'After saving Casey, a daughter of his friend, from hired assassins, Jack Devlin is hit with a strange phobia - fear of white color. But when his other friend, who works as a bodyguard for a supermodel, is wounded, Jack decides to step in for him. Now he must confront his fear and the assassin, who seems to be well aware of Jack''s problem.', 'After saving Casey, a daughter of his friend, from hired assassins, Jack Devlin is hit with a strange phobia - fear of white color. But when his other friend, who works as a bodyguard for a supermodel, is wounded, Jack decides to step in for him. Now he must confront his fear and the assassin, who seems to be well aware of Jack''s problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xinJIob2IVjXaupIkSj2TGiJYJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39083'),
  ('845705607770200901', 'BlackJack', 1990, 'Drama, Music', 'Colin Nutley, Jörgen Persson, Magnus Stenberg', 'Johanna Hald, Colin Nutley, Catti Edfeldt', 'Helena Bergström, Reine Brynolfsson, Johannes Brost, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Jan Mybrand, Lennart Hjulström, Tomas Fryk, Steve Kratz', null, 'Kaj, Lennart and Robert are 30-somethings who go out to dance every weekend. At one dance they meet Inger, whom Kaj falls in love with. Kaj has some friends who are playing in a band. The drummer Tommy is known for being the local Casanova, seducing women when ever he gets the chance. It doesn''t take him long to have an affair with Inger, behind Kaj''s back.', 'Kaj, Lennart and Robert are 30-somethings who go out to dance every weekend. At one dance they meet Inger, whom Kaj falls in love with. Kaj has some friends who are playing in a band. The drummer Tommy is known for being the local Casanova, seducing women when ever he gets the chance. It doesn''t take him long to have an affair with Inger, behind Kaj''s back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCUdv3ndI407chs1puVCUeNRW4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46977'),
  ('871767340878342671', 'BlacKkKlansman', 2018, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama, History', 'Tracey Hinds, Mike Ellis, Jason Perez', 'David Rabinowitz, Spike Lee, Charlie Wachtel', 'John David Washington, Adam Driver, Topher Grace, Laura Harrier, Alec Baldwin, Jasper Pääkkönen, Corey Hawkins, Paul Walter Hauser', 'R', 'Colorado Springs, late 1970s. Ron Stallworth, an African American police officer, and Flip Zimmerman, his Jewish colleague, run an undercover operation to infiltrate the Ku Klux Klan.', 'Colorado Springs, late 1970s. Ron Stallworth, an African American police officer, and Flip Zimmerman, his Jewish colleague, run an undercover operation to infiltrate the Ku Klux Klan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jxqAvSDoneSKRczaK8v9X5gqBp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487558'),
  ('141877239537869245', 'Blacklight', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Belinda Cusmano, Oliver Tummel, Guy Norris', 'Mark Williams', 'Liam Neeson, Emmy Raver-Lampman, Taylor John Smith, Aidan Quinn, Tim Draxl, Claire van der Boom, Michael M. Foster, Yesse Spence', 'PG-13', 'Travis Block is a shadowy Government agent who specializes in removing operatives whose covers have been exposed. He then has to uncover a deadly conspiracy within his own ranks that reaches the highest echelons of power.', 'Travis Block is a shadowy Government agent who specializes in removing operatives whose covers have been exposed. He then has to uncover a deadly conspiracy within his own ranks that reaches the highest echelons of power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bv9dy8mnwftdY2j6gG39gCfSFpV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823625'),
  ('811190376191489057', 'Blackmail', 1929, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Jack E. Cox, Alfred Hitchcock, Frank Mills', 'Michael Powell', 'Anny Ondra, Sara Allgood, Charles Paton, John Longden, Donald Calthrop, Cyril Ritchard, Hannah Jones, Harvey Braban', 'NR', 'London, 1929. Frank Webber, a very busy Scotland Yard detective, seems to be more interested in his work than in Alice White, his girlfriend. Feeling herself ignored, Alice agrees to go out with an elegant and well-mannered artist who invites her to visit his fancy apartment.', 'London, 1929. Frank Webber, a very busy Scotland Yard detective, seems to be more interested in his work than in Alice White, his girlfriend. Feeling herself ignored, Alice agrees to go out with an elegant and well-mannered artist who invites her to visit his fancy apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ioNEKouUkkWyv5tUDwVUd7BDRR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543'),
  ('32074436414656540', 'Blackmail', 1947, 'Action, Crime, Romance', 'Lesley Selander, Reggie Lanning', 'Royal K. Cole', 'William Marshall, Adele Mara, Ricardo Cortez, Grant Withers, Stephanie Bachelor, Richard Fraser, Roy Barcroft, George J. Lewis', null, 'A private detective is offered a job protecting a rich business man from suspected blackmail. Before he can accept the case a murder is uncovered.', 'A private detective is offered a job protecting a rich business man from suspected blackmail. Before he can accept the case a murder is uncovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJDqK70QLd2zbr148jDlqkQ4jyV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44137'),
  ('334700444689888856', 'Blackmail', 2005, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Anil Devgan', 'Javed Siddiqui, Robin Bhatt', 'Ajay Devgn, Suniel Shetty, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Dia Mirza, Mukesh Rishi, Parth Dave, Siddharth Ray, Shiva Rindani', null, 'Inspector Abhay Rathod is a honest and diligent Police Inspector employed with Bombay Police. He was assigned the case of racketeer and criminal don, Shekhar Mohan. Abhay successfully entraps and arrests him, and has him sentenced to a long jail term. Years later, Abhay is now the Assistant Commissioner of Police; is married, and has a son named Chirag; and Shekhar Mohan has completed his jail term and is looking to seek vengeance against Abhay. He does so by kidnapping Chirag and taking him along with him. He object is not to seek any ransom money, but attempt to separate the child from his parents, as well as attempt to make a place in his heart. Shekhar finds out that Chirag loves racing and takes him on various race courses where the child is thrilled to watch fast sport cars, and soon starts a friendship with "Uncle" Shekhar. But with Abhay and the police closing in fast, will Shekhar and Chirag be able to maintain their friendship?', 'Inspector Abhay Rathod is a honest and diligent Police Inspector employed with Bombay Police. He was assigned the case of racketeer and criminal don, Shekhar Mohan. Abhay successfully entraps and arrests him, and has him sentenced to a long jail term. Years later, Abhay is now the Assistant Commissioner of Police; is married, and has a son named Chirag; and Shekhar Mohan has completed his jail term and is looking to seek vengeance against Abhay. He does so by kidnapping Chirag and taking him along with him. He object is not to seek any ransom money, but attempt to separate the child from his parents, as well as attempt to make a place in his heart. Shekhar finds out that Chirag loves racing and takes him on various race courses where the child is thrilled to watch fast sport cars, and soon starts a friendship with "Uncle" Shekhar. But with Abhay and the police closing in fast, will Shekhar and Chirag be able to maintain their friendship?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIho6RIwbKOCAOQARqnpLGEwIb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281011'),
  ('328608077468310056', 'Blackmail', 2018, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Abhinay Deo, Jay Oza, Rizvi Naved', 'Parveez Sheikh', 'Irrfan Khan, Kirti Kulhari, Arunoday Singh, Divya Dutta, Omi Vaidya, Vibha Chibber, Urmila Matondkar, Gajraj Rao', null, 'When Dev finds about his wife''s affair, he starts blackmailing her and her lover but the blackmail game backfires on him.', 'When Dev finds about his wife''s affair, he starts blackmailing her and her lover but the blackmail game backfires on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apt3peZIUjd56Rkt0HGxp6EaxKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512098'),
  ('304867377179967595', 'Blackmail Boy', 2003, 'Drama', 'Thanasis Papathanasiou, Michalis Reppas', 'Thanasis Papathanasiou, Michalis Reppas', 'Nena Menti, Maria Kavoyianni, Akilas Karazisis, Joyce Evidi, Alexis Georgoulis, Jinny Papadopoulou, Giannis Tsimitselis, Alexandros Antonopoulos', 'NR', 'In the small, closed community of a provincial town, Magda tries to maintain a balance within a family facing many serious problems. The families apparently normal, bourgeois, every-day life will crack open, bringing to the surface hatred and passions of the kind that lie well-hidden in the mists of the nearby lake. An intense plot and a totally unexpected ending make up this film, which features characters who are vulnerable, innocent and ordinary, but who become ruthless and callous, worrying only about protecting their financial resources. The offences are disproportionately serious compared to the financial benefits they try to secure', 'In the small, closed community of a provincial town, Magda tries to maintain a balance within a family facing many serious problems. The families apparently normal, bourgeois, every-day life will crack open, bringing to the surface hatred and passions of the kind that lie well-hidden in the mists of the nearby lake. An intense plot and a totally unexpected ending make up this film, which features characters who are vulnerable, innocent and ordinary, but who become ruthless and callous, worrying only about protecting their financial resources. The offences are disproportionately serious compared to the financial benefits they try to secure', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i73bFZ84eIRQoClOash9nxOykyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47960'),
  ('233595375633978378', 'Blackmail Is My Life', 1968, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Action', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Keiji Maruyama, Yoshimi Yamada', 'Fumio Kōnami, Norio Osada, Hirō Matsuda', 'Hiroki Matsukata, Tomomi Satō, Shinjirō Ehara, Yūsuke Kawazu, Ryōhei Uchida, Hideo Murota, Akira Jo, Eriko Sono', null, 'Though he has come from a rough background on the streets, Muraki quickly rises through the ranks by means of his well-honed blackmailing instincts. Desperate to keep rolling with his freewheeling lifestyle, Muraki sees his luck begin to crumble when he sets his sights on the business partners of a powerful gang boss.', 'Though he has come from a rough background on the streets, Muraki quickly rises through the ranks by means of his well-honed blackmailing instincts. Desperate to keep rolling with his freewheeling lifestyle, Muraki sees his luck begin to crumble when he sets his sights on the business partners of a powerful gang boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdF5jkhLLpxlZXxl9YY0MRrybmq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107634'),
  ('664046093651898388', 'Blackout', 1954, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Terence Fisher, Ivor Slaney, Jimmy Sangster', 'Richard H. Landau', 'Dane Clark, Belinda Lee, Betty Ann Davies, Eleanor Summerfield, Andrew Osborn, Harold Lang, Jill Melford, Alvys Maben', 'NR', 'When a beautiful young woman suddenly offers inebriated Casey Morrow a lot of money for a quick and easy job, he doesn''t ask too many questions. But when the girl''s father is found murdered the following day and Morrow''s coat is soaked with blood, he must unravel the mystery to clear his name.', 'When a beautiful young woman suddenly offers inebriated Casey Morrow a lot of money for a quick and easy job, he doesn''t ask too many questions. But when the girl''s father is found murdered the following day and Morrow''s coat is soaked with blood, he must unravel the mystery to clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nQmi9JbPGrGxuPtcITZGz75z2L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38962'),
  ('385390866762549674', 'Blackout', 1978, 'Action, Thriller', 'Eddy Matalon, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'John C.W. Saxton', 'James Mitchum, Robert Carradine, Belinda Montgomery, June Allyson, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Ray Milland, Don Granbery, Terry Haig', 'R', 'Thriller about four sadistic criminals who, after escaping during a transfer, take over a posh Manhattan apartment complex and start looting and terrorizing its occupants during New York City''s famous 1977 blackout.', 'Thriller about four sadistic criminals who, after escaping during a transfer, take over a posh Manhattan apartment complex and start looting and terrorizing its occupants during New York City''s famous 1977 blackout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUbmuByexr9pCpdAA2Qvpjy9Psz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100063'),
  ('1072321322888894523', 'Blackout', 1985, 'Thriller, Crime, TV Movie, Horror', 'Douglas Hickox, Tak Fujimoto', 'David Ambrose', 'Keith Carradine, Kathleen Quinlan, Richard Widmark, Michael Beck, Gerald Hiken, Don Hood, Dameon Clarke, Martina Deignan', null, 'A police officer suspects that a local husband and father, who has recently undergone facial surgery because of injuries received in a car accident, is in reality the same man who committed a quadruple murder several years before.', 'A police officer suspects that a local husband and father, who has recently undergone facial surgery because of injuries received in a car accident, is in reality the same man who committed a quadruple murder several years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3j0wddj5U6W9ZBL8NxPQOxLgJo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226630'),
  ('633503316843719840', 'Blackout', 1996, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Allan A. Goldstein, Geoffrey Schaaf', 'Steve Schoenberg, Ruben Gordon', 'Brian Bosworth, Brad Dourif, Claire Yarlett, Marta DuBois, Jeremy Roberts, Lance LeGault, Marie Barrientos, Sheila Wills', 'PG-13', 'John Gray, a mild-mannered banker, gets hit by a car and loses most of his memory. When he gets out of the hospital, he has flashbacks which do not fit with his current life. After a strange telephone call and a murder attempt on his wife, Gray''s wife is murdered which he is forced to go to L.A. in order to solve the crime and piece together his mysterious past.', 'John Gray, a mild-mannered banker, gets hit by a car and loses most of his memory. When he gets out of the hospital, he has flashbacks which do not fit with his current life. After a strange telephone call and a murder attempt on his wife, Gray''s wife is murdered which he is forced to go to L.A. in order to solve the crime and piece together his mysterious past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hG8oAbQ2g1nqQZd9CMgnYydkKvx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133192'),
  ('494912247230453182', 'Blackout', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rigoberto Castañeda, Alejandro Martínez', 'Ed Dougherty', 'Amber Tamblyn, Aidan Gillen, Armie Hammer, Katie Stuart, Mabel Rivera, Claudia Bassols, Kate Jennings Grant, Emma Prescott', null, 'Three people from different walks of life find themselves trapped inside a stalled elevator. What at first seems like an inconvenience rapidly escalates into a nightmare.', 'Three people from different walks of life find themselves trapped inside a stalled elevator. What at first seems like an inconvenience rapidly escalates into a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6Z2OGtGTolqfmGaMvuVi8CUSxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16611'),
  ('51113792440644868', 'Blackout', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Sam Macaroni, Mateo Londoño', 'Van B. Nguyen', 'Josh Duhamel, Abbie Cornish, Omar Chaparro, Nick Nolte, Lou Ferrigno Jr., Bárbara de Regil, Robert Dobson, Pedro Lopez', null, 'A man wakes in a hospital with no memory, and quickly finds himself on the run in a locked down hospital with the Cartel on his tail.', 'A man wakes in a hospital with no memory, and quickly finds himself on the run in a locked down hospital with the Cartel on his tail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDgnmbdWS59NtTPdzujdZGuPUPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759507'),
  ('683089385991470968', 'Blackout', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'LeeAnne Bauer, David M. Parks', 'LeeAnne Bauer, David M. Parks', 'Mike Ferguson, Twana Barnett, Omar Moustafa Ghonim, Mario Daggett, Trent James', null, 'After a nuclear strike devastates California, a group of veterans and criminals trapped in a warehouse must fight to survive marauders, radiation, and each other in a world where the line between good and evil is gone.', 'After a nuclear strike devastates California, a group of veterans and criminals trapped in a warehouse must fight to survive marauders, radiation, and each other in a world where the line between good and evil is gone.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fc%2Fgracenote%2Fc0475d847dd4ba0edf8ba2eccd57dc9b.jpg', 'plex:movie:blackout-2026'),
  ('399944071945595410', 'Blackout bei Wellmanns', 2024, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Leo Khasin, Hendrik A. Kley, Michael Ludwig', 'Katja Röder, Leo Khasin, Fred Breinersdorfer', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Jördis Triebel, Daria Wolf, Josefine Keller, Hannes Wegener, Max Kruk, Constantin Gerhards, Hannah Gharib', null, 'Thomas Wellmann is an electrical engineer at the municipal utilities in a small town and is replaced by an AI in his mid-50s. Then a prolonged power cut becomes the trigger for Thomas to prepare himself, his wife and his two daughters for an emergency...', 'Thomas Wellmann is an electrical engineer at the municipal utilities in a small town and is replaced by an AI in his mid-50s. Then a prolonged power cut becomes the trigger for Thomas to prepare himself, his wife and his two daughters for an emergency...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hgXhSlYZyMIHhSSSCGpnbRB9sU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1252328'),
  ('14003238642366327', 'Blackout Effect', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jeff Bleckner, Alan Caso', 'Matthew Bombeck', 'Eric Stoltz, Charles Martin Smith, Leslie Hope, Denis Arndt, Lorraine Toussaint, Andy Comeau, Tucker Smallwood, Joe Guzaldo', null, 'There has been a mid-air collision involving a passenger jet and a cargo flight, killing everyone aboard the two planes. The NTSB investigator in charge, whose girlfriend died in the crash, is puzzled. On one side, the air traffic controller claims he lost radar contact with the cargo plane shortly before impact, when his screen "blacked out." On the other side, everyone else, including the controller''s bosses and the media, put the blame on human error. The truth is soon to be uncovered, as the aging air traffic control facilities are on the verge of failing right in the middle of the busy Thanksgiving season.', 'There has been a mid-air collision involving a passenger jet and a cargo flight, killing everyone aboard the two planes. The NTSB investigator in charge, whose girlfriend died in the crash, is puzzled. On one side, the air traffic controller claims he lost radar contact with the cargo plane shortly before impact, when his screen "blacked out." On the other side, everyone else, including the controller''s bosses and the media, put the blame on human error. The truth is soon to be uncovered, as the aging air traffic control facilities are on the verge of failing right in the middle of the busy Thanksgiving season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obWaJ9XOPj5wIaU8lt43QCqNp6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38009'),
  ('641554193115007796', 'Blackout Love', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Claudio Cofrancesco, Flavia Carimini, Francesca Marino', 'Tommaso Renzoni', 'Anna Foglietta, Alessandro Tedeschi, Anna Bonaiuto, Barbara Chichiarelli, Alessio Praticò, Giancarlo Commare, Christian Ginepro, Allegra Peluso', null, 'Valeria is a woman who never looks back, passing from one man to another. But one day everything changes: an ex who made her feel bad in the past reappears in her life.', 'Valeria is a woman who never looks back, passing from one man to another. But one day everything changes: an ex who made her feel bad in the past reappears in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odcXPBoW07VwErOW18YfhILLhVh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776327'),
  ('860941885891665506', 'BLACKPINK: Light Up the Sky', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Caroline Suh, Luke McCoubrey', null, 'JISOO, JENNIE, ROSÉ, LISA, TEDDY', 'PG-13', 'Record-shattering Korean girl band BLACKPINK tell their story — and detail the hard fought journey of the dreams and trials behind their meteoric rise.', 'Record-shattering Korean girl band BLACKPINK tell their story — and detail the hard fought journey of the dreams and trials behind their meteoric rise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwrvjmcgkDyB2RbCbIVLXZf82pl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740996'),
  ('731770156581570822', 'Blackrock', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Steven Vidler, Calum McFarlane, David Elfick', 'Nick Enright', 'Laurence Breuls, Linda Cropper, Simon Lyndon, Chris Haywood, Rebecca Smart, Jeanette Cronin, David Field, Justine Clarke', null, 'In New South Wales, Jared surfs with his mates and has a first girl. He hosts a beach party for his older pal, Ricko, and witnesses four of his mates gang-rape a 15 year old. He does nothing, and the next day, she''s found murdered. At school, the boys and the girls react: the girls with anger at the perpetrators, the boys with jeering at the dead girl''s morality. The students'' parents have their own responses. Jared retreats into angry silence, disgusted that he did nothing to help the dead girl. Meanwhile, his mother wants to talk to him about her impending cancer surgery, the police want to know what he saw, and his friend Ricko wants an alibi. Jared''s cracking under the pressure.', 'In New South Wales, Jared surfs with his mates and has a first girl. He hosts a beach party for his older pal, Ricko, and witnesses four of his mates gang-rape a 15 year old. He does nothing, and the next day, she''s found murdered. At school, the boys and the girls react: the girls with anger at the perpetrators, the boys with jeering at the dead girl''s morality. The students'' parents have their own responses. Jared retreats into angry silence, disgusted that he did nothing to help the dead girl. Meanwhile, his mother wants to talk to him about her impending cancer surgery, the police want to know what he saw, and his friend Ricko wants an alibi. Jared''s cracking under the pressure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36EyDOPw8tvGhvVqi3msNPDYSoY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81530'),
  ('76217743295125901', 'Blackthorn', 2011, 'Adventure, Action, Western', 'Mateo Gil, Juan Ruiz Anchía, Guillermo Escribano', 'Miguel Barros', 'Sam Shepard, Eduardo Noriega, Stephen Rea, Magaly Solier, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Pádraic Delaney, Dominique McElligott, Luis Bredow', 'R', 'In Bolivia, Butch Cassidy (now calling himself James Blackthorn) pines for one last sight of home, an adventure that aligns him with a young robber and makes the duo a target for gangs and lawmen alike.', 'In Bolivia, Butch Cassidy (now calling himself James Blackthorn) pines for one last sight of home, an adventure that aligns him with a young robber and makes the duo a target for gangs and lawmen alike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QtOCerjSPkS9fo8IBwDr7qAwoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68818'),
  ('885356721681910378', 'Blackwater Lane', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Horror, Crime', 'Jeff Celentano, Felix Cramer, Lee Preston', 'Elizabeth Fowler', 'Minka Kelly, Dermot Mulroney, Maggie Grace, Alan Calton, Natalie Simpson, Judah Cousin, Kris Johnson, Edward Baker-Duly', 'PG-13', 'An American school teacher in England drives past an abandoned car late one night, unaware that the driver was the victim of a murder. As she comes to terms with the realization, seemingly supernatural events start to affect the gothic manor she lives in with her husband.', 'An American school teacher in England drives past an abandoned car late one night, unaware that the driver was the victim of a murder. As she comes to terms with the realization, seemingly supernatural events start to affect the gothic manor she lives in with her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdUFd56CFC0o6XoAkn4WRNHwqod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1215918'),
  ('1074863826699559167', 'Blackwater Valley Exorcism', 2006, 'Horror', 'Ethan Wiley', 'Ellary Eddy', 'Cameron Daddo, Kristin Erickson, James Russo, Jeffrey Combs, Randy Colton, Madison Taylor, Don O. Knowlton, Leslie Fleming-Mitchell', null, 'Disturbed Isabelle is locked in a fierce battle with a vicious demon that''s hell-bent on owning her soul', 'Disturbed Isabelle is locked in a fierce battle with a vicious demon that''s hell-bent on owning her soul', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/710VIXEgzBCnVl7LkfP5gq3W1eS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71783'),
  ('615478532325981341', 'Blackway', 2015, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Daniel Alfredson, Rasmus Videbæk', 'Joe Gangemi, Gregory Jacobs', 'Anthony Hopkins, Julia Stiles, Alexander Ludwig, Ray Liotta, Steve Bacic, Lochlyn Munro, Hal Holbrook, Aleks Paunovic', 'R', 'A young woman newly returned to her hometown becomes the subject of harassment by a man named Blackway, an ex-cop turned violent crime lord who operates with impunity in this small community on the edge of the wilderness. Forsaken by the local townspeople—and advised by the Sheriff to leave town—Lillian decides instead to take a stand against her sociopathic stalker, and enlists the help of ex-logger Lester and his laconic young sidekick.', 'A young woman newly returned to her hometown becomes the subject of harassment by a man named Blackway, an ex-cop turned violent crime lord who operates with impunity in this small community on the edge of the wilderness. Forsaken by the local townspeople—and advised by the Sheriff to leave town—Lillian decides instead to take a stand against her sociopathic stalker, and enlists the help of ex-logger Lester and his laconic young sidekick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1ThQ0GGQ2IQ3bwSTR7mB406QV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359790'),
  ('1029816013285787983', 'Blacula', 1972, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'William Crain, John M. Stephens', 'Joan Torres, Raymond Koenig', 'William Marshall, Vonetta McGee, Denise Nicholas, Thalmus Rasulala, Gordon Pinsent, Charles Macaulay, Ji-Tu Cumbuka, Elisha Cook Jr.', 'PG', 'An 18th century African prince is turned into a vampire while visiting Transylvania. Two centuries later, he rises from his coffin attacking various residents of Los Angeles and meets Tina, a woman who he believes is the reincarnation of his deceased wife.', 'An 18th century African prince is turned into a vampire while visiting Transylvania. Two centuries later, he rises from his coffin attacking various residents of Los Angeles and meets Tina, a woman who he believes is the reincarnation of his deceased wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLqtFeZfRPoUUzzro3ogCdobB6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30566'),
  ('525531118069100189', 'Blade', 1973, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Ernest Pintoff, David Hoffman, Gerald Gewirtz', 'Ernest Pintoff, Jeff Lieberman', 'John Marley, Jon Cypher, Kathryn Walker, William Prince, Michael McGuire, Joe Santos, John Schuck, Peter White', 'R', 'A homicide detective goes after a woman-hating serial killer, who uses knives to murder his victims.', 'A homicide detective goes after a woman-hating serial killer, who uses knives to murder his victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odycG85vK9CMU77eDxMkzxPyEYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107331'),
  ('252216701244885851', 'Blade', 1998, 'Horror, Action', 'Stephen Norrington, Theo van de Sande, Michael Neumann', 'David S. Goyer', 'Wesley Snipes, Stephen Dorff, Kris Kristofferson, N''Bushe Wright, Donal Logue, Udo Kier, Arly Jover, Traci Lords', 'R', 'The Daywalker known as "Blade" - a half-vampire, half-mortal man - becomes the protector of humanity against an underground army of vampires.', 'The Daywalker known as "Blade" - a half-vampire, half-mortal man - becomes the protector of humanity against an underground army of vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWT70TvbsmQaqyphCZpsnQR7R32.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36647'),
  ('741995702734716665', 'Blade II', 2002, 'Fantasy, Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Guillermo del Toro, Gabriel Beristain, Dan Morski', 'David S. Goyer', 'Wesley Snipes, Kris Kristofferson, Ron Perlman, Leonor Varela, Norman Reedus, Thomas Kretschmann, Luke Goss, Matt Schulze', 'R', 'Blade forms an uneasy alliance with the vampire council in order to combat the Reapers, who are feeding on vampires.', 'Blade forms an uneasy alliance with the vampire council in order to combat the Reapers, who are feeding on vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDHwo3eWcMiy5LnnEnlGV9iLu9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36586'),
  ('1150903295988915623', 'Blade of Fury', 1993, 'Action, Drama', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, James Tien Chun, Billy Lau Nam-Kwong', 'Charcoal Tan', 'Ti Lung, Yang Fan, Cynthia Khan, Collin Chou, Zhao Chang-Jun, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Wong Kam-Kong, Lau Shun', null, 'Wang Wu, A kung-fu expert, is depressed about the dismal state of the political affairs of China. But, when he meets another famous kung-fu master, they together decide to bring about a revolution.', 'Wang Wu, A kung-fu expert, is depressed about the dismal state of the political affairs of China. But, when he meets another famous kung-fu master, they together decide to bring about a revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5A67fliLJPX61J50LRY3SJvdBI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67097'),
  ('236864581038995991', 'Blade of Fury', 2024, 'Action', 'Qin Pengfei, Du Xiaohui', 'Xu Shaofei', 'Ashton Chen, Michael Tong Man-Lung, Chunyu Shanshan, Qu Jingjing, Shen Shengnan, Liu Fengchao, Pema Jyad, Huang Tao', null, 'Pei Xing, known as the Jackal, once traded lives for money without emotion. After witnessing the powerful crush those fighting for justice, his sense of righteousness awakens. Now, he seeks revenge, punishing the wicked while facing off against other skilled swordsmans.', 'Pei Xing, known as the Jackal, once traded lives for money without emotion. After witnessing the powerful crush those fighting for justice, his sense of righteousness awakens. Now, he seeks revenge, punishing the wicked while facing off against other skilled swordsmans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utyfULeHcVAwyc3uAYMDpxeTLdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1360838'),
  ('1027665480149735003', 'Blade of the 47 Ronin', 2022, 'Fantasy', 'L.T. Chang, Ron Yuan', 'April Jeanette Mendez, Aimee Garcia, John Swetnam', 'Anna Akana, Mark Dacascos, Teresa Ting, Dustin Nguyễn, Dan Southworth, Yoshi Sudarso, Akira Koieyama, Nino Furuhata', 'R', 'A new class of warriors emerges among the Samurai clans to keep a sought-after sword from falling into the wrong hands.', 'A new class of warriors emerges among the Samurai clans to keep a sought-after sword from falling into the wrong hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIp7UbNKaBBxA9086jLCCRuXA6W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732459'),
  ('560486226727197699', 'Blade of the Immortal', 2017, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita', 'Tetsuya Oishi', 'Takuya Kimura, Hana Sugisaki, Sota Fukushi, Hayato Ichihara, Erika Toda, Kazuki Kitamura, Chiaki Kuriyama, Shinnosuke Mitsushima', 'R', 'Manji, a highly skilled samurai, becomes cursed with immortality after a legendary battle. Haunted by the brutal murder of his sister, Manji knows that only fighting evil will regain his soul. He promises to help a young girl named Rin avenge her parents, who were killed by a group of master swordsmen led by ruthless warrior Anotsu. The mission will change Manji in ways he could never imagine.', 'Manji, a highly skilled samurai, becomes cursed with immortality after a legendary battle. Haunted by the brutal murder of his sister, Manji knows that only fighting evil will regain his soul. He promises to help a young girl named Rin avenge her parents, who were killed by a group of master swordsmen led by ruthless warrior Anotsu. The mission will change Manji in ways he could never imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFaxg006Dt6J1k7qa7a5YuqbAhe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426284'),
  ('783287083871929500', 'Blade of the Phantom Master', 2004, 'Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Joji Shimura', 'Mitsuru Hongo, Joji Shimura', 'Keiji Fujiwara, Jun Fukushima, Noriko Hidaka, Daisuke Kishio, Sanae Kobayashi, Mitsuru Miyamoto, Ryusei Nakao, Romi Park', null, 'Long ago, the legends say, there was a secret army. Unseen until needed, these warriors struck from the shadows, protecting justice and defending the Jushin Empire from both tyrants and thieves. They were called the Amen Osa, the Phantom Masters. But now Jushin has fallen, its kingdoms destroyed and its citizens left to the mercy of zombies, beasts and sadists. Yet from the ashes of destruction, a hero has appeared to defend the people. His name is unknown, and no man knows who he serves... but there are clues: the strange symbol he wears around his neck and the female living weapon he commands. Is he the last of the Amen Osa? The answer will be revealed when the Blade of the Phantom Master is unleashed!', 'Long ago, the legends say, there was a secret army. Unseen until needed, these warriors struck from the shadows, protecting justice and defending the Jushin Empire from both tyrants and thieves. They were called the Amen Osa, the Phantom Masters. But now Jushin has fallen, its kingdoms destroyed and its citizens left to the mercy of zombies, beasts and sadists. Yet from the ashes of destruction, a hero has appeared to defend the people. His name is unknown, and no man knows who he serves... but there are clues: the strange symbol he wears around his neck and the female living weapon he commands. Is he the last of the Amen Osa? The answer will be revealed when the Blade of the Phantom Master is unleashed!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mz97kyWUxmwC0RMkR0A6kfmvu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36345'),
  ('1105135642716025581', 'Blade on the Feather', 1980, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Richard Loncraine, Peter Hannan', 'Dennis Potter', 'Donald Pleasence, Denholm Elliott, Tom Conti, Phoebe Nicholls, Kika Markham, Gareth Forwood', null, 'A reclusive author is visited by a young admirer - but both men are more than they claim to be.', 'A reclusive author is visited by a young admirer - but both men are more than they claim to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdALP0Eyz3GVBoCUDzhopDj4msN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120212'),
  ('402781160106586425', 'Blade Runner', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Ridley Scott, Jordan Cronenweth, Stephen Dane', 'Hampton Fancher, David Webb Peoples', 'Harrison Ford, Rutger Hauer, Sean Young, Edward James Olmos, M. Emmet Walsh, Daryl Hannah, William Sanderson, Brion James', 'R', 'In the smog-choked dystopian Los Angeles of 2019, blade runner Rick Deckard is called out of retirement to terminate a quartet of replicants who have escaped to Earth seeking their creator for a way to extend their short life spans.', 'In the smog-choked dystopian Los Angeles of 2019, blade runner Rick Deckard is called out of retirement to terminate a quartet of replicants who have escaped to Earth seeking their creator for a way to extend their short life spans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63N9uy8nd9j7Eog2axPQ8lbr3Wj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78'),
  ('78917843163028787', 'Blade Runner 2049', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Roger Deakins, Carsten Woithe, Paul Inglis', 'Hampton Fancher, Michael Green', 'Ryan Gosling, Harrison Ford, Ana de Armas, Dave Bautista, Robin Wright, Sylvia Hoeks, Mackenzie Davis, Jared Leto', 'R', 'Thirty years after the events of the first film, a new blade runner, LAPD Officer K, unearths a long-buried secret that has the potential to plunge what''s left of society into chaos. K''s discovery leads him on a quest to find Rick Deckard, a former LAPD blade runner who has been missing for 30 years.', 'Thirty years after the events of the first film, a new blade runner, LAPD Officer K, unearths a long-buried secret that has the potential to plunge what''s left of society into chaos. K''s discovery leads him on a quest to find Rick Deckard, a former LAPD blade runner who has been missing for 30 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gajva2L0rPYkEWjzgFlBXCAVBE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335984'),
  ('679664118898929565', 'Blade Runner: Black Out 2022', 2017, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Shinichiro Eto, Shinichiro Watanabe, Shukou Murase', 'Shinichiro Watanabe', 'Jovan Jackson, Luci Christian, Edward James Olmos, David Anthony Matranga, Joel McCrary, Bryson Baugus, Jay Hickman, Kenichirou Matsuda', 'PG-13', 'This animated short revolves around the events causing an electrical systems failure on the west coast of the US. According to Blade Runner 2049’s official timeline, this failure leads to cities shutting down, financial and trade markets being thrown into chaos, and food supplies dwindling. There’s no proof as to what caused the blackouts, but Replicants — the bio-engineered robots featured in the original Blade Runner, are blamed.', 'This animated short revolves around the events causing an electrical systems failure on the west coast of the US. According to Blade Runner 2049’s official timeline, this failure leads to cities shutting down, financial and trade markets being thrown into chaos, and food supplies dwindling. There’s no proof as to what caused the blackouts, but Replicants — the bio-engineered robots featured in the original Blade Runner, are blamed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzRjnUOVXyjp2WudgT7KxJLYh9D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475946'),
  ('107712730370848479', 'Blade: House of Chthon', 2006, 'Action, Horror, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Peter O''Fallon', null, 'Sticky Fingaz, Jill Wagner, Nelson Lee, Neil Jackson, Jessica Gower, Bill Mondy, David Palffy, David Kopp', null, 'The brutal hunt for the pure bloods continues as the ultimate vampire hunter, Blade, battles to defeat the House of Chthon, an ancient evil sect of vampires that is growing stronger everyday. Led by the vampire overlord Marcus, their objective is to create a vaccine that will give rise to a new breed of super vampires, immune to vampire weaknesses.', 'The brutal hunt for the pure bloods continues as the ultimate vampire hunter, Blade, battles to defeat the House of Chthon, an ancient evil sect of vampires that is growing stronger everyday. Led by the vampire overlord Marcus, their objective is to create a vaccine that will give rise to a new breed of super vampires, immune to vampire weaknesses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8T18FQKDoQQxb9gMDDqNLpimb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32219'),
  ('604599011809454967', 'Blade: The Iron Cross', 2020, 'Horror, Science Fiction, War', 'Brooks Davis, John Lechago, Howard Wexler', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'Tania Fox, Vincent Cusimano, Roy Abramsohn, Griffin Blazi, Todd Gajdusek, Angelica Briones, Derek Petropolis, Cyrus Hobbi', null, 'When the malevolent Dr. Hauser, the Third Reich''s maddest scientist, rises again with murder and mayhem on his mind, psychic journalist Elisa Ivanov awakens her own angel of death in Blade.', 'When the malevolent Dr. Hauser, the Third Reich''s maddest scientist, rises again with murder and mayhem on his mind, psychic journalist Elisa Ivanov awakens her own angel of death in Blade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diEqF0ewIr0hPBH1syCzpKitwBr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596332'),
  ('8876562822628627', 'Blade: Trinity', 2004, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'David S. Goyer, Gabriel Beristain, Nancy Ford', 'David S. Goyer', 'Wesley Snipes, Jessica Biel, Ryan Reynolds, Kris Kristofferson, Dominic Purcell, Parker Posey, Natasha Lyonne, James Remar', 'R', 'For years, Blade has fought against the vampires in the cover of the night. But now, after falling into the crosshairs of the FBI, he is forced out into the daylight, where he is driven to join forces with a clan of human vampire hunters he never knew existed—The Nightstalkers. Together with Abigail and Hannibal, two deftly trained Nightstalkers, Blade follows a trail of blood to the ancient creature that is also hunting him—the original vampire, Dracula.', 'For years, Blade has fought against the vampires in the cover of the night. But now, after falling into the crosshairs of the FBI, he is forced out into the daylight, where he is driven to join forces with a clan of human vampire hunters he never knew existed—The Nightstalkers. Together with Abigail and Hannibal, two deftly trained Nightstalkers, Blade follows a trail of blood to the ancient creature that is also hunting him—the original vampire, Dracula.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6f7iXvPOnf83MaLB1JmPzUor1rr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36648'),
  ('1090161077490253749', 'Blades', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Thomas R. Rondinella, William R. Pace, Ed McAveny', 'Thomas R. Rondinella, William R. Pace', 'Robert North, Jeremy Whelan, Victoria Scott D''Angelo, Holly Stevenson, William Towner, Peter Wray, Charlie Quinn, Bruce Katlin', 'R', 'A peaceful country club becomes the hunting ground for a demonically possessed lawnmower with a taste for human flesh.', 'A peaceful country club becomes the hunting ground for a demonically possessed lawnmower with a taste for human flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ebM5qUJXcNxKEtITX9w9rxMzZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121390'),
  ('274676052834998067', 'Blades of Blood', 2010, 'Action, Drama', 'Oh Se-yeong, Lee Joon-ik, Chung Chung-hoon', 'O Seung-hyeon, Cho Chul-hyun, Choi Seok-hwan', 'Cha Seung-won, Hwang Jung-min, Baek Sung-hyun, Han Ji-hye, Ryu Seung-ryong, Shin Jung-keun, Lee Dal-Hyeong, Yum Dong-hun', 'R', 'Lee Mong-hak and a skilled blind swordsman Hwang Jeong-hak, both long to wipe away corruption and heal the world. Lee Mong-hak creates a rebel army to achieve his goal and get rid of the King.', 'Lee Mong-hak and a skilled blind swordsman Hwang Jeong-hak, both long to wipe away corruption and heal the world. Lee Mong-hak creates a rebel army to achieve his goal and get rid of the King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zCBYNJJCx1HI2d9w0uRP7wlU6W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45075'),
  ('178243844585056433', 'Blades of Glory', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Josh Gordon, Will Speck, Stefan Czapsky', 'Jeff Cox, Craig Cox, John Altschuler', 'Will Ferrell, Jon Heder, Will Arnett, Amy Poehler, Jenna Fischer, William Fichtner, Craig T. Nelson, Romany Malco', 'PG-13', 'When a much-publicized ice-skating scandal strips them of their gold medals, two world-class athletes skirt their way back onto the ice via a loophole that allows them to compete together as a pairs team.', 'When a much-publicized ice-skating scandal strips them of their gold medals, two world-class athletes skirt their way back onto the ice via a loophole that allows them to compete together as a pairs team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yclY3zyzrL1MS9b6Eygs9ks0ZTY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9955'),
  ('879129907187609441', 'Blades of the Guardians: Wind Rises in the Desert', 2026, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Ku Huen-Chiu, Tony Cheung Tung-Leung', 'Su Chaobin, Larry Yang, Yu Baimei', 'Wu Jing, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Yu Shi, Chen Lijun, Sun Yizhou, Ci Sha, Li Yunxiao, Tony Leung Ka-fai', 'R', 'Dao Ma, the "second most wanted fugitive," is entrusted by his benefactor, the chief of Mo family clan, to take on a mysterious escort mission-escorting the "most wanted fugitive" to Chang''an.', 'Dao Ma, the "second most wanted fugitive," is entrusted by his benefactor, the chief of Mo family clan, to take on a mysterious escort mission-escorting the "most wanted fugitive" to Chang''an.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QZwryGm8l7N5XdEjPchNPl0BV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1305781'),
  ('1006230017617068288', 'Blair Witch', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Adam Wingard, Robby Baumgartner, Chad Fitz', 'Simon Barrett', 'James Allen McCune, Callie Hernandez, Brandon Scott, Corbin Reid, Valorie Curry, Wes Robinson, Heather Donahue', 'R', 'Students on a camping trip discover something sinister is lurking beyond the trees.', 'Students on a camping trip discover something sinister is lurking beyond the trees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ai73frMEz68bibFGRlPKdWBaIaq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351211'),
  ('186464872556615706', 'Blaise Pascal', 1972, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Roberto Rossellini, Gabriele Polverosi, Mario Fioretti', 'Luciano Scaffa, Roberto Rossellini, Renzo Rossellini', 'Pierre Arditi, Rita Forzano, Giuseppe Addobbati, Christian De Sica, Livio Galassi, Bruno Cattaneo, Anne Caprile, Claude Baks', null, 'In this evocative, atmospheric biography, Roberto Rossellini brings to life philosopher and mathematician Blaise Pascal, who, amid religious persecution and ignorance, believed in a harmony between God and science.', 'In this evocative, atmospheric biography, Roberto Rossellini brings to life philosopher and mathematician Blaise Pascal, who, amid religious persecution and ignorance, believed in a harmony between God and science.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cshklnD3abxwokg4MNpvs6krXTr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49634'),
  ('1064722243954903324', 'Blame', 2006, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Chicho Ibáñez Serrador, José Luis Alcaine', 'Chicho Ibáñez Serrador', 'Nieve de Medina, Montse Mostaza, Alejandra Lorenzo, Mariana Cordero, Asunción Díaz, Lourdes Bartolomé, Rocío Calvo, Elena de Frutos', 'PG-13', 'When nurse Gloria has financial difficulties, her friend Dr. Ana Torres invites her to move with her six year-old daughter Vicky to her old big house where she runs a gynecologic clinic. In return, Gloria will assist Ana in her clinic in the afternoons.', 'When nurse Gloria has financial difficulties, her friend Dr. Ana Torres invites her to move with her six year-old daughter Vicky to her old big house where she runs a gynecologic clinic. In return, Gloria will assist Ana in her clinic in the afternoons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Tj9BOYB87f4DV1QvaX7X2ySMZ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34993'),
  ('566590737265700832', 'Blame', 2018, 'Drama', 'Aaron Kovalchik, Quinn Shephard', 'Quinn Shephard', 'Quinn Shephard, Nadia Alexander, Trieste Kelly Dunn, Marcia DeBonis, Tessa Albertson, Sarah Mezzanotte, Owen Campbell, Luke Slattery', null, 'A drama teacher''s taboo relationship with an unstable student strikes a nerve in her jealous classmate, sparking a vengeful chain of events within their suburban high school that draws parallels to "The Crucible".', 'A drama teacher''s taboo relationship with an unstable student strikes a nerve in her jealous classmate, sparking a vengeful chain of events within their suburban high school that draws parallels to "The Crucible".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upAYxsju9jV7hU3k7pxYtS4exyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422128'),
  ('791456883528494571', 'Blame Game', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Philipp Leinemann, Tobias Joosten, Anastasia Semesch', 'Philipp Leinemann', 'Ronald Zehrfeld, Alexander Fehling, Claudia Michelsen, Antje Traue, Axel Prahl, August Zirner, Katharina Lorenz, Thomas Loibl', null, 'Martin Behrens is a Middle East expert for the German intelligence agency BND. He obtains information leading to a U.S. drone strike on a wanted terrorist in Zahiristan. A few days later, there''s a terrorist attack on a restaurant – the video claiming responsibility calls it payback for the drone strike. Freelance journalist Aurice, with whom Martin was having an affair, is among the victims – she was investigating corruption at the heart of the BND. Martin soon has to realize that in a world where big corporations profit from arms deals as well as from homeland security contracts, good and evil are sometimes hard to tell apart.', 'Martin Behrens is a Middle East expert for the German intelligence agency BND. He obtains information leading to a U.S. drone strike on a wanted terrorist in Zahiristan. A few days later, there''s a terrorist attack on a restaurant – the video claiming responsibility calls it payback for the drone strike. Freelance journalist Aurice, with whom Martin was having an affair, is among the victims – she was investigating corruption at the heart of the BND. Martin soon has to realize that in a world where big corporations profit from arms deals as well as from homeland security contracts, good and evil are sometimes hard to tell apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6yytlK5AK1nSGKjbf2GK5nekrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493522'),
  ('957411359037280622', 'Blame It on Fidel!', 2006, 'History, Drama', 'Julie Gavras, Nathalie Durand', 'Arnaud Cathrine, Julie Gavras', 'Julie Depardieu, Nina Kervel-Bey, Stefano Accorsi, Flore Vannier-Moreau, Benjamin Feuillet, Martine Chevallier, Olivier Perrier, Marie Kremer', 'NR', 'A 9-year-old girl weathers big changes in her household as her parents become radical political activists in 1970-71 Paris.', 'A 9-year-old girl weathers big changes in her household as her parents become radical political activists in 1970-71 Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMhgXisVDyoOGaXzFe0x1SAifF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17460'),
  ('202378761222461114', 'Blame It on Mum', 2009, 'Drama', 'Cécile Telerman, Robert Alazraki', 'Jérôme Soubeyrand, Cécile Telerman', 'Mathilde Seigner, Pascal Elbé, Olivier Marchal, Charlotte Rampling, Patrick Chesnais, Sophie Cattani, Gwendoline Hamon', null, 'An upper-class family''s dysfunctional harmony collapses when their daughter begins an affair with a cynical cop who unearths a long-buried secret.', 'An upper-class family''s dysfunctional harmony collapses when their daughter begins an affair with a cynical cop who unearths a long-buried secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGPjrHJatCn2SleRJdo3bznFukz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43620'),
  ('552865580077510607', 'Blame it on Paradise', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Francesco Nuti, Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Mauro Cappelloni', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Francesco Nuti, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Francesco Nuti, Ornella Muti, Roberto Alpi, Marco Vivio, Laura Betti, Bobby Rhodes, Novello Novelli, Silvia Annichiarico', null, 'A former convict discovers that his son has been adopted by a couple living on the mountains and tries to establish a contact with him', 'A former convict discovers that his son has been adopted by a couple living on the mountains and tries to establish a contact with him', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6qjpUTHzCgkLndXOkjN0wZ5Rok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58147'),
  ('835145518357866324', 'Blame It on Rio', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stanley Donen, Reynaldo Villalobos, Peter Lyons Collister', 'Charlie Peters, Larry Gelbart, Claude Berri', 'Michael Caine, Michelle Johnson, Joseph Bologna, Demi Moore, Valerie Harper, José Lewgoy, Lupe Gigliotti, Michael Menaugh', 'R', 'Matthew Hollis is man on holiday in Rio with his best friend. Both men have teenage daughters with them. When Matthew falls for his best friend''s amorous daughter named Jennifer, they embark on a secret, if slightly one-sided relationship. Jennifer''s father is furious when he finds out about the ''older man'' in his daughter''s life, and sets out to hunt him down with the aid of Matthew!', 'Matthew Hollis is man on holiday in Rio with his best friend. Both men have teenage daughters with them. When Matthew falls for his best friend''s amorous daughter named Jennifer, they embark on a secret, if slightly one-sided relationship. Jennifer''s father is furious when he finds out about the ''older man'' in his daughter''s life, and sets out to hunt him down with the aid of Matthew!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzNtmqL6HUFC7FZl9DnGmhnCQUL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14347'),
  ('1133495072021664718', 'Blame It on the Bellboy', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Mark Herman, Andrew Dunn, Irene Lamb', 'Mark Herman', 'Dudley Moore, Bryan Brown, Richard Griffiths, Andreas Katsulas, Patsy Kensit, Alison Steadman, Penelope Wilton, Bronson Pinchot', 'PG-13', 'Mike Lawton, Maurice Horton, and Melvin Orton are three men who come to Venice. One of them is a hit man sent to take out a mobster. Another is a lech looking for a little action with a woman he never met, whom he was set up with. And one of them was sent by his employer to inspect a property his boss wants to buy. All three men stay at the same hotel. But when the bellboy gets their names mixed up and gives info meant for someone else. So one of them meets a Realtor who will whatever she has to, to close the sale. And another follows a woman looking for romance. And another goes to the home of the mobster who thinks he''s sent there to kill him.', 'Mike Lawton, Maurice Horton, and Melvin Orton are three men who come to Venice. One of them is a hit man sent to take out a mobster. Another is a lech looking for a little action with a woman he never met, whom he was set up with. And one of them was sent by his employer to inspect a property his boss wants to buy. All three men stay at the same hotel. But when the bellboy gets their names mixed up and gives info meant for someone else. So one of them meets a Realtor who will whatever she has to, to close the sale. And another follows a woman looking for romance. And another goes to the home of the mobster who thinks he''s sent there to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGyu2UhON2s0J0YdTWsTUvsFJ4g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34151'),
  ('538935801892039293', 'Blame the Game', 2024, 'Comedy, Thriller, Romance', 'Marc Achenbach, Stefanie Übelhör, Frederik Jahn', 'Claudius Pläging', 'Dennis Mojen, Janina Uhse, Anna Maria Mühe, Axel Stein, Stephan Luca, Edin Hasanović, Taneshia Abt, Max Bretschneider', 'R', 'Pia and Jan have just fallen in love and arranged to meet Pia''s friends for a game night. Jan meets Pia''s friends for the first time and is under pressure to make the perfect first impression. When Pia''s ex-boyfriend shows up and even Jan''s buddy''s tips can''t save anything, everything is at stake: the relationship, the friendship, and the definition of truth.', 'Pia and Jan have just fallen in love and arranged to meet Pia''s friends for a game night. Jan meets Pia''s friends for the first time and is under pressure to make the perfect first impression. When Pia''s ex-boyfriend shows up and even Jan''s buddy''s tips can''t save anything, everything is at stake: the relationship, the friendship, and the definition of truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0UeupV6kpfDhb5Gx2RclQdxa3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172648'),
  ('1080450441091727125', 'BLAME!', 2017, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Yoshikazu Iwanami, Hiroyuki Seshita, Mitsunori Kataama', 'Sadayuki Murai', 'Takahiro Sakurai, Kana Hanazawa, Sora Amamiya, Mamoru Miyano, Aya Suzaki, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Nanako Mori, Kazuhiro Yamaji', 'PG-13', 'In the distant technological future, civilization has reached its ultimate Net-based form. An "infection" in the past caused the automated systems to spiral out of order, resulting in a multi-leveled city structure that replicates itself infinitely in all directions. Now humanity has lost access to the city''s controls, and is hunted down and purged by the defense system known as the Safeguard. In a tiny corner of the city, a little enclave known as the Electro-Fishers is facing eventual extinction, trapped between the threat of the Safeguard and dwindling food supplies. A girl named Zuru goes on a journey to find food for her village, only to inadvertently cause doom when an observation tower senses her and summons a Safeguard pack to eliminate the threat. With her companions dead and all escape routes blocked, the only thing that can save her now is the sudden arrival of Killy the Wanderer, on his quest for the Net Terminal Genes, the key to restoring order to the world.', 'In the distant technological future, civilization has reached its ultimate Net-based form. An "infection" in the past caused the automated systems to spiral out of order, resulting in a multi-leveled city structure that replicates itself infinitely in all directions. Now humanity has lost access to the city''s controls, and is hunted down and purged by the defense system known as the Safeguard. In a tiny corner of the city, a little enclave known as the Electro-Fishers is facing eventual extinction, trapped between the threat of the Safeguard and dwindling food supplies. A girl named Zuru goes on a journey to find food for her village, only to inadvertently cause doom when an observation tower senses her and summons a Safeguard pack to eliminate the threat. With her companions dead and all escape routes blocked, the only thing that can save her now is the sudden arrival of Killy the Wanderer, on his quest for the Net Terminal Genes, the key to restoring order to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eoRQY7VUMawwBnuD6uwN4szc8k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409421'),
  ('635238953997440584', 'Blancanieves', 2012, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Pablo Berger, John de Clerck, Kiko de la Rica', 'Pablo Berger', 'Maribel Verdú, Macarena García, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Ángela Molina, Inma Cuesta, Sofía Oria, Ramón Barea, Josep Maria Pou', 'PG-13', 'A black and white silent movie, based on the Snow White fairy tale, that is set in a romantic version of 1920s Seville and centered on a female bullfighter.', 'A black and white silent movie, based on the Snow White fairy tale, that is set in a romantic version of 1920s Seville and centered on a female bullfighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJzYcX23DdwR6S4XBEy1SDdiApe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127864'),
  ('204748459191348026', 'Blanche', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Guy Durban, André du Breuil', 'Walerian Borowczyk', 'Michel Simon, Georges Wilson, Jacques Perrin, Ligia Branice, Denise Péronne, Jean Gras, Lawrence Trimble, Michel Delahaye', null, 'Blanche is the young, pure, beautiful wife of the Master of the castle, in a secluded land. Every man is in love with her, including the King and his servant Bartolomeo, visiting the Master.', 'Blanche is the young, pure, beautiful wife of the Master of the castle, in a secluded land. Every man is in love with her, including the King and his servant Bartolomeo, visiting the Master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35jaJjtRwFCSJ41mjRFQuU47Xls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156231'),
  ('1116287122526863855', 'Blanche', 2002, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Bernie Bonvoisin, Bernard Cavalié', 'Bernie Bonvoisin, Guillaume Nicloux', 'Lou Doillon, Roschdy Zem, Jean Rochefort, Carole Bouquet, José Garcia, Gérard Depardieu, Antoine de Caunes, Antoine Basler', null, 'In 17th century France, cardinal Mazarin''s death squad kills young Blanche''s parents. She grows up to become a thief and steels a substance called Powder of the Devil and a coded letter that were sent to cardinal Mazarin. He is furious.', 'In 17th century France, cardinal Mazarin''s death squad kills young Blanche''s parents. She grows up to become a thief and steels a substance called Powder of the Devil and a coded letter that were sent to cardinal Mazarin. He is furious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrRzseKjKgbSvfon2b7WOaNCU5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60989'),
  ('76085679077492998', 'Blanche and Marie', 1985, 'War, Drama', 'Gérard de Battista, Jacques Renard', 'Sophie Goupil, Jacques Renard', 'Miou-Miou, Sandrine Bonnaire, Gérard Klein, Patrick Chesnais, Clémentine Célarié, Jacques Bonnaffé, María Casares, Jean-Paul Archie', null, 'A little town in the north of France, 1941. Blanche has three children. She worries about her husband Victor, who often goes out at night. Actually, Victor belongs to the Resistance. Soon, Blanche will be a resistant too. In the network, there is also Germinal, the hairdresser. His daughter Marie knows everything and asks to be part of it... Chronicle of the occupation and of the resistance through the eyes of the women.', 'A little town in the north of France, 1941. Blanche has three children. She worries about her husband Victor, who often goes out at night. Actually, Victor belongs to the Resistance. Soon, Blanche will be a resistant too. In the network, there is also Germinal, the hairdresser. His daughter Marie knows everything and asks to be part of it... Chronicle of the occupation and of the resistance through the eyes of the women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwE7YNMeMDaV7yTggciPDloYO6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328908'),
  ('690308200584452913', 'Blanche Fury', 1948, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Marc Allégret, Guy Green, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'Audrey Erskine-Lindop, Cecil McGivern', 'Valerie Hobson, Stewart Granger, Michael Gough, Walter Fitzgerald, Susanne Gibbs, Maurice Denham, Sybille Binder, Ernest Jay', 'NR', 'Penniless governess Blanche Fullerton takes a job at the estate of her rich relations, the Fury family. To better her position in life, Blanche marries her dull cousin, Laurence Fury, with whom she has a daughter. But before long, boredom sets in, and Blanche begins a tempestuous romance with stableman Philip Thorn. Together, they hatch a murderous plan to gain control of the estate.', 'Penniless governess Blanche Fullerton takes a job at the estate of her rich relations, the Fury family. To better her position in life, Blanche marries her dull cousin, Laurence Fury, with whom she has a daughter. But before long, boredom sets in, and Blanche begins a tempestuous romance with stableman Philip Thorn. Together, they hatch a murderous plan to gain control of the estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBvC2WdKSXrPfICPY0hAnV72Kgx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129815'),
  ('924339700220098664', 'Blanche Gardin - Bonne nuit Blanche', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Blanche Gardin, Maïa Sandoz, Xavier Maingon', 'Blanche Gardin', 'Blanche Gardin', null, 'Blanche offers us her new stand-up, creation 2018. She spares no one. Not even her own guts, which she still delivers to us smoking on the altar of self-derision.', 'Blanche offers us her new stand-up, creation 2018. She spares no one. Not even her own guts, which she still delivers to us smoking on the altar of self-derision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7gvgmK7t9InobiWfZYj9VqaZQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638292'),
  ('591349676013906083', 'Blanche Gardin - Il faut que je vous parle', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Fabrice Caro, Blanche Gardin', null, 'Blanche Gardin', null, 'Blanche, the queen of stand-up comedy and political incorrectness, has something to say to you! Discovered at the Jamel Comedy Club, then on Canal+ in the series Bref and Working Girls, Blanche Gardin proves to us with this show that you can laugh until you cry about any subject, but not with just anyone! Il faut que je vous parle is a brand new show performed by the comedian in 2015 that has never been shown on TV. The reason? No footage of the show is available... To broadcast a show that was never filmed, Canal+ retrieved the existing soundtrack of the one-woman show and asked the famous illustrator Fabcaro to draw Blanche Gardin on stage, behind a microphone. An original approach that still allows viewers to enjoy the comedian''s original jokes.', 'Blanche, the queen of stand-up comedy and political incorrectness, has something to say to you! Discovered at the Jamel Comedy Club, then on Canal+ in the series Bref and Working Girls, Blanche Gardin proves to us with this show that you can laugh until you cry about any subject, but not with just anyone! Il faut que je vous parle is a brand new show performed by the comedian in 2015 that has never been shown on TV. The reason? No footage of the show is available... To broadcast a show that was never filmed, Canal+ retrieved the existing soundtrack of the one-woman show and asked the famous illustrator Fabcaro to draw Blanche Gardin on stage, behind a microphone. An original approach that still allows viewers to enjoy the comedian''s original jokes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBbdqltPe5f7FwR5iNsdrhUFjjO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712091'),
  ('559597233824573609', 'Blanche Gardin: I Talk to Myself', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Maïa Sandoz', null, 'Blanche Gardin', null, 'Touching on bulimia, death and cat sodomy, this French actress and comedian is keen to push the envelope in a one-woman show with understated flair.', 'Touching on bulimia, death and cat sodomy, this French actress and comedian is keen to push the envelope in a one-woman show with understated flair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfQSBFfxZbdjKhoMJYFfUqT7jXE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496310'),
  ('942239018304788452', 'Blank', 2019, 'Action, Thriller', 'Behzad Khambata, Tarni Alok, Amit Tyagi', 'Pranav Adarsh', 'Sunny Deol, Ishita Dutta, Karan Kapadia, Karanvir Sharma, Rashika Pradhan, Jameel Khan, Akshay Kumar, Shaji Choudhary', null, 'A suicide bomber loses his memory and has a bomb attached to his heart. It is up to the police officers to prevent this bomb from exploding.', 'A suicide bomber loses his memory and has a bomb attached to his heart. It is up to the police officers to prevent this bomb from exploding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xfLBfBwPJfbZG9n15S9aF25VxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593214'),
  ('83651540268073433', 'Blank', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Natalie Kennedy, James Oldham, Simon Haveland', 'Stephen Herman', 'Rachel Shelley, Heida Reed, Wayne Brady, Annie Cusselle, Rebecca-Clare Evans, Bhasker Patel, Claire Fox, Martin Howard', 'NR', 'A desperate writer signs up for a fully A.I. operated retreat to cure her writer''s block, but when an unforeseen software glitch occurs, she gets trapped inside her unit with an unstable android and no communication with the outside world.', 'A desperate writer signs up for a fully A.I. operated retreat to cure her writer''s block, but when an unforeseen software glitch occurs, she gets trapped inside her unit with an unstable android and no communication with the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q43Wdy76hLObznZIUKIjHMFIdTa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:871891'),
  ('286483347277407393', 'Blank Check', 1994, 'Comedy, Family', 'Rupert Wainwright, David R. Ellis, Bill Pope', 'Colby Carr, Blake Snyder', 'Brian Bonsall, Karen Duffy, James Rebhorn, Jayne Atkinson, Michael Faustino, Chris Demetral, Miguel Ferrer, Tone Loc', 'PG', 'Bullied by his siblings and nagged by his parents, 11-year-old Preston Waters is fed up with his family — especially their frugality. But he gets his chance to teach them a lesson when a money-laundering criminal nearly bulldozes Preston with his car and compensates the boy with a blank check. Preston makes the check out for $1 million and goes on a spending spree he''ll never forget.', 'Bullied by his siblings and nagged by his parents, 11-year-old Preston Waters is fed up with his family — especially their frugality. But he gets his chance to teach them a lesson when a money-laundering criminal nearly bulldozes Preston with his car and compensates the boy with a blank check. Preston makes the check out for $1 million and goes on a spending spree he''ll never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhsH1BGqeCDHoogt5ebxOgERJGb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13962'),
  ('185207576584288978', 'Blank Narcissus (Passion of the Swamp)', 2022, 'Drama', 'Peter Strickland, Tim Sidell', 'Peter Strickland', 'Sebastien Kapps, Michael Brandon', 'NR', 'An ageing director commentates on a porno he directed 50 years ago, reminiscing on his relationship with the lead actor.', 'An ageing director commentates on a porno he directed 50 years ago, reminiscing on his relationship with the lead actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GVQoDGJpyYPQm2y7fwpQive3A3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006161'),
  ('450787243944964000', 'blank13', 2018, 'Family, Drama', 'Shin Hayasaka, Takumi Saitoh, Shuhei Kuwahara', 'Mitsutoshi Saijo', 'Issey Takahashi, Mayu Matsuoka, Takumi Saitoh, Misuzu Kanno, Lily Franky, Riku Onishi, Ryô Kitafuji, Junkichi Orimoto', null, 'Thirteen years after abandoning his wife and two sons by stepping out for a pack of cigarettes and never returning, deadbeat gambler Masato dies of stomach cancer. At his funeral, a motley crew of fellow mahjong players, pachinko parlor employees and former drinking buddies gather to pay their respects and tell stories, revealing aspects of Masato’s life that complicate his sons’ resentment towards him.', 'Thirteen years after abandoning his wife and two sons by stepping out for a pack of cigarettes and never returning, deadbeat gambler Masato dies of stomach cancer. At his funeral, a motley crew of fellow mahjong players, pachinko parlor employees and former drinking buddies gather to pay their respects and tell stories, revealing aspects of Masato’s life that complicate his sons’ resentment towards him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7IZHPGLJx4QVY0t7n0Xr7cTCsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461352'),
  ('265408311396723258', 'Blanka', 2015, 'Drama', 'Kohki Hasei', 'Kohki Hasei', 'Cydel Gabutero, Peter Millari, Jomar Bisuyo, Raymond Camacho, Ruby Ruiz', null, '11-years-old Blanka survives alone in Manila begging and stealing from tourists. One day, an absurd idea pops up: if she could buy a mother, she could have a good life. But she has to make countless efforts in order to collect enough money. An opportunity arises when she meets Peter, a 55 years old blind street musician, who teaches Blanka how to sing, a skill out of which she can make money. However, concerned about Blanka’s future, Peter decides to take Blanka to an orphanage. When she finds out, she runs away and the nightmare starts again.', '11-years-old Blanka survives alone in Manila begging and stealing from tourists. One day, an absurd idea pops up: if she could buy a mother, she could have a good life. But she has to make countless efforts in order to collect enough money. An opportunity arises when she meets Peter, a 55 years old blind street musician, who teaches Blanka how to sing, a skill out of which she can make money. However, concerned about Blanka’s future, Peter decides to take Blanka to an orphanage. When she finds out, she runs away and the nightmare starts again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4X9yvKSOZHalI8TRaLhEL6SOx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359129'),
  ('80920495702894488', 'Blankman', 1994, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Action, Crime', 'Mike Binder, Barry K. Thomas, Nandi Bowe', 'Damon Wayans, J.F. Lawton', 'Damon Wayans, David Alan Grier, Robin Givens, Christopher Lawford, Jason Alexander, Michael Wayans, Damon Wayans Jr., Lynne Thigpen', 'PG-13', 'Darryl is a childlike man with a genius for inventing various gadgets out of junk. When he stumbles on a method to make his clothes bulletproof, he decides to use his skills to be the lowest budgeted superhero of all.', 'Darryl is a childlike man with a genius for inventing various gadgets out of junk. When he stumbles on a method to make his clothes bulletproof, he decides to use his skills to be the lowest budgeted superhero of all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9b1zje1Yp3kaJOn8pJqaQ1WLmoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20678'),
  ('800555540799814174', 'Blanquita', 2023, 'Drama', 'Nicolás San Martín, Eduardo Paxeco, Juan Rosas', 'Fernando Guzzoni', 'Laura López, Alejandro Goic, Amparo Noguera, Nicolás Durán, Daniela Ramírez, Marcelo Alonso, Camila Roeschmann, Luis Cerda', 'R', 'Blanca, an 18-year-old foster home resident, is the key witness in a scandal involving kids, politicians and rich men taking part in sex parties. Yet, the more questions are asked, the less clear it becomes what Blanca’s role in the scandal exactly is.', 'Blanca, an 18-year-old foster home resident, is the key witness in a scandal involving kids, politicians and rich men taking part in sex parties. Yet, the more questions are asked, the less clear it becomes what Blanca’s role in the scandal exactly is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmHaXIfiFmOxiAy0X1OvpV1tTw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577921'),
  ('587859182355960478', 'Blast', 1997, 'Action', 'Albert Pyun, George Mooradian', 'Albert Pyun', 'Linden Ashby, Andrew Divoff, Kimberly Warren, Rutger Hauer, Norbert Weisser, Tim Thomerson, Yuji Okumoto, Vincent Klyn', null, 'A deadly team of terrorists mounts a precision attack on a swimming complex, which holds the world''s finest women''s swimming team hostage, and unknowingly traps a janitor inside.', 'A deadly team of terrorists mounts a precision attack on a swimming complex, which holds the world''s finest women''s swimming team hostage, and unknowingly traps a janitor inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSIHQJWX6AfPkS84js1j0A2GoAp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243856'),
  ('103263183379220946', 'Blast', 2004, 'Action', 'Anthony Hickox, Giulio Biccari', 'Steven E. de Souza', 'Eddie Griffin, Vinnie Jones, Breckin Meyer, Vivica A. Fox, Nadine Velazquez, Tommy Lister Jr., Nicky Andrews, Joel Pollak', 'R', 'Former Navy SEAL Lamont Dixon thought he left his fighting days behind when he became a tugboat captain assigned to tow an offshore oil rig. But calm waters begin to stir as an offshore drilling protest turns into a terrorist hijacking. When the hijackers reveal part of their elaborate scheme, Dixon suspects foul play. With the help of FBI Agent Lisa Reed coordinating the counter-attack from shore, it''s sink or swim as Dixon and Reed try to save the hostages, but can they diffuse the deadly plan before it''s too late?', 'Former Navy SEAL Lamont Dixon thought he left his fighting days behind when he became a tugboat captain assigned to tow an offshore oil rig. But calm waters begin to stir as an offshore drilling protest turns into a terrorist hijacking. When the hijackers reveal part of their elaborate scheme, Dixon suspects foul play. With the help of FBI Agent Lisa Reed coordinating the counter-attack from shore, it''s sink or swim as Dixon and Reed try to save the hostages, but can they diffuse the deadly plan before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ub3DShZwd40LOt0efh7suj858a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24775'),
  ('31906899732640290', 'Blast', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Vanya Peirani-Vignes, Thierry Arbogast, Vincent Canaple', 'Pablo Barbetti', 'Nora Arnezeder, Sara Mortensen, Pierre Kiwitt, Alika Del Sol, Édouard Montoute, Olga Korotyayeva, Anton Yakovlev, Marius Blivet', null, 'In a Parisian parking lot Sonia finds herself trapped in her car with her son and the daughter of her boyfriend Fred, who has been left outside, powerless to deal with the situation: an anti-tank mine has been set under the car. Sonia is a bomb-disposal expert, who works for a NGO with Fred. She just got back from a mission in Ukraine and, while she''s used to face dangerous situations, with the children''s lives on the line the stakes have never been higher. Along with colleagues Igor and Camille, who came to the rescue, Sonia and Fred have 30 minutes to defuse the bomb and work out who could be the mastermind behind this. Will they stand united until the end or will the family implode under pressure?', 'In a Parisian parking lot Sonia finds herself trapped in her car with her son and the daughter of her boyfriend Fred, who has been left outside, powerless to deal with the situation: an anti-tank mine has been set under the car. Sonia is a bomb-disposal expert, who works for a NGO with Fred. She just got back from a mission in Ukraine and, while she''s used to face dangerous situations, with the children''s lives on the line the stakes have never been higher. Along with colleagues Igor and Camille, who came to the rescue, Sonia and Fred have 30 minutes to defuse the bomb and work out who could be the mastermind behind this. Will they stand united until the end or will the family implode under pressure?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k43iS9a1ugXkcBEjYJPiAGtlzv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:827887'),
  ('755211659002550831', 'Blast from the Past', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Hugh Wilson, José Luis Alcaine, Louis D''Esposito', 'Hugh Wilson, Bill Kelly', 'Brendan Fraser, Alicia Silverstone, Christopher Walken, Sissy Spacek, Dave Foley, Joey Slotnick, Rex Linn, Deborah Kellner', 'PG-13', 'Following a bomb scare in the 1960s that locked the Webers into their bomb shelter for 35 years, Adam now ventures forth into Los Angeles to obtain food and supplies for his family, and a non-mutant wife for himself.', 'Following a bomb scare in the 1960s that locked the Webers into their bomb shelter for 35 years, Adam now ventures forth into Los Angeles to obtain food and supplies for his family, and a non-mutant wife for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVN4bbVX2tzaNbAdEJT5eOPq26c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11622'),
  ('838376835640474408', 'Blast of Silence', 1961, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Allen Baron, Merrill S. Brody, Carole Brody Sheppard', 'Waldo Salt', 'Allen Baron, Molly McCarthy, Larry Tucker, Bill DePrato, Peter H. Clune, Danny Meehan, Joe Bubbico, Gil Rogers', null, 'A hired killer from Cleveland has a job to do on a second-string mob boss in New York. But a special girl from his past and a fat gun dealer with pet rats get in his way.', 'A hired killer from Cleveland has a job to do on a second-string mob boss in New York. But a special girl from his past and a fat gun dealer with pet rats get in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53vcxT6Ptz5uR9T64IwIudZqcuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32008'),
  ('686836071593959120', 'Blasted', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Action', 'Martin Solvang, Martin Sofiedal', 'Emanuel Nordrum', 'Axel Bøyum, Mathias Luppichini, Fredrik Skogsrud, Eirik Hallert, André Sørum, Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Evelyn Rasmussen Osazuwa, Cecilie Svendsen', null, 'When a former childhood friend crashes Sebastian''s bachelor party and makes it all about himself, only an alien invasion can make them put aside their bad blood and reunite as the kick-ass laser-tag duo they once were.', 'When a former childhood friend crashes Sebastian''s bachelor party and makes it all about himself, only an alien invasion can make them put aside their bad blood and reunite as the kick-ass laser-tag duo they once were.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bbqh6KFvRdwu5CVwQJ2PUbNktc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660267'),
  ('642732990601615492', 'Blastfighter', 1984, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Lamberto Bava, Gianlorenzo Battaglia', 'Massimo De Rita, Luca De Rita', 'Michael Sopkiw, Valentina Forte, George Eastman, Stefano Mingardo, Ottaviano Dell''Acqua, Massimo Vanni, Elizabeth Forbes, Carlos Savage', 'NR', 'An ex-cop, fresh out of prison, returns home to find it ruled by violent rednecks and must fight to protect himself and his daughter, using his combat skills and a powerful grenade launcher.', 'An ex-cop, fresh out of prison, returns home to find it ruled by violent rednecks and must fight to protect himself and his daughter, using his combat skills and a powerful grenade launcher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCv591lbALZtzkFWpQ1KBS7j7ne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104274'),
  ('51986820765083301', 'Blaze', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ron Shelton, Haskell Wexler, John Toll', 'Ron Shelton', 'Paul Newman, Lolita Davidovich, Jerry Hardin, Gailard Sartain, Jeffrey DeMunn, Garland Bunting, Richard Jenkins, Brandon Smith', 'R', 'A middle-aged Louisiana governor falls in love with a young stripper, which jeopardizes his political career and the radical policies which have made him a controversial figure.', 'A middle-aged Louisiana governor falls in love with a young stripper, which jeopardizes his political career and the radical policies which have made him a controversial figure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upb42GxljtsmhoLxXbD6REm5Iwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22711'),
  ('751680749654734704', 'Blaze', 2018, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Ben LeDoux, Aaron West, Jency Griffin Hogan', 'Sybil Rosen, Ethan Hawke', 'Ben Dickey, Alia Shawkat, Josh Hamilton, Lloyd Teddy Johnson Jr., Charlie Sexton, Wyatt Russell, Jenn Lyon, Ritchie Montgomery', 'R', 'Inspired by the life of Blaze Foley, the unsung songwriting legend of the Texas outlaw country movement that spawned the likes of Merle Haggard and Willie Nelson. The film weaves together three periods in Blaze''s life, exploring his love affair with Sybil Rosen; his last, dark night on Earth; and the impact his songs and his death had on his fans, friends, and foes.', 'Inspired by the life of Blaze Foley, the unsung songwriting legend of the Texas outlaw country movement that spawned the likes of Merle Haggard and Willie Nelson. The film weaves together three periods in Blaze''s life, exploring his love affair with Sybil Rosen; his last, dark night on Earth; and the impact his songs and his death had on his fans, friends, and foes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3rMWJRP6rQO5qP9E6umeRq9hGA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489928'),
  ('25927107115955146', 'Blaze', 2022, 'Drama, Fantasy, Crime', 'Del Kathryn Barton, Liz Ellis', 'Del Kathryn Barton, Huna Amweero', 'Julia Savage, Simon Baker, Yael Stone, Josh Lawson, Remy Hii, John Waters, Heather Mitchell, Morgan Davies', null, 'After a young girl witnesses a violent crime, she summons an imaginary dragon to help process her anger and protect her on her journey into womanhood.', 'After a young girl witnesses a violent crime, she summons an imaginary dragon to help process her anger and protect her on her journey into womanhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPrsnuigEuHsFIqCs71Cu78RdMj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767254'),
  ('549476962301035101', 'Blaze Starr Goes Nudist', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Doris Wishman, Raymond Phelan', 'Doris Wishman', 'Blaze Starr, Ralph Young, Gene Berk, William Mayer, Sandra Sinclair, Stephen Bloom, Allison Louise Downe, Jim Antonio', 'NR', 'Stripper Blaze Starr visits a nudist camp for a movie to escape her troubles. She decides to join them and for a while manages to keep it from her fiancé/agent but soon he grows suspicious of her activities.', 'Stripper Blaze Starr visits a nudist camp for a movie to escape her troubles. She decides to join them and for a while manages to keep it from her fiancé/agent but soon he grows suspicious of her activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGDL6eRvNhQxAbvC3AgfI8DB5Yv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50948'),
