  ('101535150886296262', 'Blazing Neon', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'FGKO, Fabio Caldironi, Faustine Chevrin', 'FGKO, Shérazade Khalladi', 'Jérémie Laheurte, Tracy Gotoas, Bosh, Idir Azougli, Marlise Ngadem Bete, Abel Jafri, Nacho Fresneda, Jo Prestia', null, 'Two desperate characters search for freedom in action-packed road movie noir from FGKO, adapted from the thriller by Rémy Lasource.', 'Two desperate characters search for freedom in action-packed road movie noir from FGKO, adapted from the thriller by Rémy Lasource.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swHJrD76psDc45wt72slMac8UUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957604'),
  ('1138619693398264408', 'Blazing Saddles', 1974, 'Western, Comedy', 'Mel Brooks, Joseph F. Biroc, John C. Chulay', 'Richard Pryor, Mel Brooks, Norman Steinberg', 'Cleavon Little, Gene Wilder, Slim Pickens, Harvey Korman, Madeline Kahn, Mel Brooks, Burton Gilliam, Alex Karras', 'R', 'A town—where everyone seems to be named Johnson—stands in the way of the railroad. In order to grab their land, robber baron Hedley Lamarr sends his henchmen to make life in the town unbearable. After the sheriff is killed, the town demands a new sheriff from the Governor, so Hedley convinces him to send the town the first black sheriff in the west.', 'A town—where everyone seems to be named Johnson—stands in the way of the railroad. In order to grab their land, robber baron Hedley Lamarr sends his henchmen to make life in the town unbearable. After the sheriff is killed, the town demands a new sheriff from the Governor, so Hedley convinces him to send the town the first black sheriff in the west.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDSrLJcHJpMXISPdl6sPkS5Xbu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11072'),
  ('1012112986149710684', 'Blazing Stewardesses', 1975, 'Comedy, Western', 'Al Adamson, John D''Amato', 'Samuel M. Sherman, John D''Amato', 'Yvonne De Carlo, Robert Livingston, Don ''Red'' Barry, Marilyn Joi, Connie Hoffman, Regina Carrol, Geoffrey Land, Harry Ritz', 'R', 'Those "naughty stewardesses" are at it again! But this time they’ve turned in their Mile High Club sky miles for a sexy, rousing, Old West-styled adventure on a dude ranch. Punchin’ cattle and breakin’ stallions are the last things on their minds as these lovely ladies earn their wings in a whole new way…blazing a trail straight to the bedroom.', 'Those "naughty stewardesses" are at it again! But this time they’ve turned in their Mile High Club sky miles for a sexy, rousing, Old West-styled adventure on a dude ranch. Punchin’ cattle and breakin’ stallions are the last things on their minds as these lovely ladies earn their wings in a whole new way…blazing a trail straight to the bedroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k75MznotbtlQtMn5Jknrw3Mx5MP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29418'),
  ('856366212125454709', 'Bldg. N', 2022, 'Horror', 'Yosuke Goto, Takashi Matsui', 'Yosuke Goto', 'Minori Hagiwara, Yuki Kura, Kasumi Yamaya, Mariko Tsutsui, Tarō Suwa, Mariko Akama, Takashi Okabe', null, 'Urban legend horror film based on the true story of the "Ghost Apartment Incident" that occurred in Gifu Prefecture''s Tomika Town in 2000.', 'Urban legend horror film based on the true story of the "Ghost Apartment Incident" that occurred in Gifu Prefecture''s Tomika Town in 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHGPPkKiDTnuOr5l0N5XaK20Ra0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938133'),
  ('453121659201146273', 'Bleach', 2018, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Shinsuke Sato, Taro Kawazu, Yuji Shimomura', 'Shinsuke Sato, Daisuke Habara', 'Sota Fukushi, Hana Sugisaki, Ryo Yoshizawa, Erina Mano, Yu Koyanagi, Seiichi Tanabe, Hirohito Yamada, Risako Ito', 'PG-13', 'High school student Ichigo Kurosaki lives an ordinary life, besides being able to see ghosts and the blurry memories of his mother''s death under strange circumstances when he was a kid. His peaceful world suddenly breaks as he meets Rukia Kuchiki, a God of Death.', 'High school student Ichigo Kurosaki lives an ordinary life, besides being able to see ghosts and the blurry memories of his mother''s death under strange circumstances when he was a kid. His peaceful world suddenly breaks as he meets Rukia Kuchiki, a God of Death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpZVfeJaCilXr9Br7wO9xkfZn7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420426'),
  ('145838439429954880', 'Bleach the Movie: Fade to Black', 2008, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Hideki Hashimoto, Takashi Hashimoto, Noriyuki Abe', 'Ookubo Masahiro, Natsuko Takahashi, Masahiro Okubo', 'Masakazu Morita, Fumiko Orikasa, Kentaro Ito, Aya Hirano, Hiroshi Kamiya, Mitsuaki Madono, Jun Fukuyama, Taro Yamaguchi', 'PG-13', 'A strange disturbance in the World of the Living sends Ichigo and Kon to the Soul Society, where the Seireitei has been devastated by an explosion of reishi and Rukia is missing. Stranger still, none of the Soul Reapers remember Ichigo, and they think he’s the one responsible for the destruction. Now on the run, Ichigo is forced into a lonely battle in order to find Rukia and stop the real culprits!', 'A strange disturbance in the World of the Living sends Ichigo and Kon to the Soul Society, where the Seireitei has been devastated by an explosion of reishi and Rukia is missing. Stranger still, none of the Soul Reapers remember Ichigo, and they think he’s the one responsible for the destruction. Now on the run, Ichigo is forced into a lonely battle in order to find Rukia and stop the real culprits!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IfR2DrWLb26AAdQFwGkhvPTflX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17165'),
  ('281486720873652124', 'Bleach the Movie: Hell Verse', 2010, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Noriyuki Abe, Masashi Kudo, Tomomi Umemura', 'Natsuko Takahashi, Masahiro Okubo', 'Masakazu Morita, Fumiko Orikasa, Noriaki Sugiyama, Hiroki Yasumoto, Yuki Matsuoka, Ryotaro Okiayu, Kentaro Ito, Masaaki Tsukada', 'PG-13', 'Hell – A place where beings that have committed mortal sins during their lifetime are sent. It is a realm where even Soul Reapers are forbidden to interfere. When a group of vicious Sinners plot to escape from this eternal prison, they discover that Substitute Soul Reaper Ichigo Kurosaki is the key to their freedom.', 'Hell – A place where beings that have committed mortal sins during their lifetime are sent. It is a realm where even Soul Reapers are forbidden to interfere. When a group of vicious Sinners plot to escape from this eternal prison, they discover that Substitute Soul Reaper Ichigo Kurosaki is the key to their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pd7V5iCB19VBPJkihxFXFwSRW2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73245'),
  ('862112734845140766', 'Bleach the Movie: Memories of Nobody', 2006, 'Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Toshiyuki Fukushima, Satoshi Ishino, Noriyuki Abe', 'Masashi Sogo', 'Masakazu Morita, Fumiko Orikasa, Chiwa Saito, Tomoko Kawakami, Keijin Okuda, Mitsuaki Madono, Hiroshi Matsumoto, Yoko Soumi', 'NR', 'In Karakura Town, unidentifiable spirits begin appearing en mases. While attempting to deal with these strange souls, Ichigo Kurosaki and Rukia Kuchiki meet Senna, a mysterious shinigami who wipes out most of them. Senna refuses to answer any questions, so Ichigo is forced to follow her while Rukia tries to find out what''s going on.', 'In Karakura Town, unidentifiable spirits begin appearing en mases. While attempting to deal with these strange souls, Ichigo Kurosaki and Rukia Kuchiki meet Senna, a mysterious shinigami who wipes out most of them. Senna refuses to answer any questions, so Ichigo is forced to follow her while Rukia tries to find out what''s going on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QXGWJ0bsmbMUDBXXfS1RnFadkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15575'),
  ('284052436326301208', 'Bleach the Movie: The DiamondDust Rebellion', 2007, 'Action, Animation, Thriller', 'Noriyuki Abe, Toshiyuki Fukushima', 'Michiko Yokote', 'Masakazu Morita, Romi Park, Akira Ishida, Fumiko Orikasa, Kentaro Ito, Kaya Matsutani, Masaaki Tsukada, Aya Hisakawa', 'PG-13', 'When an artifact known as the "King''s Seal" is stolen during transport from Soul Society, Hitsugaya Toushirou is assigned to retrieve it. Toushirou goes missing after a battle with the thieves, leading Seireitei to suspect him of treachery. They order his immediate capture and execution. Unwilling to believe him capable of such a crime, Ichigo, Rangiku, Rukia, and Renji set out to find Toushirou.', 'When an artifact known as the "King''s Seal" is stolen during transport from Soul Society, Hitsugaya Toushirou is assigned to retrieve it. Toushirou goes missing after a battle with the thieves, leading Seireitei to suspect him of treachery. They order his immediate capture and execution. Unwilling to believe him capable of such a crime, Ichigo, Rangiku, Rukia, and Renji set out to find Toushirou.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PV8OKvHSYvgmdVnU2wcuzQGthP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17101'),
  ('153383371035647401', 'Bleak Moments', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bahram Manocheri, Mike Leigh, Liz Dallas-Ross', 'Mike Leigh', 'Anne Raitt, Sarah Stephenson, Eric Allan, Joolia Cappleman, Mike Bradwell, Malcolm Smith, Donald Sumpter, Liz Smith', null, 'Moments from the uncompromisingly bleak existence of a secretary, her intellectually disabled sister, aloof and uneasy teacher boyfriend, bizarre neighbor and irritating workmate.', 'Moments from the uncompromisingly bleak existence of a secretary, her intellectually disabled sister, aloof and uneasy teacher boyfriend, bizarre neighbor and irritating workmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6UZkLlGXxMpB4CsrZ4pyLEU5iZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122271'),
  ('894416086159717490', 'Bleak Night', 2011, 'Drama', 'Yoon Sung-hyun, Lee Seok-sool, Byun Bong-sun', 'Yoon Sung-hyun', 'Lee Je-hoon, Seo Jun-young, Park Jeong-min, Cho Seong-ha, Lee Cho-hee, Bae Je-gi, Kim Lok-kyoung, Heo Ji-won', null, 'The suicide of a former high-school bully puts the boy''s father on a quest for answers.', 'The suicide of a former high-school bully puts the boy''s father on a quest for answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vpSXK8tAbwlfow5EpYqPnAI30i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74092'),
  ('636457659915120399', 'Bleak Street', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alejandro Cantú, Arturo Ripstein, Dan Chávez', 'Paz Alicia Garciadiego', 'Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Nora Velázquez, Sylvia Pasquel, Alejandro Suárez, Arcelia Ramírez, Juan Francisco Longoria, Guillermo López, Greta Cervantes', null, 'Two wrestlers decide to go to a hotel in order to meet two prostitutes.', 'Two wrestlers decide to go to a hotel in order to meet two prostitutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdBqoN3rEmJMuxEFdeINNLvdRlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346225'),
  ('88912983513833666', 'Bledders', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Erwin van den Eshof, Olaf Westra', 'Zeynep Dülger', 'Nesim el Ahmadi, Sinan Eroglu, Vajèn van den Bosch, Mehdi Chafi, Emerson Akachar', null, 'When criminal friends Kadir and Yilmaz go undercover at an elite private school, they find themselves immersed in a world of privilege, strict rules, and hidden diamonds. What begins as a simple cover quickly turns into an explosive clash between two worlds — and a true test of their friendship.', 'When criminal friends Kadir and Yilmaz go undercover at an elite private school, they find themselves immersed in a world of privilege, strict rules, and hidden diamonds. What begins as a simple cover quickly turns into an explosive clash between two worlds — and a true test of their friendship.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fzbppdd0QdRPXzl3QHPyYJeoZt5a.jpg', 'plex:movie:bledders'),
  ('63353446587931017', 'Bleed', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tripp Rhame, Mark Carroll', 'Ben Jacoby', 'Chelsey Crisp, Riley Smith, Michael Steger, Lyndon Smith, Brittany Ishibashi, Elimu Nelson, David Yow, Kyla Deaver', 'NR', 'It seemed perfect - a new house, a new marriage, a child soon to be born. But when Sarah and Matt invite their friends to celebrate, the situation turns deadly as they enter a burned-out prison on a ghost hunt.', 'It seemed perfect - a new house, a new marriage, a child soon to be born. But when Sarah and Matt invite their friends to celebrate, the situation turns deadly as they enter a burned-out prison on a ghost hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RTVfliZTxzJA5ypFLP0TWZk7y3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388243'),
  ('131442904417094010', 'Bleed for This', 2016, 'Drama', 'Larkin Seiple, Ben Younger', 'Ben Younger', 'Miles Teller, Aaron Eckhart, Katey Sagal, Ciarán Hinds, Ted Levine, Christine Evangelista, Amanda Clayton, Daniel Sauli', 'R', 'The inspirational story of World Champion Boxer Vinny Pazienza, who after a near fatal car crash, which left him not knowing if he''d ever walk again, made one of sports most incredible comebacks.', 'The inspirational story of World Champion Boxer Vinny Pazienza, who after a near fatal car crash, which left him not knowing if he''d ever walk again, made one of sports most incredible comebacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMM9frT6sFEvz7PwHniIDUKcLDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332979'),
  ('838283730861556785', 'Bleeder', 1999, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Morten Søborg, Mette Hesthaven', 'Nicolas Winding Refn', 'Kim Bodnia, Mads Mikkelsen, Rikke Louise Andersson, Liv Corfixen, Levino Jensen, Zlatko Burić, Claus Flygare, Ole Abildgaard', null, 'Two stories for the price of one: a video store clerk tries to get acquainted with a waitress; a man beats his pregnant wife, unaware that her brother is a violent racist.', 'Two stories for the price of one: a video store clerk tries to get acquainted with a waitress; a man beats his pregnant wife, unaware that her brother is a violent racist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNF10v7Db2zq53kBcwKGlVcd8Er.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17985'),
  ('697482921583362086', 'Bleeders', 1997, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Peter Svatek, Barry Gravelle, Daniel Bouthillette', 'Ronald Shusett, Dan O''Bannon, Charles Adair', 'Roy Dupuis, Kristin Lehman, Rutger Hauer, Leni Parker, John Dunn-Hill, Joanna Noyes, Janine Theriault, Pascal Gruselle', null, 'A man with an unknown disease travels to an island with his girlfriend where his relatives once lived, hoping to find a cure to his illness. Although his relatives were all thought to be dead, he finds them living underground.', 'A man with an unknown disease travels to an island with his girlfriend where his relatives once lived, hoping to find a cure to his illness. Although his relatives were all thought to be dead, he finds them living underground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhMTDjI5Q9v9YvS2D1Mtsg5us1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58789'),
  ('357606799223429108', 'Bleeding Heart', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Diane Bell, Zak Mulligan', 'Diane Bell', 'Zosia Mamet, Jessica Biel, Edi Gathegi, Joe Anderson, Kate Burton, Harry Hamlin, Sam Ly, Megan Raye Manzi', null, 'Reserved yoga instructor May''s peaceful, clean-living life is thrown out of balance by the arrival of her long-lost sister Shiva, a street-smart yet naive young woman trapped in an abusive relationship. May feels compelled to rescue the hapless Shiva, but she finds herself increasingly drawn out of her sedate world and deeper into Shiva''s chaotic one.', 'Reserved yoga instructor May''s peaceful, clean-living life is thrown out of balance by the arrival of her long-lost sister Shiva, a street-smart yet naive young woman trapped in an abusive relationship. May feels compelled to rescue the hapless Shiva, but she finds herself increasingly drawn out of her sedate world and deeper into Shiva''s chaotic one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u04tUftlaqBsrpRCwqR6bKHgrVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332706'),
  ('931760817019941787', 'Bleeding Love', 2024, 'Drama', 'Emma Westenberg, Chris Ripley, Eric Braun', 'Ruby Caster, Clara McGregor', 'Clara McGregor, Ewan McGregor, Kim Zimmer, Devyn McDowell, Sasha Alexander, Jake Weary, Vera Bulder, Travis Hammer', null, 'In an effort to reunite with his daughter after a period of absence, a father takes her on a road trip to Santa Fe, New Mexico. Along the way they encounter some interesting characters and obstacles while sorting out their relationship.', 'In an effort to reunite with his daughter after a period of absence, a father takes her on a road trip to Santa Fe, New Mexico. Along the way they encounter some interesting characters and obstacles while sorting out their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3s6n7XtZqepNA1Mv32cvwSfGX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000780'),
  ('779456945728512531', 'Bleeding Steel', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Keir Beck, Stephen Gallacher, Jung Ku', 'Erica Xia-Hou, Cui Siwei, Leo Zhang', 'Jackie Chan, Show Lo, Ouyang Nana, Erica Xia-Hou, Callan Mulvey, Tess Haubrich, Damien Garvey, Bowie Lam Bo-Yee', 'R', 'A hardened special forces agent fights to protect a young woman from a sinister criminal gang. At the same time, he feels a special connection to the young woman, like they have met in a different life.', 'A hardened special forces agent fights to protect a young woman from a sinister criminal gang. At the same time, he feels a special connection to the young woman, like they have met in a different life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vL1KMUr0Jj6kEZ5YPZO7VQBZMLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460648'),
  ('26477347781769880', 'Blek Giek', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Enrico Caria, Pierpaolo Andriani, Italo Pesce Delfino', 'Enrico Caria', 'Biagio Izzo, Lillo Petrolo, Claudio Gregori, Cinzia Mascoli, Giovanni Mauriello, Zuleica Dos Santos, Pietro De Silva, Cristiano Callegaro', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xseqfOl8SeTC29suqJpmLpPhEqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114911'),
  ('527930833234650124', 'Blended', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Drew Monahan, John M. Morse, Julio Macat', 'Ivan Menchell, Clare Sera', 'Adam Sandler, Drew Barrymore, Kevin Nealon, Terry Crews, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Bella Thorne, Joel McHale, Abdoulaye N''Gom', 'PG-13', 'Recently divorced mom Lauren and widowed dad Jim let their friends push them into a blind date, which goes disastrously wrong. Unsurprisingly, neither wants to see the other ever again. However, fate intervenes when both Jim and Lauren, unbeknownst to each other, purchase one-half of the same vacation package at a South African resort for families, during spring break. They and their children are forced to share the same romantic suite and participate in a slew of family activities together.', 'Recently divorced mom Lauren and widowed dad Jim let their friends push them into a blind date, which goes disastrously wrong. Unsurprisingly, neither wants to see the other ever again. However, fate intervenes when both Jim and Lauren, unbeknownst to each other, purchase one-half of the same vacation package at a South African resort for families, during spring break. They and their children are forced to share the same romantic suite and participate in a slew of family activities together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2YrH9jS7CAfWjETHFeL0tth79E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232672'),
  ('925474971486992546', 'Bless the Beasts & Children', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stanley Kramer, Michel Hugo', 'Mac Benoff', 'Bill Mumy, Barry Robins, Miles Chapin, Darel Glaser, Bob Kramer, Marc Vahanian, Jesse White, Ken Swofford', null, 'A group of social misfits at a summer camp for boys run away to save penned-in buffaloes from a rifle club''s slaughter.', 'A group of social misfits at a summer camp for boys run away to save penned-in buffaloes from a rifle club''s slaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8e7NgKkaidTbeLsJcpOFzL0X7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94225'),
  ('840599838707074673', 'Bless the Child', 2000, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Chuck Russell, Peter Menzies Jr., Jae Pak', 'Clifford Green, Ellen Green, Thomas Rickman', 'Kim Basinger, Jimmy Smits, Rufus Sewell, Ian Holm, Angela Bettis, Holliston Coleman, Christina Ricci, Lumi Cavazos', 'R', 'When Maggie''s sister Jenna saddles her with an autistic newborn named Cody she touches Maggie''s heart and becomes the daughter she has always longed for. But six years later Jenna suddenly re-enters her life and, with her mysterious new husband, Eric Stark, abducts Cody. Despite the fact that Maggie has no legal rights to Cody, FBI agent John Travis takes up her cause when he realizes that Cody shares the same birth date as several other recently murdered children.', 'When Maggie''s sister Jenna saddles her with an autistic newborn named Cody she touches Maggie''s heart and becomes the daughter she has always longed for. But six years later Jenna suddenly re-enters her life and, with her mysterious new husband, Eric Stark, abducts Cody. Despite the fact that Maggie has no legal rights to Cody, FBI agent John Travis takes up her cause when he realizes that Cody shares the same birth date as several other recently murdered children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1RGEF8xIA6ecF8W4do8CaWI0yE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10391'),
  ('47403853538493790', 'Bless Their Little Hearts', 1984, 'Drama', 'Billy Woodberry, Charles Burnett', 'Charles Burnett', 'Nate Hardman, Kaycee Moore, Angela Burnett, Ronald Burnett, Kimberly Burnett, Langston Woodberry, Eugene Cherry, Ellis Griffin', null, 'Charlie Banks, chronically unemployed, struggles to find dignity and a meaning for life in the impoverished Los Angeles neighborhood of Watts.', 'Charlie Banks, chronically unemployed, struggles to find dignity and a meaning for life in the impoverished Los Angeles neighborhood of Watts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gKsQG2vvqnnwDVGiU9FoKoxXqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137765'),
  ('502641889464787688', 'Bless This House', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas', null, 'Sidney James, Diana Coupland, Terry Scott, June Whitfield, Peter Butterworth, Sally Geeson, George A. Cooper, Robin Askwith', null, 'The legendary Sid James stars as the head of a chaotic household in this movie spin-off from the hit ITV sitcom. Sid Abbott and his best mate Trevor (Peter Butterworth) enjoy home-brewing. Plans to turn their hobby into a profitable, if illicit, sideline come unstuck when a Customs and Excise officer (Terry Scott) moves in next door! What’s more, Sid’s outspoken and madcap family hinder neighbourly relations even further.', 'The legendary Sid James stars as the head of a chaotic household in this movie spin-off from the hit ITV sitcom. Sid Abbott and his best mate Trevor (Peter Butterworth) enjoy home-brewing. Plans to turn their hobby into a profitable, if illicit, sideline come unstuck when a Customs and Excise officer (Terry Scott) moves in next door! What’s more, Sid’s outspoken and madcap family hinder neighbourly relations even further.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WN3FVaoqAREZm6FbUMMttI8BA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17120'),
  ('930971129846419277', 'Blessed', 2004, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Simon Fellows, Gabriel Kosuth', 'Robert Mearns, Jayson Rothwell', 'Heather Graham, James Purefoy, Fionnula Flanagan, Alan McKenna, Michael J. Reynolds, Debora Weston, Stella Stevens, William Hootkins', 'R', 'Heather Graham and James Purefoy play a couple who desperately want to have a baby. Unfortunately, she has been diagnosed as infertile, and the couple can''t afford the medical treatments that might allow her to conceive. Good fortune appears to be smiling on the couple when they are given an opportunity to receive free treatments at a mysterious fertility clinic.', 'Heather Graham and James Purefoy play a couple who desperately want to have a baby. Unfortunately, she has been diagnosed as infertile, and the couple can''t afford the medical treatments that might allow her to conceive. Good fortune appears to be smiling on the couple when they are given an opportunity to receive free treatments at a mysterious fertility clinic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQIQzonaUBSb5VG90Eq4VGfN4Dv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20695'),
  ('976406485217698258', 'Blessed Are Those Who Thirst', 1997, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Carl Jørgen Kiønig, Kjell Vassdal', 'Axel Hellstenius', 'Kjersti Elvik, Gjertrud Jynge, Lasse Kolsrud, Nils Ole Oftebro, Bjørn Sundquist, Andrine Sæther, Marie Theisen, Anders T. Andersen', null, 'Adapted from a novel by Norway''s justice minister Anne Holt. Lesbian policewoman Hanne Wilhelmsen (Kjersti Elvik), who has a live-in lover, tools about Oslo on her Harley-Davidson. After a number of women vanish, police find blood but no bodies, and Wilhelmsen begins a search for the suspected serial killer.', 'Adapted from a novel by Norway''s justice minister Anne Holt. Lesbian policewoman Hanne Wilhelmsen (Kjersti Elvik), who has a live-in lover, tools about Oslo on her Harley-Davidson. After a number of women vanish, police find blood but no bodies, and Wilhelmsen begins a search for the suspected serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvEmoaOxqfYEstLDK28Iub60otN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115483'),
  ('336406020026005668', 'Blessed by Fire', 2005, 'Drama, War', 'Javier Julia, Tristán Bauer', 'Tristán Bauer, Gustavo Romero Borri, Edgardo Esteban', 'Gastón Pauls, Virginia Innocenti, Pablo Ribba, César Albarracín, Víctor Hugo Carrizo, Arturo Bonín, Marcelo Chaparro, Juan Leyrado', null, 'Argentine film about the experiences of conscripts in the Malvinas Islands War.', 'Argentine film about the experiences of conscripts in the Malvinas Islands War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZyOHAWLvtdl39IwzAvZuJHcqL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60435'),
  ('101843062132791893', 'Blessed Madness', 2018, 'Comedy, Family', 'Carlo Verdone', 'Carlo Verdone, Nicola Guaglianone, Menotti', 'Carlo Verdone, Ilenia Pastorelli, Lucrezia Lante della Rovere, Maria Pia Calzone, Paola Minaccioni, Federica Fracassi, Paolo Paoloni, Elisa Di Eusanio', null, 'A man dedicated to religion and very faithful husband suddenly finds himself single. The new shop assistant in his shop will overwhelm his life.', 'A man dedicated to religion and very faithful husband suddenly finds himself single. The new shop assistant in his shop will overwhelm his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UaxYbbv204sRpCL5Io4oGUDhJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486070'),
  ('110465920874082908', 'Blessed Transgression!', 1999, null, 'Enrico Bernard', 'Enrico Bernard', 'Sonia Topazio, Pascal Persiano, Tinto Brass', null, 'A young separated couple meets by chance on the terrace of a Roman park. The husband hardly recognizes in the woman''s uninhibited and provocative behavior his ex-wife, who, realizing the exciting effect it has on her ex-spouse, even offers him a threesome.', 'A young separated couple meets by chance on the terrace of a Roman park. The husband hardly recognizes in the woman''s uninhibited and provocative behavior his ex-wife, who, realizing the exciting effect it has on her ex-spouse, even offers him a threesome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3fKFKZozePsp9IC78JDsUGxoAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257835'),
  ('423248459918891329', 'Blessing Bell', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'SABU', 'SABU', 'Susumu Terajima, Naomi Nishida, Itsuji Itao, Ryoko Shinohara, Sansei Shiomi, Kazuko Shirakawa, Seijun Suzuki, Toru Tezuka', null, 'Existential study on a misplaced workers and ex-prisoner who moves through the city and his influence on other characters'' lives.', 'Existential study on a misplaced workers and ex-prisoner who moves through the city and his influence on other characters'' lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5LK3qGEaN0r5jamX9pO8fT0Dda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104277'),
  ('470106270677564357', 'Bleu Catacombes', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Charlotte Brändström, Pascal Gennesseaux', 'Gilda Piersanti, Gianguido Spinelli', 'Patrick Chesnais, Camille Panonacle, Jane Birkin, Ludmila Mikaël, Ruth Vega Fernandez, Katy Amaïzo, Michel Bompoil, Gaëlle Bona', null, 'The head of a famous artist with a sordid past is found in the catacombs in Paris. In his studio, Commissaire Rousseau and the young profiler Mariella De Luca discover a second decapitated body, his wife''s. The mystery deepens when another head is found a few days later.', 'The head of a famous artist with a sordid past is found in the catacombs in Paris. In his studio, Commissaire Rousseau and the young profiler Mariella De Luca discover a second decapitated body, his wife''s. The mystery deepens when another head is found a few days later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zFvNbfQIodmMwqiGccjfGcxnJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320299'),
  ('1077629865615158812', 'Bleu Shut', 1970, null, 'Robert Nelson', null, null, null, '"Even when we know the game is an illusion, the experience of Bleu Shut is entirely a pleasure: the ‘game’ is fun, the Nelson/Wiley debates, infectiously funny; and Nelson’s choice of imagery, quirky and amusing. Bleu Shut reveals, and allows us to enjoy, our gullibility within the pervasive absurdity of modern life." –Scott MacDonald', '"Even when we know the game is an illusion, the experience of Bleu Shut is entirely a pleasure: the ‘game’ is fun, the Nelson/Wiley debates, infectiously funny; and Nelson’s choice of imagery, quirky and amusing. Bleu Shut reveals, and allows us to enjoy, our gullibility within the pervasive absurdity of modern life." –Scott MacDonald', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NqWZjyYDLSSwVI6NmZnz9sibvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134321'),
  ('570845308101234907', 'Blight', 1996, 'Documentary', 'John Smith', null, null, null, 'A short film featuring the voices of those affected when the M11 Link Road in East London was built, accompanied by scenes and sounds of demolition.', 'A short film featuring the voices of those affected when the M11 Link Road in East London was built, accompanied by scenes and sounds of demolition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hNaWv3NBb224QyqyatytvuxmRD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289853'),
  ('120055873429267266', 'Blind', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Frederick Wiseman, John Davey', null, null, null, 'BLIND shows the educational programs and daily life of students in kindergarten through the 12th grade at the Alabama School for the Blind. The School is organized around the effort to educate blind and visually impaired students to be in charge of their own lives. Sequences in the film include mobility training, braille instruction and orientation as well as traditional classroom subjects such as English, history, science and music. Other sequences show psychological counseling sessions; vocational training; staff dealing with student disciplinary problems; and the wide variety of recreational and athletic programs.', 'BLIND shows the educational programs and daily life of students in kindergarten through the 12th grade at the Alabama School for the Blind. The School is organized around the effort to educate blind and visually impaired students to be in charge of their own lives. Sequences in the film include mobility training, braille instruction and orientation as well as traditional classroom subjects such as English, history, science and music. Other sequences show psychological counseling sessions; vocational training; staff dealing with student disciplinary problems; and the wide variety of recreational and athletic programs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CkRfezdjiCFBmzbCkZMQDLfc6W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129682'),
  ('162564345201001631', 'Blind', 2011, 'Thriller', 'Ahn Sang-hoon, Shin Sang-yeul, Sohn Won-ho', 'Choi Min-Seok', 'Kim Ha-neul, Yoo Seung-ho, Jo Hee-bong, Yang Yeong-Jo, Kim Mi-kyeong, Park Choong-seon, Park Bo-gum, Sa-hee', null, 'A blind witness and a runaway help the police find the suspect in a hit and run until the culprit realizes that they are close on his trail. The killer tracks her down and Soo-ah realizes that in order to save Gi-sub she would have to risk her life.', 'A blind witness and a runaway help the police find the suspect in a hit and run until the culprit realizes that they are close on his trail. The killer tracks her down and Soo-ah realizes that in order to save Gi-sub she would have to risk her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAfgDfAXCXcj5lPR5DUeezFrTGA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79374'),
  ('1078362656104060271', 'Blind', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Mailer, Michał Dąbal', 'John Buffalo Mailer', 'Alec Baldwin, Demi Moore, Steven Prescod, Eden Epstein, Dylan McDermott, James McCaffrey, Viva Bianca, Drew Moerlein', 'R', 'A novelist is blinded in a car crash that killed his wife and several years later rediscovers his passion for life and writing when he embarks on an affair with the neglected wife of an indicted businessman.', 'A novelist is blinded in a car crash that killed his wife and several years later rediscovers his passion for life and writing when he embarks on an affair with the neglected wife of an indicted businessman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXyObe5aB63ueOndEXxXabgAvIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364733'),
  ('441935144020685892', 'Blind & Ugly', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Tom Lass, Jieun Yi', 'Tom Lass, Ilinca Florian', 'Naomi Achternbusch, Tom Lass, Clara Schramm, Dimitri Stapfer, Peter Marty, Eva Löbau, Karin Hanczewski, Axel Ranisch', null, 'Ferdi thinks he''s ugly – but likes the fact Jona is interested in him. Maybe because she''s blind. What Ferdi doesn''t suspect: She''s just pretending to be blind to be able to live cheaply in subsidized housing. How long can she maintain her charade? Can love, which is supposed to make you blind, even work out that way? Director Tom Lass takes a closer look, shooting with blind actors and old Berlin buddies, acting the lead himself – paying tribute to a way of life beyond our way of seeing the world.', 'Ferdi thinks he''s ugly – but likes the fact Jona is interested in him. Maybe because she''s blind. What Ferdi doesn''t suspect: She''s just pretending to be blind to be able to live cheaply in subsidized housing. How long can she maintain her charade? Can love, which is supposed to make you blind, even work out that way? Director Tom Lass takes a closer look, shooting with blind actors and old Berlin buddies, acting the lead himself – paying tribute to a way of life beyond our way of seeing the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/S7Da1w2touViEoCueHBDXKNwyi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379138'),
  ('777731193317695377', 'Blind Alley', 1939, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Charles Vidor, Lucien Ballard', 'James Warwick', 'Chester Morris, Ralph Bellamy, Ann Dvorak, Joan Perry, Melville Cooper, Rose Stradner, John Eldredge, Ann Doran', 'NR', 'A gangster takes a doctor and his family hostage.', 'A gangster takes a doctor and his family hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFUl2Qbs0RzALetRGB5e5YNSqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41234'),
  ('699683110456130163', 'Blind Alley', 2011, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Antonio Trashorras', 'Antonio Trashorras', 'Ana de Armas, Diego Cadavid, Leonor Varela, Judith Diakhate, Alfonso Rojas, Kimberley Tell, Paula Castaño, Frey Nicacio Diaz', 'R', 'A serial killer traps and taunts a young dancer inside a laundromat that located down an isolated alley.', 'A serial killer traps and taunts a young dancer inside a laundromat that located down an isolated alley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/birNWbRuiFDTqlgqywek0fiOjkR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80279'),
  ('861319382835295939', 'Blind at Heart', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Barbara Albert, Filip Zumbrunn', 'Meike Hauck', 'Mala Emde, Max von der Groeben, Thomas Prenn, Liliane Amuat, Fabienne Elaine Hollwege, Laura Louisa Garde, Eli Wasserscheid, Helena Pieske', null, 'After WWII, Helene is ready to do anything to start a new life. As a young woman, she came to the exciting Berlin of the roaring 20s, wanting to become a doctor, and soon fell in love with a man named Karl. But the course of her life took a drastic, irreversible turn when the Nazis came into power.', 'After WWII, Helene is ready to do anything to start a new life. As a young woman, she came to the exciting Berlin of the roaring 20s, wanting to become a doctor, and soon fell in love with a man named Karl. But the course of her life took a drastic, irreversible turn when the Nazis came into power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zNMywBV621QCZYhHzzRLUOVCzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998937'),
  ('774667384380527654', 'Blind Beast vs Killer Dwarf', 2001, 'Horror', 'Teruo Ishii', null, 'Lily Franky, Shinya Tsukamoto, Mutsumi Fujita, Reika Hashimoto, Kenpachirō Satsuma, Tomoko Matsumoto, Tetsuro Tamba, Sion Sono', null, 'A blind masseur kidnaps young women and kills them and then make sculptures of them, while a mysterious dwarf spreading severed body parts around. Detective Akechi Kogorô investigating crimes.', 'A blind masseur kidnaps young women and kills them and then make sculptures of them, while a mysterious dwarf spreading severed body parts around. Detective Akechi Kogorô investigating crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bB6CWwK6p319pi2nLu4xMA9hr7o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76811'),
  ('975200554185774298', 'Blind Chance', 1987, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Pakulski, Krzysztof Kieślowski, Maciej J. Drygas', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Bogusław Linda, Tadeusz Łomnicki, Zbigniew Zapasiewicz, Bogusława Pawelec, Marzena Trybała, Jacek Borkowski, Jacek Sas-Uhrynowski, Adam Ferency', null, 'Witek runs after a train. Three variations follow on how such a seemingly banal incident could influence the rest of Witek''s life.', 'Witek runs after a train. Three variations follow on how such a seemingly banal incident could influence the rest of Witek''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gx84VmJllqvXF3JEqcEdsxBEcbF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127'),
  ('449527106180038662', 'Blind Date', 1959, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Joseph Losey, Christopher Challis, René Dupont', 'Ben Barzman, Millard Lampell', 'Hardy Krüger, Stanley Baker, Micheline Presle, John Van Eyssen, Gordon Jackson, Robert Flemyng, Jack MacGowran, Redmond Phillips', null, 'Dutch painter Jan-Van Rooyer hurries to keep a rendezvous with Jacqueline Cousteau, an elegant, sophisticated Frenchwoman, slightly his elder, whose relationship with him had turned from art student into one of love trysts. He arrives and is confronted by Detective Police Inspector Morgan who accuses him of having murdered Jacqueline. Morgan listens sceptically to the dazed denials of Van Rooyer as he tells the story of his relationship with the murdered woman. Morgan, after hearing the story, realizes that the mystery has deepened, and it becomes more complicated when the Assistant Commissioner, Sir Brian Lewis, explains that Jacqueline was not married but was being kept by Sir Howard Fenton, a high-ranking diplomat whose names must be kept out of the case.', 'Dutch painter Jan-Van Rooyer hurries to keep a rendezvous with Jacqueline Cousteau, an elegant, sophisticated Frenchwoman, slightly his elder, whose relationship with him had turned from art student into one of love trysts. He arrives and is confronted by Detective Police Inspector Morgan who accuses him of having murdered Jacqueline. Morgan listens sceptically to the dazed denials of Van Rooyer as he tells the story of his relationship with the murdered woman. Morgan, after hearing the story, realizes that the mystery has deepened, and it becomes more complicated when the Assistant Commissioner, Sir Brian Lewis, explains that Jacqueline was not married but was being kept by Sir Howard Fenton, a high-ranking diplomat whose names must be kept out of the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Cqpi47eDzd4QZS1TJdwhN70Mz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37216'),
  ('490209078131953580', 'Blind Date', 1984, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Nico Mastorakis, Andreas Bellis', 'Fred C. Perry', 'Joseph Bottoms, Kirstie Alley, James Daughton, Lana Clarkson, Keir Dullea, Charles Nicklin, Michael Howe, Gerry Sundquist', 'R', 'A man goes blind when remembering his lost girlfriend, but the doctors can''t find anything wrong with his eyes. They fit him with an experimental device which allows him to see with the aid of a computer interface and brain electrodes. Meanwhile, a taxi driver is taking young women up to their apartments, giving them gas, and performing a little fatal amateur surgery on them. Their paths inevitably converge, and the blind man must try to stop the psychopath.', 'A man goes blind when remembering his lost girlfriend, but the doctors can''t find anything wrong with his eyes. They fit him with an experimental device which allows him to see with the aid of a computer interface and brain electrodes. Meanwhile, a taxi driver is taking young women up to their apartments, giving them gas, and performing a little fatal amateur surgery on them. Their paths inevitably converge, and the blind man must try to stop the psychopath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/totM9TbQJ31X2qfp0D5G7baccXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80965'),
  ('107051178842764852', 'Blind Date', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Harry Stradling Jr., Blake Edwards', 'Dale Launer', 'Kim Basinger, Bruce Willis, John Larroquette, William Daniels, George Coe, Mark Blum, Phil Hartman, Stephanie Faracy', 'PG-13', 'When bachelor Walter Davis is set up with his sister-in-law''s pretty cousin, Nadia Gates, a seemingly average blind date turns into a chaotic night on the town. Walter''s brother, Ted, tells him not to let Nadia drink alcohol, but he dismisses the warning and her behaviour gets increasingly wild. Walter and Nadia''s numerous incidents are made even worse as her former lover David relentlessly follows them around town.', 'When bachelor Walter Davis is set up with his sister-in-law''s pretty cousin, Nadia Gates, a seemingly average blind date turns into a chaotic night on the town. Walter''s brother, Ted, tells him not to let Nadia drink alcohol, but he dismisses the warning and her behaviour gets increasingly wild. Walter and Nadia''s numerous incidents are made even worse as her former lover David relentlessly follows them around town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLb3akSpZhU5qkmCO46IHfJtcs0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:918'),
  ('50632196131054174', 'Blind Date', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Clovis Cornillac, Thierry Pouget', 'Mathieu Oullion, Tristan Schulmann, Lilou Fogli', 'Clovis Cornillac, Mélanie Bernier, Lilou Fogli, Philippe Duquesne, Oscar Copp, Arnaud Lechien, Olivier Bouana, Rudy Milstein', null, 'He invents puzzles. He’s committed body and soul to his work and needs silence to be able to concentrate. She is an accomplished pianist and can’t live without music. She must prepare for a competition that could change her life. They are going to be forced to coexist without seeing each other.', 'He invents puzzles. He’s committed body and soul to his work and needs silence to be able to concentrate. She is an accomplished pianist and can’t live without music. She must prepare for a competition that could change her life. They are going to be forced to coexist without seeing each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SeDsqYCmCFO7fNTzQ3GFp97sg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334878'),
  ('1021230770259121636', 'Blind Date Book Club', 2024, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Peter Benson, Jesse D.E. Young, Penny Perry', 'Nicole Baxter', 'Erin Krakow, Robert Buckley, Faith Wright, Glynis Davies, Johannah Newmarch, Daniel Bacon, Hilary Jardine, Moheb Jindran', null, 'A bookstore owner finds love and direction in life after agreeing to review a famous author’s new novel in her blind-date-with-a-book club.', 'A bookstore owner finds love and direction in life after agreeing to review a famous author’s new novel in her blind-date-with-a-book club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fwY72YdYuQW8hzC3bQXFVc8QRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1249342'),
  ('611068693917769077', 'Blind Dating', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'James Keach, Julio Macat, Nicolas Hippisley-Coxe', 'Christopher Theo', 'Chris Pine, Anjali Jay, Stephen Tobolowsky, Jane Seymour, Eddie Kaye Thomas, Pooch Hall, Jennifer Alden, Katy Mixon', 'PG-13', 'Danny is a blind man who does not let his impairment get in the way of living his life to the fullest, except when it comes to love. Danny''s brother sets him up on a series of blind dates, but all of them go disastrously wrong. Just when Danny is about to give up, he meets Leeza, a nurse who works for Danny''s doctor. There is just one catch: Leeza, who is from India, is promised to another man.', 'Danny is a blind man who does not let his impairment get in the way of living his life to the fullest, except when it comes to love. Danny''s brother sets him up on a series of blind dates, but all of them go disastrously wrong. Just when Danny is about to give up, he meets Leeza, a nurse who works for Danny''s doctor. There is just one catch: Leeza, who is from India, is promised to another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePdwljLE0jm2y1vVsds2nx5hhvH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13162'),
  ('172026177073903194', 'Blind Detective', 2013, 'Action, Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Johnnie To, Cheang Pou-Soi, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Yau Nai-Hoi, Ryker Chan, Wai Ka-Fai', 'Andy Lau, Sammi Cheng Sau-Man, Guo Tao, Gao Yuanyuan, Wang Ziyi, Lang Yueting, Lam Suet, Philip Keung Ho-Man', null, 'A brilliant detective is forced into early retirement after losing eyesight. Making ends meet by solving cold cases for reward money, he teams up with a rookie lady inspector to solve a case from her personal past.', 'A brilliant detective is forced into early retirement after losing eyesight. Making ends meet by solving cold cases for reward money, he teams up with a rookie lady inspector to solve a case from her personal past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enYIEP15dUD2t0G5wAaZ8U4uxyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194523'),
  ('51212367124502427', 'Blind Faith', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Laurie Mirsky, Rodney Charters, Rick Kush', 'Frank Military', 'Courtney B. Vance, Charles S. Dutton, Kadeem Hardison, Lonette McKee, Garland Whitt, Karen Glave, Jeff Clarke, Nancy Herard', 'NR', 'In 1957, black lawyer John Williams has to defend his nephew Charlie, who is accused of strangling a white boy to death. John doesn''t believe Charlie did it, and although Charlie confesses, John wants to find out the real truth.', 'In 1957, black lawyer John Williams has to defend his nephew Charlie, who is accused of strangling a white boy to death. John doesn''t believe Charlie did it, and although Charlie confesses, John wants to find out the real truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIZpce1DyVwvtq7l2F7PXwPAOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238972'),
  ('561615334007281850', 'Blind Fist of Bruce', 1979, 'Action', 'Luk Bong, Danny Lee Yau-Tong', 'Wu Shih, Yeung Wai', 'Ho Tsung-Tao, Simon Yuen Siu-Tien, Meg Lam Kin-Ming, Chiang Tao, Bruce Tong Yim-Chaan, Tiger Yang Cheong-Woo, Pak Sha-Lik, Chan Lau', null, 'The incomparable martial arts expert, Bruce Li, stars as a wealthy hero who defends his village from the assaults of ill-wishers.', 'The incomparable martial arts expert, Bruce Li, stars as a wealthy hero who defends his village from the assaults of ill-wishers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntsKI4znP2qorsHHdsEV0WpsIX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54321'),
  ('616847364240186845', 'Blind Fury', 1989, 'Action, Thriller', 'Phillip Noyce, Don Burgess, Sandy Collister', 'Ryōzō Kasahara', 'Rutger Hauer, Terry O''Quinn, Brandon Call, Charles Cooper, Noble Willingham, Lisa Blount, Meg Foster, Sho Kosugi', 'R', 'A blind Vietnam vet, trained as a swordfighter, comes to America and helps to rescue the son of a fellow soldier.', 'A blind Vietnam vet, trained as a swordfighter, comes to America and helps to rescue the son of a fellow soldier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufbA7v7b2xt85Cf1tocr69cwuCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19124'),
  ('477588178385597566', 'Blind Horizon', 2003, 'Thriller', 'Michael Haussman, Max Malkin', 'F. Paul Benz, Steve Tomlin', 'Val Kilmer, Neve Campbell, Sam Shepard, Amy Smart, Gil Bellows, Noble Willingham, Giancarlo Esposito, Charles Ortiz', 'R', 'Left for dead in the remote Southwest, Frank is found clinging to life and in a state of amnesia. As he recovers, ominous memories begin to flash back...', 'Left for dead in the remote Southwest, Frank is found clinging to life and in a state of amnesia. As he recovers, ominous memories begin to flash back...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmEHqjdjPiFFZnXq0nNV3VUXLS4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24619'),
  ('363326493522454247', 'Blind in Love', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Onur Ünlü, Vedat Özdemir, Özgür Sevimli', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Demet Evgar, Fatih Artman, Hare Sürel, Ezgi Eyüboğlu, Ayşenil Şamlıoğlu, Özgür Emre Yıldırım, Turgut Tunçalp, Umut Temizaş', null, 'Salim, a homicide detective, is a reclusive man in his 30s. Salim, who is divorced and has a 3-year-old daughter, learns that the eye treatment he has been undergoing for some time is not working and that he will eventually go completely blind. While trying to cope with this problem, he begins working on a new murder case, and the fact that the wife of the murdered man, Handan Hanım, is also a blind pianist makes Salim''s situation even more interesting. As the case progresses, Salim falls deeply in love with Handan Hanım, but when she rejects him, he turns his attention to Leyla, the blind wife of the prime suspect in the murder. But undoubtedly the strangest thing is that Salim''s beloved mother is an elderly, blind prostitute. As events unfold, Salim becomes even more blinded.', 'Salim, a homicide detective, is a reclusive man in his 30s. Salim, who is divorced and has a 3-year-old daughter, learns that the eye treatment he has been undergoing for some time is not working and that he will eventually go completely blind. While trying to cope with this problem, he begins working on a new murder case, and the fact that the wife of the murdered man, Handan Hanım, is also a blind pianist makes Salim''s situation even more interesting. As the case progresses, Salim falls deeply in love with Handan Hanım, but when she rejects him, he turns his attention to Leyla, the blind wife of the prime suspect in the murder. But undoubtedly the strangest thing is that Salim''s beloved mother is an elderly, blind prostitute. As events unfold, Salim becomes even more blinded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBCLzOugMsMr2otLs0qYBBNxgAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476889'),
  ('125792710085908134', 'Blind Justice', 1994, 'Action, Western, War, TV Movie', 'Richard Spence, Chris Howell, Jack Conroy', 'Daniel Knauf', 'Armand Assante, Elisabeth Shue, Robert Davi, Adam Baldwin, Ian McElhinney, Danny Nucci, M.C. Gainey, Titus Welliver', 'R', 'Canaan, a mysterious gunfighter left nearly blind from Civil War combat, roams through Mexico with a baby he has sworn to protect. On his way to a town where a family will supposedly adopt the baby, Canaan passes through a border town where U.S. Cavalry officers assigned to deliver a shipment of silver are under attack from bandits. With some reluctance, Canaan steps in to help the soldiers.', 'Canaan, a mysterious gunfighter left nearly blind from Civil War combat, roams through Mexico with a baby he has sworn to protect. On his way to a town where a family will supposedly adopt the baby, Canaan passes through a border town where U.S. Cavalry officers assigned to deliver a shipment of silver are under attack from bandits. With some reluctance, Canaan steps in to help the soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPOKT5ubbfWRZDknMLMrMLPfoqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45188'),
  ('200178478032142863', 'Blind Love', 2005, 'Romance', 'Daisuke Gotô', 'Daisuke Gotô', 'Yutaka Ikejima, Yohta Kawase, Konatsu, Shôta Kotaki, Hôryû Nakamura', null, 'The films plot hinges on a bizarre love triangle involving a loser ventriloquist, his assistant &amp; a blind woman - Hikari is blindly (literally) in love with Daisuke, a failing ventriloquist yet when she finally musters up enough courage to meet him face to face and present him with some flowers backstage she mistakes his assistant for him. For some reason Daisuke and his assistant decide to follow through with the mistaken identity farce which leads to some amusing complications, particularly in the bedroom.', 'The films plot hinges on a bizarre love triangle involving a loser ventriloquist, his assistant &amp; a blind woman - Hikari is blindly (literally) in love with Daisuke, a failing ventriloquist yet when she finally musters up enough courage to meet him face to face and present him with some flowers backstage she mistakes his assistant for him. For some reason Daisuke and his assistant decide to follow through with the mistaken identity farce which leads to some amusing complications, particularly in the bedroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ap4AUj890bxKlBRUgYHmpes9p1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123355'),
  ('1055243312449619989', 'Blind Man', 2012, 'Thriller, Action, Mystery', 'Xavier Palud, Michel Amathieu', 'Éric Besnard', 'Jacques Gamblin, Lambert Wilson, Raphaëlle Agogué, Arnaud Cosson, David Capelle, Antoine Levannier, Frédéric Kontogom, Marie Vincent', null, 'A police inspector must solve two grisly murders. The problem is that his only suspect is a blind man.', 'A police inspector must solve two grisly murders. The problem is that his only suspect is a blind man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fT2Pil07F8xglBw0Gjyjl60zK2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93840'),
  ('888312166618461782', 'Blind Man''s Bluff', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Manoel de Oliveira, António Borges Correia', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Luis Miguel Cintra, Beatriz Batarda, Diogo Dória, Isabel Ruth, Filipe Cochofel, Sofia Alves, Rogério Samora, Miguel Guilherme', null, 'A blind beggar is robbed of his chest of money. The theft leads to a dramatic situation in the street where he begs every day.', 'A blind beggar is robbed of his chest of money. The theft leads to a dramatic situation in the street where he begs every day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtfgjWY6zEi2QbxN9hR7BJL7Fi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215850'),
  ('523910870824535433', 'Blind Massage', 2014, 'Drama', 'Zeng Jian, Lou Ye', 'Bi Feiyu', 'Guo Xiaodong, Qin Hao, Zhang Lei, Mei Ting, Huang Xuan, Huang Lu, Jiang Dan, Han Zhiyou', null, 'The employees of a massage parlour share a close bond with each other as they all share a trait in common, they are all visually impaired.', 'The employees of a massage parlour share a close bond with each other as they all share a trait in common, they are all visually impaired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLCtjuQiZqlWINKloqebWftRJY4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256106'),
  ('646844904021129985', 'Blind Mountain', 2007, 'Drama, Crime', 'Li Yang, Jong Lin', 'Li Yang', 'Huang Lu, Yang Youan, Zhang Yuling, He Yunle, Jia Yingao', 'NR', 'Young student Bai Xuemei is cheated and sold as a wife by human traffickers to a remote village. Raped and beaten, she leads the life of a sex slave and child-bearer with no hope of escape because of the villagers apathy and selfishness.', 'Young student Bai Xuemei is cheated and sold as a wife by human traffickers to a remote village. Raped and beaten, she leads the life of a sex slave and child-bearer with no hope of escape because of the villagers apathy and selfishness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gabbyvJQ8i48qgJYesABMR7S5bc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51520'),
  ('819261931230245232', 'Blind Nache Marlon Brando', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Orestis Laskos, Angelos Theodoropoulos', 'Napoleon Eleftheriou', 'Thanasis Veggos, Kostas Kakavas, Dina Trianti, Efi Oikonomou, Periklis Hristoforidis, Zannino, Angelos Theodoropoulos, Athina Mertyri', null, 'An ordinary clerk decides to spend a few days vacationing in a hotel, but when he goes there, his life takes an unexpected turn. Everyone mistakes him for a famous poet, one known for his success with women. Soon, every girl in the area gets close to him, but what happens when the real poet arrives at the same hotel?', 'An ordinary clerk decides to spend a few days vacationing in a hotel, but when he goes there, his life takes an unexpected turn. Everyone mistakes him for a famous poet, one known for his success with women. Soon, every girl in the area gets close to him, but what happens when the real poet arrives at the same hotel?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWYdp3otWen5VxIs8ThN0s64TqR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332700'),
  ('930767705995036091', 'Blind Shaft', 2003, 'Drama, Crime', 'Liu Yonghong, Li Yang', 'Li Yang', 'Li Yixiang, Wang Baoqiang, Wang Shuangbao, Jing Ai, Bao Zhenjiang, Sun Wei, Zhao Jun, Wang Yining', null, 'Two Chinese miners, who make money by killing fellow miners and then extorting money from the mine owner to keep quiet about the "accident", happen upon their latest victim. But one of them begins to have second thoughts.', 'Two Chinese miners, who make money by killing fellow miners and then extorting money from the mine owner to keep quiet about the "accident", happen upon their latest victim. But one of them begins to have second thoughts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ot4n095y50pCqI4CPAfSnq79x8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11492'),
  ('621909006886445687', 'Blind Side', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Geoff Murphy, Paul Elliott, Cara Giallanza', 'Stewart Lindh, Solomon Weingarten, John Carlen', 'Rutger Hauer, Rebecca De Mornay, Ron Silver, Jonathan Banks, Mariska Hargitay, Tamara Clatterbuck, Joanna Sanchez, Bill Dance', 'R', 'A couple visits Mexico to scout a new location for their furniture manufacturing business, and hit a cop with their car on the way back stateside. Realizing that if they report it they could land in a Mexican jail (guilty until proven innocent), they clean up the car and return home. A few days later, an insistent man shows up wanting a job -- and insinuating that he saw something in Mexico that he would not want to report -- the couple must make a decision about how far they will allow themselves to be blackmailed.', 'A couple visits Mexico to scout a new location for their furniture manufacturing business, and hit a cop with their car on the way back stateside. Realizing that if they report it they could land in a Mexican jail (guilty until proven innocent), they clean up the car and return home. A few days later, an insistent man shows up wanting a job -- and insinuating that he saw something in Mexico that he would not want to report -- the couple must make a decision about how far they will allow themselves to be blackmailed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fx6Ex4wtLCzH18BzNP6QT7LSjVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60505'),
  ('424319614500179896', 'Blind Spot', 1947, 'Mystery, Crime', 'George Meehan, Robert Gordon', 'Martin Goldsmith', 'Chester Morris, Constance Dowling, Steven Geray, James Bell, William Forrest, Sid Tomack, Paul E. Burns, Harry Strang', 'NR', 'A struggling writer becomes the prime suspect in a murder investigation when his publisher is found dead in a manner mirroring one of the writer''s proposed mystery storylines.', 'A struggling writer becomes the prime suspect in a murder investigation when his publisher is found dead in a manner mirroring one of the writer''s proposed mystery storylines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwr0DG87CgwigBg3BFPvvGtFLLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45960'),
  ('33870311364772171', 'Blind Spot', 2011, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Dominic James', 'Alex Epstein, Martin Girard', 'Karine Vanasse, Sébastien Huberdeau, Peter Miller, Edwin Jose Fernandez Collado, Amarilys Nuñez Barrios, Youraisi Gomez Pena, Sophie Cadieux, Claire Pimparé', null, 'The relationship between Eric and Stephanie is floundering. They decide to leave for the Republic of Santiago to visit the famous ruins. Once there, they learn that a serial killer rages on steep roads of the region, eliminating drunk drivers.', 'The relationship between Eric and Stephanie is floundering. They decide to leave for the Republic of Santiago to visit the famous ruins. Once there, they learn that a serial killer rages on steep roads of the region, eliminating drunk drivers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVkjJ5Sg1k4lGfF2cwRWHTMQ0qy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68697'),
  ('422762407935710994', 'Blind Spot', 2019, 'Drama', 'Pierre Trividic, Patrick Mario Bernard, Jonathan Ricquebourg', 'Pierre Trividic, Patrick Mario Bernard', 'Jean-Christophe Folly, Golshifteh Farahani, Isabelle Carré, Sami Ameziane, Claudia Tagbo, Tella Kpomahou, Peter Bonke, Elliot Jenicot', null, 'Dominick Brassan has the power to turn invisible, but rarely uses it. Instead he has kept it a shameful secret, hidden even from Viveka, his fiancée. But when his ability to control his gift gets out of hand, his life, friendships and relationships will be forever turned inside out.', 'Dominick Brassan has the power to turn invisible, but rarely uses it. Instead he has kept it a shameful secret, hidden even from Viveka, his fiancée. But when his ability to control his gift gets out of hand, his life, friendships and relationships will be forever turned inside out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pX6IKPCYg6f2qBFNp9kfdggipZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585093'),
  ('287216813366813085', 'Blind Spot: Hitler''s Secretary', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Othmar Schmiderer, André Heller, Othmar Schmiderer', 'Othmar Schmiderer, André Heller', 'Traudl Junge', 'PG', 'Documentarians Andre Heller and Othmar Schmiderer turn their camera on 81-year-old Traudl Junge, who served as Adolf Hitler''s secretary from 1942 to 1945, and allow her to speak about her experiences. Junge sheds light on life in the Third Reich and the days leading up to Hitler''s death in the famed bunker, where Junge recorded Hitler''s last will and testament. Her gripping account is nothing short of mesmerizing.', 'Documentarians Andre Heller and Othmar Schmiderer turn their camera on 81-year-old Traudl Junge, who served as Adolf Hitler''s secretary from 1942 to 1945, and allow her to speak about her experiences. Junge sheds light on life in the Third Reich and the days leading up to Hitler''s death in the famed bunker, where Junge recorded Hitler''s last will and testament. Her gripping account is nothing short of mesmerizing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FyWb8uQsC2qj8o7rMiJgicZvy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9082'),
  ('77694644999565126', 'Blind Sun', 2016, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Joyce A. Nashawati, Giorgos Arvanitis, Christos Houliaras', 'Joyce A. Nashawati', 'Ziad Bakri, Mimi Denissi, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Yannis Stankoglou, Laurène Brun, Gwendoline Hamon, Yiorgos Gallos, Theodoros Kandiliotis', null, '​Greece. A seaside resort struck by a heavy heat wave. Water is scarce and violence is ready to explode. Ashraf, a solitary immigrant, is looking after a villa while its owners are away. On a dusty road crushed by the sun, he is stopped by a police officer for an identity check...', '​Greece. A seaside resort struck by a heavy heat wave. Water is scarce and violence is ready to explode. Ashraf, a solitary immigrant, is looking after a villa while its owners are away. On a dusty road crushed by the sun, he is stopped by a police officer for an identity check...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1VdztAEWhREqw0Kjgwlc55xhFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336226'),
  ('544519906769839116', 'Blind Trust', 2007, 'Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Louis Bolduc, John Ashmore, Don Terry', 'Tom Gates', 'Jessica Capshaw, Art Hindle, Chad Willett, Robin Wilcock, Carlo Mestroni, Danny Blanco Hall', null, 'A woman is convicted of killing her friend and boyfriend in the heat of passion even though she is defended by a top lawyer. She flees after the trial in order to learn who framed her.', 'A woman is convicted of killing her friend and boyfriend in the heat of passion even though she is defended by a top lawyer. She flees after the trial in order to learn who framed her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFUWs0CAumYhEUv8OY7TdefW90i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68965'),
  ('657346491095248195', 'Blind Valley', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Tristan Aurouet', 'Dominique Turin', 'Jean-Hugues Anglade, Nassim Lyes, Gilles Lellouche, Zlatko Burić, Philippe Lellouche, Finnegan Oldfield', null, 'Vincent is an ordinary-looking cop in Descharnes province. Ten years ago, he buried a dirty business to save his skin. Stan Wilson, and share their passion for Deborah but also a dark secret. Ten years ago, they suffered a trauma that no child can recover. Wilson wants to forget. Stan wants to speak, without knowing that he then puts in motion a terrible plot ...', 'Vincent is an ordinary-looking cop in Descharnes province. Ten years ago, he buried a dirty business to save his skin. Stan Wilson, and share their passion for Deborah but also a dark secret. Ten years ago, they suffered a trauma that no child can recover. Wilson wants to forget. Stan wants to speak, without knowing that he then puts in motion a terrible plot ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3iSeizq7Q5cZYDz6lcEIvhLtCh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94838'),
  ('623994413423709402', 'Blind Vaysha', 2016, 'Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Theodore Ushev', 'Theodore Ushev', 'Caroline Dhavernas', null, 'From the moment she was born, Vaysha was a very special girl. With her left eye she can only see into the past, and with her right she can only see the future. The past is familiar and safe, the future is sinister and threatening. The present is a blind spot. In captivating parabolic imagery, the award-winning animation artist Theodore Ushev illustrates the world through Vaysha’s eyes.', 'From the moment she was born, Vaysha was a very special girl. With her left eye she can only see into the past, and with her right she can only see the future. The past is familiar and safe, the future is sinister and threatening. The present is a blind spot. In captivating parabolic imagery, the award-winning animation artist Theodore Ushev illustrates the world through Vaysha’s eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cghIxM5tkDXix6yfqtLBKszd9Zu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389677'),
  ('688925795115597142', 'Blind War', 2022, 'Action', 'Chris Huo Suiqiang, Zhao Long, Ma Erkang', 'Lin Laogou', 'Andy On Chi-Kit, Yang Xing, Wang Hanyang, Qi Shenghan, Mamat Tursun Mamateli, Zhang Yaqi, Jane Wu, Cheng Sihan', null, 'A SWAT captain is permanently injured during a failed assignment and must retire. Although depressed, his daughter gives him hope, and he slowly begins to adjust to his new life. When she is kidnapped by human traffickers, he must track her down using every remaining sense and save her in this blind battle of life and death.', 'A SWAT captain is permanently injured during a failed assignment and must retire. Although depressed, his daughter gives him hope, and he slowly begins to adjust to his new life. When she is kidnapped by human traffickers, he must track her down using every remaining sense and save her in this blind battle of life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WPaSRrEZyVcYCCWtMeMiuBeh9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:969900'),
  ('923272487414513951', 'Blind Waters', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jeff Carolan, Anthony C. Ferrante', 'Anthony C. Ferrante', 'Meghan Carrasquillo, Noam Sigler, Francisco Angelini, Jhey Castles, Martijn Kuiper, Chris Cleveland, Becki Hayes, Paty Cruz', null, 'An unrelenting shark turns a couple''s dream vacation into a nightmare when they are stranded at sea and forced to fight for their lives.', 'An unrelenting shark turns a couple''s dream vacation into a nightmare when they are stranded at sea and forced to fight for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYqP7MJBu2hRhZ53S2PAE9G3G6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1161655'),
  ('599424198971506274', 'Blind Willow, Sleeping Woman', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Pierre Földes, Étienne Boilard, Alexandre Bernard', 'Pierre Földes', 'Katharine King So, Shoshana Wilder, Jesse Noah Gruman, John Vamvas, Zag Dorison, Amaury de Crayencour, Mathilde Auneveux, Arnaud Maillard', null, 'A lost cat, a giant talkative frog and a tsunami help a bank employee without ambition, his frustrated wife and a schizophrenic accountant to save Tokyo from an earthquake and find a meaning to their lives.', 'A lost cat, a giant talkative frog and a tsunami help a bank employee without ambition, his frustrated wife and a schizophrenic accountant to save Tokyo from an earthquake and find a meaning to their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZwCoTBd4k2RqxMLPPVYqnetdUT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678299'),
  ('519537386635687833', 'Blind Woman''s Curse', 1970, 'Crime, Horror, Drama, Action', 'Teruo Ishii, Saburo Endo', 'Chūsei Sone, Teruo Ishii', 'Meiko Kaji, Hoki Tokuda, Makoto Satō, Hideo Sunazuka, Nobuko Aoki, Shirō Ōtsuji, Tōru Abe, Yôko Takagi', 'NR', 'Akemi is a dragon tattooed leader of the Tachibana Yakuza clan. In a duel with a rival gang Akemi slashes the eyes of an opponent and a black cat appears, to lap the blood from the gushing wound. The cat along with the eye-victim go on to pursue Akemi’s gang in revenge, leaving a trail of dead Yakuza girls, their dragon tattoos skinned from their bodies.', 'Akemi is a dragon tattooed leader of the Tachibana Yakuza clan. In a duel with a rival gang Akemi slashes the eyes of an opponent and a black cat appears, to lap the blood from the gushing wound. The cat along with the eye-victim go on to pursue Akemi’s gang in revenge, leaving a trail of dead Yakuza girls, their dragon tattoos skinned from their bodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4dNhtbGpFfu9bOxYKG7YaWn4eA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70412'),
  ('906723691013953278', 'Blinded', 1997, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Daniel Calparsoro, Gonzalo F. Berridi', 'Daniel Calparsoro', 'Najwa Nimri, Alfredo Villa, Ramón Barea, Mariví Bilbao, Elena Irureta, Javier Nogueiras, Víctor Peñas, Vidal Fernández', null, 'Featuring plenty of two-fisted action with romantic and political overtones, this intelligent thriller from Spanish director Daniel Calparsoro is set in the Basque region of northernmost Spain and centers on the clash between two Basque terrorists whose relationship becomes strained when the female starts refusing to kill their enemies. Unfortunately, for someone like her, leaving terrorism can be as dangerous as remaining in the fray.', 'Featuring plenty of two-fisted action with romantic and political overtones, this intelligent thriller from Spanish director Daniel Calparsoro is set in the Basque region of northernmost Spain and centers on the clash between two Basque terrorists whose relationship becomes strained when the female starts refusing to kill their enemies. Unfortunately, for someone like her, leaving terrorism can be as dangerous as remaining in the fray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hFLdvWiZkwkN9xEX8QA6GyMopg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203863'),
  ('637759681956193388', 'Blinded by the Light', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lydia Currie, Lynsey Muir, Amaya Valentina Gonzalez Perez', 'Sarfraz Manzoor, Gurinder Chadha, Paul Mayeda Berges', 'Viveik Kalra, Nell Williams, Hayley Atwell, Kulvinder Ghir, Aaron Phagura, Dean-Charles Chapman, Meera Ganatra, Nikita Mehta', 'PG-13', 'In 1987, during the austere days of Thatcher’s Britain, a teenager learns to live life, understand his family, and find his own voice through the music of Bruce Springsteen.', 'In 1987, during the austere days of Thatcher’s Britain, a teenager learns to live life, understand his family, and find his own voice through the music of Bruce Springsteen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KsKNrgs7D3zPh9FT9f6MD3ampH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534259'),
  ('758365277965203304', 'Blindfire', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Halyna Hutchins, David Guglielmo, Michael Nell', 'Michael Nell', 'Brian Geraghty, Sharon Leal, Bethany Joy Lenz, Jim Beaver, Edwina Findley, Chiké Okonkwo, Wayne Brady, Sam Ashe Arnold', 'NR', 'A police officer who while responding to a violent hostage call, kills the African American suspect only to later learn of his innocence. Sensing this was a set-up, and facing repercussions, he must track down the person responsible while examining his own accountability and the ingrained racism which brought him to this point.', 'A police officer who while responding to a violent hostage call, kills the African American suspect only to later learn of his innocence. Sensing this was a set-up, and facing repercussions, he must track down the person responsible while examining his own accountability and the ingrained racism which brought him to this point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWOXx85fcVm408Cpg0Tw5NhDA4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758935'),
  ('591569651939000514', 'Blindfold', 1966, 'Comedy, Romance, Thriller', 'Philip Dunne, Joseph MacDonald', 'Philip Dunne, W.H. Menger', 'Rock Hudson, Claudia Cardinale, Jack Warden, Guy Stockwell, Anne Seymour, Alejandro Rey, Brad Dexter, Vito Scotti', null, 'A patient being psychoanalyzed by Dr. Snow is a government scientist. General Pratt hides him in a secret place known as "Base X," forcing Dr. Snow to wear a blindfold whenever he is taken there ...', 'A patient being psychoanalyzed by Dr. Snow is a government scientist. General Pratt hides him in a secret place known as "Base X," forcing Dr. Snow to wear a blindfold whenever he is taken there ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGTcBoJx9cwcwEacRGMp1TkynIR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169066'),
  ('1003004990612419085', 'Blindfold: Acts of Obsession', 1994, 'Thriller, Crime, TV Movie', 'Lawrence L. Simeone, Thomas L. Callaway, Doyle Smith', 'Jason Coleman, Lawrence L. Simeone', 'Shannen Doherty, Judd Nelson, Kristian Alfonso, Drew Snyder, Aleksandra Kaniak, Michael Woods, Scott Hillenbrand, Rudolph Willrich', 'R', 'A therapist turns an unhappy wife on to a deadly fantasy game with her husband.', 'A therapist turns an unhappy wife on to a deadly fantasy game with her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5D1NTYO9kqKAUypG1AB8n1d11Dt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125332'),
  ('839019516448505686', 'Blindly in Love', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Masahide Ichii, Daisuke Soma, Kôji Soejima', 'Masahide Ichii, Takahiro Tamura', 'Gen Hoshino, Kaho, Sei Hiraizumi, Ryoko Moriyama, Ren Osugi, Hitomi Kuroki, Honoka Ishibashi, Shuntaro Yanagi', null, 'Kentaro is an unsocial 35-year-old who lives with his parents and has never dated a woman. When Kentaro’s parents set up an arranged marriage interview with a girl named Nahoko and her parents, he falls in love for the first time in his life. However, the pair soon run into unexpected obstacles. Nahoko is vision impaired and can’t seem to break free of her doting parents. Meanwhile, Kentaro has no idea how to deal with the surge of new emotions he’s feeling.', 'Kentaro is an unsocial 35-year-old who lives with his parents and has never dated a woman. When Kentaro’s parents set up an arranged marriage interview with a girl named Nahoko and her parents, he falls in love for the first time in his life. However, the pair soon run into unexpected obstacles. Nahoko is vision impaired and can’t seem to break free of her doting parents. Meanwhile, Kentaro has no idea how to deal with the surge of new emotions he’s feeling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Tl9hPSiLakQ4qlZhvMRh8ZVUUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230834'),
  ('59654229995197494', 'Blindman', 1971, 'Western', 'Ferdinando Baldi, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Pier Giovanni Anchisi, Tony Anthony, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Tony Anthony, Ringo Starr, Lloyd Battista, Magda Konopka, Raf Baldassarre, Marisa Solinas, Franz von Treuberg, David Dreyer', 'R', 'A blind, but deadly, gunman, is hired to escort fifty mail order brides to their miner husbands. His business partners double cross him, selling the women to bandit Domingo. Blindman heads into Mexico in pursuit.', 'A blind, but deadly, gunman, is hired to escort fifty mail order brides to their miner husbands. His business partners double cross him, selling the women to bandit Domingo. Blindman heads into Mexico in pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPulAJ81joUMYlC6epEmgNcOGRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30648'),
  ('226993342716078739', 'Blindness', 2008, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Fernando Meirelles, César Charlone', 'Don McKellar', 'Julianne Moore, Mark Ruffalo, Danny Glover, Gael García Bernal, Maury Chaykin, Alice Braga, Don McKellar, Sandra Oh', 'R', 'When a sudden plague of blindness devastates a city, a small group of the afflicted band together to triumphantly overcome the horrific conditions of their imposed quarantine.', 'When a sudden plague of blindness devastates a city, a small group of the afflicted band together to triumphantly overcome the horrific conditions of their imposed quarantine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deBsx5IxyqCC217j3VY24TkkE0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8338'),
  ('766899884715580907', 'Blindside', 1987, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Paul Lynch, Rene Ohashi', 'Richard Beattie', 'Harvey Keitel, Lori Hallier, Lolita Davidovich, Michael Rudder, Cordelia Strube, Durango Coy, Alan Fawcett, James Kidnie', 'R', 'Penfield Gruber, a once great scientist, is reduced to managing a sleazy hotel. He monitors the daily comings and goings of his tenants, mainly for his own interest, until underworld figures ask him to spy on a suspected double-crosser. While watching the man, Gruber overhears a murder plot.', 'Penfield Gruber, a once great scientist, is reduced to managing a sleazy hotel. He monitors the daily comings and goings of his tenants, mainly for his own interest, until underworld figures ask him to spy on a suspected double-crosser. While watching the man, Gruber overhears a murder plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YtkWD8khUIIIm6H4igojUslBDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109610'),
  ('710088555401415890', 'Blindsided', 2018, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Louis Mandylor', 'Mamie Jean Calvert', 'Louis Mandylor, Gwendolyn Edwards, Costas Mandylor, Nick Fenske, Ron Bonomo', null, 'Jack Newman is a blind man who is given the opportunity to be the first pacient of a ocular surgery. After getting his sight back, Jack starts to develop the characteristics of his donor - a psycopath executed by the state.', 'Jack Newman is a blind man who is given the opportunity to be the first pacient of a ocular surgery. After getting his sight back, Jack starts to develop the characteristics of his donor - a psycopath executed by the state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5B7iaAcDJv2lxkPuRBVYnXobHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636703'),
  ('104950623892048026', 'Blindsided: The Game', 2018, 'Comedy, Action, Drama', 'Clayton J. Barber', 'Clayton J. Barber, Eric Jacobus', 'Eric Jacobus, Michelle Lee, Roger Yuan, David Will No, Pete Antico, Khalid Ghajji, Joe Bucaro III, Nicholas Verdi', null, 'After blind man Walter Cooke (Eric Jacobus) prevents a local gang from shaking down his local grocer Gordon (Roger Yuan), Walter must reckon with the gang''s boss Sal (Joe Bucaro). The stakes are high, but Walter''s got an ace up his sleeve.', 'After blind man Walter Cooke (Eric Jacobus) prevents a local gang from shaking down his local grocer Gordon (Roger Yuan), Walter must reckon with the gang''s boss Sal (Joe Bucaro). The stakes are high, but Walter''s got an ace up his sleeve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLHz78iJXPyimBZ6RecWoznLi4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524708'),
  ('504577506871508394', 'Blindspotting', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Robby Baumgartner, L. La Mar Stewart, Dominic Martin', 'Rafael Casal, Daveed Diggs', 'Daveed Diggs, Rafael Casal, Janina Gavankar, Jasmine Cephas Jones, Ethan Embry, Tisha Campbell, Utkarsh Ambudkar, Kevin Carroll', 'R', 'Collin must make it through his final three days of probation for a chance at a new beginning. He and his troublemaking childhood best friend, Miles, work as movers, and when Collin witnesses a police shooting, the two men’s friendship is tested as they grapple with identity and their changed realities in the rapidly-gentrifying neighborhood they grew up in.', 'Collin must make it through his final three days of probation for a chance at a new beginning. He and his troublemaking childhood best friend, Miles, work as movers, and when Collin witnesses a police shooting, the two men’s friendship is tested as they grapple with identity and their changed realities in the rapidly-gentrifying neighborhood they grew up in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4DRZfTqOlmzNWAvy4vcKWkgEGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489930'),
  ('629353147933280653', 'Blink', 1993, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Michael Apted, Dante Spinotti', 'Dana Stevens', 'Madeleine Stowe, Aidan Quinn, James Remar, Peter Friedman, Bruce A. Young, Laurie Metcalf, Matt Roth, Paul Dillon', 'R', 'Emma is an attractive girl in her 20s who has been blind for 20 years. A new type of eye operation partially restores her sight, but she is having problems: sometimes she doesn''t "remember" what she''s seen until later. One night she is awakened by a commotion upstairs. Peering out of her door, she sees a shadowy figure descending the stairs. Convinced that her neighbour has been murdered she approaches the police, only to find that she is unsure if it was just her new eyes playing tricks on her.', 'Emma is an attractive girl in her 20s who has been blind for 20 years. A new type of eye operation partially restores her sight, but she is having problems: sometimes she doesn''t "remember" what she''s seen until later. One night she is awakened by a commotion upstairs. Peering out of her door, she sees a shadowy figure descending the stairs. Convinced that her neighbour has been murdered she approaches the police, only to find that she is unsure if it was just her new eyes playing tricks on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wP6dfv85SQLogoNguUd6jO1A4be.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26203'),
  ('966295253815531567', 'Blink', 2022, 'Horror', 'Elie Smolkin, Spenser Cohen', 'Anna Halberg, Spenser Cohen', 'Alicia Coppola, Scot Nery, Sophie Thatcher', null, 'After being violently pushed from a window, Mary wakes up in the hospital, almost completely paralyzed. Trapped inside the prison of her own body, Mary''s only way to communicate is by blinking her eyes. She tries to warn the nurse that a sinister, inhuman force is trying to kill her. But when strange things begin happening around her, she realizes it may be too late to stop it.', 'After being violently pushed from a window, Mary wakes up in the hospital, almost completely paralyzed. Trapped inside the prison of her own body, Mary''s only way to communicate is by blinking her eyes. She tries to warn the nurse that a sinister, inhuman force is trying to kill her. But when strange things begin happening around her, she realizes it may be too late to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9d0SOdZMVrwH9zTBFY5yModuSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934707'),
  ('660927621639541913', 'Blink', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Edmund Stenson, Daniel Roher, James Braithwaite', null, 'Edith Lemay, Sébastien Pelletier, Mia Pelletier, Léo Pelletier, Colin Pelletier, Laurent Pelletier, François Lemay, Pauline Sirois', 'PG', 'The Pelletier family sets out on an epic journey to see the beauty of the world when three of their four children are diagnosed with an incurable eye condition.', 'The Pelletier family sets out on an epic journey to see the beauty of the world when three of their four children are diagnosed with an incurable eye condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8w7QbN4gyX4tL2nvenS7Xh44su.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1340168'),
  ('374618496111340431', 'Blink Twice', 2024, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Zoë Kravitz, Adam Newport-Berra, Frederic Henocque', 'E.T. Feigenbaum, Zoë Kravitz', 'Naomi Ackie, Channing Tatum, Alia Shawkat, Christian Slater, Simon Rex, Adria Arjona, Haley Joel Osment, Liz Caribel Sierra', 'R', 'When tech billionaire Slater King meets cocktail waitress Frida at his fundraising gala, he invites her to join him and his friends on a dream vacation on his private island. But despite the epic setting, beautiful people, ever-flowing champagne, and late-night dance parties, Frida can sense that there’s something sinister hiding beneath the island’s lush façade.', 'When tech billionaire Slater King meets cocktail waitress Frida at his fundraising gala, he invites her to join him and his friends on a dream vacation on his private island. But despite the epic setting, beautiful people, ever-flowing champagne, and late-night dance parties, Frida can sense that there’s something sinister hiding beneath the island’s lush façade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZGOK0I2DJSRlEPNOAFTSNxSjDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840705'),
  ('960526236561118513', 'Blinkers', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Álvaro Fernández Armero, David Carretero', 'Álvaro Fernández Armero, Juan Cavestany', 'Guillermo Toledo, Javier Gutiérrez, Antonio de la Torre, Nathalie Poza, Álex O''Dogherty, Lidia Navarro', null, 'A drama centered on a soccer referee whose reputation is threatened by his controversial decisions.', 'A drama centered on a soccer referee whose reputation is threatened by his controversial decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYa5pA8Pps1RB2vXXiVkng6x3Qs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115495'),
  ('632699694722207453', 'Blinkity Blank', 1955, 'Animation, Music', 'Norman McLaren', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, 'A playful exercise in intermittent animation and spasmodic imagery. Playing with the laws relating to persistence of vision and after-image on the retina of the eye, McLaren engraves pictures on blank film creating vivid, percussive effects.', 'A playful exercise in intermittent animation and spasmodic imagery. Playing with the laws relating to persistence of vision and after-image on the retina of the eye, McLaren engraves pictures on blank film creating vivid, percussive effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtoUa9I894PKMcv0aDPbHIltzhG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127817'),
  ('452621205681818963', 'Blinky™', 2011, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ruairi Robinson', 'Ruairi Robinson', 'Max Records, Jenni Fontana, James Nardini, Caroline Rich, Corbin Timbrook, Skoti Collins, Joe Childs, Antal Kalik', null, 'A story about a boy, his robot and the consequences of his anger at the disintegration of his parents marriage.', 'A story about a boy, his robot and the consequences of his anger at the disintegration of his parents marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BAFoOcJ0kp1JNcI8eVyou49A54.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59852'),
  ('150491325592303066', 'Bliss', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ray Lawrence, Paul Murphy', 'Ray Lawrence, Peter Carey', 'Barry Otto, Lynette Curran, Helen Jones, Gia Carides, Miles Buchanan, Tim Robertson, Bryan Marshall, Jon Ewing', null, 'An advertising executive dies and goes to hell... except nothing changes. Well, his daughter is buying drugs with sexual favours from her brother, and the number of cancer-causing products is on the increase. But the notes he writes to himself to prove he hasn''t gone insane are getting more disjointed, and he runs off with an ex-prostitute called Honey Barbera.', 'An advertising executive dies and goes to hell... except nothing changes. Well, his daughter is buying drugs with sexual favours from her brother, and the number of cancer-causing products is on the increase. But the notes he writes to himself to prove he hasn''t gone insane are getting more disjointed, and he runs off with an ex-prostitute called Honey Barbera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2K9Ii2DGDMKKnrD5hLCP7kCtRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54407'),
  ('1086407483146033327', 'Bliss', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mike Molloy, Lance Young, Jack Hardy', 'Lance Young', 'Craig Sheffer, Sheryl Lee, Terence Stamp, Casey Siemaszko, Spalding Gray, Lois Chiles, Blu Mankuma, Pamela Perry', 'R', 'On his wedding day, Joseph nervously admits that his wife is not quite like other women. But his beautiful bride is more than just the "impulsive, compulsive, obsessive" woman he thinks he knows. And when Joseph discovers she is hiding troubling secrets, it sends them both on a sexual odyssey that will either destroy or redeem their relationship.', 'On his wedding day, Joseph nervously admits that his wife is not quite like other women. But his beautiful bride is more than just the "impulsive, compulsive, obsessive" woman he thinks he knows. And when Joseph discovers she is hiding troubling secrets, it sends them both on a sexual odyssey that will either destroy or redeem their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGdGINvf9oSysprbWnu85dIM7rc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63945'),
  ('844681000597291207', 'Bliss', 2007, 'Drama', 'Abdullah Oğuz, Mirsad Herović', 'Elif Ayan, Abdullah Oğuz, Kubilay Tunçer', 'Talat Bulut, Özgü Namal, Murat Han, Mustafa Avkıran, Emin Gürsoy, Şebnem Köstem, Meral Çetinkaya, Erol Babaoğlu', null, 'A young woman of about 17 years old, named Meryem (Ozgu Namal), has been raped, and her village''s customs call for her to be killed to restore honor and dignity to her family and village. The eldest son of the village leader, Cemal (Murat Han), is ordered to take Meryem to Istanbul and kill her, but at the last minute he cannot complete the task.', 'A young woman of about 17 years old, named Meryem (Ozgu Namal), has been raped, and her village''s customs call for her to be killed to restore honor and dignity to her family and village. The eldest son of the village leader, Cemal (Murat Han), is ordered to take Meryem to Istanbul and kill her, but at the last minute he cannot complete the task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYNqq7qd8mHrCyoi4bbfJShrScA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23112'),
  ('432444966014418421', 'Bliss', 2012, 'Drama', 'Doris Dörrie', 'Doris Dörrie', 'Alba Rohrwacher, Vinzenz Kiefer, Andrea Sawatzki, Petra Kleinert, Maren Kroymann, Matthias Brandt, Christina Große, Oliver Nägele', null, 'Two young people in Berlin, a refugee and a homeless punk, form a relationship.', 'Two young people in Berlin, a refugee and a homeless punk, form a relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwV9C36GHI1PrCvTAKOtvlcQWjM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131244'),
