  ('424399395988129817', 'Blokadnye sudby', 2026, 'Animation, Drama, History, War', 'Aleksandra Agrinskaya, Andrey Bakhurin, Konstantin Biryukov, Mariya Dubrovina, Irina Evteeva, Mikhail Safronov', 'Andrey Bakhurin, Irina Evteeva, Mikhail Safronov, Vadim Mikhaylov', 'Elizaveta Boyarskaya, Mikhail Porechenkov', null, 'Stories based on the memoirs and diaries of people who survived the siege of Leningrad. They tell stories of the exploits of young artists and climbers, of their unwavering faith in the New Year''s miracle, the power of children''s imagination, and of the dignity, loyalty, and honor that the city''s residents managed to maintain despite the difficult and challenging days of the siege of Leningrad.', 'Stories based on the memoirs and diaries of people who survived the siege of Leningrad. They tell stories of the exploits of young artists and climbers, of their unwavering faith in the New Year''s miracle, the power of children''s imagination, and of the dignity, loyalty, and honor that the city''s residents managed to maintain despite the difficult and challenging days of the siege of Leningrad.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNmM3MWM5MzItYWQ4OS00Nzc4LTkwNTEtZDhiZjYxOGY0Y2RjXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:blokadnye-sudby-2026'),
