  ('166096820060092542', 'Blood and Sand', 1922, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fred Niblo, Alvin Wyckoff, Dorothy Arzner', 'June Mathis', 'Rudolph Valentino, Nita Naldi, Walter Long, Lila Lee, Rosa Rosanova, George Field, Leo White, Rosita Marstini', 'NR', 'Juan is the son of a poor widow in Seville. Against his mother''s wishes he pursues a career as toreador. He rapidly gains national prominence, and takes his childhood sweetheart Carmen as his bride. He meets the Marquis'' daughter Doña Sol and finds himself in the awkward position of being in love with two women, which threatens the stability of his family and his position in society. He finds interesting parallels in the life of the infamous bandit Plumitas when they eventually meet by chance.', 'Juan is the son of a poor widow in Seville. Against his mother''s wishes he pursues a career as toreador. He rapidly gains national prominence, and takes his childhood sweetheart Carmen as his bride. He meets the Marquis'' daughter Doña Sol and finds himself in the awkward position of being in love with two women, which threatens the stability of his family and his position in society. He finds interesting parallels in the life of the infamous bandit Plumitas when they eventually meet by chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snpOhcMkANfaj49I20K6qzrrOSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95134'),
