  ('451977317673246432', 'Blood Appears', 2009, 'Drama', 'Pablo Fendrik', 'Pablo Fendrik', 'Arturo Goetz, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Guillermo Arengo, Susana Pampín, Ailín Salas, Guadalupe Docampo, Stella Galazzi', null, 'The story follows the struggles of Arturo, a cab driver who has to find $2000 within 24 hours; his older son, Ramiro, who left home four years ago, has just phoned from Houston asking for urgent help. However, Arturo''s wife Irene keeps their savings away from Arturo''s reach.', 'The story follows the struggles of Arturo, a cab driver who has to find $2000 within 24 hours; his older son, Ramiro, who left home four years ago, has just phoned from Houston asking for urgent help. However, Arturo''s wife Irene keeps their savings away from Arturo''s reach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5p6cR2jZP5zSK2n5rXpeHBxwfX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187165'),
  ('644614678779896839', 'Blood Bath', 1966, 'Horror', 'Jack Hill, Alfred Taylor, Stephanie Rothman', 'Jack Hill, Stephanie Rothman', 'William Campbell, Sandra Knight, Karl Schanzer, Lori Saunders, Marissa Mathes, Sid Haig, Jonathan Haze, Biff Elliot', 'NR', 'A painter of morbid art, who becomes a murderous vampire by night and kills young women, attempts a daytime relationship with a woman who resembles a former love and is also the sister of one of his victims.', 'A painter of morbid art, who becomes a murderous vampire by night and kills young women, attempts a daytime relationship with a woman who resembles a former love and is also the sister of one of his victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTDOq2bYILUE2nxhKdvnxINpZ7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29070'),
  ('297913662230447000', 'Blood Beach', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Jeffrey Bloom, Steven Poster, Elie Cohn', 'Jeffrey Bloom', 'David Huffman, Marianna Hill, Burt Young, John Saxon, Otis Young, Stefan Gierasch, Darrell Fetty, Lynne Marta', 'R', 'Something or someone is attacking people one by one on the beach. Some of them are mutilated, but most of them are sucked into the sand, disappearing without a trace. What is the creature responsible? Where does it live, and where did it come from? And is there any chance of it reproducing? Meanwhile, David Huffman and Mariana Hill are once-almost-married old friends, reunited over the death of her mother on the beach, and searching for clues in the abandoned buildings where they used to play when they were young.', 'Something or someone is attacking people one by one on the beach. Some of them are mutilated, but most of them are sucked into the sand, disappearing without a trace. What is the creature responsible? Where does it live, and where did it come from? And is there any chance of it reproducing? Meanwhile, David Huffman and Mariana Hill are once-almost-married old friends, reunited over the death of her mother on the beach, and searching for clues in the abandoned buildings where they used to play when they were young.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BfSQmwTm8LGv2KZKcDJnFuBbIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37843'),
  ('592818390707819195', 'Blood Beat', 1983, 'Horror', 'Fabrice A. Zaphiratos, Diana Stoneberg, Vladimir Van Maule', 'Fabrice A. Zaphiratos', 'Helen Benton, Terry Brown, Dana Day, James Fitzgibbons, Claudia Peyton, Peter Spelson, Franck Miley, Carol Wagner', 'R', 'Sarah and her boyfriend have decided to spend Christmas at his home in rural Wisconsin. However, upon arriving, she begins to feel a strange presence around her, and a mysterious figure garbed in a Samurai outfit begins murdering the townsfolk.', 'Sarah and her boyfriend have decided to spend Christmas at his home in rural Wisconsin. However, upon arriving, she begins to feel a strange presence around her, and a mysterious figure garbed in a Samurai outfit begins murdering the townsfolk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym1N2A5CSJiZGaF3mfnUpmdltx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84999'),
  ('1118708648605866291', 'Blood Brother', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Matthew Irving, John Pogue', 'Michael Finch, Karl Gajdusek', 'Trey Songz, Jack Kesy, China Anne McClain, Chelle Ramos, Hassan Johnson, Fetty Wap, J.D. Williams, Joy Lofton', 'R', 'Blood Brother takes place on he mean streets of a city in decay, where a recently released convict begins to take a murderous revenge against his childhood friends, whom he believes let him take the fall for a crime they collectively committed. As the bodies start piling up, one of the friends, now a cop, will stop at nothing to put and end to the murderous rampage and to right the many wrongs of their tragically violent past.', 'Blood Brother takes place on he mean streets of a city in decay, where a recently released convict begins to take a murderous revenge against his childhood friends, whom he believes let him take the fall for a crime they collectively committed. As the bodies start piling up, one of the friends, now a cop, will stop at nothing to put and end to the murderous rampage and to right the many wrongs of their tragically violent past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpQaLkUiLzfh24zJTu4DrUas98M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552858'),
  ('802152324813313716', 'Blood Brothers', 1973, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Kung Mu-To, John Woo', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Chen Kuan-Tai, Ching Li, Tin Ching, Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Fan Mei-Sheng, Ching Miao', 'PG-13', 'Set in the waning years of the Ching Dyansty, this dramatic, tragic, romantic, blood-soaked martial arts tale of betrayal and revenge explores one of the most sensational scandals in Chinese history and marked the true ascension of its director and actors to superstar status. In fact, Ti Lung won Taiwan''s Golden Horse Award for Outstanding Performance as the challenging role of a jealous provincial governor who kills his friend in order to steal the man''s wife.', 'Set in the waning years of the Ching Dyansty, this dramatic, tragic, romantic, blood-soaked martial arts tale of betrayal and revenge explores one of the most sensational scandals in Chinese history and marked the true ascension of its director and actors to superstar status. In fact, Ti Lung won Taiwan''s Golden Horse Award for Outstanding Performance as the challenging role of a jealous provincial governor who kills his friend in order to steal the man''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUGzOfPHpaHHhAweJgGhxkPrXr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64363'),
  ('669182444169528926', 'Blood Brothers', 1974, 'Crime, Drama', 'Pasquale Squitieri, Eugenio Bentivoglio, Roberto Pariante', 'Ugo Pirro, Pasquale Squitieri', 'Franco Nero, Claudia Cardinale, Fabio Testi, Raymond Pellegrin, Lina Polito, Rita Forzano, Antonio Orlando, Sonia Viviani', null, 'In Naples at the end of the 19th century, Nicola Bellizzi dreams of becoming a lawyer. However, when he seeks the reason that people are reluctant to help him in his goals, he discovers that some of his blood relations are high-ranking members of the Mafia. He tries to break away from his family obligations, but falls into a life of crime and violence.', 'In Naples at the end of the 19th century, Nicola Bellizzi dreams of becoming a lawyer. However, when he seeks the reason that people are reluctant to help him in his goals, he discovers that some of his blood relations are high-ranking members of the Mafia. He tries to break away from his family obligations, but falls into a life of crime and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fkmnxHdl5wvnq6873qac4RvLJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4791'),
  ('979229210136419012', 'Blood Brothers', 2007, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alexi Tan, Phillip Kwok Chui, Michel Taburiaux', 'Jiang Dan, Alexi Tan, Tony Chan', 'Daniel Wu, Chang Chen, Shu Qi, Liu Ye, Tony Yang, Li Xiaolu, Sun Honglei, Zhao Jun', null, 'Three best friends who are barely getting by as fishermen seek their fate in 1930s Shanghai. Upon arriving in the bustling city, the naïve trio gradually find their innocence corrupted as they fall into the deepest depths of the criminal underworld.', 'Three best friends who are barely getting by as fishermen seek their fate in 1930s Shanghai. Upon arriving in the bustling city, the naïve trio gradually find their innocence corrupted as they fall into the deepest depths of the criminal underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AbR965SBXlyuaE7lxuxnrINJ77.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45425'),
  ('935803310707558581', 'Blood Brothers: Malcolm X & Muhammad Ali', 2021, 'Documentary, History', 'Marcus A. Clarke, Justin Janowitz', null, 'Malcolm X, Muhammad Ali, Elijah Muhammad, Al Sharpton, Cornel West, Ilyasah Shabazz, Rahman Ali, Todd Boyd', 'PG-13', 'From a chance meeting to a tragic fallout, Malcolm X and Muhammad Ali''s extraordinary bond cracks under the weight of distrust and shifting ideals.', 'From a chance meeting to a tragic fallout, Malcolm X and Muhammad Ali''s extraordinary bond cracks under the weight of distrust and shifting ideals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdOXdPIgbbCHXb51tWJZ0r8kZfe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:861604'),
  ('467260676088054226', 'Blood Car', 2007, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Alex Orr, Alex Lorre, Adam Pinney', 'Adam Pinney, Alex Orr', 'Mike Brune, Anna Chlumsky, Katie Orr, Matt Hutchinson, Marla Malcolm, Mr. Malt, Bill Szymanski, Vince Canlas', 'NR', 'In the near future, gas prices are at an astronomical high. One man is determined to find an alternate fuel source. That alternate fuel source turns out to be blood... HUMAN BLOOD.', 'In the near future, gas prices are at an astronomical high. One man is determined to find an alternate fuel source. That alternate fuel source turns out to be blood... HUMAN BLOOD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0RxUjcRRGOT2apzgpdnpwwI3mF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17141'),
