  ('616539949476227677', 'Blood Creek', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joel Schumacher, Darko Šuvak, Ovidiu Marginean', 'David Kajganich', 'Dominic Purcell, Henry Cavill, Michael Fassbender, Emma Booth, Rainer Winkelvoss, Shea Whigham, Tony Barger, Ana Popescu', 'R', 'A man and his brother on a mission of revenge become trapped in a harrowing occult experiment dating back to the Third Reich.', 'A man and his brother on a mission of revenge become trapped in a harrowing occult experiment dating back to the Third Reich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qlC48rdEac3w5STSLayC5X8rhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30685'),
  ('523115952661018820', 'Blood Cult', 1985, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Christopher Lewis, Paul McFarlane', 'Stuart Rosenthal', 'Juli Andelman, Charles Ellis, James Vance, Bennie Lee McGowan, Peter Hart, David Stice, Fred Graves, Bob Duffield', null, 'Female students on a college campus are being killed and their body parts used for blood sacrifices.', 'Female students on a college campus are being killed and their body parts used for blood sacrifices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeCMEWlaZieFtS7JtetUkS8Vpt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85000'),
  ('438273805244734116', 'Blood Curse', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Tiago Guedes, Frederico Serra, Victor Estevão', 'Rodrigo Guedes de Carvalho', 'Adriano Luz, Manuela Couto, Sara Carinhas, Afonso Pimentel, João Santos, José Pinto, João Pedro Vaz, Elisa Lisboa', null, 'An urban family inherits an old country house located in a small village. Upon their arrival they try to adapt to the new lifestyle, but they soon learn that the village is overshadowed by superstition and mysterious folklore. As they are plagued by strange events, they learn more about the history of their family, and slowly begin to believe by inheriting the house, they also inherited a curse.', 'An urban family inherits an old country house located in a small village. Upon their arrival they try to adapt to the new lifestyle, but they soon learn that the village is overshadowed by superstition and mysterious folklore. As they are plagued by strange events, they learn more about the history of their family, and slowly begin to believe by inheriting the house, they also inherited a curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEh60lxju9UissGcXirDMmLvB0Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30447'),
  ('540492738091857529', 'Blood Debts', 1985, 'Thriller, Action', 'Teddy Page, Bob Aaron, Rey Soul', 'Richard Harrison, Timothy Jorge', 'Richard Harrison, Mike Monty, Jim Gaines, Ann Milhench, Ann Jackson, Catherine Miles, Dick Israel, Willy Williams', null, 'It started with the rape of his daughter, then the killing of her boyfriend. He takes the law into his own hands and has his revenge. Branded as a vicious killer by the underworld, the syndicate blackmails him into becoming their hitman. As he gets more and more tied up in the world of drugs, prostitution and death, he decides he wants out. No one gets out of the syndicate alive. It then becomes a battle for survival, him against them in a desperate act of street warfare. His life is his prize.', 'It started with the rape of his daughter, then the killing of her boyfriend. He takes the law into his own hands and has his revenge. Branded as a vicious killer by the underworld, the syndicate blackmails him into becoming their hitman. As he gets more and more tied up in the world of drugs, prostitution and death, he decides he wants out. No one gets out of the syndicate alive. It then becomes a battle for survival, him against them in a desperate act of street warfare. His life is his prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7s6xCLnrZ8z6ge1PzAZPVncLzW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85600'),
  ('978645430760061448', 'Blood Delirium', 1988, 'Horror', 'Sergio Bergonzelli', 'Sergio Bergonzelli', 'John Phillip Law, Gordon Mitchell, Brigitte Christensen, Marco Di Stefano, Olinka Hardiman, Lucia Prato', null, 'After his beloved wife dies, an unbalanced painter who believes himself to be the reincarnation of Vincent Van Gogh goes over the edge and digs up her corpse--with the help of his necrophiliac butler--to bring it back to his castle and use it for "inspiration". He soon meets a beautiful musician who looks exactly like his late wife and brings her back to his castle. However, she eventually discovers their secret: the butler murders young women, disposes of their bodies and uses their blood--"the color of life"--for the artist''s paints.', 'After his beloved wife dies, an unbalanced painter who believes himself to be the reincarnation of Vincent Van Gogh goes over the edge and digs up her corpse--with the help of his necrophiliac butler--to bring it back to his castle and use it for "inspiration". He soon meets a beautiful musician who looks exactly like his late wife and brings her back to his castle. However, she eventually discovers their secret: the butler murders young women, disposes of their bodies and uses their blood--"the color of life"--for the artist''s paints.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bxRBbFORhKpIrjqn2W3n5fQXFQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156150'),
  ('745824075409659095', 'Blood Diamond', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Eduardo Serra, Edward Zwick, Sarah Moudjebeur', 'Charles Leavitt', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Djimon Hounsou, Jennifer Connelly, Kagiso Kuypers, Arnold Vosloo, Antony Coleman, Benu Mabhena, Anointing Lukola', 'R', 'An ex-mercenary turned smuggler. A Mende fisherman. Amid the explosive civil war overtaking 1999 Sierra Leone, these men join for two desperate missions: recovering a rare pink diamond of immense value and rescuing the fisherman''s son, conscripted as a child soldier into the brutal rebel forces ripping a swath of torture and bloodshed countrywide.', 'An ex-mercenary turned smuggler. A Mende fisherman. Amid the explosive civil war overtaking 1999 Sierra Leone, these men join for two desperate missions: recovering a rare pink diamond of immense value and rescuing the fisherman''s son, conscripted as a child soldier into the brutal rebel forces ripping a swath of torture and bloodshed countrywide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqKNoySmI4eOjsSjJEnLj4j2HAp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1372'),
  ('392206394057430639', 'Blood Diner', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jackie Kong, Jürg V. Walther', 'Michael Sonye', 'Rick Burks, Carl Crew, Roger Dauer, LaNette La France, Lisa Elaina, Roxanne Cybelle, Dino Lee, Sir Lamont Rodeheaver', 'NR', 'Two cannibalistic brothers kill various young women to make their flesh part of a new special dish at their rundown restaurant while seeking blood sacrifices to awaken a dormant Egyptian goddess.', 'Two cannibalistic brothers kill various young women to make their flesh part of a new special dish at their rundown restaurant while seeking blood sacrifices to awaken a dormant Egyptian goddess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8Y9BhkWj5Hi7hCQ5QPsDHC95jR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62132'),
  ('708459527360092286', 'Blood Dolls', 1999, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Charles Band, Thomas L. Callaway, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Charles Band', 'Kristopher Logan, Debra Mayer, William Paul Burns, Warren Draper, Nicholas Worth, Jodie Fisher, Phil Fondacaro, Naomi McClure', 'R', 'Virgil, an eccentric freak billionaire, spends his days being a "biological inventor." The "blood dolls," his newest creation, aid him in getting revenge on those who betrayed him.', 'Virgil, an eccentric freak billionaire, spends his days being a "biological inventor." The "blood dolls," his newest creation, aid him in getting revenge on those who betrayed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaY1mAjoWqj3wpmPt7APj5RrNR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29542'),
  ('775393370142551592', 'Blood Father', 2016, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Jean-François Richet, Robert Gantz, Kevin Black', 'Peter Craig, Andrea Berloff', 'Mel Gibson, Erin Moriarty, William H. Macy, Michael Parks, Thomas Mann, Diego Luna, Dale Dickey, Miguel Sandoval', 'R', 'An ex-con reconnects with his estranged teenage daughter while fighting to keep her alive after she becomes a target of violent drug dealers.', 'An ex-con reconnects with his estranged teenage daughter while fighting to keep her alive after she becomes a target of violent drug dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87wOvcjW4dfsPajJncqTsUMc9pR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309886'),
  ('1017034236410122247', 'Blood Feast', 1963, 'Horror', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis, Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'Allison Louise Downe', 'William Kerwin, Mal Arnold, Connie Mason, Lyn Bolton, Scott H. Hall, Christy Foushee, Ashlyn Martin, Astrid Olson', null, 'In the sleepy suburbs of Miami, seemingly normal Egyptian immigrant Fuad Ramses runs a successful catering business. He also murders young women and plans to use their body parts to revive the goddess Ishtar. The insane Ramses hypnotizes a socialite in order to land a job catering a party for her debutante daughter, Suzette Fremont, and turns the event into an evening of gruesome deaths, bloody dismemberment and ritual sacrifice.', 'In the sleepy suburbs of Miami, seemingly normal Egyptian immigrant Fuad Ramses runs a successful catering business. He also murders young women and plans to use their body parts to revive the goddess Ishtar. The insane Ramses hypnotizes a socialite in order to land a job catering a party for her debutante daughter, Suzette Fremont, and turns the event into an evening of gruesome deaths, bloody dismemberment and ritual sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6mWxgOrNAF3AaevaGEE4NqCwcQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28172'),
  ('403526036731582312', 'Blood Feast 2: All U Can Eat', 2002, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'W. Boyd Ford', 'John McConnell, Mark McLachlan, Melissa Morgan, Toni Wynne, J.P. Delahoussaye, John Waters, David F. Friedman', 'R', 'A cannibal caterer kills various young women in preparation for a ritual feast for a long-dormant Egyptian goddess that has him under its control.', 'A cannibal caterer kills various young women in preparation for a ritual feast for a long-dormant Egyptian goddess that has him under its control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUfYoOdiLvCoMnsmhT8HHUSz49N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28168'),
  ('1126153699560915821', 'Blood Fest', 2018, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Owen Egerton, David Blue Garcia', 'Owen Egerton', 'Robbie Kay, Seychelle Gabriel, Jacob Batalon, Barbara Dunkelman, Chris Doubek, Nick Rutherford, Tate Donovan, Owen Egerton', null, 'Fans flock to a festival celebrating the most iconic horror movies, only to discover that the charismatic showman behind the event has a diabolical agenda.', 'Fans flock to a festival celebrating the most iconic horror movies, only to discover that the charismatic showman behind the event has a diabolical agenda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7x4P33lZwstVgxlZGze18hBlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472226'),
  ('301379889356228313', 'Blood Feud', 1978, 'Drama', 'Lina Wertmüller, Mario Scarpetta, Gianni Arduini', 'Lina Wertmüller', 'Sophia Loren, Marcello Mastroianni, Giancarlo Giannini, Turi Ferro, Mario Scarpetta, Antonella Murgia, Lucio Amelio, Maria Carrara', 'R', 'In pre-World War II Sicily, just as the fascists come to power, two men fall in love with the same woman. The changes in their country''s politics ultimately take all three on a journey across the ocean to New York City.', 'In pre-World War II Sicily, just as the fascists come to power, two men fall in love with the same woman. The changes in their country''s politics ultimately take all three on a journey across the ocean to New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YpQgCnrBiuYG0cchEDIq98vu9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56177'),
  ('807595644423651690', 'Blood for a Silver Dollar', 1965, 'Western, Action, Romance', 'Giorgio Ferroni, Antonio Secchi, Giorgio Stegani', 'Giorgio Stegani, Giorgio Ferroni', 'Giuliano Gemma, Ida Galli, Pierre Cressoy, Giuseppe Addobbati, Franco Fantasia, Massimo Righi, Andrea Scotti, Tullio Altamura', null, 'Two brothers part company only to be reunited when one is hired to stop a thief who turns out to be his sibling.', 'Two brothers part company only to be reunited when one is hired to stop a thief who turns out to be his sibling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYPqaacXnlHJkTV4T8UkPxWqIGa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95838'),
  ('454995422973047563', 'Blood for Dracula', 1974, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Paul Morrissey, Luigi Kuveiller, Antonio Margheriti', 'Paul Morrissey, Pat Hackett', 'Udo Kier, Joe Dallesandro, Vittorio De Sica, Maxime McKendry, Arno Jürging, Milena Vukotić, Dominique Darel, Stefania Casini', 'R', 'Deathly ill Count Dracula and his slimy underling, Anton, travel to Italy in search of a virgin''s blood. They''re welcomed at the crumbling estate of indebted Marchese Di Fiore, who''s desperate to marry off his daughters to rich suitors. But there, instead of pure women, the count encounters incestuous lesbians with vile blood and Marxist manservant Mario, who''s suspicious of the aristocratic Dracula.', 'Deathly ill Count Dracula and his slimy underling, Anton, travel to Italy in search of a virgin''s blood. They''re welcomed at the crumbling estate of indebted Marchese Di Fiore, who''s desperate to marry off his daughters to rich suitors. But there, instead of pure women, the count encounters incestuous lesbians with vile blood and Marxist manservant Mario, who''s suspicious of the aristocratic Dracula.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLyCHzPT5kLBEPn4DMcqgNbjwke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25944'),
  ('198321363342332084', 'Blood for Dust', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Rod Blackhurst, Justin Derry, Travis LaSalle', 'David Ebeltoft', 'Scoot McNairy, Kit Harington, Josh Lucas, Stephen Dorff, Nora Zehetner, Ethan Suplee, Amber Rose Mason, Megan Folsom', 'R', 'Reckless Ricky makes serious money dealing illegal weapons throughout the tri-state area and loves to flaunt it. Traveling salesman Cliff, covers the same territory Ricky runs guns through. Desperate to find some financial relief for his struggling family, Cliff agrees to partner with Ricky, to commit cross-state drug and gun deliveries for a mid-level American cartel boss John. When a simple exchange turns into a bloodbath after Ricky kills everyone in a territory grab, the pair find themselves in a pressure cooker situation where unlikely drug dealer Cliff must fight as hard as he can to stay alive.', 'Reckless Ricky makes serious money dealing illegal weapons throughout the tri-state area and loves to flaunt it. Traveling salesman Cliff, covers the same territory Ricky runs guns through. Desperate to find some financial relief for his struggling family, Cliff agrees to partner with Ricky, to commit cross-state drug and gun deliveries for a mid-level American cartel boss John. When a simple exchange turns into a bloodbath after Ricky kills everyone in a territory grab, the pair find themselves in a pressure cooker situation where unlikely drug dealer Cliff must fight as hard as he can to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvaCnkl8RilLhVAQXPFei0tqkqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025596'),
  ('836828513671649320', 'Blood Freak', 1972, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Brad F. Grinter, Steve Hawkes, Ron N. Sill', 'Brad F. Grinter, Steve Hawkes', 'Steve Hawkes, Dana Cullivan, Heather Hughes, Randy Grinter, Larry Wright, Tera Anderson, Dolores Currier, Bob Currier', 'R', 'A biker comes upon a girl with a flat tire and offers her a ride home. He winds up at a drug party with the girl''s sister, then follows her to a turkey farm owned by her father, a mad scientist. The father turns the biker into a giant turkey monster who goes after drug dealers.', 'A biker comes upon a girl with a flat tire and offers her a ride home. He winds up at a drug party with the girl''s sister, then follows her to a turkey farm owned by her father, a mad scientist. The father turns the biker into a giant turkey monster who goes after drug dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RT4fMJNidP8mBoM4j3lVubpR6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83413'),
  ('750493153046398773', 'Blood Frenzy', 1987, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Richard Pepin, Hal Freeman', 'Ted Newsom', 'Wendy MacDonald, Tony Montero, Lisa Loring, Lisa Savage, Hank Garrett, Monica Silveria, John Clark, Chuck Rhae', null, 'A psychologist takes a group of patients into the desert for unorthodox therapy only for them to be picked off by an unseen maniac.', 'A psychologist takes a group of patients into the desert for unorthodox therapy only for them to be picked off by an unseen maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYM6uc4t2NLXxRxJxVNrVzKIg0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85150'),
  ('578589563192310670', 'Blood from a Stone', 2012, 'Drama', 'Luc Pagès, Jacques Maillot', 'Pierre Chosson, Jacques Maillot', 'Daniel Auteuil, Maud Wyler, Yann Trégouët, Alain Beigel, Moussa Maaskri, Patrick Bonnel, Carole Franck, Marc Chapiteau', null, 'The day his bank refuses to finance him, Georges will do everything he can to save his shipyard and his employees.', 'The day his bank refuses to finance him, Georges will do everything he can to save his shipyard and his employees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIy6z94Vb1kKSiYGbg4yuF9tDoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115523'),
  ('319262538564458666', 'Blood from the Mummy''s Tomb', 1971, 'Horror', 'Seth Holt, Arthur Grant, Michael Carreras', 'Christopher Wicking', 'Valerie Leon, Andrew Keir, James Villiers, Hugh Burden, George Coulouris, Mark Edwards, Rosalie Crutchley, Aubrey Morris', 'PG', 'Two Egyptologists, Professor Fuchs and Corbeck, are instrumental in unleashing unmitigated horror by bringing back to England the mummified body of Tara, the Egyptian Queen of Darkness. Fuchs’s daughter becomes involved in a series of macabre and terrifying incidents, powerless against the forces of darkness, directed by Corbeck, that are taking possession of her body and soul to fulfill the ancient prophesy that Queen Tara will be resurrected to continue her reign of unspeakable evil.', 'Two Egyptologists, Professor Fuchs and Corbeck, are instrumental in unleashing unmitigated horror by bringing back to England the mummified body of Tara, the Egyptian Queen of Darkness. Fuchs’s daughter becomes involved in a series of macabre and terrifying incidents, powerless against the forces of darkness, directed by Corbeck, that are taking possession of her body and soul to fulfill the ancient prophesy that Queen Tara will be resurrected to continue her reign of unspeakable evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2CfNW6RMpUcNMWBMhiZyVE9KLw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39263'),
  ('847676648950828829', 'Blood Games', 1990, 'Action, Thriller, Horror', 'Tanya Rosenberg', 'Craig Clyde, James Hennessy, George Saunders', 'Gregory Scott Cummins, Laura Albert, Lee Benton, Ken Carpenter, Ross Hagen, Don Dowe, Josephine Jacqueline Jones, Julie Hall', 'R', 'When a women''s softball team win a game against a group of rough talking and dirty playing men, they find themselves unwittingly involved in a new competition with much higher stakes: life and death. After being horribly attacked and assaulted by their male competitors, the women are forced to use both their wits and strength to escape their tormentors and avenge their teammates.', 'When a women''s softball team win a game against a group of rough talking and dirty playing men, they find themselves unwittingly involved in a new competition with much higher stakes: life and death. After being horribly attacked and assaulted by their male competitors, the women are forced to use both their wits and strength to escape their tormentors and avenge their teammates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WVCpkHtshJByC4766zIBjLkGAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109425'),
  ('14029432581050869', 'Blood Glacier', 2013, 'Horror', 'Matias Lackner, Marvin Kren, Fiona Brady', 'Benjamin Hessler, Marvin Kren', 'Gerhard Liebmann, Edita Malovčić, Hille Beseler, Peter Knaack, Felix Römer, Brigitte Kren, Wolfgang Pampel, Murathan Muslu', null, 'At a climate research station in the Alps, the scientists are stunned as the nearby melting glacier is leaking a red liquid. It quickly turns to be very special juice — with unexpected genetic effects on the local wildlife.', 'At a climate research station in the Alps, the scientists are stunned as the nearby melting glacier is leaking a red liquid. It quickly turns to be very special juice — with unexpected genetic effects on the local wildlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3TD8k4Jd7ah1Hasre8LZR3FpUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210913'),
  ('677698050030769904', 'Blood Hands', 1990, 'Action', 'Teddy Page, Tony Vernon, John Aloha', 'Rod Davis', 'Sean P. Donahue, Ned Hourani, Christine Landson, Jim Gaines, Jerry Bailey, Jimmy Moss, Richard Olney, Jerry Beyer', null, 'Steve, a young kickboxer, returns home to find his parents have been brutalized by a gang of martial artists. When the cops can''t find any answers, Steve decides to kickbox his way to savage justice. No thug on the streets is safe!', 'Steve, a young kickboxer, returns home to find his parents have been brutalized by a gang of martial artists. When the cops can''t find any answers, Steve decides to kickbox his way to savage justice. No thug on the streets is safe!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5lkD6EZ92HnrGOt5YoWDOx1gN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240110'),
  ('1053996430433496544', 'Blood Harvest', 1987, 'Horror', 'Bill Rebane, Bill Rebane', 'Ben Benson, Emil Joseph', 'Tiny Tim, Itonia Salchek, Dean West, Lori Minnetti, Peter Krause, Frank Benson, Leszek Burzynski, William Dexter', null, 'A college student returns home to find her parents missing, and their home vandalized. Soon, matters take a turn for the worse, when she finds herself stalked, and her friends disappearing one by one.', 'A college student returns home to find her parents missing, and their home vandalized. Soon, matters take a turn for the worse, when she finds herself stalked, and her friends disappearing one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUhCjKXEjMil9tVdWWKFoLHWHPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78068'),
  ('742099127831658468', 'Blood Hook', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller', 'Jim Mallon, Marsha Kahm', 'John Galligan, Larry Edgerton', 'Mark Jacobs, Lisa Jane Todd, Patrick Danz, Sara Hauser, Christopher Whiting, Don Winters, Paul Drake, Bill Lowrie', 'R', 'During a local fishing contest, people are being mysteriously dragged into the lake and killed by a giant fish hook. After a sufficient number of deaths, the killer is finally revealed.', 'During a local fishing contest, people are being mysteriously dragged into the lake and killed by a giant fish hook. After a sufficient number of deaths, the killer is finally revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aI7QJb6rYKx1RhjMYS2pCLxghB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99424'),
  ('137478657515837024', 'Blood Hunt', 1986, 'Thriller', 'Javier Elorrieta, José García Galisteo', 'Joaquín Oristrell', 'Patxi Andión, Beatriz Elorrieta, Yolanda Ventura, Aldo Sambrell, J.R. Martinez, Aramis Ney, Tony Fuentes, Valentín Paredes', null, 'A new doctor arrives in a small Spanish village. As soon as he begins meeting people there, he notices the strange behaviour of the population and is surprised. Young people make fun of him, a man called Gonzalo seems to be some kind of leader, and he is invited to leave the village when he tries to ask about the situation. All his questions get no answer. His neighbour is a lovely and pretty young woman, who works as the local teacher. They develop a sincere friendship from the very first moment, which grows to become love. Unfortunately, Gonzalo feels that the young teacher is "reserved" exclusively for him and he reacts with violence. Meanwhile, the doctor finds out the key of that strange behaviour. Some years ago, during the local feast, some drug-addicts attacked the village in order to get money and goods. There was a fight and some people died, including Gonzalo''s son. From then on, Gonzalo and others began their particular "crusade" against drug-addicts.', 'A new doctor arrives in a small Spanish village. As soon as he begins meeting people there, he notices the strange behaviour of the population and is surprised. Young people make fun of him, a man called Gonzalo seems to be some kind of leader, and he is invited to leave the village when he tries to ask about the situation. All his questions get no answer. His neighbour is a lovely and pretty young woman, who works as the local teacher. They develop a sincere friendship from the very first moment, which grows to become love. Unfortunately, Gonzalo feels that the young teacher is "reserved" exclusively for him and he reacts with violence. Meanwhile, the doctor finds out the key of that strange behaviour. Some years ago, during the local feast, some drug-addicts attacked the village in order to get money and goods. There was a fight and some people died, including Gonzalo''s son. From then on, Gonzalo and others began their particular "crusade" against drug-addicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exNCURvklgxeeHjX7zR8bLIgvPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529524'),
  ('717230471304501972', 'Blood Is Dry', 1960, 'Drama', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Tōichirō Narushima', 'Yoshishige Yoshida', 'Keiji Sada, Shinichirō Mikami, Mari Yoshimura, Masao Oda, Kaneko Iwasaki, Asao Sano, Yūko Kashiwagi, Takamaru Sasaki', null, 'An employee in an assurance company threatens to commit suicide when management announces a massive layoff, the company uses this threat to its own advantage by turning the incident into an advertising campaign. With the success of the campaign, however, he is no longer a desperate man pointing a gun to his head, but a potential leader who wishes to take advantage of his failed suicide.', 'An employee in an assurance company threatens to commit suicide when management announces a massive layoff, the company uses this threat to its own advantage by turning the incident into an advertising campaign. With the success of the campaign, however, he is no longer a desperate man pointing a gun to his head, but a potential leader who wishes to take advantage of his failed suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgKQEPTTQ2gLNajUCh9E9IrHcnL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88442'),
  ('153988411362184271', 'Blood Lake', 1987, 'Horror', 'Tim Boggs', 'Doug Barry', 'Doug Barry, Angela Darter, Mike Kaufman, Andrea Adams, Travis Krasser, Christie Willoughby, Tiny Frazier, Michael Darter', 'NR', 'Six teenagers decide to party one weekend, but before the partying begins one couple disappears. Only to be fount brutally murdered. A blood thirsty killer is stalking their summer playground. One by one bodies begin to show up, as they become prey to the venomous vengeance-seeking maniac.', 'Six teenagers decide to party one weekend, but before the partying begins one couple disappears. Only to be fount brutally murdered. A blood thirsty killer is stalking their summer playground. One by one bodies begin to show up, as they become prey to the venomous vengeance-seeking maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suzO1H4iqnQVmrrfBD525AW3NvW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84253'),
