  ('578672694736917673', 'Blood Money', 1974, 'Drama', 'Lütfi Akad, Gani Turanlı', 'Lütfi Akad', 'Hülya Koçyiğit, Hakan Balamir, Erol Taş, Erol Günaydın, Güner Sümer, Turgut Savaş, Günay Güner, Osman Alyanak', null, 'Hacer recently joined a factory where Hasan works and brings hope to her life. The two get married. Hacer is worried about the working conditions in the factory; she has a relationship with Hasan after she establishes a relationship with the union. Because of their disagreements, they are driven towards disaster.', 'Hacer recently joined a factory where Hasan works and brings hope to her life. The two get married. Hacer is worried about the working conditions in the factory; she has a relationship with Hasan after she establishes a relationship with the union. Because of their disagreements, they are driven towards disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ybHMR3hcaFqvNzWUysAdnZQpDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281603'),
  ('808666662842477127', 'Blood Money', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Lucky McKee, Alex Vendler, Craig Borden', 'Jared Butler, Lars Norberg', 'John Cusack, Willa Fitzgerald, Ellar Coltrane, Jacob Artist, Ned Bellamy, Antonio J Bell, Johanna McGinley', 'R', 'Three friends on a wilderness excursion must outrun a white collar criminal hellbent on retrieving his cash, but soon their greed turns them against each other. A modern re-telling of Treasure of the Sierra Madre (1948).', 'Three friends on a wilderness excursion must outrun a white collar criminal hellbent on retrieving his cash, but soon their greed turns them against each other. A modern re-telling of Treasure of the Sierra Madre (1948).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCvcvsP3w4CyiB3CLTxwaHBpKro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422821'),
  ('678396720520550956', 'Blood Money: Inside the Nazi Economy', 2021, 'History, War, Documentary', 'Gil Rabier, Fabienne Wagenaar, Gil Rabier', 'Gil Rabier, Olivier Wieviorka', 'Éric Chantelauze, Adam Tooze, Richard Overy, Marie-Bénédicte Vincent, Frank Bajohr', null, 'How did Nazi Germany, from limited natural resources, mass unemployment, little money and a damaged industry, manage to unfurl the cataclysm of World War Two and come to occupy a large part of the European continent? Based on recent historical works of and interviews with Adam Tooze, Richard Overy, Frank Bajohr and Marie-Bénédicte Vincent, and drawing on rare archival material.', 'How did Nazi Germany, from limited natural resources, mass unemployment, little money and a damaged industry, manage to unfurl the cataclysm of World War Two and come to occupy a large part of the European continent? Based on recent historical works of and interviews with Adam Tooze, Richard Overy, Frank Bajohr and Marie-Bénédicte Vincent, and drawing on rare archival material.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdkqBoMvtlMn5mGAV46pZ4wT83v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792977'),
  ('1147055817777528971', 'Blood Monkey', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Robert Young, Carl Proctor, Choochat Nantitanyatada', 'Gary Dauberman, George LaVoo', 'F. Murray Abraham, Matt Ryan, Amy Manson, Freishia Bomanbehram, Matt Reeves, Prapimporn Kanjunda, Sebastian Armesto, Laura Aikman', null, 'Six American grad students have arrived in Africa to study apes with a renowned professor. But after setting up camp in a jungle clearing, they soon become witness to the carnage inflicted by the strange and remote species.', 'Six American grad students have arrived in Africa to study apes with a renowned professor. But after setting up camp in a jungle clearing, they soon become witness to the carnage inflicted by the strange and remote species.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5qGpkxA4uFAhMqGue8uPfwABe8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42302'),
  ('226245396293677824', 'Blood Moon', 2021, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Amanda Boisselle, Maura Kelly, Aida Lembo', 'Simon Boyes, Adam Mason', 'Megalyn Echikunwoke, Yonas Kibreab, Joshua Dov, Marco Rodríguez, Gareth Williams, Brian R. Norris, Jack Yang, Jan Munroe', 'NR', 'When Esme and her ten-year-old son, Luna move to a small desert town looking for a fresh start, they attract all the wrong kinds of attention. Esme must battle to protect her son and a terrifying secret before the next full moon reveals all.', 'When Esme and her ten-year-old son, Luna move to a small desert town looking for a fresh start, they attract all the wrong kinds of attention. Esme must battle to protect her son and a terrifying secret before the next full moon reveals all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9umVH1R5Z2I1Fqzg7qwMIR2gpKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:794960'),
  ('875199414067301298', 'Blood Night: The Legend of Mary Hatchet', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Frank Sabatella, Christopher Walters, Jarin Blaschke', 'Frank Sabatella', 'Nate Dushku, Bill Moseley, Danielle Harris, Samantha Siong Facchi, Anthony Marks, Billy Magnussen, Patricia Raven, Alissa Dean', 'R', 'Local teens have long commemorated the death of ''Mary Hatchet'' - a girl who took an ax and killed her family in the 1970s - with the aptly named Blood Night. But things never got truly bloody until Mary''s ghost decided to make an appearance. Dead bodies are piling up, and Mary seems to be calling the shots. But there are secrets about her past that have yet to be uncovered.', 'Local teens have long commemorated the death of ''Mary Hatchet'' - a girl who took an ax and killed her family in the 1970s - with the aptly named Blood Night. But things never got truly bloody until Mary''s ghost decided to make an appearance. Dead bodies are piling up, and Mary seems to be calling the shots. But there are secrets about her past that have yet to be uncovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ChjBLtmxPZZ77eVCZ5pxLN7ZkN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47194'),
  ('654835358762404584', 'Blood of Dracula', 1957, 'Horror', 'Herbert L. Strock, Monroe P. Askins', 'Aben Kandel', 'Sandra Harrison, Louise Lewis, Gail Ganley, Jerry Blaine, Heather Ames, Malcolm Atterbury, Mary Adams, Thomas Browne Henry', null, 'A crazed teacher at a respectable girls'' school draws power from a medallion she has obtained from the Carpathian Mountains, and uses it to experiment telepathically on the school''s newest young pupil.', 'A crazed teacher at a respectable girls'' school draws power from a medallion she has obtained from the Carpathian Mountains, and uses it to experiment telepathically on the school''s newest young pupil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcnOgLB2QXS44uzzGwhljx291zy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110336'),
  ('59937901276137342', 'Blood of Dracula''s Castle', 1969, 'Horror', 'Al Adamson, László Kovács', 'Rex Carlton', 'Alexander D''Arcy, Paula Raymond, John Carradine, Robert Dix, Jennifer Bishop, Gene Otis Shane, Vicki Volante, Ray Young', 'NR', 'Count Dracula and his wife capture beautiful young women and chain them in their dungeon, to be used when they need to satisfy their thirst for blood.', 'Count Dracula and his wife capture beautiful young women and chain them in their dungeon, to be used when they need to satisfy their thirst for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRmmdKl4IfweC4cS2ti9Taim1We.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29121'),
