  ('978143342104440844', 'Blood of My Blood', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Christopher Zalla, Igor Martinović', 'Christopher Zalla', 'Jesús Ochoa, Armando Hernández, Jorge Adrián Espíndola, Paola Mendoza, Leonardo Anzures, Scott Glascock, Israel Hernández, Lenny Ligotti', null, 'A Mexican boy smuggles himself to Brooklyn to meet his long-lost father - only to have his identity stolen upon arrival by an impostor who seeks to steal the fathers'' fortune.', 'A Mexican boy smuggles himself to Brooklyn to meet his long-lost father - only to have his identity stolen upon arrival by an impostor who seeks to steal the fathers'' fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZlRI1lDYhRkGM8MDX7KKJWJ0Do.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79983'),
  ('719186466505828824', 'Blood of My Blood', 2011, 'Drama', 'Mário Castanheira, João Canijo', 'João Canijo', 'Rafael Morais, Nuno Lopes, Rita Blanco, Beatriz Batarda, Fernando Luís, Cleia Almeida, Anabela Moreira, Teresa Madruga', null, 'A regular family living in the outskirts of Lisbon sees the serenity of their lives shaken beyond any remedy within a week.', 'A regular family living in the outskirts of Lisbon sees the serenity of their lives shaken beyond any remedy within a week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLmegmielKMoURFK52L4V8NbRln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82968'),
  ('173610711983442321', 'Blood of My Blood', 2015, 'History, Drama', 'Marco Bellocchio, Francesca Coticoni, Marco Sgorbati', 'Marco Bellocchio', 'Roberto Herlitzka, Pier Giorgio Bellocchio, Lidiya Liberman, Alba Rohrwacher, Federica Fracassi, Alberto Cracco, Bruno Cariello, Toni Bertorelli', null, 'In the Middle Ages, Federico, a soldier, visits the convent in Bobbio, where Sister Benedetta is facing charges of witchery for seducing Fabrizio, Federico’s twin brother, and making him betray his priestly mission. Federico hopes to secure his brother a burial on consecrated grounds. In modern times, Federico Mai, a Minister inspector, knocks on the doors of the very same convent, in order to broker a sale of the property to a Russian millionaire. Unbeknownst to him, a mysterious "Count" lives there.', 'In the Middle Ages, Federico, a soldier, visits the convent in Bobbio, where Sister Benedetta is facing charges of witchery for seducing Fabrizio, Federico’s twin brother, and making him betray his priestly mission. Federico hopes to secure his brother a burial on consecrated grounds. In modern times, Federico Mai, a Minister inspector, knocks on the doors of the very same convent, in order to broker a sale of the property to a Russian millionaire. Unbeknownst to him, a mysterious "Count" lives there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgn9u3Jm5ZqlWglIQqpLH0T0FjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314400'),
  ('962983287432198237', 'Blood of Redemption', 2013, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Giorgio Serafini, Marco Cappetta, Allison Arachea', 'Rey Reyes, Giorgio Serafini, Shawn Sourgose', 'Dolph Lundgren, Billy Zane, Gianni Capaldi, Vinnie Jones, Robert Davi, Robert Miano, Massi Furlan, Manny Ayala', 'R', 'Quinn Forte had it all: power, money, a brother who idolized him, and a woman who loved him. He also had enemies. In the course of one night, he loses everything. Betrayed by someone in his inner circle, Quinn is set up and arrested. His father, the patriarch of the criminal empire is killed and his brother suspects that Quinn is behind it all. When he''s released from jail he tries to escape the demons from his past, but that becomes an impossible task. Campbell, the ruthless new leader of "The Company" won''t let him leave in peace. So instead of escaping them, Quinn fights back. He joins forces with his former henchman and friend, The Swede, and takes on his enemies head on.', 'Quinn Forte had it all: power, money, a brother who idolized him, and a woman who loved him. He also had enemies. In the course of one night, he loses everything. Betrayed by someone in his inner circle, Quinn is set up and arrested. His father, the patriarch of the criminal empire is killed and his brother suspects that Quinn is behind it all. When he''s released from jail he tries to escape the demons from his past, but that becomes an impossible task. Campbell, the ruthless new leader of "The Company" won''t let him leave in peace. So instead of escaping them, Quinn fights back. He joins forces with his former henchman and friend, The Swede, and takes on his enemies head on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxMQiHh2lP6Dq46R2OyvXYA8XqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220820'),
  ('1098683926779025038', 'Blood of the Beasts', 1949, 'Documentary', 'Georges Franju, Marcel Fradetal, Julien Bonardier', 'Jean Painlevé, Georges Franju', 'Georges Hubert, Nicole Ladmiral, Alfred Macquart, Maurice Griselle, André Brunier, Henri Fournel', null, 'An early example of ultra-realism, this movie contrasts the quiet, bucolic life in the outskirts of Paris with the harsh, gory conditions inside the nearby slaughterhouses. Describes the fate of the animals and that of the workers in graphic detail.', 'An early example of ultra-realism, this movie contrasts the quiet, bucolic life in the outskirts of Paris with the harsh, gory conditions inside the nearby slaughterhouses. Describes the fate of the animals and that of the workers in graphic detail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXubND1NNqnhOK7needlwW3kXqz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91262'),
  ('961029889396504158', 'Blood of the Condor', 1969, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jorge Sanjinés, Antonio Eguino', 'Óscar Soria, Jorge Sanjinés', 'Marcelino Yanahuaya, Benedicta Mendoza, Vicente Verneros Salinas, Danielle Caillet, Felipe Vargas', null, 'A community reacts against a group of foreigners who under the guise of development assistance are forcibly sterilizing the peasant women.', 'A community reacts against a group of foreigners who under the guise of development assistance are forcibly sterilizing the peasant women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VD8rtdnLQuW17kQ2DePqWjNcyJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157319'),
  ('713544566091407690', 'Blood of the Dragon', 1971, 'Drama, Action', 'Kao Pao-Shu, Richard Tung Chin-Hu', 'Kao Pao-Shu, Ni Kuang', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Lisa Chiao Chiao, Miao Tian, Lung You, Yang Yang, Yi Yuan, Tien Yeh, Chin Wan-Che', 'R', 'White Dragon must get a list with the names of rebel supporters to Prince Ma Tung, the leader of the rebellion. Trying to stop him in his mission is the evil Prime Minister, who naturally wants the list in order to crush his opposition. Adding another complication is the fact that Ma Tung wants to kill White Dragon in revenge for the humiliation Tung''s father suffered in a duel against White Dragon years earlier.', 'White Dragon must get a list with the names of rebel supporters to Prince Ma Tung, the leader of the rebellion. Trying to stop him in his mission is the evil Prime Minister, who naturally wants the list in order to crush his opposition. Adding another complication is the fact that Ma Tung wants to kill White Dragon in revenge for the humiliation Tung''s father suffered in a duel against White Dragon years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5S4DZuU93HHlmuz55cVblznQk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103535'),
  ('867605263832036776', 'Blood of the Losers', 2008, 'Drama, History', 'Michele Soavi, Giovanni Mammolotti', 'Michele Soavi', 'Michele Placido, Alessandro Preziosi, Philippe Leroy, Giovanna Ralli, Stefano Dionisi, Alina Nedelea, Daniela Giordano, Valerio Binasco', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0U85rqzXR1I1LUK0x36YBzARDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80317'),
  ('658653402887775982', 'Blood of the Vampire', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Henry Cass, Monty Berman', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Donald Wolfit, Vincent Ball, Barbara Shelley, Victor Maddern, William Devlin, Andrew Faulds, John Le Mesurier, Bryan Coleman', null, 'A man and wife are terrorized by Mad Scientist Dr. Callistratus who was executed but has returned to life with a heart transplant. Along with his crippled assistant Carl, the ''anemic'' Mad Scientist, believed to be a vampire, conducts blood deficiency research on the inmates of a prison hospital for the criminally insane to sustain his return to life.', 'A man and wife are terrorized by Mad Scientist Dr. Callistratus who was executed but has returned to life with a heart transplant. Along with his crippled assistant Carl, the ''anemic'' Mad Scientist, believed to be a vampire, conducts blood deficiency research on the inmates of a prison hospital for the criminally insane to sustain his return to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndLN20yprorlAyT6tLSOWXpEdlK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52639'),
  ('257659237880409280', 'Blood of the Virgins', 1967, 'Horror', 'Emilio Vieyra, Rubén Salguero, Juan Carlos Codazzi', 'Emilio Vieyra', 'Ricardo Bauleo, Susana Beltrán, Gloria Prat, Walter Kliche, Rolo Puente, Emilio Vieyra, Mary Albano, Graciela Mancuso', null, 'After their van breaks down by the side of the road, a group of hip teenagers seek shelter at an old lodge, where several go missing one by one.', 'After their van breaks down by the side of the road, a group of hip teenagers seek shelter at an old lodge, where several go missing one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RUXRye9UIEGoGmxxWHx0Xbql7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145821'),
  ('807925967736047693', 'Blood of Youth', 2016, 'Thriller, Action', 'Cheng Siu-Keung, Yang Shupeng', 'Lu Wenying', 'Guo Shutong, Guo Xiaodong, Yu Nan, Zhou Yiwei, Zhang Yi, Ou Hao', null, 'The fourth film of firefighter-turned-director Yang Shupeng, Blood of Youth follows a young hacker named Su Ang (Oho Ou), who anonymously tips off the police about the remains of a woman buried in the woods near the city of Hangzhou. Detective Zhang (Zhang Yi) discovers the victim was beaten to death almost two decades ago, and starts investigating the events that lead to her death.', 'The fourth film of firefighter-turned-director Yang Shupeng, Blood of Youth follows a young hacker named Su Ang (Oho Ou), who anonymously tips off the police about the remains of a woman buried in the woods near the city of Hangzhou. Detective Zhang (Zhang Yi) discovers the victim was beaten to death almost two decades ago, and starts investigating the events that lead to her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1cwog21x23Y9NjyS96LWEkzcXn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436792'),
  ('466726129224261836', 'Blood on Her Name', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Matthew Pope, Matthew Rogers', 'Matthew Pope, Don M. Thompson', 'Bethany Anne Lind, Will Patton, Jimmy Gonzáles, Elisabeth Röhm, Jared Ivers, Chandler Head, Jack Andrews, Tony Vaughn', null, 'A woman''s panicked decision to cover up an accidental killing spins out of control when her conscience demands she return the dead man''s body to his family.', 'A woman''s panicked decision to cover up an accidental killing spins out of control when her conscience demands she return the dead man''s body to his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VFsgJauwdnjzxU7DaTOnJVNQRE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611634'),
  ('679264873313741072', 'Blood on His Sword', 1961, 'Adventure, Romance, Action, Drama', 'André Hunebelle, Marcel Grignon', 'Henry Dupuy-Mazuel, Pierre Foucaud, Jean Halain', 'Jean Marais, Rosanna Schiaffino, Roger Hanin, Jean-Louis Barrault, Guy Delorme, Annie Anderson, Raphaël Albert-Lambert, Raoul Billerey', null, 'Charles le Temeraire asks in marriage Jeanne de Beauvais, daughter of King Louis XI, wishing to get her valuable lands in dowry. The King is wise to this, and since his daughter does not feel inclined to accept, he refuses. Charles sets up a plan to abduct the prince, in a way that the suspicions will fall upon Robert de Neuville, a noble enamoured of the princess. Robert manages to free her from the castle where she was being kept. Charles keeps setting traps, and managing people to perjure against Jeanne, and the King himself. Finally, Jeanne escapes alive from a pack of wolves, who set watching the lady alone in the snow covered woods, instead of attacking her. Charles does yet accuse her of being a witch - wishing to have her dead rather than being the wife of Robert... Robert will be her champion in a Judgement of God. Will the ''miracle of the wolfs'' repeat itself, or fearless Charles defeat Robert in the sword duel?', 'Charles le Temeraire asks in marriage Jeanne de Beauvais, daughter of King Louis XI, wishing to get her valuable lands in dowry. The King is wise to this, and since his daughter does not feel inclined to accept, he refuses. Charles sets up a plan to abduct the prince, in a way that the suspicions will fall upon Robert de Neuville, a noble enamoured of the princess. Robert manages to free her from the castle where she was being kept. Charles keeps setting traps, and managing people to perjure against Jeanne, and the King himself. Finally, Jeanne escapes alive from a pack of wolves, who set watching the lady alone in the snow covered woods, instead of attacking her. Charles does yet accuse her of being a witch - wishing to have her dead rather than being the wife of Robert... Robert will be her champion in a Judgement of God. Will the ''miracle of the wolfs'' repeat itself, or fearless Charles defeat Robert in the sword duel?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kG0rIr3iG9815BKRSvrNWOMZJUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95363'),
  ('4760123114854866', 'Blood on the Arrow', 1964, 'Western', 'Sidney Salkow', 'Robert E. Kent', 'Dale Robertson, Martha Hyer, Wendell Corey, Dandy Curran, Paul Mantee, Robert Carricart, Ted de Corsia, Elisha Cook Jr.', 'NR', 'In this western, the sole survivor of an Apache ambush rides out to save a young boy who has been captured. The hero was a captured outlaw en route to his trial.', 'In this western, the sole survivor of an Apache ambush rides out to save a young boy who has been captured. The hero was a captured outlaw en route to his trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kyzzCz6z6eWR0vaP5LX49DAJ1E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399274'),
  ('339991313567454748', 'Blood on the Land', 1966, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Markos Zervas, Vasilis Georgiadis, Nikos Dimopoulos', 'Nikos Foskolos', 'Nikos Kourkoulos, Mairi Hronopoulou, Giannis Voglis, Faidon Georgitsis, Zeta Apostolou, Notis Peryalis, Eleni Kriti, Angelos Antonopoulos', null, 'Two rival brothers vie for the same woman against the backdrop of peasant revolts in their Greek homeland. In Thessaly in 1907, a man incites the poor farmers to take over the land they work for the benefit of the landowners. Odysseus (Nikos Kourkoulos), the son of one such landowner (Manos Katrakis), refuses to clash with the farmers.', 'Two rival brothers vie for the same woman against the backdrop of peasant revolts in their Greek homeland. In Thessaly in 1907, a man incites the poor farmers to take over the land they work for the benefit of the landowners. Odysseus (Nikos Kourkoulos), the son of one such landowner (Manos Katrakis), refuses to clash with the farmers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDqPjR6ML2YCTvibDyCYe0zUto7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202764'),
  ('810983783912308481', 'Blood on the Moon', 1948, 'Western, Romance', 'Robert Wise, Nicholas Musuraca, Maxwell O. Henry', 'Lillie Hayward', 'Robert Mitchum, Barbara Bel Geddes, Robert Preston, Walter Brennan, Phyllis Thaxter, Frank Faylen, Tom Tully, Charles McGraw', 'NR', 'Down-and-out cowhand Jim Garry is asked by his old friend Tate Riling to help mediate a cattle dispute. When Garry arrives, however, it soon becomes clear that Riling has not been entirely forthright. Garry uncovers Riling''s plot to dupe local rancher John Lufton out of a fortune. When Lufton''s firecracker of a daughter, Amy, gets involved, Garry must choose between his old loyalties and what he knows to be right.', 'Down-and-out cowhand Jim Garry is asked by his old friend Tate Riling to help mediate a cattle dispute. When Garry arrives, however, it soon becomes clear that Riling has not been entirely forthright. Garry uncovers Riling''s plot to dupe local rancher John Lufton out of a fortune. When Lufton''s firecracker of a daughter, Amy, gets involved, Garry must choose between his old loyalties and what he knows to be right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQk2JSVfC1iskVEUUURs2gi0ANM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29966'),
  ('474596736670119220', 'Blood on the Sun', 1945, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Frank Lloyd, Theodor Sparkuhl', 'Garrett Fort, Lester Cole, Nathaniel Curtis', 'James Cagney, Sylvia Sidney, Porter Hall, John Emery, Robert Armstrong, Wallace Ford, Rosemary DeCamp, John Halloran', 'NR', 'Nick Condon, an American journalist in 20s Tokyo, publishes the Japanese master plan for world domination. Reaction from the understandably upset Japanese provides the action, but this is overshadowed by the propaganda of the time.', 'Nick Condon, an American journalist in 20s Tokyo, publishes the Japanese master plan for world domination. Reaction from the understandably upset Japanese provides the action, but this is overshadowed by the propaganda of the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZ4IDpM7MBdHRTQL6vYZu9jYBvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75888'),
  ('354019630282652267', 'Blood Orgy of the She-Devils', 1973, 'Horror', 'Ted V. Mikels, Anthony Salinas', 'Ted V. Mikels', 'Lila Zaborin, Victor Izay, Tom Pace, Leslie McRay, William Bagdad, Ray Myles, Annik Borel, Sherri Vernon', 'PG', 'Lorraine and Mark enter the world of witchcraft where Mara foretells the future and helps them remember their past lives. When a series of mysterious murders begin to occur, they turn to Dr. Helsford for advice.', 'Lorraine and Mark enter the world of witchcraft where Mara foretells the future and helps them remember their past lives. When a series of mysterious murders begin to occur, they turn to Dr. Helsford for advice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYuY5auXL4LfheF48BZSD4JtCwH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43402'),
  ('139779565823317341', 'Blood Out', 2011, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jason Hewitt, Christian Herrera, John Michael Sudol', 'John A. O''Connell, Jason Hewitt', '50 Cent, Val Kilmer, Luke Goss, Vinnie Jones, AnnaLynne McCord, Tamer Hassan, Ed Quinn, Ryan Donowho', 'R', 'When big city detectives refuse to further investigate his kid brother''s gang related murder, small town Sheriff Michael Spencer drops the badge and goes undercover to find his brother''s killer and avenge his death.', 'When big city detectives refuse to further investigate his kid brother''s gang related murder, small town Sheriff Michael Spencer drops the badge and goes undercover to find his brother''s killer and avenge his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7KebNqtudY3zRUSklwf8CqsEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54597'),
  ('903348887449525506', 'Blood Punch', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Madellaine Paxson, Neil Cervin', 'Eddie Guzelian', 'Milo Cawthorne, Olivia Tennet, Ari Boyland, Cohen Holloway, Adelaide Kane, Fleur Saville, Amanda Reed, Mike Ginn', null, 'Milton, a college dropout, was only supposed to cook meth for one day. Broken out of rehab by a brash young woman and her trigger-happy ("ex") boyfriend and driven to a remote cabin the woods, Milton finds himself drawn into a dangerous love triangle gone haywire. The couple''s deadpan half-truths spin around Milton like a song on repeat. They seem to read him like an open book, until a mysterious message opens his eyes to his cursed existence. With unlimited ammunition, any hunting tool they could desire, and an ever-growing body count, for what did Milton really sign up?', 'Milton, a college dropout, was only supposed to cook meth for one day. Broken out of rehab by a brash young woman and her trigger-happy ("ex") boyfriend and driven to a remote cabin the woods, Milton finds himself drawn into a dangerous love triangle gone haywire. The couple''s deadpan half-truths spin around Milton like a song on repeat. They seem to read him like an open book, until a mysterious message opens his eyes to his cursed existence. With unlimited ammunition, any hunting tool they could desire, and an ever-growing body count, for what did Milton really sign up?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQZkm86UV5qiRPbcWQOPN6iF6HN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257117'),
  ('842017674683259105', 'Blood Quantum', 2019, 'Horror', 'Esteban Sánchez, Gabriel Teller, Jeff Barnaby', 'Jeff Barnaby', 'Michael Greyeyes, Elle-Máijá Tailfeathers, Forrest Goodluck, Kiowa Gordon, Olivia Scriven, Stonehorse Lone Goeman, Brandon Oakes, William Belleau', 'NR', 'The dead are coming back to life outside the isolated Mi''kmaq reserve of Red Crow, except for its Indigenous inhabitants who are strangely immune to the zombie plague.', 'The dead are coming back to life outside the isolated Mi''kmaq reserve of Red Crow, except for its Indigenous inhabitants who are strangely immune to the zombie plague.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQnfrys3nyOpUxktxK2CBnm7Rv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592230'),
  ('498616850343870316', 'Blood Rain', 2005, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Kim Dae-seung, Shin Jae-ho, Kim Sung-kwan', 'Kim Seong-je, Lee Won-jae, Kim Dae-seung', 'Cha Seung-won, Park Yong-woo, Ji Sung, Yoon Se-a, Choi Jong-won, Park Cheol-min, Yoo Hai-jin, Jeong Gyu-su', null, 'In 1808, an imperial investigator arrives on an idyllic island to investigate a series of grisly murders. The locals believe that a ghost is responsible, taking revenge for a wrongful execution seven years ago. But the investigator suspects that something else may be behind it all.', 'In 1808, an imperial investigator arrives on an idyllic island to investigate a series of grisly murders. The locals believe that a ghost is responsible, taking revenge for a wrongful execution seven years ago. But the investigator suspects that something else may be behind it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMp2NCtAcU3tA2w4l4AKOdraXJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45089'),
  ('662572779144830026', 'Blood Red', 1989, 'Western', 'Peter Masterson, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Ron Cutler', 'Eric Roberts, Giancarlo Giannini, Dennis Hopper, Burt Young, Carlin Glynn, Julia Roberts, Lara Harris, Joseph Runningfox', 'R', 'Set in the Napa Valley in 1895, an immigrant family struggles to keep their vineyards from industrialists.', 'Set in the Napa Valley in 1895, an immigrant family struggles to keep their vineyards from industrialists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqSNkrCfWAHstfBtdho31irY2pF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135643'),
  ('190930544412617464', 'Blood Red', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Xavier Durringer, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech', 'Sylvain Saada, Xavier Durringer', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Bernard Le Coq, Éric Savin, Micha Lescot, François Duval, Carolina Jurczak, José Paul, Benjamin Baroche', null, 'Brest, the end of the world. A young woman''s foot is found near the sea. Alma Schneider, a cop fresh from Paris, leads the investigation. She can only count on the support of César Istria, forensic pathologist and passionate archaeologist. Together, they find the site where the victim is believed to have been buried. But the body they exhume is not that of a woman! It''s that of a man, probably a sailor. Not one murder to solve, but two... And the mystery thickens still further when they realize that the young woman was in fact a transsexual named Diana, a veritable icon and influential figure in the whole town. Alma and César join forces to solve this enigma, which takes them deep into the bowels of Brest.', 'Brest, the end of the world. A young woman''s foot is found near the sea. Alma Schneider, a cop fresh from Paris, leads the investigation. She can only count on the support of César Istria, forensic pathologist and passionate archaeologist. Together, they find the site where the victim is believed to have been buried. But the body they exhume is not that of a woman! It''s that of a man, probably a sailor. Not one murder to solve, but two... And the mystery thickens still further when they realize that the young woman was in fact a transsexual named Diana, a veritable icon and influential figure in the whole town. Alma and César join forces to solve this enigma, which takes them deep into the bowels of Brest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naMxfmf4BJDv5xZBaYwb4p1ByaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308817'),
  ('1088396744635686999', 'Blood Red Sky', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller, Action', 'Yoshi Heimrath, Peter Thorwarth', 'Stefan Holtz, Peter Thorwarth', 'Peri Baumeister, Carl Anton Koch, Kais Setti, Alexander Scheer, Dominic Purcell, Graham McTavish, Roland Møller, Chidi Ajufo', null, 'A woman with a mysterious illness is forced into action when a group of terrorists attempt to hijack a transatlantic overnight flight. In order to protect her son she will have to reveal a dark secret, and unleash the inner monster she has fought to hide.', 'A woman with a mysterious illness is forced into action when a group of terrorists attempt to hijack a transatlantic overnight flight. In order to protect her son she will have to reveal a dark secret, and unleash the inner monster she has fought to hide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7aOJKI5vxCHotHvN8O7SR6SpP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760883'),
  ('576265862505046012', 'Blood Reign: Curse of the Yoma', 1989, 'Horror, Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Takashi Anno, Matsuri Okuda', 'Kei Kusunoki', 'Kenyu Horiuchi, Kaneto Shiozawa, Hiromi Tsuru, Minako Arakawa, Motomu Kiyokawa, Yusaku Yara, Banjo Ginga, Miki Ito', null, 'A terrible war has ravaged the land, and now, fuelled by the blood of numerous fallen warriors the Yoma, demons from hell, emerge once more. A skilled ninja seeks to end the bloodshed these demons inflict upon humanity, but to do this he must fight against his undead former best friend and fellow ninja who was killed in battle and has been resurrected to serve the Yoma.', 'A terrible war has ravaged the land, and now, fuelled by the blood of numerous fallen warriors the Yoma, demons from hell, emerge once more. A skilled ninja seeks to end the bloodshed these demons inflict upon humanity, but to do this he must fight against his undead former best friend and fellow ninja who was killed in battle and has been resurrected to serve the Yoma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTRIgRFBVenBPDmEoiLPOcpPUq3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126006'),
  ('509270673433864656', 'Blood Relations', 1988, 'Horror', 'Graeme Campbell, Rhett Morita', 'Stephen Saylor', 'Jan Rubeš, Lydie Denier, Kevin Hicks, Lynne Adams, Ray Walston, Steven Saylor, Sam Malkin, Carrie Leigh', 'R', 'A trip to meet her fiance''s family becomes a descent into hell when Marie discovers that her future husband wants more than just a wife... Dying for a rich husband, Marie is thrilled when Thomas brings her home to his family''s massive estate. But there is something wrong in the house, and as the days go by and Marie wanders the dim halls, she makes a gruesome discovery. There is a lab underground, and a body, and all that''s missing is a brain...', 'A trip to meet her fiance''s family becomes a descent into hell when Marie discovers that her future husband wants more than just a wife... Dying for a rich husband, Marie is thrilled when Thomas brings her home to his family''s massive estate. But there is something wrong in the house, and as the days go by and Marie wanders the dim halls, she makes a gruesome discovery. There is a lab underground, and a body, and all that''s missing is a brain...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2iVp7bFxaBqw9e1IkfEWBanZD1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134572'),
  ('344182836123785079', 'Blood Relatives', 1978, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Brice Auboyneau, Justine Héroux, Jean Rabier', 'Claude Chabrol, Sydney Banks', 'Donald Sutherland, Aude Landry, Lisa Langlois, Laurent Malet, Walter Massey, Micheline Lanctôt, Stéphane Audran, Donald Pleasence', 'R', 'A Montreal police inspector cracks a murder case with clues from the victim''s diary.', 'A Montreal police inspector cracks a murder case with clues from the victim''s diary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjGLOmhbJrhB1X7a2DR9UMplD5C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47794'),
  ('215736017900587196', 'Blood River', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adam Mason, Stuart Brereton, Samir Vural', 'Adam Mason, Simon Boyes', 'Andrew Howard, Tess Panzer, Ian Duncan, Sarah Essex, Dillon Borowski, Athene Noelle', null, 'A psychological thriller following a successful young married couple on their way to visit family. After a blowout on a desolate stretch of highway in Nevada, they head to the next town only to discover it long abandoned. Here they meet a mysterious stranger who seems to know decidedly more than he is sharing.', 'A psychological thriller following a successful young married couple on their way to visit family. After a blowout on a desolate stretch of highway in Nevada, they head to the next town only to discover it long abandoned. Here they meet a mysterious stranger who seems to know decidedly more than he is sharing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SJ7zfWaPRBSJXP1e4pfKafL9xK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31549'),
  ('1013364588206274297', 'Blood Roses', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Mandati Guru Rajan', 'Mandati Guru Rajan', 'Dharma Keerthiraj, Apsara Rani, Sreelu Prudhviraj', null, 'In Hyderabad, a series of murders shakes the city as victims are found missing the same organ. With fear rising, police rush to identify the killer and find what links the crimes in a tense pursuit that reveals the truth.', 'In Hyderabad, a series of murders shakes the city as victims are found missing the same organ. With fear rising, police rush to identify the killer and find what links the crimes in a tense pursuit that reveals the truth.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FqKjkk9Y4SwOI930uRs5yWFMJzqV.jpg', 'plex:movie:blood-roses-2026'),
  ('167458368804464406', 'Blood Sabbath', 1972, 'Horror, Fantasy, Romance', 'Brianne Murphy, Michael D. Margulies', 'William A. Bairn', 'Anthony Geary, Susan Damante, Sam Gilman, Steve Gravers, Dyanne Thorne, Susan Landis, Samra Harvey, Mary Lind', 'R', 'A young man named David unknowingly ventures into a land controlled by the powerful witch queen, Alotta, and her coven. Every year the local villagers must offer a child to the queen in order to maintain a pact of peace. But David has fallen in love with a river nymph named Yyala and he cannot have a relationship with her as long as he has a soul. So, he offers his soul to Alotta in exchange for the life of a sacrificial child. Now David and Yyala can be together, but if Yyala ever abandons him, his life belongs to the witch...', 'A young man named David unknowingly ventures into a land controlled by the powerful witch queen, Alotta, and her coven. Every year the local villagers must offer a child to the queen in order to maintain a pact of peace. But David has fallen in love with a river nymph named Yyala and he cannot have a relationship with her as long as he has a soul. So, he offers his soul to Alotta in exchange for the life of a sacrificial child. Now David and Yyala can be together, but if Yyala ever abandons him, his life belongs to the witch...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7yfAIwEVAaKxWDS7Ojv3ogdgjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28224'),
  ('734371372259521297', 'Blood Salvage', 1990, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Tucker Johnston, Michael Karp', 'Ken Sanders, Tucker Johnston', 'Danny Nelson, Lori Birdsong, Christian Hesler, Ralph Pruitt Vaughn, John Saxon, Laura Whyte, Ray Walston, Evander Holyfield', 'R', 'Twisted tale about a crazy, preaching redneck named Jake who kidnaps people off the highway and performs sick medical experiments on them. He then proceeds to sell their organs on the black market to Mr. Stone. Everything is fine until he kidnaps the handicapped April and finds that she is harder to control than the others.', 'Twisted tale about a crazy, preaching redneck named Jake who kidnaps people off the highway and performs sick medical experiments on them. He then proceeds to sell their organs on the black market to Mr. Stone. Everything is fine until he kidnaps the handicapped April and finds that she is harder to control than the others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwH45tB4bFiloK1RLBHaKI0XIt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87699'),
  ('489517971323041974', 'Blood Shack', 1971, 'Horror', 'Ray Dennis Steckler, Ray Dennis Steckler', 'Ray Dennis Steckler, Ron Haydock', 'Carolyn Brandt, Ron Haydock, Jason Wayne, Laurel Spring, John Bates, Steve Edwards, Linda Steckler, Laura Steckler', 'NR', 'A woman inherits an abandoned ranch whose estate is said to be haunted by "the Chooper," the sword-wielding ghost of a vengeance-seeking Native American.', 'A woman inherits an abandoned ranch whose estate is said to be haunted by "the Chooper," the sword-wielding ghost of a vengeance-seeking Native American.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/le5ms5FGimX74SSuowpG5Ld5Wug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78250'),
  ('1058198565939428068', 'Blood Simple', 1985, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Joel Coen, Barry Sonnenfeld, Shannon Wood', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'John Getz, Frances McDormand, Dan Hedaya, Samm-Art Williams, M. Emmet Walsh, Deborah Neumann, Raquel Gavia, Van Brooks', 'R', 'The owner of a seedy small-town Texas bar discovers that one of his employees is having an affair with his wife. A chaotic chain of misunderstandings, lies and mischief ensues after he devises a plot to have them murdered.', 'The owner of a seedy small-town Texas bar discovers that one of his employees is having an affair with his wife. A chaotic chain of misunderstandings, lies and mischief ensues after he devises a plot to have them murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svU6pu4lfHn0T5BVZchVxL58HB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11368'),
