  ('211701593341949123', 'Blood Ties', 1991, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jim McBride, Affonso Beato', 'Richard Alan Shapiro', 'Harley Venton, Patrick Bauchau, Kim Johnston Ulrich, Michelle Johnson, Salvator Xuereb, Jason London, Bo Hopkins, Robert Burr', null, 'Carpathian Americans are just like any other expatriate organization, they enjoy family get together, and share business opportunities. There is just one minor difference, the Carpathian Americans seem to have a predilection for drinking human blood.', 'Carpathian Americans are just like any other expatriate organization, they enjoy family get together, and share business opportunities. There is just one minor difference, the Carpathian Americans seem to have a predilection for drinking human blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9XgqgzzQwsOTxD8LlvgsvFUrgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89337'),
