  ('1130280568527814840', 'Blood to the Head', 1956, 'Drama', 'Gilles Grangier, André Thomas, Jacques Deray', 'Gilles Grangier, Michel Audiard', 'Jean Gabin, Renée Faure, Paul Frankeur, Monique Mélinand, José Quaglio, Georgette Anys, Florelle, Paul Oettly', null, 'François Cardinaud is one of the richest shipowners in the region. But this success arouses resentment and jealousy. When Marthe, his wife, leaves the home without warning, Cardinaud sees her life cracking little by little.', 'François Cardinaud is one of the richest shipowners in the region. But this success arouses resentment and jealousy. When Marthe, his wife, leaves the home without warning, Cardinaud sees her life cracking little by little.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UlK8adtUvnbtOH8btCdlr8IsyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74672'),
  ('867110102548614790', 'Blood Totem', 2026, 'Horror', 'Robert Conway', 'Robert Conway', 'Christopher Beeman, Daniel Link, Celeste Luccitti, Brittany Mae, John Marrs', null, 'Soldiers venture into Apache county searching for a missing comrade, only to find the land itself has turned hostile. Facing demons both human and mythical in this supernatural western, they must fight to survive.', 'Soldiers venture into Apache county searching for a missing comrade, only to find the land itself has turned hostile. Facing demons both human and mythical in this supernatural western, they must fight to survive.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F9%2Fgracenote%2F9916d37b404846b6c2c2ca193bf384c8.jpg', 'plex:movie:blood-totem'),
  ('154142467602181509', 'Blood Tracks', 1985, 'Horror', 'Mats Helge, Hans Dittmer, Mike Jackson', 'Anna Wolf, Mike Jackson', 'Jeff Harding, Michael Fitzpatrick, Naomi Kaneda, Brad Powell, Peter Merrill, Harriet Robinson, Tina Shaw, Sonja Lund', null, 'A film crew producing a rock music video decides to shoot at an abandoned factory above the snow line. When an avalanche strands them, a murderous family living in the factory attacks and kills many of them.', 'A film crew producing a rock music video decides to shoot at an abandoned factory above the snow line. When an avalanche strands them, a murderous family living in the factory attacks and kills many of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkEyp0N9m6FOCygZIDqT8bu65TX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85001'),
  ('46970523818571203', 'Blood Trails', 2006, 'Horror', 'Robert Krause', null, 'Rebecca Palmer, Ben Price, Tom Frederic, J.J. Straub, Kurt Rauscher, Johann Daiminger, Christian Heiner Wolf, Maximilian Boxrucker', 'R', 'The biker Anne has a violent one night stand with the supposed cop Chris after a minor infraction. Two days later, feeling guilty and traumatized, she decides to go hiking with her boyfriend Michael in the Whistler chain of mountains, a spot where bicycles are prohibited. When she sees Chris riding a bike, she tells Michael about her affair, and Chris unexpectedly kills Michael. Along the rest of the day and night, Anne is chased by Chris in a sick and mortal mouse-and-cat game.', 'The biker Anne has a violent one night stand with the supposed cop Chris after a minor infraction. Two days later, feeling guilty and traumatized, she decides to go hiking with her boyfriend Michael in the Whistler chain of mountains, a spot where bicycles are prohibited. When she sees Chris riding a bike, she tells Michael about her affair, and Chris unexpectedly kills Michael. Along the rest of the day and night, Anne is chased by Chris in a sick and mortal mouse-and-cat game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5q7ZuKYvHE7Xl59PV9Kt154Mx96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25395'),
  ('700761109372066718', 'Blood Type O, Watermelon Chest Housekeeper', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', null, null, 'Seung Ha, Chul Jin, Kang Min-woo, Han Yi-seul', null, 'Friends Cheol Min and Jae Hyuk meet and talk to each other after a long time. Jae Hyuk said that the domestic helper who recently came to work at his house is strange. He said he was worried because she couldn''t do the housework. When Jae Hyuk said she seemed to be trying to seduce him, Cheol Min tells the innocent Jae Hyuk how to get around her. Can Jae Hyuk succeed in having sex with a beautiful housekeeper?', 'Friends Cheol Min and Jae Hyuk meet and talk to each other after a long time. Jae Hyuk said that the domestic helper who recently came to work at his house is strange. He said he was worried because she couldn''t do the housework. When Jae Hyuk said she seemed to be trying to seduce him, Cheol Min tells the innocent Jae Hyuk how to get around her. Can Jae Hyuk succeed in having sex with a beautiful housekeeper?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xdJWTn5Tuqy7yWTywC9WBPyicW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854663'),
  ('673047661697166141', 'Blood Vessel', 2020, 'Horror, Fantasy, War', 'Sky Davies, Justin Dix, Lynne Ruthven', 'Justin Dix, Jordan Prosser', 'Nathan Phillips, Alyssa Sutherland, Robert Taylor, Christopher Kirby, Alex Cooke, Mark Diaco, John Lloyd Fillingham, Vivienne Perry', null, 'Near the end of World War II, the survivors of a torpedoed hospital ship cling to life aboard a crowded lifeboat. With no food, water, or shelter, all seems lost – until an eerily silent German minesweeper drifts ominously towards them, giving them one last chance at survival. As our motley crew explores the ship, it becomes all too clear that some diabolical fate has befallen its German crew. The mystery only deepens when they encounter a young Romanian girl, apparently the sole survivor, who leads them to a locked room in the bowels of the vessel.', 'Near the end of World War II, the survivors of a torpedoed hospital ship cling to life aboard a crowded lifeboat. With no food, water, or shelter, all seems lost – until an eerily silent German minesweeper drifts ominously towards them, giving them one last chance at survival. As our motley crew explores the ship, it becomes all too clear that some diabolical fate has befallen its German crew. The mystery only deepens when they encounter a young Romanian girl, apparently the sole survivor, who leads them to a locked room in the bowels of the vessel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMxsv1JD6wUSBIIFJV7MutnYF9d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618585'),
  ('1055907758864870095', 'Blood Vessel', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Moses Inwang, Gideon Chidi Chukwu', 'Musa Jeffery David', 'David Ezekiel, Dibor Adaobi, Jidekene Achufusi, Slyvester Ekanem, Alex Budin, Obinna Okenwa, Bimbo Manuel, Levi Chikere', null, 'Brought together by chance, six people fleeing a town devastated by oil pollution stow away on a mysterious ship — not realizing the dangers that await.', 'Brought together by chance, six people fleeing a town devastated by oil pollution stow away on a mysterious ship — not realizing the dangers that await.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnUEpB35VVlMfZNT0WAFm45GGJq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214891'),
  ('475704304653112271', 'Blood Warriors', 1993, 'Action', 'Sam Firstenberg', null, 'David Bradley, Frank Zagarino, Jennifer Campbell, Frans Tumbuan, Dicky Zulkarnaen, Piet Burnama, Tanaka', null, 'An ex-Marine finds out a old buddy is leading a private army of mercenaries, and when he refuses to join, a deadly violent battle erupts between the two men!', 'An ex-Marine finds out a old buddy is leading a private army of mercenaries, and when he refuses to join, a deadly violent battle erupts between the two men!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKB6X1JYb61ppTA7Nx9cOPqtC4p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284715'),
  ('1123800584968986002', 'Blood Wedding', 1981, 'Drama, Music', 'Carlos Saura, Teo Escamilla', 'Antonio Gades, Carlos Saura, Alfredo Mañas', 'Antonio Gades, Cristina Hoyos, Juan Antonio Jiménez, Pilar Cárdenas, Carmen Villena, Elvira Andrés, Compañía Antonio Gades, El Güito', null, 'A dance troupe prepares for and completes a dress rehearsal of Federico García Lorca''s tragic play "Blood Wedding," which is about a bride who runs away from her wedding with a former boyfriend.', 'A dance troupe prepares for and completes a dress rehearsal of Federico García Lorca''s tragic play "Blood Wedding," which is about a bride who runs away from her wedding with a former boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfLdKbwayLuXkU8ZHFJoNSsbPI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42139'),
  ('628350984904035734', 'Blood Widow', 2014, 'Horror', 'Jeremiah Buckhalt', 'Chad Coup', 'Danielle Lilley, Brandon Kyle Peters, Christopher de Padua, Jose Miguel Vasquez, Kelly Quinn', null, 'Laurie and Hugh are a successful young couple who have just closed on a weekend home away from the city. Unbeknownst to them, the neighboring property contains the crumbling remains of a boarding school that was shuttered in the wake of an unspeakable massacre. The sole survivor of that massacre still resides in the ruins of the school, hiding from the world and wanting only to be left alone. When Laurie and Hugh''s friends explore the property, they have no idea that they disturbed an emotionally-broken killing machine: The Blood Widow.', 'Laurie and Hugh are a successful young couple who have just closed on a weekend home away from the city. Unbeknownst to them, the neighboring property contains the crumbling remains of a boarding school that was shuttered in the wake of an unspeakable massacre. The sole survivor of that massacre still resides in the ruins of the school, hiding from the world and wanting only to be left alone. When Laurie and Hugh''s friends explore the property, they have no idea that they disturbed an emotionally-broken killing machine: The Blood Widow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4fJFFLszfWkM1FBxgDJrPbH4B7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273509'),
  ('261927346857041819', 'Blood Will Tell', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Miguel Cohan, Catriel Vildosola, Julián Apezteguia', 'Miguel Cohan, Ana Cohan', 'Oscar Martínez, Dolores Fonzi, Paulina García, Luis Gnecco, Diego Velázquez, Malena Sánchez, Emilio Vodanovich, Norman Briski', null, 'Thriller about a family whose ties are put to the test when the patriarch’s wife dies.', 'Thriller about a family whose ties are put to the test when the patriarch’s wife dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAAcA1IziorfzydlMMWb3rbW0iT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575771'),
  ('66594999140036567', 'Blood Work', 2002, 'Thriller, Crime, Action, Mystery', 'Clint Eastwood, Tom Stern, Robert Lorenz', 'Brian Helgeland', 'Clint Eastwood, Jeff Daniels, Anjelica Huston, Wanda De Jesus, Tina Lifford, Paul Rodríguez, Dylan Walsh, Mason Lucero', 'R', 'Still recovering from a heart transplant, a retired FBI profiler returns to service when his own blood analysis offers clues to the identity of a serial killer.', 'Still recovering from a heart transplant, a retired FBI profiler returns to service when his own blood analysis offers clues to the identity of a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6wWJkIREagRWFNu3YotID3n9aW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9573'),
  ('788140543074667670', 'Blood-C: The Last Dark', 2012, 'Animation, Action, Horror', 'Naoyoshi Shiotani, Norihiro Naganuma, Yuji Hosogoe', 'Nanase Okawa, Junichi Fujisaku', 'Atsushi Abe, Masumi Asano, Keiji Fujiwara, Misato Fukuen, Miho Miyagawa, Nana Mizuki, Kenji Nojima, Tatsuhisa Suzuki', null, 'Tokyo, Winter. Despite the use of the Youth Ordinance Bill to enforce curfews for minors and regulate the use of the Internet, young people continue to fight for their own freedom through underground methods. One such group calls themselves Surat. They have decided to take on Fumito Nanahara, a man who has great influence on the political world, and basically controls Tokyo with an iron fist. While using the Internet as a weapon to discover more information about Fumito, they learn about "Tower", the secret organization behind Fumito which engages in human experimentation.', 'Tokyo, Winter. Despite the use of the Youth Ordinance Bill to enforce curfews for minors and regulate the use of the Internet, young people continue to fight for their own freedom through underground methods. One such group calls themselves Surat. They have decided to take on Fumito Nanahara, a man who has great influence on the political world, and basically controls Tokyo with an iron fist. While using the Internet as a weapon to discover more information about Fumito, they learn about "Tower", the secret organization behind Fumito which engages in human experimentation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUlxd7SRFr6ou8d5MfL0sj7XpSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171823'),
  ('874314898133390978', 'Blood, Guts, Bullets and Octane', 1998, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'John Alexander Jimenez, Joe Carnahan', 'Joe Carnahan', 'Joe Carnahan, Dan Leis, Hugh McChord, Ken Rudulph, Mike Maas, Nick Fenske, Mark Priolo, Andrew Fowler', 'R', 'To keep their struggling used-car dealership from closing, salesmen Sid and Bob agree to let a vintage 1963 Pontiac LeMans sit on their lot for two days in return for $250,000. Warned that the vehicle has been associated with many deaths already, Sid and Bob are soon pursued by hitman Mr. Reich and FBI Agent Jared, among others. As violence surrounds them, Sid talks his partner into stealing the car for a $500,000 ransom.', 'To keep their struggling used-car dealership from closing, salesmen Sid and Bob agree to let a vintage 1963 Pontiac LeMans sit on their lot for two days in return for $250,000. Warned that the vehicle has been associated with many deaths already, Sid and Bob are soon pursued by hitman Mr. Reich and FBI Agent Jared, among others. As violence surrounds them, Sid talks his partner into stealing the car for a $500,000 ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaDj4ET5kA5NUPn5q3aUjLMrIzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47139'),
  ('122354853796031245', 'Blood: The Last Vampire', 2000, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror', 'Hiroyuki Kitakubo, Keiichi Momose, Kazuchika Kise', 'Kenji Kamiyama', 'Youki Kudoh, Saemi Nakamura, Joe Romersa, Rebecca Forstadt, Stuart Robinson, Akira Koteyama, Tom Fahn, Fitz Houston', 'R', 'In Japan, the vampire-hunter Saya, who is a powerful original, is sent by her liaison with the government, David, posed as a teenage student to the Yokota High School on the eve of Halloween to hunt down vampires. Saya asks David to give a new katana to her. Soon she saves the school nurse Makiho Amano from two vampires disguised of classmates and Makiho witnesses her fight against the powerful demon.', 'In Japan, the vampire-hunter Saya, who is a powerful original, is sent by her liaison with the government, David, posed as a teenage student to the Yokota High School on the eve of Halloween to hunt down vampires. Saya asks David to give a new katana to her. Soon she saves the school nurse Makiho Amano from two vampires disguised of classmates and Makiho witnesses her fight against the powerful demon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRwR5lcl55n5JSaTiYPwp5KjP6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:919'),
  ('857534455362971794', 'Blood: The Last Vampire', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Chris Nahon, Poon Hang-Sang, Chia-Yi Renée Chao', 'Chris Chow', 'Gianna Jun, Allison Miller, Liam Cunningham, JJ Feild, Koyuki, Yasuaki Kurata, Michael Byrne, Colin Salmon', 'R', 'On the surface, Saya is a stunning 16-year-old, but that youthful exterior hides the tormented soul of a 400-year-old "halfling". Born to a human father and a vampire mother, she has for centuries been a loner obsessed with using her samurai skills to rid the world of vampires, all the while knowing that she herself can survive only on blood like those she hunts.', 'On the surface, Saya is a stunning 16-year-old, but that youthful exterior hides the tormented soul of a 400-year-old "halfling". Born to a human father and a vampire mother, she has for centuries been a loner obsessed with using her samurai skills to rid the world of vampires, all the while knowing that she herself can survive only on blood like those she hunts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzuYpbdFkNYqnBdOvhWqZxhHa5C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1450'),
  ('1101146986636988743', 'Bloodbath at the House of Death', 1984, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Ray Cameron, Brian West, Dusty Miller', 'Ray Cameron, Barry Cryer', 'Kenny Everett, Pamela Stephenson, Vincent Price, Gareth Hunt, Don Warrington, John Fortune, Sheila Steafel, John Stephen Hill', 'R', 'Six scientists arrive at the creepy Headstone Manor to investigate a strange phenomena which was the site of a mysterious massacre years earlier where 18 guests were killed in one night. It turns out that the house is the place of a satanic cult lead by a sinister monk who plans to kill the scientists who are inhabiting this house of Satan.', 'Six scientists arrive at the creepy Headstone Manor to investigate a strange phenomena which was the site of a mysterious massacre years earlier where 18 guests were killed in one night. It turns out that the house is the place of a satanic cult lead by a sinister monk who plans to kill the scientists who are inhabiting this house of Satan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6K5CzOmI5TFmpdJ8s0adURMY3lx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52528'),
  ('1116704639078265582', 'Bloodbrothers', 1978, 'Drama', 'Robert Mulligan, Robert Surtees', 'Walter Newman', 'Paul Sorvino, Tony Lo Bianco, Richard Gere, Lelia Goldoni, Yvonne Wilder, Kenneth McMillan, Floyd Levine, Marilu Henner', 'R', 'A young man is torn between following in his brothers'' footsteps or striking out on his own.', 'A young man is torn between following in his brothers'' footsteps or striking out on his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DDE8LoMSo5b7ob6gC2613ijQfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114096'),
  ('1051268380068296960', 'Bloodbrotherz', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Özgür Yildirim', null, 'Sido, B-Tight, Tim Wilde, Milton Welsh, Florian Renner, Claudia Eisinger, Alwara Höfels, Alpa Gun', null, 'Otis and Eddie have been best friends since childhood and live in Berlin on a day-to-day basis. No prospects, only the big dream of music. When one day a record label becomes aware of them, nothing stands in the way of living out this dream. But the record label likes to interfere and the friendship is put to the test.', 'Otis and Eddie have been best friends since childhood and live in Berlin on a day-to-day basis. No prospects, only the big dream of music. When one day a record label becomes aware of them, nothing stands in the way of living out this dream. But the record label likes to interfere and the friendship is put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hk5aw6nAwIbP08VjcRuFGlGWfFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83342'),
  ('8433538357799560', 'Bloodeaters', 1980, 'Horror', 'Charles McCrann, Jenny Lee, David Sperling', 'Charles McCrann', 'Charles McCrann, Beverly Shapiro, Dennis Helfend, Kevin Hanlon, Judith Brown, Pat Kellis, Roger Miles, Phillip Garfinkel', 'R', 'After drug crops are sprayed with a chemical by a passing airplane, the growers of the crop are poisoned by the chemical and turn into zombie-like mutants.', 'After drug crops are sprayed with a chemical by a passing airplane, the growers of the crop are poisoned by the chemical and turn into zombie-like mutants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcH558y4ygT6XTRYd4jmoW4TLIP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59734'),
  ('592473807843552995', 'Bloodfight', 1989, 'Action', 'Shuji Goto', 'Yoshiaki Kashigawa', 'Yasuaki Kurata, Simon Yam, Meg Lam Kin-Ming, Anzu Lawson, Bolo Yeung, Shinya Ono, John Ladalski, Stuart Smith', null, 'Master martial artist Masahiro Kai is a shadow of the champion fighter and trainer he once was. After his protégé was slain in a no-holds-barred, underground fight by the incomparable Chang Lee, Kai slips into a numbing alcohol-induced stupor to try to forget the past.', 'Master martial artist Masahiro Kai is a shadow of the champion fighter and trainer he once was. After his protégé was slain in a no-holds-barred, underground fight by the incomparable Chang Lee, Kai slips into a numbing alcohol-induced stupor to try to forget the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dvfxBT3OqIONZK6apAL7ERVC85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41289'),
  ('569324317254617157', 'Bloodfist', 1989, 'Action, Thriller', 'Terence H. Winkless, Ricardo Jacques Gale', 'Robert King', 'Don Wilson, Billy Blanks, Joe Mari Avellana, Rob Kaman, Cris Aguilar, Michael Shaner, Riley Bowman, Marilyn Bautista', 'R', 'To avenge the brutal murder of his brother, Jake Ray journeys to the Philippines, where his search for truth finds him battling both in and out of the ring. But the weapons are always the same: bare fists, bare feet. And the rules never change: last man standing wins.', 'To avenge the brutal murder of his brother, Jake Ray journeys to the Philippines, where his search for truth finds him battling both in and out of the ring. But the weapons are always the same: bare fists, bare feet. And the rules never change: last man standing wins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2OrhWH9sDC7weiUBcCjD3nJoO3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42552'),
  ('448188428121648701', 'Bloodfist 7: Manhunt', 1995, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jonathan Winfrey, Michael Gallagher, Franklin A. Vallette', 'Rob Kerchner, Brendan Broderick', 'Don Wilson, Jillian McWhirter, Jonathan Penner, Steven Williams, Mindy Seeger, Stephen Davies, Cyril O''Reilly, Eb Lottimer', null, 'Don "the Dragon" Wilson is a man pursued. Branded a cop-killer, he must fight simply to stay alive, and to clear his name... with the very police who framed him.', 'Don "the Dragon" Wilson is a man pursued. Branded a cop-killer, he must fight simply to stay alive, and to clear his name... with the very police who framed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eakonizynrr2Kdws2wUwuzpvFQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86524'),
  ('261052799682063570', 'Bloodfist II', 1990, 'Action', 'Andy Blumenthal, Enrique Reyes, Bruce Dorfman', 'Catherine Cyran, Michael Ferris', 'Don Wilson, Rina Reyes, Joe Mari Avellana, Robert Marius, Maurice Smith, Timothy D. Baker, James Warring, Richard Hill', null, 'Jake Ray gives up his title after killing a man in the ring. When Jake goes to Manila to help an old friend, trouble awaits him! After fending off multiple attacks, Jake is finally captured and chained to a half a dozen martial arts champions. Taken to an island fortress, they are forced to battle chemically-stimulated killers in fights to the death. To win - and to live - it will take every ounce of strength and skill in their martial arts arsenal', 'Jake Ray gives up his title after killing a man in the ring. When Jake goes to Manila to help an old friend, trouble awaits him! After fending off multiple attacks, Jake is finally captured and chained to a half a dozen martial arts champions. Taken to an island fortress, they are forced to battle chemically-stimulated killers in fights to the death. To win - and to live - it will take every ounce of strength and skill in their martial arts arsenal', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SwDkQEyMmn0k6sVn775weTHya8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76551'),
  ('574619705894678581', 'Bloodfist III: Forced to Fight', 1992, 'Action', 'Oley Sassone, Rick Bota, Scott P. Levy', 'Allison Burnett, Charlie Mattera', 'Don Wilson, Richard Roundtree, Gregory McKinney, Rick Dean, Richard Paul, Charles Boswell, John Cardone, Brad Blaisdell', null, 'Don Wilson returns to the screen as a man unjustly accused of a brutal crime. Within the prison he must fight for survival, freedom and justice.', 'Don Wilson returns to the screen as a man unjustly accused of a brutal crime. Within the prison he must fight for survival, freedom and justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfNzXRguPlRH8zMBrvcsRNsbPFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55798'),
  ('670306422641999509', 'Bloodfist IV: Die Trying', 1992, 'Action, Thriller', 'Paul Ziller, Tony Steinberg, Mike Elliott', 'Paul Ziller', 'Don Wilson, Catya Sassoon, Amanda Wyss, Kale Browne, Liz Torres, Dan Martin, Dino Homsey, Gene LeBell', null, 'When Danny unknowingly repossesses the car of a powerful arms merchant, it sets off a chain of violent retaliation. After his friends are killed and his daughter is kidnapped, Danny takes matters into his own hands. It does not matter that the CIA and the FBI are also involved the Dragon''s fire is in his fists!', 'When Danny unknowingly repossesses the car of a powerful arms merchant, it sets off a chain of violent retaliation. After his friends are killed and his daughter is kidnapped, Danny takes matters into his own hands. It does not matter that the CIA and the FBI are also involved the Dragon''s fire is in his fists!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cflxGYGbr0lLqvjMgr1u1ykCdLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82360'),
  ('317672394877768479', 'Bloodfist V: Human Target', 1994, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jeff Yonis, Marco Black, Brendan Broderick', 'Jeff Yonis', 'Don Wilson, Denice Duff, Steve James, Art Camacho, Andy Bolliger, James Burns, Brayton Carpenter, Milo Cudanes', null, 'Don "The Dragon" Wilson struggles to regain his memory, not knowing who to trust, or even which side he''s fighting on.', 'Don "The Dragon" Wilson struggles to regain his memory, not knowing who to trust, or even which side he''s fighting on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75KPRtWHUQWoiOsJIffH9k2qKsZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86367'),
