  ('863346901430295040', 'Bloodfist VIII: Trained to Kill', 1996, 'Action', 'John B. Aronson, Rick Jacobson, Marco Black', 'Alex Simon', 'Don Wilson, John Patrick White, Jillian McWhirter, Warren Burton, Donnie Hair, Richard Farrell, John McHugh, Conor Nolan', null, 'A former CIA agent lives a suburban life as a high school teacher with his teen son. When the agent is attacked by former allies because of knowledge he possesses and his son is kidnapped, he is forced back into the business and his son suddenly sees a side of his father that he never knew existed.', 'A former CIA agent lives a suburban life as a high school teacher with his teen son. When the agent is attacked by former allies because of knowledge he possesses and his son is kidnapped, he is forced back into the business and his son suddenly sees a side of his father that he never knew existed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYKuLErSJDy1ubrFhJmjniEpTw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86845'),
  ('682619224913538719', 'Bloodhounds of Broadway', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Howard Brookner, Elliot Davis', 'Damon Runyon', 'Matt Dillon, Jennifer Grey, Julie Hagerty, Rutger Hauer, Madonna, Esai Morales, Anita Morris, Randy Quaid', 'PG', 'This musical is based on four short stories by Damon Runyon. In one tale, gambler Feet Samuels sells his body to science just as he realizes that Hortense loves him and that he would rather live than die. In another story, Harriet''s parrot is killed, and she has problems dealing with her loss. Then, there is a gambler, "Regret", who has bloodhounds on his trail when he becomes a murder suspect. Finally, "The Brain" is bleeding profusely, and his friends search for a way to save his life through a blood transfusion.', 'This musical is based on four short stories by Damon Runyon. In one tale, gambler Feet Samuels sells his body to science just as he realizes that Hortense loves him and that he would rather live than die. In another story, Harriet''s parrot is killed, and she has problems dealing with her loss. Then, there is a gambler, "Regret", who has bloodhounds on his trail when he becomes a murder suspect. Finally, "The Brain" is bleeding profusely, and his friends search for a way to save his life through a blood transfusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z77iVAuCKKPehv4RXiEOr9kMP69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72096'),
  ('921581926533199124', 'Bloodknot', 1995, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama', 'Jorge Montesi, Philip Linzey, David McAree', 'Randy Kornfield', 'Patrick Dempsey, Kate Vernon, Margot Kidder, Krista Bridges, Allan Royal, Ashleigh Ann Wood, Craig Sheffer, Nancy Cser', null, 'A grieving family opens its household to an unknown woman who claims to have been their dearly departed''s girlfriend.', 'A grieving family opens its household to an unknown woman who claims to have been their dearly departed''s girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfQI7rKO49pzcFO6YzzgeuHYamS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373745'),
  ('767820492161755436', 'Bloodline', 1979, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Terence Young, Freddie Young, Gianni Cozzo', 'Laird Koenig', 'Audrey Hepburn, Ben Gazzara, James Mason, Romy Schneider, Irene Papas, Omar Sharif, Maurice Ronet, Beatrice Straight', 'R', 'A pampered heiress inherits her father''s pharmaceutical empire when he dies in a suspicious accident, and soon finds herself surrounded by ruthless board members and grasping family members who will seemingly stop at nothing to profit.', 'A pampered heiress inherits her father''s pharmaceutical empire when he dies in a suspicious accident, and soon finds herself surrounded by ruthless board members and grasping family members who will seemingly stop at nothing to profit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMiBusE5lhrZN0z4DXHlg3LXkSf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3013'),
  ('591940437092335929', 'Bloodline', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Carly Sturgeon, Heather I. Denton, Mark Jopling', 'Henry Jacobson, Will Honley, Avra Fox-Lerner', 'Seann William Scott, Mariela Garriga, Dale Dickey, Christie Herring, Larsen Thompson, Kevin Carroll, Raymond Cham Jr., Nick Boraine', 'R', 'Evan values family above all else, and anyone who gets between him, his wife, and newborn son learns that the hard way. But when it comes to violent tendencies, it seems the apple doesn’t fall far from the tree.', 'Evan values family above all else, and anyone who gets between him, his wife, and newborn son learns that the hard way. But when it comes to violent tendencies, it seems the apple doesn’t fall far from the tree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9UfbDVilnhT3fa82aTFs3O0TsA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543917'),
