  ('198351560649223276', 'Bloodlust', 1992, 'Horror, Action', 'Richard Wolstencroft, Jon Hewitt', 'Richard Wolstencroft, Jon Hewitt', 'Jane Stuart Wallace, Kelly Chapman, Robert James O''Neill, Phil Motherwell, Paul Moder, James Young, Max Crawdaddy, Ian Rilen', null, 'Three vampires wander the streets of Melbourne killing, screwing and taking drugs. They decide to carry out a heist, stealing three million and attracting the attention of various psychotics, who chase them through a blood spattered odyssey into the Melbourne underground.', 'Three vampires wander the streets of Melbourne killing, screwing and taking drugs. They decide to carry out a heist, stealing three million and attracting the attention of various psychotics, who chase them through a blood spattered odyssey into the Melbourne underground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzT2bERrQWolpK31bD2f51kQogD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76935'),
  ('975762508828933864', 'Bloodlust: Subspecies III', 1994, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Ted Nicolaou, Lara Porzak, Daniel Bărbulescu', 'Ted Nicolaou', 'Anders Hove, Denice Duff, Kevin Spirtas, Melanie Shatner, Pamela Gordon, Ion Haiduc, Michael Della Femina, Michael Denish', 'R', 'Still in the thrall of the evil vampire Radu, Michelle yearns to be taught the skills of the vampire. Meanwhile, her sister Becky tries to free her from his evil clutches, and this time, she''s brought some help.', 'Still in the thrall of the evil vampire Radu, Michelle yearns to be taught the skills of the vampire. Meanwhile, her sister Becky tries to free her from his evil clutches, and this time, she''s brought some help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tn4COQYIVDUgBFmOAtNeeiDNYZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52021'),
  ('103885251226536684', 'Bloodlust!', 1961, 'Drama, Horror, Adventure', 'Ralph Brooke, Richard E. Cunha, Leonard J. Shapiro', 'Ralph Brooke', 'Wilton Graff, June Kenney, Walter Brooke, Robert Reed, Eugene Persson, Joan Lora, Troy Patterson, Lilyan Chauvin', 'NR', 'Two couples are on a boating trip when they come across an uncharted island. The four investigate and find themselves in the clutches of Dr. Albert Balleau, whose hobby is hunting both animals and humans… The group tries to escape only to be thwarted by Dr. Balleau and his henchmen.', 'Two couples are on a boating trip when they come across an uncharted island. The four investigate and find themselves in the clutches of Dr. Albert Balleau, whose hobby is hunting both animals and humans… The group tries to escape only to be thwarted by Dr. Balleau and his henchmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWqwoB0ILwhTwyPGPZQ9FZJhjMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22749'),
  ('396394414342725963', 'Bloodmatch', 1991, 'Action', 'Albert Pyun, George Mooradian', 'K. Hannah', 'Thom Mathews, Hope Marie Carlton, Marianne Taylor, Benny Urquidez, Jason Brooks, Vincent Klyn, Michel Qissi, Christian Andrews', null, 'Brick Bardo is on a mission to find out which one of the world''s greatest kickboxers killed his brother. Five years ago, one of the four champs was fixing fights and set up his brother in the fight that took his life. Now Bardo must take on the gang in the ring for an all-out kickboxing fight to the finish.', 'Brick Bardo is on a mission to find out which one of the world''s greatest kickboxers killed his brother. Five years ago, one of the four champs was fixing fights and set up his brother in the fight that took his life. Now Bardo must take on the gang in the ring for an all-out kickboxing fight to the finish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeV0YUgkNqVQ4HupJ4wgXzFaxau.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111765'),
  ('1082352422198537384', 'Bloodmoon', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Alec Mills, John Stokes', 'Robert Brennan', 'Leon Lissek, Christine Amor, Ian Williams, Helen Thomson, Craig Cronin, Hazel Howson, Suzie MacKenzie, Anya Molina', null, 'In the small town of Coopers Bay, there are two high schools situated right next to each other. There’s Winchester, an all boys comprehensive and St Elizabeth’s, a girl’s only Catholic faculty. They are separated by woodland where pupils from both can meet and engage the things that attract the attention of maniac killers. It’s not surprising then that an unseen one begins murdering the youngsters as they fornicate, strangling them with a length of barbed wire before removing their eyes and burying them under the soil. Mary, the daughter of a Hollywood movie actress, becomes involved when the killer targets her and Kevin, her boyfriend. But who is this twisted psychopath and why does he want to kill all the kids?', 'In the small town of Coopers Bay, there are two high schools situated right next to each other. There’s Winchester, an all boys comprehensive and St Elizabeth’s, a girl’s only Catholic faculty. They are separated by woodland where pupils from both can meet and engage the things that attract the attention of maniac killers. It’s not surprising then that an unseen one begins murdering the youngsters as they fornicate, strangling them with a length of barbed wire before removing their eyes and burying them under the soil. Mary, the daughter of a Hollywood movie actress, becomes involved when the killer targets her and Kevin, her boyfriend. But who is this twisted psychopath and why does he want to kill all the kids?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BaUYIsqp0tytcOHncN6ELVE5vR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83717'),
  ('1143613064158329381', 'Bloodmoon', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Tony Leung Siu-Hung, Chad Graves, Dennis T. Benatar', 'Keith W. Strandberg', 'Gary Daniels, Chuck Jeffreys, Frank Gorshin, Darren Shahlavi, Nina Repeta, Leigh Jones, Jeffrey Pillars, Brandie Rocci', null, 'Ken O''Hara is a "Mindhunter" - a serial killer specialist enlisted to find the mass murderer intent on killing the strongest fighters in New York City. Trying to catch this cunning and clever killer is the hardest assignment Ken has ever had. Now, the moon is rising again and he must use all of his resources to hunt down the murderer....or he may be the next to die.', 'Ken O''Hara is a "Mindhunter" - a serial killer specialist enlisted to find the mass murderer intent on killing the strongest fighters in New York City. Trying to catch this cunning and clever killer is the hardest assignment Ken has ever had. Now, the moon is rising again and he must use all of his resources to hunt down the murderer....or he may be the next to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sszwRWxeqA8LvZvZKIxVmtgZBbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30948'),
  ('324417156814692047', 'Bloodrage', 1980, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Joseph Zito, João Fernandes, Joseph Scherer', 'Robert Jahn', 'Judith Marie-Bergan, Lawrence Tierney, Ian Scott, Jerry McGee, Patrick Hines, Kristen Steen, Irwin Keyes, Rita Ebenhart', null, 'A sexually frustrated young man kills hookers.', 'A sexually frustrated young man kills hookers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7b4emWz93Wz9M9Upn2SEo51F7L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28870'),
  ('717122390156898273', 'BloodRayne', 2005, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Uwe Boll, Bryan C. Knight, Marius Ivașcu', 'Guinevere Turner', 'Kristanna Loken, Ben Kingsley, Michelle Rodriguez, Michael Madsen, Matthew Davis, Will Sanderson, Geraldine Chaplin, Udo Kier', 'R', 'In 18th-century Romania, after spending much of her life in a traveling circus, human-vampire hybrid Rayne escapes and plots to take down her father, Kagan, the evil vampire king. When she''s discovered by three vampire hunters, she manages to convince them to spare her life and join her cause. But slaying a vampire as powerful as Kagan will be no easy task.', 'In 18th-century Romania, after spending much of her life in a traveling circus, human-vampire hybrid Rayne escapes and plots to take down her father, Kagan, the evil vampire king. When she''s discovered by three vampire hunters, she manages to convince them to spare her life and join her cause. But slaying a vampire as powerful as Kagan will be no easy task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Xy9uu5INNMnyF7W6BTEQkkGOZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168705'),
  ('237520401317210536', 'BloodRayne II: Deliverance', 2007, 'Horror, Western, Fantasy', 'Uwe Boll, Mathias Neumann', 'Christopher Donaldson', 'Natassia Malthe, Zack Ward, Michael Paré, Brendan Fletcher, Chris Coppola, Michael Eklund, John Novak, Chris Spencer', 'R', 'Rayne, a half-human half-vampire warrior, is in the America''s 1880''s Wild West to stop the vampired Billy the Kid and his posse of vampire cowboys.', 'Rayne, a half-human half-vampire warrior, is in the America''s 1880''s Wild West to stop the vampired Billy the Kid and his posse of vampire cowboys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7kx4ppzsBvNU0QriESvslcpWve.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17456'),
  ('834434844673728803', 'BloodRayne: The Third Reich', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror', 'Uwe Boll, Čejen Černić Čanak, Mathias Neumann', 'Michael Nachoff', 'Natassia Malthe, Brendan Fletcher, Michael Paré, Clint Howard, Annett Culp, Davorka Tovilo, Steffen Mennekes, Dušan Bućan', 'R', 'Rayne fights against the Nazis in Europe during World War II, encountering Ekart Brand, a Nazi leader whose target is to inject Adolf Hitler with Rayne''s blood in an attempt to transform him into a dhampir and attain immortality.', 'Rayne fights against the Nazis in Europe during World War II, encountering Ekart Brand, a Nazi leader whose target is to inject Adolf Hitler with Rayne''s blood in an attempt to transform him into a dhampir and attain immortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS48eBvmVXtNJGXWW5QMQmm1JbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12685'),
  ('506145913405186732', 'Bloodshot', 2020, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Lars Cox, Andre Weavind, Jacques Jouffret', 'Eric Heisserer, Jeff Wadlow', 'Vin Diesel, Eiza González, Sam Heughan, Toby Kebbell, Talulah Riley, Lamorne Morris, Guy Pearce, Jóhannes Haukur Jóhannesson', 'PG-13', 'After he and his wife are murdered, marine Ray Garrison is resurrected by a team of scientists. Enhanced with nanotechnology, he becomes a superhuman, biotech killing machine—''Bloodshot''. As Ray first trains with fellow super-soldiers, he cannot recall anything from his former life. But when his memories flood back and he remembers the man that killed both him and his wife, he breaks out of the facility to get revenge, only to discover that there''s more to the conspiracy than he thought.', 'After he and his wife are murdered, marine Ray Garrison is resurrected by a team of scientists. Enhanced with nanotechnology, he becomes a superhuman, biotech killing machine—''Bloodshot''. As Ray first trains with fellow super-soldiers, he cannot recall anything from his former life. But when his memories flood back and he remembers the man that killed both him and his wife, he breaks out of the facility to get revenge, only to discover that there''s more to the conspiracy than he thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WUVHemHFH2ZIP6NWkwlHWsyrEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338762'),
  ('678669839955646982', 'Bloodsport', 1988, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Newt Arnold, David Worth, Kenneth Siao Wai-Keung', 'Sheldon Lettich, Mel Friedman, Christopher Cosby', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Donald Gibb, Leah Ayres, Norman Burton, Forest Whitaker, Bolo Yeung, Roy Chiao, Philip Chan Yan-Kin', 'R', 'An American Army Major goes AWOL to Hong Kong for an outlawed martial arts contest called the Kumite.', 'An American Army Major goes AWOL to Hong Kong for an outlawed martial arts contest called the Kumite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kndxR9TRK0kJ5hxzDprRSS80F2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11690'),
  ('1086211725894310777', 'Bloodsport II', 1996, 'Action, Thriller', 'Alan Mehrez, Jacques Haitkin', 'Jeff Schechter', 'Daniel Bernhardt, Pat Morita, Donald Gibb, James Hong, Lori Lynn Dickerson, Philip Tan, Ong Soo Han, Nicholas Hill', 'R', 'After thief Alex Cardo gets caught while stealing an ancient katana in East Asia, he soon finds himself imprisoned and beaten up by the crowd there. One of the guards, Demon, feels upset by Alex appearance and tortures him as often as he gets the opportunity. Alex finds a friend and mentor in the jailhouse, Master Sun, who teaches him a superior fighting style called Iron Hand. When a ''best of the best kumite'' is to take place, Demon gets an invitation. Now Master Sun and Alex need to find a way to let Alex take part in the kumite too.', 'After thief Alex Cardo gets caught while stealing an ancient katana in East Asia, he soon finds himself imprisoned and beaten up by the crowd there. One of the guards, Demon, feels upset by Alex appearance and tortures him as often as he gets the opportunity. Alex finds a friend and mentor in the jailhouse, Master Sun, who teaches him a superior fighting style called Iron Hand. When a ''best of the best kumite'' is to take place, Demon gets an invitation. Now Master Sun and Alex need to find a way to let Alex take part in the kumite too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yHbsdHLHapmWaOcOcRShqWbr4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25087'),
  ('343090139193891021', 'Bloodsport III', 1996, 'Action, Thriller', 'Alan Mehrez, Kevan Lind', 'James Williams', 'Daniel Bernhardt, John Rhys-Davies, James Hong, Nicholas R. Oleson, Pat Morita, Amber Van Lent, Uni Park, J.J. Perry', 'R', 'Bloodsport III brings us back to the world of Alex Cardo. This time he must battle in a fight to end all fights - The Kumite, the most vicious warrior alive - Beast. He must not only battle for his own honor, but also avenge the death of Sun, his mentor, teacher, and spiritual "father", when Sun is spitefully killed by crime boss Duvalier. In order to defeat Beast, destroy Duvalier, and avenge Sun''s death, Alex turns to Leung to whom he was indebted in Bloodsport II. Leung directs him to the great shaman, Makato "the Judge", to whom Alex must turn for guidance. The judge teaches him to fully channel the energy in his mind and body in order to rout the Beast in the Kumite...', 'Bloodsport III brings us back to the world of Alex Cardo. This time he must battle in a fight to end all fights - The Kumite, the most vicious warrior alive - Beast. He must not only battle for his own honor, but also avenge the death of Sun, his mentor, teacher, and spiritual "father", when Sun is spitefully killed by crime boss Duvalier. In order to defeat Beast, destroy Duvalier, and avenge Sun''s death, Alex turns to Leung to whom he was indebted in Bloodsport II. Leung directs him to the great shaman, Makato "the Judge", to whom Alex must turn for guidance. The judge teaches him to fully channel the energy in his mind and body in order to rout the Beast in the Kumite...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgr8VRMyNrw8RooFuwrIxGnITVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36692'),
  ('328150393508318208', 'Bloodsport: The Dark Kumite', 1999, 'Action, Thriller', 'Elvis Restaino, George Mooradian', 'George Saunders', 'Daniel Bernhardt, Ivan Ivanov, Lisa Stothard, Stefanos Miltsakakis, Jeff Moldovan, Michael Krawic, Derek McGrath, Rositza Chorbadjiska', 'R', 'Agent John Keller goes undercover into the tough prison known as Fuego Penal to find out about the corpses of prisoners disappearing without a trace. There he gets involved in a dangerous tournament arranged by a man named Justin Caesar, where the prisoners are forced fight to death.', 'Agent John Keller goes undercover into the tough prison known as Fuego Penal to find out about the corpses of prisoners disappearing without a trace. There he gets involved in a dangerous tournament arranged by a man named Justin Caesar, where the prisoners are forced fight to death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fesxO5RKl3Hd6XIUohr66jlMdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36693'),
  ('108811497020557355', 'Bloodstone', 1988, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Dwight H. Little, Eric Anderson, Perry Husman', 'Curt Allen', 'Brett Stimely, Anna Nicholas, Jack Kehler, Rajinikanth, Charlie Brill, Christopher Neame, Tej Sapru, Bob Christo', 'PG-13', 'When a newlywed American couple goes to India on their honeymoon, little do they realize that they are about to go on the adventure of a lifetime. A huge ruby from the time of the Indian Maharajas has been stolen and placed in the backpack of the Americans. When the bad guys realize this, they kidnap the wife... Now the husband and his Indian friend (played by a famous Tamil Indian actor) must go out to save her.', 'When a newlywed American couple goes to India on their honeymoon, little do they realize that they are about to go on the adventure of a lifetime. A huge ruby from the time of the Indian Maharajas has been stolen and placed in the backpack of the Americans. When the bad guys realize this, they kidnap the wife... Now the husband and his Indian friend (played by a famous Tamil Indian actor) must go out to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2zQTJ67EiPlZ7VwmjOZDYuJTnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42248'),
  ('960132388379519751', 'Bloodstone: Subspecies II', 1993, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Ted Nicolaou, Lara Porzak, Daniel Bărbulescu', 'Ted Nicolaou', 'Anders Hove, Denice Duff, Ion Haiduc, Michael Denish, Kevin Spirtas, Melanie Shatner, Pamela Gordon, Tudorel Filimon', 'R', 'Continuing after the first "Subspecies", a woman who has just become a vampire tries to escape the evil vampire, Radu, who seeks her as his love interest. But she has taken the vampire family''s bloodstone, and now Radu must find her to get it back. While her sister comes to Romania to save her soul. It might be too late....', 'Continuing after the first "Subspecies", a woman who has just become a vampire tries to escape the evil vampire, Radu, who seeks her as his love interest. But she has taken the vampire family''s bloodstone, and now Radu must find her to get it back. While her sister comes to Romania to save her soul. It might be too late....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbwXXBWDk3XPAZL61GCLVzl7yKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52017'),
  ('620714857796632913', 'Bloodsuckers', 2005, 'Horror', 'Eric J. Goldstein, Matthew Hastings', 'Matthew Hastings', 'Joe Lando, Dominic Zamprogna, Natassia Malthe, Aaron Pearl, A. J. Cook, Michael DeLuise, Michael Ironside, David Palffy', 'R', 'A captain leads a team of commandos searching for vampires in the universe.', 'A captain leads a team of commandos searching for vampires in the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvcTgJIGNtDTUo4Rks2LMKd8EdC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9755'),
  ('587410331511923693', 'Bloodsuckers', 2022, 'Drama, Fantasy, History, Horror', 'Julian Radlmaier, Markus Koob', 'Julian Radlmaier', 'Alexandre Koberidze, Lilith Stangenberg, Alexander Herbst, Corinna Harfouch, Andreas Döhler, Daniel Hoesl, Kyung-Taek Lie, Darja Lewin Chalem', null, '1928: Lyovuschka, a Soviet worker, is cast in the role of Trotsky for Eisenstein‘s latest film, but quickly finds his dreams of an actor‘s life shattered when Trotsky falls into Stalin‘s disfavor. Exiled from his homeland, he poses as a wealthy baron and finds himself stuck in a glamorous seaside resort in Germany awaiting a barge that will take him to Hollywood. A summer romance kicks off when he meets the eccentric factory owner Octavia Flambow-Jansen - it''s just too bad there are vampires around.', '1928: Lyovuschka, a Soviet worker, is cast in the role of Trotsky for Eisenstein‘s latest film, but quickly finds his dreams of an actor‘s life shattered when Trotsky falls into Stalin‘s disfavor. Exiled from his homeland, he poses as a wealthy baron and finds himself stuck in a glamorous seaside resort in Germany awaiting a barge that will take him to Hollywood. A summer romance kicks off when he meets the eccentric factory owner Octavia Flambow-Jansen - it''s just too bad there are vampires around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOKtPIOOYzyNuNhzFt7gC2zQFHQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633811'),
  ('360447186272587934', 'Bloodsuckers from Outer Space', 1984, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Glen Coburn', 'Glen Coburn', 'Thom Meyers, Laura Ellis, Dennis Letts, Glen Coburn, Robert Bradeen, Rick Garlington, Wayne Greene, Christopher Heldman', null, 'A mysterious and invisible alien presence has landed in rural Texas and has started turning the nearby townspeople into white-faced, bloodthirsty killers. As the local authorities begin to investigate the strange and violent goings on, a photographer and his girlfriend find themselves trapped in the midst of an unexpected rural bloodbath, which seeks to turn them into another pair of bloodsuckers from outer space...', 'A mysterious and invisible alien presence has landed in rural Texas and has started turning the nearby townspeople into white-faced, bloodthirsty killers. As the local authorities begin to investigate the strange and violent goings on, a photographer and his girlfriend find themselves trapped in the midst of an unexpected rural bloodbath, which seeks to turn them into another pair of bloodsuckers from outer space...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdKy8oLJm36O0DmEO5ZgVUH21FQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82407'),
  ('455027208816688426', 'Bloodsucking Bastards', 2015, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Brian James O''Connell, Matt Mosher', 'Dr. God, Ryan Mitts', 'Fran Kranz, Joey Kern, Joel Murray, Pedro Pascal, Emma Fitzpatrick, Zabeth Russell, Yvette Yates Redick, Justin Ware', 'NR', 'A down on his luck cubicle worker and his slacker best friend discover their new boss is a vampire who is turning their coworkers into the un-dead.', 'A down on his luck cubicle worker and his slacker best friend discover their new boss is a vampire who is turning their coworkers into the un-dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymDJQsmDSgQ4IGZAxW4aR0WpVAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317981'),
  ('16547762356530345', 'Bloodsucking Pharaohs in Pittsburgh', 1991, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Dean Tschetter, Peter Reniers, Alan Smithee', 'Tom Tully', 'Jake Dengel, Joe Sharkey, Susann Fletcher, Beverly Penberthy, Veronica Hart, Shawn Elliott, Pat Logan, Don Brockett', 'R', 'A police detective teams up with his buddy''s daughter to investigate cult-ritual mutilations.', 'A police detective teams up with his buddy''s daughter to investigate cult-ritual mutilations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqWD8Vyp5aCchbi4Zs8NvT9KhP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27207'),
  ('1097782459793122987', 'Bloodthirsty', 2021, 'Horror', 'Dave Alexander, Charles Hamilton, Karlee Mctavish', 'Lowell, Wendy Hill-Tout', 'Lauren Beatty, Greg Bryk, Katharine King So, Michael Ironside, Judith Buchan, Jayce McKenzie, Jesse Gervais, Michael Peterson', 'NR', 'When indie singer Grey struggles to write her sophomore album, she teams up with a mysterious producer at his secluded cabin. Though their bond strengthens her music, it also starts to irreparably alter Grey’s body and mind.', 'When indie singer Grey struggles to write her sophomore album, she teams up with a mysterious producer at his secluded cabin. Though their bond strengthens her music, it also starts to irreparably alter Grey’s body and mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49a2fQEFO2R190Ng5ksJedRJun6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741636'),
  ('399837850515107114', 'Bloodthirsty Butchers', 1970, 'Horror', 'Andy Milligan, Andy Milligan', 'John Borske, Andy Milligan', 'John Miranda, Annabella Wood, Berwick Kaler, Jane Hilary, Michael Cox, Linda Driver, Susan Cassidy, William Barrel', 'R', 'Sweeney Todd, a barber, and Maggie Lovett, a baker, join forces to commit a series of brutal, gory murders in London with a little help from Tobias Ragg, an employee of Maggie''s bakery. They abduct a number of customers from the barber shop and kill them, baking them into meat pies which are sold to the public.', 'Sweeney Todd, a barber, and Maggie Lovett, a baker, join forces to commit a series of brutal, gory murders in London with a little help from Tobias Ragg, an employee of Maggie''s bakery. They abduct a number of customers from the barber shop and kill them, baking them into meat pies which are sold to the public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gB9ODp6CilQybsB2akaMDvlWNn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88374'),
  ('459393316471970373', 'Bloody Angels', 1998, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Karin Julsrud, Philip Øgaard', 'Finn Gjerdrum, Kjetil Indregard', 'Reidar Sørensen, Jon Øigarden, Gaute Skjegstad, Trond Høvik, Stig Henrik Hoff, Laila Goody, Simon Norrthon, Kjersti Holmen', null, 'A few months after a girl with developmental disabilities is murdered in the remote village Høtten, the two young men who most townsfolk think killed her go missing. A police detective is sent to investigate and finds this very challenging.', 'A few months after a girl with developmental disabilities is murdered in the remote village Høtten, the two young men who most townsfolk think killed her go missing. A police detective is sent to investigate and finds this very challenging.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCgqS3j44rZLCBOlYyhOxLhJtKk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88727'),
  ('483971974887913559', 'Bloody April Fools', 2013, 'Horror', 'Carlos Alonso-Ojea, Dídac Cervera, Marta Díaz de Lope Díaz', 'Carlos Alonso-Ojea, Albert Camps, Dídac Cervera', 'Mario Marzo, Charlotte Vega, Àlex Batllori, Diana Gómez, Joan Amargós Rubert, Enric Auquer, Bàrbara Mestanza, Aleix Melé', null, 'Nine young friends get lost on their way to spending April Fools Day together. Instead of letting the entire trip go to waste, they decide to go party at an old abandoned inn called 12 Hills. Rumor has it that the place has curse that comes to life every April 1st. Despite the warnings from the locals, the friends decide to go ahead with their April Fools Day plan. It''s all partying, sex and alcohol until victims of sick, deadly jokes start to appear.', 'Nine young friends get lost on their way to spending April Fools Day together. Instead of letting the entire trip go to waste, they decide to go party at an old abandoned inn called 12 Hills. Rumor has it that the place has curse that comes to life every April 1st. Despite the warnings from the locals, the friends decide to go ahead with their April Fools Day plan. It''s all partying, sex and alcohol until victims of sick, deadly jokes start to appear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1P7trAE5zwezsoIHcLyLAyOIaVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228263'),
  ('536580381609012361', 'Bloody Axe Wound', 2024, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Matthew John Lawrence, Kyle I. Kelley, Becky Losito', 'Matthew John Lawrence', 'Sari Arambulo, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Billy Burke, Chet Siegel, David Littleton, Matt Hopkins, Eddie Leavy, Molly Brown', null, 'Abbie Bladecut is a teenager torn between the macabre traditions of her family’s bloody trade and the tender stirrings of her first crush. In the small town of Clover Falls, Abbie’s father Roger has built an infamous legacy by capturing real-life killings on tape and selling them to eager customers, but as Abbie delves deeper into the grisly family business, she begins to wonder if it’s time to take the family tradition in a new direction.', 'Abbie Bladecut is a teenager torn between the macabre traditions of her family’s bloody trade and the tender stirrings of her first crush. In the small town of Clover Falls, Abbie’s father Roger has built an infamous legacy by capturing real-life killings on tape and selling them to eager customers, but as Abbie delves deeper into the grisly family business, she begins to wonder if it’s time to take the family tradition in a new direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dS9sU5JGnkmEVZ9ubgnJa6RMLwx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1396558'),
  ('484493743651792949', 'Bloody Beach', 2000, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery', 'Kim In-soo, Kim Yun-su', 'Son Kwang-soo, No Zin-soo', 'Lala Teresa, Jae Hee, Lee Jung-jin, Yang Dong-geun, Lee Seung-chae, Lee Se-eun, Kim Gyu-ri', null, 'A group of Internet chatters decides to spend the summer together at a beach, renting an apartment and trying to know each other for real (or maybe they just want to have sex). Apparently a guy named "Sandmanz" committed suicide when he was ousted from the chatroom, and the group has split opinions on the matter. Some think he was just a psycho with no life, and he had it coming. Some others, like Yoo-na (the one who got closer to him), think that someone spread lies to force him to quit. Suddenly, the group is decimated by a mysterious figure who keeps e-mailing everyone that his/her fate will not be unlike Sandmanz''s. The search for the killer begins, while people die right and left. (lovehkfilm.com)', 'A group of Internet chatters decides to spend the summer together at a beach, renting an apartment and trying to know each other for real (or maybe they just want to have sex). Apparently a guy named "Sandmanz" committed suicide when he was ousted from the chatroom, and the group has split opinions on the matter. Some think he was just a psycho with no life, and he had it coming. Some others, like Yoo-na (the one who got closer to him), think that someone spread lies to force him to quit. Suddenly, the group is decimated by a mysterious figure who keeps e-mailing everyone that his/her fate will not be unlike Sandmanz''s. The search for the killer begins, while people die right and left. (lovehkfilm.com)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xM2zczPDdfaHqcH3BKaWKK1LHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78452'),
  ('668380408749050798', 'Bloody Beast', 1994, 'Horror, Crime', 'Tak-Sing Tam, Lee San-Yip, Yang Chuan', 'Jimmy Leung Chi-Ming', 'Lawrence Ng Kai-Wah, Lau Siu-Ming, Joey Fan Oi-Kit, Eugina Lau Mei-Guen, Kent Tong Chun-Yip, William Ho, Wang Pei Chin, Jack Wong', null, 'After having been sexually aroused and then humiliated by a woman who was breast-feeding her baby while he was a child, a young man named Chen Siu-hsiong (Lawrence Ng) will go on a wild murder spree where he will kill every woman that he see breast-feeding her child in public.', 'After having been sexually aroused and then humiliated by a woman who was breast-feeding her baby while he was a child, a young man named Chen Siu-hsiong (Lawrence Ng) will go on a wild murder spree where he will kill every woman that he see breast-feeding her child in public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OBDLdf7kezDD8ZMK8aLGGWOsZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228269'),
  ('692334279911393312', 'Bloody Birthday', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ed Hunt, Stephen L. Posey', 'Ed Hunt, Barry Pearson', 'Lori Lethin, Melinda Cordell, Julie Brown, Susan Strasberg, José Ferrer, Joe Penny, Bert Kramer, Elizabeth Hoy', 'R', 'In 1970, three children are born at the height of a total eclipse. Due to the sun and moon blocking Saturn, which controls emotions, they have become heartless killers ten years later, and are able to escape detection because of their youthful and innocent facades. A boy and his teenage sister become endangered when they stumble onto the bloody truth.', 'In 1970, three children are born at the height of a total eclipse. Due to the sun and moon blocking Saturn, which controls emotions, they have become heartless killers ten years later, and are able to escape detection because of their youthful and innocent facades. A boy and his teenage sister become endangered when they stumble onto the bloody truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NHxjIQI6lpMo7gYCOFBrLH4WuN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55538'),
  ('966535107879332070', 'Bloody Chainsaw Girl', 2016, 'Action, Horror, Comedy', 'Takeshi Sone, Yasutaka Yuuki, Takato Kaede', 'Mitsunori Fukuhara', 'Rio Uchida, Mari Yamachi, Seira Sato, Yuki Tamaki, Kayako Okuda, Seijiro Nakamura, Rei Nishimura, Yuki Tamaki', null, 'Giko Nokomura is a delinquent girl and a senior in middle school. She struggles to kill zombies who were her classmates.', 'Giko Nokomura is a delinquent girl and a senior in middle school. She struggles to kill zombies who were her classmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfdEZms32JXbfl5f5TBXMFwOFSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359279'),
  ('807005270690615482', 'Bloody Chainsaw Girl Returns: Giko Awakens', 2019, 'Action, Horror', 'Hiroki Yamaguchi', 'Mitsunori Fukuhara', 'Nana Asakawa, ano, Nanami Hidaka, Momoko Kaechi, Asana Mamoru, Izumi Sano, Jun Aonami, Rio Uchida', null, 'There is a schoolgirl who carries her own personal chainsaw. She was attacked by a dead body who was created by her classmate one day. As such, she does not understand why she was attacked by a classmate. To find the answer she ventures into the enemy''s base. There she finds out the reason for the assault.', 'There is a schoolgirl who carries her own personal chainsaw. She was attacked by a dead body who was created by her classmate one day. As such, she does not understand why she was attacked by a classmate. To find the answer she ventures into the enemy''s base. There she finds out the reason for the assault.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LCf25U5wWpqy1EeIxdOyawNf5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601419'),
  ('176407265752424198', 'Bloody Chainsaw Girl Returns: Revenge of Nero', 2019, 'Action, Horror', 'Hiroki Yamaguchi, Takeshi Sone', 'Mitsunori Fukuhara', 'Nana Asakawa, ano, Asana Mamoru, Nanami Hidaka, Momoko Kaechi, Ayumi Kurokawa, Sasa Handa', null, 'Giko Nokomura is a female student at Nightingale Academy, who carries around her very own chainsaw. One day she begins to be attacked by modified corpses created by one of her classmates, Nero Aoi . She tears her way through the corpses and busts into Nero''s hideout. Why is Nero so intent on attacking Giko?! The reason will shock you!After her battle with Nero, she encounters a new enemy. It''s the leader of the Nightingale Academy Student Council Guardians, Nemesis.', 'Giko Nokomura is a female student at Nightingale Academy, who carries around her very own chainsaw. One day she begins to be attacked by modified corpses created by one of her classmates, Nero Aoi . She tears her way through the corpses and busts into Nero''s hideout. Why is Nero so intent on attacking Giko?! The reason will shock you!After her battle with Nero, she encounters a new enemy. It''s the leader of the Nightingale Academy Student Council Guardians, Nemesis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kx7PKp2aYqh2MtbBBMQsFXCI4kk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592452'),
  ('76171838847048550', 'Bloody Daddy', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Ali Abbas Zafar, Marcin Łaskawiec', 'Aditya Basu, Ali Abbas Zafar', 'Shahid Kapoor, Ronit Roy, Rajeev Khandelwal, Diana Penty, Sartaaj Kakkar, Sanjay Kapoor, Zeishan Quadri, Mukesh Bhatt', null, 'Sumair Azad, a dirty cop and his friend, Jaggi, steal Sikandar Chowdhary''s cocaine bag. As a result, Sikandar kidnaps Sumair''s son, but things take a turn when he loses the cocaine bag as he faces off Gurugram’s drug lords, a crime boss, murderous narcs and straight cops on one fateful night.', 'Sumair Azad, a dirty cop and his friend, Jaggi, steal Sikandar Chowdhary''s cocaine bag. As a result, Sikandar kidnaps Sumair''s son, but things take a turn when he loses the cocaine bag as he faces off Gurugram’s drug lords, a crime boss, murderous narcs and straight cops on one fateful night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gX8k6oKpIsWHpfWNz3Bu4wUuliA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1014390'),
  ('1077677363636217239', 'Bloody Daughter', 2012, 'Documentary, Music', 'Stéphanie Argerich', 'Stéphanie Argerich', 'Martha Argerich, Stephen Kovacevitch, Annie Dutoit, Lyda Chen', null, 'An atypical family portrait, directed by 34-year old Stéphanie Argerich, the daughter of pianists Martha Argerich and Stephen Kovacevich. The filmmaker follows her mother in particular, during concerts and in moments of greater intimacy, searching for answers that might shed light on the private spaces of a family that has always lived in the limelight of the international stage, where gaiety and madness rub shoulders with an absolute and overwhelming passion: music.', 'An atypical family portrait, directed by 34-year old Stéphanie Argerich, the daughter of pianists Martha Argerich and Stephen Kovacevich. The filmmaker follows her mother in particular, during concerts and in moments of greater intimacy, searching for answers that might shed light on the private spaces of a family that has always lived in the limelight of the international stage, where gaiety and madness rub shoulders with an absolute and overwhelming passion: music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPrRD4U7zrvthMBHiXYfwklobwE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181064'),
  ('660440160096190797', 'Bloody Escape: Bats Out of Hell', 2024, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Goro Taniguchi', 'Shingo Nagai, Goro Taniguchi', 'Yuki Ono, Reina Ueda, Soma Saito, Yuma Uchida, Satsuki Yukino, Masayo Kurata, Jun Fukuyama, Ryotaro Okiayu', 'PG-13', 'After being turned into a cyborg, Kisaragi faces pursuit from vampires and vengeful yakuza.', 'After being turned into a cyborg, Kisaragi faces pursuit from vampires and vengeful yakuza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWKtVX5oEgcLbMYMaWiyes6c4IB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1103432'),
  ('1095669689501146553', 'Bloody Flesh', 1983, 'Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Carlos Mayolo, Gabriel Beristain', 'Elsa Vásquez, Carlos Mayolo, Jorge Nieto', 'Adriana Herrán, David Guerrero, Santiago García, Vicky Hernández, Carlos Mayolo, Sebastian Ospina, Luis Ospina, Lina Uribe', null, 'August 6, 1956 during the military dictatorship of Rojas Pinilla. A military convoy loaded with dynamite explodes in the center of Cali, destroying a good part of the traditional buildings of the city and exposing the roots of some houses that for years had kept the secret stories of their inhabitants.', 'August 6, 1956 during the military dictatorship of Rojas Pinilla. A military convoy loaded with dynamite explodes in the center of Cali, destroying a good part of the traditional buildings of the city and exposing the roots of some houses that for years had kept the secret stories of their inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4eRza7cQbsdDvtULr62x8xFQbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308572'),
  ('565884633693562695', 'Bloody Friday', 1972, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Rolf Olsen, Franz Xaver Lederle', 'Rolf Olsen', 'Raimund Harmstorf, Amadeus August, Gianni Macchia, Christine Böhm, Ernst H. Hilbich, Gila von Weitershausen, Daniela Giordano, Walter Buschhoff', null, 'Womanizing thug Klett is sprung from the courthouse by two accomplices, then sets about planning the big heist of a local bank, equipped with a cache of high-powered weapons he''s acquired from an American army outpost. Together with his faithful protégé, who reluctantly on-boards his young girlfriend and her AWOL brother, the quartet bumble their way through the supposedly full-proof plan that aims to deliver them a cool million in cash and a new life in Australia. Predictably, things deteriorate quickly at every turn.', 'Womanizing thug Klett is sprung from the courthouse by two accomplices, then sets about planning the big heist of a local bank, equipped with a cache of high-powered weapons he''s acquired from an American army outpost. Together with his faithful protégé, who reluctantly on-boards his young girlfriend and her AWOL brother, the quartet bumble their way through the supposedly full-proof plan that aims to deliver them a cool million in cash and a new life in Australia. Predictably, things deteriorate quickly at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuleMJ914wU6Xz9CZVJHCq1WNzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28358'),
  ('581593434206997475', 'Bloody Hell', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy, Action, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alister Grierson, Brad Shield', 'Robert Benjamin', 'Ben O''Toole, Meg Fraser, Caroline Craig, Matthew Sunderland, Travis Jeffery, Jack Finsterer, David Hill, Joshua Brennan', 'R', 'A man with a mysterious past flees the country to escape his own personal hell... only to arrive somewhere much worse. In an effort to survive this new horror, he turns to his personified conscience.', 'A man with a mysterious past flees the country to escape his own personal hell... only to arrive somewhere much worse. In an effort to survive this new horror, he turns to his personified conscience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73I98oHHWEaAmp6UwTdE3tJkHCq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696822'),
  ('759851401171256', 'Bloody Kids', 1980, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Stephen Frears, Chris Menges', 'Stephen Poliakoff', 'Derrick O''Connor, Gary Holton, Richard Thomas, Peter Clark, Gwyneth Strong, Caroline Embling, Jack Douglas, Billy Colvill', null, 'Two boys pull a Saturday night prank on the police in a seaside British town.', 'Two boys pull a Saturday night prank on the police in a seaside British town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kveHwNK0j8jAtiiY7Fz792JCo7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83485'),
  ('65191867485493243', 'Bloody Mallory', 2002, 'Fantasy, Horror, Action, Comedy, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Julien Magnat, Sophie Cadet, Richard Mercier', 'Julien Magnat, Stéphane Kazandjian', 'Olivia Bonamy, Adrià Collado, Jeffrey Ribier, Valentina Vargas, Thylda Barès, Julien Boisselier, Dominique Frot, Laurent Spielvogel', null, 'Mallory is the head of an elite government-run strike force dedicated to combating the supernatural. Her team includes the drag queen Vena Cava, an explosives expert; a mute, pre-teen telepath capable of possessing others named Talking Tina; and an armed governmental agent named Durand.', 'Mallory is the head of an elite government-run strike force dedicated to combating the supernatural. Her team includes the drag queen Vena Cava, an explosives expert; a mute, pre-teen telepath capable of possessing others named Talking Tina; and an armed governmental agent named Durand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2hKsgJQpTd17rf6uSrywFkEEQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24829'),
  ('200055372799309132', 'Bloody Mama', 1970, 'Crime, Drama', 'Roger Corman, John A. Alonzo, Gary Grillo', 'Robert Thom', 'Shelley Winters, Pat Hingle, Don Stroud, Diane Varsi, Bruce Dern, Clint Kimbrough, Robert De Niro, Robert Walden', 'R', 'Sexually abused as a young girl, Kate "Ma" Barker grows into a violent and powerful woman by the 1930s. She lovingly dominates her grown sons and grooms them into a pack of tough crooks. The boys include the cruel Herman, who still shares a bed with Ma; Fred, an ex-con who fell in love with a fellow prisoner; and Lloyd, who gets high on whatever''s handy. Together they form a deadly, bizarre family of Depression-era bandits.', 'Sexually abused as a young girl, Kate "Ma" Barker grows into a violent and powerful woman by the 1930s. She lovingly dominates her grown sons and grooms them into a pack of tough crooks. The boys include the cruel Herman, who still shares a bed with Ma; Fred, an ex-con who fell in love with a fellow prisoner; and Lloyd, who gets high on whatever''s handy. Together they form a deadly, bizarre family of Depression-era bandits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nC3hrqu28L6eEC88MIN4hccARod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31581'),
  ('645396490130626412', 'Bloody Mary', 2007, 'Horror', 'Holly Y. Black, Bill Summers, Richard Valentine', 'Richard Valentine', 'Anna Pippus, Amber Borycki, Jaason Simmons, Kim Tyler, Matt Borlenghi, Danni Ravden, Cory Monteith, Eero Johnson', 'NR', 'When a group of psychiatric hospital nurses invoke the spirit of Bloody Mary -- a supposed urban myth -- the slaughter begins. The legend is real, her vengeance is fatal, and to free her, all you have to do is say her name.', 'When a group of psychiatric hospital nurses invoke the spirit of Bloody Mary -- a supposed urban myth -- the slaughter begins. The legend is real, her vengeance is fatal, and to free her, all you have to do is say her name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cM3F9T96ugiohokjXzKYZmjQn0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28344'),
  ('69397268432030504', 'Bloody Milk', 2017, 'Drama', 'Sébastien Goepfert, Hubert Charuel', 'Claude Le Pape, Hubert Charuel', 'Swann Arlaud, Sara Giraudeau, Bouli Lanners, Isabelle Candelier, Valentin Lespinasse, Clément Bresson, India Hair, Jean Charuel', null, 'Pierre, in his thirties, is a breeder of dairy cattle. His life revolves around his farm, his veterinarian sister and his parents whose livestock he took over. As the first cases of a zoonotic outbreak are reported in France, Pierre discovers that one of his animals is infected. He cannot cope with the perspective of losing the whole herd. They are everything he has and he will do whatever it takes to save them.', 'Pierre, in his thirties, is a breeder of dairy cattle. His life revolves around his farm, his veterinarian sister and his parents whose livestock he took over. As the first cases of a zoonotic outbreak are reported in France, Pierre discovers that one of his animals is infected. He cannot cope with the perspective of losing the whole herd. They are everything he has and he will do whatever it takes to save them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dG5nkpW9F4r0zlTlzKlhgJ0lIjM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453350'),
  ('34735607632390475', 'Bloody Moon', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jesús Franco, Lina Romay, Juan Soler', 'Erich Tomek', 'Olivia Pascal, Christoph Moosbrugger, Nadja Gerganoff, Alexander Waechter, Jasmin Losensky, Corinna Drews, Ann-Beate Engelke, Peter Exacoustos', 'NR', 'After being released from a mental asylum, a disfigured man becomes obsessed with a student at his sister’s boarding school while grappling with his dark past.', 'After being released from a mental asylum, a disfigured man becomes obsessed with a student at his sister’s boarding school while grappling with his dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5pDNuOifUKeCUBgLXyXllaLukf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39918'),
  ('259137905066317247', 'Bloody Murder', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ralph E. Portillo, Jeff Spielman, Kevin Utsler', 'John R. Stevenson', 'Jessica Morris, Peter Guillemette, Patrick Cavanaugh, Crystalle Ford, Tracy Pacheco, David Smigelski, Michael Stone, Justin Ross Martin', 'R', 'Julie McConnell is one of a dozen camp counselors working to re-open a summer camp when a series of murders and disappearances begin commited by a hockey masked killer who may be the urban legend killer Trevor Moorehouse. When Julie looks into the murders by herself, she finds that she may be the killer''s next target when she gets too close to some dark secrets of the camp which may lead to the killer''s identity.', 'Julie McConnell is one of a dozen camp counselors working to re-open a summer camp when a series of murders and disappearances begin commited by a hockey masked killer who may be the urban legend killer Trevor Moorehouse. When Julie looks into the murders by herself, she finds that she may be the killer''s next target when she gets too close to some dark secrets of the camp which may lead to the killer''s identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vBCxeGUoNxrm49ZIkTn3OQ6lnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89345'),
  ('725916722517892942', 'Bloody Murder 2: Closing Camp', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kazuo Minami, David Trulli, Rob Spera', 'John R. Stevenson', 'Katy Woodruff, Tyler Sedustine, Kelly Gunning, Tiffany Shepis, Amanda Magarian, Raymond Novarro Smith, Arthur Benjamin, Tom Mullen', 'R', 'Coming to Placid Pines is difficult for Tracy, who''s brother, Jason, was one of Trevor''s victims near the end of the original. When Tracy''s nightmares begin to come true as one by one the counselors are murdered. Someone is hunting them through the pitch-black Forest and is determined to kill them all. Could Trevor Moorhouse be back?!', 'Coming to Placid Pines is difficult for Tracy, who''s brother, Jason, was one of Trevor''s victims near the end of the original. When Tracy''s nightmares begin to come true as one by one the counselors are murdered. Someone is hunting them through the pitch-black Forest and is determined to kill them all. Could Trevor Moorhouse be back?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KMg0Sk5ul6SdISAAf0KEafZJYq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103971'),
  ('59649727344608673', 'Bloody Muscle Body Builder in Hell', 1995, 'Horror', 'Shinichi Fukazawa, Shinichi Okuda', 'Shinichi Fukazawa', 'Shinichi Fukazawa, Asako Nosaka, Masaaki Kai, Masahiro Kai, Aki Tama Mai', null, 'After a surprise phone call interrupts his daily workout, beefy body builder Naoto agrees to meet his photojournalist ex-girlfriend to help with her research on haunted houses. Accompanied by a professional psychic, they visit an abandoned house once owned by Naoto''s father. But inside the house a dark secret lingers and they find themselves trapped and tormented by a relentless ghost with a 30 year grudge.', 'After a surprise phone call interrupts his daily workout, beefy body builder Naoto agrees to meet his photojournalist ex-girlfriend to help with her research on haunted houses. Accompanied by a professional psychic, they visit an abandoned house once owned by Naoto''s father. But inside the house a dark secret lingers and they find themselves trapped and tormented by a relentless ghost with a 30 year grudge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpGVSCvxw4ptuIil0TfMhZhy71O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393404'),
  ('126243313866519325', 'Bloody New Year', 1987, 'Horror', 'Norman J. Warren, John Shann, Robert Champion', 'Hayden Pearce, Frazer Pearce, Norman J. Warren', 'Suzy Aitchison, Nikki Brooks, Colin Heywood, Mark Powley, Catherine Roman, Julian Ronnie, Steve Emerson, Steve Wilsher', 'R', 'A group of friends take refuge in an island hotel decorated for New Year''s. The problem is, it''s early summer, and soon enough, even the walls themselves are striking out against them.', 'A group of friends take refuge in an island hotel decorated for New Year''s. The problem is, it''s early summer, and soon enough, even the walls themselves are striking out against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSYQYBj2TqDWjQfP26AKNaiUlbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30478'),
