  ('249616528426954667', 'Bloody Oranges', 2021, 'Comedy, Horror, Crime, Drama', 'Jean-Christophe Meurisse, Javier Ruiz Gómez', 'Jean-Christophe Meurisse, Amélie Philippe, Yohann Gloaguen', 'Alexandre Steiger, Christophe Paou, Lilith Grasmug, Olivier Saladin, Lorella Cravotta, Fred Blin, Denis Podalydès, Blanche Gardin', null, 'Simultaneously, a retired couple overwhelmed by debt tries to win a dance contest, as the minister of economy is suspected of tax evasion, and a teenage girl encounters a sexual maniac, while a young lawyer attempts to climb the social ladder. When the shoe drops, the winner won’t necessarily be the one we expected.', 'Simultaneously, a retired couple overwhelmed by debt tries to win a dance contest, as the minister of economy is suspected of tax evasion, and a teenage girl encounters a sexual maniac, while a young lawyer attempts to climb the social ladder. When the shoe drops, the winner won’t necessarily be the one we expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLaYBkXhqPEsJIR4kipMCWt6Of3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833404'),
  ('1069562445290354813', 'Bloody Parrot', 1981, 'Horror, Action, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Hua Shan, Nico Wong Man-Wan', 'Ni Kuang', 'Jason Pai Piao, Tony Liu Tian-jue, Kwan Fung, Yeung Ching-Ching, Chan Shen, Eddie Koo Koon Chung, Wong Mei-Mei, Jenny Liang', null, 'An expert swordsman is suspected of being the thief of a treasure sent to the Emperor, having nothing to do with the theft, the swordsman investigates and is led on the trail of the supernatural "Bloody Parrot".', 'An expert swordsman is suspected of being the thief of a treasure sent to the Emperor, having nothing to do with the theft, the swordsman investigates and is led on the trail of the supernatural "Bloody Parrot".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvePJGG7MDeLPnF68p8YgBXCFMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63440'),
  ('315211061834564679', 'Bloody Pit of Horror', 1965, 'Horror', 'Massimo Pupillo, Luciano Trasatti, Massimo Castellani', 'Roberto Natale, Romano Migliorini', 'Mickey Hargitay, Walter Brandi, Luisa Baratto, Ralph Zucker, Rita Klein, Alfredo Rizzo, Barbara Nelli, Moa Tahi', null, 'A photographer and his models go to an old, abandoned castle for a photo shoot. Unbeknownst to them, the castle is inhabited by a lunatic who believes himself to be the reincarnated spirit of a 17th-century executioner whose job it is to protect the castle against intruders.', 'A photographer and his models go to an old, abandoned castle for a photo shoot. Unbeknownst to them, the castle is inhabited by a lunatic who believes himself to be the reincarnated spirit of a 17th-century executioner whose job it is to protect the castle against intruders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCBV9KEvgGx5CseJAaPt0r7zX9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22758'),
  ('745952324340167227', 'Bloody Reunion', 2006, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Lim Dae-wung, Kim Yun-su', 'Park Se-yeol', 'Oh Mi-hee, Seo Young-hee, Jang Seong-won, Kim Eung-soo, Kim Young-sun, Lee Ji-hyeon, Mun Ka-young, Yeo Hyun-soo', null, 'Mi-ja, who has been taking care of a retired teacher, Ms. Park, invites several of her former students to her house 16 years after their graduation. Since the end of her teaching career, Park has been residing in the countryside, suffering from an illness while an ex-student, the kind and pretty Mi-ja cares for her.', 'Mi-ja, who has been taking care of a retired teacher, Ms. Park, invites several of her former students to her house 16 years after their graduation. Since the end of her teaching career, Park has been residing in the countryside, suffering from an illness while an ex-student, the kind and pretty Mi-ja cares for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTlqhcERlOwaWUV2e12yCTJ9ZeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27428'),
  ('152806930034411634', 'Bloody Richard', 2017, 'Music', 'Roberta Torre, Matteo Cocco, Giulio Donato', 'Valerio Bariletti, Roberta Torre', 'Sonia Bergamasco, Massimo Ranieri, Silvia Calderoni, Silvia Gallerano, Tommaso Ragno, Antonella Lo Coco, Drusilla Foer', null, 'Riccardo Mancini (Ranieri) is discharged from the forensic psychiatric hospital, where he has spent many long years serving time for a crime shrouded in mystery; now he is determined to wreak revenge and win back power within his crime family.', 'Riccardo Mancini (Ranieri) is discharged from the forensic psychiatric hospital, where he has spent many long years serving time for a crime shrouded in mystery; now he is determined to wreak revenge and win back power within his crime family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBqe1DtXVhOVDdvwFjccwYOUteY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468200'),
