  ('559836601085961290', 'Blow-Up', 1966, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Carlo Di Palma', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Tonino Guerra', 'David Hemmings, Vanessa Redgrave, Sarah Miles, John Castle, Veruschka von Lehndorff, Jane Birkin, Gillian Hills, Peter Bowles', 'NR', 'A successful mod photographer in London whose world is bounded by fashion, pop music, marijuana, and easy sex, feels his life is boring and despairing. But in the course of a single day he unknowingly captures a death on film.', 'A successful mod photographer in London whose world is bounded by fashion, pop music, marijuana, and easy sex, feels his life is boring and despairing. But in the course of a single day he unknowingly captures a death on film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVDVpydUw8Z50naUDAG4NbRCrSa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052'),
  ('520397004028676136', 'Blowback', 2022, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Tibor Takács', 'Matthew Eason', 'Randy Couture, Cam Gigandet, Michele Plaia, Louis Mandylor, William McNamara, Chris Maher, Rafael Cabrera, Benjamin Abiola', 'R', 'When a master thief is sabotaged during a bank heist and left for dead, he seeks revenge on his former crew one target at a time. Now, with the cops and the mob closing in, he''s in the race of his life to reclaim an untold fortune in cryptocurrency from those who double-crossed him.', 'When a master thief is sabotaged during a bank heist and left for dead, he seeks revenge on his former crew one target at a time. Now, with the cops and the mob closing in, he''s in the race of his life to reclaim an untold fortune in cryptocurrency from those who double-crossed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHQHC32dhom8u0OxC2hs2gYQh0M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:972313'),
  ('652296249772298350', 'Blowfish', 2011, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lee Chi-yuarn', 'Lee Chi-yuarn, Vicci Pan', 'Vicci Pan, Wu Kang-ren, Lu Yi-ching, Angel Yao, Hong Xiu Wu, Fernando Hsieh, Yi-Ping Cheng, Chien Cheng Chen', null, 'A woman leaves her cheating boyfriend and goes to a remote village in the Taiwaneese mountains to deliver a blowfish to a man who won it on an online auction. Immediately, a quiet and unusual relationship develops between the two.', 'A woman leaves her cheating boyfriend and goes to a remote village in the Taiwaneese mountains to deliver a blowfish to a man who won it on an online auction. Immediately, a quiet and unusual relationship develops between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgSWtU8tArz4PgRHFOPuFuLA09v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108646'),
  ('1132764161805056349', 'Blowing Wild', 1953, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'Hugo Fregonese, Sidney Hickox, Alan Crosland, Jr.', 'Philip Yordan', 'Gary Cooper, Barbara Stanwyck, Anthony Quinn, Ruth Roman, Ward Bond, Ian MacDonald, Richard Karlan, Juan García', 'NR', 'Wildcatter Jeff Dawson does his best to bring in a gusher in Mexico despite continual bandit raids. He asks for help from his ex-employer Ward Conway, but Conway, now married to Dawson''s ex-lover Marina refuses, fearing that his wife will want to renew her romance with the other man.', 'Wildcatter Jeff Dawson does his best to bring in a gusher in Mexico despite continual bandit raids. He asks for help from his ex-employer Ward Conway, but Conway, now married to Dawson''s ex-lover Marina refuses, fearing that his wife will want to renew her romance with the other man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRIRy1yb44RHCZjKL2O1WEPjK46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76140'),
  ('510751368260911060', 'Blown Away', 1993, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Brenton Spencer, Perci Young, Roman Buchok', 'Robert C. Cooper', 'Corey Haim, Nicole Eggert, Corey Feldman, Jean LeClerc, Kathleen Robertson, Gary Farmer, Jason Hopley, Alessandro Bandiera', 'R', 'After her mother is killed by a car bomb, a 17-year-old girl lives a reckless and decadent lifestyle. She begins having sex with a boy who works at a local ski resort. He falls in love, and she tells him of her suspicions that her strict father was responsible for her mother''s death and wants him to help her out of her situation. He must decide whether she''s telling the truth or using him to her own ends.', 'After her mother is killed by a car bomb, a 17-year-old girl lives a reckless and decadent lifestyle. She begins having sex with a boy who works at a local ski resort. He falls in love, and she tells him of her suspicions that her strict father was responsible for her mother''s death and wants him to help her out of her situation. He must decide whether she''s telling the truth or using him to her own ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkdYTsyORrP7utUW1TDTHz5eyOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20859'),
  ('471801368662833171', 'Blown Away', 1994, 'Action', 'Stephen Hopkins, Peter Levy, Josh McLaglen', 'John Rice, Joe Batteer', 'Jeff Bridges, Tommy Lee Jones, Suzy Amis, Lloyd Bridges, Forest Whitaker, Stephi Lineburg, John Finn, Caitlin Clarke', 'R', 'Blown Away tells the story of Jimmy Dove, who works for the Boston bomb squad. Shortly after Dove leaves the force, his partner is killed by a bomb that Dove thinks might have been made by someone he knows.', 'Blown Away tells the story of Jimmy Dove, who works for the Boston bomb squad. Shortly after Dove leaves the force, his partner is killed by a bomb that Dove thinks might have been made by someone he knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fD23iryzdjfRU05nQAQriD0A3AR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178'),
  ('45924903560104673', 'Blubberella', 2011, 'Horror, Action, Comedy', 'Uwe Boll, Čejen Černić Čanak, Mathias Neumann', 'Uwe Boll, Lindsay Hollister, Willam Belli', 'Lindsay Hollister, Willam Belli, Uwe Boll, Brendan Fletcher, Michael Paré, Annett Culp, Clint Howard, Steffen Mennekes', 'R', 'An action comedy centered on Blubberella, an overweight half-vampire woman whose footsteps cause explosions and whose dual swords are used against anyone who makes fun of her. She must face an army of undead Nazi soldiers in her valiant struggle against bloodshed and tyranny.', 'An action comedy centered on Blubberella, an overweight half-vampire woman whose footsteps cause explosions and whose dual swords are used against anyone who makes fun of her. She must face an army of undead Nazi soldiers in her valiant struggle against bloodshed and tyranny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKEPIK6dGMxLk7ryfwrJVJfw4Pj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66608'),
  ('801896350806366393', 'Blue', 1968, 'Romance, Western', 'Silvio Narizzano, Stanley Cortez', 'Ronald M. Cohen', 'Terence Stamp, Joanna Pettet, Karl Malden, Stathis Giallelis, Ricardo Montalban, Sally Kirkland, Robert Lipton, Sara Vardi', null, 'A young man is torn between the woman he loves and his loyalty to his father, the leader of a Mexican gang.', 'A young man is torn between the woman he loves and his loyalty to his father, the leader of a Mexican gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIx2IO2TgNsqaZ2b1fW07O7t22y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169869'),
