  ('1040968525985883564', 'Blue', 1993, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Derek Jarman', 'Derek Jarman', 'Derek Jarman, Nigel Terry, Tilda Swinton, John Quentin', null, 'Against a plain, unchanging blue screen, a densely interwoven soundtrack of voices, sound effects and music attempt to convey a portrait of Derek Jarman''s experiences with AIDS, both literally and allegorically, together with an exploration of the meanings associated with the colour blue.', 'Against a plain, unchanging blue screen, a densely interwoven soundtrack of voices, sound effects and music attempt to convey a portrait of Derek Jarman''s experiences with AIDS, both literally and allegorically, together with an exploration of the meanings associated with the colour blue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ktqO8EvVE7NS3NuykukophhNtl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94794'),
