  ('903047442231744357', 'Blue Bayou', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ante Cheng, Matthew Chuang, Laura Klein', 'Justin Chon', 'Justin Chon, Alicia Vikander, Mark O''Brien, Linh-Dan Pham, Sydney Kowalske, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Emory Cohen, Geraldine Singer', 'R', 'As a Korean-American man raised in the Louisiana bayou works hard to make a life for his family, he must confront the ghosts of his past as he discovers that he could be deported from the only country he has ever called home.', 'As a Korean-American man raised in the Louisiana bayou works hard to make a life for his family, he must confront the ghosts of his past as he discovers that he could be deported from the only country he has ever called home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4xykTie8BOSW0y6K5u1AcmW4HW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644089'),
  ('756602019853858193', 'Blue Beetle', 2023, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Diem Ngo, Aaron Kelly, Pawel Pogorzelski', 'Gareth Dunnet-Alcocer', 'Xolo Maridueña, Bruna Marquezine, Susan Sarandon, Raoul Max Trujillo, Belissa Escobedo, Damián Alcázar, Elpidia Carrillo, George López', 'PG-13', 'Recent college grad Jaime Reyes returns home full of aspirations for his future, only to find that home is not quite as he left it. As he searches to find his purpose in the world, fate intervenes when Jaime unexpectedly finds himself in possession of an ancient relic of alien biotechnology: the Scarab.', 'Recent college grad Jaime Reyes returns home full of aspirations for his future, only to find that home is not quite as he left it. As he searches to find his purpose in the world, fate intervenes when Jaime unexpectedly finds himself in possession of an ancient relic of alien biotechnology: the Scarab.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXLOHHc1Zeuwsl4xYKjKh2280oL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565770'),
  ('501626374778050175', 'Blue Bird', 2026, 'Drama', 'Ganesh Hegde', 'Ganesh Hegde', 'Aman S Karkera, Gopalkrishna Deshpande, Nidhi Hegde, UV Nanjappa Benaka', null, 'The journey of a 10 year old boy who chooses his roots over his parents'' greed.', 'The journey of a 10 year old boy who chooses his roots over his parents'' greed.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2uIBdHdJM7wZCOJNPegB1fHowDA.jpg', 'plex:movie:neeli-hakki'),
  ('356229756722752226', 'Blue Black Permanent', 1992, 'Drama', 'Margaret Tait, Alex Scott, Gus Maclean', 'Margaret Tait', 'Celia Imrie, Jack Shepherd, James Fleet, Gerda Stevenson, Sean Scanlan, Hilary Maclean, Walter Leask, Sheana Marr', null, 'In 1990s Edinburgh, Barbara Thorburn reflects on memories of her poet mother, Greta, and her tragic death.', 'In 1990s Edinburgh, Barbara Thorburn reflects on memories of her poet mother, Greta, and her tragic death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/um6aic4yUAqxrx7CGnhXbI8xk9e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127633'),
  ('293672138780481121', 'Blue Blood', 1974, 'Drama, Horror', 'Andrew Sinclair, Derek Whitehurst', 'Andrew Sinclair', 'Oliver Reed, Fiona Lewis, Anna Gaël, Derek Jacobi, Meg Wynn Owen, John Rainer, Richard Davies, Gwyneth Owen', null, 'A debauched young aristocrat entrusts the running of his country house to Tom, the butler, on whom he depends absolutely. Before long the servant begins to dominate his master, to the alarm of the newly hired German nanny who senses sinister, demonic intent in Tom''s control of the house.', 'A debauched young aristocrat entrusts the running of his country house to Tom, the butler, on whom he depends absolutely. Before long the servant begins to dominate his master, to the alarm of the newly hired German nanny who senses sinister, demonic intent in Tom''s control of the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNHUUcrQj6WMrOwnomKmQs4ywMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156094'),
