  ('902176546847553807', 'Blue Jean', 2023, 'Drama', 'Georgia Oakley, Victor Seguin, Noah Demeuldre', 'Georgia Oakley', 'Rosy McEwen, Kerrie Hayes, Lucy Halliday, Lydia Page, Becky Lindsay, Maya Torres, Ellen Gowland, Amy Booth-Steel', 'NR', 'Jean, a PE teacher, is forced to live a double life. When a new student arrives and threatens to expose her sexuality, Jean is pushed to extreme lengths to keep her job and her integrity.', 'Jean, a PE teacher, is forced to live a double life. When a new student arrives and threatens to expose her sexuality, Jean is pushed to extreme lengths to keep her job and her integrity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kzhsiL340IDeaAuEz4RfiFilgf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:971699'),
