  ('625350328771560445', 'Blue Miracle', 2021, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Ana María Cabrera, Julio Quintana', 'Chris Dowling, Julio Quintana', 'Jimmy Gonzáles, Dennis Quaid, Anthony Gonzalez, Bruce McGill, Raymond Cruz, Dana Wheeler-Nicholson, Fernanda Urrejola, Nathan Arenas', 'NR', 'To save their cash-strapped orphanage, a guardian and his kids partner with a washed-up boat captain for a chance to win a lucrative fishing competition.', 'To save their cash-strapped orphanage, a guardian and his kids partner with a washed-up boat captain for a chance to win a lucrative fishing competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlDSL8Rn4eQCzDPy1pPRkCh8H32.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671295'),
  ('445330123512920250', 'Blue Money', 1985, 'Comedy, Crime, TV Movie, Drama', 'Colin Bucksey', 'Stewart Parker', 'Tim Curry, Debby Bishop, Billy Connolly, Dermot Crowley, Frances Tomelty, George Irving, Sue Wallace, Geraldine Griffiths', null, 'Mobsters and the IRA chase a stagestruck London cabby (Tim Curry) who has found a briefcase full of cash.', 'Mobsters and the IRA chase a stagestruck London cabby (Tim Curry) who has found a briefcase full of cash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAtjqvWR8Kn8HuoYvCFo3epVTbm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206312'),
  ('833783810868663164', 'Blue Monkey', 1987, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'William Fruet, Brenton Spencer', 'George Goldsmith, Chris Koseluk', 'Steve Railsback, Gwynyth Walsh, John Vernon, Joe Flaherty, Robin Duke, Susan Anspach, Don Lake, Helen Hughes', 'R', 'While working in a greenhouse, a man receives an insect bite after touching an exotic plant. Immediately, he falls ill and is taken to an emergency room where the doctors diagnose him as suffering from an unknown bacteria, and a strange parasite which emerges from his mouth as a large slimy wormlike creature. Soon, there are more cases of bacterial infection, but the more immediate problem for the hospital is the wormlike creature which after accidental exposure to a genetic growth stimulant grows to monstrous proportions and starts a reign of terror and bloodshed in the hospitals abandoned wing.', 'While working in a greenhouse, a man receives an insect bite after touching an exotic plant. Immediately, he falls ill and is taken to an emergency room where the doctors diagnose him as suffering from an unknown bacteria, and a strange parasite which emerges from his mouth as a large slimy wormlike creature. Soon, there are more cases of bacterial infection, but the more immediate problem for the hospital is the wormlike creature which after accidental exposure to a genetic growth stimulant grows to monstrous proportions and starts a reign of terror and bloodshed in the hospitals abandoned wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cOwZtocb7icG3WON8DejxHgFWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89394'),
  ('1128754459753295627', 'Blue Moon', 2002, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Andrea Maria Dusl, Wolfgang Thaler', 'Andrea Maria Dusl', 'Josef Hader, Detlev Buck, Victoria Malektorovych, Ivan Laca, Emöke Vinczeová, Peter Aczel, Andrea Karnasová, Orest Ohorodnyk', null, 'After screwing up a money exchange a Viennese small-time crook accompanied by a Russian hostess hits the road to the East.', 'After screwing up a money exchange a Viennese small-time crook accompanied by a Russian hostess hits the road to the East.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLYnKAR4BZWuO05lboSHNtsImwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53348'),
  ('23600062003567213', 'Blue Moon', 2025, 'History, Drama, Comedy', 'Richard Linklater, Shane F. Kelly, Nick Thomas', 'Robert Kaplow', 'Ethan Hawke, Bobby Cannavale, Andrew Scott, Margaret Qualley, Patrick Kennedy, Jonah Lees, Simon Delaney, Giles Surridge', 'R', 'On the evening of March 31, 1943, legendary lyricist Lorenz Hart confronts his shattered self-confidence in Sardi’s bar as his former collaborator, Richard Rodgers, celebrates the opening night of his ground-breaking hit musical, “Oklahoma!”', 'On the evening of March 31, 1943, legendary lyricist Lorenz Hart confronts his shattered self-confidence in Sardi’s bar as his former collaborator, Richard Rodgers, celebrates the opening night of his ground-breaking hit musical, “Oklahoma!”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVU7SNc6dgStTVdtbPLQncWxsyZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1299655'),
  ('81403074929585232', 'Blue Moses', 1962, null, 'Stan Brakhage', 'Stan Brakhage', 'Robert Benson', null, 'One of the few Brakhage films featuring spoken dialogue and a central character, this sly and bitter polemic pits an actor (poet? director?) against an unseen audience. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2007.', 'One of the few Brakhage films featuring spoken dialogue and a central character, this sly and bitter polemic pits an actor (poet? director?) against an unseen audience. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJ52mC04xvW5Uxb2VXCKytZLB0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148040'),
  ('76850454981741426', 'Blue Mountain State: The Rise of Thadland', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Lev L. Spiro', 'Chris Romano, Eric Falconer, Alan Ritchson', 'Alan Ritchson, Darin Brooks, Chris Romano, Frankie Shaw, Ed Marinaro, James Cade, Rob Ramsay, Omari Newton', 'R', 'With Blue Mountain State football star Thad Castle recently signing a multi-million dollar NFL contract, his teammates and college life seem like a distant memory. However, when a new school dean threatens to clean up the BMS image by auctioning off the infamous Goat House, Alex, Sammy and the boys must find a way to convince him to get involved. Despite his new fortune and fame, there is one small favor that Thad needs done before he saves the day: the biggest booze-and-sloot fest in BMS history. Welcome to Thadland!', 'With Blue Mountain State football star Thad Castle recently signing a multi-million dollar NFL contract, his teammates and college life seem like a distant memory. However, when a new school dean threatens to clean up the BMS image by auctioning off the infamous Goat House, Alex, Sammy and the boys must find a way to convince him to get involved. Despite his new fortune and fame, there is one small favor that Thad needs done before he saves the day: the biggest booze-and-sloot fest in BMS history. Welcome to Thadland!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZz8AmDvFqUY4tBcD69ou3OfiWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288171'),
  ('794805656895489755', 'Blue Mountains, or Unbelievable Story', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eldar Shengelaia', 'Eldar Shengelaia', 'Ramaz Giorgobiani, Teimuraz Chirgadze, Vasil Kakhniashvili, Ivane Sakvarelidze, Sesilia Takaishvili, Grigol Natsvlishvili, Vladimer Mezvrishvili, Otar Guntsadze', null, 'An author - a passive young man - enters the Soviet-controlled bureaucracy of Georgia attempting to get his novel published only to be neglected and compartmentalized at every turn.', 'An author - a passive young man - enters the Soviet-controlled bureaucracy of Georgia attempting to get his novel published only to be neglected and compartmentalized at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUC1JXRQ0VuxCk5xYS98VLqbAy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142798'),
