  ('368674757497048751', 'Blue Rhythm', 1931, 'Animation, Music, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', null, 'Mickey plays a bluesy tune on a piano on a stage. Minnie sings. Then an unseen band plays while both sing and dance. Mickey then leads the 9-piece band in an uptempo number, with Pluto on trombone, Horace on percussion, and Clarabelle on bass, among others. Mickey steps out for a clarinet solo.', 'Mickey plays a bluesy tune on a piano on a stage. Minnie sings. Then an unseen band plays while both sing and dance. Mickey then leads the 9-piece band in an uptempo number, with Pluto on trombone, Horace on percussion, and Clarabelle on bass, among others. Mickey steps out for a clarinet solo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xEjYaVqaS27j6FrUJuVKHrzmTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162584'),
  ('486146617058112293', 'Blue Ridge Fall', 1999, 'Drama', 'James Rowe', 'James Rowe', 'Peter Facinelli, Jay R. Ferguson, Chris Isaak, Heather Stephens, Will Estes, Garvin Funches, Brent Jennings, Amy Irving', null, 'After a boy kills his father he must turn to his frinds to cover his tracks with tests their loyality and friendship.', 'After a boy kills his father he must turn to his frinds to cover his tracks with tests their loyality and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6QYCdEqYbhKBqvf9MzSyQOmo9t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84862'),
  ('1092063606791081163', 'Blue Rita', 1977, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jesús Franco', 'Jesús Franco', 'Martine Fléty, Sarah Strasberg, Dagmar Bürger, Pamela Stanford, Eric Falk, Esther Moser, Angela Ritschard, Chantal Virapin', null, 'Nightclub owner and erotic dancer Rita Blue uses her place as a front for working undercover as a spy. Motivated by her vehement hatred of men that stems from having been sexually abused as a child, Rita and her seductive female cohorts not only gleefully torture guys as a means to obtain vital information, but also manhandle wealthy men in order to make them hand over their fortunes to them.', 'Nightclub owner and erotic dancer Rita Blue uses her place as a front for working undercover as a spy. Motivated by her vehement hatred of men that stems from having been sexually abused as a child, Rita and her seductive female cohorts not only gleefully torture guys as a means to obtain vital information, but also manhandle wealthy men in order to make them hand over their fortunes to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpiq63SzemsBu9OUBJ8O2K5tq1M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86647'),
  ('880693236686434567', 'Blue Ruin', 2014, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jeremy Saulnier, Jeremy Saulnier, Alex Orr', 'Jeremy Saulnier', 'Macon Blair, Devin Ratray, Amy Hargreaves, Kevin Kolack, Eve Plumb, Stacy Rock, David Thompson, Brent Werzner', 'R', 'When the quiet life of a beach bum is upended by dreadful news, he sets off for his childhood home to carry out an act of vengeance. However, he proves an inept assassin and finds himself in a brutal fight to protect his estranged family.', 'When the quiet life of a beach bum is upended by dreadful news, he sets off for his childhood home to carry out an act of vengeance. However, he proves an inept assassin and finds himself in a brutal fight to protect his estranged family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0itEsso2drJXqH9kfdidxIT5dF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188166'),
  ('533096431729662644', 'Blue Seduction', 2009, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Timothy Bond, Philip Hurn', 'Jacqueline Giroux', 'Billy Zane, Estella Warren, Bernard Robichaud, Josh Linton, Jane Wheeler, Robbie O''Neill, Elizabeth Stevens, Josh Linton', null, 'A middle aged music composer finds himself trapped in the seductive web of a young, sexy vocalist who is looking for her own fifteen seconds of fame...', 'A middle aged music composer finds himself trapped in the seductive web of a young, sexy vocalist who is looking for her own fifteen seconds of fame...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgiQoXPFUb848XSDAmk7lCGPvvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29109'),
  ('168611679380507682', 'Blue Skies', 1946, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Stuart Heisler, Charles Lang, William E. Snyder', 'Arthur Sheekman', 'Bing Crosby, Fred Astaire, Joan Caulfield, Billy De Wolfe, Olga San Juan, Mikhail Rasumny, Frank Faylen, Victoria Horne', 'NR', 'Jed Potter looks back on a love triangle conducted over the course of years and between musical numbers. Dancer Jed loves showgirl Mary, who loves compulsive nightclub-opener Johnny, who can''t stay committed to anything in life for very long.', 'Jed Potter looks back on a love triangle conducted over the course of years and between musical numbers. Dancer Jed loves showgirl Mary, who loves compulsive nightclub-opener Johnny, who can''t stay committed to anything in life for very long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPNmCJliNheRdHkemlq82QfqPex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53446'),
  ('298442251711547457', 'Blue Sky', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tony Richardson, Steve Yaconelli, Robert K. Lambert', 'Jerry Leichtling, Rama Laurie Stagner, Arlene Sarner', 'Jessica Lange, Tommy Lee Jones, Powers Boothe, Carrie Snodgress, Amy Locane, Chris O''Donnell, Mitchell Ryan, Dale Dye', 'PG-13', 'Hank Marshall is a tough, square-jawed, straitlaced Army engineer and nuclear science expert, assigned to help conduct weapons testing in 1950s America. Hank has become a thorn in the side of the Army, though, for a couple of very different reasons. He is an outspoken opponent of atmospheric testing, though his superiors hold contrary views and want to squelch his concerns...and his reports. The other problem is his wife, Carly. She is voluptuous and volatile, wreaking havoc in his personal life and stirring up intrigue at each new Army base.', 'Hank Marshall is a tough, square-jawed, straitlaced Army engineer and nuclear science expert, assigned to help conduct weapons testing in 1950s America. Hank has become a thorn in the side of the Army, though, for a couple of very different reasons. He is an outspoken opponent of atmospheric testing, though his superiors hold contrary views and want to squelch his concerns...and his reports. The other problem is his wife, Carly. She is voluptuous and volatile, wreaking havoc in his personal life and stirring up intrigue at each new Army base.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zG40OnO4Y98lo1iDHyFo5TaZyP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57834'),
  ('579630797638063785', 'Blue Smoke', 2007, 'Action, Drama, Romance, Thriller, TV Movie', 'David Carson, Nikos Evdemon', 'Ronni Kern', 'Alicia Witt, Matthew Settle, Scott Bakula, Talia Shire, Eric Keenleyside, John Reardon, Benjamin Ayres, Chris Fassbender', null, 'After witnessing an uncontrollable blaze burn her family''s pizzeria to the ground when she was just 11 old, it''s no wonder that Reena decides to become an arson investigator. Now, years later, she decides to visit the old neighborhood, where she finds true romance with a hunky carpenter named Bo Goodnight. But Reena is swiftly knocked off cloud nine when she discovers that a psycho connected to her past has resurfaced to wreak havoc in her life.', 'After witnessing an uncontrollable blaze burn her family''s pizzeria to the ground when she was just 11 old, it''s no wonder that Reena decides to become an arson investigator. Now, years later, she decides to visit the old neighborhood, where she finds true romance with a hunky carpenter named Bo Goodnight. But Reena is swiftly knocked off cloud nine when she discovers that a psycho connected to her past has resurfaced to wreak havoc in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vE5mONRfjxBl8YoTq2fsKNRJhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54699'),
  ('490530787172662979', 'Blue Spring', 2001, 'Drama', 'Toshiaki Toyoda, Hideaki Satô, Norimichi Kasamatsu', 'Toshiaki Toyoda', 'Ryuhei Matsuda, Hirofumi Arai, Sousuke Takaoka, Yusuke Oshiba, Yuta Yamazaki, Shugo Oshinari, Eita Nagayama, Kiyohiko Shibukawa', null, 'Soon after being named the new leader of his high school''s gang system, Kujo grows bored with the violence and hatred that surround him. He wants desperately to abandon his post… but his once-enviable position of power has a strange way of making him feel powerless.', 'Soon after being named the new leader of his high school''s gang system, Kujo grows bored with the violence and hatred that surround him. He wants desperately to abandon his post… but his once-enviable position of power has a strange way of making him feel powerless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nucvbLWcQmdyGxqMtfIHjUeEHyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33333'),
  ('141128969626653929', 'Blue Spring Ride', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Takahiro Miki, Kosuke Yamada', 'Tomoko Yoshida', 'Tsubasa Honda, Masahiro Higashide, Yua Shinkawa, Ryo Yoshizawa, Izumi Fujimoto, Yu Koyanagi, Mitsuki Takahata, Yudai Chiba', null, 'In middle school, Futaba Yoshioka was madly in love with Tanaka Kou but he moves away with his mother. She is reunited with him later in life but he is not the same person anymore.', 'In middle school, Futaba Yoshioka was madly in love with Tanaka Kou but he moves away with his mother. She is reunited with him later in life but he is not the same person anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ic3JNoQVPTGtOwgUeTWu09mmNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283727'),
  ('917691663988847844', 'Blue State', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Marshall Lewy, Phil Parmet', 'Marshall Lewy', 'Anna Paquin, Breckin Meyer, Joyce Krenz, Richard Blackburn, Adriana O''Neil, Seun Olagunju, Bryan Terrell Clark, Nicolas Ouellette', 'R', 'A disgruntled Democrat follows through on a drunken campaign promise to move to Canada if George "Dubya" Bush gets re-elected.', 'A disgruntled Democrat follows through on a drunken campaign promise to move to Canada if George "Dubya" Bush gets re-elected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2urrmnf0Pw2u2F9vfhmpa8giaGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12855'),
  ('117457390207191563', 'Blue Steel', 1934, 'Western, Action', 'Robert N. Bradbury', 'Robert N. Bradbury', 'John Wayne, Eleanor Hunt, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Edward Peil Sr., Yakima Canutt, Lafe McKee, George Cleveland, Earl Dwire', 'NR', 'When Sheriff Jake sees a man at the safe and then finds the payroll gone, he trails him. Just as he is about to arrest him, the man saves his life. Still suspicious, he joins up with the man and later they learn that Melgrove, the towns leading citizen, is trying to take over the area''s ranches by having his gang stop all incoming supply wagons. With the ranchers about to sell to Melgrove, the two newcomers say they will bring in provisions.', 'When Sheriff Jake sees a man at the safe and then finds the payroll gone, he trails him. Just as he is about to arrest him, the man saves his life. Still suspicious, he joins up with the man and later they learn that Melgrove, the towns leading citizen, is trying to take over the area''s ranches by having his gang stop all incoming supply wagons. With the ranchers about to sell to Melgrove, the two newcomers say they will bring in provisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5Ar8WGmCQlHbbrzRmUrUCqIWoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53828'),
  ('22504238363280897', 'Blue Steel', 1990, 'Thriller', 'Kathryn Bigelow, Amir Mokri, Sue Fellows', 'Kathryn Bigelow, Eric Red', 'Jamie Lee Curtis, Ron Silver, Clancy Brown, Elizabeth Peña, Louise Fletcher, Philip Bosco, Kevin Dunn, Richard Jenkins', 'R', 'Rookie cop Megan Turner orders a burglar to drop his gun. He whirls to shoot. Too late. Turner fires, killing him instantly. When someone lifts the assailant''s gun from the crime scene, the police hold Turner accountable for killing an unarmed man. That same someone carves Turner''s name into the bullets and uses them in a series of murders. Turner teams up with detective Nick Mann to clear her name and catch the killer. But she is drawn into a deadly game of wits with a psychopath who''s always one step ahead… and much closer than she thinks!', 'Rookie cop Megan Turner orders a burglar to drop his gun. He whirls to shoot. Too late. Turner fires, killing him instantly. When someone lifts the assailant''s gun from the crime scene, the police hold Turner accountable for killing an unarmed man. That same someone carves Turner''s name into the bullets and uses them in a series of murders. Turner teams up with detective Nick Mann to clear her name and catch the killer. But she is drawn into a deadly game of wits with a psychopath who''s always one step ahead… and much closer than she thinks!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPUrodB3k8NYcvr4WPwtjSe1Mv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9491'),
  ('106518720325427265', 'Blue Story', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Rapman, Simon Stolland', 'Rapman', 'Stephen Odubola, Micheal Ward, Khali Best, Karla-Simone Spence, Eric Kofi Abrefa, Max Fincham, Kadeem Ramsay, Rohan Nedd', 'R', 'Blue Story is a tragic tale of a friendship between Timmy and Marco, two young boys from opposing postcodes. Timmy, a shy, smart, naive and timid young boy from Deptford, goes to school in Peckham where he strikes up a friendship with Marco, a charismatic, streetwise kid from the local area. Although from warring postcodes, the two quickly form a firm friendship until it is tested and they wind up on rival sides of a street war. Blue Story depicts elements of Rapman''s own personal experiences and aspects of his childhood.', 'Blue Story is a tragic tale of a friendship between Timmy and Marco, two young boys from opposing postcodes. Timmy, a shy, smart, naive and timid young boy from Deptford, goes to school in Peckham where he strikes up a friendship with Marco, a charismatic, streetwise kid from the local area. Although from warring postcodes, the two quickly form a firm friendship until it is tested and they wind up on rival sides of a street war. Blue Story depicts elements of Rapman''s own personal experiences and aspects of his childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qI4Rw83LxKq07xIjM3RcbKcWpAM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621191'),
  ('1138017280257359081', 'Blue Streak', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Les Mayfield, David Eggby, Bruce Franklin', 'John Blumenthal, Michael Berry, Stephen Carpenter', 'Martin Lawrence, Luke Wilson, Dave Chappelle, Peter Greene, Nicole Ari Parker, William Forsythe, Graham Beckel, Robert Miranda', 'PG-13', 'Miles Logan is a jewel thief who just hit the big time by stealing a huge diamond. However, after two years in jail, he comes to find out that he hid the diamond in a police building that was being built at the time of the robbery. In an attempt to regain his diamond, he poses as an LAPD detective.', 'Miles Logan is a jewel thief who just hit the big time by stealing a huge diamond. However, after two years in jail, he comes to find out that he hid the diamond in a police building that was being built at the time of the robbery. In an attempt to regain his diamond, he poses as an LAPD detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jek2osBtFhzU6Hjj7yp1egOtbqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11001'),
  ('762416025081769091', 'Blue Summer', 1973, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chuck Vincent', 'Chuck Vincent', 'Davey Jones, Bo White, Lilly Bi Peep, Joann Sterling, Melissa Evers, Kathie Fitch, Any Mathieu, Eric Edwards', 'R', 'A couple of dudes pack a van full of beer and go on a road trip in search of sexual adventures. They get that and more.', 'A couple of dudes pack a van full of beer and go on a road trip in search of sexual adventures. They get that and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yZXzwqschRuEvJh53gsm4aA7GA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30485'),
  ('247612232475390485', 'Blue Sunshine', 1977, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Mystery', 'Jeff Lieberman, Richard T. Schor, Stephen P. Dunn', 'Jeff Lieberman', 'Zalman King, Deborah Winters, Mark Goddard, Robert Walden, Charles Siebert, Ann Cooper, Ray Young, Alice Ghostley', 'R', 'At a party, someone goes insane and murders three women. Falsely accused of the brutal killings, Jerry is on the run. More bizarre homicides continue with alarming frequency all over town. Trying to clear his name, Jerry discovers the shocking truth...people are losing their hair and turning into violent psychopaths and the connection may be some LSD all the murderers took a decade before.', 'At a party, someone goes insane and murders three women. Falsely accused of the brutal killings, Jerry is on the run. More bizarre homicides continue with alarming frequency all over town. Trying to clear his name, Jerry discovers the shocking truth...people are losing their hair and turning into violent psychopaths and the connection may be some LSD all the murderers took a decade before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFH2Cug6i9ztE89QZn4XmCki65C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40955'),
  ('322291180897681442', 'Blue Swallow', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'Yoon Jong-chan, Park Jung-bae, Yoon Hong-sik', 'Yoon Jong-chan', 'Jang Jin-young, Kim Joo-hyuk, Yuko Fueki, Han Ji-min, Zin Tae-hyun, Takeo Nakahara, Toru Nakamura, Ko Joo-yeon', null, 'Park Kyung-won, who aspired to become a pilot since a young age, enrolls at an aviation academy in Japan. There she meets a charming exchange student from Korea who she is destined to be with.', 'Park Kyung-won, who aspired to become a pilot since a young age, enrolls at an aviation academy in Japan. There she meets a charming exchange student from Korea who she is destined to be with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8j7xsxbdrAP0FFK9IZt8B2Ukfa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155941'),
  ('786841053126348482', 'Blue Thermal', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Yu Wakabayashi, Takayuki Yamaguchi, Miho Tanino', 'Natsuko Takahashi, Masaki Tachibana', 'Mayu Hotta, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Junya Enoki, Haruka Shiraishi, You Taichi, Ayumu Murase, Makoto Furukawa, Rie Takahashi', null, 'Tamaki becomes a captive of the vast beauty of the skies from the moment Kuramochi takes her under his wing and up for a flight in a glider.', 'Tamaki becomes a captive of the vast beauty of the skies from the moment Kuramochi takes her under his wing and up for a flight in a glider.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUIX9FA9t4S2SgnPpTcGp9LH3Uz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865767'),
  ('236538498466007762', 'Blue Thunder', 1983, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'John Badham, Jerry Ziesmer, Daniel McCauley', 'Dan O''Bannon, Don Jakoby', 'Roy Scheider, Warren Oates, Candy Clark, Daniel Stern, Paul Roebling, David Sheiner, Joe Santos, Malcolm McDowell', 'R', 'Los Angeles, California. Officer Murphy, a veteran Metropolitan Police helicopter pilot suffering from severe trauma due to his harsh experiences during the Vietnam War, and Lymangood, his resourceful new partner, are tasked with testing an advanced and heavily armed experimental chopper known as Blue Thunder.', 'Los Angeles, California. Officer Murphy, a veteran Metropolitan Police helicopter pilot suffering from severe trauma due to his harsh experiences during the Vietnam War, and Lymangood, his resourceful new partner, are tasked with testing an advanced and heavily armed experimental chopper known as Blue Thunder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYoCkgVHGUAd5BgvRMWrAScY549.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6341'),
  ('431323346738682329', 'Blue Tiger', 1994, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Norberto Barba, Mark S. Constance, Blake T. Evans', 'Joel Soisson', 'Virginia Madsen, Toru Nakamura, Dean Hallo, Ryo Ishibashi, Sal Lopez, Yuji Okumoto, Harry Dean Stanton, Brenda Varda', null, 'Gena is a sweet and dedicated mother to her little son. One day, whilst shopping with him for a halloween mask, her son is accidently shot through the chest by a Japanese Gunman, trying to kill an opposing gang of bus operators. Gena notices that the gunman has a picture of a blue tiger on his chest. She is turned into an obsessed person and has an identical red tiger etched into her skin. She then tracks down the killer and plots his death. This leads her into the world of the Japanese Mafia', 'Gena is a sweet and dedicated mother to her little son. One day, whilst shopping with him for a halloween mask, her son is accidently shot through the chest by a Japanese Gunman, trying to kill an opposing gang of bus operators. Gena notices that the gunman has a picture of a blue tiger on his chest. She is turned into an obsessed person and has an identical red tiger etched into her skin. She then tracks down the killer and plots his death. This leads her into the world of the Japanese Mafia', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wHnOCUj6q2Ag6M7okiirexjTnv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37023'),
  ('596761883267084463', 'Blue Valentine', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Derek Cianfrance, Andrij Parekh, Adam Escott', 'Cami Delavigne, Joey Curtis, Derek Cianfrance', 'Ryan Gosling, Michelle Williams, John Doman, Mike Vogel, Ben Shenkman, Jen Jones, Maryann Plunkett, Faith Wladyka', 'R', 'Dean and Cindy live a quiet life in a modest neighborhood. They appear to have the world at their feet at the outset of the relationship. However, his lack of ambition and her retreat into self-absorption cause potentially irreversible cracks in their marriage.', 'Dean and Cindy live a quiet life in a modest neighborhood. They appear to have the world at their feet at the outset of the relationship. However, his lack of ambition and her retreat into self-absorption cause potentially irreversible cracks in their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dc8BdKnDY5Iy28KzUGtHIXuqqFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46705'),
  ('771084433898607129', 'Blue Velvet', 1986, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Frederick Elmes, David Lynch, Ellen Rauch', 'David Lynch', 'Isabella Rossellini, Kyle MacLachlan, Dennis Hopper, Laura Dern, Hope Lange, Dean Stockwell, George Dickerson, Priscilla Pointer', 'R', 'The discovery of a severed human ear found in a field leads a young man on an investigation related to a beautiful, mysterious nightclub singer and a group of psychopathic criminals who have kidnapped her child.', 'The discovery of a severed human ear found in a field leads a young man on an investigation related to a beautiful, mysterious nightclub singer and a group of psychopathic criminals who have kidnapped her child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6v1zYh2FKOYVddY5pCQhd4PO9uX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793'),
  ('712651125007552151', 'Blue Vengeance', 1989, 'Crime, Action, Thriller, Horror', 'Steven Kaman, J. Christian Ingvordsen, Danny Kuchuck', 'J. Christian Ingvordsen, Danny Kuchuck, John Weiner', 'Johnny Stumper, John Weiner, Stuart Garrison Day, Dan Lutsky, J. Christian Ingvordsen, Angel Caban, Tim Kelleher, Paul Borghese', null, 'Convicted murderer Mark Trex escapes from an asylum and heads to New York City believing that his favorite band''s occult hit song, which told of Satan and death, is true.', 'Convicted murderer Mark Trex escapes from an asylum and heads to New York City believing that his favorite band''s occult hit song, which told of Satan and death, is true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5km0l03zGw7kumsacAGLUjvVlxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281168'),
  ('346771554812932502', 'Blue-Eyed Butcher', 2012, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jamie Barber, Stephen Kay, Craig Harris', 'Jamie Pachino, Michael J. Murray', 'Sara Paxton, Justin Bruening, W. Earl Brown, Michael Gross, Lucinda Jenney, Annie Corley, David Marciano, Matthew Del Negro', 'R', 'A woman appeared to have a fairy-tale life, but six years into her marriage, the fairytale crumbles when her husband is found buried in the backyard of their home with numerous stab wounds.', 'A woman appeared to have a fairy-tale life, but six years into her marriage, the fairytale crumbles when her husband is found buried in the backyard of their home with numerous stab wounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZqc88f6I7lLSEq7uRo8PbikW7G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104593'),
  ('879800310216890515', 'Blue, Painful, Fragile', 2020, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Shunsuke Kariyama, Yasushi Hanamura', 'Noriaki Sugihara', 'Ryo Yoshizawa, Hana Sugisaki, Amane Okayama, Honoka Matsumoto, Hiroya Shimizu, Ken Mitsuishi, Tasuku Emoto, Mizuki Kayashima', null, 'Two outsider college students set up a secret society circle, "Moai," which aims to change the world. But one day, one of them disappears.', 'Two outsider college students set up a secret society circle, "Moai," which aims to change the world. But one day, one of them disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXvfvOJUDi2gYhOmCVfGQaQZpyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698208'),
  ('387611504511851961', 'Blue, White, and Perfect', 1942, 'Crime, Mystery, Romance', 'Herbert I. Leeds, Emil Newman, Glen MacWilliams', 'Samuel G. Engel', 'Lloyd Nolan, Mary Beth Hughes, George Reeves, Helene Reynolds, Steven Geray, Henry Victor, Curt Bois, Marie Blake', 'NR', 'In order to win back his girlfriend, Mike Shayne promises to give up his detective practice and get a job as riveter in an aircraft plant. He quickly finds himself investigating the theft of industrial diamonds from the plant''s safe and, utilizing a variety of false identities, traces them first to a dress factory and later to a Hawaii-bound ocean liner. Escaping several attempts on his life, he is able to uncover a Nazi smuggling ring, but the location of the missing diamonds continues to elude him.', 'In order to win back his girlfriend, Mike Shayne promises to give up his detective practice and get a job as riveter in an aircraft plant. He quickly finds himself investigating the theft of industrial diamonds from the plant''s safe and, utilizing a variety of false identities, traces them first to a dress factory and later to a Hawaii-bound ocean liner. Escaping several attempts on his life, he is able to uncover a Nazi smuggling ring, but the location of the missing diamonds continues to elude him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLkxUg1wAZACz0oCZNP5dbgG4Xd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161172'),
  ('1017300070108793865', 'Blue''s Big City Adventure', 2022, 'Family, Music, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Matt Stawski, Derek McKane', 'Angela Santomero', 'Joshua Dela Cruz, Steve Burns, Donovan Patton, Traci Paige Johnson, Nick Balaban, BD Wong, Ali Stroker, Taboo', 'NR', 'When Josh gets the opportunity of a lifetime to audition for Rainbow Puppy’s Broadway musical, Josh and Blue skidoo to NYC for the very first time where they meet new friends and discover the magic of music, dance, and following one’s dreams.', 'When Josh gets the opportunity of a lifetime to audition for Rainbow Puppy’s Broadway musical, Josh and Blue skidoo to NYC for the very first time where they meet new friends and discover the magic of music, dance, and following one’s dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAYBC3WhhiX25629HLpCvkpGk9q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939210'),
  ('676529404650335953', 'Blueback', 2022, 'Family, Drama, Adventure', 'Robert Connolly, Andrew Commis', 'Robert Connolly', 'Mia Wasikowska, Eric Bana, Ariel Donoghue, Ilsa Fogg, Radha Mitchell, Pedrea Jackson, Clarence John Ryan, Albert Mwangi', null, 'Based on the best-selling novel by Tim Winton, Blueback is a timely tale about the ocean, a beautiful marine creature, and a young girl’s power to change the world.', 'Based on the best-selling novel by Tim Winton, Blueback is a timely tale about the ocean, a beautiful marine creature, and a young girl’s power to change the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIECJapKwd1X8dolC6GoLGe5a3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807132'),
  ('469995527036219722', 'Bluebeard', 1901, 'Drama, Horror, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès, Jehanne d''Alcy, Bleuette Bernon, Thomas White', null, 'A young woman becomes the eighth wife of the wealthy Bluebeard, whose first seven wives have died under mysterious circumstances.', 'A young woman becomes the eighth wife of the wealthy Bluebeard, whose first seven wives have died under mysterious circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQ05wN7yJM35iUMqa6dobIFG4Ju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49275'),
  ('1135373062743666447', 'Bluebeard', 1936, 'Animation, Music', 'Jean Painlevé, René Bertrand', 'Charles Perrault', null, null, 'Perrault''s fairy tale presented in claymation with choral voices. Bluebeard goes courting, all six of his wives having died. He arrives at the house of a widow with two daughters. He''s greatly feared, but he overcomes objections with a generous dowry. One sister (Anne) refuses him; the other accepts. At his castle, the damsel delights in precious minutes away from Bluebeard in the rose garden. The Saracens declare war; Bluebeard goes off to fight them, leaving the keys to the castle in the damsel''s hands. He warns her not to enter the forbidden room. As war rages, she discovers riches in the castle and then enters the forbidden room. Will Bluebeard discover her act? Can she escape death?', 'Perrault''s fairy tale presented in claymation with choral voices. Bluebeard goes courting, all six of his wives having died. He arrives at the house of a widow with two daughters. He''s greatly feared, but he overcomes objections with a generous dowry. One sister (Anne) refuses him; the other accepts. At his castle, the damsel delights in precious minutes away from Bluebeard in the rose garden. The Saracens declare war; Bluebeard goes off to fight them, leaving the keys to the castle in the damsel''s hands. He warns her not to enter the forbidden room. As war rages, she discovers riches in the castle and then enters the forbidden room. Will Bluebeard discover her act? Can she escape death?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsh3NdmGzjfSlruNfEskehB0mCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148243'),
  ('1107674205019383085', 'Bluebeard', 1944, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Eugen Schüfftan, Angelo Scibetta, Raoul Pagel', 'Pierre Gendron', 'John Carradine, Jean Parker, Nils Asther, Ludwig Stössel, George Pembroke, Teala Loring, Sonia Sorel, Henry Kolker', 'NR', 'Young female models are being strangled. Will law enforcement be able to stop the crime wave before more women become victims?', 'Young female models are being strangled. Will law enforcement be able to stop the crime wave before more women become victims?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6S0waXu4haFamrSxRPKHQje0FKH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42186'),
  ('319935398997778774', 'Bluebeard', 1963, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier, Claude Laporte', 'Françoise Sagan', 'Charles Denner, Michèle Morgan, Danielle Darrieux, Hildegard Knef, Juliette Mayniel, Stéphane Audran, Catherine Rouvel, Françoise Lugagne', null, 'Paris, France, during the First World War. While thousands of soldiers die every day on the battlefields, Henri Landru, a seemingly respectable furniture dealer, married and father of four children, relentlessly feeds his own sinister factory of death.', 'Paris, France, during the First World War. While thousands of soldiers die every day on the battlefields, Henri Landru, a seemingly respectable furniture dealer, married and father of four children, relentlessly feeds his own sinister factory of death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnBReq5q1KlsEMqZEHn2NRs1dtl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4195'),
  ('749723638670502401', 'Bluebeard', 1972, 'Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Edward Dmytryk, Gábor Pogány, Jean-François Dion', 'Edward Dmytryk, Maria Pia Fusco, Luciano Sacripanti', 'Richard Burton, Joey Heatherton, Raquel Welch, Virna Lisi, Nathalie Delon, Marilù Tolo, Karin Schubert, Agostina Belli', 'R', 'Baron von Sepper is an Austrian aristocrat noted for his blue-toned beard, and his appetite for beautiful wives. His latest spouse, an American beauty named Anne, discovers a vault in his castle that''s filled with the frozen bodies of several beautiful women.', 'Baron von Sepper is an Austrian aristocrat noted for his blue-toned beard, and his appetite for beautiful wives. His latest spouse, an American beauty named Anne, discovers a vault in his castle that''s filled with the frozen bodies of several beautiful women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuVlMgyg4YnQQCxQ3OFJikvlXmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27116'),
  ('743613665918120932', 'Bluebeard', 2010, 'Fantasy, Drama, Thriller', 'Catherine Breillat, Vilko Filač', 'Catherine Breillat', 'Dominique Thomas, Lola Créton, Daphné Baiwir, Marilou Lopes-Benites, Lola Giovannetti, Farida Khelfa, Isabelle Lapouge, Suzanne Foulquier', 'NR', 'Anne reads her younger sister, Marie-Catherine, the story of Bluebeard. In 17th-century France, another set of sisters — also named Anne and Marie-Catherine — are left impoverished by their father''s death. Marie-Catherine dreams of marrying into money, and soon falls for wealthy divorcé Bluebeard. Grateful for the chance at a life of comfort, Marie-Catherine marries Bluebeard — in spite of rumors that he has made a hobby of murdering his wives.', 'Anne reads her younger sister, Marie-Catherine, the story of Bluebeard. In 17th-century France, another set of sisters — also named Anne and Marie-Catherine — are left impoverished by their father''s death. Marie-Catherine dreams of marrying into money, and soon falls for wealthy divorcé Bluebeard. Grateful for the chance at a life of comfort, Marie-Catherine marries Bluebeard — in spite of rumors that he has made a hobby of murdering his wives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2AvtBdNGXvKvDKlix9dTMKi4M5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41499'),
  ('1084437680303831603', 'Bluebeard', 2017, 'Thriller', 'Lee Soo-youn, Um Hye-jung, Jung Hae-ji', 'Lee Soo-youn', 'Cho Jin-woong, Moon Jung-hyun, Shin Gu, Kim Dae-myung, Song Young-chang, Lee Chung-ah, Yoon Se-a, Kim Joo-ryoung', null, 'A doctor finds himself in the middle of an unsolved serial murder case after discovering a secret from a sedated patient. When dismembered bodies show up close to home, he must solve the riddle before the killer realizes what he knows.', 'A doctor finds himself in the middle of an unsolved serial murder case after discovering a secret from a sedated patient. When dismembered bodies show up close to home, he must solve the riddle before the killer realizes what he knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOkTC0O2ymcsem7UlYeRem0elB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435809'),
  ('605880156165441483', 'Bluebeard''s 8th Wife', 1938, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Leo Tover, Boris Morros', 'Charles Brackett, Billy Wilder', 'Claudette Colbert, Gary Cooper, Edward Everett Horton, David Niven, Elizabeth Patterson, Herman Bing, Warren Hymer, Franklin Pangborn', 'NR', 'American multi-millionaire Michael Brandon marries his eighth wife, Nicole, the daughter of a broke French Marquis. But she doesn''t want to be only a number in the line of his ex-wives and undertakes her own strategy to tame him.', 'American multi-millionaire Michael Brandon marries his eighth wife, Nicole, the daughter of a broke French Marquis. But she doesn''t want to be only a number in the line of his ex-wives and undertakes her own strategy to tame him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEhBrK5Lcrjq1BR4FurSQyvsWUX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31996'),
  ('61012276683277735', 'Bluebeard''s Castle', 1963, 'TV Movie, Music, Drama', 'Michael Powell, Hannes Staudinger', null, 'Norman Foster, Ana Raquel Satre', null, 'Based on the Béla Bartók opera, Duke Bluebeard reluctantly and gradually uncovers the secrets of his psyche to his fourth wife, Judit, opening the seven doors of his castle to ultimately reveal his still living previous wives, among whom Judit must take her place.', 'Based on the Béla Bartók opera, Duke Bluebeard reluctantly and gradually uncovers the secrets of his psyche to his fourth wife, Judit, opening the seven doors of his castle to ultimately reveal his still living previous wives, among whom Judit must take her place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRO82ZyMu2uqJkcvdDFBGFy2mvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151239'),
  ('174273149956337973', 'Blueprint', 2003, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Rolf Schübel', 'Claus Cornelius Fischer', 'Franka Potente, Ulrich Thomsen, Hilmir Snær Guðnason, Katja Studt, Justus von Dohnányi, Wanja Mues, Ole Puppe, Rita Leska', null, 'The story of the first cloned human being - told in her own words: At the age of thirty the world-famous composer Iris Sellin learns that she has an incurable illness. She - a person who wanted to live for ever - does however not give in. In order to preserve her art and also herself, beyond death, for all posterity, she has herself cloned. Her daughter Siri, whom, in this way, she turns into her virtual twin, learns as a child that she is the world''s first cloned human being. In fact a blueprint: a blueprint of her mother. From that moment on nothing is as it was before...', 'The story of the first cloned human being - told in her own words: At the age of thirty the world-famous composer Iris Sellin learns that she has an incurable illness. She - a person who wanted to live for ever - does however not give in. In order to preserve her art and also herself, beyond death, for all posterity, she has herself cloned. Her daughter Siri, whom, in this way, she turns into her virtual twin, learns as a child that she is the world''s first cloned human being. In fact a blueprint: a blueprint of her mother. From that moment on nothing is as it was before...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FE5mDwSXw7h9HuB8fWgfJ83l3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7550'),
  ('428007875714118461', 'Blueprint to the Heart', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Dale Bredeson, Geoff Wallace, Andy Wong', 'Sean Fine, John Dion', 'Laura Mitchell, Dennis Andres, Crystal Balint, Johannah Newmarch, Nelson Wong, Quinnie Vu, Clayton James, Chris Carson', 'PG', 'Interior designer trying to save her home renovation show needs to apply her successful, upscale "fixer upper" home renovation strategy to her blue collar carpenter by making the sweet but disheveled guy her next fixer upper project.', 'Interior designer trying to save her home renovation show needs to apply her successful, upscale "fixer upper" home renovation strategy to her blue collar carpenter by making the sweet but disheveled guy her next fixer upper project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUWTvddI6ItXMYYlAkzSUz8RxTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723444'),
  ('461653519276540163', 'Blues Brothers 2000', 1998, 'Music, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'David Herrington, John Landis', 'Dan Aykroyd', 'Dan Aykroyd, John Goodman, Joe Morton, Frank Oz, J. Evan Bonifant, B.B. King, Wilson Pickett, Aretha Franklin', 'PG-13', 'Finally released from prison, Elwood Blues is once again enlisted by Sister Mary Stigmata in her latest crusade to raise funds for a children''s hospital. Hitting the road to re-unite the band and win the big prize at the New Orleans Battle of the Bands, Elwood is pursued cross-country by the cops.', 'Finally released from prison, Elwood Blues is once again enlisted by Sister Mary Stigmata in her latest crusade to raise funds for a children''s hospital. Hitting the road to re-unite the band and win the big prize at the New Orleans Battle of the Bands, Elwood is pursued cross-country by the cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCoY8UK2x4DWpICipL40Hg4cDmO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11568'),
  ('719607166170944203', 'Blues Harp', 1998, 'Crime, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Takashi Miike, Hideo Yamamoto, Bunmei Katô', 'Toshihiko Matsuo, Toshiyuki Morioka', 'Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Seiichi Tanabe, Saori Sekino, Atsushi Okuno, Mickey Curtis, Tatsuo Yamada, Daisuke Iijima, Akira Ishige', null, 'Ambitious Yakuza Kenji befriends harmonica-playing bartender Chuji, who moonlights as a part-time drug-dealer for the opposing gang. Their friendship is threatened by Kenji''s plans for advancement, as well as by his bodyguards'' growing jealousy of Chuji.', 'Ambitious Yakuza Kenji befriends harmonica-playing bartender Chuji, who moonlights as a part-time drug-dealer for the opposing gang. Their friendship is threatened by Kenji''s plans for advancement, as well as by his bodyguards'' growing jealousy of Chuji.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLu5BbocsoLysN6NNVZJor2o5jk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36242'),
  ('836078612475213040', 'Blues in the Night', 1941, 'Crime, Drama, Music', 'Anatole Litvak, Ernest Haller', 'Robert Rossen', 'Priscilla Lane, Betty Field, Richard Whorf, Lloyd Nolan, Jack Carson, Wallace Ford, Elia Kazan, Howard Da Silva', null, 'A struggling band find themselves attached to a fugitive and drawn into a series of old feuds and love affairs, as they try to stay together and find musical success.', 'A struggling band find themselves attached to a fugitive and drawn into a series of old feuds and love affairs, as they try to stay together and find musical success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6anBd0LJIZ4fnsh70THxUtuCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25862'),
  ('854690764068592043', 'Bluff', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Felipe Martínez Amador, Daniel Garcés Najar', null, 'Víctor Mallarino, Carolina Gómez, Verónica Orozco, Federico Lorusso, Catalina Aristizábal, Felipe Botero, Luis Eduardo Arango, Juan Felipe Cano', null, 'A man catches his girlfriend cheating on him with his boss, and gets fired because of this. When he finds his boss cheating on his ex-girlfriend, he blackmails him, but things will end up upside-down, when a murder shows up', 'A man catches his girlfriend cheating on him with his boss, and gets fired because of this. When he finds his boss cheating on his ex-girlfriend, he blackmails him, but things will end up upside-down, when a murder shows up', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TL021aolyyLEtlscCd0UjQqCfb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88282'),
  ('380648952744795448', 'Bluffmaster!', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Himman Dhamija, Rohan Sippy', 'Shridhar Raghavan', 'Abhishek Bachchan, Riteish Deshmukh, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Nana Patekar, Boman Irani, Sanjay Mishra, Tinnu Anand, Carol Gracias', null, 'Roy, a professional conman, gets dumped by his girlfriend after she find out the truth about him. After being diagnosed with a fatal disease, he resolves to do some good by helping an amateur conman to hoodwink the mobster who hurt his family.', 'Roy, a professional conman, gets dumped by his girlfriend after she find out the truth about him. After being diagnosed with a fatal disease, he resolves to do some good by helping an amateur conman to hoodwink the mobster who hurt his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pekKOkIrc1fOwurlwqXR4g6K5sB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19620'),
  ('453468918964146163', 'Blume in Love', 1973, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Bruce Surtees, Paul Mazursky', 'Paul Mazursky', 'George Segal, Susan Anspach, Kris Kristofferson, Marsha Mason, Shelley Winters, Donald F. Muhich, Paul Mazursky, Erin O''Reilly', 'R', 'Lawyer Stephen Blume, who specializes in divorces, lives a paradoxical situation when, having his own marriage break up, is still in love with his ex-wife.', 'Lawyer Stephen Blume, who specializes in divorces, lives a paradoxical situation when, having his own marriage break up, is still in love with his ex-wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Jw2nycNuJmUyTHhVtLwX64IBv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109259'),
  ('385330327111518244', 'Blunt Force Trauma', 2015, 'Action, Drama', 'Ken Sanzel, Camilo Buendia, Paulo Andrés Pérez', 'Ken Sanzel', 'Ryan Kwanten, Freida Pinto, Mickey Rourke, Maruia Shelton, Carolina Gómez, Rubén Zamora, Steven Galarce, David Villada', null, 'Follows the journey of John and Colt, gunfighters and sometime lovers, on parallel but very different journeys through an underground dueling culture.', 'Follows the journey of John and Colt, gunfighters and sometime lovers, on parallel but very different journeys through an underground dueling culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fGGcl2yZw3aUfHoOVR7LecU0OZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360387'),
  ('436257119614340769', 'Blurr', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Ajay Bahl, Kavish Sinha, Sudhir K Chaudhary', 'Pawan Sony, Ajay Bahl', 'Taapsee Pannu, Gulshan Devaiah, Abhilash Thapliyal, Krutika Desai Khan, Sumit Nijhawan, Radha Solanki', null, 'With progressive blindness setting in, Gayatri has to find answers to her twin sister''s unlikely death. As the lines of reality keep getting blurred, is she ready to look the truth in the eye?', 'With progressive blindness setting in, Gayatri has to find answers to her twin sister''s unlikely death. As the lines of reality keep getting blurred, is she ready to look the truth in the eye?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGKE9MVoxeLNR18VLYKDszE7jye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850837'),
  ('736298602577008570', 'Blurred Lines', 2021, 'Drama', 'Judith Kaufmann, İlker Çatak', 'Gabriele Simon', 'Emil von Schönfels, Mekyas Mulugeta, Katharina Behrens, Nicole Marischka, Godehard Giese, Luissa Cara Hansen, Oğulcan Arman Uslu, Adnan Devran', null, 'Janik and Samuel are best friends and enjoy the end of high school. Their worlds are different: Janik has parents who always do everything right, while Samuel comes from a broken home. Samuel wants order, Janik wants chaos. A thoughtless moment puts the close bond between the two friends in jeopardy. As they set off on their long-planned trip to Istanbul, the boys are looking to save their friendship, enjoy their freedom and try out a new life.', 'Janik and Samuel are best friends and enjoy the end of high school. Their worlds are different: Janik has parents who always do everything right, while Samuel comes from a broken home. Samuel wants order, Janik wants chaos. A thoughtless moment puts the close bond between the two friends in jeopardy. As they set off on their long-planned trip to Istanbul, the boys are looking to save their friendship, enjoy their freedom and try out a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRpuRV56ySO4DjUAQ8859roG5AN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743921'),
  ('596974801636134610', 'Blurt!', 2018, 'Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Michelle Johnston', 'Adrian Vina', 'Jace Norman, JoJo Siwa, Cynthia Mendez, Daniella Taylor, Taylor Dianne Robinson, Aliza Vellani, Scott Patey, Jeff Sanca', 'G', 'When nice-guy Jeremy Martin puts on mysterious virtual reality glasses at the mall, he suddenly loses his “inside voice” and starts spouting every thought he has out loud. Making matters worse, Jeremy is running for student council president against his classmate Milly, who is full of great ideas to improve the school. Desperate to get back to normal, Jeremy and his sister Victoria must figure out how to convince his brain that he can speak up for himself.', 'When nice-guy Jeremy Martin puts on mysterious virtual reality glasses at the mall, he suddenly loses his “inside voice” and starts spouting every thought he has out loud. Making matters worse, Jeremy is running for student council president against his classmate Milly, who is full of great ideas to improve the school. Desperate to get back to normal, Jeremy and his sister Victoria must figure out how to convince his brain that he can speak up for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPA7q8JceNkYSWpkIArLxC8S2v1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467181'),
  ('958695700436178689', 'Blush', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michal Vinik, Jonathan Rozenbaum, Shay Peleg', 'Michal Vinik', 'Jade Sakori, Sivan Noam Shimon, Dvir Benedek, Einav Levi, Irit Pashtan, Amit Muchtar, Koral Bosidon, Oleg Rodovilski', null, 'Na''ama is seventeen. She lives in a sleepy suburbia. She is bored. With detached parents and a rebellious older sister, her life at home is a mess. It all changes when a new girl appears at school. She''s introduced to a world of drugs, lesbians and sex. She''s thrilled. Her life, at last, becomes exciting. Is it going to last? "Barash" is a coming of age story, planted in the heart of Israeli society, about a young woman who struggles to find her self-identity in an environment that has different ideas about sex, drugs and love.', 'Na''ama is seventeen. She lives in a sleepy suburbia. She is bored. With detached parents and a rebellious older sister, her life at home is a mess. It all changes when a new girl appears at school. She''s introduced to a world of drugs, lesbians and sex. She''s thrilled. Her life, at last, becomes exciting. Is it going to last? "Barash" is a coming of age story, planted in the heart of Israeli society, about a young woman who struggles to find her self-identity in an environment that has different ideas about sex, drugs and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9YYZguVLoNVyNC5XXWSJtFsaQS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361069'),
  ('1116719128880184685', 'Blush', 2021, 'Animation, Romance, Science Fiction, Family', 'Joseph Mateo', 'Joseph Mateo', null, 'PG', 'When a horticulturalist-astronaut crashes onto a desolate planet, he encounters an ethereal visitor and discovers the joy of building a new life—realizing the universe has delivered something astonishing.', 'When a horticulturalist-astronaut crashes onto a desolate planet, he encounters an ethereal visitor and discovers the joy of building a new life—realizing the universe has delivered something astonishing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbQ5CVld2AjH8DEo0L8Wz8ag3Xy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818350'),
  ('368647134467452939', 'Blutholz', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Torsten C. Fischer, Hannes Hubach', 'Alex Buresch, Torsten C. Fischer', 'Joachim Król, Désirée Nosbusch, Alina Levshin, Geo Dobre, Anja Schneider, Peter Franke, Alexander Beyer, Orodel Olanu', null, 'The manager of a large timber company disappears without a trace in a large forest area in Romania. Ex-soldier Hans Schüssler is on a secret mission to investigate the Romanian timber mafia in his old home country of Transylvania, where he has to fight against "bloodwood" and "bear dancing".', 'The manager of a large timber company disappears without a trace in a large forest area in Romania. Ex-soldier Hans Schüssler is on a secret mission to investigate the Romanian timber mafia in his old home country of Transylvania, where he has to fight against "bloodwood" and "bear dancing".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40ayDUDhnufycfbGTxMdTdaZgFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018582'),
  ('27314664273370474', 'Blutsschwestern - Jung, magisch, tödlich', 2013, 'Horror, Mystery, Romance', 'Kai Meyer-Ricks, Jo Heim', 'Matthias Lehmann', 'Jasmin Gassmann, Paula Schramm, Kristina Dörfer, Sina Tkotsch, Esther Schweins, Roy Peter Link, Michael Lott, Klaus Grünberg', null, 'Shy medical student Milla stumbles across a medieval manuscript from the time of the witch hunts while researching for a presentation: The Bible of Blood. Together with three fellow students, she starts experimenting with the text - with extremely deadly consequences: Because "The Bible of Blood" actually seems to have the power to make her most secret wishes come true. But they have also unleashed a dark power. The inconspicuous students become sex-obsessed beasts who will walk over dead bodies...', 'Shy medical student Milla stumbles across a medieval manuscript from the time of the witch hunts while researching for a presentation: The Bible of Blood. Together with three fellow students, she starts experimenting with the text - with extremely deadly consequences: Because "The Bible of Blood" actually seems to have the power to make her most secret wishes come true. But they have also unleashed a dark power. The inconspicuous students become sex-obsessed beasts who will walk over dead bodies...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDrdom8svdIul3tK2vU4lE8yUJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166632'),
  ('868293129903669142', 'BMX Bandits', 1983, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'John Seale, Brian Trenchard-Smith, Bob Howard', 'Patrick Edgeworth', 'David Argue, John Ley, Nicole Kidman, Angelo D''Angelo, James Lugton, Bryan Marshall, Brian Sloman, Peter Browne', 'PG', 'Teens P.J. and Goose get their thrills on BMX bikes, performing hair-raising tricks all across Sydney, Australia. Along with their new friend Judy, they discover a box of walkie-talkies -- and find out that a gang of criminals intends to use them to monitor police signals during a bank robbery. When the young trio snatches the devices, it propels them on a hair-raising adventure in which their pedaling skills might just save their necks.', 'Teens P.J. and Goose get their thrills on BMX bikes, performing hair-raising tricks all across Sydney, Australia. Along with their new friend Judy, they discover a box of walkie-talkies -- and find out that a gang of criminals intends to use them to monitor police signals during a bank robbery. When the young trio snatches the devices, it propels them on a hair-raising adventure in which their pedaling skills might just save their necks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9yUSie4WBQzVDSaHx17x0RtDHy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17381'),
  ('864772667461380226', 'BNK48: Girls Don''t Cry', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit, Pacharin Surawatanapongs, Niramon Ross', null, 'Cherprang Areekul, Isarapa Thawatpakdee, Jennis Oprasert, Jiradapa Intajak, Kanteera Wadcharathadsanakul, Korapat Nilprapa, Kunjiranut Intarasin, Mananya Kaoju', null, 'A documentary about a Thai idol girl group, BNK48 originally adapting from a Japanese idol girl group, AKB48 open opportunity to ordinary teens to be selected into a controlled system and competitive concept.', 'A documentary about a Thai idol girl group, BNK48 originally adapting from a Japanese idol girl group, AKB48 open opportunity to ordinary teens to be selected into a controlled system and competitive concept.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie1eMCb5zhMvvofDy9jklvgYV8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540762'),
  ('642392708526245872', 'Bo Burnham: The Inside Outtakes', 2022, 'Comedy, Music', 'Bo Burnham, Bo Burnham', 'Bo Burnham', 'Bo Burnham', 'R', 'Exactly one year after the release of the one man show, "Bo Burnham: Inside" (made in one room, by one person, throughout the pandemic,) comes a series of unseen outtakes, deleted scenes, alternative versions of songs, and new songs unused from the special.', 'Exactly one year after the release of the one man show, "Bo Burnham: Inside" (made in one room, by one person, throughout the pandemic,) comes a series of unseen outtakes, deleted scenes, alternative versions of songs, and new songs unused from the special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSHY7F5QLlJOnf1Ox9tYZc3YVOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005159'),
  ('243162143947470029', 'Bo Burnham: What.', 2013, 'Comedy, Music', 'Christopher Storer, Bo Burnham, Andrew Wehde', 'Bo Burnham', 'Bo Burnham', null, 'Left brain and right brain duke it out and then belt out a tune in comedian Bo Burnham''s quick and clever one-man show. As intelligent as he is lanky, Burnham cynically pokes at pop entertainment while offering unadulterated showmanship of his own.', 'Left brain and right brain duke it out and then belt out a tune in comedian Bo Burnham''s quick and clever one-man show. As intelligent as he is lanky, Burnham cynically pokes at pop entertainment while offering unadulterated showmanship of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGDpMWPOKStmvf4F1gkqfeFZmXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244001'),
  ('553221886653092935', 'Boa vs. Python', 2004, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Flores, Lorenzo Senatore', 'Chase Parker', 'David Hewlett, Jaime Bergman, Kirk B.R. Woller, Adamo Palladino, Angel Boris Reed, Mariana Stansheva, Griff Furst, Ivo Naidenov', 'R', 'After an overly ambitious businessman transports an 80-foot python to the United States, the beast escapes and starts to leave behind a trail of human victims. An FBI agent and a snake specialist come up with a plot to combat the creature by pitting it against a bioengineered, 70-foot boa constrictor. It''s two great snakes that snake great together!', 'After an overly ambitious businessman transports an 80-foot python to the United States, the beast escapes and starts to leave behind a trail of human victims. An FBI agent and a snake specialist come up with a plot to combat the creature by pitting it against a bioengineered, 70-foot boa constrictor. It''s two great snakes that snake great together!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tckykOvjyXvemGMXTZZ4utWM0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36086'),
  ('100620978055605142', 'Boar', 2018, 'Horror', 'Chris Sun, Andrew Conder', 'Chris Sun', 'John Jarratt, Simone Buchanan, Melissa Tkautz, Bill Moseley, Nathan Jones, Hugh Sheridan, Roger Ward, Ricci Guarnaccio', null, 'In the harsh, yet beautiful Australian outback lives a beast, an animal of staggering size, with a ruthless, driving need for blood and destruction. It cares for none, defends its territory with brutal force, and kills with a raw, animalistic savagery unlike any have seen before.', 'In the harsh, yet beautiful Australian outback lives a beast, an animal of staggering size, with a ruthless, driving need for blood and destruction. It cares for none, defends its territory with brutal force, and kills with a raw, animalistic savagery unlike any have seen before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wxEPJzfgO0jiaZVz2pFQvYoXqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416724'),
  ('357514885707072594', 'Boarding Gate', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Olivier Assayas, Yorick Le Saux, Xavier Douin', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Asia Argento, Michael Madsen, Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei, Kim Gordon, Carl Ng Ka-Lung, Alex Descas, Joana Preiss, Raymond Tsang Chau-Ming', null, 'A beautiful woman, Sandra, seduces a wealthy businessman, Miles Rennburg. Little does he realise that she has been sent to kill him at the behest of her boyfriend/crime partner, Lester. Controlling all this is Sue, Lester''s wife.', 'A beautiful woman, Sandra, seduces a wealthy businessman, Miles Rennburg. Little does he realise that she has been sent to kill him at the behest of her boyfriend/crime partner, Lester. Controlling all this is Sue, Lester''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPUwneHOwxWTOdIVQPjamHpr8Dm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14735'),
  ('950958233410227219', 'Boarding House 2', 2016, 'Romance', 'Jeong Tae-ryeong', null, 'Jeong Neom-chyeo, Eun Ha, Ryoo Hyeon-ah, Kim Do-hee, Yu Da-eun, Jang Min-hee, Lee Jae-seok, Joo Yeon-seo', null, 'Joon-hyeok is preparing to pass the exam for 9th rank government worker. Since it is his third attempt, he must pass the exam for sure this time. He becomes to live in a boarding house, which is a part of his father’s extraordinary measures to help his son studying. But what has been waiting for Joon-hyeok in the luxurious house was not the thick text books, but the two free-spirited women. Joon-hyeok begins his cohabitation with Ah-jeong, the owner of the boarding house, who is full of voluptuous beauty, and Dal-lae, a nurse, who exudes sex appeal from both her face and body. Since then, Joon-hyeok starts to spend every night to study women not his books.', 'Joon-hyeok is preparing to pass the exam for 9th rank government worker. Since it is his third attempt, he must pass the exam for sure this time. He becomes to live in a boarding house, which is a part of his father’s extraordinary measures to help his son studying. But what has been waiting for Joon-hyeok in the luxurious house was not the thick text books, but the two free-spirited women. Joon-hyeok begins his cohabitation with Ah-jeong, the owner of the boarding house, who is full of voluptuous beauty, and Dal-lae, a nurse, who exudes sex appeal from both her face and body. Since then, Joon-hyeok starts to spend every night to study women not his books.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4czpabukI94l2kBTGTHvvvllzoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376858'),
  ('703828547595741234', 'Boarding School', 1978, 'Comedy', 'André Farwagi, Richard Suzuki', 'Paul Nicholas', 'Nastassja Kinski, Gerry Sundquist, Stefano D''Amato, Gabriele Blum, Sean Chapman, Véronique Delbourg, Nigel Greaves, Marion Kracht', 'R', 'This film tells the story about a group of girls at an exclusive German girls boarding school. Across the lake is an exclusive boys boarding school...', 'This film tells the story about a group of girls at an exclusive German girls boarding school. Across the lake is an exclusive boys boarding school...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdLGfBDjvBDA5gvaRrOxlH5RSb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68123'),
  ('1066830082393592411', 'Boarding School', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Erika McGowan, Daniel Lugo, Boaz Yakin', 'Boaz Yakin', 'Luke Prael, Sterling Jerins, Nadia Alexander, Tammy Blanchard, Lucy Walters, Samantha Mathis, Will Patton, David Aaron Baker', 'R', 'When troubled 12-year-old Jacob Felsen is sent away to boarding school, he enters every kid’s worst nightmare: a creepy old mansion, deserted except for six other teenage misfits and two menacing and mysterious teachers. As events become increasingly horrific, Jacob must conquer his fears to find the strength to survive.', 'When troubled 12-year-old Jacob Felsen is sent away to boarding school, he enters every kid’s worst nightmare: a creepy old mansion, deserted except for six other teenage misfits and two menacing and mysterious teachers. As events become increasingly horrific, Jacob must conquer his fears to find the strength to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lun3G1IU6AYgXlXP649amULMPpv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531145'),
  ('204688079933664259', 'Boardinghouse', 1982, 'Horror', 'John Wintergate, Jan Lucas, Obee Ray', 'John Wintergate', 'John Wintergate, Kalassu, Alexandra Day, Joel Riordan, Brian Bruderlin, Mary McKinley, Tracy O''Brian, Selma Kora', 'R', 'A boarding house is reopened years after gruesome murders were committed there. Suddenly, the body count begins once more!', 'A boarding house is reopened years after gruesome murders were committed there. Suddenly, the body count begins once more!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5sF7CvHXd1Y9fmVhHMUmmmKjhY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40464'),
