  ('144818153415848827', 'Boat Builders', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig, Clarence Nash, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Mickey buys a boat kit, and enlists Goofy and Donald to help assemble it. The plans say, "so simple a child could do it", so of course, they have their share of troubles. But before long, they''re ready to launch the Queen Minnie, with appropriate fanfare, at which time, all the collapsible parts collapse.', 'Mickey buys a boat kit, and enlists Goofy and Donald to help assemble it. The plans say, "so simple a child could do it", so of course, they have their share of troubles. But before long, they''re ready to launch the Queen Minnie, with appropriate fanfare, at which time, all the collapsible parts collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqHZHunOfvvZ4Xy5bbePNvvbtDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66824'),
  ('556532535473062154', 'Boat Leaving the Port', 1895, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Marguerite Lumière, Jeanne-Joséphine Lumière', null, 'In very bad weather and a stormy sea, a small boat manned by two men is trying to leave the harbor of La Ciotat, while several people are watching them from the nearby pier.', 'In very bad weather and a stormy sea, a small boat manned by two men is trying to leave the harbor of La Ciotat, while several people are watching them from the nearby pier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9P6CPyLSXf7juIcHmJ0xP3GhB1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129436'),
  ('895224528582377250', 'Boat People', 1982, 'Drama', 'Ann Hui, Wong Chung-Gei, Stanley Kwan Kam-Pang', 'Chiu Kang-Chien', 'George Lam Tsz-Cheung, Season Ma, Cora Miao, Andy Lau, Tung-Sheng Chang, Qi Mengshi, Jialing Hao, Jia Meiying', 'R', 'A Japanese photojournalist revisits Vietnam after the liberation to document the nation, and begins following and documenting the young children from a poor Vietnamese family.', 'A Japanese photojournalist revisits Vietnam after the liberation to document the nation, and begins following and documenting the young children from a poor Vietnamese family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdyxE6bXtozYG2jQiWKZUz3u4LD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72445'),
  ('200688219702928463', 'Boat Trip', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Mort Nathan, Shawn Maurer', 'Mort Nathan, William Bigelow', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Horatio Sanz, Roselyn Sánchez, Vivica A. Fox, Maurice Godin, Roger Moore, Victoria Silvstedt, Lin Shaye', 'R', 'Two guys whose love lives are a wreck look forward to finding ladies on the high seas. Unfortunately, they''ve mistakenly been booked on a gay cruise.', 'Two guys whose love lives are a wreck look forward to finding ladies on the high seas. Unfortunately, they''ve mistakenly been booked on a gay cruise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHFJt9nEfVIUItBfKZr7qhbgveL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9557'),
  ('358255159393538065', 'Boats Out of Watermelon Rinds', 2004, 'Drama', 'Ahmet Uluçay, Figen Ermek Özçorlu, İlker Berke', 'Ahmet Uluçay', 'Ismail Hakki Taslak, Kadir Kaymaz, Gülayse Erkoc, Aysel Yılmaz, Boncuk Yilmaz, Hasbiye Günay, Mustafa Çoban, Fizuli Caferof', null, 'In his award-winning debut feature film, director Ahmet Ulucay portrays the innocence of childhood and the lure of the cinema for two teens in a small Turkish village. Working for a watermelon seller by day, Remet spends his evenings trying to rebuild a film projector with his friend Mehmet. Both have big dreams to be famous film directors one day.', 'In his award-winning debut feature film, director Ahmet Ulucay portrays the innocence of childhood and the lure of the cinema for two teens in a small Turkish village. Working for a watermelon seller by day, Remet spends his evenings trying to rebuild a film projector with his friend Mehmet. Both have big dreams to be famous film directors one day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DeHGGQuGdmXLORzIM6Sqy7Xn9t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103785'),
  ('75478508659594115', 'Bob & Carol & Ted & Alice', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Mazursky, Charles Lang, Anthony Ray', 'Paul Mazursky, Larry Tucker', 'Natalie Wood, Robert Culp, Elliott Gould, Dyan Cannon, Horst Ebersberg, Lee Bergere, Donald F. Muhich, Noble Lee Holderread Jr.', 'R', 'After returning to Los Angeles from a group therapy session, documentary filmmaker Bob Sanders and his wife, Carol, find themselves becoming vigilante couples counselors, offering unsolicited advice to their best friends, Ted and Alice Henderson. Not wanting to be rude, the Hendersons play along, but some latent sexual tension among the four soon comes bubbling to the surface, and long-buried desires don''t stay buried for long.', 'After returning to Los Angeles from a group therapy session, documentary filmmaker Bob Sanders and his wife, Carol, find themselves becoming vigilante couples counselors, offering unsolicited advice to their best friends, Ted and Alice Henderson. Not wanting to be rude, the Hendersons play along, but some latent sexual tension among the four soon comes bubbling to the surface, and long-buried desires don''t stay buried for long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fDLuB1q3JycYJPK0F65OYO3lAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26520'),
  ('882487229678411852', 'Bob & Marys', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Prisco, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Francesco Prisco, Marco Gianfreda', 'Rocco Papaleo, Laura Morante, Simona Tabasco, Andrea Di Maria, Francesco Di Leva, Antonino Iuorio, Giovanni Esposito, Massimiliano Gallo', null, 'A married couple must get their hands dirty when a bunch of mobsters start using their new home as a deposit for illegal material.', 'A married couple must get their hands dirty when a bunch of mobsters start using their new home as a deposit for illegal material.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fctZfO0F0sxo04o8D3vVBSfHeL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458749'),
  ('754329892598081939', 'Bob Biswas', 2021, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Gairik Sarkar, Diya Annapurna Ghosh', 'Sujoy Ghosh', 'Abhishek Bachchan, Chitrangada Singh, Paran Banerjee, Tina Desai, Purab Kohli, Pabitra Rabha, Yusuf Hussain, Barun Chanda', null, 'Bob Biswas, a hitman-for-hire, comes out of a prolonged coma and struggles to recall his identity but suffers a moral dilemma when the memories of his past resurface.', 'Bob Biswas, a hitman-for-hire, comes out of a prolonged coma and struggles to recall his identity but suffers a moral dilemma when the memories of his past resurface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CikkLfMxtKXjCDkNnzVfTwwpIL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674531'),
  ('111579174114477778', 'Bob Dylan: The 30th Anniversary Concert Celebration', 1993, 'Music', 'Gavin Taylor', null, 'Bob Dylan, Johnny Cash, Eric Clapton, George Harrison, John Mellencamp, Stevie Wonder, Lou Reed, Eddie Vedder', null, 'On October 16, 1992, an impressive and eclectic group of artists gathered at Madison Square Garden in New York City for the purpose of celebrating the music of Bob Dylan on the occasion of his 30th anniversary of recording. Bringing together musical greats as far-flung as Johnny Cash and Eddie Vedder, The Clancy Brothers and Lou Reed, the four-hour show celebrated a truly remarkable lifetime of songs in front of a sold-out audience of over 18,000. Warmly dubbed the Bobfest by participant Neil Young, the show was broadcast around the world and featured a cast of musical notables performing carefully chosen and often surprising selections from the incomparable Dylan songbook. At evening''s end, the man of honor himself appeared on stage and gracefully brought it all back home again. In a world where all-star celebrity gatherings have become commonplace, the Bob Dylan celebration stood out as, first and foremost, a legitimately memorable musical event.', 'On October 16, 1992, an impressive and eclectic group of artists gathered at Madison Square Garden in New York City for the purpose of celebrating the music of Bob Dylan on the occasion of his 30th anniversary of recording. Bringing together musical greats as far-flung as Johnny Cash and Eddie Vedder, The Clancy Brothers and Lou Reed, the four-hour show celebrated a truly remarkable lifetime of songs in front of a sold-out audience of over 18,000. Warmly dubbed the Bobfest by participant Neil Young, the show was broadcast around the world and featured a cast of musical notables performing carefully chosen and often surprising selections from the incomparable Dylan songbook. At evening''s end, the man of honor himself appeared on stage and gracefully brought it all back home again. In a world where all-star celebrity gatherings have become commonplace, the Bob Dylan celebration stood out as, first and foremost, a legitimately memorable musical event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1a7wbXbMv82uYWHreevtPY7anbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54931'),
  ('137962224884426705', 'Bob Kick, the Mischievous Kid', 1903, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A boy is led into the frame by two nursemaids who give him a big ball to play with. For the remainder of the film heads appear and disappear, stage props blow up and turn into other objects or people, and finally Bob Kick disappears.', 'A boy is led into the frame by two nursemaids who give him a big ball to play with. For the remainder of the film heads appear and disappear, stage props blow up and turn into other objects or people, and finally Bob Kick disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6sgh9ojWUv81T5YIufJ3N4Ng6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195948'),
  ('930734379012985882', 'Bob Lazar: Area 51 and Flying Saucers', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Jeremy Kenyon Lockyer Corbell', 'Jeremy Kenyon Lockyer Corbell', 'Bob Lazar, George Knapp, Mickey Rourke, Jeremy Kenyon Lockyer Corbell, Joy White, Phyllis Tucker, Layne Keck, Mario Santa Cruz', null, 'Area 51, flying saucers from another world - and the program to create a fierce technology. Bob Lazar remains the singular most famous and controversial name in the world of UFOs. The reason you know about Area 51 is because Lazar came forward and told you about it. His disclosures have turned his life upside-down and he has tried to stay out of the spotlight. For this reason, he has never let any filmmaker into the private world of his daily life - that is - until now. Corbell’s film explores Lazar’s claims through the lens of thirty years - providing rare and never before revealed footage - guaranteed to alter the landscape of the debate.', 'Area 51, flying saucers from another world - and the program to create a fierce technology. Bob Lazar remains the singular most famous and controversial name in the world of UFOs. The reason you know about Area 51 is because Lazar came forward and told you about it. His disclosures have turned his life upside-down and he has tried to stay out of the spotlight. For this reason, he has never let any filmmaker into the private world of his daily life - that is - until now. Corbell’s film explores Lazar’s claims through the lens of thirty years - providing rare and never before revealed footage - guaranteed to alter the landscape of the debate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ibnQLtq3BUXQPEjOUsIhyDDvS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522320'),
  ('163054120263803924', 'Bob le Flambeur', 1956, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Jean-Pierre Melville, Henri Decaë, François Gir', 'Jean-Pierre Melville, Auguste Le Breton', 'Roger Duchesne, Isabelle Corey, Daniel Cauchy, Gérard Buhr, Guy Decomble, Claude Cerval, Howard Vernon, Colette Fleury', 'PG', 'In Paris, Bob Montagne is practically synonymous with gambling -- and winning. He is kind, classy and well-liked by virtually everyone in town, including police inspector Ledru. However, when Bob''s luck turns sour, he begins to lose friends and makes the most desperate gamble of his life: to rob the Deauville casino during Grand Prix weekend, when the vaults are full. Unfortunately, Bob soon learns that the game is rigged and the cops are on to him.', 'In Paris, Bob Montagne is practically synonymous with gambling -- and winning. He is kind, classy and well-liked by virtually everyone in town, including police inspector Ledru. However, when Bob''s luck turns sour, he begins to lose friends and makes the most desperate gamble of his life: to rob the Deauville casino during Grand Prix weekend, when the vaults are full. Unfortunately, Bob soon learns that the game is rigged and the cops are on to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CIfIDtD1I1rYY3ooaya8iZHlD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26030'),
  ('844390114180468192', 'Bob Marley: One Love', 2024, 'Music, History, Drama', 'Robert Elswit, Reinaldo Marcus Green, Dominic Fysh', 'Zach Baylin, Frank E. Flowers, Terence Winter', 'Kingsley Ben-Adir, Lashana Lynch, James Norton, Tosin Cole, Umi Myers, Anthony Welsh, Nia Ashi, Aston Barrett Jr.', 'PG-13', 'Jamaican singer-songwriter Bob Marley overcomes adversity to become the most famous reggae musician in the world.', 'Jamaican singer-songwriter Bob Marley overcomes adversity to become the most famous reggae musician in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lQftpEARVVB9op4TaYiIbactzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802219'),
  ('1104563628762184334', 'Bob Roberts', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tim Robbins, Jean Lépine, Maria Melograne', 'Tim Robbins', 'Tim Robbins, Giancarlo Esposito, Alan Rickman, Ray Wise, Brian Murray, Gore Vidal, Rebecca Jenkins, Harry Lennix', 'R', 'Millionaire conservative Bob Roberts launches an insurgent campaign against incumbent senator Brickley Paiste, firing up crowds at his rallies by singing ''60s-style acoustic folk songs with lyrics espousing far-right conservative social and economic views.', 'Millionaire conservative Bob Roberts launches an insurgent campaign against incumbent senator Brickley Paiste, firing up crowds at his rallies by singing ''60s-style acoustic folk songs with lyrics espousing far-right conservative social and economic views.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4PokuSIrmbN5oCR54D8kiI0U6a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10608'),
  ('917666755951916192', 'Bob Ross: Happy Accidents, Betrayal & Greed', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Joshua Rofé, Ronan Killeen', null, 'Bob Ross, Steve Ross, Vicky Ross, John Thamm, Ian Bourland, Julia Friedman, Dana Jester, Doug Blandy', 'PG-13', 'Bob Ross brought joy to millions as the world''s most famous art instructor. But a battle for his business empire cast a shadow over his happy trees.', 'Bob Ross brought joy to millions as the world''s most famous art instructor. But a battle for his business empire cast a shadow over his happy trees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jov3rCzNT8u5b7A56c0XKCkP5Dc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:853354'),
  ('335028428746849391', 'Bob Spit: We Do Not Like People', 2021, 'Animation, Documentary, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Cesar Cabral, Alziro Barbosa', 'Cesar Cabral, Leandro Maciel', 'Milhem Cortaz, Angeli, Paulo Miklos, Carol Guaycuru, Laerte Coutinho, André Abujamra, Beto Hora, Hugo Possolo', null, 'Bob Spit, a comic book character, lives in a post-apocalyptic desert inside the mind of his creator, the legendary Brazilian cartoonist Angeli. When Angeli decides to kill off Bob, the old punk leaves this wasteland and faces his creator.', 'Bob Spit, a comic book character, lives in a post-apocalyptic desert inside the mind of his creator, the legendary Brazilian cartoonist Angeli. When Angeli decides to kill off Bob, the old punk leaves this wasteland and faces his creator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tv1JcxHfNtpjZQ4pCkVDpKeSF2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831760'),
  ('37893910321647753', 'Bob the Butler', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Gary Sinyor, Jason Lehel', 'Jane Walker Wood, Steven Manners, Gary Sinyor', 'Tom Green, Brooke Shields, Genevieve Buechner, Benjamin B. Smith, Rob LaBelle, Valerie Tian, Simon Callow, Iris Graham', 'PG', 'Bob, an incompetent man, is searching for an available job by alphabetical order. He had just failed all of the A''s, and discovers an ad in the Yellow Pages for a butler school. He is the only one in the butler school course to pass, because all of the other people quit due to the embarrassment and pressure of the teacher.', 'Bob, an incompetent man, is searching for an available job by alphabetical order. He had just failed all of the A''s, and discovers an ad in the Yellow Pages for a butler school. He is the only one in the butler school course to pass, because all of the other people quit due to the embarrassment and pressure of the teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbVHXnDlx9UPCYH9bIAP5Dr8PC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22747'),
  ('104851104910310415', 'Bob Trevino Likes It', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tracie Laymon, John Rosario', 'Tracie Laymon', 'Barbie Ferreira, John Leguizamo, French Stewart, Lauren ''Lolo'' Spencer, Rachel Bay Jones, Debra Stipe, Ashlyn Moore, Phil Elam', 'PG-13', 'Lily Trevino unexpectedly befriends an online stranger who shares her self-centered father’s name. This new Bob Trevino’s support could transform her life.', 'Lily Trevino unexpectedly befriends an online stranger who shares her self-centered father’s name. This new Bob Trevino’s support could transform her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMIiBztK0PgwIQ0FMItv4dd8wIL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1169789'),
  ('885697269694576259', 'Bob''s Birthday', 1994, 'Comedy, Animation, Drama', 'Alison Snowden, David Fine', 'David Fine, Alison Snowden', 'Andy Hamilton, Alison Snowden, Harry Enfield, Andrew MacLachlan, Tessa Wojiczak, Sally Grace', null, 'Margaret Fish is planning a surprise party for her dentist husband, Bob. Meanwhile, at the office, Bob is having a mid-life crisis while insects munch on what''s left of his plants. When Bob returns home, Margaret has a terrible time getting him into the room where everyone''s hidden until he''s halfway through changing clothes and talking about how horrid all their nebbishy friends are (the same friends hidden all over the room).', 'Margaret Fish is planning a surprise party for her dentist husband, Bob. Meanwhile, at the office, Bob is having a mid-life crisis while insects munch on what''s left of his plants. When Bob returns home, Margaret has a terrible time getting him into the room where everyone''s hidden until he''s halfway through changing clothes and talking about how horrid all their nebbishy friends are (the same friends hidden all over the room).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95VhGG4rTKSgMJ2QwcRN1ewGyvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48273'),
  ('927965158717260699', 'Bobbie Jo and the Outlaw', 1976, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Mark L. Lester, Stanley Wright, Gil Hubbs', 'Vernon Zimmerman', 'Marjoe Gortner, Lynda Carter, Jesse Vint, Merrie Lynn Ross, Belinda Balaski, Gene Drew, Peggy Stewart, Gerrit Graham', 'R', 'A young country-star wannabe takes off from her carhop career to join with a young, modern Billy the Kid wannabe for an adventure in theft, murder and mayhem.', 'A young country-star wannabe takes off from her carhop career to join with a young, modern Billy the Kid wannabe for an adventure in theft, murder and mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m32mECgVlf6b4laxNf017lIlgDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59902'),
