  ('617422126934974123', 'Body Chemistry III: Point of Seduction', 1994, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Jim Wynorski, Tony Schwartz, Don E. FauntLeRoy', 'Jackson Barr', 'Andrew Stevens, Morgan Fairchild, Shari Shattuck, Chick Vennera, Robert Forster, Stella Stevens, Delia Sheppard, Jon Lindstrom', null, 'Movie producer Alan Clay wants to make a movie about Dr. Claire Archer and her amazing life story. Claire falls for Alan, and Alan cannot resist temptation, so now he''s hiding an affair from wife Beth. When the movie writer''s investigations uncover new facts in the killings, Claire senses the danger, and responds.', 'Movie producer Alan Clay wants to make a movie about Dr. Claire Archer and her amazing life story. Claire falls for Alan, and Alan cannot resist temptation, so now he''s hiding an affair from wife Beth. When the movie writer''s investigations uncover new facts in the killings, Claire senses the danger, and responds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YAxQv20gSrIgnzSaJxihm2DfXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149561'),
  ('500377519741352661', 'Body Count', 1986, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Ruggero Deodato, Emilio Loffredo, Alberto Acciarito', 'Dardano Sacchetti, Alessandro Capone, Luca D''Alisera', 'Bruce Penhall, Mimsy Farmer, David Hess, Luisa Maneri, Nicola Farron, Andrew J. Lederer, Stefano Madia, John Steiner', 'R', 'A bodybuilder, a junk-food addict and a wild blonde nymph and their friends are stalked by a terrifying figure. An horrific tale of murder as a fun-loving group of college students explore the Colorado wilderness.', 'A bodybuilder, a junk-food addict and a wild blonde nymph and their friends are stalked by a terrifying figure. An horrific tale of murder as a fun-loving group of college students explore the Colorado wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yfQEFECJrSo1Y7sXdZHdbeBDPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30879'),
  ('625006063339257877', 'Body Count', 1995, 'Thriller, Action', 'Talun Hsu, Blake T. Evans, Irv Goodnoff', 'Henry Madden', 'Robert Davi, Steven Bauer, Brigitte Nielsen, Sonny Chiba, Jan-Michael Vincent, Cindy Ambuehl, Eric Lutes, Eliott Keener', 'R', 'A cold-blooded assassin is out for revenge against an elite corps of Special Crimes Agents headed by Eddie Cook and Vinnie Rizzo. When Cold blooded hit man Makoto escapes from prison, he and his sexy and lethal partner set out to execute the agents who sent them away. As the Special Crimes Agents are systematically gunned down, Cook and Rizzo find themselves in a deadly race to find the assassins and stop the bloodbath.', 'A cold-blooded assassin is out for revenge against an elite corps of Special Crimes Agents headed by Eddie Cook and Vinnie Rizzo. When Cold blooded hit man Makoto escapes from prison, he and his sexy and lethal partner set out to execute the agents who sent them away. As the Special Crimes Agents are systematically gunned down, Cook and Rizzo find themselves in a deadly race to find the assassins and stop the bloodbath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FlFCAI46OMMJy9cHso36vSYrlV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322590'),
  ('304356097300399791', 'Body Count', 1998, 'Action, Thriller', 'Robert Patton-Spruill, Charles Mills', 'Theodore Witcher', 'David Caruso, Linda Fiorentino, John Leguizamo, Ving Rhames, Donnie Wahlberg, Forest Whitaker, Mick Corrigan, Terry Loughlin', 'R', 'A group of thieves attempt to rob an art gallery, but when plans backfire and one of the men winds up dead, the group head down south, running afoul of the law. Along the way, they meet up with a seductive con artist with ideas of her own.', 'A group of thieves attempt to rob an art gallery, but when plans backfire and one of the men winds up dead, the group head down south, running afoul of the law. Along the way, they meet up with a seductive con artist with ideas of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6TuM0hWFD1la74txZrXYEASJSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31015'),
  ('226172162995523616', 'Body Double', 1984, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Brian De Palma, Stephen H. Burum, Joe Napolitano', 'Robert J. Avrech, Brian De Palma', 'Craig Wasson, Melanie Griffith, Gregg Henry, Deborah Shelton, Guy Boyd, Dennis Franz, David Haskell, Rebecca Stanley', 'R', 'After losing an acting role and his girlfriend, Jake Scully finally catches a break: he gets offered a gig house-sitting in the Hollywood Hills. While peering through the beautiful home''s telescope one night, he spies a gorgeous woman dancing in her window. But when he witnesses the girl''s murder, it leads Scully through the netherworld of the adult entertainment industry on a search for answers—with porn actress Holly Body as his guide.', 'After losing an acting role and his girlfriend, Jake Scully finally catches a break: he gets offered a gig house-sitting in the Hollywood Hills. While peering through the beautiful home''s telescope one night, he spies a gorgeous woman dancing in her window. But when he witnesses the girl''s murder, it leads Scully through the netherworld of the adult entertainment industry on a search for answers—with porn actress Holly Body as his guide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRFm5P2AdOGpELwm3HHhmUz6k5I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11507'),
  ('112944542521512903', 'Body Electric', 2017, 'Drama', 'Marcelo Caetano, Andrea Capella, Gabriel Domingues', 'Marcelo Caetano, Hilton Lacerda, Gabriel Domingues', 'Kelner Macêdo, Lucas Andrade, Welket Bungué, Ana Flavia Cavalcanti, Daniel Torres, Dani Nefussi, Emerson Ferreira, Ernani Sanchez', null, 'Elias is a handsome young deputy manager in a garment factory in São Paulo. When he’s not working, he enjoys casual encounters in the big city. The arrival of a young African, Fernando, on the production line piques his interest and Elias finds himself increasingly drawn into socialising with his work colleagues.', 'Elias is a handsome young deputy manager in a garment factory in São Paulo. When he’s not working, he enjoys casual encounters in the big city. The arrival of a young African, Fernando, on the production line piques his interest and Elias finds himself increasingly drawn into socialising with his work colleagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9MfxX2eHRBI3c7XZSMfYI0bTYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434471'),
  ('1018089849989895268', 'Body Guards', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Maria Pia Rocco', 'Marco Martani, Fausto Brizzi, Neri Parenti', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Biagio Izzo, Enzo Salvi, Cindy Crawford, Victoria Silvstedt, Anna Falchi, Megan Gale', null, 'Fabio Leone and Paolo Pecora are two police officers from Rome, who, together with the careless Neapolitan Ciro Marmotta, are fired from the barracks due their scuppering of a plan to capture a secret agent.', 'Fabio Leone and Paolo Pecora are two police officers from Rome, who, together with the careless Neapolitan Ciro Marmotta, are fired from the barracks due their scuppering of a plan to capture a secret agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfVuyuYz1D7SjVZM8JywVHx8xZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43555'),
  ('1060811786074316044', 'Body Heat', 1981, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Lawrence Kasdan, Richard H. Kline, Michael Grillo', 'Lawrence Kasdan', 'William Hurt, Kathleen Turner, Richard Crenna, Ted Danson, J.A. Preston, Mickey Rourke, Kim Zimmer, Jane Hallaren', 'R', 'During an extreme heatwave, a beautiful Florida woman and a seedy lawyer engage in an affair while plotting the murder of her rich husband.', 'During an extreme heatwave, a beautiful Florida woman and a seedy lawyer engage in an affair while plotting the murder of her rich husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LipPcaW1J9IjAP7TOTesw8OcMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14412'),
  ('1080569877342935951', 'Body Language', 1995, 'Thriller, Romance, TV Movie', 'Andrzej Sekula, George Case, Jim LaClair', 'Eric Harlacher', 'Tom Berenger, Nancy Travis, Robert Patrick, Eddie Jones, Heidi Schanz, Dana Gladstone, Patricia Belcher, Dayton Callie', 'R', 'A lawyer, defending a Mafia boss, falls for a beautiful woman with a sad story to tell. She says she''s being abused by her brutal husband and she needs his help.', 'A lawyer, defending a Mafia boss, falls for a beautiful woman with a sad story to tell. She says she''s being abused by her brutal husband and she needs his help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsGP22L9Gz7DAkUVTFffZWxQaR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65280'),
  ('458956068836791863', 'Body Language', 2011, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Jeffrey Elmont, Edd Lukas', null, 'Floris Bosveld, Lorenzo van Velzen Bottazzi, Ingrid Jansen, Sigourney Korper, Ruben Solognier', null, 'An hour before the five best Dutch dance crews fly to a contest in New York, the subsidized trip is cancelled. Five dancers from totally different crews don''t want to give up their free plane ticket and go anyway. In New York they realize what they''ve done. They have no money, no plan and no crew. But... They came to dance so there is only one thing to do. Together they form a new crew and do everything they can to enter the contest they came for. In the mean time... they have to survive two weeks in New York without any cash. Written by Tijs van Marle', 'An hour before the five best Dutch dance crews fly to a contest in New York, the subsidized trip is cancelled. Five dancers from totally different crews don''t want to give up their free plane ticket and go anyway. In New York they realize what they''ve done. They have no money, no plan and no crew. But... They came to dance so there is only one thing to do. Together they form a new crew and do everything they can to enter the contest they came for. In the mean time... they have to survive two weeks in New York without any cash. Written by Tijs van Marle', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdqpcPGhz9PO7yzZzMNxYMCQqBu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87019'),
  ('1151776112234264152', 'Body Melt', 1994, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Philip Brophy, Euan Keddie, Tony Gilbert', 'Philip Brophy, Rod Bishop', 'Gerard Kennedy, Andrew Daddo, Ian Smith, Regina Gaigalas, Vincent Gil, Neil Foley, Anthea Davis, Matthew Newton', null, 'Residents of peaceful Pebbles Court, Homesville, are being used unknowingly as test experiments for a new ''Body Drug'' that causes rapid body decomposition (melting skin etc.) and painful death.', 'Residents of peaceful Pebbles Court, Homesville, are being used unknowingly as test experiments for a new ''Body Drug'' that causes rapid body decomposition (melting skin etc.) and painful death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DhwXNsZ5X66aQi9VnJMPn1Xcsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22455'),
  ('545810887107828726', 'Body of Evidence', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Douglas Milsome, Uli Edel, Dennis Maguire', 'Brad Mirman', 'Madonna, Willem Dafoe, Julianne Moore, Anne Archer, Jürgen Prochnow, Frank Langella, Lillian Lehman, Joe Mantegna', 'R', 'When an elderly millionaire is found dead with cocaine in his system, his will leaves $8 million to Rebecca Carlson, who was having an affair with him. District attorney Robert Garrett decides to prosecute Rebecca, arguing that she deliberately engaged in wild sex with the old man to overexcite him and lead to his premature death. Defense attorney Frank Dulaney defends Rebecca in court while getting sucked into a dangerous affair with her.', 'When an elderly millionaire is found dead with cocaine in his system, his will leaves $8 million to Rebecca Carlson, who was having an affair with him. District attorney Robert Garrett decides to prosecute Rebecca, arguing that she deliberately engaged in wild sex with the old man to overexcite him and lead to his premature death. Defense attorney Frank Dulaney defends Rebecca in court while getting sucked into a dangerous affair with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGDfwZHRMpY5R0ZkmaiHHvpYQKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2149'),
  ('163157978405197681', 'Body of Influence', 1994, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Glenn Kershaw, João Fernandes, Gregory Dark', 'David P. Schreiber', 'Nick Cassavetes, Shannon Whirry, Richard Roundtree, Anna Karin, Sandahl Bergman, Don Swayze, Catherine Parks, Diana Barton', 'R', 'A successful psychiatrist has his world turned upside-down by the appearance of a mystery woman who cannot recall her own past...', 'A successful psychiatrist has his world turned upside-down by the appearance of a mystery woman who cannot recall her own past...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6rMLugMP6WAHNqdTNBcLoxyNhp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95084'),
  ('476909088566919271', 'Body of Influence 2', 1996, 'Thriller', 'Brian J. Smith, Azusa Ohno', 'Brian J. Smith', 'Jodie Fisher, Daniel Anderson, Jonathan Goldstein, Stephen Poletti, Pat Brennan, Cheryl Lawyer, Clive Rees, Landon Hall', null, 'The relationship between a psychoanalyst and his seductive, unhappily married patient troubled by psycho-sexual nightmares becomes dangerously intimate as they gradually reveal dark secrets from their pasts.', 'The relationship between a psychoanalyst and his seductive, unhappily married patient troubled by psycho-sexual nightmares becomes dangerously intimate as they gradually reveal dark secrets from their pasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiWaTOWmVrr9XmK0uNAvnKtmXQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279576'),
  ('987037267314492238', 'Body of Lies', 2008, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Ridley Scott, Alexander Witt, Monica Sallustio', 'William Monahan', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Russell Crowe, Golshifteh Farahani, Mark Strong, Ali Suliman, Oscar Isaac, Simon McBurney, Lubna Azabal', 'R', 'The CIA’s hunt is on for the mastermind of a wave of terrorist attacks. Roger Ferris is the agency’s man on the ground, moving from place to place, scrambling to stay ahead of ever-shifting events. An eye in the sky – a satellite link – watches Ferris. At the other end of that real-time link is the CIA’s Ed Hoffman, strategizing events from thousands of miles away. And as Ferris nears the target, he discovers trust can be just as dangerous as it is necessary for survival.', 'The CIA’s hunt is on for the mastermind of a wave of terrorist attacks. Roger Ferris is the agency’s man on the ground, moving from place to place, scrambling to stay ahead of ever-shifting events. An eye in the sky – a satellite link – watches Ferris. At the other end of that real-time link is the CIA’s Ed Hoffman, strategizing events from thousands of miles away. And as Ferris nears the target, he discovers trust can be just as dangerous as it is necessary for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OK0FoZV2UIYqYlIEa9NHPYe2Gl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12113'),
  ('399573854606951131', 'Body Parts', 1991, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Eric Red, Theo van de Sande', 'Eric Red, Norman Snider', 'Jeff Fahey, Lindsay Duncan, Kim Delaney, Zakes Mokae, Brad Dourif, John Walsh, Paul Ben-Victor, Peter Murnik', 'R', 'A criminal psychologist loses his arm in a car crash, and becomes one of three patients to have their missing limbs replaced by those belonging to an executed serial killer. One of them dies violently, and disturbing occurrences start happening to the surviving two.', 'A criminal psychologist loses his arm in a car crash, and becomes one of three patients to have their missing limbs replaced by those belonging to an executed serial killer. One of them dies violently, and disturbing occurrences start happening to the surviving two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hFSFiLMy0wnyVaaJ4EHFlPD1yf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32146'),
  ('369729528986811847', 'Body Parts', 1992, 'Thriller, Comedy, Horror', 'Michael Paul Girard, Gerald M. Williams, Jan Marlyn Reesman', 'Michael Paul Girard', 'Teri Marlow, Dick Monda, Clement von Franckenstein, Debra Lamb, Steven B. McMillin, Johnny Gidcomb, Jonathan Mandell, Sharon Kane', null, 'A psycho videotapes his dismemberment of strippers.', 'A psycho videotapes his dismemberment of strippers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBNoRg0sk7DLXifS5k97m60QAqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69939'),
  ('401064937196754603', 'Body Parts', 2023, 'Horror', 'Kim Jang-mi, Wally Seo, G’sam', null, 'Kim Min-seok, Kim Chae-eun, Kwon Ah-reum, Han Sang-hyuk, Kang Joon-kyu, Kim A-hyun, Jo Woo-ri, Lala Teresa', null, 'Si-Kyung, the youngest reporter, infiltrates an unnamed religious group. Invited to a special ceremony, she witnesses strange things happening in the prayer house. Five sacrifices and five stories offered by the church members. When the story is over, she too must make a sacrifice.', 'Si-Kyung, the youngest reporter, infiltrates an unnamed religious group. Invited to a special ceremony, she witnesses strange things happening in the prayer house. Five sacrifices and five stories offered by the church members. When the story is over, she too must make a sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xZHUmCLgcWsrK5p18eTsqTnTDl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987538'),
  ('1071863681381363935', 'Body Puzzle', 1992, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Lamberto Bava, Luigi Kuveiller, Alberto Brusco', 'Lamberto Bava, Teodoro Corrà, Bruce Martin', 'Joanna Pacula, Tomas Arana, François Montagut, Erika Blanc, Gianni Garko, Matteo Gazzolo, Susanna Javicoli, Bruno Corazzari', null, 'A homicide detective realizes that the brutal murders committed by a mysterious serial killer he''s after have something to do with the late husband of a beautiful widow.', 'A homicide detective realizes that the brutal murders committed by a mysterious serial killer he''s after have something to do with the late husband of a beautiful widow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlNfUemYKvrYI2eh17PjUQA4ZHR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29954'),
  ('721985718626128512', 'Body Rock', 1984, 'Music, Drama', 'Marcelo Epstein, Robby Müller', 'Desmond Nakano', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Vicki Frederick, Cameron Dye, Michelle Nicastro, Ray Sharkey, Seth Kaufman, Joseph Whipp, Grace Zabriskie', 'PG-13', 'A disco owner lures a New York breakdancer away from his rapping and dancing friends.', 'A disco owner lures a New York breakdancer away from his rapping and dancing friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbP7KnApzdk8p1wf8ZAFPAx1bdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47946'),
  ('135290038833739262', 'Body Shots', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Cristofer, Hans Berggren, Kristen Ploucha', 'David McKenna', 'Jerry O''Connell, Amanda Peet, Sean Patrick Flanery, Tara Reid, Ron Livingston, Emily Procter, Joe Basile, Scott Burkholder', 'R', 'The Los Angeles club scene is a place of booze-fueled decadence and debauchery. In a night full of possibilities, eight 20-somethings take to the clubs seeking good times, companionship and maybe a little sex. But in the harsh light of the morning after, their worlds are thrown into a spin of confusion when hungover Sara accuses hard-partying Mike of date rape. Loyalties are tested as each among them is forced to take sides.', 'The Los Angeles club scene is a place of booze-fueled decadence and debauchery. In a night full of possibilities, eight 20-somethings take to the clubs seeking good times, companionship and maybe a little sex. But in the harsh light of the morning after, their worlds are thrown into a spin of confusion when hungover Sara accuses hard-partying Mike of date rape. Loyalties are tested as each among them is forced to take sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YihuAszdbPMPxK7k46UYLdP1mz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14484'),
  ('851422651286183074', 'Body Slam', 1986, 'Comedy, Music', 'Hal Needham, Michael Shea', 'Steve Burkow, Shel Lytton', 'Dirk Benedict, Tanya Roberts, Roddy Piper, Louis Albano, Barry Gordon, Charles Nelson Reilly, Billy Barty, John Astin', 'PG', 'M. Harry Smilac is a down-on-his-luck music manager who is having a hard time attracting talent and booking gigs for his band, Kicks (The most recent of the gigs is a Dairy Queen opening!!). When making arrangements for a campaign fund-raiser, he mistakes Rick Roberts, a professional wrestler, for a musician and hires him. At that moment he becomes a wrestling manager and starts to book matches for him and his teammate Tonga Tom. The team is a success, and Harry decides to take his wrestlers and his band on a "Rock n'' Wrestling" tour. The tour is a success, and Harry feels what it is like to be a winner again.', 'M. Harry Smilac is a down-on-his-luck music manager who is having a hard time attracting talent and booking gigs for his band, Kicks (The most recent of the gigs is a Dairy Queen opening!!). When making arrangements for a campaign fund-raiser, he mistakes Rick Roberts, a professional wrestler, for a musician and hires him. At that moment he becomes a wrestling manager and starts to book matches for him and his teammate Tonga Tom. The team is a success, and Harry decides to take his wrestlers and his band on a "Rock n'' Wrestling" tour. The tour is a success, and Harry feels what it is like to be a winner again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3nDVRacsvB1kLQYz1F9hzyYORv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83415'),
  ('259372942132022939', 'Body Snatchers', 1993, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Abel Ferrara, Bojan Bazelli, Michael Neumann', 'Nicholas St. John, Dennis Paoli, Stuart Gordon', 'Terry Kinney, Meg Tilly, Gabrielle Anwar, Reilly Murphy, Billy Wirth, Christine Elise, R. Lee Ermey, Kathleen Doyle', 'R', 'When Environmental Protection Agency inspector Steve Malone travels to a remote military base in order to check for toxic materials, he brings his family along for the ride. After arriving at the base, his teenage daughter Marti befriends Jean Platt, daughter of the base''s commander, General Platt. When people at the base begin acting strangely, Marti becomes convinced that they are slowly being replaced by plant-like aliens.', 'When Environmental Protection Agency inspector Steve Malone travels to a remote military base in order to check for toxic materials, he brings his family along for the ride. After arriving at the base, his teenage daughter Marti befriends Jean Platt, daughter of the base''s commander, General Platt. When people at the base begin acting strangely, Marti becomes convinced that they are slowly being replaced by plant-like aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52uEKbVSpCyilZl0zRApq3zvVs3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4722'),
  ('993913160194273488', 'Body Switch', 1995, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Jørn Faurschou', null, 'Ulf Pilgaard, Morten Schaffalitzky, Kenn Godske, Helle Fagralid, Jannie Faurschou, Lars Lippert, Stephania Potalivo, Anne Werner Thomsen', null, 'A dying elderly scientist proposes love-sick Jonas a cure that will improve the youngster''s physical skills and general sex-appeal. What the scientist really aims to accomplish is a body switch: he wants to survive in a young man''s body and gladly leaves Jonas to wake up in his own wasted frame. Jonas must somehow signal his predicament to his friends. Both men rev up for a survival-of-the-fittest chase.', 'A dying elderly scientist proposes love-sick Jonas a cure that will improve the youngster''s physical skills and general sex-appeal. What the scientist really aims to accomplish is a body switch: he wants to survive in a young man''s body and gladly leaves Jonas to wake up in his own wasted frame. Jonas must somehow signal his predicament to his friends. Both men rev up for a survival-of-the-fittest chase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4lraNetAimkMSde8x91wCB13l4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84131'),
  ('211065477455944822', 'Body to Body', 2003, 'Thriller', 'François Hanss, Giovanni Fiore Coltellacci', 'Arthur-Emmanuel Pierre', 'Emmanuelle Seigner, Philippe Torreton, Yolande Moreau, Vittoria Scognamiglio, Luc Robert, Maurice Lamy, Tony D''Amario, Marc Duret', null, 'Laura Bartelli is a stripper in a French bar. She retires after a moody landscape architect named Marco Tisserand asks her to abandon her life and share his. However, after her red Volkswagen runs off the road en route to the rendezvous, she ends up scarred and comatose in a hospital. Marco stays at her bedside.', 'Laura Bartelli is a stripper in a French bar. She retires after a moody landscape architect named Marco Tisserand asks her to abandon her life and share his. However, after her red Volkswagen runs off the road en route to the rendezvous, she ends up scarred and comatose in a hospital. Marco stays at her bedside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ob8DpeXQPGHDRv6qu4JHMsHHBwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64805'),
  ('821263703232617470', 'Body Weapon', 1999, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Aman Chang Man, Choi Sung-Fai', 'Cheung Kwok-Yuen', 'Angie Cheung Wai-Yee, Vincent Zhao Wenzhuo, Stephen Au Kam-Tong, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Rocky Lai Keung-Ken, Sam Wong Ming-Sing, Pinky Cheung Man-Chi, Clarence Ford', null, 'While investigating murder cases involving masked rapists, Officer Ling herself is raped and her husband murdered by the suspects, on their wedding night. Rather than relying on her fellow police officers to solve her case, Ling chooses to use her own body as the weapon to take revenge on her violators.', 'While investigating murder cases involving masked rapists, Officer Ling herself is raped and her husband murdered by the suspects, on their wedding night. Rather than relying on her fellow police officers to solve her case, Ling chooses to use her own body as the weapon to take revenge on her violators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjkpalWqDgipDVbqWT7QMHIL3si.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137990'),
  ('268028360886358047', 'Body Without Soul', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Wiktor Grodecki, David Švec, Vladimír Holomek', 'Wiktor Grodecki', 'Pavel Rousek, Vaclav Cernogursky, Pavel Petroci, Jarda, Matthew, Ota, Sawanah, Thomas', 'R', 'A stark documentary about young male prostitutes in Prague, aged 15 to 18, who work the streets, train stations, and clubs. Through candid interviews and behind-the-scenes footage of gay porn shoots, the film explores their lives, struggles, and dreams, touching on themes of exploitation, identity, AIDS, and survival.', 'A stark documentary about young male prostitutes in Prague, aged 15 to 18, who work the streets, train stations, and clubs. Through candid interviews and behind-the-scenes footage of gay porn shoots, the film explores their lives, struggles, and dreams, touching on themes of exploitation, identity, AIDS, and survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJoZI4EbFZmHFiieR28qjqhBgbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48114'),
  ('906129694020222729', 'Bodybuilder', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Roschdy Zem, Thomas Letellier, Thibault Mattei', 'Roschdy Zem, Julie Peyr', 'François Yolin Gauvin, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Vincent Rottiers, Roschdy Zem, Caroline Gaume, Adel Bencherif, Dominique Reymond, Marina Foïs', null, 'Twenty year old Antoine has made enemies of a gang of young thugs, to whom he owes money. Fed up with his scams and petty crimes, his mother and older brother decide to send Antoine to his father''s place in Saint-Etienne. The two men haven''t seen each other for several years.', 'Twenty year old Antoine has made enemies of a gang of young thugs, to whom he owes money. Fed up with his scams and petty crimes, his mother and older brother decide to send Antoine to his father''s place in Saint-Etienne. The two men haven''t seen each other for several years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQ7Y0HiWBdmSXIU3UXRJVcZkLG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270920'),
