  ('239321151399903995', 'Boggy Creek II: And the Legend Continues', 1984, 'Adventure, Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Charles B. Pierce, Shirak Kojayan', 'Charles B. Pierce', 'Charles B. Pierce, Cindy Butler, Chuck Pierce Jr., Jimmy Clem, Serene Hedin, Rick Hildreth, Don Adkins, James Tennison', 'PG', 'Having heard tales of Bigfoot wreaking havoc in the swamps of Louisiana, a zoology professor sets out to investigate these strange occurrences for himself, aided by a ragtag team. Hitting the road in their camper, the group encounter person after person who relay their strange and often frightening encounters with the beast, while the creature itself remains elusive...', 'Having heard tales of Bigfoot wreaking havoc in the swamps of Louisiana, a zoology professor sets out to investigate these strange occurrences for himself, aided by a ragtag team. Hitting the road in their camper, the group encounter person after person who relay their strange and often frightening encounters with the beast, while the creature itself remains elusive...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55tjsHfdIk0BtgxemqzKaBHa3xK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31263'),
  ('875803040877979826', 'Bogotá: City of the Lost', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Kim Seong-je, Lee Sung-jae, Lee Dong-hwa', 'Kim Seong-je, Hwang Sung-goo', 'Song Joong-ki, Lee Hee-jun, Kwon Hae-hyo, Cho Hyun-chul, Park Ji-hwan, Kim Jong-soo, Juana del Río, Im Sung-jae', 'R', 'After moving to Bogotá for a chance at a better life, a young Korean man rises through the Colombian black market — risking peril for a shot at success.', 'After moving to Bogotá for a chance at a better life, a young Korean man rises through the Colombian black market — risking peril for a shot at success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1WPGGPVHHVJwTjmUaCsbTNATgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636279'),
