  ('288417830270216794', 'Bohachi Bushido: Code of the Forgotten Eight', 1973, 'Action', 'Teruo Ishii, Jūhei Suzuki', 'Susumu Saji', 'Tetsuro Tamba, Tatsuo Endō, Ryōhei Uchida, Kyōichi Satō, Yuriko Hishimi, Rena Ichinose, Emi Katsura, Ruriko Ikejima', null, 'A Ronin with a death wish reluctantly joins the Clan of the Forgotten Eight, a nasty crew of ronin who are wrapped up in a clan war over local prostitution.', 'A Ronin with a death wish reluctantly joins the Clan of the Forgotten Eight, a nasty crew of ronin who are wrapped up in a clan war over local prostitution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcWG8ThKz9QgOD46IqysnkAzNjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89552'),
  ('576114255681529631', 'Bohachi Bushido: The Villain', 1974, 'Action', 'Takashi Harada, Shigeru Akatsuka', 'Takeo Kaneko, Sadao Nakajima', 'Gorō Ibuki, Emi Jo, Keiko Aikawa, Harumi Kuri, Aki Takagi, Miki Nakai, Kenji Kusumoto, Yōichi Numata', null, 'The Bohachi Clan, the most vile, corrupt organization with ties deep in the Shogunate, have controlled the flesh trade in Japan for generations. When threatened by a competitor, they employ Saburai, a nihilistic ronin on the verge of self destruction. Blood gushes and limbs fly for anyone who stands against Saburai as he instills the Way of the Bohachi.', 'The Bohachi Clan, the most vile, corrupt organization with ties deep in the Shogunate, have controlled the flesh trade in Japan for generations. When threatened by a competitor, they employ Saburai, a nihilistic ronin on the verge of self destruction. Blood gushes and limbs fly for anyone who stands against Saburai as he instills the Way of the Bohachi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ro8ph8pCtk5zYJ6rh77APdLfA55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105929'),
  ('363808226949872232', 'Bohemian Rhapsody', 2018, 'Music, History, Drama', 'Newton Thomas Sigel, David Hindle, Claire Frayn', 'Anthony McCarten', 'Rami Malek, Gwilym Lee, Ben Hardy, Joseph Mazzello, Lucy Boynton, Aidan Gillen, Allen Leech, Tom Hollander', 'PG-13', 'Singer Freddie Mercury, guitarist Brian May, drummer Roger Taylor and bass guitarist John Deacon take the music world by storm when they form the rock ''n'' roll band Queen in 1970. Hit songs become instant classics. When Mercury''s increasingly wild lifestyle starts to spiral out of control, Queen soon faces its greatest challenge yet – finding a way to keep the band together amid the success and excess.', 'Singer Freddie Mercury, guitarist Brian May, drummer Roger Taylor and bass guitarist John Deacon take the music world by storm when they form the rock ''n'' roll band Queen in 1970. Hit songs become instant classics. When Mercury''s increasingly wild lifestyle starts to spiral out of control, Queen soon faces its greatest challenge yet – finding a way to keep the band together amid the success and excess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHu1wtNaczFPGFDTrjCSzeLPTKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424694'),
  ('626093507694212104', 'Boi', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Jorge M. Fontana', 'Jorge M. Fontana', 'Bernat Quintana, Adrian Pang, Andrew Lua, Miranda Gas, Anatoly Chugunov, Fina Rius, Man Mourentan, José Sacristán', null, 'Boi is a young man starting out in a new job as a chauffeur. While anxiously waiting for news from his girlfriend regarding a decision that could change both their lives, he must accompany his first clients, Michael and Gordon, two Asian businessmen who have come to Barcelona in order to close a multimillion-dollar deal.', 'Boi is a young man starting out in a new job as a chauffeur. While anxiously waiting for news from his girlfriend regarding a decision that could change both their lives, he must accompany his first clients, Michael and Gordon, two Asian businessmen who have come to Barcelona in order to close a multimillion-dollar deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lGKEaL315JTlusiQDRobBA84ES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591789'),
