  ('169784774992196324', 'Boiling Point', 1990, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Yûrei Yanagi, Yuriko Ishida, Takeshi Kitano, Guadalcanal Taka, Dankan, Makoto Ashikawa, Hisashi Igawa, Johnny Ohkura', 'NR', 'Masaki, a baseball player and gas-station attendant, gets into trouble with the local Yakuza and goes to Okinawa to get a gun to defend himself. There he meets Uehara, a tough gangster, who is in serious debt to the yakuza and planning revenge.', 'Masaki, a baseball player and gas-station attendant, gets into trouble with the local Yakuza and goes to Okinawa to get a gun to defend himself. There he meets Uehara, a tough gangster, who is in serious debt to the yakuza and planning revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyOqtWxEtMPThNYdydH0W7sYlVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26936'),
  ('786236306094306272', 'Boiling Point', 1993, 'Drama, Action, Crime, Thriller', 'James B. Harris, Jules Lichtman, Philip M. Krystosek', 'James B. Harris', 'Wesley Snipes, Dennis Hopper, Lolita Davidovich, Viggo Mortensen, Seymour Cassel, Jonathan Banks, Christine Elise, Tony Lo Bianco', 'R', 'Red is an aging scam-artist who''s just been released from prison together with Ronnie, a young and not-so-bright hoodlum who is easily manipulated. Their new business is to organize fake-money sales and then kill the buyer to take his money; but when Ronnie kills an undercover secret service agent, his partner Jimmy Mercer vows revenge and is given one week to catch the killers before being transferred.', 'Red is an aging scam-artist who''s just been released from prison together with Ronnie, a young and not-so-bright hoodlum who is easily manipulated. Their new business is to organize fake-money sales and then kill the buyer to take his money; but when Ronnie kills an undercover secret service agent, his partner Jimmy Mercer vows revenge and is given one week to catch the killers before being transferred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmCgFzCnqoPRtm1zXTxKzV8yUJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22213'),
