  ('1101757442088746335', 'Bommarillu', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bhaskar', 'Bhaskar, Rajasimha Tadinada', 'Siddharth, Genelia D''Souza, Prakash Raj, Jayasudha, Kota Srinivasa Rao, Sunil Varma, Ravi Varma, Chitram Seenu', null, 'Siddu is the son of an over-protective business man. Every decision of his is made by his father, which leads him into frustration. He half-heartedly agrees to become engaged to a rich man''s daughter, but then falls for a middle-class man''s daughter called Haasini. The film focuses on his realization that he has to stand on his own and come out of his father''s protective shell - and try to succeed in love.', 'Siddu is the son of an over-protective business man. Every decision of his is made by his father, which leads him into frustration. He half-heartedly agrees to become engaged to a rich man''s daughter, but then falls for a middle-class man''s daughter called Haasini. The film focuses on his realization that he has to stand on his own and come out of his father''s protective shell - and try to succeed in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYN5XJzV9dYGwzq4fmp41xcIaDS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31626'),
