  ('9920047596798913', 'Bon Cop Bad Cop 2', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Alain Desrochers, Jean Frenette, Ronald Plante', 'Patrick Huard', 'Patrick Huard, Colm Feore, Erik Knudsen, Noam Jenkins, Sarah-Jeanne Labrosse, Lucie Laurier, André Bédard, Catherine St-Laurent', null, 'Ward and Bouchard must face an important car theft ring that turns out to be a lot more than they bargained for: one where the stolen cars will serve as bombs in a well planned terrorist attack.', 'Ward and Bouchard must face an important car theft ring that turns out to be a lot more than they bargained for: one where the stolen cars will serve as bombs in a well planned terrorist attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXP6WjVJGeZuqVQJVMMAf8CeGma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417489'),
  ('557917638000075892', 'Bon Voyage', 1944, 'War, Drama', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'J.O.C. Orton, Angus MacPhail', 'John Blythe, Janique Joelle', 'NR', 'After escaping a Nazi POW camp, a young Scottish RAF gunner recounts his perilous journey through occupied France with the help of the Resistance. During his debriefing in London, French intelligence officers press him for details—especially about one companion whose true loyalties may not be what they seemed.', 'After escaping a Nazi POW camp, a young Scottish RAF gunner recounts his perilous journey through occupied France with the help of the Resistance. During his debriefing in London, French intelligence officers press him for details—especially about one companion whose true loyalties may not be what they seemed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0ADJX0ClbsF3PNipCXDbopbd23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48140'),
  ('92736596258108172', 'Bon Voyage', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Thierry Arbogast, Stéphane Gluck', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Patrick Modiano', 'Grégori Derangère, Isabelle Adjani, Gérard Depardieu, Virginie Ledoyen, Yvan Attal, Peter Coyote, Jean-Marc Stehlé, Aurore Clément', null, 'On the eve of World War II four Parisians cope with the impending invasion of their city by German forces. While the French government braces for impact, the intersected lives of a young writer, a vain movie star, a French politician and a young scientist are examined as they attempt to deal with war and evade German spies.', 'On the eve of World War II four Parisians cope with the impending invasion of their city by German forces. While the French government braces for impact, the intersected lives of a young writer, a vain movie star, a French politician and a young scientist are examined as they attempt to deal with war and evade German spies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pP1STSvXOv6jITKQnaZfI1xXB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14652'),
  ('790788582557708756', 'Bon Voyage, Charlie Brown (and Don''t Come Back!)', 1980, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Phil Roman, Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Arrin Skelley, Daniel Anderson, Laura Planting, Casey Carlson, Annalisa Bortolin, Laura Planting, Bill Melendez, Pascale De Barolet', 'G', 'Charlie Brown, Linus, Peppermint Patty and Marcie travel to France as foreign exchange students. Also along is Snoopy and Woodstock. While everyone is excited about the opportunity to travel to a foreign country, Charlie is disturbed by a letter he receives from a mysterious girl from France who invites him as a her guest only to find that he does not seem welcomed to her Chateau.', 'Charlie Brown, Linus, Peppermint Patty and Marcie travel to France as foreign exchange students. Also along is Snoopy and Woodstock. While everyone is excited about the opportunity to travel to a foreign country, Charlie is disturbed by a letter he receives from a mysterious girl from France who invites him as a her guest only to find that he does not seem welcomed to her Chateau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eds4cxarUjHn7OdDd26SauphUnR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31112'),
  ('718325598754056706', 'Bon Voyage!', 1962, 'Family, Comedy', 'James Neilson, William E. Snyder', 'Bill Walsh', 'Fred MacMurray, Jane Wyman, Michael Callan, Deborah Walley, Jessie Royce Landis, Tommy Kirk, Georgette Anys, Kevin Corcoran', null, 'The Willards from Terre Haute, Indiana travels abroad for the once-in-a-lifetime vacation in Paris, France. Harry Willard believes that the greatest problem will be avoiding tap water, but bringing his three children will prove to be more troublesome', 'The Willards from Terre Haute, Indiana travels abroad for the once-in-a-lifetime vacation in Paris, France. Harry Willard believes that the greatest problem will be avoiding tap water, but bringing his three children will prove to be more troublesome', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yuGFk3TTGKmhHTChvQOyc6VBIB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103709'),
  ('250908765717716986', 'Bona', 1984, 'Drama', 'Jeric Soriano, Lino Brocka, Conrado Baltazar', 'Cenen Ramones', 'Nora Aunor, Phillip Salvador, Marissa Delgado, Raquel Monteza, Venchito Galvez, Rustica Carpio, Nanding Josef, Spanky Manikan', null, 'Bona, a middle-class student, becomes infatuated with a struggling actor, Gardo, and drops out of school to live with him. She becomes his unpaid maid, performing chores and enduring his relationships with other women, in the hopes of reciprocation.', 'Bona, a middle-class student, becomes infatuated with a struggling actor, Gardo, and drops out of school to live with him. She becomes his unpaid maid, performing chores and enduring his relationships with other women, in the hopes of reciprocation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/H9iQZZ3tCvheLH1QoQbMRj8ULe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75628'),
  ('30052554445115668', 'Bonanza Bunny', 1959, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Robert C. Bruce', 'NR', 'Bugs fights with Blacque Jacque Shellacque over Klondike gold.', 'Bugs fights with Blacque Jacque Shellacque over Klondike gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9kV7zAMIGdXk2vsKXDWWdwi74D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234811'),
  ('955982808150665108', 'Bonanza: The Return', 1993, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Jerry Jameson, Haskell B. Boggs', 'David Dortort, Michael Landon Jr.', 'Ben Johnson, Michael Landon Jr., Emily Warfield, Brian Leckner, Richard Roundtree, Jack Elam, Dirk Blocker, David Sage', 'PG', 'A man with a grudge against the late Little Joe seeks revenge on the Cartwrights and attempts to take over the Ponderosa.', 'A man with a grudge against the late Little Joe seeks revenge on the Cartwrights and attempts to take over the Ponderosa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOGanl6gCD9EFUYVYMcQscUooLT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390555'),
  ('589579560868993272', 'Bonanza: Under Attack', 1995, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Mark Tinker', 'Denne Bart Petitclerc, David Dortort', 'Leonard Nimoy, Ben Johnson, Jack Elam, Richard Roundtree, Dennis Farina, Dirk Blocker, Michael Landon Jr., Emily Warfield', 'NR', 'After a rogue band of Pinkerton detectives led by ruthless Charley Siringo bushwhacks reformed outlaw Frank James, he seeks sanctuary on the Ponderosa with the next generation of Cartwrights and his former Civil War compatriots. Will Frank''s comrades come to his aid or turn their backs on him? Richard Roundtree also stars in this made-for-TV sequel to the popular Western series.', 'After a rogue band of Pinkerton detectives led by ruthless Charley Siringo bushwhacks reformed outlaw Frank James, he seeks sanctuary on the Ponderosa with the next generation of Cartwrights and his former Civil War compatriots. Will Frank''s comrades come to his aid or turn their backs on him? Richard Roundtree also stars in this made-for-TV sequel to the popular Western series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53JkC3sjNa9ZPHgtrVhK87F85Kr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312209'),
  ('969879738618079381', 'Bond Girls Are Forever', 2002, 'Documentary', 'John Watkin', null, 'Maryam D''Abo', null, 'Through vintage film clips of past Bond movie epics, and with the participation of several former "Bond Girls" as interviewees (among them Dr. No''s Ursula Andress and Diamonds Are Forever''s Jill St. John), the documentary traces the evolution of the typical James Bond heroine from decorative damsel in distress to gutsy (but still decorative) participant in the action.', 'Through vintage film clips of past Bond movie epics, and with the participation of several former "Bond Girls" as interviewees (among them Dr. No''s Ursula Andress and Diamonds Are Forever''s Jill St. John), the documentary traces the evolution of the typical James Bond heroine from decorative damsel in distress to gutsy (but still decorative) participant in the action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg1vnE0P6bzrth7PabphXEDE1fd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34079'),
  ('527672470199945862', 'Bone', 1972, 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 'Larry Cohen, George Folsey Jr.', 'Larry Cohen', 'Yaphet Kotto, Andrew Duggan, Joyce Van Patten, Jeannie Berlin, Brett Somers, Dick Yarmy, Casey King, James Lee', 'R', 'When a criminal breaks into the Beverly Hills home of a wealthy couple experiencing marital problems, he unwillingly provides the spouses with an unlikely resolution to their conflicts as well as a solution to his own secret.', 'When a criminal breaks into the Beverly Hills home of a wealthy couple experiencing marital problems, he unwillingly provides the spouses with an unlikely resolution to their conflicts as well as a solution to his own secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ik2QO1CLffGOO8khqTfbHMKlTIa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27012'),
  ('722751059100301763', 'Bone Bandit', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Pluto discovers that a gopher has been stealing bones from his hidden stash.', 'Pluto discovers that a gopher has been stealing bones from his hidden stash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Iibo2DWihvLUDfPYvc3mU11lDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164901'),
  ('1148570935228072008', 'Bone Daddy', 1998, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Mario Azzopardi, Danny Nowak', 'Tom Szolossi', 'Rutger Hauer, Barbara Williams, R.H. Thomson, Joseph Kell, Robin Gammell, Blu Mankuma, Mimi Kuzyk, Wayne Best', null, 'Doctor Palmer, a former pathologist, wrote a fictional book based on his real cases. In the book, the madman gets caught, but in reality he is still uncaught. After the book is released, Palmer''s editor is kidnapped. Palmer soon is sent a present containing a page of his book, and a bone from his editor. Together with the police, Palmer tries to find his editor, who might still be alive. In addition, his own son becomes one of the main suspects. Written by Julian Reischl', 'Doctor Palmer, a former pathologist, wrote a fictional book based on his real cases. In the book, the madman gets caught, but in reality he is still uncaught. After the book is released, Palmer''s editor is kidnapped. Palmer soon is sent a present containing a page of his book, and a bone from his editor. Together with the police, Palmer tries to find his editor, who might still be alive. In addition, his own son becomes one of the main suspects. Written by Julian Reischl', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAtj1hZsbDvhkCrpR2KT1LUfMuF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60504'),
  ('185207534142631126', 'Bone Dry', 2007, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Brett A. Hart, Kevin G. Ellis, John Darbonne', 'Jeff O''Brien, Brett A. Hart', 'Luke Goss, Lance Henriksen, Tommy Lister Jr., Jennifer Siebel Newsom, Dee Wallace, Carl Buffington, Hudson Thames, Julia Self', null, 'Eddie finds himself being forced at a gunpoint, by an unseen assailant, on a dark and brutal journey through the harsh terrain of the Mojave desert. His nemesis is Jimmy, a man with an aberrant agenda; armed with a rifle, a scope, walkie-talkies and a truck, he has organized a series of ambushes and mantraps designed to push Eddie to the limits of his humanity and beyond.', 'Eddie finds himself being forced at a gunpoint, by an unseen assailant, on a dark and brutal journey through the harsh terrain of the Mojave desert. His nemesis is Jimmy, a man with an aberrant agenda; armed with a rifle, a scope, walkie-talkies and a truck, he has organized a series of ambushes and mantraps designed to push Eddie to the limits of his humanity and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3P5JdJBHAZRDtksicmGYZAnQxkK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23165'),
  ('70705637537896955', 'Bone Eater', 2008, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Jim Wynorski, Shawn Dyrdahl, Jill Hoppy', 'Jim Wynorski, William Langlois', 'Paul Rae, Bruce Boxleitner, William Katt, Walter Koenig, Gil Gerard, Michael Horse, Adoni Maropis, Clara Bryant', null, 'Ancient Native American legend of the Bone Eater rises up and begins terrorizing the local townspeople', 'Ancient Native American legend of the Bone Eater rises up and begins terrorizing the local townspeople', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQPHTuJOJJp1QNeAu00yR3HlaJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58791'),
  ('1002502046072869319', 'Bone Keeper', 2026, 'Horror, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Howard J. Ford', 'Howard J. Ford', 'Sarah Alexandra Marks, Louis James, Tiffany Hannam-Daniels, John Rhys-Davies, Danny Rahim', null, 'Six young friends investigate missing persons cases in a remote cave system, unaware they''re being stalked by an ancient creature lurking in the depths.', 'Six young friends investigate missing persons cases in a remote cave system, unaware they''re being stalked by an ancient creature lurking in the depths.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FaTJ9SfZeZ1FUqpsKLjinQGTtjns.jpg', 'plex:movie:bone-keeper'),
  ('1070141079469521143', 'Bone Lake', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mercedes Bryce Morgan, Nick Remy Matthews, T.C. Barrera', 'Joshua Friedlander', 'Alex Roe, Maddie Hasson, Marco Pigossi, Andra Nechita, Clayton Spencer, Eliane Reis', 'R', 'A couple’s romantic vacation at a secluded lakeside estate is upended when they are forced to share the mansion with a mysterious and attractive couple. In this darkly hilarious and seductive horror story, a dream getaway spirals into a nightmarish maze of sex, lies, and manipulation, bringing terrifying secrets to light and triggering a bloody battle for survival.', 'A couple’s romantic vacation at a secluded lakeside estate is upended when they are forced to share the mansion with a mysterious and attractive couple. In this darkly hilarious and seductive horror story, a dream getaway spirals into a nightmarish maze of sex, lies, and manipulation, bringing terrifying secrets to light and triggering a bloody battle for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGo5ti82LlydAZrvcsaj31iPuEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1330421'),
  ('89221321312783386', 'Bone Sickness', 2004, 'Horror', 'Brian Paulin', 'Brian Paulin', 'Rich George, Brian Paulin, Kevin Barbare, Griff Brohman, Brian DeClercq, Darya Zabinski, Ernest Hutcherson, Ruby LaRocca', 'NR', 'Her husband''s health suddenly devastated by a terminal bone disease, a desperate young woman finds her search for alternative treatment leading to unexpectedly grave consequences.', 'Her husband''s health suddenly devastated by a terminal bone disease, a desperate young woman finds her search for alternative treatment leading to unexpectedly grave consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqW3TfYBtaEWIuVdxHkxMeWtegk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39909'),
  ('1069759979232614457', 'Bone Tomahawk', 2015, 'Western, Horror, Drama', 'S. Craig Zahler, Benji Bakshi, Dave Halls', 'S. Craig Zahler', 'Kurt Russell, Patrick Wilson, Richard Jenkins, Matthew Fox, Lili Simmons, David Arquette, Fred Melamed, Evan Jonigkeit', 'NR', 'During a shootout in a saloon, Sheriff Hunt injures a suspicious stranger. The doctor''s assistant, wife of the local foreman, tends to him in prison. That night, the town is attacked and they both disappear—only the arrow of a cannibal tribe is found. Hunt and a few of his men go in search of the prisoner and the foreman''s wife.', 'During a shootout in a saloon, Sheriff Hunt injures a suspicious stranger. The doctor''s assistant, wife of the local foreman, tends to him in prison. That night, the town is attacked and they both disappear—only the arrow of a cannibal tribe is found. Hunt and a few of his men go in search of the prisoner and the foreman''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MmTHpn2Y8emqvBgvOjufImUmKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294963'),
  ('1097664978909225917', 'Bone Trouble', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', 'Jack Kinney', 'Lee Millar, James MacDonald, Clarence Nash, Hal Rees, Elvia Allman', 'NR', 'Pluto is on the run after stealing a bone from Butch the bulldog and finds refuge in a carnival Hall of Mirrors.', 'Pluto is on the run after stealing a bone from Butch the bulldog and finds refuge in a carnival Hall of Mirrors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kWwqupKYLxlpphsyJ8k78RE2Aq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68489'),
  ('732316276396994111', 'Bones', 2001, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime, Fantasy', 'Ernest R. Dickerson, Flavio Martínez Labiano', 'Tim Metcalfe, Adam Simon', 'Snoop Dogg, Pam Grier, Bianca Lawson, Khalil Kain, Michael T. Weiss, Clifton Powell, Ricky Harris, Merwin Mondesir', 'R', 'Over 20 years after his death, local legend and benefactor Jimmy Bones returns as a ghost to get revenge on those who killed him and restore his neighborhood.', 'Over 20 years after his death, local legend and benefactor Jimmy Bones returns as a ghost to get revenge on those who killed him and restore his neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UOHEPTQMaiwaI14CGxd5yFAPMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11380'),
  ('979237846459545364', 'Bones and All', 2022, 'Horror, Romance, Drama', 'Arseni Khachaturan, Ryan Brunner, Sam Alvelo', 'David Kajganich', 'Taylor Russell, Timothée Chalamet, Mark Rylance, Anna Cobb, André Holland, David Gordon Green, Michael Stuhlbarg, Jessica Harper', 'R', 'Abandoned by her father, a young woman embarks on a thousand-mile odyssey through the backroads of America where she meets a disenfranchised drifter. But despite their best efforts, all roads lead back to their terrifying pasts and to a final stand that will determine whether their love can survive their otherness.', 'Abandoned by her father, a young woman embarks on a thousand-mile odyssey through the backroads of America where she meets a disenfranchised drifter. But despite their best efforts, all roads lead back to their terrifying pasts and to a final stand that will determine whether their love can survive their otherness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBQuk2LkHjrDsSjueirPQg96GCc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791177'),
  ('665203338828768071', 'Boneyard', 2024, 'Thriller', 'Asif Akbar, Joshua Reis', 'Asif Akbar, Vincent E. McDaniel, Koji Steven Sakai', 'Mel Gibson, Nora Zehetner, Gabrielle Haugh, 50 Cent, Brian Van Holt, Spice Williams-Crosby, Weston Cage, Michael Sirow', 'R', 'After Police Chief Carter discovers the remains of eleven women, FBI Special Agent Petrovick is recruited to profile the serial killer responsible for the infamous "boneyard" killings. As the police force, narcotics agency, and FBI lock horns, a tangled web of intrigue turns everyone into a suspect.', 'After Police Chief Carter discovers the remains of eleven women, FBI Special Agent Petrovick is recruited to profile the serial killer responsible for the infamous "boneyard" killings. As the police force, narcotics agency, and FBI lock horns, a tangled web of intrigue turns everyone into a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/At4aWmOnKwH9k1ciB5ZNe0dP1jH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114738'),
  ('1051036272437240960', 'Bongo', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Dinah Shore', 'G', 'Bongo, the performing bear, escapes from the circus and tries to adapt to life in the wild.', 'Bongo, the performing bear, escapes from the circus and tries to adapt to life in the wild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTnH9pAp31IGtKoXPYXyM99Hysx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144458'),
  ('333660178333886389', 'Bongwater', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Sears, Richard Crudo', 'Eric Weiss, Nora Maccoby', 'Luke Wilson, Alicia Witt, Amy Locane, Brittany Murphy, Jack Black, Andy Dick, Jeremy Sisto, Jamie Kennedy', 'R', 'David is an artist and a pothead. He''s fallen in love with the beautiful and sexy Serena, and things are going simply splendidly until poor David''s house burns down. Serena doesn''t need the bad vibes, so she splits the scene and runs off to New York with rocker and junkie Tommy. Lonely David finally turns to the sweet, sweet comfort of marijuana and his strange menagerie of friends to forget about his lost home and love', 'David is an artist and a pothead. He''s fallen in love with the beautiful and sexy Serena, and things are going simply splendidly until poor David''s house burns down. Serena doesn''t need the bad vibes, so she splits the scene and runs off to New York with rocker and junkie Tommy. Lonely David finally turns to the sweet, sweet comfort of marijuana and his strange menagerie of friends to forget about his lost home and love', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gW8VZHOvvS1KnyH3u0svl7yCU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14887'),
  ('635981241213370334', 'Bonhoeffer: Pastor. Spy. Assassin', 2024, 'History, Drama, War', 'Todd Komarnicki, Kadija Leclère, Michael Pontvert', 'Todd Komarnicki', 'Jonas Dassler, Phileas Heyblom, August Diehl, David Jonsson, Flula Borg, Moritz Bleibtreu, Nadine Heidenreich, Greg Kolpakchi', 'PG-13', 'As the world teeters on the brink of annihilation, Dietrich Bonhoeffer joins a deadly plot to assassinate Hitler, risking his faith and fate to save millions of Jews from genocide.', 'As the world teeters on the brink of annihilation, Dietrich Bonhoeffer joins a deadly plot to assassinate Hitler, risking his faith and fate to save millions of Jews from genocide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WtImcI6k9XOcnPmSeN2Kzpf4ay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1079244'),
  ('220735410589027814', 'Boniface''s Holiday', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Boris Kotov, Georgiy Martynyuk', 'Fyodor Khitruk', 'Aleksey Polevoy', null, 'A circus lion goes on holiday to Africa, but his circus skills doesn''t let him be. Based on the tale of the Czech writer Milos Macourek "Boniface and his nephews»', 'A circus lion goes on holiday to Africa, but his circus skills doesn''t let him be. Based on the tale of the Czech writer Milos Macourek "Boniface and his nephews»', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LhyFNoDYBqWZr33EmLYw3oOxMN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77557'),
  ('176019815491972138', 'Bonitinha, Mas Ordinária', 2013, 'Drama', 'Moacyr Góes, Jacques Cheuiche, Hsu Chien', 'Moacyr Góes', 'João Miguel, Leandra Leal, Letícia Colin, Gracindo Júnior, Leon Góes, Ângela Leal, André Valli, Lígia Cortez', null, 'Edgard works as a subordinate in the company of millionaire Werneck and is in love with Ritinha, a simple woman who works as a teacher to support her mother and her three sisters. One day, Peixoto, Werneck''s son-in-law, makes him a proposal to marry Maria, the boss''s daughter. The reason is that Maria was abused and now is being forced to marry by her family. Edgard hesitates first but accepts the offer. From then on he enters into a great doubt: should he deposit the check and marry Maria or stay with Ritinha, his great love?', 'Edgard works as a subordinate in the company of millionaire Werneck and is in love with Ritinha, a simple woman who works as a teacher to support her mother and her three sisters. One day, Peixoto, Werneck''s son-in-law, makes him a proposal to marry Maria, the boss''s daughter. The reason is that Maria was abused and now is being forced to marry by her family. Edgard hesitates first but accepts the offer. From then on he enters into a great doubt: should he deposit the check and marry Maria or stay with Ritinha, his great love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1caql8cVoV3KSdGzO5OLDXD75KC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197759'),
  ('1079663155048548150', 'Bonjour Switzerland', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Rafael Kistler, Peter Luisi', 'Beat Schlatter, Peter Luisi', 'Beat Schlatter, Vincent Kucholl, Catherine Pagani, Leonardo Nigro, Silvia Jost, Pascal Ulli, Sandro Brotz, Urs Gredig', null, 'A crazy referendum throws Switzerland into a state of emergency. By the acceptance of the initiative “No Bilangue” there should be from now on only one national language: French. Many German-speaking Swiss are therefore having a crisis.', 'A crazy referendum throws Switzerland into a state of emergency. By the acceptance of the initiative “No Bilangue” there should be from now on only one national language: French. Many German-speaking Swiss are therefore having a crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjVWlezdAQY3mfOinNC7dCo5PG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1148298'),
  ('31999136956887980', 'Bonjour Tristesse', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Otto Preminger, Georges Périnal, Serge Friedman', 'Arthur Laurents', 'Deborah Kerr, David Niven, Jean Seberg, Mylène Demongeot, Geoffrey Horne, Juliette Gréco, Walter Chiari, Martita Hunt', null, 'A spoiled teenager spends the summer at the French Riviera with her rich, widower, playboy father, but when his old flame resurfaces, she resolves to keep her frivolous lifestyle at all costs.', 'A spoiled teenager spends the summer at the French Riviera with her rich, widower, playboy father, but when his old flame resurfaces, she resolves to keep her frivolous lifestyle at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Pm9H9Rzubd9doNTsVMOfv588n1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1937'),
  ('357182543943939338', 'Bonjour Tristesse', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Durga Chew-Bose, Maximilian Pittner', 'Durga Chew-Bose', 'Lily McInerny, Claes Bang, Chloë Sevigny, Nailia Harzoune, Aliocha Schneider, Nathalie Richard, Thierry Harcourt, Rebecca Dayan', 'NR', 'At the height of summer, 18-year-old Cécile is relaxing by the French seaside with her father and falling in love with her new boyfriend. The arrival of her late mother''s enigmatic friend turns her world upside down.', 'At the height of summer, 18-year-old Cécile is relaxing by the French seaside with her father and falling in love with her new boyfriend. The arrival of her late mother''s enigmatic friend turns her world upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHqkaTLL1aPcpMzbvu8kFckEpi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127648'),
  ('769303484546203992', 'Bonnard, Pierre and Marthe', 2024, 'History, Romance', 'Martin Provost, Juliette Maillard, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Martin Provost', 'Vincent Macaigne, Cécile de France, Anouk Grinberg, Stacy Martin, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, André Marcon, Philippe Richardin, César Domboy', null, 'When French painter Pierre Bonnard met Marthe de Méligny, he didn’t know this self-proclaimed aristocrat would become the cornerstone of his life and work. From this moment, she became more than just a muse for the “painter of happiness”, appearing in more than a third of his work. Together, they reached their artistic fulfillment thanks to a colourful love, different from the standards of their time, nurturing the great mystery around their relationship. Based on a true story.', 'When French painter Pierre Bonnard met Marthe de Méligny, he didn’t know this self-proclaimed aristocrat would become the cornerstone of his life and work. From this moment, she became more than just a muse for the “painter of happiness”, appearing in more than a third of his work. Together, they reached their artistic fulfillment thanks to a colourful love, different from the standards of their time, nurturing the great mystery around their relationship. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QOJAXMGV3wMVM2CwvuJQRtiLx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995749'),
  ('1027130045059987091', 'Bonneville', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Christopher N. Rowley, Jeffrey L. Kimball', 'Daniel D. Davis', 'Jessica Lange, Kathy Bates, Joan Allen, Christine Baranski, Tom Amandes, Tom Skerritt, Victor Rasuk, Tom Wopat', 'PG', 'Faced with the decision of a lifetime, Arvilla Holden enlists her two best friends and sets off in a vintage ''66 Bonneville convertible to deliver her late husband''s ashes to Santa Barbara.', 'Faced with the decision of a lifetime, Arvilla Holden enlists her two best friends and sets off in a vintage ''66 Bonneville convertible to deliver her late husband''s ashes to Santa Barbara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCNLAuRo3K70QgWlXCNWQadox1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16700'),
  ('208342291338175454', 'Bonnie and Bonnie', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rodja Kükenthal, Ali Hakim', 'Ali Hakim, Maike Rasch', 'Emma Nova, Sarah Mahita, Slavko Popadic, Kasem Hoxha, Emma Torner, Milena Tscharntke, Zoran Pingel, Anton Nürnberg', null, 'Shattering the patriarchal concept that a true crime duo requires a man, Bonnie and Bonnie showcases the development of true friendship between two strong and independent women, determined to make their mark on the world.', 'Shattering the patriarchal concept that a true crime duo requires a man, Bonnie and Bonnie showcases the development of true friendship between two strong and independent women, determined to make their mark on the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMF8tiJwFZesMBoYx55YPhLLRpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632665'),
  ('686626864863811034', 'Bonnie and Clyde', 1967, 'Crime, Drama', 'Arthur Penn, Burnett Guffey, Jack N. Reddish', 'Robert Benton, David Newman', 'Warren Beatty, Faye Dunaway, Michael J. Pollard, Gene Hackman, Estelle Parsons, Denver Pyle, Dub Taylor, Evans Evans', 'R', 'In the 1930s, bored European-American waitress Bonnie Parker falls in love with a European-American ex-con named Clyde Barrow and together they start a violent crime spree through the country, stealing cars and robbing banks.', 'In the 1930s, bored European-American waitress Bonnie Parker falls in love with a European-American ex-con named Clyde Barrow and together they start a violent crime spree through the country, stealing cars and robbing banks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCSQFK9kMsprT4jgWqgw82dT6WI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475'),
  ('875440859093612179', 'Bonnie and Clyde Italian Style', 1983, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Steno, Massimo Carocci, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Sergio Donati, Giovanni Manganelli', 'Paolo Villaggio, Ornella Muti, Jean Sorel, Ferdinando Murolo, Antonio Allocca, Antonio Basile, Loris Bazzocchi, Dino Cassio', null, 'Two stupid lowlifes are "forced" into a life of violent crime on the streets of Italy. What follows is a mocking takeoff of the American crime classic "Bonnie and Clyde."', 'Two stupid lowlifes are "forced" into a life of violent crime on the streets of Italy. What follows is a mocking takeoff of the American crime classic "Bonnie and Clyde."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vHm3ODc7K1fD67VSTySz1U5ViS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84066'),
  ('599366703780371969', 'Bonnie Scotland', 1935, 'Comedy', 'James W. Horne, Art Lloyd, Walter Lundin', 'Frank Butler, Jefferson Moffitt', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, William Janney, June Lang, James Finlayson, Anne Grey, Vernon Steele, Maurice Black', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie stow away to Scotland expecting to inherit the MacLaurel estate. When things don''t quite turn out that way, they unwittingly enlist in the Scottish army and are posted to India.', 'Stan and Ollie stow away to Scotland expecting to inherit the MacLaurel estate. When things don''t quite turn out that way, they unwittingly enlist in the Scottish army and are posted to India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eUwTJEFA6iciNvV2oJJWFRsKMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43889'),
  ('533439380763454982', 'Bonnie''s Kids', 1973, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Arthur Marks, Robert Charles Wilson, Walter Dominguez', 'Arthur Marks', 'Tiffany Bolling, Steve Sandor, Robin Mattson, Scott Brady, Alex Rocco, Leo Gordon, Max Showalter, Lenore Stevens', 'R', 'After killing their repulsive stepfather, emboldened sisters Myra and Ellie set out to become career criminals. While enjoying the freedom of being bad, the new lawbreakers stumble into a stash of mob money, which they’ll stop at nothing to keep.', 'After killing their repulsive stepfather, emboldened sisters Myra and Ellie set out to become career criminals. While enjoying the freedom of being bad, the new lawbreakers stumble into a stash of mob money, which they’ll stop at nothing to keep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAaTnYWncP2ynalEG2qlEIkXZIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84658'),
