  ('537057125900617635', 'Bono: Stories of Surrender', 2025, 'Documentary, Music', 'Andrew Dominik, Erik Messerschmidt', null, 'Bono, Jacknife Lee, Kate Ellis, Gemma Doherty', 'R', 'Through words, music, and mischief, Bono pulls back the curtain on his deeply personal experiences that have shaped him as a son, father, husband, activist, and U2 frontman.', 'Through words, music, and mischief, Bono pulls back the curtain on his deeply personal experiences that have shaped him as a son, father, husband, activist, and U2 frontman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Xv9uRyeYO1xwZXOoOI2cdfofrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1440718'),
  ('480802938832741408', 'Bonobos: Back to the Wild', 2011, 'Documentary, Drama, Family', 'Alain Tixier', null, 'Rebecca Hall, Luke Evans, Claudine André, Fanny Mehl', null, 'The critically important work by renowned naturalist Claudine Andre to save the endangered bonobo apes of the Congo is presented in this visually stunning feature film.', 'The critically important work by renowned naturalist Claudine Andre to save the endangered bonobo apes of the Congo is presented in this visually stunning feature film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNxKF7cJg98ZIzE4FAMOnvOGvFk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62176'),
  ('316505426946358013', 'Bonolota Express', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tanim Noor, Barkat Hossain Polash, Tania Rahman', 'Samiul Bhuiyan, Ayman Asib Shadhin', 'Mosharraf Karim, Chanchal Chowdhury, Sabila Nur, Sariful Razz, Zakia Bari Mamo, Shamol Mawla, Azmeri Haque Badhon, Intekhab Dinar', null, 'On a foggy winter journey, the Bonolota Express carries strangers burdened by secrets whose lives begin to collide within the train’s confined corridors. As the night unfolds, personal and political crises erupt, exposing hidden grief, moral decay, and moments of unexpected compassion amid chaos and revolt. By dawn, the train moves on, leaving its passengers irrevocably changed by a single journey where illusions collapse and human truths emerge.', 'On a foggy winter journey, the Bonolota Express carries strangers burdened by secrets whose lives begin to collide within the train’s confined corridors. As the night unfolds, personal and political crises erupt, exposing hidden grief, moral decay, and moments of unexpected compassion amid chaos and revolt. By dawn, the train moves on, leaving its passengers irrevocably changed by a single journey where illusions collapse and human truths emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wved9mxrbbae8eW0X5ydBfOWsba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1542995'),
  ('224752975771341749', 'Bonsai', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cristián Jiménez, Inti Briones, Jose Luis Rivas', 'Cristián Jiménez', 'Diego Noguera, Nathalia Galgani, Gabriela Arancibia, Cristóbal Briceño, Julio Carrasco, Paola Lattus, Ingrid Isensee, Alicia Rodríguez', null, 'A young writer recounts an earlier romance in hopes of attracting his new love interest.', 'A young writer recounts an earlier romance in hopes of attracting his new love interest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12d3KFkjmLniK44bEggUDPdXCw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85543'),
  ('966242027141459002', 'Boo', 1932, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Albert DeMond', 'Albert DeMond', 'Morton Lowry, Mae Clarke, Lawrence Grant, Raymond Hackett, Elizabeth Patterson, Max Schreck, Helen Twelvetrees, Edward Van Sloan', null, 'A wisecracking narrator mocks footage featuring Frankenstein''s monster and Count Dracula.', 'A wisecracking narrator mocks footage featuring Frankenstein''s monster and Count Dracula.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wayQQ13Tq3SGYmfi1hJTBtERI1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150340'),
  ('586336704739847393', 'Boo', 2005, 'Horror', 'Anthony C. Ferrante, Nick Franco, Mike Greene', 'Anthony C. Ferrante', 'Rachel Melvin, Dig Wayne, Dee Wallace, Trish Coren, Rachel Harland, Dutchess Botti-Smith, Jilon VanOver, Shirlene Quigley', 'R', 'The friends Emmett, Freddy, Marie, Kevin and his reluctant girlfriend Jessie decide to spend the Halloween night in an abandoned hospital. Meanwhile, the younger Allan meets the old friend of his father Arlo Ray Baines and asks him to help to find his vanished sister Meg in the same spot. The two groups meet each other in the mental institution section on the haunted third floor.', 'The friends Emmett, Freddy, Marie, Kevin and his reluctant girlfriend Jessie decide to spend the Halloween night in an abandoned hospital. Meanwhile, the younger Allan meets the old friend of his father Arlo Ray Baines and asks him to help to find his vanished sister Meg in the same spot. The two groups meet each other in the mental institution section on the haunted third floor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VyMAPsjUIeLf71J2OG5V8DO7Jj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20215'),
