  ('748079700787338060', 'Boo!', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Luke Jaden, Nicholas Wiesnet', 'Luke Jaden, Diane Michelle', 'Aurora Perrineau, Jill Marie Jones, Jaden Piner, Rob Zabrecky, Charley Palmer Rothwell', null, 'A torn suburban family refuses to heed the warning of an innocent prank left upon them which causes an unknown supernatural force to wreak havoc.', 'A torn suburban family refuses to heed the warning of an innocent prank left upon them which causes an unknown supernatural force to wreak havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Lnt9yuLlPwmYW3LLzWmQQWrUmK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550273'),
  ('1065042512358124325', 'Boo! A Madea Halloween', 2016, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Richard J. Vialet, Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Cassi Davis, Diamond White, Yousef Erakat, Bella Thorne, Liza Koshy, Patrice Lovely, Lexy Panterra', 'PG-13', 'Madea winds up in the middle of mayhem when she spends a hilarious, haunted Halloween fending off killers, paranormal poltergeists, ghosts, ghouls, and zombies while keeping a watchful eye on a group of misbehaving teens.', 'Madea winds up in the middle of mayhem when she spends a hilarious, haunted Halloween fending off killers, paranormal poltergeists, ghosts, ghouls, and zombies while keeping a watchful eye on a group of misbehaving teens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82TLEZv1rOJNgllfYD22NkivGDH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380124'),
  ('560786545100914404', 'Boobs in Arms', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Jules White', 'Felix Adler', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Richard Fiske, Evelyn Young, Charles Dorety', 'NR', 'The stooges are greeting card salesmen who are mistakenly inducted into the army after escaping from the jealous husband of one of their customers. In bootcamp their sergeant turns out to be the same man, whom they constantly vex and bewilder. When the boys are sent to the front lines and the sergeant is captured they must rescue him, which they do after doping themselves with laughing gas. At the end they get shot off into the sunset on a cannon shell.', 'The stooges are greeting card salesmen who are mistakenly inducted into the army after escaping from the jealous husband of one of their customers. In bootcamp their sergeant turns out to be the same man, whom they constantly vex and bewilder. When the boys are sent to the front lines and the sergeant is captured they must rescue him, which they do after doping themselves with laughing gas. At the end they get shot off into the sunset on a cannon shell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48D0Ea2BR2jzf85envoChhLUaUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115988'),
  ('24991645428464018', 'Boobs in the Woods', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky sets out to the great outdoors to paint landscapes, but Daffy claims that the lake and mountains are his, and he refuses to let Porky paint them.', 'Porky sets out to the great outdoors to paint landscapes, but Daffy claims that the lake and mountains are his, and he refuses to let Porky paint them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Yf7C7epvakiMJVN8ClBjzqSe3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151446'),
  ('554407896256118313', 'Booby Hatched', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Sara Berner, Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'A duck struggles mightily and finally hatches her eggs in the bitter cold. All but one, that is: poor little Robespierre. Mama doesn''t notice him missing until after he has sprouted legs and run off in search of warmth.', 'A duck struggles mightily and finally hatches her eggs in the bitter cold. All but one, that is: poor little Robespierre. Mama doesn''t notice him missing until after he has sprouted legs and run off in search of warmth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4J5f8r2t7NatUtxEHST8r3PrUyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147003'),
  ('1081224640352680909', 'Booby Traps', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy, War', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc, Robert C. Bruce', null, 'Pvt. Snafu thinks he''s too smart to get caught by an enemy booby trap, but he soon finds that the traps are alluring and that he is every bit the booby.', 'Pvt. Snafu thinks he''s too smart to get caught by an enemy booby trap, but he soon finds that the traps are alluring and that he is every bit the booby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bw1QPLBi0152tZQcBhhjScM24HN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101380'),
  ('474683040403624333', 'Boog and Elliot''s Midnight Bun Run', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Anthony Stacchi, Jill Culton', null, 'Martin Lawrence, Ashton Kutcher, Georgia Engel, Cody Cameron, Gordon Tootoosis', 'PG', 'Bob and Bobbie left their trailer to go skinny-dipping, and putting Mr. Weenie in charge to guard the cinnamon buns they left on the counter. When Boog and Elliot sneak into the camp, they are excited to discover that there are buns in the trailer. Unfortunately for them, Mr. Weenie is guarding the door.', 'Bob and Bobbie left their trailer to go skinny-dipping, and putting Mr. Weenie in charge to guard the cinnamon buns they left on the counter. When Boog and Elliot sneak into the camp, they are excited to discover that there are buns in the trailer. Unfortunately for them, Mr. Weenie is guarding the door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgXxMcnUCSGxjOjOe2bCKppjD82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71430'),
  ('379164063406735650', 'Boogeyman', 2005, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'Bobby Bukowski, Stephen Kay, Paul Grinder', 'Juliet Snowden, Stiles White, Eric Kripke', 'Barry Watson, Emily Deschanel, Lucy Lawless, Skye McCole Bartusiak, Tory Mussett, Louise Wallace, Andrew Glover, Charles Mesure', 'PG-13', 'Every culture has one – the horrible monster fueling young children''s nightmares. But for Tim, the Boogeyman still lives in his memories as a creature that devoured his father 16 years ago. Is the Boogeyman real, or did Tim make it up to explain why his father abandoned his family?', 'Every culture has one – the horrible monster fueling young children''s nightmares. But for Tim, the Boogeyman still lives in his memories as a creature that devoured his father 16 years ago. Is the Boogeyman real, or did Tim make it up to explain why his father abandoned his family?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KffN0UcuAKJdUAcOvZ21OrqXc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8968'),
  ('605680419833744569', 'Boogeyman 2', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jeff Betancourt, Nelson Cragg', 'Brian Sieve', 'Danielle Savre, Matt Cohen, Chrissy Calhoun, Michael Graziadei, Mae Whitman, Renée O''Connor, Tobin Bell, Johnny Simmons', 'NR', 'A young woman attempts to cure her phobia of the boogeyman by checking herself into a mental health facility, only to realize too late that she is now helplessly trapped with her own greatest fear.', 'A young woman attempts to cure her phobia of the boogeyman by checking herself into a mental health facility, only to realize too late that she is now helplessly trapped with her own greatest fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPtDUBYzbbTnTsLXIfoOHGg8Gux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14913'),
  ('831767184783251944', 'Boogeyman 3', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gary Jones, Lorenzo Senatore, Todor Chapkanov', 'Brian Sieve', 'Erin Cahill, Chuck Hittinger, Mimi Michaels, Matt Rippy, Nikki Sanderson, W.B. Alexander, Elyes Gabel, George Maguire', 'NR', 'When a college student witnesses the alleged suicide of her roommate, it sets into motion a series of horrific events that cause her to fear the supernatural entity. As she tries to convince the rest of her dorm that the Boogeyman does exist, the evil force grows stronger and her friends begin to pay the price. Now she must stop this ultimate evil before the entire campus falls prey.', 'When a college student witnesses the alleged suicide of her roommate, it sets into motion a series of horrific events that cause her to fear the supernatural entity. As she tries to convince the rest of her dorm that the Boogeyman does exist, the evil force grows stronger and her friends begin to pay the price. Now she must stop this ultimate evil before the entire campus falls prey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOCBPiNeQ7tPuQDwxapNYuSLKT5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15262'),
  ('34987884108385043', 'Boogeyman II', 1983, 'Horror', 'Ulli Lommel, Bruce Pearn, David Sperling', 'Ulli Lommel, Suzanna Love, Bruce Pearn', 'Suzanna Love, Ulli Lommel, Shannah Hall, Shoto von Douglas, Bob Rosenfarb, Rhonda Aldrich, Sarah Jean Watkins, Rock Mackenzie', null, 'Lacey, the shaken survivor of a bloody supernatural rampage in the countryside, is flown to Los Angeles where a slick movie producer plans to cash in on her story. At a decadent Hollywood party, plans for the beginning of a new horror movie franchise are torn asunder when a fragment of the original haunted mirror turns these hotshot movers and shakers into screamers and quakers!', 'Lacey, the shaken survivor of a bloody supernatural rampage in the countryside, is flown to Los Angeles where a slick movie producer plans to cash in on her story. At a decadent Hollywood party, plans for the beginning of a new horror movie franchise are torn asunder when a fragment of the original haunted mirror turns these hotshot movers and shakers into screamers and quakers!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgvWLAl6qdPoMXJ6uCZLfua8jC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54127'),
  ('683669400999580638', 'Boogie', 2009, 'Action, Animation, Crime', 'Gustavo Cova, Sebastián Ramseg', 'Marcelo Páez Cubells', 'Pablo Echarri, Nancy Dupláa, Nicolás Frías, Marcelo Armand, Rufino Gallo, Diego Brizzi, Ricardo Alanis, Luciana Falcón', null, 'Hoping to make some money, Boogie, a violent and ruthless assassin, kidnaps a witness a mafia boss wants dead.', 'Hoping to make some money, Boogie, a violent and ruthless assassin, kidnaps a witness a mafia boss wants dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AkYQbzcr2q0ls8YKGaKSJktUrX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35837'),
  ('885008700702232269', 'Boogie', 2021, 'Drama', 'Brett Jutkiewicz, Nicholas R. Bell, Scott Foster', 'Eddie Huang', 'Taylor Takahashi, Taylour Paige, Pop Smoke, Perry Yung, Pamelyn Chee, Mike Moh, Jorge Lendeborg Jr., Domenick Lombardozzi', 'R', 'Alfred “Boogie” Chin is a basketball phenom living in Queens, New York, who dreams of one day playing in the NBA. While his parents pressure him to focus on earning a scholarship to an elite college, Boogie must find a way to navigate a new girlfriend, high school, on-court rivals and the burden of expectation.', 'Alfred “Boogie” Chin is a basketball phenom living in Queens, New York, who dreams of one day playing in the NBA. While his parents pressure him to focus on earning a scholarship to an elite college, Boogie must find a way to navigate a new girlfriend, high school, on-court rivals and the burden of expectation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5xmNu7Lb4IqOahsE8K6W8xBTC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631058'),
  ('239872849539797519', 'Boogie Boy', 1998, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Craig Hamann, Adam Kane', null, 'Mark Dacascos, Emily Lloyd, Jaimz Woolvett, Frederic Forrest, Traci Lords, John Hawkes, Joan Jett, Jonathan Scarfe', null, 'A man who has just been released from prison vows to start a new life, but is put to the test when an old cellmate appears.', 'A man who has just been released from prison vows to start a new life, but is put to the test when an old cellmate appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyT6wAw774IGcAU7xgRstbXj3NT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182502'),
  ('392129903904082976', 'Boogie Nights', 1997, 'Drama', 'Robert Elswit, Paul Thomas Anderson, John Wildermuth', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Mark Wahlberg, Burt Reynolds, Julianne Moore, John C. Reilly, Heather Graham, Don Cheadle, Philip Seymour Hoffman, William H. Macy', 'R', 'Set in 1977, back when sex was safe, pleasure was a business and business was booming, idealistic porn producer Jack Horner aspires to elevate his craft to an art form. Horner discovers Eddie Adams, a hot young talent working as a busboy in a nightclub, and welcomes him into the extended family of movie-makers, misfits and hangers-on that are always around. Adams'' rise from nobody to a celebrity adult entertainer is meteoric, and soon the whole world seems to know his porn alter ego, "Dirk Diggler". Now, when disco and drugs are in vogue, fashion is in flux and the party never seems to stop, Adams'' dreams of turning sex into stardom are about to collide with cold, hard reality.', 'Set in 1977, back when sex was safe, pleasure was a business and business was booming, idealistic porn producer Jack Horner aspires to elevate his craft to an art form. Horner discovers Eddie Adams, a hot young talent working as a busboy in a nightclub, and welcomes him into the extended family of movie-makers, misfits and hangers-on that are always around. Adams'' rise from nobody to a celebrity adult entertainer is meteoric, and soon the whole world seems to know his porn alter ego, "Dirk Diggler". Now, when disco and drugs are in vogue, fashion is in flux and the party never seems to stop, Adams'' dreams of turning sex into stardom are about to collide with cold, hard reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnE24UPCPQsQnbBOu4zVE2qaDNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4995'),
  ('319926096984091042', 'Boogie Woogie', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Duncan Ward, John Mathieson, Gary Davy', 'Danny Moynihan', 'Gillian Anderson, Alan Cumming, Heather Graham, Danny Huston, Jack Huston, Christopher Lee, Joanna Lumley, Simon McBurney', 'R', 'In London''s contemporary art world, everyone has a hustle. Art Spindle runs a high-end gallery: he hopes to flip a Mondrian for millions. One of his assistants, Beth, is sleeping with Art''s most acquisitive client, Bob Macclestone. Beth wants Bob to set her up in her own gallery, so she helps him go behind Art''s back for the Mondrian. Bob''s wife, Jean, sets her eye on a young conceptual artist, Jo, who lusts after Art''s newest assistant, Paige. Meanwhile, self-absorbed videographer Elaine is chewing her way through friends and lovers looking to make it: if she''ll throw Dewey, her agent, under the bus, Beth may give her a show. And the Mondrian? No honor among thieves.', 'In London''s contemporary art world, everyone has a hustle. Art Spindle runs a high-end gallery: he hopes to flip a Mondrian for millions. One of his assistants, Beth, is sleeping with Art''s most acquisitive client, Bob Macclestone. Beth wants Bob to set her up in her own gallery, so she helps him go behind Art''s back for the Mondrian. Bob''s wife, Jean, sets her eye on a young conceptual artist, Jo, who lusts after Art''s newest assistant, Paige. Meanwhile, self-absorbed videographer Elaine is chewing her way through friends and lovers looking to make it: if she''ll throw Dewey, her agent, under the bus, Beth may give her a show. And the Mondrian? No honor among thieves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plnHFNGI1ToCFhyyYU3bb0AmDpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36939'),
  ('951832827610267273', 'Boogie Woogie Bugle Boy of Company "B"', 1941, 'Animation', 'Walter Lantz', 'Ben Hardaway, Lowell Elliot', 'Willie Best, Danny Webb', null, 'Hot Breath Harry is a hot trumpeter at a jazz club. He finds himself drafted into the Army, where he''s assigned to be the bugler of an African-American company. But everyone hates the bugler, because he blows reveille at the ungodly hour of 5 AM sharp.', 'Hot Breath Harry is a hot trumpeter at a jazz club. He finds himself drafted into the Army, where he''s assigned to be the bugler of an African-American company. But everyone hates the bugler, because he blows reveille at the ungodly hour of 5 AM sharp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHymDtKAuioxCQ5D4Yp1scTEczt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236567'),
  ('423468782468897436', 'Boogie-Doodle', 1941, 'Animation', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'An animation film, made without the use of a camera, in which "boogie" played by Albert Ammons and "doodle" drawn by Norman McLaren combine to make a rhythmic, brightly colored film experiment. The main title is in eight languages.', 'An animation film, made without the use of a camera, in which "boogie" played by Albert Ammons and "doodle" drawn by Norman McLaren combine to make a rhythmic, brightly colored film experiment. The main title is in eight languages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbf8ut9juDzonhtxUyJM0MW4eKb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132038'),
  ('979800532066309937', 'Boogiepop and Others', 2000, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ryu Kaneda, Satoshi Maeda', 'Sadayuki Murai', 'Sayaka Yoshino, Daijiro Kawaoka, Ayana Sakai, Tetsu Sawaki, Asumi Miwa, Mami Shimizu, Hassei Takano, Hideyuki Kasahara', null, 'The story takes place in an unnamed Japanese city, and follows five students at Shinyo Academy as they try to piece together the puzzle of a new drug and recent disappearances among the student populace. While the teachers believe them to only be runaways, the female students whisper among themselves about the urban legend Boogiepop, who is said to be a Shinigami.', 'The story takes place in an unnamed Japanese city, and follows five students at Shinyo Academy as they try to piece together the puzzle of a new drug and recent disappearances among the student populace. While the teachers believe them to only be runaways, the female students whisper among themselves about the urban legend Boogiepop, who is said to be a Shinigami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UL26KIJHzJtvDCYOzWoiPLWoER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46956'),
  ('353165152633489880', 'Booha', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Nezar Shaker, Ramy Imam', 'Nader Salah Al-Din', 'Mohamed Saad, Mai Ezz ElDein, Lebleba, Hassan Hosny, Magdy Kamel, Hisham Al Meleji, Ghareib Mahmoud, Badria Tolba', null, 'Booha, a butcher coming from the countryside to Cairo to find the man whom his late father left his money with, gets tangled in the big city, finds love with Kotta, and gets exploited by Farag.', 'Booha, a butcher coming from the countryside to Cairo to find the man whom his late father left his money with, gets tangled in the big city, finds love with Kotta, and gets exploited by Farag.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81NR0eJ2j7x4ioq9xBZWVQFZHiC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418077'),
  ('488406038327069457', 'Book Club', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Bill Holderman, Stephen P. Dunn, Anneke Scott', 'Bill Holderman, Erin Simms', 'Diane Keaton, Jane Fonda, Candice Bergen, Mary Steenburgen, Craig T. Nelson, Andy Garcia, Don Johnson, Richard Dreyfuss', 'PG-13', 'Four lifelong friends decide that their lives could change by becoming nasty and reading Fifty Shades of Grey in their monthly book club to get inspiration on how to handle sexual pleasure at an elderly age.', 'Four lifelong friends decide that their lives could change by becoming nasty and reading Fifty Shades of Grey in their monthly book club to get inspiration on how to handle sexual pleasure at an elderly age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ORGBbOA45pfKQXvntPf46NoFGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502682'),
  ('226574653609767960', 'Book Club: The Next Chapter', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bill Holderman, Andrew Dunn, Yvonne Olivieri', 'Erin Simms, Bill Holderman', 'Diane Keaton, Jane Fonda, Candice Bergen, Mary Steenburgen, Andy Garcia, Don Johnson, Craig T. Nelson, Giancarlo Giannini', 'PG-13', 'Four best friends take their book club to Italy for the fun girls'' trip they never had. When things go off the rails and secrets are revealed, their relaxing vacation turns into a once-in-a-lifetime cross-country adventure.', 'Four best friends take their book club to Italy for the fun girls'' trip they never had. When things go off the rails and secrets are revealed, their relaxing vacation turns into a once-in-a-lifetime cross-country adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXoeOcWWhPpLH1wzTIhOx8jydBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982271'),
  ('767823327442488027', 'Book Girl', 2010, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Shunsuke Tada, Keita Matsumoto, Keiichi Sano', 'Yuka Yamada', 'Kana Hanazawa, Miyu Irino, Aki Toyosaki, Asami Shimoda, Aya Hirano, Daisuke Ono, Mamoru Miyano, Nana Mizuki', null, 'Konoha Inoue and Tōko Amano, the Literary Girl, as she calls herself, are the sole members of their high school literature club. Their lives will be altered when Konoha''s past, forgotten for a long time, reaches the present, involving them in a whirlwind of feelings where love, jealousy, revenge, remorse and forgiveness struggle to prevail.', 'Konoha Inoue and Tōko Amano, the Literary Girl, as she calls herself, are the sole members of their high school literature club. Their lives will be altered when Konoha''s past, forgotten for a long time, reaches the present, involving them in a whirlwind of feelings where love, jealousy, revenge, remorse and forgiveness struggle to prevail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qR1LjPZLdgjfkjQJWf9ppHifjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60669'),
  ('1035019034088550970', 'Book of Blood', 2009, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mark Inglis, Jonathan Farmer, John Harrison', 'Darin Silverman', 'Jonas Armstrong, Sophie Ward, Clive Russell, Paul Blair, Romana Abercromby, Simon Bamford, Doug Bradley, Gowan Calder', 'R', 'Based on the wraparound story penned by Clive Barker in the author''s "Books of Blood" collection, the story centers on a paranormal expert who, while investigating a gruesome slaying, finds a house that is at the intersection of "highways" transporting souls to the afterlife.', 'Based on the wraparound story penned by Clive Barker in the author''s "Books of Blood" collection, the story centers on a paranormal expert who, while investigating a gruesome slaying, finds a house that is at the intersection of "highways" transporting souls to the afterlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxkBQ6LVrcO3FnfWaVyRryLHx8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19599'),
  ('165036378569730050', 'Book of Dragons', 2011, 'Fantasy, Animation, Action, Comedy, Family', 'Steve Hickner', 'Steve Hickner, Bart Coughlin, Joshua Pruett', 'Jay Baruchel, Craig Ferguson, America Ferrera, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Jim Cummings, Tress MacNeille', 'PG', 'So you want to be a dragon trainer do you? Prepare yourself for adventure, excitement and training as Hiccup, Astrid, Toothless and Gobber tell the legend behind the Book of Dragons and reveal insider training secrets about new, never-before-seen dragons.', 'So you want to be a dragon trainer do you? Prepare yourself for adventure, excitement and training as Hiccup, Astrid, Toothless and Gobber tell the legend behind the Book of Dragons and reveal insider training secrets about new, never-before-seen dragons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDInObzAHYGsde02gTxL8B56HGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79379'),
  ('34528163088129662', 'Book of Joshua: Walls of Jericho', 2025, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Tony Goss', null, 'Mac Rogers, Merri Jamison, Xander Bailey, Allen Marsh, Alistair David Herz, Hannah Marie Lloyd, McKenzie Harms', 'NR', 'Led by Joshua, the Israelites abide by God''s battle plan and witness the collapse of the mighty walls of Jericho, revealing the power of unwavering faith.', 'Led by Joshua, the Israelites abide by God''s battle plan and witness the collapse of the mighty walls of Jericho, revealing the power of unwavering faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zu54drUl5ZPSTrTOHSuFnImMz4A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1483546'),
  ('409877531638624929', 'Book of Love', 1990, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Shaye, Peter Deming, Douglas A. Raine', 'William Kotzwinkle', 'Michael McKean, Chris Young, Josie Bissett, Beau Dremann, John Cameron Mitchell, Keith Coogan, Tricia Leigh Fisher, Danny Nucci', 'PG-13', 'John Twiller takes down his high school yearbook and begins to reminiscence about that time he first moved into the neighborhood in 1956. His teenage self, Jack is obsessed with Lily one of the more popular girls around. The sole obstacle is Angelo, her bullying boyfriend. With the help of his pals Crutch, Floyd, and Spider, he makes every attempt possible to change her mind.', 'John Twiller takes down his high school yearbook and begins to reminiscence about that time he first moved into the neighborhood in 1956. His teenage self, Jack is obsessed with Lily one of the more popular girls around. The sole obstacle is Angelo, her bullying boyfriend. With the help of his pals Crutch, Floyd, and Spider, he makes every attempt possible to change her mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euB7qu0yqFWqWlPfgNeOTjEIZCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52560'),
  ('526546016664604713', 'Book of Love', 2004, 'Drama', 'Alan Brown', 'Alan Brown', 'Simon Baker, Frances O''Connor, Gregory Smith, Bryce Dallas Howard, Joanna Adler, Sabrina Grdevich, Ari Graynor, Beth MacDonald', 'R', 'Living among fusty academics, an unusual young man gets between a high school history teacher and his wife.', 'Living among fusty academics, an unusual young man gets between a high school history teacher and his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nY5ZQvQHwWxVzihBfdIu5llGoad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120515'),
  ('227553177183170633', 'Book of Love', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Analeine Cal y Mayor, Gerardo Barroso, Anna Kennedy', 'David Quantick, Analeine Cal y Mayor', 'Sam Claflin, Verónica Echegui, Antonia Clarke, Horacio García Rojas, Melissa Pino, Galya Vidal, Fernando Becerril, Ruy Gaytan', null, 'Henry, an English writer who has written a new book that has become a failure in the U.K, gets notified that the dull book has been highly trending over in Mexico. Little does he know that Maria, a Spanish translator, turned the book into an erotic novel. Henry and Maria then swerve around Mexico to do a book tour and go through a wind of events.', 'Henry, an English writer who has written a new book that has become a failure in the U.K, gets notified that the dull book has been highly trending over in Mexico. Little does he know that Maria, a Spanish translator, turned the book into an erotic novel. Henry and Maria then swerve around Mexico to do a book tour and go through a wind of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLrXzWWGlCQ9V2iNGyhVz7nMTTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892835'),
  ('513784139173718301', 'Book of Monsters', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror, Action', 'Frankie Maiden, Stewart Sparke, Oliver Mitchell', 'Paul Butler', 'Lyndsey Craine, Michaela Longden, Lizzie Stanton, Anna Dawson, Daniel Thrace, Rose Muirhead, Arron Dennis, Steph Mossman', 'NR', 'Sophie''s 18th birthday becomes a bloodbath when monsters descend upon her house, devouring the guests and killing anyone who tries to leave. To survive the night, Sophie must face her destiny: monsters are real and she''s the only one who can stop them.', 'Sophie''s 18th birthday becomes a bloodbath when monsters descend upon her house, devouring the guests and killing anyone who tries to leave. To survive the night, Sophie must face her destiny: monsters are real and she''s the only one who can stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bl9AX7lOgZuqqdV4dIjW2UxXiHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532649'),
  ('1013012516014641948', 'Book of Shadows: Blair Witch 2', 2000, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Nancy Schreiber, Joe Berlinger, Bill Carraro', 'Dick Beebe, Joe Berlinger', 'Kim Director, Jeffrey Donovan, Erica Leerhsen, Tristine Skyler, Stephen Barker Turner, Lanny Flaherty, Lauren Hulsey, Raynor Scheine', 'R', 'A group of college students decide to take part in a witch hunt tour inspired by a horror movie. As the adventure goes awry, the students realise that an evil being has followed them home.', 'A group of college students decide to take part in a witch hunt tour inspired by a horror movie. As the adventure goes awry, the students realise that an evil being has followed them home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1jF93S9FYbzp3Byh5VUA1KApSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11531'),
