  ('1077723134053244041', 'Bookies', 2003, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Mark Illsley, Brendan Galvin', 'Michael Bacall', 'Nick Stahl, Johnny Galecki, Lukas Haas, Rachael Leigh Cook, David Proval, John Diehl, Julio Oscar Mechoso, Dwight Armstrong', null, 'Four college friends become small-time bookies, only to find their world spinning dangerously out of control when their greed attracts the attention of organized crime.', 'Four college friends become small-time bookies, only to find their world spinning dangerously out of control when their greed attracts the attention of organized crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHfc4AbPqx7St264XoWzm7cScQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14759'),
  ('474973268617082072', 'Books of Blood', 2020, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Brannon Braga, Michael Dallatorre', 'Adam Simon, Brannon Braga', 'Britt Robertson, Freda Foh Shen, Nicholas Campbell, Anna Friel, Rafi Gavron, Yul Vazquez, Andy McQueen, Kenji Fitzgerald', 'NR', 'A journey into uncharted and forbidden territory through three tales tangled in space and time.', 'A journey into uncharted and forbidden territory through three tales tangled in space and time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXLVZGgLgd7OwbfP6fC5GCfrxuD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715123'),
  ('335791185537050985', 'Booksmart', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Olivia Wilde, Jason McCormick, Scott Robertson', 'Sarah Haskins, Emily Halpern, Katie Silberman', 'Kaitlyn Dever, Beanie Feldstein, Jessica Williams, Jason Sudeikis, Lisa Kudrow, Will Forte, Victoria Ruesga, Mason Gooding', 'R', 'Two academic teenage superstars realize, on the eve of their high school graduation, that they should have worked less and played more. Determined to never fall short of their peers, the girls set out on a mission to cram four years of fun into one night.', 'Two academic teenage superstars realize, on the eve of their high school graduation, that they should have worked less and played more. Determined to never fall short of their peers, the girls set out on a mission to cram four years of fun into one night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aSxRDmisJP90H3S0aocyuQIe4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505600'),
  ('281557679687747829', 'Bookworm', 2024, 'Adventure, Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Miranda Rivers, Daniel Katz, Ant Timpson', 'Toby Harvard', 'Nell Fisher, Elijah Wood, Michael Smiley, Vanessa Stacey, Morgana O''Reilly, Millen Baird, Nikki Si''ulepa, Theo Shakes', null, 'Eleven-year-old Mildred’s life is turned upside down when her mother lands in hospital and estranged, American magician father, Strawn Wise, comes to look after her. Hoping to entertain the bookish tween, Strawn takes Mildred camping in the notoriously rugged New Zealand wilderness, and the pair embark on the ultimate test of family bonding – a quest to find the mythological beast known as the Canterbury Panther.', 'Eleven-year-old Mildred’s life is turned upside down when her mother lands in hospital and estranged, American magician father, Strawn Wise, comes to look after her. Hoping to entertain the bookish tween, Strawn takes Mildred camping in the notoriously rugged New Zealand wilderness, and the pair embark on the ultimate test of family bonding – a quest to find the mythological beast known as the Canterbury Panther.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/260GDjmYf2A9W09RRo5FwUueQ3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1153110'),
  ('845239494887241029', 'Boom', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Laurie Pereira De Figueiredo, Charles Di Cicco, Yannick Jacquin', 'Laurie Pereira De Figueiredo, Charles Di Cicco, Gabriel Augerai', null, null, 'A pair of clumsy birds try their best to protect their eggs from a volcanic eruption.', 'A pair of clumsy birds try their best to protect their eggs from a volcanic eruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAvcKutzVqAdQvsxkRYMpBRkkes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1078483'),
  ('794629824158998564', 'Boom Boom', 1936, 'Animation', 'Jack King', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Tommy Bond, Tedd Pierce, Joe Dougherty', null, 'World War I, apparently. There is a series of quick blackout gags, including a soldier that throws the pin...', 'World War I, apparently. There is a series of quick blackout gags, including a soldier that throws the pin...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZxPz0ACvMfCvy9qNb5ysuFYU8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202293'),
  ('562857138061308595', 'Boom in the Moon', 1946, 'War, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Jaime Salvador, Agustín Jiménez', 'Victor Trivas, Jaime Salvador', 'Buster Keaton, Guillermo Bravo Sosa, Pedro Elviro, Luis G. Barreiro, Ángel Garasa, Ramón G. Larrea, Jorge Mondragón, José Torvay', null, 'An American soldier (Keaton) during World War II escapes from an airplane crash over the Pacific Ocean. He arrives on a beach believing he has landed in Japan, but he is actually in Mexico. He wanders into a fishing village and is arrested under the mistaken belief that he is a wanted serial killer. Keaton and another prisoner are put in the custody of an scientist who is planning to launch a manned rocket into outer space. The two prisoners, along with the scientist’s assistant, are blasted into space but their craft lands in an isolated portion of Mexico instead. They mistake a beekeeper wearing protective headgear as an alien, while the beekeeper believes the trio (who are wearing wizard robes) are escaped lunatics. The prisoners and the scientist’s assistant are apprehended by the local police, and the matter is quickly settled. The film is notable both as Keaton’s only Mexican production and as the last time Keaton had star billing in a feature film.', 'An American soldier (Keaton) during World War II escapes from an airplane crash over the Pacific Ocean. He arrives on a beach believing he has landed in Japan, but he is actually in Mexico. He wanders into a fishing village and is arrested under the mistaken belief that he is a wanted serial killer. Keaton and another prisoner are put in the custody of an scientist who is planning to launch a manned rocket into outer space. The two prisoners, along with the scientist’s assistant, are blasted into space but their craft lands in an isolated portion of Mexico instead. They mistake a beekeeper wearing protective headgear as an alien, while the beekeeper believes the trio (who are wearing wizard robes) are escaped lunatics. The prisoners and the scientist’s assistant are apprehended by the local police, and the matter is quickly settled. The film is notable both as Keaton’s only Mexican production and as the last time Keaton had star billing in a feature film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIoFDEPWIh8rtv6FsDtPjl7Js5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53610'),
  ('885820247863090540', 'Boom Town', 1940, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance, Western', 'Jack Conway, Harold Rosson', 'John Lee Mahin', 'Clark Gable, Spencer Tracy, Claudette Colbert, Hedy Lamarr, Frank Morgan, Lionel Atwill, Chill Wills, Marion Martin', 'NR', 'Two buddies who rise from fly-by-night wildcatters to oil tycoons over a twenty year period both love the same woman. McMasters and Sand come to oil towns to get rich. Betsy comes West intending to marry Sand but marries McMasters instead. Getting rich and losing it all teaches McMasters and Sand the value of personal ties.', 'Two buddies who rise from fly-by-night wildcatters to oil tycoons over a twenty year period both love the same woman. McMasters and Sand come to oil towns to get rich. Betsy comes West intending to marry Sand but marries McMasters instead. Getting rich and losing it all teaches McMasters and Sand the value of personal ties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upPOcyAhnL0tDPL8MsTRrOJquiJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55604'),
  ('50095199735131596', 'Boom!', 1968, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Joseph Losey, Douglas Slocombe', 'Tennessee Williams', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Richard Burton, Noël Coward, Joanna Shimkus, Michael Dunn, Romolo Valli, Fernando Piazza, Veronica Wells', 'PG', 'Secluding herself in an island mansion in the Mediterranean with her servants and nurses, the wealthy Flora "Sissy" Goforth prepares for her impending death -- and she isn''t the only one who''s waiting. Known for his attraction to the dying rich, poet Chris Flanders ingratiates himself with the wilting Sissy. Although her friend explains Flanders'' "Angel of Death" nature to her, Sissy embraces the vulture-like Flanders.', 'Secluding herself in an island mansion in the Mediterranean with her servants and nurses, the wealthy Flora "Sissy" Goforth prepares for her impending death -- and she isn''t the only one who''s waiting. Known for his attraction to the dying rich, poet Chris Flanders ingratiates himself with the wilting Sissy. Although her friend explains Flanders'' "Angel of Death" nature to her, Sissy embraces the vulture-like Flanders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnZXyiICb8mJzXNMnnJnq6nQwEr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85765'),
  ('810356707856923734', 'Boomerang', 1976, 'Crime, Drama', 'José Giovanni, Pierre-William Glenn', 'José Giovanni, Alain Delon, Monica Venturini', 'Alain Delon, Carla Gravina, Louis Julien, Monique Chaumette, Louisa Colpeyn, Charles Vanel, Dora Doll, Suzanne Flon', null, 'A reformed gangster turns to his old associates for help after his son kills a police officer.', 'A reformed gangster turns to his old associates for help after his son kills a police officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMFF63UyJdCsFEONc2qrLLwBY9s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205872'),
  ('218550356292000548', 'Boomerang', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Reginald Hudlin, Woody Omens, Joseph Ray', 'Barry W. Blaustein, David Sheffield', 'Eddie Murphy, Robin Givens, Halle Berry, David Alan Grier, Martin Lawrence, Grace Jones, Geoffrey Holder, Eartha Kitt', 'R', 'Marcus is a successful advertising executive who woos and beds women almost at will. After a company merger he finds that his new boss, the ravishing Jacqueline, is treating him in exactly the same way. Completely traumatised by this, his work goes badly downhill.', 'Marcus is a successful advertising executive who woos and beds women almost at will. After a company merger he finds that his new boss, the ravishing Jacqueline, is treating him in exactly the same way. Completely traumatised by this, his work goes badly downhill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apwkBVaJqLuK6mxe6sOABCeNjRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11066'),
  ('550439176379595799', 'Boomerang', 2015, 'Drama', 'François Favrat, Laurent Brunet', 'Tatiana De Rosnay', 'Mélanie Laurent, Laurent Lafitte, Audrey Dana, Wladimir Yordanoff, Bulle Ogier, Anne Suarez, Anne Loiret, Lise Lamétrie', null, 'When Antoine returns to the island of Noirmoutier, secrets kept in the past resurfaces and threatens to change his family’s present.', 'When Antoine returns to the island of Noirmoutier, secrets kept in the past resurfaces and threatens to change his family’s present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmca3IeMIe3DLD8WOyvnmvGanIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352187'),
