  ('722003020675140246', 'Boonie Bears: The Big Shrink', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ding Liang', 'Qin Wan, Lin Jiang', 'Tan Xiao, Yutian Meng, Zhang Bingjun, Zhang Wei, Siqi Liu, Li Wanyao, Pei Liu', null, 'Briar and Bramble, two bear brothers who constantly annoy Vick, are about to have a rude awakening. Vick goes to meet them to make them disappear and remove them from his life. During the commotion, all three are caught in by a shrink ray and miniaturized. The tiny team must return to the device to reverse the effects, but their efforts are thwarted by Vick''s father. All three of them embark on a crazy race through a beautiful world, right under our feet, not only to return to their right , but also to find their families.', 'Briar and Bramble, two bear brothers who constantly annoy Vick, are about to have a rude awakening. Vick goes to meet them to make them disappear and remove them from his life. During the commotion, all three are caught in by a shrink ray and miniaturized. The tiny team must return to the device to reverse the effects, but their efforts are thwarted by Vick''s father. All three of them embark on a crazy race through a beautiful world, right under our feet, not only to return to their right , but also to find their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SHjHTSbbl9bWe4dFCignISpGEA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529426'),
