  ('585577634176042544', 'Bopha!', 1993, 'Drama', 'Morgan Freeman, David Watkin', 'Brian Bird, John Wierick, Percy Mtwa', 'Danny Glover, Malcolm McDowell, Alfre Woodard, Marius Weyers, Maynard Eziashi, Malick Bowens, Robin Smith, Michael Chinyamurindi', null, 'In this story of a black policeman during South African apartheid, Danny Glover plays the cop, who believes he''s trying to help his people, even while serving as a pawn of the racist government. When his son gets involved in the anti-apartheid movement, he finds himself torn between his family and what he believes is his duty.', 'In this story of a black policeman during South African apartheid, Danny Glover plays the cop, who believes he''s trying to help his people, even while serving as a pawn of the racist government. When his son gets involved in the anti-apartheid movement, he finds himself torn between his family and what he believes is his duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chp4an84fVorgFz1ICbbnQkW2pK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76264'),
