  ('398928425357953812', 'Borat Subsequent Moviefilm: Delivery of Prodigious Bribe to American Regime for Make Benefit Once Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Jason Woliner, Luke Geissbühler, Joshua Stickler', 'Peter Baynham, Jena Friedman, Dan Swimer', 'Sacha Baron Cohen, Maria Bakalova, Tom Hanks, Dani Popescu, Manuel Vieru, Miroslav Tolj, Alin Popa, Ion Gheorghe', 'R', '14 years after making a film about his journey across the USA, Borat risks life and limb when he returns to the United States with his young daughter, and reveals more about the culture, the COVID-19 pandemic, and the political elections.', '14 years after making a film about his journey across the USA, Borat risks life and limb when he returns to the United States with his young daughter, and reveals more about the culture, the COVID-19 pandemic, and the political elections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3L1Ml5RWjFVfVq3rQENvgFymT0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740985'),
  ('340325557048130471', 'Borat: Cultural Learnings of America for Make Benefit Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Larry Charles, Luke Geissbühler, Anthony Hardwick', 'Dan Mazer, Sacha Baron Cohen, Anthony Hines', 'Sacha Baron Cohen, Ken Davitian, Luenell, Pamela Anderson, Bob Barr, Alan Keyes, Carole De Saram, Mitchell Falk', 'R', 'Kazakh journalist Borat Sagdiyev travels to America to make a documentary. As he zigzags across the nation, Borat meets real people in real situations with hysterical consequences. His backwards behavior generates strong reactions around him exposing prejudices and hypocrisies in American culture.', 'Kazakh journalist Borat Sagdiyev travels to America to make a documentary. As he zigzags across the nation, Borat meets real people in real situations with hysterical consequences. His backwards behavior generates strong reactions around him exposing prejudices and hypocrisies in American culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfkyALfD4G1mlBJI1lOt2QCra4i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496'),
