  ('649640399093362114', 'Bordello', 1985, 'Drama', 'Nikos Kavoukidis, Nikos Koundouros', 'Nikos Koundouros, Marios Pontikas, Giorgos Veltsos', 'Marina Vlady, Eleonora Stathopoulou, Vasilis Laggos, Agapi Manoura, Aris Retsos, Antigoni Amanitou, Antonis Antoniou, Fanis Hinas', null, 'Crete 1897. Greek rebels gained their freedom by fighting in the mountains. An allied fleet of French, English, Italian and Russian warships anchored in the port of Chania in protecting Greek and Turkish inhabitants. Rosa Bonaparte, accompanied by twelve girls off at a deserted beach with all the equipment of a Marseille brothel. Installed in a wing of a huge, ruined former Town Hall, where the officers of the allied fleet meet and entertain in the evenings surrounded by undercover agents, military connectors, and speculators : an East-West mosaic of languages, costumes and intrigue ...', 'Crete 1897. Greek rebels gained their freedom by fighting in the mountains. An allied fleet of French, English, Italian and Russian warships anchored in the port of Chania in protecting Greek and Turkish inhabitants. Rosa Bonaparte, accompanied by twelve girls off at a deserted beach with all the equipment of a Marseille brothel. Installed in a wing of a huge, ruined former Town Hall, where the officers of the allied fleet meet and entertain in the evenings surrounded by undercover agents, military connectors, and speculators : an East-West mosaic of languages, costumes and intrigue ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCqMVwbFhLJknT88lTy8i8zmwGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276506'),
  ('968784613370604872', 'Bordello of Blood', 1996, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Gilbert Adler, Tom Priestley Jr., Lee Knippelberg', 'Gilbert Adler, A L Katz', 'Dennis Miller, Erika Eleniak, Angie Everhart, Chris Sarandon, Corey Feldman, John Kassir, William Sadler, Aubrey Morris', 'R', 'Private eye Rafe Guttman is hired by repressed, born-again Katherine to find her missing bad-boy brother. The trail leads him to a whorehouse run by a thousand-year-old vampire and secretly backed by Katherine''s boss, televangelist Jimmy Current.', 'Private eye Rafe Guttman is hired by repressed, born-again Katherine to find her missing bad-boy brother. The trail leads him to a whorehouse run by a thousand-year-old vampire and secretly backed by Katherine''s boss, televangelist Jimmy Current.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKkUQ0Zd9TFlqfcMMHFKQBB15wZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9431'),
  ('1015084312262298070', 'Border', 1997, 'History, Action, War, Drama', 'J. P. Dutta, Ishwar Bidri, Nirmal Jani', 'J. P. Dutta', 'Sunny Deol, Jackie Shroff, Suniel Shetty, Akshaye Khanna, Puneet Issar, Sudesh Berry, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Rakhee Gulzar', null, 'Amidst the 1971 Indo-Pak war, a company of 120 Indian soldiers stationed at the border region of Longewala in Rajasthan must defend their post through the night against two thousand Pakistani troops armed with tanks. Based on the true events of the Battle of Longewala.', 'Amidst the 1971 Indo-Pak war, a company of 120 Indian soldiers stationed at the border region of Longewala in Rajasthan must defend their post through the night against two thousand Pakistani troops armed with tanks. Based on the true events of the Battle of Longewala.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYih9kPSCh6CrJsZFWugXOY0ySj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33125'),
  ('665651523703597015', 'Border', 2018, 'Fantasy, Drama, Crime', 'Ali Abbasi, Nadim Carlsen, Peter Hjorth', 'Ali Abbasi, Isabella Eklöf, John Ajvide Lindqvist', 'Eva Melander, Eero Milonoff, Jörgen Thorsson, Ann Petrén, Sten Ljunggren, Kjell Wilhelmsen, Rakel Wärmländer, Andreas Kundler', 'R', 'When a border guard with a sixth sense for identifying smugglers encounters the first person she cannot prove is guilty, she is forced to confront terrifying revelations about herself and humankind.', 'When a border guard with a sixth sense for identifying smugglers encounters the first person she cannot prove is guilty, she is forced to confront terrifying revelations about herself and humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KzOTRlKjdAKQTemV41hq86ldFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517839'),
  ('1142296800735517162', 'Border 2', 2026, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Anurag Singh, Mukesh Chhabra, Anshul Chobey', 'Sumit Arora', 'Sunny Deol, Varun Dhawan, Diljit Dosanjh, Ahan Shetty, Mona Singh, Sonam Bajwa, Anya Singh, Medha Rana', 'R', 'Three idealistic soldiers in the Indian army, navy and air force face grueling combat conditions in this film set during the 1971 Indo-Pak war.', 'Three idealistic soldiers in the Indian army, navy and air force face grueling combat conditions in this film set during the 1971 Indo-Pak war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUcttG71zo9deP4m9sDhYPUcvi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1213898'),
  ('615617621741130933', 'Border Hunters', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ruben Islas, Istvan Lettang', 'Pedro Fernandez', 'Dean Norris, Julio Macias, Danforth Comins, Ramón Medína, Pía Sanz, Eligio Meléndez, Christina Urias, Luis Velázquez', 'R', 'After his police officer brother is killed by a drug dealer who flees to the protection of his cartel-connected uncle in Mexico, an American man with a diverse law enforcement/military background goes south of the border to get revenge', 'After his police officer brother is killed by a drug dealer who flees to the protection of his cartel-connected uncle in Mexico, an American man with a diverse law enforcement/military background goes south of the border to get revenge', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TNFZnJ5CU0uFQxGaO9dbqriiI7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1469354'),
  ('823607114490230968', 'Border Incident', 1949, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Anthony Mann, John Alton, André Previn', 'John C. Higgins', 'Ricardo Montalban, George Murphy, Howard Da Silva, James Mitchell, Arnold Moss, Alfonso Bedoya, Teresa Celli, Charles McGraw', 'NR', 'The story concerns two agents, one Mexican (PJF) and one American, who are tasked to stop the smuggling of Mexican migrant workers across the border to California. The two agents go undercover, one as a poor migrant.', 'The story concerns two agents, one Mexican (PJF) and one American, who are tasked to stop the smuggling of Mexican migrant workers across the border to California. The two agents go undercover, one as a poor migrant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FESTAHTpccVj6npkUv6GJ5d1St.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33811'),
  ('377893567644983975', 'Border Radio', 1987, 'Drama', 'Allison Anders, Kurt Voss, Dean Lent', 'Kurt Voss, Allison Anders, Dean Lent', 'Chris D., Luanna Anders, Chris Shearer, John Doe, Devon Anders, Dave Alvin, Texacala Jones', 'R', 'Two musicians and a roadie take money that is owed to them from a job. One flees to Mexico, and everyone has questions.', 'Two musicians and a roadie take money that is owed to them from a job. One flees to Mexico, and everyone has questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/poWO4hit66F2FZFvXlJKasHgTqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37497'),
  ('1001351834715178866', 'Border River', 1954, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Frank Shaw, Joseph Gershenson', 'Louis Stevens, William Sackheim', 'Joel McCrea, Yvonne De Carlo, Pedro Armendáriz, Alfonso Bedoya, Howard Petrie, Renate Hoy, George J. Lewis, Nacho Galindo', 'NR', 'A Confederate officer travels to a wild Mexican border town to buy guns, aiming to keep up the fight against the Yankees - but who can he trust in this lawless place?', 'A Confederate officer travels to a wild Mexican border town to buy guns, aiming to keep up the fight against the Yankees - but who can he trust in this lawless place?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZGFNo1W4FyOgxUIZZ2sfw7McNy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112004'),
  ('755126641420131438', 'Border Run', 2012, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Gabriela Tagliavini, Andrew Strahorn', 'Don Fiebiger, Amy Kolquist', 'Sharon Stone, Billy Zane, Rosemberg Salgado, Miguel Rodarte, Giovanna Zacarías, Olga Segura-Gall, Manolo Cardona, Gilmer Bejarano', 'R', 'A female American reporter searches for her missing brother against the backdrop of violence and human smuggling across the US/Mexican border.', 'A female American reporter searches for her missing brother against the backdrop of violence and human smuggling across the US/Mexican border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anA1Musyha2EmgiW9m4FXOFMX3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146955'),
  ('732955552261892210', 'Borderland', 2007, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Zev Berman, Scott Kevan, Renan Bendersky', null, 'Brian Presley, Rider Strong, Jake Muxworthy, Sean Astin, Beto Cuevas, Martha Higareda, Damián Alcázar, Mircea Monroe', 'R', 'Three college students, Phil, Ed, and Henry take a road trip into Mexico for a week of drinking and carefree fun only to have Phil find himself a captive of a group of satanic Mexican drug smugglers who kill tourists and whom are looking for a group of new ones to prepare for a sacrifice.', 'Three college students, Phil, Ed, and Henry take a road trip into Mexico for a week of drinking and carefree fun only to have Phil find himself a captive of a group of satanic Mexican drug smugglers who kill tourists and whom are looking for a group of new ones to prepare for a sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27DKHSvO9rF17cr7qRuGIYNZvSy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13548'),
  ('670192113207050776', 'Borderlands', 2024, 'Action, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Rogier Stoffers, Zsuzsa Kismarty-Lechner, Noon Orsatti', 'Joe Crombie, Eli Roth', 'Cate Blanchett, Kevin Hart, Edgar Ramírez, Jamie Lee Curtis, Ariana Greenblatt, Florian Munteanu, Janina Gavankar, Jack Black', 'PG-13', 'Returning to her home planet, an infamous bounty hunter forms an unexpected alliance with a team of unlikely heroes. Together, they battle monsters and dangerous bandits to protect a young girl who holds the key to unimaginable power.', 'Returning to her home planet, an infamous bounty hunter forms an unexpected alliance with a team of unlikely heroes. Together, they battle monsters and dangerous bandits to protect a young girl who holds the key to unimaginable power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JGoZu1ZKFpMJTWAP35PCfkMgu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365177'),
  ('227769993912436188', 'Borderlands Jaguar', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Ben Masters', 'Ben Masters, Austin Alvarado', 'Ben Masters, Austin Alvarado', 'PG', 'Wildlife cinematographers Austin Alvarado and Ben Masters embark on a quest to document the elusive Borderlands Jaguar with the goal of inspiring binational conservation efforts and the species'' return to the United States.', 'Wildlife cinematographers Austin Alvarado and Ben Masters embark on a quest to document the elusive Borderlands Jaguar with the goal of inspiring binational conservation efforts and the species'' return to the United States.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FfZKsk7l99rGTrlTSQr4GQFmTjME.jpg', 'plex:movie:borderlands-jaguar'),
  ('128329182935810355', 'Borderless Fog', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Edwin, Yunita Chun, Gadis Fajriani', 'Edwin, Ifan Adriansyah Ismail', 'Putri Marino, Yoga Pratama, Lukman Sardi, Yudi Ahmad Tajudin, Yusuf Mahardika, Kiki Narendra, Siti Fauziah, Maryam Supraba', null, 'A big-city detective investigates a series of gruesome murders along the Indonesia-Malaysia border — forcing her to confront ghosts from her past.', 'A big-city detective investigates a series of gruesome murders along the Indonesia-Malaysia border — forcing her to confront ghosts from her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6uPuxzFJs7OyTPrl5V0XUITKj5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1126357'),
  ('735054453048220790', 'Borderless Love', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hsu Chien, Marcelo Santiago', 'Marcelo Santiago', 'Luana Piovani, Paulo Tiefenthaler, Aylin Prandi, Gabi Lopes, Francisco Andrade, Maria Clara Gueiros, Naomi Nero, Toni Garrido', null, 'Borderless Love is a romantic comedy about two couples - Pedro and Joana, Brazilians; Martin and Pilar, Argentines - involved in an involuntary couples exchange. Pedro and Joana turn a blind eye to each other''s infidelity. Their daughter, Paula, a jealous teenager, distrusts the father and ends up discovering his case with Pilar. Pedro opts for the family, but without his lover, he becomes a burden at home. Tired of her husband''s depression, Joana asks Pilar to return to be Pedro''s lover. In the end, everyone''s life takes on new paths, but they remain united. Borderless Love is a fun and romantic journey of self-knowledge in the lives of these characters.', 'Borderless Love is a romantic comedy about two couples - Pedro and Joana, Brazilians; Martin and Pilar, Argentines - involved in an involuntary couples exchange. Pedro and Joana turn a blind eye to each other''s infidelity. Their daughter, Paula, a jealous teenager, distrusts the father and ends up discovering his case with Pilar. Pedro opts for the family, but without his lover, he becomes a burden at home. Tired of her husband''s depression, Joana asks Pilar to return to be Pedro''s lover. In the end, everyone''s life takes on new paths, but they remain united. Borderless Love is a fun and romantic journey of self-knowledge in the lives of these characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXINvoevUcoQwD69CwI1aAzibCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623086'),
  ('738814012267419037', 'Borderline', 1930, 'Drama', 'Kenneth MacPherson, Kenneth MacPherson', 'Kenneth MacPherson', 'Paul Robeson, Eslanda Robeson, Hilda Doolittle, Gavin Arthur, Charlotte Arthur, Blanche Lewin', null, 'When a black couple vacations at a resort in Switzerland, an interracial affair stirs racial tensions among the townsfolk.', 'When a black couple vacations at a resort in Switzerland, an interracial affair stirs racial tensions among the townsfolk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgf0dkarPJqsAY5B7aQesEXyGqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65874'),
  ('550119272187279823', 'Borderline', 1950, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Lucien N. Andriot, William A. Seiter, James H. Anderson', 'Devery Freeman', 'Fred MacMurray, Claire Trevor, Raymond Burr, José Torvay, Morris Ankrum, Roy Roberts, Don Diamond, Nacho Galindo', 'NR', 'The Los Angeles police know that Pete Ritchie has been bringing drugs into the city, but they can''t pin a single piece of evidence on him. After many botched attempts to get at the crook, they resort to having cop Madeleine go undercover and seduce her way into Ritchie''s circle. Before she can get anywhere, she''s abducted by Johnny, a government agent posing as a thug. But Johnny and Madeleine have no idea they''re on the same side of the law.', 'The Los Angeles police know that Pete Ritchie has been bringing drugs into the city, but they can''t pin a single piece of evidence on him. After many botched attempts to get at the crook, they resort to having cop Madeleine go undercover and seduce her way into Ritchie''s circle. Before she can get anywhere, she''s abducted by Johnny, a government agent posing as a thug. But Johnny and Madeleine have no idea they''re on the same side of the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6f7Lgj6qfGEehEWZmb3YXr8rkqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46531'),
  ('60633309573395129', 'Borderline', 1980, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Jerrold Freedman, Tak Fujimoto', 'Jerrold Freedman, Steve Kline', 'Charles Bronson, Bruno Kirby, Bert Remsen, Michael Lerner, Kenneth McMillan, Ed Harris, Karmin Murcelo, Enrique Castillo', 'PG', 'Jeb Maynard is a patrolman guarding the U.S.-Mexican border, whose partner and buddy Scooter has just been murdered. Maynard knows that a smuggler of illegal aliens is responsible for Scooter''s death, but the feds insist that drug dealers committed the crime.', 'Jeb Maynard is a patrolman guarding the U.S.-Mexican border, whose partner and buddy Scooter has just been murdered. Maynard knows that a smuggler of illegal aliens is responsible for Scooter''s death, but the feds insist that drug dealers committed the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2waGlqv59q6CyzcYozsBh8BNqfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8490'),
  ('130066709792158663', 'Borderline', 2002, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Evelyn Purcell, Michael Alan Brierley, Lisa Davison', 'David Loucka', 'Gina Gershon, Sean Patrick Flanery, Michael Biehn, Rae Allen, Eddie Driscoll, Jon Huertas, Natasha Napoli, Daniela Napoli', 'R', 'Psychiatrist Dr. Lila Colleti is divorcing her husband and is devastated when he wins custody of their two little girls, whom he gets largely because Lila''s job, being a psychiatrist for the criminally insane at the local prison, is a potentially dangerous one that forces her to keep long, erratic hours. When one of Lila''s patients, Ed Baikman, is released into a half-way house, he decides under the delusional influence of his psychosis to help her out by murdering her ex-husband and his girlfriend, and then threatening to tell the cops they''d planned it together when she refuses to become romantically involved with him. Though Lila''s lover, police detective Macy Kobacek, stands by her loyally, Baikman does such an ingenious job of implicating Lila in the crime that even Macy begins to have his doubts about Lila''s innocence', 'Psychiatrist Dr. Lila Colleti is divorcing her husband and is devastated when he wins custody of their two little girls, whom he gets largely because Lila''s job, being a psychiatrist for the criminally insane at the local prison, is a potentially dangerous one that forces her to keep long, erratic hours. When one of Lila''s patients, Ed Baikman, is released into a half-way house, he decides under the delusional influence of his psychosis to help her out by murdering her ex-husband and his girlfriend, and then threatening to tell the cops they''d planned it together when she refuses to become romantically involved with him. Though Lila''s lover, police detective Macy Kobacek, stands by her loyally, Baikman does such an ingenious job of implicating Lila in the crime that even Macy begins to have his doubts about Lila''s innocence', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVe5Uf85ZToJxR5KLaMqH4Dsjpa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69492'),
  ('261743754318774422', 'Borderline', 2008, 'Drama', 'Lyne Charlebois', 'Lyne Charlebois, Marie-Sissi Labrèche', 'Isabelle Blais, Angèle Coutu, Sylvie Drapeau, Pierre-Luc Brillant, Marie-Chantal Perron, Antoine Bertrand, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Hubert Proulx', null, 'Borderline, a film version of the novels Borderline and La Brèche, tells the story of Kiki at various stages of her life. With her mother institutionalized, she is raised by her grandmother, where left to her own devices, she takes refuge in school. Her life before 30 is a far cry from fairy-tale. Sex and alcohol are her only outlets and her daily reality. She goes through men one after another.', 'Borderline, a film version of the novels Borderline and La Brèche, tells the story of Kiki at various stages of her life. With her mother institutionalized, she is raised by her grandmother, where left to her own devices, she takes refuge in school. Her life before 30 is a far cry from fairy-tale. Sex and alcohol are her only outlets and her daily reality. She goes through men one after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhM2WRNxa9qr1JJzDiijUdXKiEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23962'),
  ('643450537428425536', 'Borderline', 2011, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Alexandre Coffre, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Alexandre Coffre', 'François Damiens, Pascale Arbillot, Laurent Lafitte, Gilles Cohen, Didier Flamand, Nicolas Marié, Stéphane Lagoutte, Fabien Ara', null, 'An attorney stumbles upon a suitcase filled with cocaine.', 'An attorney stumbles upon a suitcase filled with cocaine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a214ZtIB6p9kobuQ2T2Wt6Bz5zU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57417'),
  ('816339701817129024', 'Borderline', 2014, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Olivier Marchal', 'Laurent Guillaume, Christophe Gavat, Olivier Marchal', 'Bruno Wolkowitch, Patrick Catalifo, Catherine Marchal, Laure Marsac, Jacques Perrin, Tarik Lamli, Vincent Jouan, Pascal Elso', null, 'A police superintendent, after 25 years of a flawless professional career, is arrested by internal affairs for 4 days, before being indicted for criminal conspiracy, drug trafficking, theft and embezzlement by the magistrate in charge.', 'A police superintendent, after 25 years of a flawless professional career, is arrested by internal affairs for 4 days, before being indicted for criminal conspiracy, drug trafficking, theft and embezzlement by the magistrate in charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSHQLZ14HMT5o2Q1N8aOOZOhnw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363072'),
  ('526673824360923382', 'Borderline', 2025, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Jimmy Warden, Michael Alden Lloyd, Jeremy Doiron', 'Jimmy Warden', 'Samara Weaving, Ray Nicholson, Jimmie Fails, Eric Dane, Alba Baptista, Catherine Lough Haggquist, Patrick Cox, Terence Kelly', 'R', 'After escaping from a mental hospital, a violent sociopath named Paul begins a dangerous rampage targeting Sofia, a world-famous pop star. Obsessed with her, he takes Sofia hostage in her own home, acting under the delusional belief that they are getting married. Paul is desperate to prove his devotion, leading to a tense and unpredictable situation.', 'After escaping from a mental hospital, a violent sociopath named Paul begins a dangerous rampage targeting Sofia, a world-famous pop star. Obsessed with her, he takes Sofia hostage in her own home, acting under the delusional belief that they are getting married. Paul is desperate to prove his devotion, leading to a tense and unpredictable situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUrNKVrkMN7sdt0oAioopMcxyoq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013482'),
  ('643413210535550511', 'Borders of Love', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tomasz Wiński, Kryštof Melka', 'Kateřina Jandáčková, Petra Hůlová, Hana Vagnerová', 'Hana Vagnerová, Matyáš Řezníček, Eliška Křenková, Martin Hofmann, Antonie Formanová, Hynek Čermák', null, 'After years together, Petr and Hana, partners in work and in life, share their unspoken erotic fantasies. What begins as an innocent conversation gradually turns into curious experimentation with a non-monogamous approach to their relationship. But sexual freedom tastes differently for each of them.', 'After years together, Petr and Hana, partners in work and in life, share their unspoken erotic fantasies. What begins as an innocent conversation gradually turns into curious experimentation with a non-monogamous approach to their relationship. But sexual freedom tastes differently for each of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdwRsbVA3lVDZEHrwHstNdlKoIq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993234'),
  ('14078436034295907', 'Bordertown', 1935, 'Crime, Drama', 'Archie Mayo, Tony Gaudio, Maxwell Arnow', 'Laird Doyle, Wallace Smith', 'Paul Muni, Bette Davis, Margaret Lindsay, Eugene Pallette, Robert Barrat, Soledad Jiménez, Hobart Cavanaugh, Gavin Gordon', 'NR', 'An ambitious Mexican-American gets mixed up with the neurotic wife of his casino boss.', 'An ambitious Mexican-American gets mixed up with the neurotic wife of his casino boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqQiWQwIdD7JydpNglrBlIO4YAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26323'),
  ('186462302269571149', 'Bordertown', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gregory Nava, Reynaldo Villalobos, Brian J. Reynolds', 'Gregory Nava', 'Jennifer Lopez, Martin Sheen, Antonio Banderas, Maya Zapata, Sonia Braga, Kate del Castillo, Randall Batinkoff, Juan Diego Botto', 'R', 'American corporations are using the North American Free Trade Agreement by opening large maquiladoras right across the United States–Mexico border. The maquiladoras hire mostly Mexican women to work long hours for little money in order to produce mass quantity products. Lauren Adrian, an impassioned American news reporter for the Chicago Sentinel wants to be assigned to the Iraq front-lines to cover the war. Instead, her editor George Morgan assigns her to investigate a series of slayings involving young maquiladora factory women in a Mexican bordertown.', 'American corporations are using the North American Free Trade Agreement by opening large maquiladoras right across the United States–Mexico border. The maquiladoras hire mostly Mexican women to work long hours for little money in order to produce mass quantity products. Lauren Adrian, an impassioned American news reporter for the Chicago Sentinel wants to be assigned to the Iraq front-lines to cover the war. Instead, her editor George Morgan assigns her to investigate a series of slayings involving young maquiladora factory women in a Mexican bordertown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0AR36VzvB5ileCoMfSlV9bFsVn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4351'),
  ('176627343620403912', 'Bordertown: The Mural Murders', 2021, 'Crime', 'Mika Orasmaa, Olli Hietanen, Paula Haukinen', 'Miikko Oikkonen, Antti Pesonen', 'Ville Virtanen, Anu Sinisalo, Sampo Sarkola, Johan Storgård, Olivia Ainali, Lenita Susi, Kristiina Halttu, Satu Paavola', null, 'A mural painted with blood is found on the wall of Pasila train station, which depicts Finland''s best-known serial killer Lasse Maasalo. The text in the mural, “Making the world a better place”, is linked to a voting circulating in social media, where people can vote for persons that world would be a better place without. Soon the first body is found and Sorjonen must find the person who has named himself as The Judge.', 'A mural painted with blood is found on the wall of Pasila train station, which depicts Finland''s best-known serial killer Lasse Maasalo. The text in the mural, “Making the world a better place”, is linked to a voting circulating in social media, where people can vote for persons that world would be a better place without. Soon the first body is found and Sorjonen must find the person who has named himself as The Judge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g24OiKp3k9b3VzrhCNcaQzHhZ60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716810'),
  ('825657051830062708', 'Bored of Education', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Gordon Douglas, Art Lloyd', 'Jack Jevne', 'Darla Hood, Carl Switzer, Eugene ''Porky'' Lee, George McFarland, Billie Thomas, Rosina Lawrence, Jack Egan', null, 'Spanky and Alfalfa fake a toothache to get out of school. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with UCLA Film & Television Archive in 2013.', 'Spanky and Alfalfa fake a toothache to get out of school. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with UCLA Film & Television Archive in 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrNRS2Fzxd5n91TNKkmARsWgX9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202265'),
  ('392287773630077173', 'Borg vs McEnroe', 2017, 'Drama, History', 'Janus Metz, Niels Thastum', 'Ronnie Sandahl', 'Sverrir Gudnason, Shia LaBeouf, Stellan Skarsgård, Tuva Novotny, Leo Borg, Marcus Mossberg, Jackson Gann, Scott Arthur', 'R', 'The Swedish Björn Borg and the American John McEnroe, the best tennis players in the world, maintain a legendary duel during the 1980 Wimbledon tournament.', 'The Swedish Björn Borg and the American John McEnroe, the best tennis players in the world, maintain a legendary duel during the 1980 Wimbledon tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jdg8VxleYb1DhPiEfHM7DzfvGw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397538'),
  ('439085522019427077', 'Borga', 2021, 'Drama', 'Tobias von dem Borne, York-Fabian Raabe', 'Toks Körner, Toks Körner, York-Fabian Raabe', 'Eugene Boateng, Christiane Paul, Emmanuel Affadzi, Jude Arnold Kurankyi, Lydia Forson, Adjetey Anang, Thelma Buabeng, Prince Kuhlmann', null, '"Borga" is Better. A Borga is a Ghanaian abroad living an excessive wealthy lifestyle. At least that''s what they want everyone to believe.', '"Borga" is Better. A Borga is a Ghanaian abroad living an excessive wealthy lifestyle. At least that''s what they want everyone to believe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLU7sAvIs3ReuPxe6YTkv8aGA7q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777930'),
  ('763137202798481289', 'Borgman', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Alex van Warmerdam, Tom Erisman, Annet Malherbe', 'Alex van Warmerdam', 'Jan Bijvoet, Hadewych Minis, Jeroen Perceval, Alex van Warmerdam, Tom Dewispelaere, Sara Hjort Ditlevsen, Dirkje van der Pijl, Annet Malherbe', null, 'An enigmatic vagrant cons himself into the home life of an arrogant upper-class family, turning their lives into a psychological nightmare in the process.', 'An enigmatic vagrant cons himself into the home life of an arrogant upper-class family, turning their lives into a psychological nightmare in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kasPhXDk4BI4FUS3ku5Y4GrgBJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186929'),
  ('888078787960829548', 'Borgo', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Stéphane Demoustier, Ombeline Lévêque, David Chambille', 'Stéphane Demoustier, Pascal-Pierre Garbarini', 'Hafsia Herzi, Moussa Mansaly, Florence Loiret Caille, Pablo Pauly, Cédric Appietto, Michel Fau, Louis Memmi, Fanny Guidecoq', null, 'Melissa is an experienced, exemplary prison guard. But a dangerous spiral is set into motion when she transfers to a Corsican jail, where she accepts help and protection from inmate Saveriu to get her bearings. Upon his release, he contacts Melissa expecting to collect.', 'Melissa is an experienced, exemplary prison guard. But a dangerous spiral is set into motion when she transfers to a Corsican jail, where she accepts help and protection from inmate Saveriu to get her bearings. Upon his release, he contacts Melissa expecting to collect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48xwJpo5tecapOAEq0Gio1LQ3Q1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989474'),
  ('851718783362064898', 'Borinage', 1934, 'Documentary', 'Joris Ivens, Henri Storck, Joris Ivens', 'Joris Ivens, Henri Storck', null, null, 'Henri Storck and Joris Ivens’ landmark of social documentary, blending staged scenes with locals and on-the-spot reportage to depict the 1932 miners’ strike in Belgium’s Borinage—evictions, hunger, and police repression—transforming outrage into a call for solidarity.', 'Henri Storck and Joris Ivens’ landmark of social documentary, blending staged scenes with locals and on-the-spot reportage to depict the 1932 miners’ strike in Belgium’s Borinage—evictions, hunger, and police repression—transforming outrage into a call for solidarity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vs94gZ7p5nTqYKIKndsSgI82OwM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163048'),
  ('868976708349427492', 'Boris and Natasha', 1992, 'Adventure, Comedy, Action', 'Daryn Okada, Charles Martin Smith', 'Anson Downes, Linda Favila, Charles Fradin', 'Sally Kellerman, Dave Thomas, Andrea Martin, John Calvin, Paxton Whitehead, Larry Cedar, Christopher Neame, Alex Rocco', 'PG', 'Sent by Fearless Leader to America to find an important microchip, dastardly Pottsylvanian spies Boris Badenov and Natasha Fatale begin questioning who they''re working for and why.', 'Sent by Fearless Leader to America to find an important microchip, dastardly Pottsylvanian spies Boris Badenov and Natasha Fatale begin questioning who they''re working for and why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ecna45xiPMsYRE3ips2t5r055e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101897'),
  ('194799383934621380', 'Boris Godounov', 1989, 'Music, Drama, History', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Andrzej J. Jaroszewicz, Slobodan Ivetić', 'Andrzej Żuławski', 'Ruggero Raimondi, Kenneth Riegel, Pavel Slabý, Wyatscheslaw Polozov, Bernard Lefort, Paul Plishka, Delphine Forest, Galina Vishnevskaya', null, 'A possible impostor torments a newly crowned medieval czar who may have ordered the real successor''s death.', 'A possible impostor torments a newly crowned medieval czar who may have ordered the real successor''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRbjE0ujzyi7p56oR2OV1ReoTqy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99686'),
  ('807964375668795723', 'Boris Godunov', 1986, 'History, Drama', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Vadim Yusov, Igor Petrov', 'Sergey Bondarchuk', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Alyona Bondarchuk, Georgi Burkov, Irina Skobtseva, Valeriy Storozhik, Boris Khimichev, Yuriy Sherstnyov, Vladimir Ferapontov', null, 'Praised for its fine photography and production design if not its narrative, Sergei Bondarchuk directed this adaptation of the tale by Alexander Pushkin. Boris Godunov came to the Czarist throne at the end of the 16th century, after the original heir to Ivan the Terrible had died. At first, things went well for Godunov (played by Bondarchuk), but when the Russian people began to believe he had killed Ivan the Terrible''s son in order to gain the throne, an alliance sprang up against the new Czar. Events continued to spin out of control as a young monk was presented as the son Godunov had supposedly killed. Now he was openly accused of failing an assassination attempt, which seems to be even worse than succeeding. In addition to these woes, Boris Godunov began to suffer serious health problems. So much for the joys of kingship.', 'Praised for its fine photography and production design if not its narrative, Sergei Bondarchuk directed this adaptation of the tale by Alexander Pushkin. Boris Godunov came to the Czarist throne at the end of the 16th century, after the original heir to Ivan the Terrible had died. At first, things went well for Godunov (played by Bondarchuk), but when the Russian people began to believe he had killed Ivan the Terrible''s son in order to gain the throne, an alliance sprang up against the new Czar. Events continued to spin out of control as a young monk was presented as the son Godunov had supposedly killed. Now he was openly accused of failing an assassination attempt, which seems to be even worse than succeeding. In addition to these woes, Boris Godunov began to suffer serious health problems. So much for the joys of kingship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sz0uY9fcFIbBQzBra3rbB8YlOi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198460'),
  ('20033886418036721', 'Boris Without Beatrice', 2016, 'Drama', 'Jessica Lee Gagné, Denis Côté', 'Denis Côté', 'James Hyndman, Simone-Elise Girard, Denis Lavant, Isolda Dychauk-Ott, Dounia Sichov, Laetitia Isambert, Louise Laprade, Anie Pascale', null, 'Living somewhere in present-day Quebec, Boris Malinowski has achieved all his goals. A freethinker, open-minded and proud, he also displays a certain arrogance when it comes to his successes. For some time now, his wife Béatrice, a Canadian government minister, has been bedridden, suffering from a mysterious depression. To escape from his wife’s agony, Boris begins a relationship with a colleague, Helga, and gets close to Klara, a young woman who works as a maid in Boris’s home. The sudden appearance of a stranger in his life forces Boris to come face-to-face with the world, with everything he takes for granted, with all his certainties.', 'Living somewhere in present-day Quebec, Boris Malinowski has achieved all his goals. A freethinker, open-minded and proud, he also displays a certain arrogance when it comes to his successes. For some time now, his wife Béatrice, a Canadian government minister, has been bedridden, suffering from a mysterious depression. To escape from his wife’s agony, Boris begins a relationship with a colleague, Helga, and gets close to Klara, a young woman who works as a maid in Boris’s home. The sudden appearance of a stranger in his life forces Boris to come face-to-face with the world, with everything he takes for granted, with all his certainties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5tJdoRM7xBxWQPS14RiV5V5EZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372985'),
  ('80470605716433762', 'Boris: The Film', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Giacomo Ciarrapico, Mattia Torre, Luca Vendruscolo', 'Mattia Torre, Luca Vendruscolo, Giacomo Ciarrapico', 'Francesco Pannofino, Caterina Guzzanti, Alessandro Tiberi, Alberto Di Stasio, Antonio Catania, Antonino Bruschetta, Pietro Sermonti, Carolina Crescentini', null, 'A director and his crew attempt to make the transition from the small to the big screen.', 'A director and his crew attempt to make the transition from the small to the big screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bro0yk5rDSU3mCIk5pnEzPDWV50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58522'),
  ('1050173814192925145', 'Born', 2007, 'Horror', 'Richard Friedman, Stuart Asbjornsen', 'Alex D''Lerma', 'Joan Severance, Alison Brie, Kane Hodder, Denise Crosby, James T. Callahan, Eddie Velez, Alex D''Lerma, Vince Lozano', null, 'Mary Elizabeth goes to bed alone one night, still a twenty one year old virgin, and wakes up the next morning pregnant. Possessed by the demon fetus growing within her womb, Mary Elizabeth obeys her homicidal cravings to kill, for the sake of her unborn spawn. Mary Elizabeth''s dark transformation is controlled by her unborn demon child''s deadly evil cravings.', 'Mary Elizabeth goes to bed alone one night, still a twenty one year old virgin, and wakes up the next morning pregnant. Possessed by the demon fetus growing within her womb, Mary Elizabeth obeys her homicidal cravings to kill, for the sake of her unborn spawn. Mary Elizabeth''s dark transformation is controlled by her unborn demon child''s deadly evil cravings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3b4OBwbtYiSOjMbWrVJVogj9xq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21860'),
  ('498380210668238487', 'Born a Champion', 2021, 'Action, Drama', 'Reuben Steinberg, Alex Ranarivelo', 'Alex Ranarivelo, Sean Patrick Flanery', 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Dennis Quaid, Katrina Bowden, Maurice Compte, Costas Mandylor, Currie Graham, Reno Wilson, Ali Afshar', 'R', 'After a blood- soaked jujitsu match in Dubai, fighting legend Mickey Kelley falls to superstar Blaine. But years later, an online video proves that Blaine cheated, and the world demands a rematch. Can the aging underdog get back into shape in time to vanquish his foe, get revenge, and claim his prize?', 'After a blood- soaked jujitsu match in Dubai, fighting legend Mickey Kelley falls to superstar Blaine. But years later, an online video proves that Blaine cheated, and the world demands a rematch. Can the aging underdog get back into shape in time to vanquish his foe, get revenge, and claim his prize?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijizwYu2B04gVkrbGlclAAfdN3p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766931'),
  ('1044425143908085965', 'Born American', 1986, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Renny Harlin, Paul Martin Hardesty, Harry Päiväläinen', 'Renny Harlin, Markus Selin', 'Mike Norris, Steve Durham, David Coburn, Thalmus Rasulala, Albert Salmi, Piita Vuosalmi, Vesa Vierikko, Ismo Kallio', 'R', 'A trio of American students vacationing in Finland cross the border into the USSR and are soon imprisoned following a skirmish with Soviet soldiers.', 'A trio of American students vacationing in Finland cross the border into the USSR and are soon imprisoned following a skirmish with Soviet soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBUetiqyYC4u7Ua7ceE8OUn8wwi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103960'),
  ('396299786653600448', 'Born and Bred', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pablo Trapero, Guillermo Nieto, Oscar Godoy', 'Pablo Trapero, Mario Rulloni', 'Fernanda de Almeida, Federico Esquerro, Martina Gusmán, Tomás Lipán, Guillermo Pfening, Nilda Raggi, Victoria Vescio, Roberto Artiagoitía', null, 'In Patagonia, a successful interior designer''s life falls apart after he suffers a horrific accident.', 'In Patagonia, a successful interior designer''s life falls apart after he suffers a horrific accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gduwQAx3KC05o3oSaYKouBWuU0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67073'),
  ('921958490800710543', 'Born for Hell', 1976, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Denis Héroux, Heinz Hölscher', 'Fred Denger, Clement Woods, Denis Héroux', 'Mathieu Carrière, Debra Berger, Christine Boisson, Myriam Boyer, Leonora Fani, Ely Galleani, Carole Laure, Eva Mattes', null, 'Loosely based on the notorious Richard Speck murders, this is the grim tale of a disturbed Vietnam vet returning home via Belfast, who invades a house shared by eight nurses and proceeds to terrorize and murder them.', 'Loosely based on the notorious Richard Speck murders, this is the grim tale of a disturbed Vietnam vet returning home via Belfast, who invades a house shared by eight nurses and proceeds to terrorize and murder them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ok7WHby5ATCRjil9amoiblWZMNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40338'),
  ('91668676459160259', 'Born for You', 2023, 'Drama', 'Fabio Mollo, Claudio Cofrancesco', 'Furio Andreotti, Fabio Mollo, Giulia Calenda', 'Pierluigi Gigante, Teresa Saponangelo, Barbora Bobuľová, Alessandro Piavani, Antonia Truppo, Iaia Forte, Giuseppe Pirozzi, Sypario', null, 'Alba has Down''s Syndrome and was left in the hospital when she was born. Thirty families rejected her before the court decided to entrust her to Luca: a Catholic — and gay — single man.', 'Alba has Down''s Syndrome and was left in the hospital when she was born. Thirty families rejected her before the court decided to entrust her to Luca: a Catholic — and gay — single man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Y5bNAxlOuWr3EfvJl8ris7VURN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030531'),
  ('1072759403668744540', 'Born Free', 1966, 'Adventure, Family, Drama, History', 'James Hill, Gavrik Losey, William P. Cartlidge', 'Lester Cole', 'Virginia McKenna, Bill Travers, Geoffrey Keen, Peter Lukoye, Omar Chambati, Bill Godden, Robert S. Young, Bryan Epsom', null, 'At a national park in Kenya, English game warden George Adamson and his wife, Joy, care for three orphaned lion cubs. After the two larger lions are shipped off to a zoo in the Netherlands, the smallest of the three, Elsa, stays with the couple. When Elsa is blamed for causing an elephant stampede in the nearby village, head warden John Kendall demands the young lion either be trained to survive in the wilds of the Serengeti or be sent to a zoo.', 'At a national park in Kenya, English game warden George Adamson and his wife, Joy, care for three orphaned lion cubs. After the two larger lions are shipped off to a zoo in the Netherlands, the smallest of the three, Elsa, stays with the couple. When Elsa is blamed for causing an elephant stampede in the nearby village, head warden John Kendall demands the young lion either be trained to survive in the wilds of the Serengeti or be sent to a zoo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xI5BkObQm7UtYEFTw7ZmiDGF7gT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15347'),
  ('306012621095856890', 'Born in ''45', 1966, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jürgen Böttcher, Roland Gräf, Siegbert Fischer', 'Klaus Poche, Jürgen Böttcher', 'Rolf Römer, Monika Hildebrandt, Holger Mahlich, Paul Eichbaum, Gesine Rosenberg, Werner Kanitz, Ruth Kommerell, Walter Stolp', null, 'Originally banned in 1966, East German director Jürgen Böttcher''s tale of love and disillusionment among two newlyweds attempting to navigate the treacherous world of marriage was never officially released in his homeland until after reunification in 1990.', 'Originally banned in 1966, East German director Jürgen Böttcher''s tale of love and disillusionment among two newlyweds attempting to navigate the treacherous world of marriage was never officially released in his homeland until after reunification in 1990.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEzrr9M0W361yx7poqok4kjmDVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194443'),
  ('227508232071286339', 'Born in 68', 2008, 'Drama', 'Olivier Ducastel, Jacques Martineau', 'Guillaume Le Touze, Olivier Ducastel, Jacques Martineau', 'Laetitia Casta, Yannick Renier, Yann Trégouët, Sabrina Seyvecou, Christine Citti, Kate Moran, Marc Citti, Théo Frilet', null, '1968. Catherine, Yves and Hervé are twenty years old. They''re students in Paris and they love each other. The May student uprisings radically change their lives. Overtaken by communal utopia, they leave the city with a few friends to set up house in an abandoned farm in the Lot region. A desire for freedom and the search for individual fulfillment lead them to make choices that cause them to separate.', '1968. Catherine, Yves and Hervé are twenty years old. They''re students in Paris and they love each other. The May student uprisings radically change their lives. Overtaken by communal utopia, they leave the city with a few friends to set up house in an abandoned farm in the Lot region. A desire for freedom and the search for individual fulfillment lead them to make choices that cause them to separate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mD16CvwukkmKlVi5YDhyp6z9Obs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15339'),
  ('988352237042735889', 'Born in China', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Lu Chuan', 'David H. Fowler, Brian Leith, Phil Chapman', 'John Krasinski, Zhou Xun', 'G', 'Venturing into the wilds of China, "Born in China" captures intimate moments with a panda bear and her growing cub, a young golden monkey who feels displaced by his baby sister, and a mother snow leopard struggling to raise her two cubs.', 'Venturing into the wilds of China, "Born in China" captures intimate moments with a panda bear and her growing cub, a young golden monkey who feels displaced by his baby sister, and a mother snow leopard struggling to raise her two cubs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8xdrR1ZtCXMmaxyxYwaGSndvV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355277'),
  ('392357439287431719', 'Born in East L.A.', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Álex Phillips Jr., Cheech Marin, David N. Schrager', 'Cheech Marin', 'Cheech Marin, Daniel Stern, Paul Rodríguez, Jan-Michael Vincent, Kamala Lopez, Alma Martinez, Tony Plana, Eddie Barth', 'R', 'Rudy, an American of Hispanic descent, whose south-of-the-border looks show him no mercy during an immigration raid in a migrant worker factory. As his luck goes, he is caught with neither money nor his ID and is deported to Mexico - without speaking a word of Spanish!', 'Rudy, an American of Hispanic descent, whose south-of-the-border looks show him no mercy during an immigration raid in a migrant worker factory. As his luck goes, he is caught with neither money nor his ID and is deported to Mexico - without speaking a word of Spanish!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKoP0NNcumI9MQ6K8ughP5Kqt8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19324'),
  ('787806376957659176', 'Born in Flames', 1983, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Lizzie Borden, Ed Bowes, Al Santana', 'Lizzie Borden', 'Honey, Adele Bertei, Jean Satterfield, Florynce Kennedy, Pat Murphy, Kathryn Bigelow, Becky Johnston, Hillary Hurst', 'NR', 'In near-future New York, ten years after the “social-democratic war of liberation,” diverse groups of women organize a feminist uprising as equality remains unfulfilled.', 'In near-future New York, ten years after the “social-democratic war of liberation,” diverse groups of women organize a feminist uprising as equality remains unfulfilled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uV8R8B8m5rp1NFvuodWk4ZuCXY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36832'),
