  ('427965232159248770', 'Born Innocent', 1976, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Donald Wrye, David M. Walsh', 'Gerald Di Pego', 'Linda Blair, Joanna Miles, Allyn Ann McLerie, Mary Murphy, Janit Baldwin, Richard Jaeckel, Kim Hunter, Nora Heflin', null, 'A constant runaway is given over to the care of the state and finds herself in a remand centre for girls. She is soon caught between the uncaring bureaucracy, the sometimes brutal treatment from her peers and her own abusive family, and only one care worker sees her potential to rise above her tragic circumstances.', 'A constant runaway is given over to the care of the state and finds herself in a remand centre for girls. She is soon caught between the uncaring bureaucracy, the sometimes brutal treatment from her peers and her own abusive family, and only one care worker sees her potential to rise above her tragic circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqQlrmCB3UEVSxs9GocOn0r7QG8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30671'),
  ('1147088320691131426', 'Born into Brothels: Calcutta''s Red Light Kids', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Zana Briski, Ross Kauffman', 'Zana Briski, Ross Kauffman', 'Zana Briski, Avijit, Geeta Masi, Kochi, Mamuni', 'R', 'Documentary depicting the lives of child prostitutes in the red light district of Songachi, Calcutta. Director Zana Briski went to photograph the prostitutes when she met and became friends with their children. Briski began giving photography lessons to the children and became aware that their photography might be a way for them to lead better lives.', 'Documentary depicting the lives of child prostitutes in the red light district of Songachi, Calcutta. Director Zana Briski went to photograph the prostitutes when she met and became friends with their children. Briski began giving photography lessons to the children and became aware that their photography might be a way for them to lead better lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7OWmWptBRCnUKj6MJ2qbxj5ZY5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1392'),
  ('729455241381506027', 'Born Invincible', 1978, 'Action', 'Joseph Kuo, Che Dang-Biu, Kuo Hsiao Wu', 'Yao Ching Kang', 'Carter Huang Chia-Ta, Lo Lieh, Mark Lung, Jack Long Shi-Chia, Nancy Yen Nan-See, Corey Yuen, Yuen Shun-Yi, Lung Fei', null, 'A very arrogant white haired Tai Chi martial artist and two of his cronies wreaks havoc in a small village, terrorizing people and their families. Three local heroes team up to defeat the villainous three, but they have to find a secret weak point, which the Tai Chi master can choose and change at will.', 'A very arrogant white haired Tai Chi martial artist and two of his cronies wreaks havoc in a small village, terrorizing people and their families. Three local heroes team up to defeat the villainous three, but they have to find a secret weak point, which the Tai Chi master can choose and change at will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZNbFB3O4pCXYltHgk6MRFdOjMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64257'),
  ('673767946026328851', 'Born of Fire', 1987, 'Fantasy, Horror, Drama', 'Jamil Dehlavi, Bruce McGowan, Alison Barnett', 'Jamil Dehlavi', 'Peter Firth, Suzan Crowley, Stefan Kalipha, Nabil Shaban, Orla Pederson, Jean Ainslie, Peter Penry-Jones, Morris Perry', 'R', 'For reasons unknown, a flautist and an astronomer find themselves drawn to one another. But, when the flautist stumbles upon a secret regarding his late father, the two wind up in a celestial duel against the ancient Master Flautist for earth''s future.', 'For reasons unknown, a flautist and an astronomer find themselves drawn to one another. But, when the flautist stumbles upon a secret regarding his late father, the two wind up in a celestial duel against the ancient Master Flautist for earth''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3Rs1fT2bpGTs1cRVtA1AlG9rNi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25920'),
  ('48969600398809332', 'Born on the Fourth of July', 1989, 'Drama, War', 'Oliver Stone, Robert Richardson, Stephen Lim', 'Oliver Stone, Ron Kovic', 'Tom Cruise, Raymond J. Barry, Caroline Kava, Kyra Sedgwick, Willem Dafoe, Jerry Levine, Stephen Baldwin, Josh Evans', 'R', 'Paralyzed in the Vietnam war, Ron Kovic becomes an anti-war and pro-human rights political activist after feeling betrayed by the country he fought for.', 'Paralyzed in the Vietnam war, Ron Kovic becomes an anti-war and pro-human rights political activist after feeling betrayed by the country he fought for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5gSie6ZA90iBs62yNM5MV4y9R7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2604'),
  ('341062188706584165', 'Born Reckless', 1930, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama, War, Romance', 'John Ford, Edward O''Fearna, George Schneiderman', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Edmund Lowe, Catherine Dale Owen, Frank Albertson, Marguerite Churchill, William Harrigan, Lee Tracy, Warren Hymer, Ilka Chase', 'NR', 'In order to use the publicity to get re-elected, a judge sentences a notorious gangster to fight in the war.', 'In order to use the publicity to get re-elected, a judge sentences a notorious gangster to fight in the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2E0R1b3cCyq83JehkqmL7RNMep5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94009'),
  ('640167034221434589', 'Born Reckless', 1958, 'Western, Drama, Romance', 'Howard W. Koch, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Richard H. Landau', 'Mamie Van Doren, Jeff Richards, Arthur Hunnicutt, Carol Ohmart, Tom Duggan, Nacho Galindo, Don ''Red'' Barry, Jeanne Carmen', 'NR', 'Rider Kelly Cobb travels to county rodeos to win money so he can buy a patch of land he wants to call his own. One night he rescues trick rider Jackie Adams from the clutches of an amorous rodeo promoter and they form a team and hit the circuit along with sidekick Cool Man.', 'Rider Kelly Cobb travels to county rodeos to win money so he can buy a patch of land he wants to call his own. One night he rescues trick rider Jackie Adams from the clutches of an amorous rodeo promoter and they form a team and hit the circuit along with sidekick Cool Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvqJrRPOQiGVycsNv1NHe9RLdYj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167101'),
  ('33915220223623848', 'Born Rich', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Jamie Johnson', null, 'Ivanka Trump, Georgina Bloomberg, Christina Floyd, Juliet Hartford, Si Newhouse IV, Luke Weil, Cody Franchetti, Josiah Hornblower', 'NR', 'A documentary on children of the insanely rich. Directed by one of their own, Johnson &amp; Johnson heir, Jamie Johnson.', 'A documentary on children of the insanely rich. Directed by one of their own, Johnson &amp; Johnson heir, Jamie Johnson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6M8O4tNFy93wvTE9U5QKZNrolww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55047'),
  ('502363412337773907', 'Born Romantic', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Kane, Robert Alazraki, Lynne Huitson', 'David Kane', 'Craig Ferguson, Jane Horrocks, Adrian Lester, Catherine McCormack, Jimi Mistry, David Morrissey, Olivia Williams, Kenneth Cranham', 'R', 'In modern-day London, three men (Craig Ferguson, Jimi Mistry and David Morrissey) and three women (Olivia Williams, Jane Horrocks and Catherine McCormack) fall in and out of love and back again, to the Greek-chorus accompaniment of two cab drivers, who engage in an ongoing conversation about sex. A winning romantic comedy, Born Romantic is the second feature by British writer-director David Kane of This Year''s Love fame.', 'In modern-day London, three men (Craig Ferguson, Jimi Mistry and David Morrissey) and three women (Olivia Williams, Jane Horrocks and Catherine McCormack) fall in and out of love and back again, to the Greek-chorus accompaniment of two cab drivers, who engage in an ongoing conversation about sex. A winning romantic comedy, Born Romantic is the second feature by British writer-director David Kane of This Year''s Love fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okQsBtYgfKfbjtHZMdiEGWF40TY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35066'),
  ('972354058911205850', 'Born to Be a Criminal', 2006, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Wael Ehsan, Sameh Hussein, Hesham Fathy', 'Belal Fadl', 'Mohamed Henedi, Lebleba, Bushra, Said Tarabeek, Khaled Zaki, Ahmed Salah ElSaadany, Amr Mcgyver, Zizi Mostafa', null, 'Our man has about everything against him : he is short, weak, so simple, with an IQ far below the average. There is no wonder why he keeps on being teased by his friends, parents and even fiancee. But circumstances will turn him into a hero and then a vicious criminal feared by all. Half-educated and out-of-work, Taha, is kidnapped by a gang of thieves in his hometown Alexandria. Unbeknownst to them, neither Taha''s mother nor his girlfriend has a fraction of the ransom', 'Our man has about everything against him : he is short, weak, so simple, with an IQ far below the average. There is no wonder why he keeps on being teased by his friends, parents and even fiancee. But circumstances will turn him into a hero and then a vicious criminal feared by all. Half-educated and out-of-work, Taha, is kidnapped by a gang of thieves in his hometown Alexandria. Unbeknownst to them, neither Taha''s mother nor his girlfriend has a fraction of the ransom', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pCFfIrprmpVrgCuFWgcyhaoVez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366230'),
  ('592243586524013722', 'Born to Be Bad', 1934, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lowell Sherman, William J. Scully, Barney McGill', 'Ralph Graves', 'Loretta Young, Cary Grant, Jackie Kelk, Marion Burns, Henry Travers, Paul Harvey, Russell Hopton, Harry Green', 'NR', 'Letty, a young woman who ended up pregnant, unmarried and on the streets at fifteen is bitter and determined that her child will not grow up to be taken advantage of. Letty teaches her child to lie, steal, cheat and anything else he''ll need to be street smart.', 'Letty, a young woman who ended up pregnant, unmarried and on the streets at fifteen is bitter and determined that her child will not grow up to be taken advantage of. Letty teaches her child to lie, steal, cheat and anything else he''ll need to be street smart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WGsz8Zy0GPIUI6yWP7AltPLLZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81111'),
  ('714927920200031630', 'Born to Be Bad', 1950, 'Drama', 'Nicholas Ray, Nicholas Musuraca, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Edith R. Sommer', 'Joan Fontaine, Robert Ryan, Zachary Scott, Joan Leslie, Mel Ferrer, Harold Vermilyea, Virginia Farmer, Kathleen Howard', null, 'Christabel Caine has the face of angel and the heart of a swamp rat. She''ll step on anyone to get what she wants, including her own family. A master of manipulation, she covertly breaks off the engagement of her trusting cousin, Donna, to her fabulously wealthy beau, Curtis Carey. Once married to Curtis herself, Christabel continues her affair with novelist Nick Bradley, who knows she''s evil, but loves her anyway.', 'Christabel Caine has the face of angel and the heart of a swamp rat. She''ll step on anyone to get what she wants, including her own family. A master of manipulation, she covertly breaks off the engagement of her trusting cousin, Donna, to her fabulously wealthy beau, Curtis Carey. Once married to Curtis herself, Christabel continues her affair with novelist Nick Bradley, who knows she''s evil, but loves her anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGpviqO04uPH3WUo1MjbWtOsdaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43385'),
  ('372011151387478273', 'Born to Be Blue', 2015, 'Drama, Music', 'Robert Budreau, Steve Cosens', 'Robert Budreau', 'Ethan Hawke, Carmen Ejogo, Callum Keith Rennie, Stephen McHattie, Janet-Laine Green, Tony Nappo, Janine Theriault, Tony Nardi', null, 'Jazz legend Chet Baker finds love and redemption when he stars in a movie about his own troubled life to mount a comeback.', 'Jazz legend Chet Baker finds love and redemption when he stars in a movie about his own troubled life to mount a comeback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEdh2CkSyDXBTAPlNS6uLF9yTTH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327528'),
  ('278398395155724786', 'Born to Be King', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Jacky Tang Hon-Pong', 'Chau Ting, Manfred Wong Man-Chun', 'Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Shu Qi, Gigi Lai Chi, Sonny Chiba, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Anya, Chin Ka-Lok', null, 'Triad member Chicken is designated by Taiwan''s San Luen Gang to marry Nanako, the daughter of the fifth generation leader of the Yamada Gang in Japan. Later, the leader of the triad group gets murdered. Actually, all the San Luen Gang members suspect Chicken attacked their leader Liu, in order to make a chance for him to rule the Gang and thus have adopted an extremely hostile attitude towards him.', 'Triad member Chicken is designated by Taiwan''s San Luen Gang to marry Nanako, the daughter of the fifth generation leader of the Yamada Gang in Japan. Later, the leader of the triad group gets murdered. Actually, all the San Luen Gang members suspect Chicken attacked their leader Liu, in order to make a chance for him to rule the Gang and thus have adopted an extremely hostile attitude towards him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9g2e0hMlh2TpFCiB1SqoBRUcbfa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48944'),
  ('743654122723512983', 'Born to Be Wild', 1995, 'Drama, Family', 'John Gray, Donald M. Morgan', 'John Bunzel, Paul Young', 'Wil Horneff, Helen Shaver, John C. McGinley, Jean Marie Barnwell, Peter Boyle, Leif Tilden, Gregory Itzin, Titus Welliver', 'PG', 'Rick Heller is a juvenile delinquent who keeps getting himself into trouble. To keep him out of trouble his mother puts him to work cleaning the cage of a gorilla named Katie which she is teaching to communicate through the use of sign language. When the owner of the gorilla takes her back to become a flea market freak Rick takes it upon himself to break Katie out and take her on an adventurous journey to get her out of the country.', 'Rick Heller is a juvenile delinquent who keeps getting himself into trouble. To keep him out of trouble his mother puts him to work cleaning the cage of a gorilla named Katie which she is teaching to communicate through the use of sign language. When the owner of the gorilla takes her back to become a flea market freak Rick takes it upon himself to break Katie out and take her on an adventurous journey to get her out of the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k886xdc3tQLq5X4p5sWPMOot96C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68927'),
  ('132974780014692243', 'Born to Be Wild', 2011, 'Documentary, Adventure', 'David Lickley, David Douglas', null, 'Morgan Freeman, Birute Galdikas, Daphne Sheldrick', 'G', 'Born to Be Wild observes various orphaned jungle animals and their day-to-day behavioural interactions with the individuals who rescue them and raise them to adulthood. The film unfurls in two separate geographic spheres. Half of it takes place in the rain forests of Borneo, where celebrated primatologist Dr. Birute Galdikas assists baby orangutans; the other half takes place on the arid savannahs of Kenya, where zoologist Dame Daphne Sheldrick works with baby elephant calves.', 'Born to Be Wild observes various orphaned jungle animals and their day-to-day behavioural interactions with the individuals who rescue them and raise them to adulthood. The film unfurls in two separate geographic spheres. Half of it takes place in the rain forests of Borneo, where celebrated primatologist Dr. Birute Galdikas assists baby orangutans; the other half takes place on the arid savannahs of Kenya, where zoologist Dame Daphne Sheldrick works with baby elephant calves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78qdFtASdnBSOiqSvazDgxGcQHk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50081'),
  ('88650425434318269', 'Born to Dance', 1936, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Roy Del Ruth, Ray June, Alfred Newman', 'Jack McGowan, Sid Silvers', 'Eleanor Powell, James Stewart, Virginia Bruce, Una Merkel, Sid Silvers, Frances Langford, Raymond Walburn, Alan Dinehart', 'NR', 'On leave, a sailor falls in love with a young lady aspiring to become a Broadway dancer, but their relationship is jeopardized by an established Broadway star, who is also enamored by him.', 'On leave, a sailor falls in love with a young lady aspiring to become a Broadway dancer, but their relationship is jeopardized by an established Broadway star, who is also enamored by him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40ANyC8M0OuL7hevKmQFrAAbZaB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43872'),
  ('1048550043278964695', 'Born to Defence', 1988, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jet Li', 'Sze Yeung-Ping, Chit Yi-Gwoh', 'Jet Li, Song Jia, Zhao Erkang, Kurt Roland Petersson, Paulo Tocha, Yuen Fai, Lam Hak-Ming, Cho Wing', null, 'Jet, a young soldier at the end of the second world war must overcome some abusive Americans who are bullying him as well as the Chinese people.', 'Jet, a young soldier at the end of the second world war must overcome some abusive Americans who are bullying him as well as the Chinese people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s93Z58kEDjdBRmCZvRp7feGCkhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15770'),
  ('388711607391269576', 'Born to Fight', 2004, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Panna Rittikrai, Surachet Thongmee, Piyanuch Trakulsajawat', 'Thanapat Taweesuk, Morakat Kaewthanek', 'Noppol Gomarachun, Santisuk Promsiri, Dan Chupong, Piyapong Piew-on, Somrak Khamsing, Amornthep Waewsang, Suebsak Pansueb, Nantaway Wongwanichislip', null, 'When a remote Thai village is overrun by terrorists armed with a nuclear missile, an elite undercover operative leads the most unique fighting force ever assembled in a heroic bid to save their nation.', 'When a remote Thai village is overrun by terrorists armed with a nuclear missile, an elite undercover operative leads the most unique fighting force ever assembled in a heroic bid to save their nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4YPOpK9L9jHzKFN5Aa9uJuhvCn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10254'),
  ('233908625831895601', 'Born to Fly', 2023, 'Action, Drama', 'Liu Xiaoshi, Bai Yuxia', 'Guan Gui, Liu Xiaoshi', 'Wang Yibo, Hu Jun, Zhou Dongyu, Xu Kaicheng, Bu Yu, Zhai Yujia, Tian Zhuangzhuang, Pan Binlong', null, 'A talented trainee pilot is given the opportunity to virtually test the latest fighter jet, which pushes him to his limits.', 'A talented trainee pilot is given the opportunity to virtually test the latest fighter jet, which pushes him to his limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsbRnYqHm2OBLQK8E2bvgFafvpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1012837'),
  ('1033406893639626637', 'Born to Kill', 1947, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Robert De Grasse, Robert Wise', 'Richard Macaulay, Eve Greene', 'Claire Trevor, Lawrence Tierney, Walter Slezak, Phillip Terry, Audrey Long, Elisha Cook Jr., Isabel Jewell, Esther Howard', 'NR', 'A calculating divorcée risks her chances at wealth and security with a man she doesn''t love by getting involved with a hotheaded murderer.', 'A calculating divorcée risks her chances at wealth and security with a man she doesn''t love by getting involved with a hotheaded murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFq23ToiVg8sWiMnD4f3Fj37UHD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33813'),
  ('368489934261232506', 'Born to Race', 2011, 'Action', 'Alex Ranarivelo, Reuben Steinberg', 'Steve Sarno, Alex Ranarivelo', 'Joseph Cross, John Pyper-Ferguson, Brando Eaton, Nicole Badaan, Sherry Stringfield, Sara Swain, Christina Moore, Diogo Morgado', 'PG-13', 'Danny Krueger is a rebellious young street racer on a collision course with trouble. After an accident at an illegal race, he''s sent to a small town to live with his estranged father, a washed up NASCAR racer. When Danny decides to enter the NHRA High School Drags, he''s forced to seek his father''s help in taking down the local hotshot.', 'Danny Krueger is a rebellious young street racer on a collision course with trouble. After an accident at an illegal race, he''s sent to a small town to live with his estranged father, a washed up NASCAR racer. When Danny decides to enter the NHRA High School Drags, he''s forced to seek his father''s help in taking down the local hotshot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aamkezlj7SEpzdxa84GLvvmgTqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74523'),
  ('168084332757588695', 'Born to Race: Fast Track', 2014, 'Action', 'Reuben Steinberg, Alex Ranarivelo', 'Steve Sarno', 'Beau Mirchoff, Brett Davern, Bill Sage, Sharon Lawrence, Nicole Badaan, Tiffany Dupont, Steve Bond, Corbin Bernsen', 'PG', 'Danny Krueger is a twenty-year old drag racer who plays by his own rules. After winning a scholarship to the prestigious Fast Lane Racing Academy, Danny finds himself competing against some of the fiercest young drivers in the world. Tension soars on and off the track, and a terrible incident leaves Danny without a racing partner. Facing dismissal from the academy, Danny is forced to team up with an old rival. The pair must learn to set aside their differences as they vie for rookie spots on a professional racing team.', 'Danny Krueger is a twenty-year old drag racer who plays by his own rules. After winning a scholarship to the prestigious Fast Lane Racing Academy, Danny finds himself competing against some of the fiercest young drivers in the world. Tension soars on and off the track, and a terrible incident leaves Danny without a racing partner. Facing dismissal from the academy, Danny is forced to team up with an old rival. The pair must learn to set aside their differences as they vie for rookie spots on a professional racing team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYYQ9kS6Twvt0UcjxGLmBcq5k11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213927'),
  ('1027695002080395924', 'Born to Raise Hell', 2010, 'Action', 'Lauro David Chartrand-DelValle, Eric J. Goldstein', 'Steven Seagal', 'Steven Seagal, Dan Badarau, Darren Shahlavi, D. Neil Mark, George Remes, Claudiu Bleonţ, Madalina Mariescu, Călin Puia', null, 'A hard core Interpol Agent is assigned to an Eastern European task force to target gun trafficking and dope running throughout the Balkans. While investigating a Russian gun dealer, his team is caught in a bloody street war between a Gypsy gang and the Russians, leaving one task force member dead. Fueled with vengeance, he leads us on an action packed thrill ride while avenging his friend''s death.', 'A hard core Interpol Agent is assigned to an Eastern European task force to target gun trafficking and dope running throughout the Balkans. While investigating a Russian gun dealer, his team is caught in a bloody street war between a Gypsy gang and the Russians, leaving one task force member dead. Fueled with vengeance, he leads us on an action packed thrill ride while avenging his friend''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arH52UwfIEKuzUR0qZrm2E1r0Rh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46103'),
  ('1103659670918417451', 'Born to Ride', 1991, 'Action', 'Graham Baker, Frank Gell, Leslie Tomkins', 'Janice Hickey, Michael Pardridge', 'John Stamos, Teri Polo, John Stockwell, Sandy McPeak, Kris Kamm, Keith Cooke, Dean Yacalis, Salvator Xuereb', 'PG', 'The US Army has decided to modernize its cavalry, so Colonel James E. Devers is ordered by a general to convert a horse unit to motorcycles, but his men are easily outclassed as riders by a pack of rowdies, especially Grady Westfall; when he is arrested risking a long jail term, he''s given one way out: enlisting as Corporal, assigned as driving instructor. Unit commander Captain Jack Hassler reviles his unorthodox boyish methods as undermining discipline and tradition, not to mention flirting with the Colonels daughter Beryl Ann, but he''s needed, especially when his unit is deployed on a secret mission in Spain.', 'The US Army has decided to modernize its cavalry, so Colonel James E. Devers is ordered by a general to convert a horse unit to motorcycles, but his men are easily outclassed as riders by a pack of rowdies, especially Grady Westfall; when he is arrested risking a long jail term, he''s given one way out: enlisting as Corporal, assigned as driving instructor. Unit commander Captain Jack Hassler reviles his unorthodox boyish methods as undermining discipline and tradition, not to mention flirting with the Colonels daughter Beryl Ann, but he''s needed, especially when his unit is deployed on a secret mission in Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2Rb9ZsBFWJnQwwAXFqV3ruisA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54843'),
  ('138993991083226813', 'Born to the West', 1937, 'Western, Action, Romance', 'Charles Barton, Devereaux Jennings', 'Stuart Anthony, Robert Yost', 'John Wayne, Marsha Hunt, Johnny Mack Brown, John Patterson, Monte Blue, Syd Saylor, Lucien Littlefield, Jack Kennedy', 'NR', 'Dare Rudd takes a shine to his cattleman cousin Tom''s girlfriend who asks Tom to hire Dare to head the big cattle drive. Dare loses the money for the drive to cardsharps, but Tom wins it back, but Dare must save Tom''s life.', 'Dare Rudd takes a shine to his cattleman cousin Tom''s girlfriend who asks Tom to hire Dare to head the big cattle drive. Dare loses the money for the drive to cardsharps, but Tom wins it back, but Dare must save Tom''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foyYxoCr9wNWmrC4beJSzZpyBV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53574'),
  ('684745572146576724', 'Born to Win', 1971, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Ivan Passer, Jack Priestley, Richard C. Kratina', 'Ivan Passer, David Scott Milton', 'George Segal, Karen Black, Paula Prentiss, Jay Fletcher, Héctor Elizondo, Robert De Niro, Ed Madsen, Marcia Jean Kurtz', 'R', 'A smart-mouthed junkie and a former hairdresser spends his days looking for just "one more fix".', 'A smart-mouthed junkie and a former hairdresser spends his days looking for just "one more fix".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y43Zv5TMVNxO7UBjjTgYcXXQlWn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21256'),
  ('258456084014645717', 'Born to Win', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Vicente Villanueva, Aitor Mantxola', 'Vicente Villanueva', 'Alexandra Jiménez, Cristina Castaño, Victoria Abril, Antonio de la Cruz, Luisber Santiago, José Manuel Cervino, Pedro Pablo Isla', null, 'Encarna, a thirtysomething girl of Móstoles (Madrid) is trapped in a life without changes, at the side of her lifelong boyfriend and with a job absent of incentives. Stigmatized by the famous Spanish sketch of the "Empanadillas de Móstoles", Encarna looks for a way to escape her boring life.', 'Encarna, a thirtysomething girl of Móstoles (Madrid) is trapped in a life without changes, at the side of her lifelong boyfriend and with a job absent of incentives. Stigmatized by the famous Spanish sketch of the "Empanadillas de Móstoles", Encarna looks for a way to escape her boring life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYiDhFZNuhRCJenrR9dq2nVpGrA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331642'),
  ('726904997042368465', 'Born with It', 2015, 'Drama, Family', 'Emmanuel Osei-Kuffour, Jr.', 'Emmanuel Osei-Kuffour, Jr.', 'Dadie T, Aoba Kawai, Ryôya Shinoda, Kôdai Izumiya, Kyōko Yanagihara, Mitsue Hori, Teruo Kikuchi, Masakazu Saiga', null, 'Living in Tokyo, Keisuke Fujii never really considered the colour of his skin; but when he and his mother move to rural Japan, the other kids assume that he is of African descent and therefore must have AIDS. Unsure of how to address these prejudices, Keisuke sets out to find answers and confront the cruel rumours once and for all.', 'Living in Tokyo, Keisuke Fujii never really considered the colour of his skin; but when he and his mother move to rural Japan, the other kids assume that he is of African descent and therefore must have AIDS. Unsure of how to address these prejudices, Keisuke sets out to find answers and confront the cruel rumours once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/et1MA4VFxLeybRIhvnXsj1ErpG3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400810'),
  ('148634311655807049', 'Born Yesterday', 1950, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Earl Bellamy, Morris Stoloff, George Cukor', 'Albert Mannheimer', 'Judy Holliday, Broderick Crawford, William Holden, Howard St. John, Frank Otto, Larry Oliver, Barbara Brown, Grandon Rhodes', 'NR', 'Uncouth, loud-mouth junkyard tycoon Harry Brock descends upon Washington D.C. to buy himself a congressman or two, bringing with him his mistress, ex-showgirl Billie Dawn.', 'Uncouth, loud-mouth junkyard tycoon Harry Brock descends upon Washington D.C. to buy himself a congressman or two, bringing with him his mistress, ex-showgirl Billie Dawn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPiQUhnkgp2O9bQz9KhSyOjLvGl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24481'),
  ('501898110734281115', 'Born Yesterday', 1993, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Luis Mandoki, Richard Patrick, Lajos Koltai', 'Douglas McGrath', 'Melanie Griffith, John Goodman, Don Johnson, Edward Herrmann, Max Perlich, Michael Ensign, Ben Bradlee, Sally Quinn', 'PG', 'A rich millionaire hires a sophisticated journalist to bring his somewhat dim-witted girlfriend up to the level of his peers. He fears that the showgirl''s lack of etiquette may damage his own social reputation and tries to change her — but fails to realise that her enhanced eloquence will empower her to voice her own strong opinions.', 'A rich millionaire hires a sophisticated journalist to bring his somewhat dim-witted girlfriend up to the level of his peers. He fears that the showgirl''s lack of etiquette may damage his own social reputation and tries to change her — but fails to realise that her enhanced eloquence will empower her to voice her own strong opinions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUANBUEbVprsyEzRPe1mQFACr3n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44968'),
  ('984246327387144903', 'Bornless Ones', 2016, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alexander Babaev, Egor Povolotskiy', 'Alexander Babaev', 'Michael Johnston, Mark Furze, David Banks, Gwen Holloway, Margaret Judson, Devin Goodsell, Victoria Clare, Nick Saso', null, 'With the help of her friends, Emily moves to a remote home to take better care of her brother, Zack who is diagnosed with cerebral palsy. But what they don''t know is that the house is keeping a terrifying secret that will haunt them one by one.', 'With the help of her friends, Emily moves to a remote home to take better care of her brother, Zack who is diagnosed with cerebral palsy. But what they don''t know is that the house is keeping a terrifying secret that will haunt them one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ega1G9rdcDsuDQeonGaCpm8FR3S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421601'),
  ('777406662929749508', 'Bornova Bornova', 2009, 'Drama', 'Inan Temelkuran', 'Inan Temelkuran', 'Öner Erkan, Kadir Çermik, Damla Sönmez, Erkan Bektaş, Öner Ateş, Murat Kılıç, Selen Uçer, Hasan Şahintürk', null, 'A story from Bornova, a neighborhood in Izmir. Two good friends Salih and Hakan spend their days in front of a grocery store waiting for a chance to do something with their lives.', 'A story from Bornova, a neighborhood in Izmir. Two good friends Salih and Hakan spend their days in front of a grocery store waiting for a chance to do something with their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBblQd2skYTjY7pjtrb4vMJOZJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61845'),
  ('345023285081830984', 'Boro in the Box', 2014, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Bertrand Mandico, Pascale Granel', 'Bertrand Mandico', 'Elina Löwensohn, Norbert Brondeau, Laure Lapeyre, Thierry Benoiton, Jacques Malnou, Elise Hote, Benoît Serre, Audrey Le Corre', null, 'From its epic conception to its film death, the fantasized and fictitious portrait of the film-maker Walerian Borowczyk : Boro-in-the-box discovers a cruel and obscene world, crosses commonplace and colorful adventures, from Poland to Paris, caressing erotic birds and organic cameras in a phantasmagorical alphabet primer.', 'From its epic conception to its film death, the fantasized and fictitious portrait of the film-maker Walerian Borowczyk : Boro-in-the-box discovers a cruel and obscene world, crosses commonplace and colorful adventures, from Poland to Paris, caressing erotic birds and organic cameras in a phantasmagorical alphabet primer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybTme70iKysvxDyjk2LTiZAzp00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111833'),
  ('1126084967209049821', 'Borrego', 2022, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Octavio Arias, Jesse Harris', 'Jesse Harris', 'Lucy Hale, Nicholas Gonzalez, Leynar Gomez, Jorge A. Jimenez, Olivia Trujillo, Edward J. Bentley, Brendan McNamee, Jaime Aymerich', 'R', 'A young botanist relocates to a small desert town to study an invasive plant species. While out on research, she comes to the aid of a downed plane only to find herself taken captive by an inexperienced drug mule who forces her to lead a trek across the sweltering desert to his drop. A local sheriff is drawn into the hunt as his rebellious daughter sets out to find the missing botanist, all the while being pursued by a local drug receiver.', 'A young botanist relocates to a small desert town to study an invasive plant species. While out on research, she comes to the aid of a downed plane only to find herself taken captive by an inexperienced drug mule who forces her to lead a trek across the sweltering desert to his drop. A local sheriff is drawn into the hunt as his rebellious daughter sets out to find the missing botanist, all the while being pursued by a local drug receiver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPzQtr5LTheO0mBodIeAXHgthYX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728366'),
  ('9189204977602857', 'Borrón y Vida Nueva', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Chava Cartas, Anilú Pardo', 'Juan Carlos Garzón, Angélica Gudiño', 'Memo Villegas, Carolina Miranda, Mariané Cartas, Omar Yubeili, Consuelo Duval, Carlos Ferro, Margarita Muñoz, Alejandra Andreu', null, 'Ulises wakes up in a hospital "with no memory". Now he''ll reclaim the life he lost: the ex who keeps to stalking her, the business that was stolen from him, and the house of his dreams; however, not everything is as he remembered it.', 'Ulises wakes up in a hospital "with no memory". Now he''ll reclaim the life he lost: the ex who keeps to stalking her, the business that was stolen from him, and the house of his dreams; however, not everything is as he remembered it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bB5KB2uILvbyzeoM2jBMw4EUoxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1584628'),
  ('796629732465413461', 'Borrowed Bride', 2005, 'Romance, History, Drama', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Kenan Ormanlar', 'Tarık Günersel, Gül Dirican', 'Nurgül Yeşilçay, Müjde Ar, Onur Ünsal, Füsun Demirel, Şevket Çoruh, Eylem Yıldız, Fikret Hakan, Metin Akpınar', null, 'Ali is 18. His feet are firmly off the ground. The very idea of marriage seems like a game. But the bride''s parents are ready and willing. Business ventures will be set up between the families; the arrangement will pay off all round. Ali, meanwhile, is more interested in playing with puppets and dressing up as a rooster for the travelling theatre. His fiancée has only so much patience... So what should his parents do? What was that? Hire a Borrowed Bride? Meaning exactly what? Well just that: borrow a bride, as the title of the film suggests......', 'Ali is 18. His feet are firmly off the ground. The very idea of marriage seems like a game. But the bride''s parents are ready and willing. Business ventures will be set up between the families; the arrangement will pay off all round. Ali, meanwhile, is more interested in playing with puppets and dressing up as a rooster for the travelling theatre. His fiancée has only so much patience... So what should his parents do? What was that? Hire a Borrowed Bride? Meaning exactly what? Well just that: borrow a bride, as the title of the film suggests......', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifsEZXTJiHWFurdx7vvCoZRJvat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133525'),
  ('244051346406530789', 'Borrowed Hearts', 1997, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Ted Kotcheff', 'Pamela Wallace, Earl W. Wallace', 'Roma Downey, Eric McCormack, Shawn Thompson, Janet Bailey, Héctor Elizondo, Barbara Gordon, Sarah Rosen Fruitman, Kevin Hicks', null, 'Single mom Kathleen Russell (Roma Downey) and her daughter Zoey pretend to be Kathleen''s boss''s "family" so he can close a major business deal with the mysterious Mexican financier Javier Del Campo.', 'Single mom Kathleen Russell (Roma Downey) and her daughter Zoey pretend to be Kathleen''s boss''s "family" so he can close a major business deal with the mysterious Mexican financier Javier Del Campo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zVDQ8F0QVS3BP5fTmguR3RQJxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70417'),
  ('897789536967917882', 'Borrowed Time', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Western', 'Andrew Coats, Lou Hamou-Lhadj, James Campbell', 'Andrew Coats, Lou Hamou-Lhadj, Mark C. Harris', 'Greg Dykstra, Nick Pitera, Steve Purcell', null, 'A weathered Sheriff returns to the remains of an accident he has spent a lifetime trying to forget. With each step forward, the memories come flooding back. Faced with his mistake once again, he must find the strength to carry on.', 'A weathered Sheriff returns to the remains of an accident he has spent a lifetime trying to forget. With each step forward, the memories come flooding back. Faced with his mistake once again, he must find the strength to carry on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2FoxeUWAKwS9LbCzXszfV2er4j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421281'),
  ('690527654533966695', 'Borsalino', 1970, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Jacques Deray, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Jean Cau, Jacques Deray', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Alain Delon, Catherine Rouvel, Françoise Christophe, Corinne Marchand, Laura Adani, Nicole Calfan, Hélène Rémy', 'PG', 'In 1930s Marseilles two small-time crooks decide to join forces when they meet while brawling over a woman. Starting with fixed horse races and boxing matches, they soon find themselves doing jobs for the local gangster bosses. When they decide to go into the business for themselves, their easy-going approach to crime starts to change.', 'In 1930s Marseilles two small-time crooks decide to join forces when they meet while brawling over a woman. Starting with fixed horse races and boxing matches, they soon find themselves doing jobs for the local gangster bosses. When they decide to go into the business for themselves, their easy-going approach to crime starts to change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYmYPRswLysH9D1Qvy7diumFXG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25251'),
  ('913027901935786845', 'Borsalino and Co.', 1974, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jacques Deray, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'Pascal Jardin, Jacques Deray', 'Alain Delon, Riccardo Cucciolla, Daniel Ivernel, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Catherine Rouvel, Lionel Vitrant, André Falcon, Adolfo Lastretti', null, 'Marseille. Heaps of flowers and funeral wreaths... "A man who no longer defends his colors is no longer a man."', 'Marseille. Heaps of flowers and funeral wreaths... "A man who no longer defends his colors is no longer a man."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8NRzyVyZSLlyW7b1cOWiQCe1jh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60181'),
  ('275640975336355899', 'Borstal Boy', 2001, 'Drama', 'Peter Sheridan, Ciarán Tanham, Andrew Hegarty', 'Peter Sheridan, Nye Heron', 'Shawn Hatosy, Danny Dyer, Robin Laing, Ian McElhinney, Eva Birthistle, Mark Huberman, Lee Ingleby, Ronnie Drew', 'NR', 'Brendan Behan, a sixteen year-old IRA foot soldier, is going on a bombing mission from Ireland to Liverpool during the second world war. His mission is thwarted when he is apprehended, charged and imprisoned in Borstal, a reform institution for young offenders in East Anglia, England.', 'Brendan Behan, a sixteen year-old IRA foot soldier, is going on a bombing mission from Ireland to Liverpool during the second world war. His mission is thwarted when he is apprehended, charged and imprisoned in Borstal, a reform institution for young offenders in East Anglia, England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wtBSqyuRqiab8Bfdp38FngbIje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24309'),
  ('636668035714250262', 'Boruto: Naruto the Movie', 2015, 'Adventure, Action, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Atsuho Matsumoto, Tetsuya Nishio, Tetsuya Nishio', 'Ukyo Kodachi', 'Yuko Sanpei, Cocoro Kikuchi, Junko Takeuchi, Noriaki Sugiyama, Daisuke Namikawa, Akira Ishida, Chie Nakamura, Nana Mizuki', 'PG-13', 'The spirited Boruto Uzumaki, son of Seventh Hokage Naruto, is a skilled ninja who possesses the same brashness and passion his father once had. However, the constant absence of his father, who is busy with his Hokage duties, puts a damper on Boruto''s fire. He ends up meeting his father''s friend Sasuke, and requests to become... his apprentice!? The curtain on the story of the new generation rises!', 'The spirited Boruto Uzumaki, son of Seventh Hokage Naruto, is a skilled ninja who possesses the same brashness and passion his father once had. However, the constant absence of his father, who is busy with his Hokage duties, puts a damper on Boruto''s fire. He ends up meeting his father''s friend Sasuke, and requests to become... his apprentice!? The curtain on the story of the new generation rises!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1k6iwC4KaPvTBt1JuaqXy3noZRY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347201'),
  ('1104528437656979432', 'Bosch: The Garden of Dreams', 2016, 'Documentary', 'José Luis López-Linares', 'Cristina Otero Roth', 'Salman Rushdie, Orhan Pamuk, Cees Nooteboom, Albert Boadella, Renée Fleming, William Christie, Ludovico Einaudi, Leonardo García Alarcón', null, '2016 marks the 500th anniversary of the death of Hieronymus Bosch. It is almost the only information about the artist of The Garden of Earthly Delights that we can put a precise date to. Bosch, the garden of dreams is a film about his most important painting and one of the most iconic paintings in the world: The Garden of Earthly Delights.', '2016 marks the 500th anniversary of the death of Hieronymus Bosch. It is almost the only information about the artist of The Garden of Earthly Delights that we can put a precise date to. Bosch, the garden of dreams is a film about his most important painting and one of the most iconic paintings in the world: The Garden of Earthly Delights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZfVJGY3W5Fu8SxVXhnZPzxKZe0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402042'),
  ('18522128979672301', 'Bosco', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nicholas Manuel Pino, Taylor Newman, Kenry Allan Hutchinson', 'Nicholas Manuel Pino', 'Aubrey Joseph, Theo Rossi, Thomas Jane, Tyrese Gibson, Vivica A. Fox, Nikki Blonsky, Jim O''Heir, D.C. Young Fly', null, 'Based on the true story of Quawntay “Bosco” Adams. Sentenced to 35 years for attempted possession of marijuana, Adams miraculously escaped from a Federal maximum-security prison while under 24-hour surveillance in solitary confinement with the help of an older woman he met through a lonely-hearts ad.', 'Based on the true story of Quawntay “Bosco” Adams. Sentenced to 35 years for attempted possession of marijuana, Adams miraculously escaped from a Federal maximum-security prison while under 24-hour surveillance in solitary confinement with the help of an older woman he met through a lonely-hearts ad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXjSeS3w97setnrNv4m6tlqqXzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175351'),
  ('241029394950727397', 'Bosko and Bruno', 1932, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Hugh Harman', null, 'Johnny Murray', null, 'Bosko and Bruno escape from a speeding train via a handcar; make a failed attempt to steal a chicken; and end up on a runaway boxcar.', 'Bosko and Bruno escape from a speeding train via a handcar; make a failed attempt to steal a chicken; and end up on a runaway boxcar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uB13ghZxYBGmESUYvwyn9L3qTQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161571'),
  ('832107370750998989', 'Bosko at the Zoo', 1932, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Hugh Harman', null, 'Rochelle Hudson, Johnny Murray', null, 'Bosko and Honey go to the zoo. Honey is frightened by the lion, but Bosko is the one who ends up in danger.', 'Bosko and Honey go to the zoo. Honey is frightened by the lion, but Bosko is the one who ends up in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGOnfuw063XyGwzyznB3TbgRJBy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161609'),
  ('622345974369738289', 'Boško Buha', 1978, 'Drama, War', 'Branko Bauer, Branko Blažina', 'Dušan Perković, Boško Matić', 'Ivan Kujundžić, Dragan Bjelogrlić, Žarko Radić, Marko Nikolić, Ljubiša Samardžić, Milan Štrljić, Miroljub Lešo, Milena Dapčević', null, 'The movie is based on the true story about a group of children, barely teenagers, who joined Yugoslav Partizans after losing their families in WW2. At first, Partizans want to get rid of them, but later they are joining combat ranks. Among them, Bosko Buha would become a legend because of his skill in destroying enemy bunkers.', 'The movie is based on the true story about a group of children, barely teenagers, who joined Yugoslav Partizans after losing their families in WW2. At first, Partizans want to get rid of them, but later they are joining combat ranks. Among them, Bosko Buha would become a legend because of his skill in destroying enemy bunkers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTUfu5No1uplSqamXMwFSIA4jhj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46209'),
  ('30548333532912607', 'Bosko in Person', 1933, 'Animation, Music, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Hugh Harman', null, 'Johnny Murray, Rochelle Hudson', null, 'Bosko and Honey perform a wacky stage act that includes doing imitations of Maurice Chevalier, Greta Garbo and Jimmy Durante.', 'Bosko and Honey perform a wacky stage act that includes doing imitations of Maurice Chevalier, Greta Garbo and Jimmy Durante.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oaoUHh8MZsNIuVk9s5JoQnNmOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161935'),
  ('621405194980150374', 'Bosko Shipwrecked!', 1931, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hugh Harman', null, 'Carman Maxwell', null, 'Bosko is shipwrecked on an island where he is chased by a lion and pursued by simian cannibals.', 'Bosko is shipwrecked on an island where he is chased by a lion and pursued by simian cannibals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s56JVzcz1BaeJUdNpBiCwPzrEeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162702'),
  ('188790082181872037', 'Bosko the Doughboy', 1931, 'War, Animation, Comedy', 'Hugh Harman', null, 'Johnny Murray, Rudolf Ising', null, 'Bosko is a doughboy in the Great War. Bullets and bombs are everywhere. (A bomb even blows up the title card.) Bosko and his fellow infantrymen are hardly safe in their trench. Bosko is happily eating from a pan full of beans when a bomb hits the pan and destroys his meal. Bosko misses Honey; he pulls out her picture and kisses it. A cannonball tears through it, making her head a gaping hole. Now Bosko is angry. He vows revenge but the moment his helmet appears above the trench, it’s hit with dozens of bullets, knocking him back down. Another soldier briefly cheers him up with harmonica music. Bosko gets his chance to be a hero when his buddy swallows a cannonball.', 'Bosko is a doughboy in the Great War. Bullets and bombs are everywhere. (A bomb even blows up the title card.) Bosko and his fellow infantrymen are hardly safe in their trench. Bosko is happily eating from a pan full of beans when a bomb hits the pan and destroys his meal. Bosko misses Honey; he pulls out her picture and kisses it. A cannonball tears through it, making her head a gaping hole. Now Bosko is angry. He vows revenge but the moment his helmet appears above the trench, it’s hit with dozens of bullets, knocking him back down. Another soldier briefly cheers him up with harmonica music. Bosko gets his chance to be a hero when his buddy swallows a cannonball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3la2ZvAJKmvh4DptxKmO5iLwvl5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162573'),
  ('12856069418244497', 'Bosko, the Talk-Ink Kid', 1929, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hugh Harman', null, 'Rudolf Ising, Carman Maxwell', null, 'A cartoonist draws Bosko, who promptly comes to life.', 'A cartoonist draws Bosko, who promptly comes to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KjqLvhMVAAkVNcrbJQCAPFvrFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151448'),
  ('915137324819063881', 'Bosko''s Dizzy Date', 1932, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Hugh Harman', null, 'Rochelle Hudson, Johnny Murray', null, 'Honey is trying to teach the violin to Wilbur, the one who hates music. Honey calls Bosko over. Bosko and Honey sing, dance, and play music while Wilbur continues to express its disdain.', 'Honey is trying to teach the violin to Wilbur, the one who hates music. Honey calls Bosko over. Bosko and Honey sing, dance, and play music while Wilbur continues to express its disdain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trSLxKEnfwRMufI0VKHQGJgI6Cw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157450'),
